    'ADL' => [
        '$ExpeditionAdventure_01_01_01' => 'You failed to complete the expedition training island.',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_10*' => 'You lost the small barren colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_11*' => 'You lost the small promising colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_12*' => 'You lost the small rich colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_13*' => 'You lost the regular barren colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_14*' => 'You lost the regular promising colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_15*' => 'You lost the regular rich colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_16*' => 'You lost the huge barren colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_17*' => 'You lost the huge promising colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_18*' => 'You lost the huge rich colony',
        '1001NightsBesiegedCity' => 'The frenzied apes repel your forces with all their savage might. The inhabitants of the city start to lose hope when they see you retreat.',
        '1001NightsFirstThief' => 'The thieves were too strong and were ultimately able to repel your efforts. Ali Baba encourages you to regroup your forces and try again.',
        '1001NightsOilLamp' => 'The sellswords hired by the informant prove to be too powerful for your troops, and he manages to escape with the information you were looking for. There is no choice now for you but to retreat.',
        '1001NightsSeaPrincess' => 'So close, and yet so far away. Scheherezade\'s location was finally at hand, but the enemy ultimately managed to block your efforts to reach her.',
        '1001NightsSeaSnake' => 'Defeated, you never manage to reach the cave where the treasure allegedly lies. Sinbad and you retreat, wondering if the treasure cave of legend actually exists.',
        '1001NightsSecondThief' => 'The greedy thieves don\'t want anyone near their treasure and they have made themselves brutally clear about it. You decide to regroup your army and reconsider your approach.',
        '1001NightsThirdThief' => 'Unfortunately, you were not able to make it through the center of the stronghold. Ali Baba, fearing for the captive ladies, suggests you to regroup and try again.',
        '1001NightsTreasureKnowledge' => 'The arid terrain and fearsome enemies eventually took a toll on your troops, and you were defeated. You retire to your home, hoping that perhaps you\'ll get another chance some day.',
        '1001NightsTreasureWisdom' => 'The tomb raiders proved to be more troublesome than petty thieves. You retreat, leaving the tombs at the raider\'s mercy, and the mystery of the ancient civilization unsolved.',
        '1001NightsWoodcutter' => 'The thieves laugh at your futile efforts at breaking through their camps. You decide to regroup your forces at home, and have the last laugh next time.',
        'ANightToRemember' => 'And so the father\'s daughter was nowhere to be found. Eventually a letter from her arrived, saying that she was in good hands and very happy, but her father still mourns her loss to this day.',
        'BanditNest' => 'Your scout\'s reports underestimated the number of soldiers allied to the rogues, meaning you arrived there with way too few men. Accordingly, you were not able to break through enemy lines and have been forced to fall back.',
        'Birthday2013Adventure1' => 'Sadly, you did not manage to gather all the items. Well, better luck next time.',
        'Birthday2013Adventure2' => 'It seems you had problems collecting all the items. I hope you will do better next time.',
        'Birthday2013Adventure3' => 'You failed to remove all the objects. This makes me sad, but I am sure we will manage it during the next adventure.',
        'Birthday2013Adventure4' => 'Those islands are really weird. No wonder you failed to collect everything. Let\'s head back to your home zone.',
        'Birthday2013Adventure5' => 'Oh I\'m pretty sure you can do better than that. Please concentrate.',
        'Birthday2013MilitaryAdventure1' => 'You failed to defeat the shaman. Now the settlers have to live in their weird-looking houses. However, they still hope you will come to their aid.',
        'Birthday2013MilitaryAdventure1ShopVersion' => 'You failed to defeat the shaman. Now the settlers have to live in their weird-looking houses. However, they still hope you will come to their aid.',
        'Birthday2013MilitaryAdventure2' => 'The ruins are still standing and the bond still exists. With a little more effort, you will surely be able to destroy them.',
        'Birthday2013MilitaryAdventure2ShopVersion' => 'The ruins are still standing and the bond still exists. With a little more effort, you will surely be able to destroy them.',
        'Birthday2020CakeMap' => 'It looks like the fallen enemies have re-emerged from the mist. You have to get rid of them before they become a threat to your island!',
        'BonabertiBusiness' => 'How very disappointing.

You were not able to completely chase the bandits away from family Bonaberti\'s island.',
        'BountyHunter' => 'How very disappointing.

You were not able to hunt the bounty properly and thus the scoundrels can continue to double-cross honest merchants freely.',
        'BountyHunterNew' => 'How very disappointing.

You were not able to hunt the bounty properly and thus the scoundrels can continue to double-cross honest merchants freely.',
        'BuccaneerRoundup' => 'The bad part is that there\'s so much treasure the pirates are going to spend on themselves .',
        'BuffAdventures_DragonsRoost' => 'Flafir has been around for centuries, and is a cunning opponent. This defeat is nothing to be ashamed of. Let\'s retreat for now, and return once you\'ve recovered from this defeat.',
        'BuffAdventures_Easter_Event_2015' => 'Oh no! The chickens still aren\'t hatching their eggs. There\'ll never be enough eggs for everyone this Easter now!',
        'BuffAdventures_ElChupacabra' => 'It was wise to withdraw from the island, as we were in over our heads. We cannot ignore the creature either, though. You should train more troops, and then have another go at this hunt.',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Fisherman' => 'The fisherman is still out there and needs your help. Come back when you\'re ready.',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Hansel_Gretel' => 'Hansel & Gretel are still missing, and their parents don\'t know what to do.',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Piper_of_Hamelin' => 'The rats overran Hamelin, and nobody could stop them.',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Red_Riding_Hood' => 'Red Riding Hood went missing when she went to visit her grandmother. The details are unknown.',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Snow_White' => 'Snow White is still in danger. Please return here when you\'re ready, and we can attempt to rescue her again.',
        'BuffAdventures_LostCity' => 'Returning from that island empty handed is rather disappointing. Considering its history, there must be something valuable to find there... You should start another expedition when it\'s convenient.',
        'BuffAdventures_OfSongsAndCurses' => 'Are we really leaving the islanders to this dark fate? 
I understand that you were in over your head this time, but be sure to return eventually, okay?',
        'BuffAdventures_OneStepAhead' => 'You missed the ships by a hair\'s breadth and lost your chance to intercept them.
It looks like their raids will continue for now.',
        'BuffAdventures_RaidOfTheNords' => 'It feels terrible to leave the native populace in such a sorry state, but you can\'t help them at the moment. We\'ll have to wait for a better opportunity.',
        'BuffAdventures_Riches_of_the_Mountain' => 'We\'re too late. The vein rights have gone to another person. The foreman was ordered to leave, and there is nothing left for you to do but return to your island.',
        'BuffAdventures_Storm_Recovery' => 'You didn\'t manage to help the villagers. They remain at the mercy of the storm.',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_A_giant_battle' => 'There is no shame admitting defeat against an enemy that has withstood decades of war against one of the mightiest clans out there. We have to prepare our troops, and map out our strategy to overcome all obstacles as efficiently as possible. Next time, we will prevail!',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_At_the_foot_of_the_Mountain' => 'Despite all the unforeseen challenges, you did your best to find out the truth about the Mountain Clan. However, their secret remains intact. Will you be able to uncover it next time?',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_Mountain_Labyrinth' => 'Did you get lost? Don\'t worry. As they say, there will always be a second, or even a third chance. Just don\'t make the same mistakes again. Prepare well, and you will surely succeed when you return to the Mountain Labyrinth.',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_The_People_of_the_Mountain' => 'No wonder the Mountain Clan hasn´t been able to defeat their nemesis yet. The sheer volume of wildlife that keeps pouring into the Mountain Clan´s territory has been keeping them more than occupied! 

We should prepare our troops, and gather enough resources to help them out of their misery. Next time they won´t stand a chance!',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_Unknown_Regions' => 'You couldn\'t have known the environment would be this harsh! There\'s nothing you can do except pull back for now. 
Maybe you\'ll start a new expedition into the Nords\' lands another time.',
        'BuffAdventures_ValuableIntel' => 'Puerto Sombrío is surprisingly well defended! But that\'s just further proof that something fishy must be going on there. We should return as soon as possible.',
        'BuffAdventures_heartOfTheWood_medium' => 'Now the sickness has infected everything on the island. In few weeks, this island will become a desert.',
        'BuffAdventures_safeTheTowns_easy' => 'The two towns are still in conflict. So no delicious bread, and no tasty brew for a long, long time.',
        'BuffAdventures_twins_easy' => 'Unfortunately, you were not able to save the children in time. Hopefully, the other villagers will have more luck than you - but for now, you can do nothing but hope.',
        'ChristmasAdventure2013' => 'Oh no! It seems Croaker was better prepared this time round. Somebody else will have to get that sleigh back before Christmas.',
        'ChristmasAdventureEasy' => 'Unfortunately, Croaker had more help than expected, meaning that you could not reach him and retrieve the stolen presents in time. Hopefully, there will be another chance to save the Christmas feast.',
        'ChristmasAdventureNormal' => 'Unfortunately, Croaker had more help than expected, so you couldn\'t reach him and retrieve the stolen presents in time. Hopefully, there will be another chance to save the Christmas feast.',
        'EMEventAdventure01' => 'You weren\'t up to your opponents battling abilities, but you are in good company there - these contestants have trounced many a skilled adversary.',
        'EMEventAdventure01_2' => 'You weren\'t up to your opponents battling abilities, but you are in good company there - these contestants have trounced many a skilled adversary.',
        'EMEventAdventure02' => 'You seem to have fallen victim to the enemies\' unpredictability. Or you just weren\'t up for it?',
        'EMEventAdventure02_2' => 'You seem to have fallen victim to the enemies\' unpredictability. Or you just weren\'t up for it?',
        'EMEventAdventure03' => 'Humbly, you have to acknowledge your opponents\' superiority; you were just no match for them. Better luck next time!',
        'EMEventAdventure03_2' => 'Humbly, you have to acknowledge your opponents\' superiority; you were just no match for them. Better luck next time!',
        'EMEventAdventure04' => 'Your adversary\'s determination seems to have been too much for you. A well earned victory for your opponent, one might say.',
        'EMEventAdventure04_2' => 'Your adversary\'s determination seems to have been too much for you. A well earned victory for your opponent, one might say.',
        'EMEventAdventure05' => 'There is no disgrace in losing this battle; your opponent was simply ahead of you. However, let us hope you do not intend to continue like this.',
        'EMEventAdventure05_2' => 'There is no disgrace in losing this battle; your opponent was simply ahead of you. However, let us hope you do not intend to continue like this.',
        'EMEventAdventure06' => 'Well, you seem to have succumbed to their superior looks after all! Nevertheless, in the end they simply outsmarted you. What a dramatic conclusion to a great tournament!',
        'EMEventAdventure06_2' => 'Well, you seem to have succumbed to their superior looks after all! Nevertheless, in the end they simply outsmarted you. What a dramatic conclusion to a great tournament!',
        'EasterGarrunTrapper' => 'The Easter is in great jeopardy now! 
Who\'s going to deliver all those eggs, if the bunnies are hopelessly trapped?',
        'EoWEventAdventure' => 'They defeated you? We can not afford to let this happen, too much is at stake! But that is the beauty of time travel, all is not yet lost. Go back again and teach those foul creatures a lesson!',
        'Gunpowder' => 'What mad god invented those mighty weapons? Deafening explosions and iron-melting fire drove your men to take flight in panic. You were not able to secure even one of those mighty weapons. Maybe you should try to send more experienced men in future...',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv1' => 'I understand why you struggled - those golems are incredibly resilient. I wish we could have helped more, but what\'s done is done.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv2' => 'That climb was too much for your troops. Fighting corrupted animals is one thing, but fighting them on such a steep path is extra taxing. I can\'t blame you for retreating.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv3' => 'I can\'t believe we were defeated! So much was on the line! I hope those poor villagers will find a way to manage without us...',
        'Horseback' => 'The veld is not a safe place any more. Rampaging rider clans roam freely and unchallenged. Your men were no match for their massive horses and swift spears. The local settlers have been driven away from their homeland...',
        'LakesideTreasure' => 'Bad luck! The cultists finished a dark ritual using the artefact and the island disappeared again into a strange mist.  
Don\'t worry, we will find it again!',
        'MadHenry' => 'The wild woman has triumphed!
Your men were not able to defeat the fiendish bandits of Wild Mary. Those wicked men were just too strong this time. Frightened, the villagers tremble in their homes waiting for the next impending raid...',
        'MadHenryReloaded' => 'The wild woman has triumphed!
Your men were not able to defeat the fiendish bandits of Wild Mary. Those wicked men were just too strong this time. Frightened the villagers tremble in their homes waiting for the next impending raid...',
        'MiadArcticExplosion' => 'We didn\'t expect so many Nords on the island. We should leave now, and come back with a bigger army… they\'re just too powerful! I\'m sorry!',
        'MiadBastilleIsland' => 'Retreat! It\'s too much, sorry! The clans seem to be too powerful, even for us! We need to regroup and approach the island with a new tactic!',
        'MiadPirateLife' => 'No! Call back your men, this is not going to work, I\'m sorry! We need stronger troops and better tactics. Regroup and let us try again later.',
        'MiadSleepyReef' => 'Oh no! There\'s way too many of them for our troops! We need to retreat and use another plan! Maybe next time we\'ll be more prepared!',
        'MiadTheLostSkull' => 'I can\'t believe this! Oh well, they managed to find the Skull and escape by the time our troops had found the pirate captain\'s camp ! It\'s no use chasing after them… they\'ve sailed into that storm to the east. Maybe we\'ll get them next time, huh?',
        'MiadTheSleepingVolcano' => 'I guess the "Cult of the Sleeping Flame" has strong followers, stronger than our army, apparently. We need to regroup and try again. We can\'t let those maniacs burn down the island!',
        'MiadTikkiIsland' => 'Unfortunately, you were not able to drive the bandits from the island. Since you couldn\'t reach the main Tikki camp to return their missing coin, the bandits continue reinforcing their settlement, and the Tikki island remains cursed.',
        'MiadTropicalSun' => 'Sadly, your enemy had more experience in surprise attacks. Somehow, they reached the village and captured Lord Walder and the council, forcing you to leave the island. Maybe next time we\'ll come more prepared!',
        'MoreSecludedExperiments' => 'Oh no! You didn\'t manage to stop the experiments - but there might still be time! The experiments aren\'t quite finished - so you may be able to have another go.',
        'MotherLove' => 'Nothing is more dangerous than the love of a mother. Your battle-hardened men fled from a woman.',
        'NewBanditNest' => 'Unfortunately, you didn\'t manage to clear the area, so the villagers will continue shivering in a state of paranoia for now.  They\'d be thankful if you gave it another try.',
        'OldFriends' => 'The witch and her lackeys are serious opponents, despite being weakened. You and your army fought to the last man, but it was not enough. Now the witch of the swamp will have enough time to regenerate her full power.',
        'Outlaws' => 'Was it lack of training or just bad luck? The outlaws have proven too strong for your men, the local knights have been overwhelmed and this region of the land is now feared by all passing travellers.',
        'Pirates' => 'And pirates swarm the coast...

There is nothing you can do about it. Drinking rum, playing illegal games and laughing at your efforts to drive them away, the pirates continue to spread fear and agony.',
        'RoaringBull' => 'Your men were not able to defeat the shamans. Their magic has proven too strong for you. Even your finest soldiers didn\'t stand a chance against this overpowering enemy. You must accept their claim of regency and retreat to your own lands.',
        'SecludedExperiments' => 'The mad alchemist did a good job hiring these mercenaries. Their experience was too much for your troops. Nobody came near the laboratory to stop him. Who knows what evil experiments have been conducted? Perhaps you will never find out...',
        'SonsOfTheVeld' => 'What a disgrace! You were not able to defend your honour against those loud-mouthed savages. They have proven to be formidable enemies. It would be best if you retreated for now and regained your strength. New challengers will almost certainly show up in the future.',
        'SplitCity' => 'Let us hope the people will be able to hold out until we\'re ready for another attempt at freeing them of their besiegement. 

Regather your strength, and head out to help these people!',
        'SplitCityFall' => 'It seems the people have gotten used to living with the constant onslaught, and instead just hide away. Not surprising when they\'re facing these kinds of enemies. Will you hide as well?',
        'StealingFromTheRich' => 'You have encountered a master archer indeed. Your men did not stand a chance against this well trained bunch of bowmen. The landlord is very disappointed with your defeat and is looking for more competent help.',
        'StealingFromTheRich02' => 'We should hurry - we need to inform the rich merchants that their gold is still in danger. What a disappointing outcome. Let\'s discuss another strategy - we can’t give up like this!',
        'SurpriseAttack' => 'The Nords were better prepared than expected. Someone must have warned them. Your men fought bravely, but the enemies numbers were too high. Let\'s hope their next target is not your kingdom.',
        'TheBetrayedLittleTailor' => 'Too bad - it seems the stolen goods are now out of your reach.',
        'TheBlackKnights' => 'You were not able to defeat the black knights. Their fortifications were too strong. There\'s nothing left to do except acknowledge their claim of sovereignty. This mountain range is now in the firm hands of those vicious brothers.',
        'TheCleverLittleTailor' => 'You were too late. Although the little tailor was able to escape the bear and his rival, he will probably never be respected.',
        'TheDarkBrotherhood' => 'The brotherhood is a formidable adversary. Your men were not able to capture their leaders. Instead, many of your men were lured into their ranks by their corrupted magic. You have to get your men to retreat, and defend your remaining townsfolk. Be wary, for the brotherhood is always watching.',
        'TheDarkPriests' => 'What magic is this? Your men were not able to pierce through this daunting opposition. The priests\' henchmen, encouraged by their black magic, bested your men in combat. Your townsfolk tremble in fear...',
        'TheHeroicLittleTailor' => 'You were unable to protect the little tailor. You can only hope he will find his way out of the forest alive…',
        'TheIslandOfThePirates' => 'Your soldiers had no chance against the hundreds of pirates. They hired every man who has ever set foot on a ship.',
        'TheNords' => 'The tribe has proven to be stronger than you thought. One by one your soldiers were defeated until no one was left to fight. What can you do against this unstoppable rage? Best leave them alone and wait until they leave these shores on their own...',
        'TheNords2' => 'The invaders have proven to be stronger than we thought. One by one your soldiers were defeated until no-one was left to fight, and many of them are now trapped in the ice. The island is now a frozen prison for those who lived here... Who knows where these bringers of frost will land next...',
        'TheSiege' => 'Well, too bad! Lord Scroogius\' fortune is now divided between the bandits. 
Better luck next time!',
        'TheSonsOfTheLittleTailor' => 'You were unable to help the little tailor’s sons and unite the family.',
        'TheValiantLittleTailor' => 'Ouch, that was quite a beating.
Let\'s hope the little tailor has found a hole to hide himself away in. He is no longer welcome in this realm.',
        'TombRaiders' => 'On the positive side, you didn\'t end up on the sacrificial table yourself ... unlike most of your men.',
        'Traitors' => 'Solid as a rock, the traitors stand in your way. Against their thick armour and strong swords your men didn\'t stand a chance. With this, the deserters have made a name for themselves and may cause much trouble in the future. Your nobility is very displeased with the whole situation.',
        'Traitors02' => 'No! How is this even possible? Sir Robin really is a tough enemy... Please, hurry and try again!',
        'TwinTown_Cave1' => 'You may have lost this battle, but you haven\'t given up just yet. You\'ll soon be able to return, and try a new approach to defeating your opponents. It\'s not like this colossal cave is going anywhere fast...',
        'TwinTown_Main' => 'Laeylorn\'s mesmerizing streets won\'t leave you so soon. Return whenever you feel the time is right.',
        'VictorTheVicious' => 'The razor sharp arrowheads instilled fear in your men. Victor the Vicious has trained his bandits well. Your men were no match for his troops and the valley stays in his possession.',
        'WMEventAdventure01' => 'We could not defeat the Knight of Crowrock. Luckily, this was only a practice match. I hope we\'re better prepared for the next one.',
        'WMEventAdventure02' => 'We have been defeated by the Barony of Tepidwater. Good thing there\'s a second group game waiting for us.',
        'WMEventAdventure03' => 'The Barony of Emberstream defeated us in this match... shame on us - we disappointed our settler fans.',
        'WMEventAdventure04' => 'The Shire of Oxwater defeated us... This is a disappointing day for us - even if we fought hard.',
        'WMEventAdventure05' => 'We lost! It was a close match, but the Electorate of Sunflower Grove had been the better team today.',
        'WMEventAdventure06' => 'We almost made it... but only almost. In the end, it all comes down to the small differences when you play at such a high level of skill.',
        'WMEventAdventure07' => 'Oh no! We lost the finals! So close and yet so far. But our settlers are proud of us and our team. No one expected us to come this far.',
        'Whirlwind' => 'Was it lack of training or just bad luck? The outlaws have proven too strong for your men, the local knights have been overwhelmed and this region of the land is now feared by all passing travellers.',
        'WitchOfTheSwamp' => 'Fame and glory are not for you!

The witch has driven you away. Her magic was too strong and her evil henchmen backed her up, defeating your troops with seeming ease. Be careful next time you wander near her tower, for it rises in the night sky like a dark omen...',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Easy_1' => 'Hach can\'t you do anything ri- I mean, please, these children need their toys...so my sensitive ears can finally get some rest. Hurry! Ribbit.',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Easy_2' => 'Fudge! This evildoer\'s plan must be stopped, and the children must be saved! You have to come back as soon as possible.',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Hard_1' => 'Hach can\'t you do anything ri- I mean, please, these children need their toys...so my sensitive ears can finally get some rest. Hurry! Ribbit.',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Hard_2' => 'Fudge! This evildoer\'s plan must be stopped, and the children must be saved! You have to come back as soon as possible.',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Medium_1' => 'Hach can\'t you do anything ri- I mean, please, these children need their toys...so my sensitive ears can finally get some rest. Hurry! Ribbit.',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Medium_2' => 'Fudge! This evildoer\'s plan must be stopped, and the children must be saved! You have to come back as soon as possible.',
        'XMAS_Map_Easy_1' => 'Unfortunately, you couldn\'t deliver all the presents in time... Christmas may be ruined, but at least you tried your best... Right?',
