    'ADO' => [
        '$ExpeditionAdventure*' => 'Expedition Island',
        '$ExpeditionPvE*' => 'Archipelago',
        '$ExpeditionPvP*' => 'Contested Island',
        '1001NightsBesiegedCity' => 'On your search for hints about the missing Scheherazade, you meet the intrepid sailor Sinbad. He recommends that you ask the people of the island for information, but the island is currently being besieged by apes! You decide to help the locals with their problem.',
        '1001NightsFirstThief' => 'Ali Baba gave you this map. According to his information, a beautiful woman is held captive here. All you can do is set out, and have a look around for her.',
        '1001NightsOilLamp' => 'You and Ali Baba decide to go separate ways, but he puts you in touch with a friend of his. The man, known as Aladdin, has heard rumours about a beautiful woman arriving on the island, and offers to help... for a price.',
        '1001NightsPrincess' => 'The leads are solid, and all the information points here. You finally arrive at the island where the king\'s wife, Scheherazade, is being held captive. Aladdin has joined you, following a lead of his own on the oil lamp.',
        '1001NightsSeaSnake' => 'The clues you found brought you to a man named Sinbad - an experienced sailor that knows the area like the back of his hand. You hear from the locals that there may be a large amount of treasure hidden on this island, so you decide to investigate more.',
        '1001NightsSecondThief' => 'Ali Baba shares a possible clue to the location of the king\'s missing wife. The thieves may also be using the cave where they stash their treasure for holding people hostage. You both decide to investigate this a bit further.',
        '1001NightsThirdThief' => 'Ali Baba approaches you with another clue. Beautiful women are being held captive in a heavily guarded stronghold. It seems impenetrable at first, but Ali Baba has urged you to wait for him to arrive, assuring he\'ll be able to help you find a way in.',
        '1001NightsTreasureKnowledge' => 'The map you found on the previous island led you here. Ali Baba is convinced that something big is hidden here. You decide to trust his hunch and search the island for the missing Scheherezade, and the treasure Ali Baba is after.',
        '1001NightsTreasureWisdom' => 'Your search brings you to this island, where it appears a long lost civilization once lived. Ali Baba mentions that perhaps the treasure he searches for is also here. Curious about the ancient civilization, you decide to help.',
        '1001NightsWoodcutter' => 'The orient king approaches you with an urgent request - his wife is missing! Last seen on a nearby island. You arrive on the island and get a really harsh welcome..',
        'ANightToRemember' => 'The daughter of one of your settlers has run off with a wicked rogue!

The concerned father has turned to you in desperate need of help. He cannot afford to equip enough men to bring his daughter back, and since the rogue and his outlaws are dangerous men, you are the only one that can help.',
        'BanditNest' => 'The Scouts have found a house hidden in the forest where they think the rogues Chuck, One-Eyed Bert and Metal Tooth are living. Travel to the dark part of the forest and check the rumour out. If you find the scoundrels there, catch them and bring them to justice.',
        'Birthday2013Adventure1' => 'The map shows a small island quite far away. On the picture, it looks different from the other islands you\'ve seen before. A new experience awaits you, it seems…',
        'Birthday2013Adventure2' => 'Buildings are appearing all across another kingdom, and the inhabitants are scared. They await a hero to take care of the phenomenon. Are you that hero?',
        'Birthday2013Adventure3' => 'The jester has given you a map with a funny looking island on it. It seems to be far away, but something a little different will make for a  new experience. As a experienced settler, can you really let this opportunity slip through your fingers?',
        'Birthday2013Adventure4' => 'The island on the picture looks somehow familiar to you, but you don\'t know why. Anyway, the jester wants you to travel there and make your own appraisal, so maybe you should do so.',
        'Birthday2013Adventure5' => 'Buildings are spreading like mushrooms. Sounds pretty strange, and yet interesting. It seems no-one can handle this problem except you. All hopes are pinned on you. Will you live up to expectations?',
        'Birthday2013MilitaryAdventure1' => 'The map shows a big island with a village located on it. It seems the settlers there are having problems with some strange magic that has changed the look of their buildings. The source of the problem has to be somewhere on the island.',
        'Birthday2013MilitaryAdventure1ShopVersion' => 'The map shows a big island with a village located on it. It seems the settlers there are having problems with some strange magic that has changed the look of their buildings. The source of the problem has to be somewhere on the island.',
        'Birthday2013MilitaryAdventure2' => 'The new adventure leads you to an island famous for its beautiful ruins. It seems the inhabitants there have the same problems as the last ones: their buildings look different than usual.',
        'Birthday2013MilitaryAdventure2ShopVersion' => 'The new adventure leads you to an island famous for its beautiful ruins. It seems the inhabitants there have the same problems as the last ones: their buildings look different than usual.',
        'Birthday2020CakeMap' => 'A mysterious island has suddenly appeared out of the morning mists, visible on the horizon. Several fishermen and boats that ventured close enough have given similar reports about seeing evildoers roaming around the island. Strangely, however, it seems everybody saw completely different types of evildoer, but no leaders at all! Either way, you cannot let something like this stand so close to your own island.',
        'BonabertiBusiness' => 'One of the Bonaberti family’s belongings, a beautiful untouched island in the far south, has been overrun by unknown bandits. The Bonabertis, though incredibly wealthy, are not exactly experienced in warfare. Therefore, they\'ve trustingly turned to you for help: could you please eradicate the hostiles on the island? The rewards will definitely be worth it!',
        'BountyHunter' => 'A rich merchant seeks your help.

Some business partners have double-crossed him and now he wants revenge. They have set up camp in a nearby canyon.',
        'BountyHunterNew' => 'A rich merchant seeks your help.

Some business partners have double-crossed him and now he wants revenge. They have set up camp in a nearby canyon.',
        'BuccaneerRoundup' => 'The Pirates have encamped on this island with a complex network of unbreakable stockades.
Only proper teamwork and synchronized attacks will be able to unravel the island’s formidable fortifications.',
        'BuffAdventures_DragonsRoost' => 'A dragon has suddenly appeared and started terrorizing a chain of islands. Somebody must stop it!',
        'BuffAdventures_Easter_Event_2015' => 'For a long time now, where Easter eggs come from has been one of life\'s biggest mysteries. Well, here\'s the truth. In a well hidden village, on a well hidden island, in a well hidden part of the world, there lies a small egg farm. But lately, there\'s been a problem. Polecats have overrun the island, and occupied the chickens\' nests so they can\'t lay any eggs!
Help the chickens to get their nests back.',
        'BuffAdventures_ElChupacabra' => 'The legendary Chupacabra has been spotted on an island to the west, where it is spreading madness among the natives. You have to put an end to it!',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Fisherman' => 'A fisherman shares with you the story of how an enchanted flounder granted his wife her wish of becoming all-powerful. Perhaps too powerful. She\'s become blinded with power, and is now oppressing the land!',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Hansel_Gretel' => 'A distressed woodcutter approaches you. He says that his wife convinced him to abandon his children in the woods, but he\'s now extremely worried about them. Will you help him find them?',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Piper_Of_Hamelin' => 'The Mayor of the town of Hamelin has contacted you, to inform you that a piper has brought a plague of rats to his island. He cordially asks if you could help them deal with it, and promises a huge reward if you do.',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Red_Riding_Hood' => 'The latest reports on the whereabouts of the Evil Queen point to a remote island. The only apparent sign of civilization is a lonely hut in the middle of the island. You decide to investigate a bit further.',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Snow_White' => 'You receive a letter from a young maid called Snow White, stating that her evil stepmother, the queen, has had her hunted down just because she\'s the prettier one. You follow the lead in hopes of finding a clue as to Ilsebille\'s whereabouts.',
        'BuffAdventures_LostCity' => 'We have located an island! It must be the one that houses the fabled City of Glory! 
But why is it teeming with bandits? And where is the city itself? Could the six altars hold the answers?',
        'BuffAdventures_OfSongsAndCurses' => 'An island has been plunged into darkness and eternal mist by some sort of curse. Could the ghost musicians that Sonya claims to have met be the cause of it?

This venture is based on the story "Roxy and the Music of Avalon" by contest winner TheJollyOne!',
        'BuffAdventures_OneStepAhead' => 'Pirates have robbed several of your allied kingdoms. We have identified an island, where we believe the fleet is going to restock. If you can intercept them, you can teach them a lesson and return your allies\' stolen goods.',
        'BuffAdventures_RaidOfTheNords' => 'The natives of a small island need your help! They\'re being threatened by aggressors from the north.',
        'BuffAdventures_Riches_of_the_Mountain' => 'In a mountain on a nearby island, a valuable ore vein has been found. You have been asked to help with the construction of a mining outpost, and to provide it with security. You\'ll receive a big reward for your help.',
        'BuffAdventures_Storm_Recovery' => 'An anxious villager approaches you asking for help. There was a serious storm on their island, and the villagers can\'t afford to make the essential repairs they need. Their harvest was bad, and hunger is starting to haunt the people. Are you willing to help them?

Recommended level: 50+',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_A_giant_battle' => 'After aiding the Mountain Clan to safeguard their border, the time has come to strike back. With the Mountain Clan backing you up, you embark on a Venture to wage war against epic foes.',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_At_the_foot_of_the_Mountain' => 'With your islanders in distress due to the volcanic outburst, Sonya has thought of a way to solve the crisis. 
Old legends speak of a mysterious Mountain Clan in the far north. The only problem is, the region isn\'t mapped out and it\'s been a long time since an adventurer has dared to travel so far north.
Sonya is eager to head out, but first we should make sure we\'re well equipped. Let\'s get ready to go and make history!',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_Mountain_Labyrinth' => 'Deep in the mountains where nobody has set a foot in decades, a labyrinth of paths unfolds. Will you be able to reach the exit alive?',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_The_People_of_the_Mountain' => 'High up in the mountains, people fight a desperate battle for survival and the good of all mankind. Will you be able to change their fate?',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_Unknown_Regions' => 'Just as you start your journey north, the weather suddenly worsens. There is no way to move forward in this storm. 
You\'ll have to find a way to brave this harsh environment somehow.',
        'BuffAdventures_ValuableIntel' => 'One of your informants has gone missing!
He was tasked with keeping an eye on the dealings of a suspicious island town. They must have captured him because he discovered something they didn\'t want us to know!
We must send out a rescue party!',
        'BuffAdventures_heartOfTheWood_medium' => 'The rangers of a nearby town are calling for aid. A strange sickness has fallen upon the trees near their settlement. They\'ve done all they can, but it seems to be spreading into the forest, and even to the local wildlife. We should help them out, and perhaps we can find the reason for this strange plight.',
        'BuffAdventures_safeTheTowns_easy' => 'Not far from here there lies Grain Island, a small island full of swaying, golden ears, which gave the island its name. On this small piece of land, there are two towns - one producing the most delicious brew in these spheres, the other baking the tastiest bread of all the known kingdoms.
The guilds in both towns used to share the grain. 
They would meet in the Grain House - a place where they would negotiate and distribute it equally. But one day, the two guilds started arguing over which product would be the best, and to which guild the most grain should go. Since that day, there have been no more negotiations in the Grain house, as every guild just tries to get as much as they can.
Maybe you can help the two guilds to re-enter negotiations, so our Settlers can feast on the Grain Island\'s famous exports again.',
        'BuffAdventures_twins_easy' => 'In a neighbouring city, two twins have gone missing without a trace. The poor kids! Maybe you can be of help finding them?',
        'ChristmasAdventure2013' => 'The Christmas feast is in danger once again!
A letter from Santa explains that his old nemesis, the Croaker has stolen his sleigh!
And without the sleigh, there\'s no way to deliver the presents to the children!

It\'s up to you to get the sleigh back, and defeat the Croaker!',
        'ChristmasAdventureEasy' => 'As you adjourn to your chamber in the evening, you find an unsigned letter lying on your bed. Excited, you open it and read through the hastily written lines. It is from Santa Claus himself. He reports in short words about a meanie called "Croaker" who has stolen all the presents and barricaded himself on an isle together with other bandits. Get the presents back and save the Christmas feast!',
        'ChristmasAdventureNormal' => 'As you adjourn to your chamber in the evening, you find an unsigned letter lying on your bed. Excited, you open it and read through the hastily written lines. It is from Santa Claus himself. He reports in short words about a meanie called "Croaker" who has stolen all the presents and barricaded himself on an isle together with other bandits. Get the presents back and save the Christmas feast!',
        'EMEventAdventure01' => 'The defensive stance of your first opponent might suggest diffidence, and tempt the foolhardy general into carelessness. However, rest assured that these men, hardened by some fateful battles, have quite a few perfidious tricks up their sleeves, and their injuries may not be as serious as they make out.',
        'EMEventAdventure01_2' => 'The defensive stance of your first opponent might suggest diffidence, and tempt the foolhardy general into carelessness. However, rest assured that these men, hardened by some fateful battles, have quite a few perfidious tricks up their sleeves, and their injuries may not be as serious as they make out.',
        'EMEventAdventure02' => 'They seem unpredictable and wayward, but it would not be advisable to underestimate them. Among them are some of the most experienced and well versed fighters, yet word is that their own trainers seem to struggle with their rigidity. It is even reported that in the face of defeat, some of them become inappropriately headstrong...',
        'EMEventAdventure02_2' => 'They seem unpredictable and wayward, but it would not be advisable to underestimate them. Among them are some of the most experienced and well versed fighters, yet word is that their own trainers seem to struggle with their rigidity. It is even reported that in the face of defeat, some of them become inappropriately headstrong...',
        'EMEventAdventure03' => 'You are now facing veterans of this tournament, even if their historical feats are not always undisputed. These all-weather champions seem quick to battle and always ready for a jolly knees-up, but they can also quickly turn a battle in their favor without much of a plan.',
        'EMEventAdventure03_2' => 'You are now facing veterans of this tournament, even if their historical feats are not always undisputed. These all-weather champions seem quick to battle and always ready for a jolly knees-up, but they can also quickly turn a battle in their favor without much of a plan.',
        'EMEventAdventure04' => 'One ought to be surprised how ruthless the men from these otherwise cultivated lands can act in battle. These valiant combatants used to win their battles with skill and finesse, proving to be formidable opponents. These days, it is said that when particularly challenged, they resort to combat techniques similar to those practiced in the east.',
        'EMEventAdventure04_2' => 'One ought to be surprised how ruthless the men from these otherwise cultivated lands can act in battle. These valiant combatants used to win their battles with skill and finesse, proving to be formidable opponents. These days, it is said that when particularly challenged, they resort to combat techniques similar to those practiced in the east.',
        'EMEventAdventure05' => 'With almost mechanical routine these contestants have turned many a battle in their favor, often not exactly with tactical flair. It seems that only their predictability and confidence in victory could possibly be their undoing. Yet, they may have met their match with you. If you manage to bring them out of their shell, victory is already within reach.',
        'EMEventAdventure05_2' => 'With almost mechanical routine these contestants have turned many a battle in their favor, often not exactly with tactical flair. It seems that only their predictability and confidence in victory could possibly be their undoing. Yet, they may have met their match with you. If you manage to bring them out of their shell, victory is already within reach.',
        'EMEventAdventure06' => 'How deceptively graceful these apparitions may appear when seen scurrying across the battlefield. These sinuous combatants might tempt the short-witted to underestimate their actual proficiency. But beware, your opponents are astute strategists that are up to every trick in the book. Many opponents have already fallen prey to their clever tactical scheming.',
        'EMEventAdventure06_2' => 'How deceptively graceful these apparitions may appear when seen scurrying across the battlefield. These sinuous combatants might tempt the short-witted to underestimate their actual proficiency. But beware, your opponents are astute strategists that are up to every trick in the book. Many opponents have already fallen prey to their clever tactical scheming.',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure01' => 'The map shows the coordinates of a small and easily located island in the north of the country. Looks quite small and easy to find.

Note: No general is required in order to complete the adventure. Just visit the island and gather all Easter eggs.
Note: This adventure contains no rewards!',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure02' => 'Even though this map is no Picasso, it serves its purpose and shows an island far away. Looks promising...

Note: No general is required in order to complete the adventure. Just visit the island and gather all Easter eggs.
Note: This adventure contains no rewards!',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure03' => 'A map of an island even the most casual sailor knows.

Note: No general is required in order to complete the adventure. Just visit the island and gather all Easter eggs.
Note: This adventure contains no rewards!',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure04' => 'It is said that on this island lie a lot of Easter eggs, so if you want to help the Easter bunny, this might be a good place to start.

Note: No general is required in order to complete the adventure. Just visit the island and gather all Easter eggs.
Note: This adventure contains no rewards!',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure05' => 'That is one of the islands belonging to the Easter guy\'s cousin. You\'ve heard the cousin is pretty nice, so maybe it would be OK to borrow some of his eggs?! 

Note: No general is required in order to complete the adventure. Just visit the island and gather all Easter eggs.
Note: This adventure contains no rewards!',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure06' => 'That is the other island belonging to the Easter guy\'s cousin. You\'ve heard the cousin is pretty nice, so maybe it would be OK to borrow some of his eggs?! 

Note: No general is required in order to complete the adventure. Just visit the island and gather all Easter eggs.
Note: This adventure contains no rewards!',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure07' => 'There\'s a rumour going around about some islands with hidden eggs the finder is welcome to keep. What are you waiting for? 

Note: No general is required in order to complete the adventure. Just visit the island and gather all Easter eggs.
Note: This adventure contains no rewards!',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure08' => 'There\'s a rumour going around about some islands with hidden eggs the finder is welcome to keep. What are you waiting for? 

Note: No general is required in order to complete the adventure. Just visit the island and gather all Easter eggs.
Note: This adventure contains no rewards!',
        'EasterEventAdventure01' => 'The map shows the coordinates of an island in the north of the country. It looks quite small and easy to find. Now the Easter egg paper chase can begin.
Note: no general is needed to complete the adventure. Simply visit the island and gather all the eggs.',
        'EasterEventAdventure02' => 'This island looks pretty small too. Let\'s see what the Easter bunny has figured out for you this time.',
        'EasterEventAdventure03' => 'After a strange kind of goodbye from the Easter bunny\'s brother, you arrive at the new isle. This time it is a bit bigger than the last few ones, meaning that it will probably be a lot more challenging.',
        'EasterEventAdventure04' => 'After arriving on the island, you immediately see that the Easter eggs were not hidden properly… They are lying in every corner of the isle. Well then, let\'s get started!',
        'EasterEventAdventure05' => 'This island seems similar to the last one. Easter eggs are lying everywhere, randomly spread, waiting for someone to pick them up. You should have enough practice by now to get through this pretty quickly.',
        'EasterEventAdventure06' => 'This is supposed to be the last island the Easter bunny\'s brother lost Easter eggs on. The end of the odyssey seems close, even though this island appears thick with vegetation. It will not be easy to find all Easter eggs here.',
        'EasterEventAdventure07' => 'The old man\'s description brought you here. The island is very mountainous. How did the Easter bunny\'s brother come up with the idea to hide Easter eggs here? Whatever... Go for the Easter eggs!',
        'EasterEventAdventure08' => 'Hmm.. This time there are no mountains but the main part of the island is all desert, and it is really hot. Think positive: at least there are no mountains.',
        'EasterEventAdventure09' => 'The rabbit wasn\'t exaggerating; there really are quite a lot of wild animals in these dark woods. Hopefully, they haven\'t eaten most of the Easter eggs already.',
        'EasterEventAdventure10' => 'Finally, you have reached the end of your search and can now do your own little Easter egg hunt completely relaxed. However... the island is huge. Happy hunting.',
        'EasterGarrunTrapper' => 'Garrun the Trapper has decided to take upon himself to sabotage Easter. 
To accomplish this he has gathered a cohort of poachers, trappers and hounds and is holding many, if not all, of the Easter Bunnies captive on his camp on Egg Island. 
Set forth to destroy him and liberate the bunnies!',
        'EoWEventAdventure' => 'The old astrologist has convinced our venerable King Damien that we\'re all doomed! In fact, the whole world is doomed! Apparently, the world is soon going to end because of a terrible curse, cast by an old and mysterious clan of witch-doctors over a thousand years ago! However, luckily, the old astrologist also knows a way we can escape the disaster. He\'s opened a gateway in time to take you back to the day the curse was cast, and we need you to prevent the cataclysmic curse from ever being set upon the Earth in the first place! Can you hear their shamans chanting? Quick! There\'s no more time to waste - go and avert what will otherwise be the end of us all!',
        'Gunpowder' => 'A spy report tells of a secluded castle in a large valley far to the east. Obviously the knights there have got hold of some cannons. Those mighty weapons might prove very useful in the future. Yet, these knights surely won\'t give them away freely. You may have to convince them with a little... manpower.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv1' => 'A call for aid from a hitherto unknown island. Artificial creatures are threatening to destroy the inhabitants\' town! Can you defend the people, and investigate the golems\' source?',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv2' => 'Something\'s still not right on the island where you fought the golems. The town is under attack once again, as it seems the true culprit is still at large!',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv3' => 'The barrier around the tyrant\'s castle has a weak point! If you follow the scientist\'s instructions, you may still get to face that villain.',
        'Horseback' => 'The people of the great veld seek your assistance.

One of the rider clans has started terrorizing the settlers in this region, taking their belongings and steal their flocks. If no-one helps them they will have to leave their homeland. The local population doesn\'t possess much, but they are willing to offer their most precious heirloom to anyone who can drive the rider clan away.',
        'LakesideTreasure' => 'An old treasure map we found points to a great treasure hidden on a small island. It seems to be linked to an ancient civilization.
Set sail for this island and find the treasure!',
        'MadHenry' => 'A plea for help reaches your kingdom.

Terrified citizens claim they have been repeatedly raided by a band of villains under the command of a strange woman. She calls herself "Wild Mary" and dares everyone to challenge her. The villagers are in desperate need of help.',
        'MadHenryReloaded' => 'A plea for help reaches your kingdom.
Terrified citizens claim they have been repeatedly raided by a band of villains under the command of a strange woman. She calls herself "Wild Mary" and dares everyone to challenge her. The villagers are in desperate need of help.',
        'MiadArcticExplosion' => 'You wouldn\'t believe it! The Nords are back, and this time they mean business. They raided an island that produces gunpowder for the King\'s army, and they took more than one thousand barrels. It takes just one barrel to destroy a small village...imagine what they could do with that amount! If I understood correctly, they want to detonate the barrels, creating a tidal wave that would wipe out several neighbouring islands, including our own. We cannot let this happen! We need to travel to that abandoned island and take care of business!',
        'MiadBastilleIsland' => 'There is an island somewhere far from here where all of the infamous bad guys and their clans are imprisoned. They live there under their own rules, but they\'re not allowed to leave. The island warden, Count Hackett, has written us a letter saying the clans have started a war between each other to try and win ownership of the island! We must go there quickly and calm down them using our own techniques. Yes, that\'s right, we\'re going to do a little cleanup!',
        'MiadPirateLife' => 'Are you sitting? This letter here came from pirates! And it\'s not a call for ransom or a new threat. They need our help! Yes, you heard me right! A group of veteran and retired pirates, who we defeated several times some years ago, are under attack by bandits. They write that the bandits came and they took over their island. Apparently, the bandits want to become pirates, so they\'re forcing the veterans to teach them about pirate life. I\'m so confused now. Should we help them? Yes? Well, let\'s buckle up, then!',
        'MiadSleepyReef' => 'We have an urgent matter to attend to. Please, sit - there is much to tell. King Damien has an Elite Group called "The Unity". The King trusts them implicitly and shares all his secret plans etc. with them. One of the generals who was part of this special group retired some years ago, and the King gave him an island. Yes, you heard me, the man got an island. Gregorid Skoln is his name, and lives an honourable retirement on his little island, Sleepy Reef, along with his wife and most beloved daughter, Sabilyn. Sadly, Gregorid had some unfinished business before he left Capital Island, and that business has taken over his island. Some of the traitors have stormed the island and are now holding Gregorid and his family hostage. I think this calls for a visit, don\'t you agree? Don\'t forget your sword.',
        'MiadTheLostSkull' => 'A letter from King Damien arrived this morning. We are to travel to Skull Island and stop a bunch of young pirates finding a long lost treasure! I\'ll tell you more about it all when we arrive! Off we go to Skull Island!',
        'MiadTheSleepingVolcano' => 'We\'ve had our share of weird people trying to do weird things, but this is going a tad too far. There\'s this alchemist who somehow managed to create the "Cult of the Sleeping Flame". He actually has followers! And that\'s not all...here comes the best part: he wants to revive a sleeping volcano. Yes, you heard me. Flintrock island is right on the top of a sleeping volcano, and we must go there and save those people before the cult leader burns the whole island to ashes!',
        'MiadTikkiIsland' => 'A beautiful, yet small island, whose population is a bit eccentric. They\'ve asked you for help against the bandits that have been giving them a hard time. Help them, so you can return the coin that was stolen from them and remove the curse surrounding their otherwise peaceful island.',
        'MiadTropicalSun' => 'A pigeon landed this morning, bringing news from your good friend Lord Walder the Bold. Or is it bald? Anyway, he requested your attention regarding a problem he has. His people live on an island ruled by a fierce pirate leader, but they get along well. Neither hurts the other, peace can be smelled in the air. Then two weeks ago an unknown bandit gang appeared from the badlands, and they seem to want the island for themselves. Lord Walder needs your help! I say rally up some of our military forces and pay them a visit. Do you agree?',
        'MoreSecludedExperiments' => 'Can you still remember the man who made these strange experiments some time ago? He was not amused that you destroyed his laboratory. Now, he wants revenge. Fast! Stop his new experiments before they are finished!',
        'MotherLove' => 'The last time you met the crazy ship’s cook, you defeated him and his crew and banished them from the island. After that defeat, the crazy ship’s cook went back to his parent’s house. Now his mother is watching over him. If you want to finish him off you\'ll have to overwhelm his mother first.',
        'NewBanditNest' => 'You\'ve received some new messages from your villagers, telling you there are once again some strange things happening in the woods where you defeated the bandits. The villagers have asked you to take a look and get to the bottom of this new mystery.',
        'OldFriends' => 'The last time you battled the witch of the swamp, you defeated her, but a Dark High Priest escaped. The priest retreated to an abandoned piece of land and performed a dark ritual to bring the witch back to life again. Now the witch of the swamp is regenerating and planning a vendetta against you. Defeat her, while she is still weak!',
        'Outlaws' => 'It is a mark of troubled times when even captivity cannot stop wicked bandits from forming new groups of outlaws. Travellers tell of fearsome raids in the nearby forests. The local knights cannot deal with this hardened group alone and have requested your assistance. Send your men and make the roads safe again!',
        'Pirates' => 'There be pirates!

Peg-legged good-for-nothing brutes are at large near a beach to the south. The surrounding settlements tremble in fear. They have collected quite a decent sum of coins as a reward to anyone that dares to scare the pirates away.',
        'RaidingTheRaiders' => 'One of the scouts managed to track a Raider ship back to its homeport. 
His report indicates the Raiders are based out of a thriving island, governed, in true Raider fashion, by three chieftains. If you ask me, this would be a great opportunity to show them how it feels to be the target of a raid! 
We should strike at their leaders and loot their supplies, once they are defenceless!',
        'RoaringBull' => 'The rider clans of the great veld have requested your assistance. Apparently, an evil shaman called "Roaring Bull" has claimed regency over the whole area. He and his fellow shamans command dark magic and fierce warriors. Nobody can stand against them. You will have to send your finest men in order to defeat them.',
        'SecludedExperiments' => 'You have received word of a mad alchemist who performs experiments on living human beings! He has hired an experienced troop of deadly mercenaries to protect him. You cannot allow this to happen in the vicinity of your realm! Send your troops and stop the madman!',
        'SonsOfTheVeld' => 'You have received a letter of challenge from a group called "The Sons Of The Veld". Obviously a new rider clan has emerged and is overconfident about its own strength. This challenge is an affront to your honour. You have to show these savages their place!',
        'SplitCity' => 'A city split by a landslide encounters strange evil-doers, and is in dire straits. Will you be able to help them?',
        'SplitCityFall' => 'The split city situation is getting ever more dire, as winter is fast approaching. On top of the mad invaders, the piercing cold is becoming almost unbearable. Are you capable of helping the townspeople again?',
        'StealingFromTheRich' => 'A very concerned landlord has written a letter to you. One of his previously loyal master archers has turned rogue, living in the forest and stealing gold from rich merchants and nobles. With it, he bribes simple peasants into rioting. You have to stop this at once!',
        'StealingFromTheRich02' => 'Do you remember the master archer who stole from the rich? Well, he’s back! Or at least, that’s what we think... It may just be a copycat. Nevertheless, someone is rioting within our noble kingdom, stealing from rich merchants to fuel another riot. Please, find this guy and put a stop to it before he does any further harm to our kingdom...',
        'SurpriseAttack' => 'A group of the notorious Nords have built their camp on a small island nearby. It seems as if they are preparing an attack against you. However, they don’t know that their landing did not go unnoticed, so it would be a clever move to attack them now.',
        'TheBetrayedLittleTailor' => 'Though the little tailor has reconciled with his sons, new problems have arisen.
A greedy inn-keeper has stolen the magical items his sons received from their masters.
Once again, he needs your help to get them back.',
        'TheBlackKnights' => 'A claim of sovereignty has arrived at your castle. Hector the Black and his brother Barnabas demand a whole mountain range as their new territory. They have already secretly built black castles and recruited numerous men to defend them. What will you do? Allow this treason to happen? Or will you put an end to this claim once and for all?',
        'TheCleverLittleTailor' => 'Your friend, the little tailor once again needs your help.

The king you defeated regrets his sins and had pledged to approve a marriage between his daughter and the tailor. 

But a rivaling tailor claims he did all the hard work, and has therefore acquired the right to the princess\' hand.

To prove his competitor wrong, the princess has given the little tailor a difficult task…',
        'TheDarkBrotherhood' => 'More and more townsfolk are drawn to a mysterious order in the vicinity of your castle. After some investigation it turns out that a dark brotherhood is trying to undermine your regency. You cannot allow that to happen! Send your men to stop this foul corruption from spreading.',
        'TheDarkPriests' => 'Rumour has it that a couple of dark priests are performing dark rituals. Very dark rituals. There have even been several cats reported missing recently. Understandably, your citizens are more than a little concerned about this. They have turned to you for help and are willing to give what they have in order to compensate you for your efforts.',
        'TheHeroicLittleTailor' => 'You have received a messenger pigeon from your old friend, the little tailor.

He has divorced the princess after realizing she couldn’t be the right person for him if she demands he risk his life for no reason.

So he has decided to go on a journey to see the wonders of this world.

Unfortunately though, he has wandered too far into a dark forest, and is now stranded in a hermit’s hut.
The forest around him is too dangerous for him to leave the hut alone, so he needs your help to get back home.',
        'TheIslandOfThePirates' => 'On a secluded island, a bunch of pirates have built their headquarters. Within a radius of hundreds of kilometers they attack helpless port cities and frighten inhabitants. If you want to earn fame and glory, visit the island and banish the pirates and their crazy ship\'s cook.',
        'TheNords' => 'You have received a threating letter containing the demands of a bunch of wild men that landed on the shore not long ago. Apparently, they are part of some kind of wild Nordic tribe that intends to go pillaging and plundering their way through the area. For the sake of your people\'s safety you should challenge this tribe. Drive them away and restore peace and order to your kingdom.',
        'TheNords2' => 'One of our traders just arrived back from Nearpole Island and has some grave news! He claims the most feared Nords have invaded the island and brought a cold wind along with them! They came from the northern islands that were believed to be buried under the ice. We need to head to Windy Island and see what\'s happening!',
        'TheSiege' => 'The remote mansion of Lord Scroogius is besieged by two competing factions. 
Due to the lay of the land, a two-pronged assault is required to break the siege in the little time they have left until their provisions run out. 
Hurry to help the Lord and the reward will be well worth it!',
        'TheSonsOfTheLittleTailor' => 'You have received a letter from your friend the little tailor.
He says he has three sons, and has made a big mistake. 
He now wants to make up for it, but needs your help to do so.',
        'TheValiantLittleTailor' => 'Your old friend the little tailor is in a bad way. The king has sent him on a very dangerous task where he can’t succeed alone.
Maybe you can help him out?',
        'TombRaiders' => 'Dark Cultists have retrieved an ancient artefact and secluded it on their fortified island, where they perform unspeakable rituals in its name. 
Sail forth with your comrades and put an end to this abominable practice!',
        'Traitors' => 'Loyal men they were, but greed turned them into ruthless bandits. The nobles have turned to you for help against these deserters. Be careful if you approach them since these traitors are heavily armed, battle hardened men.',
        'Traitors02' => 'Do you remember Sir Robin, the king of the traitors? Well, he’s back! Some loyal followers have freed him from his prison. Ever since, he’s been hiding on an island nearby. Finally, we’ve managed to locate him, and it’s time to take action! We need to put him back in prison before he starts attacking our beautiful kingdom!',
        'TwinTown_Cave1' => 'After following Kaedric\'s tracks, your people discovered a colossal underground cave. However, unknown challenges are lurking in the dark. What might the true nature of this place be?',
        'TwinTown_Main' => 'While searching for Sonya\'s missing former mentor, a new and far away island has become the center of attention. Adventures, secrets and revelations await, but they lie a many-day long sea voyage away. Are you ready for this huge endeavor?',
        'VictorTheVicious' => 'Victor The Vicious hails from a kingdom far away.

His skills in archery are unparalleled. Some say he shot an apple from the head of his own son! Unfortunately he has claimed the nearby hunting valley of a friendly regent for his own. The regent cannot accept such boldness, and has placed a bounty on Victor\'s head.',
        'WMEventAdventure01' => 'Oh, this is exciting!  A practice match against the Knight of Crowrock and his entourage. We can use this to figure out how to play the match.',
        'WMEventAdventure02' => 'So, this will be our first real match. Our opponent is the Barony of Tepidwater. Much like us, they haven\'t played many matches yet. Folks say the barony is playing a very offensive 4-3-3 system. We should keep an eye on their midfielders, but at the same time watch out for their three strikers. The Baron of Tepidwater has some strong players in his team.',
        'WMEventAdventure03' => 'Here comes the next game of the group stage. Today our opponent will be the Barony of Emberstream. The guys from Emberstream are a very defensive team with a strong defensive line-up. If we want to make it to their goal, we\'ll need a cunning plan.',
        'WMEventAdventure04' => 'Now it\'s getting serious - our first knock-out match, against the Shire of Oxwater. During the group stage they showed skill in attack, while maintaining a stable defence. They play in a 4-2-4 formation – that means with four forwards.',
        'WMEventAdventure05' => 'In the quarter finals, we will play the Electorate of Sunflower Grove. They\'ve certainly earnt their place amongst the last eight teams in the tournament. Similar to our former opponent they play with a strong attacking squad, although their midfield is a little more balanced. This will be a tough opponent.',
        'WMEventAdventure06' => 'The semi-finals! We\'re up against the grand Duchy of Darkwood. What do you need to know about this opponent? They stand closely staggered in a 1-4-1-4 system and have many very strong players. They are one of the best teams left.',
        'WMEventAdventure07' => 'It’s the day of the finals. Our opponent is the Kingdom of Dragonhead. Going by their results so far, they\'ve clearly been the best team in the whole tournament – next to us, of course. All their players are strong, and they are said to be confident. But then, they\'ve never played us. Go out on the field and show them what we\'re made of!',
        'Whirlwind' => 'It is a mark of troubled times when wicked bandits form new groups of outlaws. Travellers talk of an island shrouded in mist, where the bandits set sail and spread over the land.
Send your men and see to it that this stronghold is destroyed!',
        'WitchOfTheSwamp' => 'Rumours tell of a mighty witch.

She lives in a poisonous swamp and is believed to have the ugliest face you can imagine, warts all over her deformed nose and a laughter that can freeze your spine. Anyone who dares to journey into her realm is sure to earn fame and glory.',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Easy_1' => 'With your support, Santa was able to build a magical Christmas Wonderland to bring joy to abandoned children. Deliver Toys to the children to make them behave, as Santa seems unable to handle them!',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Easy_2' => 'You and the real Santa have discovered that an evildoer is using magic to trick everyone. Deliver Santa\'s spell-breaking gifts to free everyone and reveal who\'s behind this mysterious scheme!',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Hard_1' => 'With your support, Santa was able to build a magical Christmas Wonderland to bring joy to abandoned children. Deliver Toys to the children to make them behave, as Santa seems unable to handle them!',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Hard_2' => 'You and the real Santa have discovered that an evildoer is using magic to trick everyone. Deliver Santa\'s spell-breaking gifts to free everyone and reveal who\'s behind this mysterious scheme!',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Medium_1' => 'With your support, Santa was able to build a magical Christmas Wonderland to bring joy to abandoned children. Deliver Toys to the children to make them behave, as Santa seems unable to handle them!',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Medium_2' => 'You and the real Santa have discovered that an evildoer is using magic to trick everyone. Deliver Santa\'s spell-breaking gifts to free everyone and reveal who\'s behind this mysterious scheme!',
        'XMAS_Map_Easy_1' => 'Since Santa\'s reindeers are missing, he\'s a little short on time - and he could use our help! Close to our kingdom, there are a few smaller islands with loads of families living there. They\'re not exactly in a very Christmassy mood, as they heard that Santa might not make it to their island this year. If we deliver the presents instead, we could help Santa, and bring some Christmas spirit to those poor families too! 
Wouldn\'t that be the right thing to do at Christmas?',
