    'ADT' => [
        '$ExpeditionAdventure*' => 'A mysterious island. Your explorer found a hidden island! Fame, glory, adventure and - most of all - treasure awaits! ...behind the hordes of enemies, that is.',
        '$ExpeditionPvE*' => 'A haven of beautiful islands. Your explorer found the location of a secret archipelago, rich in natural resources. Explore the beautiful islands, and set out to make one of them your colony. But beware! The inhabitants might not welcome you with open arms...',
        '$ExpeditionPvP*' => 'An expedition island! Your explorer has found the location of a secret colony island, extremely rich in natural resources. There are signs of previous battles everywhere, meaning someone else has likely found it before you. Conquer the island and snatch it from its previous owner to take control of its resources. But beware! Other explorers might find the island too, and then their armies will be landing on your doorstep...',
