    'ADW' => [
        '$ExpeditionAdventure_01_01_01' => 'You cleared the expedition training island.',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_10*' => 'You won the small barren colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_11*' => 'You won the small promising colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_12*' => 'You won the small rich colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_13*' => 'You won the regular barren colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_14*' => 'You won the regular promising colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_15*' => 'You won the regular rich colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_16*' => 'You won the huge barren colony',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_17*' => 'You won a huge, promising colony!',
        '$ExpeditionPvP_18*' => 'You won the huge rich colony',
        '1001NightsBesiegedCity' => 'The crazed apes ran away, and the city is free again! The locals shower you with praise and riches, and start calling you their saviour. There doesn\'t seem to be anything else in the way of treasure or clues here, though. Having hit a dead end, you hope Ali Baba has more luck finding his treasure and the missing Scheherezade.',
        '1001NightsFirstThief' => 'You\'ve managed to hunt down the thief and free a slave girl named Mardschana. She seems to be attracted to Ali Baba and agrees to help you on your quest.',
        '1001NightsOilLamp' => 'The cornered informant spills the beans. A beautiful woman was indeed brought to this island not long ago. Unfortunately for you, both the woman and the oil lamp that Aladdin is looking for were recently taken to another island. You and Aladdin decide to go to this island to confirm the informant\'s claims.',
        '1001NightsPrincess' => 'In the dungeons of the old palace you encounter Scheherezade, King Schahri\'s wife, and another beautiful young woman that Aladdin recognizes immediately as Jasmine, the sultan\'s daughter. Leaving Jasmine and Aladdin for their new adventures together, you take Scheherezade back to her husband, who lavishes you with riches and praise in appreciation.',
        '1001NightsSeaSnake' => 'The sea snake has been slain. There are no signs of any treasure or Scheherezade at all, but you find a silver lining knowing that the shiny sea snake scales are worth a lot, so long as you can figure out where to take them. Having hit a dead end, you hope Ali Baba has better luck than you.',
        '1001NightsSecondThief' => 'It was too late. The thieves have taken most of the treasure and left. Ali Baba notices that there are two different trails left by the thieves. You collect the remaining treasure and leave, wondering which of the trails will take you to Scheherazade.',
        '1001NightsThirdThief' => 'You realize that the "captive women" that you were looking for were none other than finely crafted female sculptures. Ali Baba tries to comfort you by reminding you there are still a few loose ends that the thieves have left, and that there may be still hope.',
        '1001NightsTreasureKnowledge' => 'Despite the lack of clues about Scheherezade\'s location in the library, one of its books catches your eye. It talks about great riches, legendary sailors and hidden treasures on a neighbouring island. After discussing it with Ali Baba, you both decide it\'s worth investigating.',
        '1001NightsTreasureWisdom' => 'Inside the temple, you find invaluable information about the ancient civilization. Their knowledge, traditions, and wisdom passed on throughout the centuries. Unfortunately, there are no clues about Scheherezade whatsoever. Ali Baba notices a legend in the chronicles mentioning islands with great treasures and legendary sailors. Given that you don\'t have any more leads to follow, you decide it\'s worth taking a look.',
        '1001NightsWoodcutter' => 'You\'ve met Ali Baba, the young woodcutter, who agrees to help you find Scheherazade.',
        'ANightToRemember' => 'Oh joy!

The daughter has been returned to her loving father. The family reunion is indeed a happy one. The rogue had apparently twisted the daughter\'s mind into thinking that her father was keeping her in a gilded cage. Stuff and nonsense, of course.',
        'BanditNest' => 'As you suspected, the rumours were true. You found the bandits and brought them to justice one by one. The woods are now safe again, thanks to you.',
        'Birthday2013Adventure1' => 'That was a really new experience, and a strange one. Anyway, the people you helped are happy and can go on living as normal. If you can call living there \'normal\'.',
        'Birthday2013Adventure2' => 'You managed to find and remove all the out of place buildings. Well done! The inhabitants are happy and can continue their everyday lives as if nothing had happened.',
        'Birthday2013Adventure3' => 'You were able to solve the problem on the island and return successfully. The settlers are happy and thankful, and they hope you will come back and visit them sometime soon.',
        'Birthday2013Adventure4' => 'It seems everyone is very grateful for your help. The jester is eager to know your opinion. Have you figured out why the island looks familiar? Is it familiar at all?',
        'Birthday2013Adventure5' => 'You did it, and lived up to your expectations. The jester seems especially satisfied. Not sure whether that\'s a good or bad thing though.',
        'Birthday2013MilitaryAdventure1' => 'You managed to defeat the shaman and return everything back to normal. The jester and the settlers living there are satisfied, and you can go back to your everyday business.',
        'Birthday2013MilitaryAdventure1ShopVersion' => 'You managed to defeat the shaman and return everything back to normal. The jester and the settlers living there are satisfied, and you can go back to your everyday business.',
        'Birthday2013MilitaryAdventure2' => 'The magic bond between the ruins and the village has been broken, and once again you have restored the buildings to their normal condition. Well done!',
        'Birthday2013MilitaryAdventure2ShopVersion' => 'The magic bond between the ruins and the village has been broken, and once again you have restored the buildings to their normal condition. Well done!',
        'Birthday2020CakeMap' => 'After the evildoers had been defeated, they started to disappear like fog. Then the whole island began to vanish bit by bit! The troops barely made it back to their ships, and some even had to swim as the ground melted into thin air under their feet.',
        'BonabertiBusiness' => 'Well done! The island is free from bandits again. The Bonabertis are very pleased with your work, and have started searching through their treasure chambers to find something that would adequately reward you.',
        'BountyHunter' => 'A bounty well hunted!

The vicious business partners will think twice about double-crossing honest merchants in the future.',
        'BountyHunterNew' => 'A bounty well hunted!

The vicious business partners will think twice about double-crossing honest merchants in the future.',
        'BuccaneerRoundup' => 'Congratulations! You teamwork has paid off.  The pirate threat is once again eliminated from these islands!',
        'BuffAdventures_DragonsRoost' => 'You\'ve stopped a dangerous threat - and I got to see a live dragon! I know the latter wasn\'t a priority for you, but I still appreciate it.
I have just the thing to thank you..',
        'BuffAdventures_Easter_Event_2015' => 'Great! Now the chickens can relax and hatch their eggs. Here\'s a small reward for your efforts.',
        'BuffAdventures_ElChupacabra' => 'Good news! With the Chupacabra gone, the people have indeed already started to recover.
This whole business was quite interesting, from both a zoological and medical perspective.  As way of thanks, I have designed this modern mine for you.',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Fisherman' => 'The Evil Queen, defeated, flees towards a different land. Although your job is not yet done, the inhabitants of this land are grateful for your help. The fisherman begs you to help his wife, and bids you good luck with your adventures.',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Hansel_Gretel' => 'The Evil Queen has been defeated once more, and Hansel and Gretel are back with their father, where they belong. The food you gathered on your hunt will ensure that they won\'t go hungry for a long, long time.',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Piper_Of_Hamelin' => 'As it turns out, the mayor was in fact Queen Ilsebille in disguise! You managed to avoid the set-up and defeat her once again. The inhabitants of Hamelin hail your success, and they accept the piper as one of their own. After all, he was only another victim of the Evil Queen.',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Red_Riding_Hood' => 'Now that the Evil Queen\'s been forced off the island, Red and her grandma can go back to living a peaceful life in their hut. Still, somehow, you quite can\'t shake the feeling that this may not be the last time we hear from Queen Ilsebille...',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Snow_White' => 'Snow White\'s stepmother, the Evil Queen, was in fact Queen Ilsebille in disguise! It turns out her real stepmother was being held captive. Snow White and her stepmother had a long overdue talk, where they agreed to become better friends, and exchange beauty tips.',
        'BuffAdventures_LostCity' => 'The knowledge I found within the ruins is priceless! This civilization was technologically advanced even by today\'s standards.
It has already inspired me to come up with several new inventions! What do you think of this mine? I\'ll let you keep the prototype.',
        'BuffAdventures_OfSongsAndCurses' => 'What a beautiful song! Just listening to it was worth the trouble, was it not?

Don\'t worry - I was just joking. The islanders and I have prepared some actual rewards for you',
        'BuffAdventures_OneStepAhead' => 'Your allies send their sincerest thanks. They\'ve even said I can perform my research on some of the artifacts you recovered.
This would not have been possible without your help! Please accept this as a token of my gratitude.',
        'BuffAdventures_RaidOfTheNords' => 'What a feast! By repelling the Nords and rebuilding their village, we saved the natives and earned their trust. I can\'t wait to study all their legends!
I think you\'re due a reward!',
        'BuffAdventures_Riches_of_the_Mountain' => 'You did it! You managed to defeat the sabotage effort, and secure the vein. The foreman is pleased, and sends you the reward to your island.',
        'BuffAdventures_Storm_Recovery' => 'Great Job! You\'ve rebuilt the settlement and the villagers are very thankful.',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_A_giant_battle' => 'Unthinkable. Unfathomable. Formidable. Once again, you have proven yourself, and the story of your journey into the mountains will be shared as a legend by generations to come. The Frost Giant\'s generals weren\'t able to stop your iron will, and Risi has drawn his last icy breath.

The Mountain Clan has declared this week as "The Settlers" Festival Week, and prepared a banquet for you and your troops. The celebrations will continue for long after you\'ve left.

The Mountain Clan is finally able to recuperate from the years of fighting. And with the borders now open, and trade routes slowly growing, they will be able to restore the former glory of their clan.',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_At_the_foot_of_the_Mountain' => 'A great beginning to a great venture! You conquered new enemies and the harsh environment alike. 
But the journey has just begun, and there\'s a lot more to come. The challenges we\'ll face aren\'t getting any easier, but the rewards will be worth it. Now let\'s head out, and conquer new frontiers!',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_Mountain_Labyrinth' => 'Mountains are full of challenges, but you burst through them all. Despite the harsh environment, and barely any help, you overcame a labyrinth of obstacles and enemies. Will anything be able to stop you? Continue your journey north, and find out.',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_The_People_of_the_Mountain' => 'What a great achievement! You managed to save the legendary Mountain Clan from their imminent destruction, and in the process gained an ally for a lifetime. But the battle is not over yet. The Mountain Clan is still desperately holding the lines against the ancient evil.',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_Unknown_Regions' => 'Was the landscape not a big enough challenge? Did you really have to fight those bandits, on top of everything else?! Not to worry. Once again, you overcame every obstacle. 
Time to see what else this continent has in store for you.',
        'BuffAdventures_ValuableIntel' => 'Looks like the mission was a huge success. You freed the spy, earned the governor\'s respect and returned the treasures to the peoples they were stolen from - but not before I analyzed some of the more interesting artefacts!
As you haven\'t really got much out of this endeavour, let me at least share this invention with you.',
        'BuffAdventures_heartOfTheWood_medium' => 'You did it! You helped the rangers revitalize their island. The rangers are pleased, and sent a reward to your island.',
        'BuffAdventures_safeTheTowns_easy' => 'Well done! The bakers and brewers are back at the Grain House to start negotiating. Maybe soon our Settlers will be able to enjoy their tasty products again.',
        'BuffAdventures_twins_easy' => 'You were able to help the villagers find the kids! Hopefully, this won\'t happen again - but if it does, we\'ll know who to call!',
        'ChristmasAdventure2013' => 'Happy days!
You managed to defeat the Croaker and get Santa\'s Sleigh back.

And in the ruins of the Croaker\'s lair you found some treasure.',
        'ChristmasAdventureEasy' => 'You had never seen a creature like Croaker before. He said he wanted to destroy Christmas because he didn\'t appreciate joy. However, you have managed to put an end to his plans. The Christmas feast is saved.',
        'ChristmasAdventureNormal' => 'You had never seen a creature like Croaker before. He said he wanted to destroy Christmas because he didn\'t appreciate joy. However, you have managed to put an end to his plans. The Christmas feast is saved.',
        'EMEventAdventure01' => 'What a glorious victory! Your opponent truly didn\'t hold back, and showed impressive class, all of which makes this success even sweeter. What a great way to start the tournament!',
        'EMEventAdventure01_2' => 'What a glorious victory! Your opponent truly didn\'t hold back, and showed impressive class, all of which makes this success even sweeter. What a great way to start the tournament!',
        'EMEventAdventure02' => 'You stood fast and showed the enemy that you\'re there\'s no messing with you! A worthy victory that is going to make a lasting impression on your followers.',
        'EMEventAdventure02_2' => 'You stood fast and showed the enemy that you\'re there\'s no messing with you! A worthy victory that is going to make a lasting impression on your followers.',
        'EMEventAdventure03' => 'You have defeated a worthy opponent with skill and finesse, and your supporters are jubilating. Truly a respectable effort to be proud of!',
        'EMEventAdventure03_2' => 'You have defeated a worthy opponent with skill and finesse, and your supporters are jubilating. Truly a respectable effort to be proud of!',
        'EMEventAdventure04' => 'Your opponent was no match for you! Revel in the glory of this moment while you can, for there are more stiff challenges ahead of you!',
        'EMEventAdventure04_2' => 'Your opponent was no match for you! Revel in the glory of this moment while you can, for there are more stiff challenges ahead of you!',
        'EMEventAdventure05' => 'You were victorious in what can only be called a remarkable battle! Such a spectacle is a rare sight to behold and your followers are rightfully stoked.',
        'EMEventAdventure05_2' => 'You were victorious in what can only be called a remarkable battle! Such a spectacle is a rare sight to behold and your followers are rightfully stoked.',
        'EMEventAdventure06' => 'What a triumph! You have proven your strategic brilliance in a truly epic struggle that shall be remembered! Your Settlers shall tell their offspring of this day and proudly look up to you.',
        'EMEventAdventure06_2' => 'What a triumph! You have proven your strategic brilliance in a truly epic struggle that shall be remembered! Your Settlers shall tell their offspring of this day and proudly look up to you.',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure01' => 'Congratulations! The Easter egg search was successful. You found all the eggs! You can return now to your home zone.',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure02' => 'Congratulations! The Easter egg search was successful. You found all the eggs! You can return now to your home zone.',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure03' => 'Congratulations! The Easter egg search was successful. You found all the eggs! You can return now to your home zone.',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure04' => 'Congratulations! The Easter egg search was successful. You found all the eggs! You can return now to your home zone.',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure05' => 'Congratulations! The Easter egg search was successful. You found all the eggs! You can return now to your home zone.',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure06' => 'Congratulations! The Easter egg search was successful. You found all the eggs! You can return now to your home zone.',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure07' => 'Congratulations! The Easter egg search was successful. You found all the eggs! You can return now to your home zone.',
        'EasterEvent2013Adventure08' => 'Congratulations! The Easter egg search was successful. You found all the eggs! You can return now to your home zone.',
        'EasterEventAdventure01' => 'That should be all Easter eggs for this isle. Quite a lot to carry around. If all islands contain that many Easter eggs it will become difficult to carry them at all. But for now, let\'s go home!',
        'EasterEventAdventure02' => 'Once again, your Easter egg search was successful. It\'s good that you stored the Easter eggs from the first search, otherwise it would have been too much to carry.',
        'EasterEventAdventure03' => 'This isle was a lot more difficult than the others. Nevertheless, you managed to find all Easter eggs once again, finishing the paper chase. Congratulations!',
        'EasterEventAdventure04' => 'The Easter bunny\'s brother must have had a real huge hole in his backpack, considering how many Easter eggs have fallen out of it. You should go home for now and check whether there is any news.',
        'EasterEventAdventure05' => 'It\'s astounding that all the Easter eggs are safe and sound even after falling out of a back pack and lying around for quite some time in the wilderness. Anyway, you managed once again to secure all the Easter eggs, and can now make your way home.',
        'EasterEventAdventure06' => 'Well, that was the last Easter egg. All the missing Easter eggs should be together again. Now, you just have to find a way to carry them all home.',
        'EasterEventAdventure07' => 'Now the mountains are free of Easter eggs. The only thing left is to hope the next islands are easier to cross.',
        'EasterEventAdventure08' => 'Who would have thought that one day you would be searching for Easter eggs in the desert? Let\'s hope the eggs haven\'t become completely hard boiled after all that time in the sun.',
        'EasterEventAdventure09' => 'Unbelievable! All the Easter eggs have been found, and the Easter bunny\'s brother is safe too. A total success.',
        'EasterEventAdventure10' => 'You have truly become a master hunter. An Easter egg hunter, that is. Now you can return home with your large collection of Easter eggs.',
        'EasterGarrunTrapper' => 'Garrun lies defeated and you proceed to open all the bunny cages. 
What follows can only be described as an avalanche of fluffiness. 
Easter is saved!',
        'EoWEventAdventure' => 'Now how does that feel? Not only have you defeated all of these hideous wretches, you also saved the entire world from destruction!  All hail our savior!',
        'Gunpowder' => 'Explosions and searing flames marked much of this battle, but in the end your men remained victorious.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv1' => 'The townsfolk send their thanks, and the scientist sends an apology. I have a feeling we\'ll be seeing them again sooner than we\'d like, though...',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv2' => 'That didn\'t really feel like a success, but all we can do now is wait. And prepare.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv3' => 'You did it! It may have taken a while, but evil has been banished from the island. The people no longer need to fear for their lives, and are busily rebuilding the houses that were destroyed. They send a reward for you, too.',
        'Horseback' => 'The people of the veld are forever grateful for your help. In a joyful celebration with dancing and percussive music they declare you an honourary member of their tribe.',
        'LakesideTreasure' => 'Congratulations! Your teamwork has paid off. The treasure is yours - at least, until you get it to a museum and get your reward.',
        'MadHenry' => 'The wild woman has been driven away!
As you return to the villagers with the good news you are greeted cheerfully. Another bandit leader has been defeated and the land is safe once more. The village elder is proud to hand over your reward.',
        'MadHenryReloaded' => 'The wild woman has been driven away!
As you return to the villagers with the good news you are greeted cheerfully. Another bandit leader has been defeated and the land is safe once more. The village elder is proud to hand over your reward.',
        'MiadArcticExplosion' => 'All of the barrels are now on the bottom of the sea, and the Nords are once again defeated! Very well done!',
        'MiadBastilleIsland' => 'Well done! Count Hackett got his island back, and all the bad guys were sealed off inside their little territory. I hope they won\'t cause any more trouble!',
        'MiadPirateLife' => 'Great work! Those bandits should learn to behave, not to become something even worse! The retired pirate veterans are very happy and grateful for your help, and they promised to talk with their relatives about considering retirement too. Pirate life is dangerous, after all.',
        'MiadSleepyReef' => 'The family should be safe now, but I\'ve advised them to get more guards on the island - they shouldn\'t risk another unfortunate problem like the one we just resolved! Thank the maker we arrived in time! Good work!',
        'MiadTheLostSkull' => 'I have personally sealed the Skull and had it delivered to Capital Island! The King will be most satisfied when he hears of your victorious campaign! Great work!',
        'MiadTheSleepingVolcano' => 'Flintrock island is safe again...the volcano will not erupt in the near future. Let\'s hope that it won\'t ever erupt again. The people of the island asked me to give you these gifts. We did a good thing here!',
        'MiadTikkiIsland' => 'The Tikkians are very happy about your help - but they\'re even happier that you brought back their coin! It is of inestimable value for them. To reward you for your good deed, they\'ve announced you an honorary citizen of Tikki island.',
        'MiadTropicalSun' => 'Lord Walder and the council have decided to build a statue in your honour. It will be placed at the plaza in their village! Sunrimm Island is safe again, thanks to you!',
        'MoreSecludedExperiments' => 'You managed to defeat the mad scientist once again and stopped all the experiments. However, at the last moment, he slipped through your clutches. Let\'s hope he doesn\'t come back any time soon.',
        'MotherLove' => 'No one had imagined that the battle against the mother of the crazy ship’s cook would be so difficult, or that such heavy losses would be incurred, but you have banished her and her son from the seven seas.',
        'NewBanditNest' => 'Who would have thought that someone would move in here again? Nevertheless, you cleared the area once more, and everything has returned to normal. For now.',
        'OldFriends' => 'It was an uphill battle, but you defeated the new army of the witch of the swamp. Try not to imagine what would have happened if she had been given more time…',
        'Outlaws' => 'Those men were stronger than expected and still you managed to break their band into pieces. The roads are safe to travel again and the local knight happily hands over your reward. You\'re a shining example to them.',
        'Pirates' => 'The shores are safe again!

With vigilance and dedication you\'ve removed all the scum from the ocean. Not even a single eye-patch is left. Good work! The villagers happily hand over your reward.',
        'RaidingTheRaiders' => 'This magnificent strike at the heart of their leadership should set the raiders back, at least for a while!',
        'RoaringBull' => 'One by one the witch towers have fallen. Your soldiers have shown extraordinary skill while fighting against this overpowering enemy. The loot they brought back is well deserved!',
        'SecludedExperiments' => 'After a decisive battle, the mercenaries have been beaten. Thankfully you were able to free those poor townsmen. They are forever grateful. Additionally your men have destroyed the laboratory and looted it for any useful remains.',
        'SonsOfTheVeld' => 'The fight was tough but you were victorious. That should teach those savages a lesson. Nobody challenges you and walks away unharmed. Your name will surely be remembered by those rider clans.',
        'SplitCity' => 'What a relief. You beat the evildoers surrounding the city; the people were able to recuperate, and at least they can have a few days of rest before more foes arrive to terrorize them. Even if this victory is only a short-term remedy, the tears of joy the people shed showed it was not for naught.',
        'SplitCityFall' => 'Wow, that was unexpectedly difficult. Quite curious how those apes banded together with those bandits? They probably came in over the mountains to the north. Imagine what it would have looked like had the route not been blocked by a mountain ridge... Yet in spite of all those vicious creatures, you came through and managed to protect the people from a devastating fate. Hopefully, they\'ll hold out through the winter again. But according to people\'s reports, both the foes that arrive, and surviving in general gets much worse during the winter. Can you imagine? It\'s doubtful anyone would even attempt to do anything about it. Or would you dare to try?',
        'StealingFromTheRich' => 'Your decisive action has put an end to these peasant riots. All bandits have been put into prison. Unfortunately, the mysterious master archer has escaped. Who knows when he will assemble new outlaws to threaten the merchants again? Well, at least for now the forest is safe again.',
        'StealingFromTheRich02' => 'Well done! Here’s your reward. It was a pleasure seeing this evil man be defeated. Finally, the rich can relax and enjoy their riches again. Thank you so much.',
        'SurpriseAttack' => 'The arrogant Nords were surprised by your attack and had no chance of winning. Before they could react, your men chased them away.',
        'TheBetrayedLittleTailor' => 'Well done! You’ve got the stolen goods back, and taught the greedy inn-keeper a lesson he will never forget!',
        'TheBlackKnights' => 'Hector and Barnabas have proven to be worthy opponents. Were it not for their treason you could almost congratulate them. Now they are on the run, their castles smashed and their men scattered. Just goes to show; if you claim a territory you should be able to hold it.',
        'TheCleverLittleTailor' => 'Finally! I’m now married and still alive, all thanks to you my old friend! Let me give you something for your efforts.',
        'TheDarkBrotherhood' => 'The brotherhood is destroyed! Your men have successfully captured the leaders of this dark brotherhood. Still they seem unwilling to revoke their teachings. Maybe some other time the brotherhood will rise again. You must be ever watchful.',
        'TheDarkPriests' => 'You encountered armoured henchmen, vicious ruins and black magic, but in the end you were victorious. The dark priests have been driven away and the world has been freed of those evil rituals. You were even able to return numerous cats to their loving owners in your town.',
        'TheHeroicLittleTailor' => 'You have saved a whole kingdom, and the tailor has finally found a wife who truly loves him. Last but not least, you have also found a great amount of treasure in the ruins of the Dark Magician’s castle.',
        'TheIslandOfThePirates' => 'You have put the crazy ship’s cook and his pirates to flight. Now the sea is safe again. The inhabitants of the port cities show their thankfulness and donate their riches to you.',
        'TheNords' => 'By burning the ridiculous letter of demands in front of the defeated Nordic tribe, you made it quite clear who is the true king of these parts. The tribe has agreed to leave your shores peacefully, never to return.',
        'TheNords2' => 'Done! The Hoarfrost Globe was destroyed, and the Nords will think twice before they try something like that again! Sadly, Odinom the Cruel managed to escape, and I fear this is not the last time we will hear of him. Anyway, it\'s over! No, don\'t go yet…you see, we\'ve found a frozen chest inside Odinom\'s tent. It contains several "interesting" items that we must take back to Capital Island. However, you may keep this one. I\'m sure it will be of great use to you. Let this be our little secret...',
        'TheSiege' => 'Congratulations! Your teamwork has paid off. Or, at least, that\'s what Lord Scroogius will tell you.',
        'TheSonsOfTheLittleTailor' => 'Congratulations! Not only have you found the little tailor’s sons, you\'ve also helped them get their apprenticeships!',
        'TheValiantLittleTailor' => 'The King has been defeated, the little tailor is safe, and you\'ve obtained quite a lot of treasure.
This calls for a feast!',
        'TombRaiders' => 'Congratulations! The Cultists have scattered! May peace reign once more within the islands!',
        'Traitors' => 'You brought those deserters to justice. They can now spend their time in prison thinking about what they did to the people they swore to protect. Your nobility is very happy with your success and is delighted to reward you accordingly.',
        'Traitors02' => 'That was a real fight, but you managed to defeat Sir Robin and his men once more! Leave the rest to us. We’ll take him back to prison, where he belongs - and where he’ll stay for the rest of his life!',
        'TwinTown_Cave1' => 'A weird feeling wraps around your body, even though you\'ve managed to fight through all these new threats. But have you really left the adventure behind? The feeling that something has not yet been concluded seems to stick to your innermost core. Still, it\'s nothing a good night\'s sleep won\'t fix, right? And you can always come back if the nagging feeling won\'t leave...',
        'TwinTown_Main' => 'Laeylorn took you into its fangs and didn\'t let go. Or did it?',
        'VictorTheVicious' => 'In an epic battle you bested Victor\'s men!

Only by the favor of the gods did the scoundrel escape captivity. Still, the valley has been freed and the regent rewards your effort handsomely.',
        'WMEventAdventure01' => 'Well done! The real matches will be a lot tougher, but it looks like you\'re well prepared',
        'WMEventAdventure02' => 'Congratulations! We won the first group stage game. If we can win the second one as well, we might just advance to the last 16!',
        'WMEventAdventure03' => 'That was really a good performance! Thanks to your excellent tactics, it\'s now official: we made the last 16!',
        'WMEventAdventure04' => 'What a thrilling match! I\'m glad we could beat the Shire of Oxwater – even if it was a close call. Let’s see which opponent is awaiting us next.',
        'WMEventAdventure05' => 'Unbelievable! You made it! We\'re in the semi-finals, and are amongst the four best teams in the competition!',
        'WMEventAdventure06' => 'We\'re in the finals! I can\'t believe it! We reached the finals! What a match! I always hoped we\'d go far with this team, but to actually reach the finals!! I\'m thrilled!',
        'WMEventAdventure07' => 'Unbelievable! We won the tournament! We won, we won, WE WON!!! Congratulations, now we are officially the Settlers Football Champions! We wooooooooooon!',
        'Whirlwind' => 'Congratulations! Those men were stronger than expected but with the aid of our allies we managed to break their band into pieces.',
        'WitchOfTheSwamp' => 'And thus you defeated the mighty witch of the swamp!

Everyone is sure to hear of this heroic feat.',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Easy_1' => 'Finally, those annoying cries have stopped..ribbit...I mean, it\'s good to see those tiny people smiling again. Bring more gifts.',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Easy_2' => 'So it was Ribbitha...She wanted to get revenge for her twin brother Croaker, because he\'s been losing to you for years now. Well... she clearly underestimated your skills.

You were able to free all those Settlers in the end, and the children above all! This also explains why Santa was unable to locate the children. Ribbitha used her evil tricks to hide their presence. Good that this is over now, and the families can spend the rest of the holidays together!',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Hard_1' => 'Finally, those annoying cries have stopped..ribbit...I mean, it\'s good to see those tiny people smiling again. Bring more gifts.',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Hard_2' => 'So it was Ribbitha...She wanted to get revenge for her twin brother Croaker, because he\'s been losing to you for years now. Well... she clearly underestimated your skills.

You were able to free all those Settlers in the end, and the children above all! This also explains why Santa was unable to locate the children. Ribbitha used her evil tricks to hide their presence. Good that this is over now, and the families can spend the rest of the holidays together!',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Medium_1' => 'Finally, those annoying cries have stopped..ribbit...I mean, it\'s good to see those tiny people smiling again. Bring more gifts.',
        'XMAS_Cookie_Medium_2' => 'So it was Ribbitha...She wanted to get revenge for her twin brother Croaker, because he\'s been losing to you for years now. Well... she clearly underestimated your skills.

You were able to free all those Settlers in the end, and the children above all! This also explains why Santa was unable to locate the children. Ribbitha used her evil tricks to hide their presence. Good that this is over now, and the families can spend the rest of the holidays together!',
        'XMAS_Map_Easy_1' => 'You made all those families very happy by delivering those gifts - and you helped Santa too! That\'s the Christmas spirit!',
        'XMAS_Map_Easy_2' => 'You made all those families very happy by delivering those gifts - and you helped Santa too! That\'s the Christmas spirit!',
        'XMAS_Map_Easy_3' => 'You made all those families very happy by delivering those gifts - and you helped Santa too! That\'s the Christmas spirit!',
        'XMAS_Map_Easy_4' => 'You made all those families very happy by delivering those gifts - and you helped Santa too! That\'s the Christmas spirit!',
