        'XMAS_Map_Hard_2' => 'You made all those families very happy by delivering those gifts - and you helped Santa too! That\'s the Christmas spirit!',
        'XMAS_Map_Hard_3' => 'You made all those families very happy by delivering those gifts - and you helped Santa too! That\'s the Christmas spirit!',
