        'Anniversary2018plus_Content_DescItem_1' => 'Convert resources into Balloons at the Festival Hall!',
        'Anniversary2018plus_Content_DescItem_2' => 'Enhance your Balloon production with Birthday Cakes!',
        'Anniversary2018plus_Content_DescItem_3' => 'Enjoy adventures with a nostalgic look!',
        'Anniversary2018plus_Content_Description' => 'Celebrate The Settlers Online\'s anniversary with us! Contribute balloons to the party preparations, benefit from a 2x XP + 3x adventure loot bonus, and earn exclusive rewards!',
        'Anniversary2018plus_Content_Title' => 'Anniversary Event',
        'Anniversary2018plus_PhaseOne_Title' => 'Community Goal - Phase 1',
        'Anniversary2018plus_PhaseTwo_Title' => 'Community Goal - Phase 2',
        'Anniversary2019Garrison' => 'Your general\'s military camp.',
        'Anniversary2019General' => 'As the elder twin, he aimed to surpass his father, General Log, by leading a larger army with success.',
        'AnniversaryEventWindow' => 'Come celebrate our anniversary with us! We need to gather as many balloons (1) as possible for the party - and your help won\'t go unrewarded!

You can donate balloons by clicking them in the event tab in your Mayor\'s House. You can earn a handful of balloons by completing quests, but the best way is to convert your resources at the Festival Hall (2). 
You can run up to three conversions at the same time, for maximum productivity.

If you want to shoot for the biggest rewards, you can improve your balloon output even further with birthday cake buffs (3).
You can create these buffs by combining candles and cake dough (4). However, you\'ll only be able to find one or the other, with the resource you find being determined by your level. You\'ll have to trade with other players to get the other one. 
Either way, you can get your ingredient from several sources:
- Collectibles
- Treasure searches
- Adventure loot

There are two types of rewards for donating balloons: Personal and worldwide.
- Quests will reward you for your personal contributions.
- Every week, there will be a worldwide objective, which everyone contributes towards. If the goal is met, everyone will receive the reward! (5)

Unlike many other event resources, balloons are not a currency to be spent at the merchant. However, he still offers a selection of celebratory items in exchange for gems! (6)',
