        'BattleBuffHurtWMBicycleKick' => 'The bicycle kick is an expert technique, which is so fast, even the quickest goalkeeper will struggle to react in time.  

Efficient against:
1. Fast Reflexes',
        'BattleBuffHurtWMCornerBall' => 'An effective, yet underestimated move that can play havoc with an unorganized defence.

Efficient against:
1. Zone defence',
        'BattleBuffHurtWMFeint' => 'Deliberate use of false body language can confuse defenders or turn a goalkeeper\'s reflexes against him.

Efficient against:
1. Zone defence
2. Fast reflexes',
        'BattleBuffHurtWMFoul' => 'Fouls are efficient against almost everything - just make sure no one sees you doing it.

Efficient against:
1. Diver
2. Dribble
3. One-on-one defence

Should an opposing player have several skills a tactical item can be used against, they will be countered in the order shown above.',
        'BattleBuffHurtWMHeader' => 'A well-placed and powerful header can overcome even the tallest goalkeeper or defender.

Efficient against:
1. High jumper
2. Zone defence

Should an opposing player have several skills a tactical item can be used against, they will be countered in the order shown above.',
        'BattleBuffHurtWMPass' => 'Teamwork is the foundation of every victory. A solid pass is the safest way to avoid contact with dangerous opponents.

Efficient against:
1. Fast runner
2. One-on-one defence

Should an opposing player have several skills a tactical item can be used against, they will be countered in the order shown above.',
        'BattleBuffHurtWMPenaltyKick' => 'A penalty kick is every goal keeper’s nightmare – and for good reason. If the goalkeeper\'s not in top form, it will almost certainly lead to a goal.

Efficient against:
1. High Jumper
2. Fast Reflexes

Should an opposing player have several skills a tactical item can be used against, they will be countered in the order shown above.',
        'BattleBuffHurtWMRedCard' => 'If an opponent is fouling one of your team mates, you can give the referee a hint and earn the player a red card for his troubles. Nobody likes a squealer, but an unpunished foul is even worse, isn’t it?

Efficient against:
1. Diver',
        'BattleBuffHurtWMSlidingTackle' => 'If your opponent is making a run for it, the sliding tackle is a very rough, but efficient method of stopping his advance. 

Efficient against:
1. Fast Runner
2. Back-Heel

Should an opposing player have several skills a tactical item can be used against, they will be countered in the order shown above.',
        'BattleBuffHurtWMTackle' => 'If the ball is stuck to an opponent like glue, it sometimes helps to unbalance the player with a decent tackle.

Efficient against:
1. Dribble 
2. Back-Heel

Should an opposing player have several skills a tactical item can be used against, they will be countered in the order shown above.',
