        'EliteWildlifeAir' => 'They rule the skies of the northern continent. Fearsome and fast, they\'re able to see a mouse in the snow from the air with their sharp eyes.',
        'EliteWildlifeBowman' => 'Fast, wild and well camouflaged. With these features, it\'s no surprise they could grow so big in the secluded mountain area. Be wary of its cold and dangerous fangs.',
        'EliteWildlifeCannoneer' => 'The Jotun, as they are called by the Mountain Clan, are ancient beings that live in the northern mountains. People always thought that those giants were mere stories told to children.',
        'EliteWildlifeCavalry' => 'Cute only on first sight. Their agility makes these foxes formidable enemies.',
        'EliteWildlifeLongbowman' => 'Leopards may be deadly on their own, but in a group they\'re even more fearsome. Beware their sharp claws.',
        'EliteWildlifeMilitia' => 'An invertebrate foe with huge paws and an angst-inducing growl. Few men are brave enough to hold their ground when a Frost Bear stands on his rear legs.',
        'EliteWildlifeRecruit' => 'The enormous horns not only scare its enemies away, but they are also useful to send any adversary flying.',
        'EmphaticExplorer' => 'Twice as fast as a normal explorer; brings home three times as many rewards from treasure searches. Period.',
