        'EnchantedCastle' => 'Its walls are built with an ancient stone that teems with magic. Settlers who dwell in it are filled with an overwhelming feeling joy and love.',
        'EnemyBowman' => 'A cheap unit that can do a decent amount of damage, but has very low HP.',
        'EnemyCannoneer' => 'An expensive unit that attacks after most other combatants. It makes up for it with high AD and decent HP, as well as dealing double damage while tearing camps down.',
        'EnemyCavalry' => 'A very squishy unit that deals low damage.
It attacks first, and uses flanking to attack enemies with the lowest HP.',
        'EnemyCrossbowman' => 'A unit with pretty high AD, but similarly high production costs.',
        'EnemyEliteSoldier' => 'A unit with high HP, a decent amount of AD, but high production costs.',
        'EnemyLongbowman' => 'A unit with decent production costs, which can do a fair amount of damage, but has very low HP.',
        'EnemyMilitia' => 'Can absorb and do more damage than the recruit, but has slightly higher production costs.',
        'EnemyRecruit' => 'A unit with decent HP and AD and low production costs. The first target of non-flanking enemies.',
        'EnemySoldier' => 'A pretty tanky unit with decent AD and production costs.',
        'EoW2021_Description' => 'An obscure group of priests prophesied the end of the world would occur before the end of the year 2012. As it turned out, they were wrong. But rumors point to a curious case of transposed digits. And actually, it’s true - some of their records clearly state the year 2021. Now, the priests are back to get their revenge, and have already tried to end your island’s legacy by shutting off Adobe Flash. But we will fight them together. This will be your role: You will have to gather all your military forces to defeat the priests in a special adventure – as often as possible. All servers will have to work together to overturn our impending fate.',
        'EoW2021_Title' => 'End of the World Mini-Event',
        'Eow2021_DescItem_1' => '+200% experience, resources and refills for the adventure “The End Of The World”.',
        'Eow2021_DescItem_2' => 'Each player will need to complete the adventure “The End Of The World” as many times as possible in order to save the world.

The amount of adventures that will need to be completed depends on the number of active players. There are 3 reward tiers, based on how many adventures are completed globally. The countdown for all the completed adventures will start on March 5th and end March 15th. 

For more details, please take a look at the forum.',
        'EpicBronzeMine' => 'Produces copper ore. Has to be placed on top of a copper deposit.',
        'EpicCoalMine' => 'Produces coal. Has to be placed on top of a coal deposit.',
        'EpicGoldMine' => 'Produces gold ore. Has to be placed on top of a gold deposit.',
        'EpicIronMine' => 'Produces iron ore. Has to be placed on top of an iron deposit.',
        'EpicMines_Description' => 'Having issues with your mines not being efficient enough? Try the industrial mines! They gather ore in large amounts and will suit your production perfectly.',
        'EpicMines_Title' => 'Industrial Mines',
        'EpicMonsterHeart1' => 'Defeat the Golem by destroying its heart with purified water.',
        'EpicMonsterHeart2' => 'Defeat the Greater Golem by destroying its heart with enriched water.',
        'EpicMonsterHeart3' => 'Defeat the Ancient Golem by destroying its heart with holy water.',
        'EpicMonsterHeart4' => 'Defeat the Supreme Golem by destroying its heart with Glistening water.',
        'EpicRaidBoss1' => 'In contrast to his \'smarter\' brother, this giant always prefers the direct \'bash first - ask never\' method.',
        'EpicRaidBoss10' => 'Unholy energy has disfigured his face in exchange for vast powers. You can only imagine what magic he will use against you.',
        'EpicRaidBoss11' => 'This goat does not only lie a lot, she is also quite agressive.',
        'EpicRaidBoss12' => 'The only thing "Cudgel Claus" really shines at is bashing with his club, but boy does he do it well!',
        'EpicRaidBoss13' => 'When someone hires this guy against you, you are in serious trouble!',
        'EpicRaidBoss14' => 'When he’s not counting his wealth, he is probably stealing your stuff.',
        'EpicRaidBoss2' => 'Though a bit smarter than the average giant, don\'t expect him to solve your math homework.',
        'EpicRaidBoss3' => 'Don’t be fooled by its beautiful appearance: the Unicorn’s horn wields magical powers beyond imagination.',
        'EpicRaidBoss4' => 'Until today, no one has ever managed to stop this boar driven by demonic rage.',
        'EpicRaidBoss5' => 'First he promises you vast riches for fulfilling his tasks, then he betrays you. Watch your back!',
        'EpicRaidBoss6' => 'This guy truly lives up to his name. Where he strikes, nothing can withstand him, and the slightest thing makes him strike, so be ready!',
        'EpicRaidBoss7' => 'This beast is almost twice as big as a normal bear, and his claws can rip apart whole buildings with ease.',
        'EpicRaidBoss8' => 'The leader of the local bandit group, and he really does not like the little tailor.',
        'EpicRaidBoss9' => 'This is no ordinary bull. You can feel its dark and unnatural presence all over the place.',
        'EpicRaidBossCaptain' => 'The best officer the Royal Guard can offer. Known by many, feared by many more.',
        'EpicRaidBossEvilQueen' => 'The formerly kind and humble wife of the fisherman, corrupted by dark powers. Her evil knows no bounds now.',
        'EpicRaidBossHuntsman' => 'The leader of the hunters of this land. He seems to have mistaken you for a stag.',
        'EpicRaidBossJuggernaut' => 'You wouldn\'t want to be stuck between this guy\'s hand and a hard surface. His strength matches that of giants!',
        'EpicRaidBossMayor' => 'The Mayor of Hamelin. He looks shady, and not very trustworthy...',
        'EpicRaidBossPiper' => 'The piper, after being betrayed by the mayor, kidnapped the children and holds them in this cave.',
        'EpicRaidBossRatKing' => 'From a distance, it\'s hard to tell whether it\'s a massive rat or a small black hippo.',
        'EpicRaidBossStepmother' => 'Snow White\'s evil stepmother, and queen of this land.',
        'EpicRaidKingdomBowman' => 'A proud member of the royal army.',
        'EpicRaidKingdomCannoneer' => 'A proud member of the royal army.',
        'EpicRaidKingdomCavalry' => 'A proud member of the royal army.',
        'EpicRaidKingdomEliteSoldier' => 'A proud member of the royal army.',
        'EpicRaidKingdomLongbowman' => 'A proud member of the royal army.',
        'EpicRaidKingdomMilitia' => 'A proud member of the royal army.',
        'EpicRaidKingdomRecruit' => 'A proud member of the royal army.',
        'EpicResidence' => 'Increases the population limit.
+500 Population. Upgrades will increase the population limit further',
        'EpicSalpeterMine' => 'Produces saltpetre. Has to be placed on top of a saltpetre deposit.',
        'EpicTitaniumMine' => 'Produces titanium ore. Has to be placed on top of a titanium deposit.',
        'EpicWorkyardBalloons' => 'Celebrate the anniversary of your home island\'s discovery by trading resources for balloons.',
        'EpicWorkyardCorn' => 'Can run wheat-related production chains at increased efficiency.',
        'EpicWorkyardOre' => 'Can run sword-related production chains at increased efficiency.',
        'EpicWorkyardRefinery' => 'Refines metal ores for better yields. Requires fuel to operate.',
        'EpicWorkyardWood' => 'Can run wood-related production chains at an increased efficiency.',
        'EraseStreet' => 'Remove road.',
        'EspionageBuilding' => 'Collect information that will affect any adventures you start for a certain duration. Every additional scouting post reduces the cooldown time.',
        'EspionageMailBody' => 'Someone has sabotaged you. Do you want to know who? In order to be able to retaliate you can buy the information for...',
        'EventBuffLvl01' => 'WARNING: Only works until the last day of the Halloween event!

Can only be used once!

This magical powder called the Sun Buff was developed in the Nordic countries, where nights are long and days are short. When used, this magical powder brings the sun back to the sky.

Effect: Use on Mayor\'s house to make the sun shine. Works only at night.',
        'EventLootRewardsCurrentUserMailBody' => 'You found the eggs a friend has hidden on your island. You both get to share the reward of this little game.',
        'EventLootRewardsFriendUserMailBody' => 'Your friend {0} has found the eggs you have hidden on his island. You both get to share the reward of this little game.',
        'EventMonster' => 'A towering stone golem animated by evil spirits.',
        'EventMonsterBuff2014Heart1' => 'Golems are brought to life using their inner fire. By splashing a lot of pure water on him, we can extinguish the threat.',
        'EventMonsterBuff2014Heart2' => 'Pure water has no effect on greater golems, but splashing a lot of specially enriched water on him might do the trick.',
        'EventMonsterBuff2014Heart3' => 'The ancient golem\'s inner fire is sustained by evil spirits. Using holy water should reverse the spell and destroy him.',
        'EventMonsterBuff2014Heart4' => 'The ultimate form of golem requires the ultimate form of water to fight it. This water contains all the benefits of the previous concoctions, amplified to the max with rare metals. It has to be used while boiling to melt the thick layer of ice that covers the golem\'s heart.',
        'EventMonsterBuffArcheologyFrameLarge' => 'Equipped by an Expert Archaeologist.
Required to solve some quests in the "Archaeological Excavation" weekly challenge.',
        'EventMonsterBuffArcheologyFrameMedium' => 'Equipped by a Journeyman Archaeologist.
Required to solve some quests in the "Archaeological Excavation" weekly challenge.',
        'EventMonsterBuffArcheologyFrameSmall' => 'Equipped by an Apprentice Archaeologist.
Required to solve some quests in the "Archaeological Excavation" weekly challenge.',
        'EventMonsterBuffConstructionProvisionLarge' => 'Feeds an Expert Construction Worker.
Required to solve some quests in the "Town Construction" weekly challenge.',
        'EventMonsterBuffConstructionProvisionMedium' => 'Feeds a Journeyman Construction Worker.
Required to solve some quests in the "Town Construction" weekly challenge.',
        'EventMonsterBuffConstructionProvisionSmall' => 'Feeds an Apprentice Construction Worker.
Required to solve some quests in the "Town Construction" weekly challenge.',
        'EventMonsterBuffDrillManualDetailed' => 'Trains a Bowman Conscript.
Required to solve some quests in the "Kingdom Defence" weekly challenge.',
        'EventMonsterBuffDrillManualNormal' => 'Trains a Cavalry Conscript.
Required to solve some quests in the "Kingdom Defence" weekly challenge.',
        'EventMonsterBuffDrillManualRough' => 'Trains a Recruit Conscript.
Required to solve some quests in the "Kingdom Defence" weekly challenge.',
        'EventMonsterBuffHealingPotionHigh' => 'Cures Mayan Jaguar Warriors of infection. 
Required to solve some quests in the "Epidemic" weekly challenge.',
        'EventMonsterBuffHealingPotionLow' => 'Cures Mayan Tribesmen of infection. 
Required to solve some quests in the "Epidemic" weekly challenge.',
        'EventMonsterBuffHealingPotionMedium' => 'Cures Mayan Shamans of infection. 
Required to solve some quests in the "Epidemic" weekly challenge.',
        'EventMonsterBuffHeart1' => 'Golems are clumsy. By putting lots of bags of marbles in its way, we can make it fall to the ground.',
        'EventMonsterBuffHeart2' => 'Once the golem has fallen to the ground we can capture him by using these strong ropes.',
        'EventMonsterBuffHeart3' => 'With the golem incapacitated, we can use lots of water to extinguish his flames, and turn him into stone.',
        'EventMonsterBuffRefinedConstructionKit' => 'These tools are intended for craftwork. Mostly for details and delicate pieces.
Give them to an Artisan on Stage 4 of the Crisis Quest in order to make progress on the watchtower.',
        'EventMonsterBuffRobustConstructionKit' => 'A set of robust tools, made of really hard mahogany wood. Only the most capable hands can use them efficiently.
Give them to a Professional on Stage 4 of the Crisis Quest in order to make progress on the watchtower.',
        'EventMonsterBuffSimpleConstructionKit' => 'These tools might not be flashy, but they\'ll do the trick.
Give them to an unemployed builder on Stage 4 of the Crisis Quest in order to make progress on the watchtower.',
        'EventMonsterBuffSticksAndStones' => 'When we said to give the bandits "sticks and stones" we meant "ignore their taunts". But someone took it a little too literally.',
        'EventMonsterBuffSturdyConstructionKit' => 'Tools made of hardwood. These tools can take a beating before they break.
Give them to a Strong Builder on Stage 4 of the Crisis Quest in order to make progress on the watchtower.',
        'EventMonsterBuff_EventMarketBuff1' => 'These funny little ducks are not only cute to look at, they can swim in your bath tub and they also quack when pressed!',
        'EventMonsterBuff_EventMarketBuff2' => 'No one is really sure how these stuffed animals are crafted, or where they come from, but they still make everyone smile.',
        'EventMonsterBuff_EventMarketBuff3' => 'This is your go-to toy when you feel lonely. Every Settler needs a cuddle bear from time to time.',
        'EventMonsterHitByFriendMailBody' => 'A friend has helped you with your golem by using some buffs on it.',
        'EventMonster_Ancient' => 'This thing looks HUGE... and fiery!',
        'EventMonster_BanditFortressStage2' => 'A division of the fortress dedicated to the recruitment and training of new bandits.',
        'EventMonster_EventMarket_Tutorial' => 'A small Christmas Market with a few stalls.',
        'EventMonster_EventMarket_lvl1' => 'A medium sized Christmas Market with several stalls.',
        'EventMonster_EventMarket_lvl2' => 'A big Christmas Market with space to roam.',
