Just like last year, you can get great things through the Event Calendar (2). Every day, you can open a door and receive resources and buffs.
On special days, you\'ll even get a special bonus if you\'ve opened all the previous doors.

On certain days, you can get special adventures from the Event Calendar. These adventures will require you to help Santa make some unfortunate settlers happy (3) by delivering them some gifts (4) which you can produce in your provision house. These adventures will reward you with extra presents. 

