        'MailPremiumChristmasBuffMailBody' => 'A token of appreciation from a very good friend who thought you might enjoy a boost.
Don\'t forget to thank your generous benefactor!

• All single production buff effects are doubled!!
• 50% bonus XP from Adventures. Applies to Premium Time XP Boost too!
• Production time at barracks & elite barracks is halved
• Production time at the provisioner & rarity provisioner is halved
• Weapon production (except at the combat armory) is twice as fast
• Explorers and geologists complete their tasks 20% faster
• Duration: 5 days',
        'MailPremiumFriendBuffMailBody' => 'A token of appreciation from a very good friend who thought you might enjoy a boost.
Don\'t forget to thank your generous benefactor!

• All single production buff effects are doubled!!
• 50% bonus XP from Adventures. Applies to Premium Time XP Boost too!
• Production time at barracks & elite barracks is halved
• Production time at the provisioner & rarity provisioner is halved
• Weapon production (except at the combat armory) is twice as fast
• Explorers and geologists complete their tasks 20% faster
• Duration: 15 days',
        'MailValentinesCard_01MailBody' => 'Darling, 

I need to confess something to you... 
I\'ve fallen in love several times in my life, 
but every time, I\'ve fallen for you.',
        'MailValentinesCard_02MailBody' => 'Valentine, 

Although I\'m sure you\'ve heard it before, I love you 
,and I will dedicate the rest of my days to prove it to you.',
        'MailValentinesCard_03MailBody' => 'Darling, 

Ever since I met you, I haven\'t been able to get enough of you. 
I wanted to let you know, on today of all days, that I love you.',
        'MailValentinesCard_04MailBody' => 'Dearest friend, 

Since we\'ve been playing together for so long, 
do you think you could SETTLE for me?',
        'MailValentinesCard_05MailBody' => 'Valentine, 

I love you more than I could ever say. 
Let\'s spend our days together.',
        'MailValentinesCard_06MailBody' => 'Valentine, 

I need but lose myself in your eyes to understand the beauties of the world. 
Please, let us spend our days together.',
        'MailValentinesCard_07MailBody' => 'My love, 

The first half of my happiness consists of thinking about you, 
the second half consists of being with you.',
        'MailValentinesCard_08MailBody' => 'Dearest friend, 

My home island is you. 
Safely in your arms.',
