        'MultiplierBuffZone1' => 'Zone Effect: Doubles the effect of all single production buffs
Target: Workyards
Duration: 2 hours (3 hours on friends)
The doubling of buff effects does not stack with other buffs of this kind, and does not apply to epic workyards.',
        'MultiplierBuffZone2_PremiumCompensationBuff_1Day' => 'A token of appreciation. 
• All single production buff effects are doubled!! 
• +50% bonus XP from adventures. Applies to Premium Time XP boost too!
• Production time in barracks & elite barracks is halved!
• Production time in the provision house & rarity provision house is halved!
• Weapon producers (except the combat armory) will be twice as fast
• Explorers and geologists complete their tasks 20% faster
• Duration: 1 day

Important Note:
• This buff can only be applied on your home island.
• Reapplying the buff will restart the runtime, and any leftover time will be lost.
• The doubling of buff effects does not stack with other buffs of this kind, and does not apply to epic workyards.',
        'MultiplierBuffZone2_PremiumCompensationBuff_3Day' => 'A token of appreciation. 
• All single production buff effects are doubled!! 
