        'PartyCrasherBoss2' => 'He\'s really, REALLY upset that he didn\'t get an invitation, you know.',
        'PartyCrasherBoss3' => 'He likes stuffing his face with food, and he heard there\'s a lot of grub at your party. Do I really need to spell out the rest?',
        'PartyCrasherBowman' => 'He likes to gather and use stones, although not usually as paperweights.',
        'PartyCrasherCannoneer' => 'Complain, complain, complain. That\'s all he does. He\'s really annoying.',
        'PartyCrasherCavalry' => 'He uses his speed to quickly knock on someone\'s door and immediately bolt away. A good use of his skills, according to himself.',
        'PartyCrasherCrossbowman' => 'Ranked in the top 10 of the "best liars" leaderboard. Or so he says.',
        'PartyCrasherEliteSoldier' => 'He had fun once. It was horrible.',
        'PartyCrasherElitecavalry' => 'This guy is hyperactive, loud, and has had WAY too much sugar.',
        'PartyCrasherLongbowman' => 'He\'s actually a magician. He can make your pockets lighter without you even noticing it.',
        'PartyCrasherMilitia' => 'His fighting style usually translates to picking on someone who\'s smaller than he is.',
        'PartyCrasherRecruit' => 'If you ask him why he\'s behaving the way he is, he will just mockingly mimic you back.',
        'PartyCrasherSoldier' => 'You don\'t recall ever seeing him at home, but he sure says a lot of things about your mother.',
        'PathPreviewDelete' => 'Delete a path preview of a ghost garrison.',
        'PathPreviewStart' => 'Place the ghost garrison on any spot.',
        'PermanentBuildQueueSlot' => 'Unlock an additional permanent slot for your building queue.',
        'Pirate-Ship_BIG' => 'A wonderful pirate ship.',
        'Pirate-hut01' => 'Decorative building',
        'Pirate-hut02' => 'A pirate storehouse.',
        'PirateBoss1' => 'Woe betide you if you criticise his culinary skills! Regardless of the consequences, this muddleheaded cook will hunt you down with his giant meat cleaver.',
        'PirateBowman' => 'This gutless character excels in hiding behind his comrades, occasionally throwing a rusty knife into the fray.',
        'PirateCaptain' => 'His razor-sharp hook has often been of great service during battles, frightening both enemies and subordinates.',
        'PirateCavalry' => 'Tiny, barbed metal spikes. Lying around almost invisible, they can cause nasty injuries.',
        'PirateExplorer' => 'A seasoned sailor and a master navigator, he loves nothing more than the scent of the wind on the sea. Always eager to head into the horizon to face the unknown, the Pirate Explorer is a scallywag obsessed with finding treasure and adventure.',
        'PirateLongbowman' => 'Even if his rusty old pistol does not appear fully functional, this nasty guy can cause a lot of trouble.',
        'PirateMilitia' => 'In spite of his weathered sabre and uncoordinated movements, his grim gaze lends him an air of danger. Furthermore, he reeks of rum.',
        'PirateRecruit' => 'Used to swabbing the deck full-time, he has become rather skilled in handling a mop.',
        'PirateResidence' => 'Increases the population limit.
