        'SoccerEventWindow' => 'Welcome to the Settlers’ Soccer Championship! During this 3 week tournament, you\'ll be able to win awesome rewards - provided we succeed against our competitors on our way to the soccer championship! 
For the duration of the event, you\'ll earn double loot from adventures, while the XP you gain from adventures has been tripled!

Your main goal is to gather as many soccer balls as possible, and trade them in for great rewards in the shop. There are several ways (1) to get them, some guaranteed, some subject to chance:
• Winning tournament games
• Rewards for some event related quests
• Treasure searches
• Collectibles
• Loot from certain adventures
• Buying the small fan package in the shop

The central element during the tournament is the fixture list (2). If you check it every day, you can earn extra rewards. Most importantly, your next opponents will be drawn here. 
• Brown door - contains a fixed, or random reward (can only be opened on the respective day in the calendar)
• Green door – contains a soccer adventure (can also be opened at a later point)
• Trophy door – special door in which you can choose a reward (can only be opened if you\'ve opened all previous doors)

The soccer games (3) work like scenario adventures. In each game you will encounter enemy players (4) who have certain skills (5). To defeat them, you will need to produce certain tactical items (6) in your provision house or rarity provision house (7). The materials to produce those tactical items can be found in different ways:
• Some are collectibles only
• Some can be found through treasure searches
• You can get them as rewards for some event-related quests, especially for daily quests
• You can get them as loot from (regular) adventures
• You can buy resource packages in the shop
• You can also trade them with other players

The only thing left to say is good luck, coach! Lead our great kingdom to the Soccer Championship Cup!',
