        'StrongBuilder' => 'This burly fellow will take on the hardest of jobs without ever complaining. He breaks regular tools, though, so you\'ll need to supply him with sturdier ones.',
        'Stronghold' => 'Let your troops participate in harsh environmental training with the mountain clan.
