        'Swordsman' => 'A basic elite unit with average AD but high HP. The first elite-target of non-flanking enemies.',
        'SylvanaGeneral' => 'A fierce leader and astute strategist, she trains your cavalry to use muskets and frontal attacks.',
        'TMC_BossEnormousIbex' => 'This Ibex is not only huge, but fast. Do not underestimate his horns, which look like massive trees.',
        'TMC_BossFrostBearMatriarch' => 'The strongest female Frost Bear, the Matriarch is seen as the leader of the pack. Their urge to keep the pack safe makes them one of the most fearsome enemies on the battlefield.',
        'TMC_BossFrostGiantKing_0' => 'The mighty king of all Jötnar. Huge, old, strong and very smart. Legends say his gaze can freeze your whole body.',
        'TMC_BossFrostGiantKing_1' => 'The mighty king of all Jotun. Huge, old, strong and very smart. Legends say his gaze alone can freeze your entire body.',
        'TMC_BossFrostGiantKing_2' => 'The mighty king of all Jotun. Huge, old, strong and very smart. Legends say his gaze alone can freeze your entire body.',
        'TMC_BossFrostGiantKing_3' => 'The mighty king of all Jotun. Huge, old, strong and very smart. Legends say his gaze alone can freeze your entire body.',
        'TMC_BossFrostGiantKing_4' => 'The mighty king of all Jotun. Huge, old, strong and very smart. Legends say his gaze alone can freeze your entire body.',
        'TMC_BossGargantuanLynx' => 'This feline\'s plushy appearance has fooled many adventurers. The gargantuan lynx is a fast and ruthless predator - don\'t try to pet it if you value your life!',
        'TMC_BossGhastlyWolf' => 'Legends speak of a wolf the size of a horse, with sharp fangs and claws, which can slice through metal as if it were paper... Who would\'ve imagined such an animal could even exist?',
        'TMC_BossMammoth' => 'This ancient animal was always thought to have only existed in books - until now. Its appearance is proof of the uncovered mysteries of the northern continent.',
        'TMC_BossNordsLeader' => 'A truly sinister Bandit Ringleader who capitalizes on the misery of the people living here. He seems to pack a punch.',
        'TMC_BossParagonElk' => 'A prime example of an overproportioned Elk. Its antlers are as high as a house, and can easily sweep away whole garrisons. Don\'t get under its hooves!',
        'TMC_BossRavagingOx' => 'The might of a Ravaging Ox\'s frenzy can be compared to an avalanche that strikes from above. Don\'t be near it if it chomps at the bit.',
        'TMC_BossSmilodon' => 'As if a Frost Leopard isn\'t enough, this ancient animal is far bigger and stronger in comparison. Keep your distance, and don\'t let their huge fangs get you.',
        'TMC_BossWinterTerror' => 'Not much is known about the Terrors hidden in the snow. They are described as shapeless ghosts wandering within snowstorms. When you see their silhouette, it\'s already too late.',
        'TMC_ColossalEagleBoss' => 'The real king of the cold northern skies. It might be slower, because of its sheer size, but don\'t underestimate its power.',
        'TMC_v1_NordsRightHandBoss' => 'He does not seem best pleased with our appearance here, and is clearly throwing a nasty look our way.',
        'TSR_SheetMusic6' => 'Change background music to “The Settlers: New Allies Main Theme”
Zone Effect: +700% Output
Target: Weaponsmith (Bronze, Iron, Steel, Damascene, Platinum), Epic Weaponsmith (Bronze, Iron, Steel, Damascene, Platinum), Maker (Bow, Longbow, Crossbow, Arquebuse), Cannon Forge, Foundry, Stable (Normal, Elite, Epic)
