        'TheSmuggler' => 'A transporter general with the ability to smuggle in weapons and gold with every trip.',
        'ThoroughGeologist' => 'Insisting on never leaving any stone unturned, he takes three times as long on deposit searches. But thanks to his thoroughness, he also finds three times bigger deposits.',
        'TikiStorehouse' => 'Don’t let the spooky masks intimidate you. It’s much more welcoming than it looks, and spacious too!',
        'TipOfTheDay01' => 'Your population grows automatically; but only if enough living space is available, so you should keep an eye on your population limit when expanding your town.',
        'TipOfTheDay02' => 'Refill your mines before they run empty and become destroyed.',
        'TipOfTheDay03' => 'A Farm needs only one field, but the farmer will harvest the next field automatically if a field is harvested completely.',
