        'TipOfTheDay09' => 'Build storehouses or upgrade them to increase your storage capacity.',
        'TipOfTheDay10' => 'Every workyard has a production process bar, which displays the remaining time of the current production.',
        'TipOfTheDay11' => 'All military structures have an influence area. If other military units enter this area, they will be attacked automatically. Entering overlapping influence areas may result in battle with more than one enemy camp.',
