        'Valentines2019plus_Shop_Title' => 'Valentine\'s Event',
        'ValentinesEventWindow' => 'Welcome to the Settlers\' Valentines Event! During this time you\'ll be able to obtain awesome rewards, and help your friends reach their goals.

Your main goal is to gather Valentine\'s Flowers, and trade those against unique rewards at the merchant. There are several ways to obtain Valentine\'s Flowers.
• Produce them using Flower Farms. These farms have a deposit which contains Valentine\'s Flowers, and can be refilled with refills earned by playing co-op and multiplayer adventures.
• Find them through Treasure Searches.
• Trade them with other players.
• Or buy Flower Packages from the merchant.


This event is all about cooperation between you and your friends/loved ones. 

Use a small amount of Valentine\'s Flowers to craft Flower Bouquets in both provision houses, which can be applied on the residences of your friends. Applying those buffs will create a lovely buff animation, and having several Flower Bouquets active will trigger certain zone wide buffs.
• 5x triggers the "Heart Locks" buff, boosting population recruitment. The buff will remain applied so long as at least 5 Flower Bouquets remain active.
• 10x triggers the "Family Day" buff, boosting unit recruitment speed. The buff will remain applied so long as at least 10 Flower Bouquets remain active.

In addition, a Valentine\'s Card Box can be crafted in both provision houses. Opening this box will grant one of nine Valentine\'s Cards. Those cards can be applied to Flower Farms to boost their output, but they also have an additional effect.
• Each Valentine\'s Card sends a lovely short message to your friend.
• Having all 3 Flower Farms buffed with Valentine\'s Cards will trigger the "Valentine" zone wide buff. This buff provides a +200% bonus to resource, refill and XP rewards from co-op and multiplayer adventures.

Exchange cards and bouquets with your friends to boost your islands and complete your achievements!',
        'ValentinesTransporterGeneral' => 'With the biggest heart of all the leaders, every soldier\'s dream is to join his regiment. Thanks to encouragement from his recruits, and his soft heart, he grew to become the quartermaster who can transport the largest amount of units of all - but this is also the reason he decided to never fight himself.',
        'ValorRateBonus' => 'Gives a {0} bonus to acquired Valour Points.',
        'VersedGeologist' => 'Finds 50% bigger deposits in half the normal time, and has a 50% chance of finding an additional deposit. Works on all types of deposits!',
        'VesyGeologist' => 'In his aimless, adventurous, amateur attempts at searching for gold, all areas are acceptable for prospecting. It is indeed an arbitrary and absurdly ambitious approach, because he actively avoids any actual advice. However, from time to time, and against all odds, he manages to strike gold.',
        'VillageSchool' => 'Produces population.',
        'VisitZoneTip' => 'Check what is happening in this adventure.',
        'WM1on1Defense' => 'You can\'t shake them off – they\'re all clingy! Better pass the ball to an unmarked teammate, or make yourself some room with a foul.

Is countered by:
Pass / Foul',
        'WMBackHeel' => 'Quick, precise and sneaky! Only a speedy intervention will help here.

Is countered by:
Sliding Tackle / Tackle',
        'WMDiver' => 'Around here, one falls more easily than usual. Either the referee sees what\'s really going on here, or you make the fall count.

Is countered by:
