        'WelcomeText' => 'I offer you my greetings, {0}.
I conformed to your wish and have selected an island for you to settle on. The people on this island need someone to guide them. Additionally, bandits located nearby now pose a threat to the settlers. Thus, your task will not only be to form a properly functioning economy, but also to take care of all necessary security issues.
Since this is a big responsibility and you are still a greenhorn, I am sending my treasurer Sir Oliver with you. He will accompany you on your way and provide help in all necessary matters. He is a man of honour and one of the most trustworthy men I know, so, you can totally rely on him.
All that remains is to wish you the best of luck. Sir Oliver will send me reports of your actions regularly, so apply yourself and don\'t make me regret my decision to send you.

Farewell.
King Damien',
