    'GMS' => [
        'CrisisQuestchain1DaysLeft' => 'Remember to finish the Crisis quest chain today to receive big rewards!',
        'CrisisQuestchain2DaysLeft' => 'Remember to finish the Crisis quest chain within the next 2 days to receive big rewards!',
        'CrisisQuestchain3DaysLeft' => 'Remember to finish the Crisis quest chain within the next 3 days to receive big rewards!',
        'CrisisQuestchain7DaysLeft' => 'Remember to finish the Crisis quest chain within the next 7 days to receive big rewards!',
        'CrisisQuestchainStarted' => 'CRISIS QUEST CHAIN: A Great Evil
Dramatic events are unfolding. A new crisis quest chain has begun. Consult your quest book to find out more - but hurry! The event won\'t last forever!',
        'EventEoWOpeningMail' => 'The surprise event is about to begin tomorrow at 10:00 CET.
An obscure group of priests prophesied the end of the world before the end of the year 2012. As it turned out, they were wrong. But rumors point to a curious case of transposed digits - some of their records clearly state the year 2021! Now, the priests are back to get their revenge, and have already tried to end your island’s legacy by shutting off Adobe Flash. But we will fight them together. This will be your part: You will have to gather all your military forces to defeat the priests in a special adventure – as many times as you can. All servers will have to work together to stop our impending fate.
Each player will need to complete the adventure “The End Of The World” as many times as possible in order to save the world.
The amount of adventures you\'ll need to complete depends on the number of active players. There are 3 reward tiers, based on how many adventures are completed globally. The countdown for all the completed adventures will start on March 5th and end March 15th. 
For more details, please take a look at the forum.',
        'EventEoWRewardMail_100' => 'We\'re still here! Congratulations - your united efforts have saved the world from falling victim to the grizzly curse of the witch-doctors!
And what’s more, there are plenty of riches for you to collect after this glorious crusade.

Your game world has completed the minimum number of adventures! As a reward, you\'ve received:',
        'EventEoWRewardMail_150' => 'We\'re still here! Congratulations, your united efforts have saved the world from falling victim to the grizzly curse of the witch-doctors!
And what’s more, there are plenty of riches for you to collect after this glorious crusade.

Your game world has completed more than 150% of the required number of adventures, earning you a special reward:',
        'EventEoWRewardMail_200' => 'We\'re still here! Congratulations, your united efforts have saved the world from falling victim to the grizzly curse of the witch-doctors!
And what’s more, there are plenty of riches for you to collect after this glorious crusade.

Your game world has completed more than twice the required number of adventures, earning you a special reward:',
        'EventEoWRewardMail_Fastest' => 'We\'re still here! Congratulations, your united efforts have saved the world from falling victim to the grizzly curse of the witch-doctors!
And what’s more, there are plenty of riches for you to collect after this glorious crusade.

Your game world was the fastest to complete the required number of adventures, earning you a special reward:',
        'EventEoWRewardMail_Most' => 'We\'re still here! Congratulations, your united efforts have saved the world from falling victim to the grizzly curse of the witch-doctors!
And what’s more, there are plenty of riches for you to collect after this glorious crusade.

Your game world has completed the most adventures overall, earning you a special reward:',
        'MailPremiumChristmasBuff' => 'A token of appreciation from a very good friend who thought you might enjoy a boost.
Don\'t forget to thank your generous benefactor!

• All single production buff effects are doubled!!
• 50% bonus XP from Adventures. Applies to Premium Time XP Boost too!
• Production time at barracks & elite barracks is halved
• Production time at the provisioner & rarity provisioner is halved
• Weapon production (except at the combat armory) is twice as fast
• Explorers and geologists complete their tasks 20% faster
• Duration: 5 days',
        'MailPremiumFriendBuff' => 'A token of appreciation from a very good friend who thought you might enjoy a boost.
Don\'t forget to thank your generous benefactor!

• All single production buff effects are doubled!!
• 50% bonus XP from Adventures. Applies to Premium Time XP Boost too!
• Production time at barracks & elite barracks is halved
• Production time at the provisioner & rarity provisioner is halved
• Weapon production (except at the combat armory) is twice as fast
• Explorers and geologists complete their tasks 20% faster
• Duration: 15 days',
        'ServerEventResource' => 'Thanks to your efforts during the game, you have gathered the following resource(s):',
        'TutBonusMoreAdventuresLetter' => 'Dear Sir / Madam,
You have been chosen to represent your city by participating in the countrywide adventure competition. The rules are simple: there are three rounds. Each round has its own goals. Whoever accomplishes them qualifies for the next round. After three rounds, the person who has finished the rounds the most effectively wins. The goal of the first round is to complete 5 adventures. This competition is secret. You are only allowed to talk to other combatants about it. If you should break this rule, you will be disqualified.

Good luck!',
        'TutBonusResourceBuffLetter' => 'All hail,
This is your brother Theodor. I have heard the rumour saying you have located to a new island to build a new settlement there. My congratulations. As a small present, I have transferred some resources to your star menu to support your project. I would be happy to receive an invitation to visit from you. After all, I\'m sure there is much you could teach me.

Best wishes
Theodor',
        'TutBonusSpecialAdventuresLetter' => 'Dear Sir / Madam,
The second round is about to begin. This time, the goal is to complete 3 adventures of supreme difficulty. Please remember that this competition is still secret. Furthermore, you will still be disqualified if you contravene this rule.

Good luck!',
        'TutPopulationCap2Letter' => 'All hail! 

I am writing you this letter personally to inform you about a competition. However, this competition is not official, which is why no one else must learn of its existence. From time to time, I will give certain assignments to a few different people. If you manage to complete the given task, you will be greatly rewarded with goods and my gratitude. If not, you will not receive any further assignments, and thus will also no longer receive rewards or help from me. The current task is written in your quest book. 


I wish you the best of luck. 
Your king',
        'TutPopulationCap3Letter' => 'Greetings,

As you managed to finish the last task successfully, I have a new task for you. Your new goal has been entered into your quest book. The conditions are the same as last time. 


Good luck,
Your King',
        'TutPopulationCap4Letter' => 'Greetings! 

I\'m pleased to see you\'ve completed all the tasks I gave you. However, I\'m eager to see how you will handle this next one. As always, you will find the new task in your quest book. I will be following your progress. 


Good luck,
Your King',
        'UnityLetter' => 'So, you made it to the end…

We\'re sorry for any inconvenience Mr. Foozler might have caused you. Needless to say, you won\'t have to deal with him again anytime soon.

As a token of our appreciation for sticking with us all these long years, we\'ve left a little something in your Star Menu.



With love, The Settlers Online Team',
