        'AdvDefeatAllDarkCastles' => 'You have defeated all dark castles.',
        'AdvDefeatAllDarkCastlesAndBonechurches' => 'You\'ve defeated all the witch towers and bone churches.',
        'AdvDefeatAllWitchtower' => 'You have defeated all witch towers.',
        'AdvDefeatCroaker' => 'This is probably not the last we\'ll hear from him... But that\'s not important now. 
You saved the Christmas feast! My gratitude, and that of all the world\'s children, is yours.',
        'AdvDefeatOneBanditleader' => 'You\'ve cleared the sector.
Now you can place your garrison in the free sector.

NOTE: You will receive your XP and rewards by mail, when you have finished the adventure.',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ1_Salesman_1' => 'In the tavern you are told that a local salesman has gone missing. He was last seen moving east with his baggage and has not been seen since.
Search for clues and find out the salesman\'s whereabouts.',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ1_Salesman_2' => 'You found one the salesman\'s carts and signs of a fight. Look for more clues to find out what happened to the salesman!',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ1_Salesman_3' => 'You found some of the salesman\'s missing goods..',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ1_Salesman_4' => 'You found more of the salesman\'s goods. He must be close!',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ1_Salesman_5' => 'You have found the salesman\'s cart. He must have been ambushed! Find the bandit nest and free the salesman.',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ1_Salesman_6' => 'You have razed the bandit nest and freed the salesman.',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ2_SpareOurBoys_1' => 'The old forester\'s wife has asked you not to destroy her boy\'s camp. Spare them to receive an extra reward!',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ2_SpareOurBoys_2' => 'You have razed the bandit nest and freed the salesman.',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ3_TheTreesHaveEyes_1' => 'A terrified townsman complains to you: "Nowhere\'s safe these days! Not only do these scallywags entrench themselves in their camps, they also lurk in the dark of the forest! Do these lands a great service and cast these vermin out from their treetop hideouts!"',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ3_TheTreesHaveEyes_2' => 'You have shaken the last of the rogues out of their treetop hideouts and made these lands a bit safer.',
        'AdvPlaceGarrison' => 'Your army is at the adventure zone and you are now able to defeat bandit camps.',
        'AdvTheNords_SQ1_LostChildren_1' => 'You have discovered a hidden quest!',
        'AdvTheNords_SQ1_LostChildren_2' => 'You have successfully inspected all the caves.',
        'AdvTheNords_SQ1_LostChildren_3' => 'You have successfully inspected the ruins.',
        'AdvTheNords_SQ1_LostChildren_4' => 'You have found the old well.',
        'AdvTheNords_SQ1_LostChildren_5' => '"You did it! You cast the nasty old witch out, and our children have returned home safely! We can\'t ever thank you enough!"',
        'AdvTraitors_SQ1_destroyHiddenCamps_1' => 'You have discovered a hidden quest!',
        'AdvTraitors_SQ1_destroyHiddenCamps_2' => 'The mayor is overwhelmed with joy and in an almost solemn gesture hands you a worn and dusty piggy bank.',
        'AdvTraitors_SQ2_findFlowers_1' => 'You have discovered a hidden quest!',
        'AdvTraitors_SQ2_findFlowers_2' => 'The Guild Master thanks you for your helpfulness. "We shall be able to weave the most magnificent wreathes this year!", he exults and hands you a chest of exquisite treasures.',
        'AdvVictorTheVicious_SQ1_SpareCenterCamp_1' => 'A deserted royal regiment is reported to hide among Victor\'s troops. Make sure they survive so they can be taken before the king for a fair trial.',
        'AdvVictorTheVicious_SQ1_SpareCenterCamp_2' => 'You managed to catch the deserters! The king shall pass fair judgment on them.',
        'AdvVictorTheVicious_SQ2_Rivals_1' => 'Vicious Victor seems to have driven some local scoundrels to the woods when seizing these lands. His old rival Ruppert the Revengeful is secretly gathering troops and is just waiting for Victor to be cast out so he can return to pester the righteous folks. 
Stop the evildoer\'s scheming, and the local regent will increase your rewards even further!',
        'AdvVictorTheVicious_SQ2_Rivals_2' => 'You have successfully prevented Ruppert\'s ruthless return! The regent admires your prudence and rewards you with additional treasures.',
        'AdvWitchOftheSwamp_SQ1_SpareNorthCamp_1' => 'You have discovered a hidden quest!',
        'AdvWitchOftheSwamp_SQ1_SpareNorthCamp_2' => 'You managed to expel the witch and free the king\'s men. The king expresses his gratitude in the form a decent reward.',
        'AdvWitchOftheSwamp_SQ2_FindLostSouls_1' => 'Find the seven hidden graves to free the cursed souls that the Witch has bound to her island!',
        'AdvWitchOftheSwamp_SQ2_FindLostSouls_2' => 'You have found and freed all the damned souls!',
        'Adv_BeautifulPrincess_Q1' => 'Buried beneath the remains of the last camp, Aladdin steps on a piece of metal. Removing it from the sand, it turns out to be the oil lamp that he\'s been looking for! With cheers and laughter, you celebrate the finding, but you keep wondering about Scheherezade\'s location.',
        'Adv_BeautifulPrincess_Q2' => 'You continue questioning the bandits regarding Scheherezade\'s location, when Aladdin tells you that one of them is running away with some hostages. You quickly climb the dune to determine their route.',
        'Adv_BeautifulPrincess_Q3' => 'You finally manage to best the leader of the thieves and free the captive women from the dungeons. Scheherezade can\'t express her gratitude with words, but her beautiful face says it all. Aladdin immediately recognizes the other woman as the Sultan\'s daughter, Jasmine, upon seeing her up close. They start talking and seem to hit it off with each other.',
        'Adv_BesiegedCity_Q1' => 'They clearly didn\'t know who they were messing with. Sinbad praises your battle efforts, but isn\'t convinced that there won\'t be any more threats, so he offers to explore the area looking for more enemies.',
        'Adv_BesiegedCity_Q2' => 'The inhabitants of the city are very grateful for your help, and offer you whatever little treasure they have in compensation. When you inquire about the treasure and the missing woman, they are sad they can\'t provide what you were looking for, and repeatedly apologize for disappointing you.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Event_01' => 'And? Like it? Quite out of the ordinary, isn\'t it?! But funny! Tee hee hee… No-one knows exactly where these buildings come from, but things are generally a bit strange these days.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Event_02' => 'It looks like magic. You click them, they disappear. Amazing! Tee hee hee… There\'s nothing left for us to do here now. Let\'s get back to your home zone.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Event_03' => 'Hmm… I wonder… What? Oh, nothing. Just daydreaming as usual. Tee hee hee… It seems these buildings are appearing on several islands. Pretty interesting, don\'t you think?',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Event_04' => 'So, have you finished looking? Quite impressive, isn\'t it? Doesn\'t it remind you of something in the past, too? I\'m not sure about this. Anyway, let\'s head back! Tee hee hee…',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Event_05' => 'Ta daaa! You made it. Never doubted you would, of course. Now let\'s go back to the future! Tee hee hee… just kidding! Let\'s just head back to your home island.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military2_01' => 'Very good, the way is clear now. Let us go on. I am sure there is enough trouble for everyone ahead. Tee hee hee…',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military2_02' => 'Ah, there is the village. Very well, let us see what the problem is. Do you think it is a shaman doing black magic again? Tee hee hee…',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military2_03' => 'Well well… old magic ruins behind this building metamorphosis? Tee hee hee… the people here really do have fertile imaginations. Whatever… let\'s get to the bottom of this.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military2_04' => 'There! The toad hopped away. What an ugly thing, that croaker. Tee hee hee… Well, the item has been acquired and used. We can shut down the ruins now.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military2_05' => 'Well done! The ruins have been destroyed and the village looks normal again. Now we can go back and celebrate your skill for breaking black magic. Tee hee hee…',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military_01' => 'Well, I\'d heard all about your military abilities, but I\'m impressed nonetheless. Did you already clear a way through the rocks? If so, we can move on.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military_02' => 'Wow, you are a strong person. Tee hee hee… Now let\'s hurry up - who knows how much time we have to solve this. Not that I have any further information. Tee hee hee...',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military_03' => 'Tee hee hee… you drove them back. Very impressive. You seemed to quite enjoy it too. But enough chatter - let\'s continue finding out exactly what the situation is.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military_04' => 'What a weird story. A witch came by and used black magic on their houses. Tee hee hee… A likely story. Anyway, there is only one way to find out. Let\'s go and ask the witch!',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military_05' => 'This is getting weirder and weirder. A shaman has cursed the village to go back in time little by little. Tee hee hee… Anyway, let\'s pay him a visit and… talk.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military_06' => 'Did you see? The buildings were turned back to normal. We managed to break the black magic spell. Piece of cake! Tee hee hee… Let\'s head back to your home zone - there is still a lot to do.',
        'Adv_Christmas2013_Q1' => 'Great work, the path to the Croaker is clear!',
        'Adv_Christmas2013_Q2' => 'We did it, the Croaker is defeated!',
        'Adv_EMEvent1' => 'What a glorious victory! Your opponent truly didn\'t hold back, and showed impressive class, all of which makes this success even sweeter. What a great way to start the tournament!',
        'Adv_EMEvent1_2' => 'What a glorious victory! Your opponent truly didn\'t hold back, and showed impressive class, all of which makes this success even sweeter. What a great way to start the tournament!',
        'Adv_EMEvent2' => 'You stood fast and showed the enemy that you\'re there\'s no messing with you! A worthy victory that is going to make a lasting impression on your followers.',
        'Adv_EMEvent2_2' => 'You stood fast and showed the enemy that you\'re there\'s no messing with you! A worthy victory that is going to make a lasting impression on your followers.',
        'Adv_EMEvent3' => 'You have defeated a worthy opponent with skill and finesse, and your supporters are jubilating. Truly a respectable effort to be proud of!',
        'Adv_EMEvent3_2' => 'You have defeated a worthy opponent with skill and finesse, and your supporters are jubilating. Truly a respectable effort to be proud of!',
        'Adv_EMEvent4' => 'Your opponent was no match for you! Revel in the glory of this moment while you can, for there are more stiff challenges ahead of you!',
        'Adv_EMEvent4_2' => 'Your opponent was no match for you! Revel in the glory of this moment while you can, for there are more stiff challenges ahead of you!',
        'Adv_EMEvent5' => 'You were victorious in what can only be called a remarkable battle! Such a spectacle is a rare sight to behold and your followers are rightfully stoked.',
        'Adv_EMEvent5_2' => 'You were victorious in what can only be called a remarkable battle! Such a spectacle is a rare sight to behold and your followers are rightfully stoked.',
        'Adv_EMEvent6' => 'What a triumph! You have proven your strategic brilliance in a truly epic struggle that shall be remembered! Your Settlers shall tell their offspring of this day and proudly look up to you.',
        'Adv_EMEvent6_2' => 'What a triumph! You have proven your strategic brilliance in a truly epic struggle that shall be remembered! Your Settlers shall tell their offspring of this day and proudly look up to you.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_01' => 'Congratulations! You have found all Easter eggs. Return to your home zone to complete the Easter quest.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_02' => 'Congratulations! You have found all Easter eggs. Return to your home zone to complete the Easter quest.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_03' => 'Congratulations! You have found all Easter eggs. Return to your home zone to complete the Easter quest.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_04' => 'Congratulations! You have found all Easter eggs. Return to your home zone to complete the Easter quest.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_05' => 'Congratulations! You have found all Easter eggs. Return to your home zone to complete the Easter quest.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_06' => 'Congratulations! You have found all Easter eggs. Return to your home zone to complete the Easter quest.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_07' => 'Congratulations! You have found all Easter eggs. Return to your home zone to complete the Easter quest.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_08' => 'Congratulations! You have found all Easter eggs. Return to your home zone to complete the Easter quest.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_09' => 'Congratulations! You have found all Easter eggs. Return to your home zone to complete the Easter quest.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_10' => 'Congratulations! You have found all Easter eggs. Return to your home zone to complete the Easter quest chain.',
        'Adv_EoWEventQ1' => 'We did it! We defeated the last of them. The future is safe. We have done well, I have to say!',
        'Adv_EoWEventQ2' => 'We have no time to waste - I see their witchdoctors have gathered and are up to no good, that much is certainl!',
        'Adv_EoWEventQ3' => 'Over there! They seem to have begun some sort of ritual! Can you feel it? It\'s sending chills down my spine. We must not let them finish their abysmal deeds. Quickly now, we might still be able to prevent them from casting the curse upon all of us!',
        'Adv_FirstThief_Q1' => 'Ali Baba searched the chests for any sign of the treasure. Unfortunately, there was nothing to be found, except a letter showing the location of an oasis nearby. You should rest till the night arrives. Travelling under the burning sun will tire our troops out.',
        'Adv_FirstThief_Q2' => 'The bandits didn’t expect you and started to panic. This ensured your victory, but also allowed one of the thieves to escape with his caravan - and valuable information in tow.',
        'Adv_FirstThief_Q3' => 'Ali Baba found a slave girl named Mardschana held captive in a cage. She seems to be attracted to him, the hero who saved her life, and agrees to help you. Her story is a long and sad one. She tells you about all the other islands, where the bandits take the people they\'ve captured. Ali Baba, driven by her story, is determined to find those islands.',
        'Adv_OilLamp_Q1' => 'The shady informant has betrayed you! The bandits were working for him all along, and he is not willing to share any information with you. Aladdin is sorry that he was not trustworthy, but he is convinced that he knows something.',
        'Adv_OilLamp_Q2' => 'In the face of your unstoppable advance, the shady informant panics and tries to make it to the docks. You can sense that his information is way too valuable to let him escape, and continue the pursuit alongside Aladdin.',
        'Adv_OilLamp_Q3' => 'The cornered informant gives up and shares his information. Both Scheherezade and the oil lamp were on that island, but the informant managed to raise the alarm of your arrival and they were taken to a different island to the north of this one. You are angry that you narrowly missed them, but at the same time happy that you finally have such a solid lead on Scheherezade\'s location. Aladdin decides to accompany you on your final trial.',
        'Adv_SeaSnake_Q1' => 'The sailors are impressed by your strength, and share with you a few more details. It seems that somewhere on this island there is a cave, in which there are lots of glittering gems. Sinbad seems interested in this, so he decides to accompany you on this adventure.',
        'Adv_SeaSnake_Q2' => 'The sea snake was definitely an unexpected enemy to face, but you prevailed nonetheless. The sunlight reflects across all of its scales, making them glitter like diamonds. Sinbad then starts laughing, as he realizes that whoever started the rumour mistook the sea snake\'s scales for glittering diamonds.',
        'Adv_SecondThief_Q1' => 'The bandits, overwhelmed by your forces, decided to point you in the right direction in return for their lives. They pointed towards the east, and mentioned an ancient ruin located there. Magnanimous as you are, you hold your end of the bargain and set them free.',
        'Adv_SecondThief_Q2' => 'The thieves located in the ancient ruins wouldn\'t say a word regarding their base, until one of your scouts came in, dragging a messenger with a secret message behind him. When the thieves see that their sneaky messenger had been apprehended, they lose hope and confess that the oasis does indeed exist, and that they have set up their main camp right there.',
        'Adv_SecondThief_Q3' => 'The thieves\' leader has been defeated, but he distracted you for long enough that the rest of the thieves could grab most of their treasure and leave the island. The defeated leader tells you that the woman you\'re looking for is being held on an island to the east. Ali Baba, on the other hand, has found a report that states that she has been taken to the south... But which one\'s right?',
        'Adv_TheBetrayedLittleTailorQ1' => 'There\'s his hut, but who are those people around it?',
        'Adv_TheBetrayedLittleTailorQ2' => 'Alright, my son is safe now. Next, let’s make a plan about how to deal with the inn-keeper.',
        'Adv_TheBetrayedLittleTailorQ3' => 'Well done - we have the cudgel back, and the inn-keeper’s tavern is already in sight.',
        'Adv_TheBetrayedLittleTailorQ4' => 'Yeah, that was one hell of a fight!',
        'Adv_TheBetrayedLittleTailorQ5' => 'Very well, I can almost smell him!',
        'Adv_TheBetrayedLittleTailorQ6' => 'That was fabulous! That greedy guy will not cheat anyone again soon.',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ1' => 'Great, you found their camp. Now we need to get the violin from them.',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ2' => 'Fantastic! The violin is ours!',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ3' => 'This forest is full of wild animals, but we have to continue - the blacksmith’s hut should come into sight any minute now.',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ4' => 'Great, he gave you his vise just as I said. Thank you very much, old friend. And just in time - it’s already getting dark.
Wish me luck that my plan works and I don\'t end up as bear food.',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ5' => 'There is the stable where I\'ve trapped the bear. Be careful - he is much tougher than normal bears.',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ6' => 'You did it, great! The wedding is saved, thanks to you!',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ7' => 'I knew it - those thugs were no match for you. You\'ve almost reached my rival’s hideout!',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ8' => 'Fantastic - you taught that guy a lesson he will never forget!',
        'Adv_TheHeroicLittleTailorQ1' => 'Good work. You have reached the hut and secured the area around it. You see the little tailor running out the hut with a relieved smile.',
        'Adv_TheHeroicLittleTailorQ2' => 'You have successfully rescued the stag. The black bull realised he had no chance, and ran away.',
        'Adv_TheHeroicLittleTailorQ3' => 'Well done! You managed not to lose his trail while fending off hordes of wild animals.',
        'Adv_TheHeroicLittleTailorQ4' => 'After the fight with the cultists, you find the little tailor in the catacombs below the tower, together with a maiden.
“Hurry up, I’ll explain everything later!” he says.',
        'Adv_TheHeroicLittleTailorQ5' => '"We\'re almost there. I can see the top of his castle behind those hills!"',
        'Adv_TheHeroicLittleTailorQ6' => 'Great! You\'ve defeated the Dark Magician and saved the maiden’s shire.',
        'Adv_TheNords2Q1' => 'I\'m sorry, but it seems that the Hoarfrost Globe is not in this camp! What a shame! I guess they managed to move it before we arrived! We should continue with our search!',
        'Adv_TheNords2Q2' => 'We\'ve found a man saying that the leader, Odinom the Cruel, broke the globe into pieces! Wait wait, don\'t start smiling just yet - the globe hasn\'t been destroyed!',
        'Adv_TheNords2Q3' => 'The wells were destroyed and the pieces of the globe are buried forever! However, it seems the ice is still devouring the island! I have no idea what to do next!',
        'Adv_TheNords2Q4' => 'We won, but Odinom the Cruel managed to escape! It doesn\'t matter! Quick, men - find that globe! Now!',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ1' => 'Well done - the city is now free from the bandit’s grip and we can move without fear of attack.',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ2a' => 'Aha! Look who’s chopping wood over there!',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ2b' => 'Good job - we have almost reached the tree!',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ2c' => 'Wow, what a breathtaking tree. I almost feel bad hurting it. I guess I don’t need to chop it entirely. I’ll just pick up some fallen branches…',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ3a' => 'After defeating the creatures in the old iron mine, you discover the second son hiding from the beasts behind some rocks.',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ3b' => 'Fabulous! I never really believed your stories about beating up giants, but now I’ve seen it with my own eyes!',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ4a' => 'It would appear the third son overestimated his abilities. You\'ve found him enchained in the bandit leader’s hut you just secured.',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ4b' => 'Great - you’ve driven the bandits back to their lair to protect their leader.',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ4c' => 'Really good work! The town is safe and we\'ve retrieved the cudgel for my master. I’m sure he will be very glad about this.',
        'Adv_TheValiantLittleTailorQ1' => 'We did it - we’ve beaten the giants! 
Wait here. I will tell the king of our success.',
        'Adv_TheValiantLittleTailorQ2' => 'That was great! I\'ve never seen a Unicorn that close up before. 
The King will be very pleased when I show him!',
        'Adv_TheValiantLittleTailorQ3' => 'Nice work, old friend.
I will go tell the King and return with the reward.',
        'Adv_TheValiantLittleTailorQ4' => 'The King is beaten!
I can’t thank you enough for helping me. Take this treasure I found in the king’s vault.',
        'Adv_TheWoodcutterMain_Q1' => 'Those rumours about your bravery are true then. It\'s been a long time since I saw someone fight like that. Thank you for your help, my dear friend.',
        'Adv_TheWoodcutterMain_Q2' => 'We freed many of the prisoners, but my wife was nowhere to be found. I came across a man named Ali Baba, a young wood cutter searching for treasure, but he was found and captured by 40 of those bandits! He offered us his help to find my wife, if we can help him find his lost treasure. I agreed, because the chance is high that both are in the same place.',
        'Adv_ThirdThief_Q1' => 'From the remains of the last camp, you spot Ali Baba\'s ship in the distance. You go and greet your friend, and, smiling, he tells you that he has a plan to get through the stronghold.',
        'Adv_ThirdThief_Q2' => 'The boulder covering the secret passage crumbles down and reveals the entrance to a dark cave. Ali Baba points inside and tells you that this cave will take you to where you want to go. You\'re worried that you can\'t see anything inside, much less an exit, but you decide to trust your friend.',
        'Adv_ThirdThief_Q3' => 'Behind the lair of the giant bat you catch a small glimpse of sunlight. Ali Baba quickly rustles through it to finally reveal the exit of the cave. Your troops let out a cheer as you announce to them that you have found the exit.',
        'Adv_ThirdThief_Q4' => 'When questioning the thieves\' leader about the captive women, you observe that the thief starts cackling loudly. Ali Baba fears the worst and starts searching the stronghold\'s prison, only to find that they\'re empty. One of your soldiers comes through from the storage room calling you in. What you find inside is unsettling to say the least.',
        'Adv_TreasureKnowledge_Q1' => 'Having cleared out the first area of bandit camps, you see a small path that climbs to the next level of the mountain. Understanding what to do next, you proceed along the newfound path.',
        'Adv_TreasureKnowledge_Q2' => 'The horrible plant monster withers, revealing the path to the summit of the mountain. You give your troops a rest after the long fight. Feeling refreshed, it\'s not long before Ali Baba screams in excitement after spotting the ancient library in the distance, as you set off on your way.',
        'Adv_TreasureKnowledge_Q3' => 'You are surprised and relieved to see that the bandits didn\'t destroy any of the books that were kept in the library. However, it\'s then you realize that the treasure the library holds isn\'t quite what the bandits expected. You won\'t find any gold or coins in this library, but the biggest and most valuable treasure in existence. Knowledge.',
        'Adv_TreasureWisdom_Q1' => 'The defeated raiders try to call reinforcements, but you swiftly put a stop to their efforts. They confess that they were only a diversion while the others pillaged the tombs around them in search for treasure. You quickly recover and give chase to them.',
        'Adv_TreasureWisdom_Q2' => 'The tomb raiders head back to one of the few remaining camps they have. You spot the temple on top of the mountain, and the obvious defence system linked to it. With your goal clear, you start heading towards it.',
        'Adv_TreasureWisdom_Q3' => 'The defence system shuts down, and you start searching the temple for treasure. You don\'t find anything material, but you encounter some very useful chronicles about an ancient race who lived here before. Their wisdom will prove to be a far more valuable treasure than any gold or trinkets that you may have found.',
        'AdventureSeasonMercenary_LevelRequirement26' => 'Perfect. Now you can continue. There’s news from the scouts. Hear them out!',
        'AdventureSeasonMercenary_Main' => 'Perfect. The mercenaries are retreating, and you collected plenty of those Adventure Relics. Use them to go on more adventures!',
        'AdventureSeasonMercenary_Sub1' => 'Great! This a perfect start for our investigations into the Adventure Relics. Try collecting some more!',
        'AdventureSeasonMercenary_Sub2' => 'Our investigators are making progress with each Adventure Relic you collect. Please continue!',
        'AdventureSeasonMercenary_Sub3' => 'Well done. I’m pleased to report that we’ve now made our discovery - we’ve discovered that these Adventure Relics are absolutely worthless. We’ll hold on to them for you, and you can grab a handful of rewards for your efforts.',
        'BAUMP1' => 'Now that everyone\'s safe, I have some significant developments to discuss with you.

Please meet me back on your island.',
        'BAUMP1_Sub1' => 'That should be enough. Now take them back to the wreck.',
        'BAUMP1_Sub2' => '2... 3... 4... Looks like everyone\'s accounted for, thank goodness.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main1' => 'Well done. I\'m already exhausted from all the festivities. Haha just joking, let\'s keep the parties coming. Not like I have to prepare everything, that sounds like a lot of work thehehe.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10' => 'Well done. I\'m already exhausted from all the festivities. Haha just joking, let\'s keep the parties coming. Not like I have to prepare everything, that sounds like a lot of work thehehe.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub1' => 'Looks like this was all too easy for a veteran like you. But as you might expect, preparing a Celebrathon will become hard work at some point. You\'ll see.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub10' => 'It seems your offer of making amends was gladly accepted. You\'re a kind person after all. Keep up the good work.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub2' => 'Ha ha ha, he he, ohhhh yeah that was a great story! Oh, no, not yours - the one I just retold myself, in my mind, hehehehe.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub3' => 'Aaahhh. Nothing better than a cold drink after dancing your feet off.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub4' => 'Oh, yeah... Just as I expected. Several chairs were broken, and a few tables too - maybe I shouldn\'t have started one of my famous table dance-off challenges. But they\'re always so much fun! I don\'t know how it happened, but a Bronze Statue was kind of destroyed, too. I could never condone such irresponsible behavior. Tsk tsk tsk.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub5' => 'That took longer than expected. It almost felt like work. Who told you to do that? Me? No I\'d never do that. Ok, maybe I would...',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub6' => 'As if nothing happened. You\'re an amazing party host!',
