        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Looped' => 'Thanks! I found this stuff in the tras- treasure chamber. You can have it, tee hee.',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Main' => 'If I could be serious for a minute... I\'d just like to say a big thank you, for all your help.

OK, that\'s quite enough of that - now, back to be being silly! Tee hee!',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Sub1' => 'And your reward is... a firm and satisfying handshake! Ha ha ha! Huh? Wait, you don\'t like it? 
Okay, okay - I have something else...',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Sub2' => 'You did it! Looks like it was just as easy as I thought, tee hee hee!',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Sub3' => 'Looks like you\'re starting to get into it, too! 
Let\'s fill the hall to the rafters with balloons!',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Sub4' => 'Whaaat?! You really did it?? Oh... "yippee!"
I guess this belongs to you now...',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Sub5' => 'Wow! This is the closest I\'ve ever come to being speechless!
You\'ve more than earned your reward.',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Sub6' => 'Are you kidding!? You really managed to donate that many balloons!? You are one of a kind!',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Sub7' => 'No no no, this can\'t be true! Can someone pinch me just so I know I\'m not dreaming?!',
        'Birthday2018plusLevelRequirement16' => 'You did well... for a rookie! Ha ha ha!!
Fine - as a reward, I\'ll let you help with the preparations!',
        'Birthday2018plusLevelRequirement26' => 'You! Hey! I just received word of something very curious going on! Let\'s have some fun!',
        'Birthday2018plusMissions_Main' => 'That whole business was crazy... I loved every minute of it, ha ha!',
        'Birthday2018plusMissions_Sub1' => 'I don\'t get why the islanders were so upset about this whole affair.
I just thought it was funny, tee hee!',
        'Birthday2018plusMissions_Sub2' => 'Did you really have to put and end to it? The island looks so boring now!',
        'Birthday2018plusPhaseDelay' => 'I hope you did take some time out to enjoy the festivities? Pretty impressive, right? OK - time to move on with the second week. Can I count on you once again?',
        'Birthday2018plusPhaseDelay2' => 'I hope you managed to take some time out to enjoy the festivities. Pretty impressive, right? OK - time to move on with the third week. Can I count on you one final time?',
        'Birthday2018plusPhaseOneDonation_Main' => 'Wow, you\'re all so incredibly amazing! Thanks so much for helping out!
You ended up making me a lot of work, what with having to get all your rewards ready in time and everything, but still - here you go!',
        'Birthday2018plusPhaseThreeDonation_Main' => 'What an amazing thing we accomplished together. Absolutely stunning work, my friends! You\'ve all really earned your rewards. Here they come!',
        'Birthday2018plusPhaseTwoDonation_Main' => 'What an amazing thing we\'ve accomplished together! Absolutely stunning work, my friends! You\'ve all really earned your rewards. Here they come!',
        'Birthday2018plusTutorial_Main' => 'Looks like this wise master has taught you everything you need to know, tee hee! 
Keep contributing to our balloon supply, and you won\'t regret it!',
        'Birthday2018plusTutorial_Sub1' => 'Thank you! Just keep those resources flowing if you want as many balloons as possible.',
        'Birthday2018plusTutorial_Sub2' => 'You only found half the items? 
Oh no! Actually, it looks like the other stuff ended up on your neighbours\' islands.',
        'Birthday2018plusTutorial_Sub3' => 'The cake was great - although now I think I need a nap...
Oh, right! I almost forgot to tell you - you can find more cake ingredients on successful adventures. However, you\'ll still only find one type of ingredient. You\'ll have to trade for the other.',
        'Birthday2018plusTutorial_Sub4' => 'If you keep donating balloons to the party, you\'ll be rewarded handsomely.
