        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_62-80_UnknownSeas_Main' => 'The mystery deepens. Though the fleet was scattered, its story did not end in tragedy alone. Survivors carried Octavianus\'s legacy onward.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_62-80_UnknownSeas_Sub1' => 'The generosity of strangers sustained the Romans when their own supplies grew scarce. Their gratitude is recorded in every page of the journal.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_62-80_UnknownSeas_Sub2' => 'Many ships were lost, but not all. Survivors regrouped on distant shores, determined to continue despite overwhelming odds.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_62-80_UnknownSeas_Sub3' => 'These settlements became beacons of hope. From them, the search for the Roman homeland continued.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_62-80_UnknownSeas_Sub4' => 'Though scarred by countless battles, the standard never fell. It points toward the expedition\'s final march inland.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_62-80_UnknownSeas_Sub5' => 'Beyond the mountains lies evidence of a much larger settlement. The final chapter of the expedition is close at hand.',
        'BirthdayBasicsMain' => 'So, you managed to complete the basics of this competition. Congratulations. You know, there are many more ways to obtain these balloons, such as quests, upgrading buildings, etc. etc. etc. You should try to find them all! How? Well, I guess the best way is simply by playing! Tee hee hee…',
        'BirthdayBasicsSub1' => 'See? They\'re beautiful, aren\'t they?! Now, you might wonder where to get them, right? Tee hee hee… There are many ways actually. I\'ll show you!',
        'BirthdayBasicsSub2' => 'Well done! You will not know instantly whether you\'ve created balloons. Every now and then you will get a message detailing the balloons you\'ve gathered, so check your mailbox regularly. Let me show you the next way to collect balloons.',
        'BirthdayBasicsSub3' => 'Very well, you know how to handle things. Have you already received a message? If not, do not despair! The time will come. Let\'s go on with our little balloon lesson. Tee hee hee…',
        'BirthdayBasicsSub4' => 'See? Pretty easy, isn\'t it? Tee hee hee… The balloons will be sent to a server storage and count toward your server. Of course, there\'s a place where you can see how the servers are performing. Tee hee hee….',
        'BirthdayBasicsSub5' => 'Marvelous, isn\'t it? This should answer all your remaining questions. By the way, the window will be updated with every new event, so it\'s your new source for event-related questions. Tee hee hee…',
        'BirthdayMain' => 'I shall go now. Thank you for your cooperation. I will make sure it has been noted, and recommend you for a nice, shiny reward. Tee hee hee… Don\'t stop gathering balloons though - the competition isn\'t over yet. Good luck and goodbye!',
        'BirthdaySub1' => 'Wow, you actually gathered the amount I asked for. Nicely done! I mean, I didn\'t doubt you would for a second, but I\'m impressed nonetheless. Tee hee hee…',
        'BirthdaySub2' => 'That should be enough. It seems you are ready for a new challenge. I will send a message to the settler who alerted me, then we will make plans for how to proceed. Tee hee hee…',
        'BirthdaySub3' => 'Wow, that was a weird adventure, but it was funny. Anyway, let\'s check what to do next. I\'m sure I\'ll find more things in need of a solution. Tee hee hee…',
        'BirthdaySub4' => 'New settlers, new life, and more fun. Tee hee hee… But this is no time to catch you breath - we need to forge onwards. Still a lot to do!',
        'BirthdaySub5' => 'Nice! Now we\'re ready for the next step. I\'ll check the map for the new island. Hopefully, it\'s not as far away as the last one.',
        'BirthdaySub6' => 'Nicely done. Everyone is happy, and I haven\'t received any new disturbing news about buildings changing their appearance. I assume this is good. Tee hee hee…',
        'BirthdaySub7' => 'You actually gathered all the balloons. You really are the most impressive person I have ever met. Tee hee hee… Well, I supposed it\'s time for me to go then.',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main1' => 'Well done! Our relationship with the Bonabertis has deepened. Maybe you could deepen it even more?',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main1_Sub1' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main1_Sub2' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main1_Sub3' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main1_Sub4' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main2' => 'Well done! Our relationship with the Bonabertis has deepened. Maybe you could deepen it even more?',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main2_Sub1' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main2_Sub2' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main2_Sub3' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main2_Sub4' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main3' => 'Well done! Our relationship with the Bonabertis has deepened. Maybe you could deepen it even more?',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main3_Sub1' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main3_Sub2' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main3_Sub3' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main3_Sub4' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main4' => 'Well done! Our relationship with the Bonabertis has deepened. Actually, they regard you as a true friend now, and wish to reward you with their expensive obsidian ore.',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main4_Sub1' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main4_Sub2' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main4_Sub3' => 'Well done!',
        'BonabertiConnection_Main4_Sub4' => 'Well done!',
        'BonusAdvancedAForeignThreat' => 'As your newly trained elite soldiers go on a military parade, you hear your settlers cheer and rejoice: “There is no foe strong enough to take on our island’s forces.”',
        'BonusAdvancedCloth' => 'With this much cloth we could cover a grain field. Or two!',
        'BonusAdvancedEpicAdventureComplete' => 'They\'ve returned! Glorious! I think it\'s time for them to rest for a spell.',
        'BonusAdvancedExoticPlank' => 'We have enough exotic wood planks! Now we can build more advanced buildings!',
        'BonusAdvancedExoticWoodProduce' => 'We have the exotic wood we need. Let\'s hope that the winds will calm down.',
        'BonusAdvancedExoticWoodRefill' => 'Good, now the woodcutters can continue their work!',
        'BonusAdvancedFairytailAdventure' => 'Your explorer returned and he has a map for you! Let\'s see where this new adventure will take us!',
        'BonusAdvancedFairytailSearch' => 'Your explorer returned and he has a map for you! Let\'s see where this new adventure will take us!',
        'BonusAdvancedFairytaleAdventure' => 'Ahh! The magical creatures! Splendid! Thank you my lord.',
        'BonusAdvancedGraniteProduce' => 'We\'ll use some of this granite to fill the holes. Or shall we just use stones?',
        'BonusAdvancedLetFlowersSpeak' => '“Oh, look at our wonderful sunflowers – how beautiful they are!”, your love says and gives you a warm smile.',
        'BonusAdvancedMahoganyPlank' => 'I think this amount of mahogany wood should suffice! Good work!',
        'BonusAdvancedMahoganyWood' => 'Your workers were happy to create the planks for you!',
        'BonusAdvancedMajorGeneral' => 'Ohh, the major general looks so fierce he could burn a hole right through you! Wait, what\'s that smell?',
        'BonusAdvancedMoreNewWeapons' => 'So many weapons, where are we going to store them?',
        'BonusAdvancedOiledMachine' => 'Having you as a friend is a blessing.',
        'BonusAdvancedPlatinumOreSearch' => 'The platinum ore is here, but it seems that the only thing that\'s special about it is the colour. It\'s really much brighter. Well, at least we have some more platinum ore now.',
        'BonusAdvancedPlatinumProduce' => 'Your miners have replaced the missing stock with platinum ore. Good work!',
        'BonusAdvancedPrincessAdventure' => 'Now you know all the secrets of the sand dunes. There are many adventures that await in the future, but for now, take some time and rest.',
        'BonusAdvancedSaddleCloth' => 'Yes, now we have more saddle cloth, and they come in various sizes. It should be fine!',
        'BonusAdvancedSalpeterProduce' => 'This is more than enough! We\'ll send some of it to the alchemists!',
        'BonusAdvancedStory01' => 'Ahh, good! This saltpetre will make the perfect gunpowder! Now for the next gift.',
        'BonusAdvancedStory02' => 'The smell of this basket is splendid! King Schahri will be more than delighted! Now let\'s see what we can do about that last gift.',
        'BonusAdvancedStory03' => 'Now I can tell which of your knights is the best! There, that group! They will make a fine addition to the king\'s guard! Thank you my lord!',
        'BonusAdvancedStory04' => 'The manors are ready! Now all we need are some decorations, and we\'ll be able to welcome any visitor of royal blood.',
        'BonusAdvancedStory05' => 'The king was speechless when he saw the gold! He loves gold! Unfortunately, he also asked me about how generous you are so… well, I think I know what he wants next.',
        'BonusAdvancedStory06' => 'The king is impressed with your wealth and generosity! He must leave now, but I\'m sure he will be back! Maybe he\'ll even invite you to his castle?',
        'BonusAdvancedTailorAdventure' => 'That was a true adventure! I\'ve learned so much!',
        'BonusAdvancedTaskComplete' => 'The captain was impressed! Good work!',
        'BonusAdvancedTheGreatestGood' => 'Your heart is filled with joy as you look at your island’s merry and bright youth. The future does look mightily promising.',
        'BonusAdvancedTheLocustPlague' => 'That insecticide works wonders, and soon the locust plague is over. You saved the harvest – great job!',
        'BonusAdvancedTitaniumProduce' => 'It seems the report was wrong... At least now we have a lot of titanium. That can\'t be a bad thing!',
        'BonusAdvancedWoodcutterAdventure' => 'Ahh! You\'re back! Have you ever seen such marvels?',
        'BonusAdvancedWool' => 'The wool is ready! I will have it dyed in gold… I mean yellow paint!',
        'BuccaneerRoundupQ1' => 'The coast is clear! Onward to the docks!',
        'BuccaneerRoundupQ2' => 'Excellent job! 

The ship is burning at the docks, and through the dense smoke you can see your soldiers "liberating" chests, barrels and packages from its hold. 

A fine prize indeed!',
        'BuffAd4_Construction_Area_Sub2' => 'Good work! Now we have enough building space, let\'s continue with the next step.',
        'BuffAd4_Miner_Catering_Sub5' => 'No miner can do his job without the proper provisions. Thank you for the help. I think we\'re done!',
        'BuffAd4_Mining_Post_Sub3' => 'The infrastructure and our base are built. We can finally start mining!',
        'BuffAd4_Opening_the_Shaft_Sub4' => 'Good job. We\'re nearly done!',
        'BuffAd4_Proof_of_Purity_Sub1' => 'Very good. The ore has a very high quality as expected. Let\'s carry on with our plan.',
        'BuffAd4_Riches_of_the_Mountain_Main1' => 'It\'s ready. The mining shaft is complete, the supply line is set and the security of the miners is ensured. Thank you very much for your help. I\'ll have someone prepare a reward for you and send it to your main island.',
        'BuffAd4_Sabotage_Sub6' => 'You did it! I don\'t know how, but you stopped the sabotage! Now our miners can go about their business without any more inconvenience.',
        'BuffAd_Dragons_Roost_Main' => 'The threat has been lifted, and my curiosity sated. Time to go home.',
        'BuffAd_Dragons_Roost_Sub1' => 'I knew you could do it! Now for the interesting part...',
        'BuffAd_Dragons_Roost_Sub2' => 'Good job! Your army can advance to the mountaintop now.',
        'BuffAd_Dragons_Roost_Sub3' => 'The sword sparkles with energy! Looks like there might be something to the legend. We\'ll see if it works soon enough.',
        'BuffAd_Dragons_Roost_Sub4' => 'What a fight! But it\'s not over yet! I saw Flafir escape when the castle collapsed, even though his wounds should have been lethal. That\'s the final proof of his immortality.',
        'BuffAd_Dragons_Roost_Sub5' => 'The deed is done. Flafir is no more.',
        'BuffAd_HeartOfTheWoods_Main' => 'It\'s over - the blight is gone! With time, the forest will recover and the animals will come back to our woods. Thank you for doing this for us - we are forever in your debt.',
        'BuffAd_HeartOfTheWoods_Sub1' => 'That worked. The animals show signs of getting better.
However, they\'re still in danger, unless we treat the root of the problem.',
        'BuffAd_HeartOfTheWoods_Sub2' => 'The potion worked. That is a sight for sore eyes! The tree will bloom soon, and start spreading its magic again throughout the forest.',
        'BuffAd_HeartOfTheWoods_Sub3' => 'The powder is doing its job. The forest is looking better than ever.',
        'BuffAd_HeartOfTheWoods_Sub4' => 'Good work. The sickness seems to have faded from the land. Thank you!',
        'BuffAd_Lost_City_Main' => 'With the city unearthed and the spells lifted, I can finally start exploring the ruins. And all thanks to you!',
        'BuffAd_Lost_City_Sub1' => 'At last, some quiet! Now let\'s have a look at the remaining altars…',
        'BuffAd_Lost_City_Sub2' => 'See how this place\'s magic invigorates your troops?
It appears that every shrine offers a unique boon. I advise you make liberal use of them.',
        'BuffAd_Lost_City_Sub3' => 'Woah! It really was here! Look at that grandeur!
But... there seems to be an invisible force blocking the way... Hmm... Ah, this archway is adorned with some interesting glyphs. They may hold a clue...',
        'BuffAd_Lost_City_Sub4' => 'Good job activating the altars! Now I just need to… and then… Yes, That did the trick! The barrier has disappeared!',
        'BuffAd_Of_Songs_And_Curses_Main' => 'Looks like King Roxy and his band managed to clean up the mess they made. Good thing they had you to help.

Let\'s hope they won\'t be so careless with their ghastly powers again.',
        'BuffAd_Of_Songs_And_Curses_Sub1' => 'We were able to convince the guards that we only mean to help. 
Let\'s talk to the people in the town. Maybe somebody knows the whereabouts of the Serenade.',
        'BuffAd_Of_Songs_And_Curses_Sub2' => 'Roxy is already writing the missing pieces. You can tell he and the band are eager to play.',
        'BuffAd_Of_Songs_And_Curses_Sub2_Cultists' => 'Those cultists really were up to no good. Did you have a peek inside that church? Good thing we got rid of them in time.
And you also got two Serenade pages from the priest!',
        'BuffAd_Of_Songs_And_Curses_Sub2_Forest' => 'That was a lot to take care of. I\'d say you\'ve more than earned that page.',
        'BuffAd_Of_Songs_And_Curses_Sub2_Hermit' => 'The page was in the hut alright. I\'m relieved that the bandits didn\'t harm it. It\'s all yours now.',
        'BuffAd_Of_Songs_And_Curses_Sub2_Ruins1' => 'Good job taking care of the bandits. Time to assess the damage...',
        'BuffAd_Of_Songs_And_Curses_Sub2_Ruins2' => 'This should suffice for now. Let\'s report your success so that the first people can move back in.',
        'BuffAd_Of_Songs_And_Curses_Sub2_Scraps' => 'Looks like we got lucky. Now just to apply some glue and... good as new!',
        'BuffAd_Of_Songs_And_Curses_Sub3' => 'Thanks to you, the concert was a great success!
Look, the mist is dispersing! And is that the sun I see rising on the horizon?',
        'BuffAd_Raid_of_the_Nords_Main' => 'You are a true hero. Not many people would have gone to such lengths to help random strangers.
Me? Well, I\'ve made some new friends. This tribe has lived here for centuries, and has some amazing stories to share!',
        'BuffAd_Raid_of_the_Nords_Sub1' => 'This is routine for you at this point, is it not?',
        'BuffAd_Raid_of_the_Nords_Sub2' => 'I\'m glad that my invention could be of service. The Nords will think twice before raiding this island again.
All that\'s left to do now is to clear up the mess they\'ve made…',
        'BuffAd_Raid_of_the_Nords_Sub3' => 'With the tents rebuilt, the natives won\'t have to worry about freezing to death. But there is one final problem to take care of…',
        'BuffAd_Raid_of_the_Nords_Sub4' => 'What a feast! You didn\'t spare any expense, did you? But look at the relief and gratitude on the people\'s faces! You did something truly great today.',
        'BuffAd_SafeTheTowns_Main' => 'Marvelous! You managed to settle the conflict between the brewers and bakers from Grain Island. Maybe you should consider a career in diplomacy...',
        'BuffAd_SafeTheTowns_Sub1' => 'Ha! This place looks as good as new... or as good as old, I guess. Thank you. I feel much better about this place already.',
        'BuffAd_SafeTheTowns_Sub2' => 'It actually worked! Well done! Both brewers and bakers were a little disgruntled after we revealed the truth about the beer and bread we gave them, but it served its purpose. We made them come back to the negotiation table.',
        'BuffAd_SafeTheTowns_Sub3' => 'The first negotiation in years was a complete success! Especially thanks to the meal you provided! Thank you, in the name of both the brewer and the baker\'s guilds.',
        'BuffAd_twins_Main' => 'Thank you very much. The twins are back at their home, safe and sound. Their parents can sleep again, and have sent a small reward to your island.',
        'BuffAd_twins_Sub1' => 'These bridges should give the patrol team the footing they need to navigate the swamps.',
        'BuffAd_twins_Sub2' => 'Great - there are already some hints coming in. Let\'s see whether there\'s anything viable.',
        'BuffAd_twins_Sub3' => 'Wow, the helpers did great work there. That will not happen to the twins again.',
        'BuffAdv_El_Chupacabra_Main' => 'Well done! I\'m glad that you were able to act so swiftly. Who knows how this would have turned out otherwise?
Anyway, there\'s a fair chance that the creature\'s demise will also lift the curse. I\'ll stay behind and monitor the aftermath. If all goes well, I will see you soon.',
        'BuffAdv_El_Chupacabra_Sub1' => 'This was an unpleasant task, no matter how you look at it. Either way, at least we\'ve managed to tear down a section of the palisade. The path to the monster is clear.',
        'BuffAdv_El_Chupacabra_Sub2' => 'Well fought! It\'s well known that animals are at their most dangerous when cornered; yet you dispatched the Chupacabra and his pack easily.',
        'BuffAdv_El_Chupacabra_Sub3' => 'It works! The inhabitants of the camp have calmed down. 
That means we can avoid unnecessary conflict by producing more of this mushroom medicine!',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Fisherman_Main1' => 'Ilsebille is escaping! Part of me is relieved that no harm came to her, but unfortunately, it seems that her madness persists.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Fisherman_Sub1' => 'It\'s a bittersweet victory, this one. We\'re definitely closer to the castle, but the innocent wildlife paid the price. We have to make sure that nobody else is affected by Ilsebille!',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Fisherman_Sub2' => 'Great! We gained control of the pond! Now we need to make sure that the prince stays safe.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Fisherman_Sub3' => 'Great, the potion seems to have taken effect! The prince is finally free from his curse!',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Fisherman_Sub4' => 'We\'re close. Very close. One more move, and we\'ll finally be able to pin her down. Let\'s get ready!',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Fisherman_Sub5' => 'The castle is ours! But there\'s no sign of the queen… Where did she go?',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Hansel_Gretel_Main1' => 'There\'s no sign of the Queen. While this is unfortunate news, at least we made sure that the Queen and the Dark Cult will no longer bother these people. Hansel and Gretel are finally back home, and the woodcutter has expressed his infinite gratitude to us.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Hansel_Gretel_Sub1' => 'The device seems to work well! We now have a solid lead on where Hansel went. He\'s a smart cookie, that boy...',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Hansel_Gretel_Sub2' => 'That seems to be the last of the enraged animals. I feel bad that it had to come to this, but at least we know that if the children are still lost in the woods, they won\'t be in quite so much danger.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Hansel_Gretel_Sub3' => 'We found Hansel locked away in the witch\'s house! In an unusual turn of events, it was Gretel who came out as soon as she saw us, and told us how she\'d managed to trick the blind witch. We\'re going to need a carriage for Hansel, though. He\'s... incapable of walking right now.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Hansel_Gretel_Sub4' => 'That was the last of the Dark Cult\'s camps. I see a big castle in the distance, and I\'d bet my left hand that it\'s their headquarters.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Hansel_Gretel_Sub5' => 'Excellent. This will be enough food for the woodcutter and his family to last for several months. They send their most heartfelt thanks.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Hansel_Gretel_Sub6' => 'Victory is ours! We seized the Evil Queen\'s castle!',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Piper_of_Hamelin_Main1' => 'She was hiding in plain sight! I feel like a complete fool for not noticing before. In any case, the land of Hamelin is now safe from her influence, the rat plague is gone, the children are safe, and the piper wants to atone by helping the town. We should head back and follow the queen.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Piper_of_Hamelin_Sub1' => 'Well, it cost a lot to make the right flutes, but it seems things worked out for the best. The rats have fled the island, and should pose no threat to the people of Hamelin anymore.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Piper_of_Hamelin_Sub2' => 'The piper has released the children, and explained what happened with the Mayor. The guilt weighs heavily on him, and he now wants to support us in our efforts. One thing really struck me about his speech, though. He said very firmly "Do not trust the mayor. He seems to be a changed man."',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Piper_of_Hamelin_Sub3' => 'All of this is very strange. Why is the Dark Cult defending the Mayor of Hamelin? Nothing makes sense! In any case, we\'re getting close now. I can see the mayor\'s house from here.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Piper_of_Hamelin_Sub4' => 'What? Queen Ilsebille!? She was disguised as the mayor all along!? It must have been a magic disguise - it looked exactly like the original! She quickly fled the scene, but we found the real mayor kidnapped in the wine cellar.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Red_Riding_Hood_Main1' => 'The queen is escaping! Bah, no matter. We need to make sure that Red and her grandma are safe. We\'ll catch the queen later!',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Red_Riding_Hood_Sub1' => 'When we cleared that last cave, we found a little girl wearing a red hood, hiding in a corner. She looks really scared. Let\'s see what\'s up with her.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Red_Riding_Hood_Sub2' => 'I have no idea where that lumberjack got his medical licence, but all that matters is, it worked. Grandma doesn\'t look too healthy, though… She\'s horribly shaken.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Red_Riding_Hood_Sub3' => 'It worked! She\'s feeling a lot calmer now. Grandma said that the wolf "convinced" her to open her door? But… wolves don\'t talk! That smells like dark magic to me. Ilsebille must be behind this attack…',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Red_Riding_Hood_Sub4' => 'The Dark Cult is retreating, and the path to the queen\'s castle is finally clear. Time to give "her majesty" a piece of our minds!',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Red_Riding_Hood_Sub5' => 'The queen is retreating! Victory is ours!',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Snow_White_Main1' => 'To be honest with you, I\'m not surprised that Ilsebille was disguised as the queen of this kingdom. Few people are as twisted as she is. The important thing is that Snow White is safe, and the queen has been expelled from these lands. Good job!',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Snow_White_Sub1' => 'There\'s no trace of her, but I can see the hunter who was hired to kill her! Let\'s see if we can convince him to change his mind.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Snow_White_Sub2' => 'As I suspected, the hunter never wanted to harm Snow White. He\'s just another victim. He spotted some of the wildlife that we encountered before, and has said that he\'ll try to trick the queen into thinking that the heart of a boar is in fact Snow White\'s. At least it will buy her some time.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Snow_White_Sub3' => 'Those were no ordinary bugs! The potions we prepared got rid of the problem, and the dwarfs can now focus on taking care of Snow White full-time.',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Snow_White_Sub4' => 'Well done. It\'s time to confront the queen!',
        'BuffAdv_Evil_Queen_Snow_White_Sub5' => 'Queen Ilsebille was impersonating the real queen!? Is she really that desperate for power and attention? She must have known about the real queen\'s feelings towards Snow White, and taken it to the extreme. That\'s low, even for her.',
        'BuffAdv_OneStepAhead_Main' => 'That concludes our work here. Are you ready to return home, or do you have any business remaining on this rotten island?',
        'BuffAdv_OneStepAhead_Sub1' => 'Good job. The remaining pirates look intimidated, and some have already sworn to change their wicked ways. We can expect fewer similar attacks in future.',
        'BuffAdv_OneStepAhead_Sub2' => 'The preparations are complete. Now we wait.',
        'BuffAdv_OneStepAhead_Sub3' => 'This should satisfy your allies. Will you be taking care of the remaining fleet before heading for home?',
        'BuffAdv_OneStepAhead_Sub4' => 'Look at all this stolen treasure! Of course, we\'ll have to return it to its original owners. But doesn\'t feel great being selfless? You look like you\'ve grown from the experience.',
        'BuffAdv_SplitCityFall_Sub1' => 'So far, so good. Let\'s push on before the garrisons start doubting our chance of winning.
The latest research suggests that there\'s something in the water that\'s attracting the evildoers. But that doesn\'t explain why we\'ve so far remained unaffected, as we also drink the same water. Maybe it has something to do with this volcano, and the air surrounding it? I need more time to investigate - but I\'m afraid we cannot stay long.',
        'BuffAdv_SplitCityFall_Sub2' => 'That was one of the hardest challenges I\'ve had to face in my entire life. There were some ineffably challenging foes to defeat, but you\'ve overcome them all, as always.
I am proud and thankful of being able to travel and fight with you.',
        'BuffAdv_SplitCity_Sub1' => 'Great work - now let\'s continue to the city. 

Still, something\'s been bothering me. I can\'t stop wondering why these villains aren\'t setting up their tents, and are instead choosing to camp in caves and holes. As if their appearance isn\'t wild enough already. On one hand, they talk and fight as if nothing is out of the ordinary, but on the other they look like they\'re in some sort of gold rush. The village chief told us there aren\'t any valuable ores or other resources to be found in this region, but I\'d discuss this matter with your geologists... Something\'s just not... never mind. Let\'s get going.',
        'BuffAdv_SplitCity_Sub2' => 'Though these foes are a wild bunch, I imagined it\'d be harder to defeat them. Good work. Now there\'s only a few enemies left, let us clean out the trash and set the townspeople free.',
        'BuffAdv_TF_Introduction_Main1' => 'The problem has been dealt with for now. The governor\'s "clients" will not dare to come close to Puerto Sombrío.

What about you? Are you ready to leave?',
        'BuffAdv_TF_Introduction_Sub1' => 'Those fighters were no natives. What is going on here?',
        'BuffAdv_TF_Introduction_Sub2' => 'Did they really think those gates would stop us? Finding that spy of yours should be just a formality now.',
        'BuffAdv_TF_Introduction_Sub3' => 'Wow! You\'ve got to hear this! Your spy has uncovered quite the conspiracy! 
A group of pirates, and other "explorers", dock at Puerto Sombrío to restock the supplies of their treasure fleets. The loot they\'re carrying is obviously stolen - but the governor gets bribed to turn a blind eye.
I say it\'s time to claim indemnity for your subject.',
        'BuffAdv_TF_Introduction_Sub4' => 'This just goes to show that crime doesn\'t pay! 
You should probably dispatch a different spy to this place, just to keep an eye on things. In my experience, corruption is not that easy to root out.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V1_Main1' => 'Not only could we help the poor villagers, but we also managed to find some new friends. This Venture is going to be a breeze! Let\'s continue our journey north.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V1_Main2' => 'Another obstacle overcome. We can now head further into the mountains, and continue our search for the ominous Mountain Clan.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V1_Side1' => 'Apparently, the Nords settled here long ago. We discovered an old children\'s book depicting the history of the Mountain Clan. It seems they all had very long beards, including the women of the tribe! They were all styled in different ways, hinting towards their various professions. It also showed a man of the Mountain Clan, covered in hair from head to toe. Unfortunately, though, the text below cannot be deciphered any more.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V1_Side2' => 'After investigating the place thoroughly, we found some leg chains that would fit a leg the size of a barrel! The Nords were using it as a cable for the winch on their well. Legends painted on the walls show the sinister people of the Mountain Clan, some as big as trees, biting the head of the Nords\' children if they dared to get too close.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V1_SideSub1' => 'A small step for a carpenter, a big step for... nevermind. Let\'s get moving!',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V1_SideSub2' => 'Good news, the wildlife is no longer in our way!',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V1_SideSub3' => 'Restoring these bridges will not only help us find out more about the Mountain Clan, but will also help the people living here reclaim their land.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V1_SideSub4' => 'Well, that\'s the wildlife dealt with. Well done! Now, let me through! I want to start digging!',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V1_Sub1' => 'Well done. This area should be able to breathe easy again without so many bandits scarring the land.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V1_Sub2' => 'Incredible. The Varaldsvik Village Elders let us know that they\'ve seen smiles on faces that haven\'t smiled for decades. With tears welling in their eyes, they are finally able to see hope again, thanks to your effort!',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V1_Sub3' => 'One step closer to the mountains. Let\'s go forth without fear!',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V1_Sub4' => 'Fantastic! You\'ve defeated the Ibexes! But before we continue, could we make a short stop to take a shower?',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V1_Sub5' => 'Good as new! Well, OK - not quite, but at least it looks like we should be able to get across. Is it safe? Yes, yes of course it is! That\'s why you can go first...',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V1_Sub6' => 'Well, that was  tough. It seems the enemies here have some tricks up their sleeves and are somehow influencing the wildlife. We\'d better prepare well before we continue our venture. But for now, let us celebrate our recent triumph! Well done.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V2_Main' => 'The path ahead is clear, and we have the equipment we need. Shall we push on now, or do you still have business with the other Nords?',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V2_Optional' => 'A wise decision. 
It looks like you won\'t get your hands on enough quality pelts to go through with a fourth deal, but you\'ve done as much as you can.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V2_OptionalSub1' => 'The chieftain appreciates you helping out his village despite your bandit troubles. He\'s open to negotiating a trade.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V2_Sub1' => 'I see you got your hands on the bare necessities.
You should really consider grabbing more gear if you can, though.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V2_Sub2' => 'You sure showed the beasties! 
The chieftain looks impressed. Good position to be in for trade negotiations, I\'d wager.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V2_Sub3' => 'Another job well done. You\'re a real trooper, ain\'t ya?',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V2_Sub4' => 'They really should have known better after last time...',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V2_TradeA' => 'What are you waiting for? 
Distribute these shoes to your army and deep snow will no longer slow you down.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V2_TradeB' => 'They\'ve delivered the spikes. Once you\'ve handed them out to your troops, they should be able to keep their footing on even the most slippery ice.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V2_TradeC' => 'I\'m freezing just looking at you in that weak excuse for a coat. You should really wear your new clothes.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V2_TradeD' => 'I see, you\'ve... Wait, I can\'t see anything! 
Will you lend me a pair of those goggles, please?',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V2_TradeTutorial' => 'Great! Just deliver everything to the Mead Hall in the village you want to trade with.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V3_Main1' => 'So many unknown paths. So many obstacles. And on top of all that, you\'re facing weather conditions that are above and beyond anything you\'ve encountered so far. But nothing could stop you, and you sanguinely found your path. Keep it up!',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V3_Side1' => 'So... I guess at least some of the legends about the Mountain Clan seem to be nothing more than the overactive imagination of some frightened villagers. But what is the truth behind these legends? As they say, there\'s no smoke without fire...',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V3_SideSub1' => 'So, what did you find? Ah, interesting... So most mine entrances are a bit smaller than you\'d expect, and the handles of the tools are also a bit shorter? Hmm.
But the tools weigh too much for children to work with? Remarkable... And what conclusion would you draw from this my friend?',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V3_SideSub2' => 'Ah, nice! You discovered another ruin! So  what about all that boiling water?

Ooh - turns out they\'re just hot springs, and the area was most likely used for baths and relaxation. That makes much more sense....',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V3_SideSub3' => 'So, you`re saying that even after thoroughly investigatingboth the ruins and the cliffside, you didn\'t find any warning signs? Remarkable.

Only some ropes, pitons and other climbing gear scattered all over the place... Aha! So it looks like this is a climbing training area! Astonishing...',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V3_Sub1' => 'You managed far better than I expected. I thought you\'d be dea...erm, exhausted by now. 
Luckily, the worst seems to be behind us. To avoid getting lost in the mountains, you should never look back - only move forward.
Oh, and I want to point out that the paintings you found while excavating the ruins clearly show beautiful women without any weird body hair...or facial hair...',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V3_Sub2' => 'That was surprising. Who\'d have thought we\'d encounter such a wild creature up here in the mountains? I wonder if the Mountain Clan ever met any of those if they supposedly live here.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Click1' => 'The elders decided to let you in, as in the end, they had no choice. Our enemies have managed to enter the city fortress, and are using abandoned mine shafts to hide and spread throughout our homeland.

I received a map from the Elders showing where the situation is the most dire. My friend, I know this is a lot to ask. But seeing your strength, we could really use your help. Please, help us reinforce our city fortress and retake our homeland!',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Click2' => 'We got far too many requests from the townspeople for us to be able to handle them all. We\'ll have to focus on what\'s most important.

The clan elders gave me another list of tasks. Looks like we´ll have our work cut out today.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Gate' => 'With this, we will hopefully be able to prevent the enemy from attacking our lands, or ambushing your generals.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Main' => 'Friend, you have averted certain disaster that could have engulfed the entire world. Now, will you help us bring the fight to Risi, and end this threat once and for all?',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Obsidian1a' => 'We didn\'t leave empty-handed, but the reserves were disappointingly low. We\'ll need to find more obsidian shards somewhere, even just to reinforce a single gate.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Obsidian1b' => 'Lucky - they found an obsidian shard already! Talk about immediate gratification!',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Obsidian2a' => 'Our food supply has been secured once again. Thank you!

As expected, it seems we can break down some of the farming tools to extract some obsidian.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Obsidian2b' => 'Can you believe it? When they started cultivating new fields, the farmers found a sizeable shard of obsidian burried beneath the earth!',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Obsidian3a' => 'Laire - that\'s her name, apparently - has expressed her gratitude for, and I quote, "clearing her yard of nuisances."

She\'s also parted with her obsidian stock, for the clan\'s sake. Apparently she might have a job for you soon.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Obsidian3b' => 'The experiment was a success! It wasn\'t exactly the most efficient way of doing it, but we got a good-sized shard out of it nonetheless.

If only we had more time to repeat the process.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Obsidian4' => 'The blacksmiths are hard at work again. They don\'t exactly look happy about it, but they know it\'s a necessity.

There is another bright side to this, however - working with obsidian produces some waste that cannot be used for smithing, but will do us nicely for reinforcing our gates.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Obsidian5' => 'Ah, how refreshing! This should last for a while.

In the meantime, our scouts have just found out what happened to the well - the jötnar must have used some sort of magic to freeze the river solid! They are truly fearsome enemies!

Ironically, they also found a shard of obsidian in the dried-up well. Someone must have dropped it in there a long time ago. I guess we should thank the giants for this dirty trick.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_ObsidianDynamiteDummy' => 'Well, well, well - what have we here! This dynamite is a specialty of the mountains. It can crack even the toughest and most frozen boulders. We don\'t have anything to use it on now, but I\'m sure we\'ll find use for it later.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_OptionalCamp' => 'Young clan members, still wet behind their ears, snuck out of the fortress to get a glimpse of our enemies. They found a hidden path through the hills, and used it to get there. Apparently, our enemies were about to discover the path too - so the young clan members threw caution to the wind to defend it on their own! They shouldn´t have risked so much, but they stalled the wild beasts long enough for us to give them a kick in the pants! If we need it, we can take this path too.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Sub1' => 'The clan appreciates your help. That alone usually wouldn\'t be enough to be admitted to the city, but the situation is desperate.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Sub2' => 'This constant back and forth must end! I hope this\'ll be the last time we have to rebuild this outpost.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Sub3' => 'The problem has been taken care of for now - but if we don\'t reinforce the gates, they\'ll just keep breaking through.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Sub4' => 'A good first step. I\'m sure this building will aid us in the battles yet to come.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Sub5' => 'We must finish reinforcing those gates, or their numbers will overwhelm us!',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Sub6' => 'Now we\'re getting somewhere! Your troops can only benefit from these buildings.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Sub7' => 'We must finish reinforcing those gates, or their numbers will overwhelm us!',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V4_Sub8' => 'What a beauty that outpost has become!',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V5_Main1' => 'Well done! We´ve come so much further than anyone has before us, and victory is within our grasp. Time to finalise our strategy for dealing with the Frost Giant. I wish you good luck from here on out!',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V5_Main2' => 'That... was... the most masterfully executed battle I´ve seen in my entire life. You accomplished what many of us have never even dared to dream of for centuries. 

I... no, ALL of us cannot thank you enough for your bravery, your effort, and dedication erasing this shadow over our lives.

We will do everything in our power to not only help you with your crisis, but repay you for your efforts with interest. 

If you ever need anything, be sure to visit again. You´re always welcome here, my friend.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V5_Sub1' => 'Good work. This Bridge will let us transport as many troops as we need. 

I wonder what kind of enemies await us on the other side?',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V5_Sub2' => 'OK, this is it! We´ve reached the point of no return. If we head any further north, we\'ll come face to face with the Frost Giant King and any remaining generals.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V5_Sub3_Main' => 'Oooooff, am I glad that beast is out of the way. Those tusks made me freeze in fear, but you didn´t even blink!',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V5_Sub4_Main' => 'That battle awakened some memories I hoped to forget. But it will never bother me again, thanks to you.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V5_Sub5_Main' => 'Miaow! I mean, goodbye devil´s cat! The news about this splendid victory will be heard by all our clan members before this day is over, and celebrated until the small hours. We are in your debt.',
        'BuffAdv_TMC_V5_Sub6_Main' => 'I\'d heard the stories about this oversized bird, but I never would have imagined its wings would beat that loud, or that the creature itself would give off such a bang when it hit the ground. Nicely done.',
        'BuffQuestAThreatMain' => 'I learned a valuable lesson today. Paranoia and distrust can make you make very bad choices. But looking on the bright side, this little "prank", and the bad experience, has earned us a powerful ally in the end! All\'s well that ends well.',
        'BuffQuestAThreat_Sub1' => 'The barricades are finished, and have been set up. We\'ve even made some makeshift watchtowers to keep an eye on things. But still... It\'s not enough!',
        'BuffQuestAThreat_Sub2' => 'Phew! We now have enough troops to defend ourselves. I feel a little better now...',
        'BuffQuestAThreat_Sub3' => 'The watchtowers have been equipped with a spyglass each. Now at least we\'ll be able to see if anything\'s coming!',
        'BuffQuestAThreat_Sub4' => 'Our guards appreciate that you care about them as much as they care about our island. Meanwhile, we checked with our newest prisoner. He\'s very confused and doesn\'t know why we arrested him. I say he must know something... His timing is too perfect! We\'ll keep him locked away until we understand what\'s happening.',
        'BuffQuestAThreat_Sub5' => 'It\'s a good thing we managed to talk it out... The little rascal we imprisoned is apparently the count\'s favorite son, and he fabricated that letter we received as a prank! Everything has been cleared up as a misunderstanding. That boy is in big trouble now. His "prank" nearly caused a war! Teenagers... I don\'t understand them.',
        'BuffQuestAThreat_Sub6' => 'When we returned from the adventure, the count asked how we\'d got on. Their general only nodded silently. Apparently this is a big deal, since the general hardly ever shows any kind of emotion or approval at all! The count enjoyed his stay on our island as a guest while you were away, and promises to return... as a friend this time.',
        'BuffQuestAnnoholicsMain' => 'Wow, what a memorable concert! And the band loved their brand-new instruments! They said they\'ll always look back fondly on their time on the island, and would be honoured to play for us some other time.',
        'BuffQuestAnnoholics_Sub1' => 'They accepted our offer! W-what? You thought I was trying to scam them by adding some shady clauses in ridiculously small print? No, no! Only bad people do that! The fine print was only to cover our backs in case something happens, that\'s all! I swear!',
        'BuffQuestAnnoholics_Sub2' => 'The stage has passed all of the safety inspections and is safely stored inside the mayor\'s house for when the Annoholics are ready to perform. Great work!',
        'BuffQuestAnnoholics_Sub3' => 'These instruments are a fine piece of work! The band is impressed and can\'t wait to try them out! They will need some rehearsal time to get used to them, though.',
        'BuffQuestAnnoholics_Sub4' => 'I\'ve started to see some new faces around town - some wearing Annoholics clothing - so our efforts seem to have paid off! It\'s almost time for the concert! I can\'t wait!',
        'BuffQuestBartMain' => 'Bart\'s visit was definitely very profitable - both for us, and for him. We\'ve obtained some nice rare materials that will certainly come in handy, and he got... well whatever junk he asked for, I guess? Maybe we should invite him again sometime? He was such a nice guy.',
        'BuffQuestBart_Sub1' => 'Bart is pleased with the deal, but I have to say... This marble statue is UGLY! Perhaps we should demolish it, and recycle the marble? Yes, I think that\'s a good idea.',
        'BuffQuestBart_Sub2' => 'It may not exactly be brass, but it seems that it\'s close enough. Bart likes this sword even more, so everyone is happy!',
        'BuffQuestBart_Sub3' => 'I feel a little jealous that Bart had the chance to eat such a succulent dinner. Ah... I\'m hungry now...',
        'BuffQuestBart_Sub4' => 'Well, this is a sturdy doorstop. In fact, maybe a little too sturdy... I\'m pretty sure we can make cheaper, reliable doorstops out of our own wood. I suggest we re-use the granite from this, and put it to work as something a bit more useful.',
        'BuffQuestBart_Sub5' => 'Bart seems to be really happy with the coins we gave him. I don\'t really get it. We only use one kind of coin as a currency after all, but he seems to firmly believe that every single one is different. Collectors are interesting people, indeed.',
        'BuffQuestGoldsmith' => 'Very interesting... He said that this coin belongs to an ancient tribe from a civilization called the "Tikki". Apparently for the Tikki people, these coins symbolize wealth and prosperity, and are considered sacred. Unfortunately, for us, it\'s little more than a piece of junk.',
        'BuffQuestLostCompassMain' => 'Well, those were some strange coins! I\'m not sure how useful they\'ll be, but at the very least, we\'ve obtained some knowledge about hidden treasures and legends from the past. And you know what they say - knowledge is the most precious of treasures!
In future, let\'s hope we find a pirate treasure that can pay the bills, though.',
        'BuffQuestLostCompass_Sub1' => 'The researcher has found a similarity in the design of the compass and an old pirate legend from the past. He\'s very grateful to us for letting him study such an interesting artefact.',
        'BuffQuestLostCompass_Sub2' => 'Nothing around here, apparently... It\'s strange. Although the compass has very slightly shifted directions, it seems to always be pointing... East?',
        'BuffQuestLostCompass_Sub3' => 'While fighting the bandits, we managed to find the chest the compass was pointing to! It seems heavy, and we don\'t have a key to open it, but at least we can take it home and decide what to do with it there.',
        'BuffQuestLostCompass_Sub4' => 'The locksmith arrived in a bit of a hurry. The chest is open! Let\'s go check it out!',
        'BuffQuestMirandaMain' => 'Jonas is really grateful for all the help we\'ve given him. He says that he owes us his life, and therefore would like to spend it here, with us. He\'s going to go pick up Miranda and settle down here. How great is that?',
        'BuffQuestMiranda_Sub1' => 'The pigeon has flown the nest. Now let\'s hope it uses its training to take the letter to the right man.',
        'BuffQuestMiranda_Sub2' => 'Our generals report that they found Jonas on the adventure. He\'s not looking good.',
        'BuffQuestMiranda_Sub3' => 'Jonas is starting to look better. What did I tell you? My grandma knows a lot about medicines and remedies! A special vitamin boost is exactly what this man needed!',
        'BuffQuestMysteriousCoin' => 'Who would have thought that a little coin could be so important? It\'s clear that we have a lot to learn from other cultures, and a lot of friends to make. The merchant who initially gave me the coin could hardly believe our story. You should have seen his face!',
        'BuffQuestNewStone' => 'You can keep the stone in your memories, but it definitely has no value!',
        'BuffQuestNewStone_Sub1' => 'Ohhhhh, that\'s so much better. Now you can see everything. It\'s so beautiful! It must be a special stone!',
        'BuffQuestNewStone_Sub2' => 'The experts need some more time. Let\'s do something meaningful while we wait.',
        'BuffQuestNewStone_Sub3' => 'Well, we didn\'t find anything - but at least we\'re prepared if someone tries to steal the stone!',
        'BuffQuestNewStone_Sub4' => 'Great! You protected the stone! Let\'s go back to the smelters and see what the experts have learnt.',
        'BuffQuestNewStone_Sub5' => 'You should be proud of yourself. You went through so many things for that precious stone . It\'s red and shiny. It could be a ruby! But it\'s  not. In fact, it has no value on your island.',
        'BuffQuestSaveTheDeers' => 'That should be it! Now all that\'s left is to wait for the upcoming breeding season, and everything should be back to normal!

It\'s always important to keep nature in mind!',
        'BuffQuestSaveTheDeers_Sub1' => 'The hunters have been very helpful, and have delivered a full list of the current deer population on your island.',
        'BuffQuestSaveTheDeers_Sub2' => 'The hunters could help you track the number of wolves, but it wouldn\'t help solve the problem of your deer.',
        'BuffQuestSaveTheDeers_Sub3' => 'Turns out the foresters had all been wondering what was affecting the deer themselves. None were sure what could be behind the situation, but they each promised that they\'ve always been careful to leave the animal\'s normal habitat untouched.',
        'BuffQuestSaveTheDeers_Sub4' => 'Everyone\'s very happy for your help, but we\'re still no closer to solving the problem. Let\'s continue with the research.',
        'BuffQuestSaveTheDeers_Sub5' => 'Your bowmen managed to chase the strangers away. Congratulations! It seems they were the cause of all our deer problems.',
        'BuffQuestSaveTheDeers_Sub6' => 'The hunters appreciate your help, and have promised to keep an eye on the population to keep nature in balance.',
        'BuffQuestSettlersBanditsMain' => 'I can\'t believe that Settlers & Bandits is so popular! I hope this serves as a good way to encourage people to use their imagination more, and more importantly to have fun with it!',
        'BuffQuestSettlersBandits_Sub1' => 'You know, I think we could have something fun here. In fact, I\'m starting to think a lot of people might be interested in this! Are you thinking what I\'m thinking?',
        'BuffQuestSettlersBandits_Sub2' => 'It\'s catching on! People are talking about it, and they host regular sessions to play! They\'re even planning complex stories, and deep character bios. I could have never imagined my childhood hobby would have this many people interested!',
        'BuffQuestSettlersBandits_Sub3' => 'The first print of the "Settlers and Bandits" rulebook has been distributed, and I\'m starting to see small groups playing! "Settlers and Bandits" is the name I came up with for the game. It may not be very original, but I think it\'s catchy. Don\'t you agree?',
        'BuffQuestSharpClawMain' => 'Bah, it was nothing more than a conveniently shaped rock! The geologist must have been seeing things, with the darkness and everything. Actually, looking a bit more closely, this "claw" could be nothing more than a sharp, oddly-coloured mineral. There\'s probably no beast to worry about after all. Strange, how our minds can play tricks on us like that, eh?',
        'BuffQuestSharpClaw_Sub1' => 'The explorers have not been able to find anything. Neither the beast itself, nor any evidence of its existence. Perhaps it\'s a docile beast? No, what am I saying... This claw is not from a docile creature!',
        'BuffQuestSharpClaw_Sub2' => 'The geologists have returned. One of them is as white as a sheet, and stammers that he saw a huge gray monster underground. Upon hearing its massive roar, he ran away as fast as he could. This doesn\'t look good, my lord. We have to do something to protect our people!',
        'BuffQuestSharpClaw_Sub3' => 'Yes, this looks good. It can probably hold a bear. Or two. Or Fifty! It\'s very sturdy!',
        'BuffQuestSharpClaw_Sub4' => 'The men braved the cave, but upon reaching the place the geologist described, they only found an odd formation of rocks. As for the roar? Apparently one of the caves below caved in, which may have sounded like a roar to him. The poor guy was in the right place, at the wrong time.',
        'BuffQuestSilkCatMain' => 'The poor thing doesn\'t look happy at the prospect of going back to its loudmouth of a master. I cannot say I blame it.                
Hey, how\'s this for a suggestion. As you found the cat so quickly, I doubt our noble friends will be expecting results quite this soon. Why not let it enjoy some peace and quiet on the Excelsior? I’ll return it to von Peahead in a few weeks.',
        'BuffQuestSilkCat_Sub1' => 'Here they come. Let’s see what they have to say for themselves.',
        'BuffQuestSilkCat_Sub2' => 'I found prints! But they\'re not what I expected…',
        'BuffQuestSilkCat_Sub3' => 'The fishmongers reported spotting an ivory cat sneaking about the area. Looks like we\'re in the right place.',
        'BuffQuestSilkCat_Sub4' => 'You’ve got the little guy! Nice catch!',
        'BuffQuestStrangeIdolsMain' => 'I sometimes regret having sold that little idol. What if instead of a cheap knock-off, it was an actual piece of culture from an ancient civilization? What if that civilization were simply known for being scammers and liars? Aaah, too many questions. My head hurts. I\'m going to take a nap.',
        'BuffQuestStrangeIdols_Sub1' => 'The scholars have come back with the results of their research, and the results are... inconclusive. They don\'t seem to be able to figure out what it\'s made of!',
        'BuffQuestStrangeIdols_Sub2' => 'One of our allies recognized the idol. The idol represents a deity that some ancient civilization worshipped. Rumour has it, this civilization was so wealthy, they made everything out of pure gold!',
        'BuffQuestStrangeIdols_Sub3' => 'Well, our scholars are convinced that if the idol had been made of gold, they would have known. So their best guess is that this civilization did not actually have stuff made of pure gold - they simply made it look like it instead! A fake!',
        'BuffQuestStrangeIdols_Sub4' => 'Our tradesmen definitely have some interest in the idol. However, due to its special nature, we can\'t just offer it to anyone. Fortunately, I got contacted by a potential buyer that\'s offering a nice price for it!',
        'BuffQuestTheJourney' => 'This should be enough. The exotic planks will make for a very robust mainframe that should endure the worst weather conditions while at sea. We\'re ready to go save the Tikki tribe!',
        'BuffQuestTheLittlePanda' => 'I just received the report confirming that the panda has made it home safely. I miss him already... Do you think we can have one of our own? I\'m kidding, of course!',
        'BuffQuestThePandaCub' => 'It\'s working! He seems to be a lot calmer when you\'re feeding him. What a relief... I was worried he might not make it if he kept refusing to eat or drink!',
        'BuffQuestTikkiIsland' => '"Live and let live" is what my grandpa used to say. Those bandits will think twice before messing with a pacific civilization such as the Tikkis once again. The grateful Tikki people are chanting your name, and want to reward you with an important part of their culture. We should place it somewhere on our home island, so we always remember this day!',
        'BuffQuestTravelCage' => 'This cage will do nicely. It\'s so big, sturdy and comfortable that I\'m thinking of ordering one to live in myself! The ship has departed, and all going well, mother and son will be back together very soon.',
        'BuffQuestVigilanteMain' => 'Unfortunately, the Custodian does not feel to be ready to become a general as of now. She hasn\'t completely written off becoming one in future, however, and she\'s convinced that someone else would take the Custodian mantle. We\'ll let her continue her vigilantism for now. At least she\'s following our regulations now.',
        'BuffQuestVigilante_Sub1' => 'Strange. Nobody reacted when the generals yelled the name. In fact, I could have sworn that some of them even laughed. This can only mean one thing: "The Custodian" is one of our very own settlers.',
        'BuffQuestVigilante_Sub2' => 'Oh wow, that definitely looked ugly. I think our actor may have broken a couple of ribs! Now with the incident clarified, perhaps the Custodian will listen to us. I never expected a lady to be so... brutal.',
        'BuffQuestVigilante_Sub3' => 'Well look at those results! She passed with flying colours! At least now that we\'ve spoken to her about what she\'s been doing, she understands that criminals, although they are criminals, are people too.',
        'BuffQuestVigilante_Sub4' => 'It took a bit of effort, but she managed to pass the test. Granted, this is not a test that an unprepared person should be able to easily pass, so given the short length of time she took, this makes it all the more impressive.',
        'BuffQuestVigilante_Sub5' => 'The generals are praising her left and right. They say that she even devised a cunning strategy to win a battle without suffering any losses of our troops! They say she would make a fine general, and want to offer her a place in their ranks.',
        'BuffQuestWeddingCake' => 'This is the most magnificent cake I\'ve ever seen. I\'m sure the king and his guests will be over the moon. Do you think they\'d notice if I had just a small slice now?',
        'BuffQuestWeddingInvitation' => 'What a wonderful ceremony! Oh, don\'t worry about me. I always cry at weddings... The king appreciates our efforts, though, and has insisted on compensating us. We\'ve reinforced a strong alliance today.',
        'BuffQuestWeddingStory1_A' => 'I swear this story is real.
And there are plenty more to tell.',
        'BuffQuestWeddingStory1_B' => 'In the end, the ring was never found, and another was ordered in its stead.
Yet the jewelcrafter lacked the needed metals, and so the groom and his companions took up spade and pick to wrest the materials from the earth themselves.',
        'BuffQuestWeddingStory1_C' => 'Then, to the wonder of all, the hound came forth and laid the lost ring at the bride’s feet, and thus the riches drawn from the deep were kept, a quiet favor granted by fate.',
        'BuffQuestWeddingStory2_A' => 'I swear this story is real.
And there are plenty more to tell.',
        'BuffQuestWeddingStory2_B' => 'Thus, the order was given: first, the cloth must be gathered, then the trees set into the earth, so that all might be twisted together in proper fashion.',
        'BuffQuestWeddingStory2_C' => 'Only afterward did it dawn on everyone that newly planted saplings bear no branches fit for weaving at all. 
But by then the trees were rooted, the cloth unused, and the bride entirely satisfied with how it would look someday.',
        'BuffQuestWeddingStory3_A' => 'I swear this story is real.
And there are plenty more to tell.',
        'BuffQuestWeddingStory3_B' => 'The gatherers were sent into the field and meadow with firm instructions, yet returned bearing armfuls of sunflowers.',
        'BuffQuestWeddingStory3_C' => 'Thus, the flowers were put to better use.
Their seeds were pressed for oil, and the proper bouquets were made anew.',
        'BuffQuestWolfPuppy' => 'Turns out the little pup and the girl have grown more than a little bit attached. The pup wouldn\'t be able to survive in the wilderness alone. I guess he\'ll make a great companion for the girl!',
        'BuffQuestWolfPuppy_Sub1' => 'Slowly, the puppy is getting there. The fireplace provides enough heat to warm the little guy up.',
        'BuffQuestWolfPuppy_Sub2' => 'It was a good idea to clean the wounds and bandage them. The little pup only needs to rest now.',
        'BuffQuestWolfPuppy_Sub3' => 'What a relief! The pup\'s healing up, and it can already walk again. It\'s certainly a cute little guy - and it looks like he likes you and the little girl.',
        'BuffQuestWolfPuppy_Sub4' => 'We couldn\'t find a wolf pack that had puppies, or a mother wolf who\'s searching for her child. So where did he come from?',
        'BuffQuestWolfPuppy_Sub5' => 'The girl is holding the pup tight, and the pup is not willing to leave her.',
        'Buff_Adv_StormRecovery_MainQuest' => 'The villagers are very happy, and incredibly grateful to you. Those who are gathered approach you with a present to show their gratitude.',
        'Buff_Adv_StormRecovery_SubQuest01' => 'Look at how nicely the wheat is growing. The villagers are very happy, and some of the kids have been watching the crops grow all day.',
        'Buff_Adv_StormRecovery_SubQuest02' => 'That\'s the boulders out of the way - now we can use the area to start building up the village.',
        'Buff_Adv_StormRecovery_SubQuest03' => 'The last potion just arrived, and everything is ready to start the cleansing.',
        'Buff_Adv_StormRecovery_SubQuest04' => 'Good work with clearing up the ruins.',
        'Buff_Adv_StormRecovery_SubQuest05' => 'The villagers are admiring the new buildings. They say they\'re even better than before.',
        'Buff_Adv_StormRecovery_SubQuest06' => 'The villagers are admiring the new buildings. They say they\'re even better than before.',
        'BuiBonus_AuroraTower_Repeatable' => 'Nothing like an inspirational story to light fire in young hearts.',
        'BuiBonus_AuroraTower_Timer_Loop1026' => 'Nothing like an inspirational story to light fire in young hearts.',
        'BuiBonus_AuroraTower_Timer_Loop1080' => 'Nothing like an inspirational story to light fire in young hearts.',
        'BuiBonus_AuroraTower_Timer_Loop864' => 'Nothing like an inspirational story to light fire in young hearts.',
        'BuiBonus_AuroraTower_Timer_Loop918' => 'Nothing like an inspirational story to light fire in young hearts.',
        'BuiBonus_AuroraTower_Timer_Loop972' => 'Nothing like an inspirational story to light fire in young hearts.',
        'BuiBonus_BalloonMarket_miniStart' => 'Yes! You got it! You just got a random balloon buff from this beautiful Balloon Market Tribute. Come back in a week to get another balloon buff.',
        'BuiBonus_BalloonMarket_mini_Timer' => 'Perfect timing! The Balloon Creator just finished a new balloon creation. Go to your Balloon Market Tribute and check out your star menu afterwards.',
        'BuiBonus_BalloonMarket_mini_Timer_Loop' => 'Perfect timing! The Balloon Creator just finished a new balloon creation. Go to your Balloon Market Tribute and check out your star menu afterwards.',
        'BuiBonus_Depositorium_Start' => 'Wonderful! Now close this window, and your find will be placed into the Star Menu. And don\'t forget, if you don\'t collect the box discovered on the tour, no new tour will start, and no new findings can be made. So make sure to take the tour every few days!',
        'BuiBonus_Depositorium_Timer' => 'The time has come to take the Depositorium tour. Just click on the building and see what you will discover! And don\'t forget to check your Star Menu afterwards!',
        'BuiBonus_Depositorium_Timer_Loop' => 'The time has come to take the Depositorium tour. Just click on the building and see what you will discover! And don\'t forget to check your Star Menu afterwards!',
        'BuiBonus_DimensionalRift_Start' => 'Oh dear!

We should nail that window down quickly with planks or something.',
        'BuiBonus_FluffyLogistics_Loop' => 'All eggs are accounted for...
Good time to get out of this outfit and relax.',
        'BuiBonus_FlyingHouse_Start' => 'Nice! You can close the quest window now, and you should be able to retrieve your find via the star menu. Remember to talk to the lookout, otherwise they\'ll stop searching for more nice things!',
        'BuiBonus_FlyingHouse_Timer' => 'Hey, check it out - your lookouts have again found something! Curious what it might be? Then go visit your lookout and check your star menu afterwards!',
        'BuiBonus_FlyingHouse_Timer_Loop' => 'Hey, check it out - your lookouts have again found something! Curious what it might be? Then go visit your lookout and check your star menu afterwards!',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_Timer' => 'Time\'s up, and the Flying Ghostman returns for our weekly visit home! To wash our sheets and so on... Whoooooo-hoo!',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_Timer_Loop' => 'Time\'s up, and the Flying Ghostman returns for our weekly visit home! To wash our sheets and so on... Whoooooo-hoo!',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest1' => 'Such a shame. Someone mistook these wisps for tiny ghosts. That\'s so super-natural-ficial. Typical of those pirates who gave us the false intel.',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest10' => 'And? Did it work? Keep on finding friends in any case, though - you never know when you might need them! Or when they\'ll need you... Or when you might need each other... Or... Ah, you kno-whooo-w what I mean.',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest11' => 'Half the load went straight through the hulk. Let\'s hope we didn\'t scare the fishes. Sigh.',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest12' => 'Oh, this is so much fun! What are we doing, you ask? Riding horses around the island! At night, of course - that way it\'s more fun, and no-one can see us. There aren\'t that many fun activities for ghosts, you know...
Oh, some people saw us and got scared? Oh, I see. Okay - we\'ll only do it for one more night, whooooo-ho-ho.',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest13' => 'Apologies - looks like we didn\'t think this one through. First, we couldn\'t find the island again and traveled seemingly forever - even though our ship flies faster than birds - then we lost most of the cargo in a storm! We might have to go back with some more later. But the people were very thankful for what they got - they couldn\'t believe their eyes when coal started "flying" into their warehouse!',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest14' => 'It whooooooo-rked! Our ghost blades are shinier than ever, see? Oh, you can\'t see them, huh? But you could feel it if I just sliced you a bit... May I? OK, OK - apologies, I didn\'t mean it like that. I just thought someone like you, who produces so many weapons each day, would cherish such a result - no offense intended!',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest15' => 'So many people freed, so many soldiers, traders and travellers returned home. So many joyful tears from families and friends. You can rest easy today my friend, for you have done a very good deed!',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest16' => 'Oh, how magnificent is the glow from below. The sun\'s rays, split by the water\'s surface, reflect off the marble reef and dance like little rainbows along the ship\'s side. Go take a look yourself!',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest17' => 'As good as new! Well, I guess it\'s more like if the Flying Ghostman was destroyed only yesterday. Ah, I\'ll never get used to this. Even after hundreds of years, I still stumble over my own words... Maybe it\'ll impr-whooooo-ve now I\'m able to talk to living people more often.',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest18' => 'So. Much. Better. Whoooooo-hoo!
Sorry for the scares we gave some of your settlers when we flew away, though.',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest19' => 'Hah! Thanks to you, we were able to beat the sheets out of those pillows! They\'ll be back for sure, but we showed them for now!',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest2' => 'Whoooooo-ray! It worked! Their pride seems to have taken a bit of a hit, and now the crew is eager to show the living how it\'s done. They even use phrases like "Thank you my fellow perished one" and "Apologies my immortal fellow".',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest20' => 'Sometimes when I wake up at night, I can still hear the quacks. Only kidding - I don\'t sleep!',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest21' => 'The men you sent fulfilled their task meticulously, and even got rewarded with medals by the mayor, who asked them to stay and continue their efforts. All of them agreed, and many even plan to build their own homes over there. One man\'s even got married already! Can you believe that? Me neither... But I wish the couple all the best.',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest22' => 'Your men fulfilled their orders to the word. Congrats!
I think it wouldn\'t have mattered what you told your men - the Duke is pleased enough that you provided the riders.',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest23' => 'It\'s raining... arrows. OK, we probably should have seen this coming. But at least the drought has also been watered down. Better get some whooooo-den umbrellas!',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest24' => 'Your men did wonderfully! They even improved on the few issues I picked up on! The men, and the audience, have asked if they can create a permanent show to lighten everyone\'s mood. You don\'t oppose, do you? Well, I already told them it\'ll be fine so... whoooo-hoo.',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest25' => 'OK, so now the troops are taking some of the brew as payment for their work, but I guess that\'s better than it being stolen! At least they\'re taking less than the thieves would - and your tradesmens\' mood has improved drastically.',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest26' => 'Oh, those spots you mentioned are perfect! I think we\'ll check them all out one by one. My crew is already looking forward to it, and they\'ve got their vacation clothes on already... Well, they would have if they could wear clothes, anyway.',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest3' => 'Isn\'t he the cutest ghost dog you\'ve ever seen? Did he behave, or did he just howl away at your enemies?
Oh yeah! I\'ve just this second realized I forgot to give you some ghost bags for the ghostly doggy-doo. Ah, just kidding - we don\'t eat anymore, so there\'s nothing coming out of us. Except for this ghostly goo of course... Ho-ho-whoooooo.',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest4' => 'Oh, that was fun. And the enemies you chose were awesome! We avoided the dragon, but the huge slime blobs were very entertaining. And that underground caves we discovered - just amazing. Wait... What do you mean those weren\'t the evildoers you meant? That wasn\'t even the island you chose for us? Where have we been then?!',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest5' => 'The notes vanished with a glow you say? Ah, that\'s go-whooooo-od to hear. The mother seems to have had stayed on the bright side of life. But I bet she wasn\'t the only one who had such a dream. We\'ll let you know if we encounter more.',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest6' => 'What a coincidence! I would never have believed it if I hadn\'t seen it with my own eyes. I mean, if I hadn\'t had seen it with my... ghost eye-holes? Ah, whatever.
Who\'d have thought you\'d find the woman taken prisoner by the bandits still unharmed?
It\'s moments like this that make us cling on to this world - and that make the heavens let us stay, I assume. I\'d forgotten that even us gho-whooooo-sts can still cry - in a way.
What did you say to the family when they asked how you knew about their tragedy? A little bird told you about it?',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest7' => 'Oh, these lands are the best we\'ve conquered in a long while! Thanks for the tip! Here, take this as reward!',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest8' => 'Oh, so you found the place? And? What did you find, don\'t keep us on tenterhooks!
Oh, what? Seriously, toys?!?
Oh, and a picture of a girl. I can just about make out what it says on the back... "I\'ll bury our childhood mementos, so someday maybe they\'ll make someone else as happy as us. I\'ll love you until the end of days."',
        'BuiBonus_GhostLantern_WeeklyQuest9' => 'I only said I \'might\' tell you the answer... And no, the answer isn\'t chicken. Now I\'m hungry. This is terrible! Do you know how painful it is to be hungry but unable to eat? This is going to bug me for years again!',
        'BuiBonus_GiftChristmasTree_Start' => 'Great! Now close the quest window, and your gift box will be placed into your Star Menu. Just remember that if no-one grabs the gift from under the tree, no new gift will appear! Make sure you come by once a week to collect your gift(s)!',
        'BuiBonus_GiftChristmasTree_Timer' => 'The time has come to fetch your gift. Click on a Gift Christmas Tree and check your Star Menu afterwards!',
        'BuiBonus_GiftChristmasTree_Timer_Loop' => 'The time has come to fetch your gift. Click on a Gift Christmas Tree and check your Star Menu afterwards!',
        'BuiBonus_GiftGhostShip_Start' => 'Thanks for visiting! I hope my crew hasn\'t scared you too much... Has that tress in your hair always been such a pale white? Ha-whooooo, I\'m just kidding.
We\'ll return regularly, and we\'ll try to be on time every week. But you know, there\'s nothing like ghostly punctuality whooo-ho-hoo.',
        'BuiBonus_HauntedMansion_Start' => 'Oh my... Turns out the rumours were true - the mansion was haunted! You disturbed the ghosts, and now they\'re all over the place! At least they seem friendly enough...',
        'BuiBonus_Offshorelighthouse_Start' => 'Make sure to visit him every day so you do not miss out on his bounty.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Bronze_02' => 'Look at the shine upon those ingots.
A simple improvement, perhaps, yet proof that refinement itself may be refined.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Bronze_03' => 'Excellent work, Major.
The copper now pours like water from the furnace, and the workers produce twice the ingots with much less effort.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Gold_01' => 'Beautiful.
The gold gleams bright enough to mirror candlelight itself.
Traders who once mocked our refinery now seek contracts with eager hands.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Gold_02' => 'Splendid work.
Losses have fallen sharply, and the purity of each gold bar surpasses anything we have produced before.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Gold_03' => 'The refinery now produces gold with both speed and precision unimaginable only a few seasons ago.
What once stood as smoke and scaffolding has become the beating heart of this town\'s prosperity.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Iron_01' => 'Durable and fit for arms and armor rather than simple farm tools. The town guard already boasts that their next blades shall be forged from refinery iron.
Your investment begins to reshape this town\'s strength itself.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Iron_02' => 'The flames burn hotter and steadier than ever before.
Iron production has become predictable rather than perilous.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Iron_03' => 'The refinery wastes almost nothing now. Iron flows steadily from even poor-quality ore, and our stores grow faster than ever before.
This is no longer mere experimentation, Major. This is mastery.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Platinum_01' => 'The platinum shines with a pale brilliance unlike gold or silver. Even in small quantities, its value rivals entire wagonloads of lesser metals.
The refinery has reached heights once thought impossible.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Platinum_02' => 'The refinery now handles platinum with remarkable consistency, producing bars of astonishing purity.
Word of our achievements spreads far beyond neighboring lands.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Platinum_03' => 'At last... perfection.
The fires burn clean. The machinery answers without fault. Not a fragment of ore nor a spark of fuel is wasted.
What began as scattered scrolls and uncertain theory has become the greatest refinery these lands have ever known.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Titanium_01' => 'The titanium emerged lighter than iron, yet stronger than steel. Even the master smiths could scarcely believe what they held.
We stand upon the edge of a new age of craftsmanship.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Titanium_02' => 'Where once the machinery buckled beneath the strain, it now operates with surprising stability.
The workers speak of the refinery with awe, as though it were some great mechanical beast brought under your command.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Titanium_03' => 'Titanium refinement now proceeds with efficiency few would dare imagine possible.
The town has become a marvel of industry.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Unlock_01' => 'Remarkable... these markings, these diagrams...
We shall need stone foundations, great vats, bellows, pipes, and enough hands to raise such a structure.
Let us begin the construction before doubt settles in their hearts.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Unlock_02' => 'Ha! Hear that rumble? That is the sound of progress itself. Yet the furnace burns weak.
Whatever powers these grand refineries in foreign lands, common firewood alone shall not suffice.
We have built the beast, Major. Now we must learn how to feed it.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Unlock_03' => 'So this is the substance... dense, bitter-smelling, yet it burns hotter than seasoned oak ever could.
These mechanisms were never meant for ordinary flame, nor crude substitutes. The refinery was designed around fuels and methods we do not yet fully understand.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Unlock_04' => 'Extraordinary. The furnaces burn steadier. The yield improves.
And still, I suspect we stand only at the threshold of true industry.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Upgrades_01' => 'Remarkable. The grinders turn true, the crucibles hold, and the smoke rises proudly above the rooftops.
For a fleeting moment, I dared believe we had mastered the craft entirely.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Upgrades_02' => 'There was a time when this town knew only smoke from humble smithies and the ring of worn hammers.
Now behold it. Great furnaces thunder day and night.',
        'BuiBonus_OreRefinery_Upgrades_03' => 'Scholars, merchants, and smiths alike journey here simply to witness the refinery in operation.

The refinery stands as a monument to ambition, knowledge, and relentless progress.
The people shall remember this achievement long after we are gone.
Not merely a refinery.
A legacy.',
        'BuiBonus_Smokehouse_MiniStart' => 'Excellent! You received a Smoked Fish Steak from the Smokehouse Tribute. Come back in a day to collect another one.',
        'BuiBonus_WitchCovenUpgrade_Start' => 'Who... Who goes there?! 

Leave us alone! We’re busy here.

Come back when you have something meaningful to say or trade.',
        'BuiBonus_WitchCovenUpgrade_Upgrade1' => 'Ah, yes. These will do nicely.

Lots of new recipes and conjurations.

Stop by our coven whenever you’re in need of our services.

We would gladly provide aid... For a price...',
        'BuiBonus_WitchCovenUpgrade_Upgrade2' => 'Bwahaha! My sisters will make good use of these.

Visit our coven when you are ready to harvest the rewards of your work.',
        'BuiBonus_WitchCoven_CancelBLoodustA' => 'Always a pleasure doing business with you, Mayor... Bwahahaha',
        'BuiBonus_WitchCoven_CancelBLoodustB' => 'Always a pleasure doing business with you, Mayor... Bwahahaha',
        'BuiBonus_WitchCoven_CancelRisenArmyA' => 'Always a pleasure doing business with you, Mayor... Bwahahaha',
        'BuiBonus_WitchCoven_CancelRisenArmyB' => 'Always a pleasure doing business with you, Mayor... Bwahahaha',
        'BuiBonus_WitchCoven_PageReward_Repeatable' => 'Always a pleasure doing business with you...',
        'CQ1M1_FourWinds_Tcl1' => 'It\'s over! We survived the storm! This crisis really shook everyone up. I think our people will need quite a bit of time to recover. Nevertheless, you did a great job averting disaster. King Damien is sure to be very grateful!',
        'CQ1M1_FourWinds_Tcl2' => 'It\'s over! We survived the storm! This crisis really shook everyone up. I think our people will need quite a bit of time to recover. Nevertheless, you did a great job averting disaster. King Damien is sure to be very grateful!',
        'CQ1M1_FourWinds_Tcl3' => 'It\'s over! We survived the storm! This crisis really shook everyone up. I think our people will need quite a bit of time to recover. Nevertheless, you did a great job averting disaster. King Damien is sure to be very grateful!',
        'CQ1M1_FourWinds_Tcl4' => 'It\'s over! We survived the storm! This crisis really shook everyone up. I think our people will need quite a bit of time to recover. Nevertheless, you did a great job averting disaster. King Damien is sure to be very grateful!',
        'CQ1M1_FourWinds_Tcl5' => 'It\'s over! We survived the storm! This crisis really shook everyone up. I think our people will need quite a bit of time to recover. Nevertheless, you did a great job averting disaster. King Damien is sure to be very grateful!',
        'CQ2M1_TheFallenArmy_Tcl2' => 'What an achievement, what a crusade! We\'ve finally managed to expel the clan lords from Dust Hold, leaving their marauding hordes leaderless and easy to disperse. The valiant Ewanian Pioneers finally get to return home, and with them our own beloved soldiers. We can finally say we have brought peace to the troubled lands of Randomar, and in the process, also uprooted a tribe of conspiring bandits! What a well deserved victory!',
        'CQ2M1_TheFallenArmy_Tcl3' => 'What an achievement, what a crusade! We\'ve finally managed to expel the clan lords from Dust Hold, leaving their marauding hordes leaderless and easy to disperse. The valiant Ewanian Pioneers finally get to return home, and with them our own beloved soldiers. We can finally say we have brought peace to the troubled lands of Randomar, and in the process, also uprooted a tribe of conspiring bandits! What a well deserved victory!',
        'CQ2M1_TheFallenArmy_Tcl4' => 'What an achievement, what a crusade! We\'ve finally managed to expel the clan lords from Dust Hold, leaving their marauding hordes leaderless and easy to disperse. The valiant Ewanian Pioneers finally get to return home, and with them our own beloved soldiers. We can finally say we have brought peace to the troubled lands of Randomar, and in the process, also uprooted a tribe of conspiring bandits! What a well deserved victory!',
        'CQ2M1_TheFallenArmy_Tcl5' => 'What an achievement, what a crusade! We\'ve finally managed to expel the clan lords from Dust Hold, leaving their marauding hordes leaderless and easy to disperse. The valiant Ewanian Pioneers finally get to return home, and with them our own beloved soldiers. We can finally say we have brought peace to the troubled lands of Randomar, and in the process, also uprooted a tribe of conspiring bandits! What a well deserved victory!',
        'CQ2S10_Revelation_Tcl2' => 'The King is pleased. Not only did our support turn the tide of battle in his and our favor, but we also took care of a threat that might have jeopardized this entire operation. The King shall not forget.',
        'CQ2S10_Revelation_Tcl3' => 'The King is pleased. Not only did our support turn the tide of battle in his and our favor, but we also took care of a threat that might have jeopardized this entire operation. The King shall not forget.',
        'CQ2S10_Revelation_Tcl4' => 'The King is pleased. Not only did our support turn the tide of battle in his and our favor, but we also took care of a threat that might have jeopardized this entire operation. The King shall not forget.',
        'CQ2S10_Revelation_Tcl5' => 'The King is pleased. Not only did our support turn the tide of battle in his and our favor, but we also took care of a threat that might have jeopardized this entire operation. The King shall not forget.',
        'CQ2S1_Reconstitution_Tcl2' => 'This will be of great aid to the Pioneers, and it has earned us the King\'s gratitude and respect. Not a bad move at all!',
        'CQ2S1_Reconstitution_Tcl3' => 'This will be of great aid to the Pioneers, and it has earned us the King\'s gratitude and respect. Not a bad move at all!',
        'CQ2S1_Reconstitution_Tcl4' => 'This will be of great aid to the Pioneers, and it has earned us the King\'s gratitude and respect. Not a bad move at all!',
        'CQ2S1_Reconstitution_Tcl5' => 'This will be of great aid to the Pioneers, and it has earned us the King\'s gratitude and respect. Not a bad move at all!',
        'CQ2S2_Recovery_Tcl2' => 'All those great treasures and artefacts we recovered - what a relief to find so many of them back in our possession. I think we also did well to give that loot up and let the rightful owners reclaim it eventually. Well done.',
        'CQ2S2_Recovery_Tcl3' => 'All those great treasures and artefacts we recovered - what a relief to find so many of them back in our possession. I think we also did well to give that loot up and let the rightful owners reclaim it eventually. Well done.',
        'CQ2S2_Recovery_Tcl4' => 'All those great treasures and artefacts we recovered - what a relief to find so many of them back in our possession. I think we also did well to give that loot up and let the rightful owners reclaim it eventually. Well done.',
        'CQ2S2_Recovery_Tcl5' => 'All those great treasures and artefacts we recovered - what a relief to find so many of them back in our possession. I think we also did well to give that loot up and let the rightful owners reclaim it eventually. Well done.',
        'CQ2S3_Sharing_Tcl2' => 'I think we calmed the situation the best we could in light of the situation, and our Pioneers have finally got some rest. We might actually have made some friends around here. I\'m glad you agreed to play along with this.',
        'CQ2S3_Sharing_Tcl3' => 'I think we calmed the situation the best we could in light of the situation, and our Pioneers have finally got some rest. We might actually have made some friends around here. I\'m glad you agreed to play along with this.',
        'CQ2S3_Sharing_Tcl4' => 'I think we calmed the situation the best we could in light of the situation, and our Pioneers have finally got some rest. We might actually have made some friends around here. I\'m glad you agreed to play along with this.',
        'CQ2S3_Sharing_Tcl5' => 'I think we calmed the situation the best we could in light of the situation, and our Pioneers have finally got some rest. We might actually have made some friends around here. I\'m glad you agreed to play along with this.',
        'CQ2S4_Elitist_Tcl2' => 'Impressive, we\'ve found some truly gifted leaders and incredibly disciplined, hard-boiled squads among our troops. The King and his Generals will be more than impressed when they come to inspect them.',
        'CQ2S4_Elitist_Tcl3' => 'Impressive, we\'ve found some truly gifted leaders and incredibly disciplined, hard-boiled squads among our troops. The King and his Generals will be more than impressed when they come to inspect them.',
        'CQ2S4_Elitist_Tcl4' => 'Impressive, we\'ve found some truly gifted leaders and incredibly disciplined, hard-boiled squads among our troops. The King and his Generals will be more than impressed when they come to inspect them.',
        'CQ2S4_Elitist_Tcl5' => 'Impressive, we\'ve found some truly gifted leaders and incredibly disciplined, hard-boiled squads among our troops. The King and his Generals will be more than impressed when they come to inspect them.',
        'CQ2S5_Equipment_Tcl2' => 'It never fails to amaze me, seeing this settlement at work - all the bustling and scurrying. Despite the seemingly chaotic activity, the results are always works of great craftsmanship. It must take a genius to choreograph all this!',
        'CQ2S5_Equipment_Tcl3' => 'It never fails to amaze me, seeing this settlement at work - all the bustling and scurrying. Despite the seemingly chaotic activity, the results are always works of great craftsmanship. It must take a genius to choreograph all this!',
        'CQ2S5_Equipment_Tcl4' => 'It never fails to amaze me, seeing this settlement at work - all the bustling and scurrying. Despite the seemingly chaotic activity, the results are always works of great craftsmanship. It must take a genius to choreograph all this!',
        'CQ2S5_Equipment_Tcl5' => 'It never fails to amaze me, seeing this settlement at work - all the bustling and scurrying. Despite the seemingly chaotic activity, the results are always works of great craftsmanship. It must take a genius to choreograph all this!',
        'CQ2S6_StandingArmy_Tcl2' => 'This should do. The King\'s Advisor has announced their interest, so we shall know soon enough whether our preparations meet the King\'s demands (although I\'m more than confident they do).',
        'CQ2S6_StandingArmy_Tcl3' => 'This should do. The King\'s Advisor has announced their interest, so we shall know soon enough whether our preparations meet the King\'s demands (although I\'m more than confident they do).',
