        'CQ2S7_Scheming_Tcl2' => 'That was unexpected. It felt like an unusually coordinated effort from their side - how bizarre. We should keep an eye out for further bandit activity.',
        'CQ2S7_Scheming_Tcl3' => 'That was unexpected. It felt like an unusually coordinated effort from their side - how bizarre. We should keep an eye out for further bandit activity.',
        'CQ2S7_Scheming_Tcl4' => 'That was unexpected. It felt like an unusually coordinated effort from their side - how bizarre. We should keep an eye out for further bandit activity.',
        'CQ2S7_Scheming_Tcl5' => 'That was unexpected. It felt like an unusually coordinated effort from their side - how bizarre. We should keep an eye out for further bandit activity.',
        'CQ2S8_Aquisition_Tcl2' => 'Did you see their faces? I told you they were going to be impressed! I think the King and his Advisor didn\'t expect a small island like ours to be so militarily advanced. Our men will lead this quest to glory, I\'m sure of it!',
        'CQ2S8_Aquisition_Tcl3' => 'Did you see their faces? I told you they were going to be impressed! I think the King and his Advisor didn\'t expect a small island like ours to be so militarily advanced. Our men will lead this quest to glory, I\'m sure of it!',
