        'CQC3M3Q1_SomethingOdd_lvl16' => 'Mmm-hmm… That is interesting… Very interesting indeed. Well, I can tell you that it appears to be a very powerful spell which has affected your entire island, and everything growing on it… I just can\'t figure out which school of magic it came from yet.',
