        'CQC3M3Q2_Hunch_lvl16' => 'Ma\'Bristley sends yet another letter to you:
"I knew it! It was a curse! And what does that tell us, I hear you ask? It tells us it was invoked by a powerful witch, that\'s what. And I\'m pretty sure I know who\'s responsible. There aren\'t many witches around that can invoke a curse like that."

