        'CQC3M3Q3_FinalClue_lvl16' => 'Judging by Ma\'Bristley\'s latest letter, she\'s concerned about your well-being. It reads:
"Oh… this is not good. I found out who cast that spell. And you won\'t like the answer… Have you ever heard of Lady Fraila? No? Well, she used to keep herself to herself. But then, one day, she grew bitter. Somebody banished her sister, who also happened to be a witch, from the island where they were born. Some swampy island in the middle of nowhere. Her sister even called herself "Witch of the Swamp". Do you have any idea why she\'d have a grudge against you?"',
