        'CQS10_SunnyDay_Tcl2' => 'Done and done! We should finish the reports and send them to Capital Island as soon as possible!',
        'CQS10_SunnyDay_Tcl3' => 'Done and done! We should finish the reports and send them to Capital Island as soon as possible!',
