        'CQS1_AStrongAdvice_Tcl1' => 'The specialists have returned, and we\'ve managed to get some of the resources we need to start preparations. Good work. It\'s time to move on to step two.',
        'CQS1_AStrongAdvice_Tcl2' => 'The specialists have returned, and we\'ve managed to get some of the resources we need to start preparations. Good work. It\'s time to move on to step two.',
        'CQS1_AStrongAdvice_Tcl3' => 'The specialists have returned, and we\'ve managed to get some of the resources we need to start preparations. Good work. It\'s time to move on to step two.',
        'CQS1_AStrongAdvice_Tcl4' => 'The specialists have returned, and we\'ve managed to get some of the resources we need to start preparations. Good work. It\'s time to move on to step two.',
        'CQS1_AStrongAdvice_Tcl5' => 'The specialists have returned, and we\'ve managed to get some of the resources we need to start preparations. Good work. It\'s time to move on to step two.',
        'CQS2_FromTheMines_Tcl1' => 'I knew we could count on our Military Forces to help the miners! You did great too! Let’s move on to the next step of the plan!',
        'CQS2_FromTheMines_Tcl2' => 'I knew we could count on our miners! You did great too! Let’s move on to the next step of the plan!',
        'CQS2_FromTheMines_Tcl3' => 'I knew we could count on our miners! You did great too! Let’s move on to the next step of the plan!',
        'CQS2_FromTheMines_Tcl4' => 'I knew we could count on our miners! You did great too! Let’s move on to the next step of the plan!',
        'CQS2_FromTheMines_Tcl5' => 'I knew we could count on our miners! You did great too! Let’s move on to the next step of the plan!',
        'CQS3_WatcherInTheTower_Tcl1' => 'We have news from the tower! The storm didn\'t do any serious damage! The watcher has promised he will supply us with news of the storm if things get worse. He was most impressed when he heard that we were ready to help. Good work!',
        'CQS3_WatcherInTheTower_Tcl2' => 'We got news from the tower! They got our shipment and are very thankful! The watcher has promised he will supply us with news of the storm if things get worse. Good work!',
        'CQS3_WatcherInTheTower_Tcl3' => 'We got news from the tower! They got our shipment and are very thankful! The watcher has promised he will supply us with news of the storm if things get worse. Good work!',
        'CQS3_WatcherInTheTower_Tcl4' => 'We got news from the tower! They got our shipment and are very thankful! The watcher has promised he will supply us with news of the storm if things get worse. Good work!',
        'CQS3_WatcherInTheTower_Tcl5' => 'We got news from the tower! They got our shipment and are very thankful! The watcher has promised he will supply us with news of the storm if things get worse. Good work!',
        'CQS4_Alliance_Tcl1' => 'Wow, having allies is indeed a good thing! Let\'s hope for the best!',
        'CQS4_Alliance_Tcl2' => 'Our allies won\'t forget the help. Some will even come to our aid if their islands are safe! Let\'s hope for the best!',
        'CQS4_Alliance_Tcl3' => 'Our allies won\'t forget the help. Some will even come to our aid if their islands are safe! Let\'s hope for the best!',
        'CQS4_Alliance_Tcl4' => 'Our allies won\'t forget the help. Some will even come to our aid if their islands are safe! Let\'s hope for the best!',
        'CQS4_Alliance_Tcl5' => 'Our allies won\'t forget the help. Some will even come to our aid if their islands are safe! Let\'s hope for the best!',
        'CQS5_WrongTiming_Tcl1' => 'The island and our storage facilities are secure again. The storm is about to hit us, so let\'s find our way to the shelters. It\'s going to be all right!',
        'CQS5_WrongTiming_Tcl2' => 'The island and our storage facilities are secure again. The storm is about to hit us, so let\'s find our way to the shelters. It\'s going to be all right!',
        'CQS5_WrongTiming_Tcl3' => 'The island and our storage facilities are secure again. The storm is about to hit us, so let\'s find our way to the shelters. It\'s going to be all right!',
        'CQS5_WrongTiming_Tcl4' => 'The island and our storage facilities are secure again. The storm is about to hit us, so let\'s find our way to the shelters. It\'s going to be all right!',
        'CQS5_WrongTiming_Tcl5' => 'The island and our storage facilities are secure again. The storm is about to hit us, so let\'s find our way to the shelters. It\'s going to be all right!',
        'CQS6_Aftermath_Tcl2' => 'Good. Very good! If we keep going like this we\'ll recover in no time, I can feel it! Now, what’s next?',
        'CQS6_Aftermath_Tcl3' => 'Good. Very good! If we keep going like this we\'ll recover in no time, I can feel it! Now, what’s next?',
        'CQS6_Aftermath_Tcl4' => 'Good. Very good! If we keep going like this we\'ll recover in no time, I can feel it! Now, what’s next?',
        'CQS6_Aftermath_Tcl5' => 'Good. Very good! If we keep going like this we\'ll recover in no time, I can feel it! Now, what’s next?',
        'CQS7_BrokenArmor_Tcl2' => 'The Military Forces are very pleased to receive the swords! Good job! I\'m sure they\'re going to be eager to help next time we ask!',
        'CQS7_BrokenArmor_Tcl3' => 'The Military Forces are very pleased to receive the swords! Good job! I\'m sure they\'re going to be eager to help next time we ask!',
        'CQS7_BrokenArmor_Tcl4' => 'The Military Forces are very pleased to receive the swords! Good job! I\'m sure they\'re going to be eager to help next time we ask!',
        'CQS7_BrokenArmor_Tcl5' => 'The Military Forces are very pleased to receive the swords! Good job! I\'m sure they\'re going to be eager to help next time we ask!',
        'CQS8_ANewForce_Tcl2' => 'Training units might be a loud activity, with all that yelling coming from the commanding officer, but at least the people feel safe, and we have some strong hands to help out around the island. Good work!',
        'CQS8_ANewForce_Tcl3' => 'Training units might be a loud activity, with all that yelling coming from the commanding officer, but at least the people feel safe, and we have some strong hands to help out around the island. Good work!',
        'CQS8_ANewForce_Tcl4' => 'Training units might be a loud activity, with all that yelling coming from the commanding officer, but at least the people feel safe, and we have some strong hands to help out around the island. Good work!',
        'CQS8_ANewForce_Tcl5' => 'Training units might be a loud activity, with all that yelling coming from the commanding officer, but at least the people feel safe, and we have some strong hands to help out around the island. Good work!',
        'CQS9_SmallChange_Tcl2' => 'We got just enough coin to pay for all the repairs, good work!',
        'CQS9_SmallChange_Tcl3' => 'We got just enough coin to pay for all the repairs, good work!',
        'CQS9_SmallChange_Tcl4' => 'We got just enough coin to pay for all the repairs, good work!',
        'CQS9_SmallChange_Tcl5' => 'We got just enough coin to pay for all the repairs, good work!',
        'ChrDaiAHugeChristmasTree' => 'The Christmas tree looks really adorable on your village square. Setting up a Christmas tree was a great idea.',
        'ChrDaiANewShelter' => 'You built the shelter as promised, and the reindeers do not have to freeze anymore. Santa Claus is grateful and sends you some presents.',
        'ChrDaiChristmasPostcard' => 'Timble Jude was happy to hear that you care so much for your friends! I\'m happy too!',
        'ChrDaiColoredFish' => 'Oh look at all those fish! So many colours!',
        'ChrDaiCozyChristmasEve' => 'Now your settlers will have a warm and cozy Christmas Eve and will be able to enjoy the feast.',
        'ChrDaiHeavyGifts' => 'Nutty Matty told me that he\'s never seen such beautiful horses in all his life! He\'s very happy!',
        'ChrDaiHelpForMotherHolle' => 'The help came just in the nick of time. Without you, they would have been late. As thanks, Santa Claus and mother Holle have sent you some presents.',
        'ChrDaiImportantWood' => 'This method works quite well. Let us hope that more people will follow your good example and use recycling in the future.',
        'ChrDaiLateDinner' => 'The sausage…It\'s fantastic! I\'ve never had such a tasty meal! I usually only get milk and cookies…',
        'ChrDaiMerryMaintenance' => 'Smiley Nakrul was more than happy to receive the tools from you! Now he can go ahead and fix my sledge!',
        'ChrDaiMulledWine' => 'It seems your attendant was not exaggerating. Maybe you should temporarily produce this mulled wine yourself?!',
        'ChrDaiSantasLittleHelper' => 'With these belts Santa\'s helper should be able to finish the presents. Well done!',
        'ChrDaiSaveTheChristmasFeast' => 'You managed to stop Croaker\'s plans, but it was a close call. Thanks to you, Christmas can take place as normal.',
        'ChrDaiSaveTheChristmasFeast2' => 'You managed to stop Croaker\'s plans, but it was a close call. Thanks to you, Christmas can take place as normal.',
        'ChrDaiSaveTheChristmasFeast2Prequest' => 'It was mostly incoherent, but you got the impression that he was really afraid of something. Additionally, he gave you a strange piece of paper that looks suspiciously like a map. Intriguing…',
        'ChrDaiSaveTheChristmasFeastPrequest' => 'It was mostly incoherent, but you got the impression that he was really afraid of something. Additionally, he gave you a strange piece of paper that looks suspiciously like a map. Intriguing…',
        'ChrDaiSavingOfChristmasEve' => 'That was just in time. Thanks to you Christmas can take place as planned. Santa Claus has sent you a few presents as thanks.',
        'ChrDaiSnowflakeTea' => 'Oh, smell this amazing snowflake tea! You can\'t? Well, maybe you need to become an elf yourself, so you can smell snowflakes!',
        'ChrDaiTallTree' => 'Ahh, these hardwood planks are indeed strong! I will have my elves start building the tree holders. There\'s no time to waste!',
        'ChrDaiTheChristmasBakery' => 'As the enjoyable smell of fresh cookies wafts up your nose, you know that you did the right thing. There is nothing better than cookies.',
        'ChrDaiTheNaughtyAndTheNice' => 'Sirim Seb was pleased with the swift shipment of coal he received. I will make sure to sneak some presents to the naughty kids too. Ho ho ho!',
        'ChrDaiTheNewMantelshelf' => 'Out of the marble blocks, your settlers manufactured a really beautiful mantelpiece. Now, Christmas can come.',
        'ChrDaiTheSnowyPretzel' => 'The fairy Vava will come in the morning and will prepare the pretzels for your settlers! I can’t wait. Maybe she\'ll make one for me too!',
        'ChrDaiTheToyMaker' => 'Yes, this wood will be enough for me to carve the toys from. Thank you!',
        'ChrDaiWarmBrew' => 'It seems your attendant was not exaggerating. Maybe you should temporarily produce this warm brew yourself?!',
        'ChrDaiYellowStar' => 'Shady Slayer has received all the iron ore he needs to prepare the iron dust. The shadow should be removed soon and we\'ll be able to get our yellow star!',
        'CollectAllCollectibles' => 'Great! You found all the collectibles ! We\'ll have to keep an eye out for when they reappear next!',
        'CollectAllCollectiblesAdventure' => 'Great! You found all the collectibles.',
        'CollectAllEasterCollectibles' => 'Congratulations, you managed to find all the hidden eggs before the Easter Egg Hunt timer ran out.',
        'CollectAllEventCollectibles' => 'Great! You found all the collectibles! They\'ll be transferred to your home island immediately.',
        'CoopLakesideTreasureQ1' => 'The palisades are crumbling, their magic is undone! We just need to keep going forward, together! Good work!',
        'CoopLakesideTreasureQ2' => 'We cleared out the witches! The cult is in disarray! We won\'t get a better chance than this - let\'s go for the treasure.',
        'CoopLakesideTreasureQ3' => 'We found it! My word, it is indeed a sight to behold! Now let\'s get back and get this artefact in a museum, where it belongs.',
        'CoopWhirlwindQ1' => 'Good going - the walls have fallen. This should allow our allies to make some progress.',
        'CoopWhirlwindQ2' => 'Great work! Their scouts are in disarray! Nothing stands between us and their stronghold now.',
        'CoopWhirlwindQ3' => 'The palisades have fallen! Great work!',
        'CoopWhirlwindQ4' => 'Hooray! We made short work of their walls! There\'s no stopping us now.',
        'CoopWhirlwindQ5' => 'Victory is ours! They will sing songs of our deeds for years to come!',
        'DaiADarkShadow' => 'Your trap has been sprung. The shadow has been caught and put in jail. Your streets are safe once more.',
        'DaiAFullArmory' => 'The brothers will be pleased to see and feel the great quality our swords provide!',
        'DaiANewGoldDeposit' => 'Indeed it seems to be a huge deposit. Surely, the mine will pay off.',
        'DaiANewJob' => 'Now he should have got the hang of it, and can continue fishing on his own.',
        'DaiANewQuest' => 'The bowman did not stand a chance against you. Now we are in need of a new quest, but don\'t worry - we\'ll find one soon enough.',
        'DaiANewTreasure' => 'You have managed to gather all the parts of the map. However, this time your cousin will have to search for the treasure on his own….',
        'DaiASignOfEsteem' => 'Never would the settlers have expected such generosity. They are very happy to have come to your lands.',
        'DaiASignOfPeace' => 'The king gives you great credit for your participation. He hopes that additional people will follow your good example, and relays his thanks to you.',
        'DaiAdventureSeasonMercenary' => 'This is not the end. There might be more Adventure Relics to collect, but for now, take some rest and continue your adventure tomorrow.',
        'DaiAdventures' => 'The numerous new stories your troops can tell should comfort them for a while.',
        'DaiAlienation' => 'Our troops will represent our island! The King will be pleased!',
        'DaiAnimalMarket' => 'Your cousin is very grateful for your help and has sent you a few small items as thanks. Oh well, at least it\'s better than nothing.',
        'DaiAnnoholicsLive' => 'The band members were really happy about the award. They promised to continue to throw concerts.',
        'DaiArcticExplosion' => 'Well done! I bet the King\'s going to hear about this and will reward you!',
        'DaiAttacks' => 'Even though you could not get all of them, you were able to lower the attacks to a minimum. Now, the inhabitants can travel again.',
        'DaiBanditNest' => 'Never again will bandits walk all over you… Chuck will think twice about it too…',
        'DaiBastilleIsland' => 'Well done! Problem solved! We\'ll be sending more and more prisoners to Bastille Island, so I hope Count Hackett knows how to handle the situation!',
        'DaiBeerSupply' => 'Now that the brew supply is secured, the feast can be readied.',
        'DaiBehindYourBack' => 'With the help of your militia you were able to find the culprit. It was a neighbouring monarch, casting a jealous eye on your lands. Stay cautious!',
        'DaiBigHarvest' => 'Now we just have to wait and see.',
        'DaiBirthday2018plusAdventure1' => 'I hear that everything went well with those buildings. Good… Tee hee hee. There\'s a possibility strange looking buildings will start appearing again you know. If they do, I\'ll contact you straight away.',
        'DaiBirthday2018plusAdventure2' => 'It seems there is no problem too big for you, is there? As you might have guessed, there\'s a possibility strange looking buildings will start appearing again. If they do, I\'ll contact you straight away.',
        'DaiBirthday2018plusAdventure3' => 'As I said, no trouble. It might be a side effect of our party preparations. I\'m sure it won\'t be a problem in the future. At least not a big one… Tee hee hee.',
        'DaiBirthday2018plusAdventure4' => 'And, what do you think? Do the buildings look strange, or is it the landscape? I suppose it depends on your point of view, doesn\'t it? Tee hee hee… Anyway - funny!',
        'DaiBirthday2018plusAdventure5' => 'I wonder whether this will continue. If it does, you should also continue taking care of it. I mean it is fun, isn\'t it? Tee hee hee…',
        'DaiBurntDown' => 'With the help of the wood, the settlers can at least rebuild the most essential buildings. Well done! I\'ll have our sages investigate this issue with the sun.',
        'DaiCannonBurglary' => 'We took back the castle! And just as I entered the cannon room, I found the attack plans! The next target was to be your city. That was really close.',
        'DaiCarvedIntoStone' => 'We opened the cavern and all we found was an empty chest! Well not completely empty, but the main treasure had already been taken. I wonder who…',
        'DaiCaseOfEmergency' => 'Against cannons, those ships won\'t stand a chance. We will see whether they will attack anyway. Oh, and it was fog after all. There are no such things as ghost ships! Right...?',
        'DaiCheapPrices' => 'The lady was so happy to see the ore that she put your name on the sponsors list! Maybe you\'re in line for a nice gift from her?',
        'DaiCollapsedMines' => 'Always keep in mind that mines have limited durability, and you should look after them regularly.',
        'DaiCopperCopperEverywhere' => 'That was just in time. One of your neighbours had just decided to begin building mines himself. He does not look very happy. Hopefully, this will not bring trouble.',
        'DaiDebts' => 'That should be enough to clear the dept. Your townswoman is exuberantly happy and vows eternal gratitude.',
        'DaiDeerCrossing' => 'This should minimize the animal population a bit for now. Just make sure it doesn\'t ever get too low.',
        'DaiDefense' => 'The additional weapons resulting from the increased steel resources should be enough to defend your settlers.',
        'DaiDogFamily' => 'That was nice of you. You have saved the dogs\' lives. Your servants will take care of them from here on.',
        'DaiEliteDrill' => 'It looks like it totally paid off to train elite soldiers. They are considerably more effective than the normal ones.',
        'DaiFirstWave' => 'Now your cousin should be able to make the preparations for his first attack. He will contact you again when he is done.',
        'DaiFollower' => 'Well, this seems quite promising. It would appear you can look forward to a new farmer in the near future.',
        'DaiFoodDonation' => 'The king has sent you a little thank you, and conveys the message that his inhabitants were very glad of your help.',
        'DaiFoodForThePeople' => 'Well done. This food should be enough to feed his inhabitants. Hopefully, he has learnt something from this.',
        'DaiFriends' => 'That was quite a generous gesture from you. Surely, your friend will not forget this. Good thing we found that box!',
        'DaiGoodExchangeRate' => 'The exchange rate could have been better, but it paid off anyway. It\'s always worth having a look at trading.',
        'DaiGoodFriends' => 'Theodor admits that good friends can prove to be a great help, and immediately runs off to get some. Let\'s hope he will be alright.',
        'DaiGoodThingsCome' => 'Finally, your cousin has claimed the island. Good things come to those who wait.',
        'DaiHarvestTime' => 'There has been a small argument between two lords who both wanted to buy our wheat! Thankfully, our merchants managed to resolve the problem peacefully! Next time we should bring more!',
        'DaiHelpToThoseBeingInNeedOf' => 'As you suspected, he wanted to acquire goods he does not really need. Unfortunately, you didn\'t have much to offer, so he went away. Maybe you have pampered him too much in the past?!',
        'DaiHighRequest' => 'Well done! I\'ll make sure we won\'t get any more complains!',
        'DaiHiredForces' => 'We banished those bandits, and they\'ll think twice before coming back.',
        'DaiHorseGrowing' => 'Well, the payment was quite good. Let\'s see whether the next generation will become as lucrative.',
        'DaiHorseRace' => 'Your settlers enjoyed an exciting horse race. To everyone’s surprise, a formerly unknown rider called Sylvana electrified the crowd and won with flying colors.',
        'DaiInTheCitysHonor' => 'All preparations are finished, and the feast can start. Your settlers will surely enjoy themselves magnificently.',
        'DaiInTheVeld' => 'In fact, your visit was as unpleasant as you anticipated, but on a good note, they now think you\'re handsome, so that\'s good news!',
        'DaiIronOutOfBronze' => 'Well I\'ll be… it worked! I guess we can use the treatment if we really need it!',
        'DaiIslandOfThePirates' => 'With an assault on the root of all evil, you were able to bring peace back to the island. The inhabitants are very grateful.',
        'DaiKittyLure' => 'Those kittens are so cute. The children love to play with them.',
        'DaiLiberty' => 'You stopped the terror and granted the region peace again. The people are grateful for your help.',
        'DaiLibrary' => 'The people are grateful for your contribution. Now they are able to teach our youngsters about the world and how it works.',
        'DaiLocalAlchemist' => 'The man was so happy. He furiously shook my hand, and thanked me several times.',
        'DaiLotsOfGunpowder' => 'With all this gunpowder, they should be able to load all their new cannons and help us achieve a perfect victory!',
        'DaiLovelyGold' => 'Well, at least the mercenaries will stay calm now. Soon though your cousin will be in need of a plan, otherwise claiming the island will be impossible.',
        'DaiMarbleOutOfStone' => 'It really works. Fascinating! Too bad your stone cutter cannot write to document the procedure.',
        'DaiMeatForTheNeighbors' => 'That should do for the beginning at least. Maybe you can send additional goods later on.',
        'DaiMilitaryExtension' => 'Maybe your ship will appear again, but until then at least your military capabilities have been extended a little. You never know…',
        'DaiMoreAdventures' => 'Phew! She left! Good work!',
        'DaiMoreCorn' => 'Generous as you are, you have granted your inhabitant\'s request and built more wheatfields. Again, your inhabitants are grateful and happy.',
        'DaiMotivation' => 'The additional food should be enough motivation for your settlers, and allow them to flourish again. I wonder where that scent is coming from though…',
        'DaiMythBusters' => 'Well, that settles it. We found out that platinum swords are lighter and faster, but not really more durable compared to damascene swords. Your settlers loved the comparison, though - maybe we should blow something up next time?',
        'DaiNegotiationSkills' => 'Always make sure you keep trading unneeded goods against other useful resources. It will pay off.',
        'DaiNeighborlyHelp' => 'Your neighbour was eager to help you. Now you have enough goods to please our guests!',
        'DaiNewFarm' => 'Very well. Now the settlers can build a new farm in the shadows of the old mountain.',
        'DaiNewHelpForTheodor' => 'Once again, your brother is grateful for your help. We will see whether he will come and ask for help again next time… Maybe you should send him random resources now and then, eh?',
        'DaiNewLand' => 'Even though the wood will last for quite some time, you should look for the next land... just to be sure.',
        'DaiNewSettlers' => 'The people began construction immediately after receipt of the resources and are happy to be counted among your inhabitants.',
        'DaiNobleFurniture' => 'Look at this fancy furniture! Maybe I should buy some of it...',
        'DaiNobleHouses' => 'The Lord is very thankful, and invites you for dinner in a few weeks\' time to see how the beanstalks are coming along.',
        'DaiNotEnoughGoods' => 'That was close again and your brother can be glad to have you. Let us see, how long it will last until he becomes the next problem.',
        'DaiNutritionForTheNew' => 'Your new settlers don\'t know how to thank you. Thanks to your generosity, they promise to remain diligent and loyal.',
        'DaiOrigami' => 'Here - I brought you a crane made out of paper. There\'s a lot more where that came from, and people are going crazy for it.',
        'DaiPepperoni' => 'Irma’s pepperoni was incredibly delicious, and her birthday celebration a great success all around. Good job!',
        'DaiPirateLife' => 'We should probably keep quiet about what we accomplished here today, as I\'m not sure the settlers would understand us helping pirates! Good work nonetheless!',
        'DaiRaiseYourStock' => 'That should be enough to equip the first hunting session of the royal court. Enjoy the hunt!!',
        'DaiRanAground' => 'With the tools you sent, the sailors were able to repair their ships and the column could continue on their way. Once again, you have won an additional friend.',
        'DaiReforesting' => 'Therewith you should be able to reforest your wood. At the next walk, the forest will be thicker again.',
        'DaiReparations' => 'Now your soldiers should have enough resources for the necessary repairs.',
        'DaiSecludedExperiments' => 'With your drastic measures, you showed your settlers that there is nothing to be afraid of!',
        'DaiSecondWave' => 'The second wave is invading the isle already. Let\'s see how far they get.',
        'DaiSettlerOnTheMoon' => 'W-what happened to the man? He just flew out of the cannon into the blue! I hope he\'s alright...',
        'DaiSleepyReef' => 'Good work! Gregorid and his island should be safe now! The King will reward us accordingly!',
        'DaiSocialBehavior' => 'Your inhabitants know your good example is to be valued. Now, nothing stands in the way of the holiday and its festivities.',
        'DaiSpecialForces' => 'Our troops will leave soon, and help the king to train his troops.',
        'DaiStrongAllies' => 'That is enough to begin with. I\'m sure he will be able to protect his island from here on.',
        'DaiSupplyForTheodor' => 'These carriages should be enough for the goods your brother has ordered. What would he do without you anyway?',
        'DaiTheAnimalInitiative' => 'Therewith, you should be able to attract enough animals to send them into other countries.',
        'DaiTheBakery' => 'Your support was very helpful. With the help of the flour they were able to gather enough gold and combine it with tools to make a new mill.',
        'DaiTheBear' => 'With the help of a few inhabitants, you managed to catch the bear. In his big compound he seems to feel comfortable, and the people feel safe again. The caretaker has even given him a name - "Tram".',
        'DaiTheBoneDiscovery' => 'It will take a while to expose all of the bones, but one thing is already certain... They\'re huge!',
        'DaiTheDefendOfTheVillage' => 'Your friend is very thankful and invites you for a visit. Unfortunately, you have no time at the moment, but you will come back for sure.',
        'DaiTheExhibition' => 'The exhibition catches on and your settlers are fascinated by the huge animal. However, it also seems to frighten them. Hopefully, the exhibition was a good idea.',
        'DaiTheFearAmongstTheSettlers' => 'Helvian Kones and your explorers could not find any proof of the existence of such an animal. Now, you just have to convince your settlers that this means the animal does not exist.',
        'DaiTheGreatDiscovery' => 'Well, that was not what you had hoped for. Just a few old stone heads and clay jugs filled with phosphor. Your brother Theodor has a birthday coming up doesn\'t he?',
        'DaiTheGreatFeast' => 'How rude! They left before we could serve the food! Well, that at least leaves some spare food for our settlers.',
        'DaiTheHugeStatue' => 'Even though the construction of the statue will still take some time, the king is very grateful for your help and invites you to visit him in his castle. What an honour!',
        'DaiTheKingsMonument' => 'The envoy is on his way. The monument will rise toward the skies…. The king will be proud of you.',
        'DaiTheLastTime' => 'With the help of the swords, your brother will be able to defend himself, but this is definitely the last time you help him out, right?',
        'DaiTheLostSkull' => 'Great work! We managed to complete all the tasks we had to do! You are truly a strong leader! The King is proud of you!',
        'DaiTheMonster' => 'After a long search, the monster turned out to be just a wild hog. However, to calm the fears of your inhabitants, you should tell them that the monster is dead.',
        'DaiTheMostBeautifulCities' => 'The king was unsure whether your city should qualify. He has delayed his decision and will inform you at a later date.',
        'DaiTheMostBeautifulCityInTheLand' => 'You finished your last building just as the king arrived. Impressed by the beautiful buildings and your determination, he declares your city to be one of the most beautiful in the land.',
        'DaiThePlay' => 'William was impressed by how well our troops can handle bows, but one specific guy caught his attention. His name is Robin. William was so impressed by his acting skills, he decided to name the play after him.',
        'DaiTheProposal' => 'Your brother has a smile all over his face. Well, let\'s see whether his beloved accepts his proposal…',
        'DaiTheRace' => 'Our shoe maker delivered an incredible performance. The skill he must have to control that wagon at top speed - unbelievable.',
        'DaiTheSausageCompetition' => 'You did not win the competition, but at least you got a little prize.',
        'DaiTheSecretOrder' => 'We managed to capture all of them! We even found the shadow essence and locked it in our deepest cellar! Luckily, we saw through them and prevented further damage. Our streets are safe again.',
        'DaiTheSleepingVolcano' => 'Good work! The island is safe again! Good work!',
        'DaiTheWorldOfTrading' => 'Hopefully, that example was demonstrative enough for your brother Theodor. Well, if he should not be successful, he will surely return.',
        'DaiTheatre' => 'The traveling actors are grateful for your generosity, and assure you they\'ll be back again next season.',
        'DaiTheodorNeedsHelp' => 'Your brother is very grateful for your help. Hopefully, he will learn from it… Good thing he knows how to write…',
        'DaiTimberWorm' => 'Luckily, our trees are not affected. We can continue our wood production. That was a close shave.',
        'DaiTitanNarrow' => 'This stock should be enough, in case the rumours should turn out to be true.',
        'DaiTournament' => 'It\'s the Black Knight! He did incredibly well. I didn\'t even know we had such talented people among our troops.',
        'DaiTraitors' => 'You showed them the ropes. Now, your settlers will think twice before betraying you.',
        'DaiTropicalSun' => 'Very well done! Lord Walder and the council will never forget your help!',
        'DaiTrueFriends' => 'Of course, your friends were eager to help immediately. They are true friends after all.',
        'DaiUnsatisfiedSettlers' => 'That should be enough to spare your settlers a little, but maybe a pair of new shoes would have had the same result?!',
        'DaiValuableJugs' => 'Now the coppersmiths should be able to produce more. The exhibition can begin.',
        'DaiValuableWater' => 'Keep in mind you never can have enough wells, and you should always be sure to have enough water in stock.',
        'DaiWarmerRegions' => 'Waltor the Grey was sad to hear about his friend. Well, dark magic is not a toy for anyone to play with.',
        'DaiWellFilled' => 'The storage is filled. Well done!',
        'DaiWitchHunt' => 'Even though the reward was not as huge as expected, the whole thing paid off. She was no match for you, anyway. Even so, I\'m not sure we\'ve seen the last of that witch…',
        'DaiWrongOrder' => 'Done! I hope that the spirit of the shrine will come back one day to watch over and protect our island!',
        'EMDaiBalls' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiCelebration' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiCleats' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiConcentration' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiConfetti' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiCubicles' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiDiet' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiDummies' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiFireworks' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiFraternal' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiFreebeer' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiFriendly' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiGraffiti' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiHottestDay' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiHygiene' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiJerseys' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiMagazine' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiNervous' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiParade' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiPavement' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiProtection' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiRepairs' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiRing' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiSaboteurs' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiShakespeare' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiSouvenirs' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiStadiumsnack' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiStands' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiSteaks' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiTradebeer' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiTraining' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiTravelsnack' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMDaiWhistles' => 'Daily Quest completed!',
        'EMEventAdvQ1' => 'You have won the match!',
        'EMEventAdvQ2' => 'You have won the match!',
        'EMEventAdvQ3' => 'You have won the match!',
        'EMEventAdvQ4' => 'You have won the match!',
        'EMEventAdvQ5' => 'You have won the match!',
        'EMEventAdvQ6' => 'You have won the match!',
        'EasAGoodbyePresent' => 'Well, that is a really huge amount of Easter eggs. What an unusual Easter…',
        'EasALongSearch' => 'Slowly, he recovers and reports that he searched and searched until he fell unconscious. Now, it is up to you to find all remaining Easter eggs.',
        'EasEasterEggShed' => 'That should suffice to store not only the eggs already found, but all future finds too. Let\'s go on to the next stage of the paper chase.',
        'EasMissingEasterEggs' => 'CAUTION! THE NEXT QUEST WILL START AUTOMATICALLY IN ONE HOUR!

You return from your Easter egg search successfully. Just as you arrive, one of your settlers approaches excitedly. This does not bode well.',
        'EasMissingMap' => 'After a long search, your team was able to find the map, and the last stage of the paper chase can begin.',
        'EasPaperChaseFinalStage' => 'CAUTION! THE NEXT QUEST WILL START AUTOMATICALLY IN ONE HOUR!

You have successfully collected the remaining Easter eggs and brought them to the Easter bunny. He is very grateful and would like to contact you when he is feeling better.',
        'EasPaperChaseStage1' => 'CAUTION! THE NEXT QUEST WILL START AUTOMATICALLY IN ONE HOUR!

That was quite a successful visit. You found a lot of Easter eggs, too many to take them with you to the next island. What now?',
        'EasPaperChaseStage2' => 'CAUTION! THE NEXT QUEST WILL START AUTOMATICALLY IN ONE HOUR!

Once again, you found all the Easter eggs. It\'s just a little strange that you didn\'t haven\'t had a message from the Easter bunny yet. Maybe, something is wrong?',
        'EasStartOfThePaperChase' => 'This basket should be big enough to collect the Easter eggs from the paper chase. So, let\'s go!',
        'EasTakingABreak' => 'That was really good, but that\'s enough relaxation for the moment. The next map awaits.',
        'EasTheDamagedBackpack' => 'The Easter bunny\'s brother is very grateful. However, you immediately sense he has another favor to ask. He has another map in his pocket.',
        'EasTheEndOfTheAdventure' => 'CAUTION! THE NEXT QUEST WILL START AUTOMATICALLY IN ONE HOUR!

Everyone joyfully arrives at your home. The rabbit thanks you very much for your immense help, picks up his backpack and hobbles away.',
        'EasTheLastIsland' => 'That should be enough to protect the Easter bunny\'s brother effectively. Let\'s go to the last island.',
        'EasTheMemoryPotion' => 'It takes some time for the potion to take effect. Didn\'t the old man talk about an area somewhere? Maybe this would be a good place to start until the rabbit recovers his memory.',
        'EasTheMissionEasterEggRecovery' => 'CAUTION! THE NEXT QUEST WILL START AUTOMATICALLY IN ONE HOUR!

Phew, those Easter eggs were very really well hidden. Now, get home quickly to check whether the potion has taken effect already.',
        'EasTheOldMan' => 'CAUTION! THE NEXT QUEST WILL START AUTOMATICALLY IN ONE HOUR!

As you are on your way home you come across a little hut. An old man is sitting in front of it and tells you something remarkable when he sees the Easter eggs: He saw a bunny hiding Easter eggs in a completely unsettled area. Maybe you should ask the rabbit about it?',
        'EasTheSearchGoesOn' => 'CAUTION! THE NEXT QUEST WILL START AUTOMATICALLY IN ONE HOUR!

So, another adventure finished successfully. Let\'s see what further surprises the rabbit has in store.',
        'EasTheSurprise' => 'What are the rabbits doing right now? Well, speak of the devil, isn\'t that a letter from them?',
        'EasTradings' => 'That really was a lot of work, but it is to be rewarded! A message from your doctor reaches you, saying that the rabbit\'s memory is slowly coming back.',
        'EasUnreadableHandwriting' => 'CAUTION! THE NEXT QUEST WILL START AUTOMATICALLY IN ONE HOUR!

No sooner have you secured the last Easter egg than one of your messengers arrives and reports that the rabbit has fully recovered his memory. You start for home immediately.',
        'EasWeeklyDailyQuest_Delay' => 'Aaaaaand done! Thank you for visiting us. The preparations are now complete - and some people would like to talk to you!',
        'Easter2015_TutAchievementBuild_Sub02' => 'Well, isn\'t this a beautiful sight? Just remember, the more stuff you do, the bigger the Easter residence will be.',
        'Easter2015_TutAchievements' => 'Ok then! Now that you know everything there is to know about the Easter building, let\'s get to work! Chop-chop!',
        'Easter2015_TutAchievements_Sub01' => 'Well done - you found the achievement button. Much like everyone will. Here, take the Easter residence as a token of my appreciation.',
        'Easter2016_Main1Elite' => 'The strange man in the bunny costume just went by. It seems you really helped him out. Thank you very much. I would have been totally helpless on my own.',
        'Easter2016_Main1EliteSub1' => 'About time! I don\'t have all day! Ahhh… that\'s good! I\'m sure I\'ll have my memory back in no time! Let\'s see… where am I?!',
        'Easter2016_Main1EliteSub2' => 'Thank god, he found something! Don\'t know what I would have done without him. Let\'s see, what does the hint tell us about the egg\'s location?!',
        'Easter2016_Main1EliteSub3' => 'Well, that\'s a lot of eggs, but I\'m not sure you got them all. Hmm… If any are missing, my Easter pal will be mad!',
        'Easter2016_Main1EliteSub4' => 'Yeah! That was good. Even better, I\'ve just remembered the location of the other eggs I lost. I\'ll mark it on the map... Look away, I cannot draw when someone stares at me!',
        'Easter2016_Main1EliteSub5' => 'Phew! All eggs together, finally! Man, I was really concerned my Easter pal would never talk to me again. Thanks buddy. Until next time.',
        'Easter2016_Main1High' => 'The strange man in the bunny costume just went by. It seems you really helped him out. Thank you very much. I would have been totally helpless.',
        'Easter2016_Main1HighSub1' => 'About time! I haven\'t got all day! Aaah… that\'s good! I am sure my memory will start coming back in no time! Let\'s see… where was I?!',
        'Easter2016_Main1HighSub2' => 'Thank God, he has found something! I don\'t know what I would have done without him. Let\'s see, what does the hint tell us about the egg\'s location?!',
        'Easter2016_Main1HighSub3' => 'Well, that\'s a lot of eggs, but I\'m not sure you got them all. Hmm… If any are missing, my Easter pal will be mad!',
        'Easter2016_Main1HighSub4' => 'Yeah! That was good. So, now I remember the location of the last eggs I lost. I\'ll draw it on this map... Look away, I can\'t draw with someone staring at me!',
        'Easter2016_Main1HighSub5' => 'Phew! All eggs together, finally! Man, I was really concerned my Easter pal would never talk to me again. Thanks buddy. Until next time.',
        'Easter2016_Main1Low' => 'The strange man in the bunny costume just went by. It seems you really helped him out. Thank you very much. I would have been totally helpless.',
        'Easter2016_Main1LowSub1' => 'About time! I haven\'t got all day! Aaah… that\'s good! I am sure my memory will start coming back in no time! Let\'s see… where was I?!',
        'Easter2016_Main1LowSub2' => 'Thank God, he has found something! I don\'t know what I would have done without him. Let\'s see, what does the hint tell us about the egg\'s location?!',
        'Easter2016_Main1LowSub3' => 'Well, that\'s a lot of eggs, but I\'m not sure you got them all. Hmm… If any are missing, my Easter pal will be mad!',
        'Easter2016_Main1LowSub4' => 'Yeah! That was good. So, now I remember the location of the last eggs I lost. I\'ll draw it on this map... Look away, I can\'t draw with someone staring at me!',
        'Easter2016_Main1LowSub5' => 'Phew! All eggs together, finally! Man, I was really concerned my Easter pal would never talk to me again. Thanks buddy. Until next time.',
        'Easter2016_Main1Middle' => 'The strange man in the bunny costume just went by. It seems you really helped him out. Thank you very much. I would have been totally helpless.',
        'Easter2016_Main1MiddleSub1' => 'About time! I haven\'t got all day! Aaah… that\'s good! I am sure my memory will start coming back in no time! Let\'s see… where was I?!',
        'Easter2016_Main1MiddleSub2' => 'Thank God, he has found something! I don\'t know what I would have done without him. Let\'s see, what does the hint tell us about the egg\'s location?!',
        'Easter2016_Main1MiddleSub3' => 'Well, that\'s a lot of eggs, but I\'m not sure you got them all. Hmm… If any are missing, my Easter pal will be mad!',
        'Easter2016_Main1MiddleSub4' => 'Yeah! That was good. So, now I remember the location of the last eggs I lost. I\'ll draw it on this map... Look away, I can\'t draw with someone staring at me!',
        'Easter2016_Main1MiddleSub5' => 'Phew! All eggs together, finally! Man, I was really concerned my Easter pal would never talk to me again. Thanks buddy. Until next time.',
        'Easter2016_Main2Elite' => 'That rude person just stumbled away. Are you alright? It was so generous of you to help him. You saved the Easter feast with your efforts. Thank you very much.',
        'Easter2016_Main2EliteSub1' => 'OK. I will take this decent compensation and look the other way. So, how are you planning on getting my eggs back? What? You expected me to gather my lost eggs alone? That is the last straw!',
        'Easter2016_Main2EliteSub2' => 'I asked the settlers working in the mine, but they weren\'t sure. They said someone told them something about some eggs and painted it onto a sheet of paper, but I couldn\'t find any sign of him. Jeez…',
        'Easter2016_Main2EliteSub3' => 'Oh my god, that took you, like, years! Have you finally managed it? What do you mean I didn\'t do anything to help? I was sitting here and giving managerial advice! This was obviously a lot of work!',
        'Easter2016_Main2EliteSub4' => 'Oh great! You found them! Let me see! … What the… There are some missing! Are you kidding me? I hope you haven\'t kept some for yourself?',
        'Easter2016_Main2EliteSub5' => 'Nice - I think that\'s all of them. But with the good news comes some bad, too, as I\'m afraid I have to leave you now. I know you\'ll be sad when I\'m gone, but I\'m sure we\'ll meet again. Until then….',
        'Easter2016_Main2High' => 'That rude person just stumbled away. Are you alright? It was so generous of you to help him. You\'ve saved Easter with your efforts. Thank you very much.',
        'Easter2016_Main2HighSub1' => 'Oh well, I will take this reasonable compensation and forget about it. So tell me, what plan do you have to get my eggs back? What? Did you expect me to gather my lost eggs alone? It\'s the least you can do!',
        'Easter2016_Main2HighSub2' => 'I asked the settlers working in the mine, but they weren\'t sure. They said someone mentioned something about eggs, and painted something onto a sheet of paper, but I couldn\'t find any sign of the person. Jeez…',
        'Easter2016_Main2HighSub3' => 'Oh my God, I feel like this has taken years! Were you successful at last? What? You think I didn\'t make any effort at all? Look at me, I\'ve been busy sitting here providing advice! It\'s very tiring work, let me assure you!',
        'Easter2016_Main2HighSub4' => 'Oh great! You found them. Let me see! … What the… These are not all the eggs! Are you kidding me? I hope, you didn\'t keep some eggs for yourself?',
        'Easter2016_Main2HighSub5' => 'Nice. I think that\'s all of them. I have to leave you now. I know, you will be sad when I\'m gone, but I\'m sure you will get over it. Until then…',
        'Easter2016_Main2Low' => 'That rude person just stumbled away. Are you alright? It was so generous of you to help him. You\'ve saved Easter with your efforts. Thank you very much.',
        'Easter2016_Main2LowSub1' => 'Oh well, I will take this reasonable compensation and forget about it. So tell me, what plan do you have to get my eggs back? What? Did you expect me to gather my lost eggs alone? It\'s the least you can do!',
        'Easter2016_Main2LowSub2' => 'I asked the settlers working in the mine, but they weren\'t sure. They said someone mentioned something about eggs, and painted something onto a sheet of paper, but I couldn\'t find any sign of the person. Jeez…',
        'Easter2016_Main2LowSub3' => 'Oh my God, I feel like this has taken years! Were you successful at last? What? You think I didn\'t make any effort at all? Look at me, I\'ve been busy sitting here providing advice! It\'s very tiring work, let me assure you!',
        'Easter2016_Main2LowSub4' => 'Oh great! You found them. Let me see! … What the… These are not all the eggs! Are you kidding me? I hope, you didn\'t keep some eggs for yourself?',
        'Easter2016_Main2LowSub5' => 'Nice. I think that\'s all of them. I have to leave you now. I know, you will be sad when I\'m gone, but I\'m sure you will get over it. Until then…',
        'Easter2016_Main2Middle' => 'That rude person just stumbled away. Are you alright? It was so generous of you to help him. You\'ve saved Easter with your efforts. Thank you very much.',
        'Easter2016_Main2MiddleSub1' => 'Oh well, I will take this reasonable compensation and forget about it. So tell me, what plan do you have to get my eggs back? What? Did you expect me to gather my lost eggs alone? It\'s the least you can do!',
        'Easter2016_Main2MiddleSub2' => 'I asked the settlers working in the mine, but they weren\'t sure. They said someone mentioned something about eggs, and painted something onto a sheet of paper, but I couldn\'t find any sign of the person. Jeez…',
        'Easter2016_Main2MiddleSub3' => 'Oh my God, I feel like this has taken years! Were you successful at last? What? You think I didn\'t make any effort at all? Look at me, I\'ve been busy sitting here providing advice! It\'s very tiring work, let me assure you!',
        'Easter2016_Main2MiddleSub4' => 'Oh great! You found them. Let me see! … What the… These are not all the eggs! Are you kidding me? I hope, you didn\'t keep some eggs for yourself?',
        'Easter2016_Main2MiddleSub5' => 'Nice. I think that\'s all of them. I have to leave you now. I know, you will be sad when I\'m gone, but I\'m sure you will get over it. Until then…',
        'Easter2016_Main3Elite' => 'Well, that was different. I hope he\'ll do a good job for the Easter bunny. But you did what you had to do. I\'m sure he\'s grateful, even if he didn\'t seem it.',
        'Easter2016_Main3EliteSub0' => 'Great stuff! Now stick around, so I can tell you the story behind this whole adventure.',
        'Easter2016_Main3EliteSub1' => 'Nice, it worked! I\'d love to be able to see his face when he realizes his eggs are being stolen. Hey, don\'t look like that. He is a complete jerk after all!',
        'Easter2016_Main3EliteSub2' => 'The baker is incredibly satisfied with your help, and is ready to give us the coordinates for my cousin\'s other island. We\'re getting closer!',
        'Easter2016_Main3EliteSub3' => 'Oh, back already? So, how was it? Yes, yes, that was the last time we… borrowed eggs from him. Now, we have to rebuild my reputation with the Easter bunny… After some sleep!',
        'Easter2016_Main3EliteSub4' => 'Nice, the Easter bunny already recognized all the people gathered around me. That went pretty well! What? Oh, of course you can have the coins back. I was just about to give them back to you anyway! Honestly!',
        'Easter2016_Main3EliteSub5' => 'The Easter bunny was so choked up by my efforts, he decided to give me another chance. I\'m sure the Easter eggs he lost were also a reason. Well, thanks for your help buddy. I couldn\'t have done it without you… Well, maybe I could have, but it would have taken a little bit longer.',
        'Easter2016_Main3High' => 'That was really a strange visit. I hope he will do a good job for the Easter bunny. You, however, have already accomplished what needed to be done. I am sure he is grateful... even if he doesn\'t let it show.',
        'Easter2016_Main3HighSub0' => 'Great stuff! Now stick around a bit so I can tell you the story behind this whole adventure.',
        'Easter2016_Main3HighSub1' => 'Good, it worked. I would love to see his face when he realises his eggs have been stolen. Don\'t feel bad about it - he\'s a complete jerk!',
        'Easter2016_Main3HighSub2' => 'The baker is very satisfied with your help and is ready to give us the coordinates for my cousin\'s other island. We are getting closer!',
        'Easter2016_Main3HighSub3' => 'Oh, back already? So, how was it? Yes yes, now we can stop, er, \'borrowing\' eggs from him and start rebuilding my reputation with the Easter bunny… After some sleep!',
        'Easter2016_Main3HighSub4' => 'Great - the Easter bunny has already recognized all the people gathered around me. That went pretty well! What? Oh, of course, here are the coins back. I wanted to give them back to you from the beginning, honestly!',
        'Easter2016_Main3HighSub5' => 'Oh, the Easter bunny was so choked up by my efforts, he has decided to give me another chance. I\'m sure the missing Easter eggs also helped him decide. Well, thanks for your help buddy. Couldn\'t have done it without you… Well, maybe I could have, but it certainly would have taken longer.',
        'Easter2016_Main3Low' => 'That was really a strange visit. I hope he will do a good job for the Easter bunny. You, however, have already accomplished what needed to be done. I am sure he is grateful... even if he doesn\'t let it show.',
        'Easter2016_Main3LowSub0' => 'Great stuff! Now stick around a bit so I can tell you the story behind this whole adventure.',
        'Easter2016_Main3LowSub1' => 'Good, it worked. I would love to see his face when he realises his eggs have been stolen. Don\'t feel bad about it - he\'s a complete jerk!',
        'Easter2016_Main3LowSub2' => 'The baker is very satisfied with your help and is ready to give us the coordinates for my cousin\'s other island. We are getting closer!',
        'Easter2016_Main3LowSub3' => 'Oh, back already? So, how was it? Yes yes, now we can stop, er, \'borrowing\' eggs from him and start rebuilding my reputation with the Easter bunny… After some sleep!',
        'Easter2016_Main3LowSub4' => 'Great - the Easter bunny has already recognized all the people gathered around me. That went pretty well! What? Oh, of course, here are the coins back. I wanted to give them back to you from the beginning, honestly!',
        'Easter2016_Main3LowSub5' => 'Oh, the Easter bunny was so choked up by my efforts, he has decided to give me another chance. I\'m sure the missing Easter eggs also helped him decide. Well, thanks for your help buddy. Couldn\'t have done it without you… Well, maybe I could have, but it certainly would have taken longer.',
        'Easter2016_Main3Middle' => 'That was really a strange visit. I hope he will do a good job for the Easter bunny. You, however, have already accomplished what needed to be done. I am sure he is grateful... even if he doesn\'t let it show.',
        'Easter2016_Main3MiddleSub0' => 'Great stuff! Now stick around a bit so I can tell you the story behind this whole adventure.',
        'Easter2016_Main3MiddleSub1' => 'Good, it worked. I would love to see his face when he realises his eggs have been stolen. Don\'t feel bad about it - he\'s a complete jerk!',
        'Easter2016_Main3MiddleSub2' => 'The baker is very satisfied with your help and is ready to give us the coordinates for my cousin\'s other island. We are getting closer!',
        'Easter2016_Main3MiddleSub3' => 'Oh, back already? So, how was it? Yes yes, now we can stop, er, \'borrowing\' eggs from him and start rebuilding my reputation with the Easter bunny… After some sleep!',
        'Easter2016_Main3MiddleSub4' => 'Great - the Easter bunny has already recognized all the people gathered around me. That went pretty well! What? Oh, of course, here are the coins back. I wanted to give them back to you from the beginning, honestly!',
        'Easter2016_Main3MiddleSub5' => 'Oh, the Easter bunny was so choked up by my efforts, he has decided to give me another chance. I\'m sure the missing Easter eggs also helped him decide. Well, thanks for your help buddy. Couldn\'t have done it without you… Well, maybe I could have, but it certainly would have taken longer.',
        'Easter2016_Main4Elite' => 'Ah, how sweet it is to see someone beaten by their own weapons. Even if I do get the impression that his cousin isn\'t much better. Anyway, here are some Easter eggs for your help. Thank you.',
        'Easter2016_Main4EliteSub1' => 'Nice - this should be enough for now. Well then, let us begin our egg hunt. I already have an idea where we can begin.',
        'Easter2016_Main4EliteSub2' => 'Very good! We\'re off to a good start. But of course, this will not be enough to win the competition. I\'m sure there are more islands to find eggs on. And I know someone who can point us in the right direction.',
        'Easter2016_Main4EliteSub3' => 'Nice, that went fast! What? Yeah, I know it was pretty bad, but we managed, didn\'t we? So stop sulking! We still have work to do.',
        'Easter2016_Main4EliteSub4' => 'Hmm... There are fewer eggs than I expected here. With such a paltry amount we\'ll lose the competition for sure! We need more eggs!',
        'Easter2016_Main4EliteSub5' => 'Wow, look at these piles of eggs. Amazing! And just in time! I will now take the eggs and hurry to the appointment with my cousin. I can\'t wait to see his face! He he… What? Oh, OK… I\'ll leave you some eggs too. Until we meet again!',
        'Easter2016_Main4High' => 'Ah, it was nice seeing that person getting beaten with his own weapons, even if I got the impression his cousin isn\'t much better. Anyway, here - have some Easter eggs as thanks for your help.',
        'Easter2016_Main4HighSub1' => 'Right that should be enough for now. Well then, let\'s begin our egg hunt. I already have an idea where we can begin.',
        'Easter2016_Main4HighSub2' => 'Very good! This is a start at least, but it will not suffice to win the competition. I am sure there are more islands to find eggs on, and I know someone who can give us a location.',
        'Easter2016_Main4HighSub3' => 'Good, that was fast! What? Yeah, I know it went pretty bad, but we managed didn\'t we? So stop grieving - we still have work to do.',
        'Easter2016_Main4HighSub4' => 'Hmm... That was fewer eggs than expected. With only this amount I\'ll lose the competition for sure! We need more eggs!',
        'Easter2016_Main4HighSub5' => 'Wow, look at these piles of eggs. Amazing! And just in time. Now I am going to take the eggs and hurry to the appointment with my cousin. I can\'t wait to see his face! He he! What? OK, I\'ll leave you a few too. See you soon!',
        'Easter2016_Main4Low' => 'Ah, it was nice seeing that person getting beaten with his own weapons, even if I got the impression his cousin isn\'t much better. Anyway, here - have some Easter eggs as thanks for your help.',
        'Easter2016_Main4LowSub1' => 'Right that should be enough for now. Well then, let\'s begin our egg hunt. I already have an idea where we can begin.',
        'Easter2016_Main4LowSub2' => 'Very good! This is a start at least, but it will not suffice to win the competition. I am sure there are more islands to find eggs on, and I know someone who can give us a location.',
