        'Easter2016_Main4MiddleSub4' => 'Hmm... That was fewer eggs than expected. With only this amount I\'ll lose the competition for sure! We need more eggs!',
        'Easter2016_Main4MiddleSub5' => 'Wow, look at these piles of eggs. Amazing! And just in time. Now I am going to take the eggs and hurry to the appointment with my cousin. I can\'t wait to see his face! He he! What? OK, I\'ll leave you a few too. See you soon!',
        'Easter2016_PartyCrasher_BossGrind' => 'These guys sure are persistent! I have a feeling they won\'t stay quiet for very long. If we\'ve learnt anything from these past few days, it\'s that I\'m sure they\'ll come back tomorrow as well!',
        'Easter2016_PartyCrasher_BossGrindPeace' => 'See? There\'s no need for violence at all! I had a nice talk with them, and took them some presents, and they\'ve agreed to leave us alone for today. Aren\'t you happy?',
        'Easter2016_PartyCrasher_BossGrindWar' => 'Ha! That\'ll teach them not to mess with our party! I\'m pretty sure they\'ll leave us alone for a while now.',
        'Easter2016_PartyCrasher_Easy1Peace' => 'See? There\'s no need for violence at all! I had a nice talk with them, and took them some presents, and they\'ve agreed to leave us alone for today. Aren\'t you happy?',
