        'Easter2017_LevelRequirement' => 'Awesome! We can get started now!',
        'Easter2017_Main1Elite' => 'The strange man in the bunny costume just went by. It seems you really helped him out. Thank you very much. I would have been totally helpless on my own.',
        'Easter2017_Main1EliteSub1' => 'About time! I don\'t have all day! Ahhh… that\'s good! I\'m sure I\'ll have my memory back in no time! Let\'s see… where am I?!',
        'Easter2017_Main1EliteSub2' => 'Thank god, he found something! Don\'t know what I would have done without him. Let\'s see, what does the hint tell us about the egg\'s location?!',
        'Easter2017_Main1EliteSub3' => 'Well, that\'s a lot of eggs, but I\'m not sure you got them all. Hmm… If any are missing, my Easter pal will be mad!',
        'Easter2017_Main1EliteSub4' => 'Yeah! That was good. Even better, I\'ve just remembered the location of the other eggs I lost. I\'ll mark it on the map... Look away, I cannot draw when someone stares at me!',
        'Easter2017_Main1EliteSub5' => 'Phew! All eggs together, finally! Man, I was really concerned my Easter pal would never talk to me again. Thanks buddy. Until next time.',
        'Easter2017_Main1High' => 'The strange man in the bunny costume just went by. It seems you really helped him out. Thank you very much. I would have been totally helpless.',
        'Easter2017_Main1HighSub1' => 'About time! I haven\'t got all day! Aaah… that\'s good! I am sure my memory will start coming back in no time! Let\'s see… where was I?!',
        'Easter2017_Main1HighSub2' => 'Thank God, he has found something! I don\'t know what I would have done without him. Let\'s see, what does the hint tell us about the egg\'s location?!',
        'Easter2017_Main1HighSub3' => 'Well, that\'s a lot of eggs, but I\'m not sure you got them all. Hmm… If any are missing, my Easter pal will be mad!',
        'Easter2017_Main1HighSub4' => 'Yeah! That was good. So, now I remember the location of the last eggs I lost. I\'ll draw it on this map... Look away, I can\'t draw with someone staring at me!',
        'Easter2017_Main1HighSub5' => 'Phew! All eggs together, finally! Man, I was really concerned my Easter pal would never talk to me again. Thanks buddy. Until next time.',
