        'Easter2017_Main1MiddleSub4' => 'Yeah! That was good. So, now I remember the location of the last eggs I lost. I\'ll draw it on this map... Look away, I can\'t draw with someone staring at me!',
        'Easter2017_Main1MiddleSub5' => 'Phew! All eggs together, finally! Man, I was really concerned my Easter pal would never talk to me again. Thanks buddy. Until next time.',
        'Easter2017_Main2Elite' => 'That rude person just stumbled away. Are you alright? It was so generous of you to help him. You saved the Easter feast with your efforts. Thank you very much.',
        'Easter2017_Main2EliteSub1' => 'OK. I will take this decent compensation and look the other way. So, how are you planning on getting my eggs back? What? You expected me to gather my lost eggs alone? That is the last straw!',
        'Easter2017_Main2EliteSub2' => 'I asked the settlers working in the mine, but they weren\'t sure. They said someone told them something about some eggs and painted it onto a sheet of paper, but I couldn\'t find any sign of him. Jeez…',
        'Easter2017_Main2EliteSub3' => 'Oh my god, that took you, like, years! Have you finally managed it? What do you mean I didn\'t do anything to help? I was sitting here and giving managerial advice! This was obviously a lot of work!',
        'Easter2017_Main2EliteSub4' => 'Oh great! You found them! Let me see! … What the… There are some missing! Are you kidding me? I hope you haven\'t kept some for yourself?',
        'Easter2017_Main2EliteSub5' => 'Nice - I think that\'s all of them. But with the good news comes some bad, too, as I\'m afraid I have to leave you now. I know you\'ll be sad when I\'m gone, but I\'m sure we\'ll meet again. Until then….',
        'Easter2017_Main2High' => 'That rude person just stumbled away. Are you alright? It was so generous of you to help him. You\'ve saved Easter with your efforts. Thank you very much.',
        'Easter2017_Main2HighSub1' => 'Oh well, I will take this reasonable compensation and forget about it. So tell me, what plan do you have to get my eggs back? What? Did you expect me to gather my lost eggs alone? It\'s the least you can do!',
        'Easter2017_Main2HighSub2' => 'I asked the settlers working in the mine, but they weren\'t sure. They said someone mentioned something about eggs, and painted something onto a sheet of paper, but I couldn\'t find any sign of the person. Jeez…',
        'Easter2017_Main2HighSub3' => 'Oh my God, I feel like this has taken years! Were you successful at last? What? You think I didn\'t make any effort at all? Look at me, I\'ve been busy sitting here providing advice! It\'s very tiring work, let me assure you!',
        'Easter2017_Main2HighSub4' => 'Oh great! You found them. Let me see! … What the… These are not all the eggs! Are you kidding me? I hope, you didn\'t keep some eggs for yourself?',
        'Easter2017_Main2HighSub5' => 'Nice. I think that\'s all of them. I have to leave you now. I know, you will be sad when I\'m gone, but I\'m sure you will get over it. Until then…',
