        'Easter2017_Main2MiddleSub2' => 'I asked the settlers working in the mine, but they weren\'t sure. They said someone mentioned something about eggs, and painted something onto a sheet of paper, but I couldn\'t find any sign of the person. Jeez…',
        'Easter2017_Main2MiddleSub3' => 'Oh my God, I feel like this has taken years! Were you successful at last? What? You think I didn\'t make any effort at all? Look at me, I\'ve been busy sitting here providing advice! It\'s very tiring work, let me assure you!',
        'Easter2017_Main2MiddleSub4' => 'Oh great! You found them. Let me see! … What the… These are not all the eggs! Are you kidding me? I hope, you didn\'t keep some eggs for yourself?',
        'Easter2017_Main2MiddleSub5' => 'Nice. I think that\'s all of them. I have to leave you now. I know, you will be sad when I\'m gone, but I\'m sure you will get over it. Until then…',
        'Easter2017_Main3Elite' => 'Well, that was different. I hope he\'ll do a good job for the Easter bunny. But you did what you had to do. I\'m sure he\'s grateful, even if he didn\'t seem it.',
        'Easter2017_Main3EliteSub0' => 'Great stuff! Now stick around, so I can tell you the story behind this whole adventure.',
        'Easter2017_Main3EliteSub1' => 'Nice, it worked! I\'d love to be able to see his face when he realizes his eggs are being stolen. Hey, don\'t look like that. He is a complete jerk after all!',
        'Easter2017_Main3EliteSub2' => 'The baker is incredibly satisfied with your help, and is ready to give us the coordinates for my cousin\'s other island. We\'re getting closer!',
        'Easter2017_Main3EliteSub3' => 'Oh, back already? So, how was it? Yes, yes, that was the last time we… borrowed eggs from him. Now, we have to rebuild my reputation with the Easter bunny… After some sleep!',
        'Easter2017_Main3EliteSub4' => 'Nice, the Easter bunny already recognized all the people gathered around me. That went pretty well! What? Oh, of course you can have the coins back. I was just about to give them back to you anyway! Honestly!',
        'Easter2017_Main3EliteSub5' => 'The Easter bunny was so choked up by my efforts, he decided to give me another chance. I\'m sure the Easter eggs he lost were also a reason. Well, thanks for your help buddy. I couldn\'t have done it without you… Well, maybe I could have, but it would have taken a little bit longer.',
        'Easter2017_Main3High' => 'That was really a strange visit. I hope he will do a good job for the Easter bunny. You, however, have already accomplished what needed to be done. I am sure he is grateful... even if he doesn\'t let it show.',
        'Easter2017_Main3HighSub0' => 'Great stuff! Now stick around a bit so I can tell you the story behind this whole adventure.',
        'Easter2017_Main3HighSub1' => 'Good, it worked. I would love to see his face when he realises his eggs have been stolen. Don\'t feel bad about it - he\'s a complete jerk!',
        'Easter2017_Main3HighSub2' => 'The baker is very satisfied with your help and is ready to give us the coordinates for my cousin\'s other island. We are getting closer!',
        'Easter2017_Main3HighSub3' => 'Oh, back already? So, how was it? Yes yes, now we can stop, er, \'borrowing\' eggs from him and start rebuilding my reputation with the Easter bunny… After some sleep!',
        'Easter2017_Main3HighSub4' => 'Great - the Easter bunny has already recognized all the people gathered around me. That went pretty well! What? Oh, of course, here are the coins back. I wanted to give them back to you from the beginning, honestly!',
        'Easter2017_Main3HighSub5' => 'Oh, the Easter bunny was so choked up by my efforts, he has decided to give me another chance. I\'m sure the missing Easter eggs also helped him decide. Well, thanks for your help buddy. Couldn\'t have done it without you… Well, maybe I could have, but it certainly would have taken longer.',
        'Easter2017_Main3Low' => 'That was really a strange visit. I hope he will do a good job for the Easter bunny. You, however, have already accomplished what needed to be done. I am sure he is grateful... even if he doesn\'t let it show.',
