        'Easter2017_Main3MiddleSub3' => 'Oh, back already? So, how was it? Yes yes, now we can stop, er, \'borrowing\' eggs from him and start rebuilding my reputation with the Easter bunny… After some sleep!',
        'Easter2017_Main3MiddleSub4' => 'Great - the Easter bunny has already recognized all the people gathered around me. That went pretty well! What? Oh, of course, here are the coins back. I wanted to give them back to you from the beginning, honestly!',
        'Easter2017_Main3MiddleSub5' => 'Oh, the Easter bunny was so choked up by my efforts, he has decided to give me another chance. I\'m sure the missing Easter eggs also helped him decide. Well, thanks for your help buddy. Couldn\'t have done it without you… Well, maybe I could have, but it certainly would have taken longer.',
        'Easter2017_Main4Elite' => 'Ah, how sweet it is to see someone beaten their own weapons. Even if I get the impression that his cousin isn\'t much better. Anyway, here are some Easter eggs for your help. Thank you.',
        'Easter2017_Main4EliteSub1' => 'Nice - this should be enough for now. Well then, let us begin our egg hunt. I already have an idea where we can begin.',
        'Easter2017_Main4EliteSub2' => 'Very good! We\'re off to a good start. But of course, this will not be enough to win the competition. I\'m sure there are more islands to find eggs on. And I know someone who can point us in the right direction.',
        'Easter2017_Main4EliteSub3' => 'Nice, that went fast! What? Yeah, I know it was pretty bad, but we managed, didn\'t we? So stop sulking! We still have work to do.',
        'Easter2017_Main4EliteSub4' => 'Hmm... There are fewer eggs than I expected here. With such a paltry amount we\'ll lose the competition for sure! We need more eggs!',
        'Easter2017_Main4EliteSub5' => 'Wow, look at these piles of eggs. Amazing! And just in time! I will now take the eggs and hurry to the appointment with my cousin. I can\'t wait to see his face! He he… What? Oh, OK… I\'ll leave you some eggs too. Until we meet again!',
        'Easter2017_Main4High' => 'Ah, it was nice seeing that person getting beaten with his own weapons, even if I got the impression his cousin isn\'t much better. Anyway, here - have some Easter eggs as thanks for your help.',
        'Easter2017_Main4HighSub1' => 'Right that should be enough for now. Well then, let\'s begin our egg hunt. I already have an idea where we can begin.',
        'Easter2017_Main4HighSub2' => 'Very good! This is a start at least, but it will not suffice to win the competition. I am sure there are more islands to find eggs on, and I know someone who can give us a location.',
        'Easter2017_Main4HighSub3' => 'Good, that was fast! What? Yeah, I know it went pretty bad, but we managed didn\'t we? So stop grieving - we still have work to do.',
        'Easter2017_Main4HighSub4' => 'Hmm... That was fewer eggs than expected. With only this amount I\'ll lose the competition for sure! We need more eggs!',
        'Easter2017_Main4HighSub5' => 'Wow, look at these piles of eggs. Amazing! And just in time. Now I am going to take the eggs and hurry to the appointment with my cousin. I can\'t wait to see his face! He he! What? OK, I\'ll leave you a few too. See you soon!',
