        'Easter2017_NewDelight_MainLvl16' => 'I just received a message from the boss. Apparently, all this stuff about him leaving was just a test to see if I was ready to become the boss myself someday, and he says that I\'m ready! Don\'t worry, though - you\'re not getting rid of me that easily...',
