        'Easter2017_PartyCrasher_Medium5Peace' => 'See? There\'s no need for violence at all! I had a nice talk with them, and took them some presents, and they\'ve agreed to leave us alone for today. Aren\'t you happy?',
        'Easter2017_PartyCrasher_Medium5War' => 'Ha! That\'ll teach them not to mess with our party! I\'m pretty sure they\'ll leave us alone for a while now.',
        'Easter2017_TutAchievementBuild_Sub02' => 'Really? You\'re going to place it there? Oh well, you\'ve been doing this for a while, so I\'ll let you have your artistic freedom this time. Let\'s move on!',
        'Easter2017_TutAchievements' => 'Ok then! Now that you know everything there is to know about the Easter building, let\'s get to work. Chop-chop!',
        'Easter2017_TutAchievements_Sub01' => 'Well done... you found the achievement button! Not everyone has the derring-do to find that... Here, take the Settlers University as a token of my appreciation.',
        'Easter2018plus_LevelRequirement' => 'Awesome! We can get started now!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1Elite' => 'The strange man in the bunny costume just went by. It seems you really helped him out. Thank you very much. I would have been totally helpless on my own.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1EliteSub1' => 'About time! I don\'t have all day! Ahhh… that\'s good! I\'m sure I\'ll have my memory back in no time! Let\'s see… where am I?!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1EliteSub2' => 'Thank god, he found something! Don\'t know what I would have done without him. Let\'s see, what does the hint tell us about the egg\'s location?!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1EliteSub3' => 'Well, that\'s a lot of eggs, but I\'m not sure you got them all. Hmm… If any are missing, my Easter pal will be mad!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1EliteSub4' => 'Yeah! That was good. Even better, I\'ve just remembered the location of the other eggs I lost. I\'ll mark it on the map... Look away, I cannot draw when someone stares at me!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1EliteSub5' => 'Phew! All eggs together, finally! Man, I was really concerned my Easter pal would never talk to me again. Thanks buddy. Until next time.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1High' => 'The strange man in the bunny costume just went by. It seems you really helped him out. Thank you very much. I would have been totally helpless.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1HighSub1' => 'About time! I haven\'t got all day! Aaah… that\'s good! I am sure my memory will start coming back in no time! Let\'s see… where was I?!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1HighSub2' => 'Thank God, he has found something! I don\'t know what I would have done without him. Let\'s see, what does the hint tell us about the egg\'s location?!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1HighSub3' => 'Well, that\'s a lot of eggs, but I\'m not sure you got them all. Hmm… If any are missing, my Easter pal will be mad!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1HighSub4' => 'Yeah! That was good. So, now I remember the location of the last eggs I lost. I\'ll draw it on this map... Look away, I can\'t draw with someone staring at me!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1HighSub5' => 'Phew! All eggs together, finally! Man, I was really concerned my Easter pal would never talk to me again. Thanks buddy. Until next time.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1Low' => 'The strange man in the bunny costume just went by. It seems you really helped him out. Thank you very much. I would have been totally helpless.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1LowSub1' => 'About time! I haven\'t got all day! Aaah… that\'s good! I am sure my memory will start coming back in no time! Let\'s see… where was I?!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1LowSub2' => 'Thank God, he has found something! I don\'t know what I would have done without him. Let\'s see, what does the hint tell us about the egg\'s location?!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1LowSub3' => 'Well, that\'s a lot of eggs, but I\'m not sure you got them all. Hmm… If any are missing, my Easter pal will be mad!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1LowSub4' => 'Yeah! That was good. So, now I remember the location of the last eggs I lost. I\'ll draw it on this map... Look away, I can\'t draw with someone staring at me!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1LowSub5' => 'Phew! All eggs together, finally! Man, I was really concerned my Easter pal would never talk to me again. Thanks buddy. Until next time.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1Middle' => 'The strange man in the bunny costume just went by. It seems you really helped him out. Thank you very much. I would have been totally helpless.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1MiddleSub1' => 'About time! I haven\'t got all day! Aaah… that\'s good! I am sure my memory will start coming back in no time! Let\'s see… where was I?!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1MiddleSub2' => 'Thank God, he has found something! I don\'t know what I would have done without him. Let\'s see, what does the hint tell us about the egg\'s location?!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1MiddleSub3' => 'Well, that\'s a lot of eggs, but I\'m not sure you got them all. Hmm… If any are missing, my Easter pal will be mad!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1MiddleSub4' => 'Yeah! That was good. So, now I remember the location of the last eggs I lost. I\'ll draw it on this map... Look away, I can\'t draw with someone staring at me!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1MiddleSub5' => 'Phew! All eggs together, finally! Man, I was really concerned my Easter pal would never talk to me again. Thanks buddy. Until next time.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2Elite' => 'That rude person just stumbled away. Are you alright? It was so generous of you to help him. You saved the Easter feast with your efforts. Thank you very much.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2EliteSub1' => 'OK. I will take this decent compensation and look the other way. So, how are you planning on getting my eggs back? What? You expected me to gather my lost eggs alone? That is the last straw!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2EliteSub2' => 'I asked the settlers working in the mine, but they weren\'t sure. They said someone told them something about some eggs and painted it onto a sheet of paper, but I couldn\'t find any sign of him. Jeez…',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2EliteSub3' => 'Oh my god, that took you, like, years! Have you finally managed it? What do you mean I didn\'t do anything to help? I was sitting here and giving managerial advice! This was obviously a lot of work!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2EliteSub4' => 'Oh great! You found them! Let me see! … What the… There are some missing! Are you kidding me? I hope you haven\'t kept some for yourself?',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2EliteSub5' => 'Nice - I think that\'s all of them. But with the good news comes some bad, too, as I\'m afraid I have to leave you now. I know you\'ll be sad when I\'m gone, but I\'m sure we\'ll meet again. Until then….',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2High' => 'That rude person just stumbled away. Are you alright? It was so generous of you to help him. You\'ve saved Easter with your efforts. Thank you very much.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2HighSub1' => 'Oh well, I will take this reasonable compensation and forget about it. So tell me, what plan do you have to get my eggs back? What? Did you expect me to gather my lost eggs alone? It\'s the least you can do!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2HighSub2' => 'I asked the settlers working in the mine, but they weren\'t sure. They said someone mentioned something about eggs, and painted something onto a sheet of paper, but I couldn\'t find any sign of the person. Jeez…',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2HighSub3' => 'Oh my God, I feel like this has taken years! Were you successful at last? What? You think I didn\'t make any effort at all? Look at me, I\'ve been busy sitting here providing advice! It\'s very tiring work, let me assure you!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2HighSub4' => 'Oh great! You found them. Let me see! … What the… These are not all the eggs! Are you kidding me? I hope, you didn\'t keep some eggs for yourself?',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2HighSub5' => 'Nice. I think that\'s all of them. I have to leave you now. I know, you will be sad when I\'m gone, but I\'m sure you will get over it. Until then…',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2Low' => 'That rude person just stumbled away. Are you alright? It was so generous of you to help him. You\'ve saved Easter with your efforts. Thank you very much.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2LowSub1' => 'Oh well, I will take this reasonable compensation and forget about it. So tell me, what plan do you have to get my eggs back? What? Did you expect me to gather my lost eggs alone? It\'s the least you can do!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2LowSub2' => 'I asked the settlers working in the mine, but they weren\'t sure. They said someone mentioned something about eggs, and painted something onto a sheet of paper, but I couldn\'t find any sign of the person. Jeez…',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2LowSub3' => 'Oh my God, I feel like this has taken years! Were you successful at last? What? You think I didn\'t make any effort at all? Look at me, I\'ve been busy sitting here providing advice! It\'s very tiring work, let me assure you!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2LowSub4' => 'Oh great! You found them. Let me see! … What the… These are not all the eggs! Are you kidding me? I hope, you didn\'t keep some eggs for yourself?',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2LowSub5' => 'Nice. I think that\'s all of them. I have to leave you now. I know, you will be sad when I\'m gone, but I\'m sure you will get over it. Until then…',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2Middle' => 'That rude person just stumbled away. Are you alright? It was so generous of you to help him. You\'ve saved Easter with your efforts. Thank you very much.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2MiddleSub1' => 'Oh well, I will take this reasonable compensation and forget about it. So tell me, what plan do you have to get my eggs back? What? Did you expect me to gather my lost eggs alone? It\'s the least you can do!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2MiddleSub2' => 'I asked the settlers working in the mine, but they weren\'t sure. They said someone mentioned something about eggs, and painted something onto a sheet of paper, but I couldn\'t find any sign of the person. Jeez…',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2MiddleSub3' => 'Oh my God, I feel like this has taken years! Were you successful at last? What? You think I didn\'t make any effort at all? Look at me, I\'ve been busy sitting here providing advice! It\'s very tiring work, let me assure you!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2MiddleSub4' => 'Oh great! You found them. Let me see! … What the… These are not all the eggs! Are you kidding me? I hope, you didn\'t keep some eggs for yourself?',
        'Easter2018plus_Main2MiddleSub5' => 'Nice. I think that\'s all of them. I have to leave you now. I know, you will be sad when I\'m gone, but I\'m sure you will get over it. Until then…',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3Elite' => 'Well, that was different. I hope he\'ll do a good job for the Easter bunny. But you did what you had to do. I\'m sure he\'s grateful, even if he didn\'t seem it.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3EliteSub0' => 'Great stuff! Now stick around, so I can tell you the story behind this whole adventure.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3EliteSub1' => 'Nice, it worked! I\'d love to be able to see his face when he realizes his eggs are being stolen. Hey, don\'t look like that. He is a complete jerk after all!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3EliteSub2' => 'The baker is incredibly satisfied with your help, and is ready to give us the coordinates for my cousin\'s other island. We\'re getting closer!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3EliteSub3' => 'Oh, back already? So, how was it? Yes, yes, that was the last time we… borrowed eggs from him. Now, we have to rebuild my reputation with the Easter bunny… After some sleep!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3EliteSub4' => 'Nice, the Easter bunny already recognized all the people gathered around me. That went pretty well! What? Oh, of course you can have the coins back. I was just about to give them back to you anyway! Honestly!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3EliteSub5' => 'The Easter bunny was so choked up by my efforts, he decided to give me another chance. I\'m sure the Easter eggs he lost were also a reason. Well, thanks for your help buddy. I couldn\'t have done it without you… Well, maybe I could have, but it would have taken a little bit longer.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3High' => 'That was really a strange visit. I hope he will do a good job for the Easter bunny. You, however, have already accomplished what needed to be done. I am sure he is grateful... even if he doesn\'t let it show.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3HighSub0' => 'Great stuff! Now stick around a bit so I can tell you the story behind this whole adventure.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3HighSub1' => 'Good, it worked. I would love to see his face when he realises his eggs have been stolen. Don\'t feel bad about it - he\'s a complete jerk!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3HighSub2' => 'The baker is very satisfied with your help and is ready to give us the coordinates for my cousin\'s other island. We are getting closer!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3HighSub3' => 'Oh, back already? So, how was it? Yes yes, now we can stop, er, \'borrowing\' eggs from him and start rebuilding my reputation with the Easter bunny… After some sleep!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3HighSub4' => 'Great - the Easter bunny has already recognized all the people gathered around me. That went pretty well! What? Oh, of course, here are the coins back. I wanted to give them back to you from the beginning, honestly!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3HighSub5' => 'Oh, the Easter bunny was so choked up by my efforts, he has decided to give me another chance. I\'m sure the missing Easter eggs also helped him decide. Well, thanks for your help buddy. Couldn\'t have done it without you… Well, maybe I could have, but it certainly would have taken longer.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3Low' => 'That was really a strange visit. I hope he will do a good job for the Easter bunny. You, however, have already accomplished what needed to be done. I am sure he is grateful... even if he doesn\'t let it show.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3LowSub0' => 'Great stuff! Now stick around a bit so I can tell you the story behind this whole adventure.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3LowSub1' => 'Good, it worked. I would love to see his face when he realises his eggs have been stolen. Don\'t feel bad about it - he\'s a complete jerk!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3LowSub2' => 'The baker is very satisfied with your help and is ready to give us the coordinates for my cousin\'s other island. We are getting closer!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3LowSub3' => 'Oh, back already? So, how was it? Yes yes, now we can stop, er, \'borrowing\' eggs from him and start rebuilding my reputation with the Easter bunny… After some sleep!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3LowSub4' => 'Great - the Easter bunny has already recognized all the people gathered around me. That went pretty well! What? Oh, of course, here are the coins back. I wanted to give them back to you from the beginning, honestly!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3LowSub5' => 'Oh, the Easter bunny was so choked up by my efforts, he has decided to give me another chance. I\'m sure the missing Easter eggs also helped him decide. Well, thanks for your help buddy. Couldn\'t have done it without you… Well, maybe I could have, but it certainly would have taken longer.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3Middle' => 'That was really a strange visit. I hope he will do a good job for the Easter bunny. You, however, have already accomplished what needed to be done. I am sure he is grateful... even if he doesn\'t let it show.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3MiddleSub0' => 'Great stuff! Now stick around a bit so I can tell you the story behind this whole adventure.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3MiddleSub1' => 'Good, it worked. I would love to see his face when he realises his eggs have been stolen. Don\'t feel bad about it - he\'s a complete jerk!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3MiddleSub2' => 'The baker is very satisfied with your help and is ready to give us the coordinates for my cousin\'s other island. We are getting closer!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3MiddleSub3' => 'Oh, back already? So, how was it? Yes yes, now we can stop, er, \'borrowing\' eggs from him and start rebuilding my reputation with the Easter bunny… After some sleep!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3MiddleSub4' => 'Great - the Easter bunny has already recognized all the people gathered around me. That went pretty well! What? Oh, of course, here are the coins back. I wanted to give them back to you from the beginning, honestly!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main3MiddleSub5' => 'Oh, the Easter bunny was so choked up by my efforts, he has decided to give me another chance. I\'m sure the missing Easter eggs also helped him decide. Well, thanks for your help buddy. Couldn\'t have done it without you… Well, maybe I could have, but it certainly would have taken longer.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4Elite' => 'Ah, how sweet it is to see someone beaten their own weapons. Even if I get the impression that his cousin isn\'t much better. Anyway, here are some Easter eggs for your help. Thank you.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4EliteSub1' => 'Nice - this should be enough for now. Well then, let us begin our egg hunt. I already have an idea where we can begin.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4EliteSub2' => 'Very good! We\'re off to a good start. But of course, this will not be enough to win the competition. I\'m sure there are more islands to find eggs on. And I know someone who can point us in the right direction.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4EliteSub3' => 'Nice, that went fast! What? Yeah, I know it was pretty bad, but we managed, didn\'t we? So stop sulking! We still have work to do.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4EliteSub4' => 'Hmm... There are fewer eggs than I expected here. With such a paltry amount we\'ll lose the competition for sure! We need more eggs!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4EliteSub5' => 'Wow, look at these piles of eggs. Amazing! And just in time! I will now take the eggs and hurry to the appointment with my cousin. I can\'t wait to see his face! He he… What? Oh, OK… I\'ll leave you some eggs too. Until we meet again!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4High' => 'Ah, it was nice seeing that person getting beaten with his own weapons, even if I got the impression his cousin isn\'t much better. Anyway, here - have some Easter eggs as thanks for your help.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4HighSub1' => 'Right that should be enough for now. Well then, let\'s begin our egg hunt. I already have an idea where we can begin.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4HighSub2' => 'Very good! This is a start at least, but it will not suffice to win the competition. I am sure there are more islands to find eggs on, and I know someone who can give us a location.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4HighSub3' => 'Good, that was fast! What? Yeah, I know it went pretty bad, but we managed didn\'t we? So stop grieving - we still have work to do.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4HighSub4' => 'Hmm... That was fewer eggs than expected. With only this amount I\'ll lose the competition for sure! We need more eggs!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4HighSub5' => 'Wow, look at these piles of eggs. Amazing! And just in time. Now I am going to take the eggs and hurry to the appointment with my cousin. I can\'t wait to see his face! He he! What? OK, I\'ll leave you a few too. See you soon!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4Low' => 'Ah, it was nice seeing that person getting beaten with his own weapons, even if I got the impression his cousin isn\'t much better. Anyway, here - have some Easter eggs as thanks for your help.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4LowSub1' => 'Right that should be enough for now. Well then, let\'s begin our egg hunt. I already have an idea where we can begin.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4LowSub2' => 'Very good! This is a start at least, but it will not suffice to win the competition. I am sure there are more islands to find eggs on, and I know someone who can give us a location.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4LowSub3' => 'Good, that was fast! What? Yeah, I know it went pretty bad, but we managed didn\'t we? So stop grieving - we still have work to do.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4LowSub4' => 'Hmm... That was fewer eggs than expected. With only this amount I\'ll lose the competition for sure! We need more eggs!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4LowSub5' => 'Wow, look at these piles of eggs. Amazing! And just in time. Now I am going to take the eggs and hurry to the appointment with my cousin. I can\'t wait to see his face! He he! What? OK, I\'ll leave you a few too. See you soon!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4Middle' => 'Ah, it was nice seeing that person getting beaten with his own weapons, even if I got the impression his cousin isn\'t much better. Anyway, here - have some Easter eggs as thanks for your help.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4MiddleSub1' => 'Right that should be enough for now. Well then, let\'s begin our egg hunt. I already have an idea where we can begin.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4MiddleSub2' => 'Very good! This is a start at least, but it will not suffice to win the competition. I am sure there are more islands to find eggs on, and I know someone who can give us a location.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4MiddleSub3' => 'Good, that was fast! What? Yeah, I know it went pretty bad, but we managed didn\'t we? So stop grieving - we still have work to do.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4MiddleSub4' => 'Hmm... That was fewer eggs than expected. With only this amount I\'ll lose the competition for sure! We need more eggs!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main4MiddleSub5' => 'Wow, look at these piles of eggs. Amazing! And just in time. Now I am going to take the eggs and hurry to the appointment with my cousin. I can\'t wait to see his face! He he! What? OK, I\'ll leave you a few too. See you soon!',
        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_MainLvl16' => 'I just received a message from the boss. Apparently, all this stuff about him leaving was just a test to see if I was ready to become the boss myself someday, and he says that I\'m ready! Don\'t worry, though - you\'re not getting rid of me that easily...',
