        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_Sub3_Lvl16' => 'I\'m back - and I bring terrible news! The boss is gone! All that was left was a note at his desk that said "I\'m skipping Easter this year. I need a vacation". How could he? He has ONE job!',
        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_Sub3_Lvl26' => 'I\'m back - and I bring terrible news! The boss is gone! All that was left was a note at his desk that said "I\'m skipping Easter this year. I need a vacation". How could he? He has ONE job!',
