        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_Sub6_Lvl16' => 'Oh wow, I tried just a bite and I nearly had a sugar rush! However, he assures me that no additional sugar was used. What kind of witchcraft is this?',
        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_Sub6_Lvl26' => 'Oh wow, I tried just a bite and I nearly had a sugar rush! However, he assures me that no additional sugar was used. What kind of witchcraft is this?',
