        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_Sub7_Lvl16' => 'Yes! With Mr. Croix Sant\'s treat, we can be sure that people\'s spirits will remain high for the rest of Easter! Yeah, you heard that right. He has earned the privilege of me using his name.',
        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_Sub7_Lvl26' => 'Yes! With Mr. Croix Sant\'s treat, we can be sure that people\'s spirits will remain high for the rest of Easter! Yeah, you heard that right. He has earned the privilege of me using his name.',
        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_Sub7_Lvl36' => 'Yes! With Mr. Croix Sant\'s treat, we can be sure that people\'s spirits will remain high for the rest of Easter! Yeah, you heard that right. He has earned the privilege of me using his name.',
