        'Easter2018plus_PartyCrasher_BossGrind' => 'These guys sure are persistent! I have a feeling they won\'t stay quiet for very long. If we\'ve learnt anything from these past few days, it\'s that I\'m sure they\'ll come back tomorrow as well!',
        'Easter2018plus_PartyCrasher_BossGrindPeace' => 'See? There\'s no need for violence at all! I had a nice talk with them, and took them some presents, and they\'ve agreed to leave us alone for today. Aren\'t you happy?',
        'Easter2018plus_PartyCrasher_BossGrindWar' => 'Ha! That\'ll teach them not to mess with our party! I\'m pretty sure they\'ll leave us alone for a while now.',
