        'Easter2018plus_PartyCrasher_LendAHand' => 'That\'s it! Everyone needs to know how horrible this mindless violence is. For helping me convey such a wonderful message, I\'d say you deserve a reward.',
        'Easter2018plus_PartyCrasher_MainEasy1' => 'Well! As the saying goes, "all\'s well that ends well", am I right? Let\'s hope the party crashers don\'t bother us for a while.',
