        'Easter2018plus_PartyCrasher_Medium4War' => 'Ha! That\'ll teach them not to mess with our party! I\'m pretty sure they\'ll leave us alone for a while now.',
        'Easter2018plus_PartyCrasher_Medium5Peace' => 'See? There\'s no need for violence at all! I had a nice talk with them, and took them some presents, and they\'ve agreed to leave us alone for today. Aren\'t you happy?',
        'Easter2018plus_PartyCrasher_Medium5War' => 'Ha! That\'ll teach them not to mess with our party! I\'m pretty sure they\'ll leave us alone for a while now.',
        'Easter2018plus_TutAchievementBuild_Sub02' => 'Really? You\'re going to place it there? Oh well, you\'ve been doing this for a while, so I\'ll let you have your artistic freedom this time. Let\'s move on!',
        'Easter2018plus_TutAchievements' => 'Ok then! Now that you know everything there is to know about the Easter building, let\'s get to work. Chop-chop!',
        'Easter2018plus_TutAchievements_Sub01' => 'Well done... you found the achievement button... Not the first, but a trendsetter nonetheless... Here, take this special Easter building as a token of my appreciation.',
        'Easter_Event_2015_Buff_Adventure_MainQuest' => 'Great! Now the chickens can relax and hatch their eggs. Here\'s a small reward for your efforts.',
        'Easter_Event_2015_Buff_Adventure_SubQuest01' => 'Good job! The nests are free, and waiting for the chickens to come home to roost.',
        'Easter_Event_2015_Buff_Adventure_SubQuest02' => 'Great, you caught them all! Give them to me, and I\'ll take them to another island.',
        'Easter_Event_2015_Buff_Adventure_SubQuest03' => 'You found all the chickens. Amazing! They\'re usually so good at hiding...',
        'Easter_Event_2015_Buff_Adventure_SubQuest04' => 'Great work! The chickens are hatching their eggs nicely again.',
        'Easter_hunt1' => 'Great - now keep close and we\'ll proceed with the next stage of our plan!',
        'Easter_hunt2' => 'Marvellous! 
Now all we need to do is wait and reap the fruits of their labour.
Be mindful though - your friends might be doing the same to you!',
        'EconomicLong1' => 'Look at them. Doesn’t it bring you a tear to your eyes, seeing them so happy? It sure does to me… *sniffle*',
        'EconomicLong2' => 'Splendid! I know grout is hard to come by, but using it wisely may boost your income enormously. I’m glad you followed my advice.',
        'EconomicLong3' => 'Oh, thank you for your generosity! My cousin Otto has returned home, and told me that if it wasn’t for you they would have been captured by the bandits. You saved their skins!',
        'EconomicLong4' => 'Nice work! I can’t say I like the idea of someone spreading stuff around the island every day, but I won’t deny that the results of this can be very useful to us!',
        'EconomicMedium1' => 'It’s nice to have a change of scenery every now and then. Scenarios are a lot more relaxed than other adventures, wouldn’t you agree? Although the settlers working at the workyards don’t seem to think so...',
        'EconomicMedium2' => 'Brilliant! These weapons will make our armies substantially stronger. Those bandits won’t stand a chance!',
        'EconomicMedium3' => 'We may not have much need for coins right now, but some other lords desperately require them for their building upgrades. Why not offer some of our spare cash as a trade?',
        'EconomicMedium4' => 'Now this is what I call production! If we can keep this up, we\'ll have enough platinum to last an age! Try to keep this up for as long as you can, and make the most of our precious, rare platinum ore!',
        'EconomicShort1' => 'Fantastic! This granite will definitely help our expansion efforts. And in the worst-case scenario, we can always sell it on the market for a good deal.',
        'EconomicShort2' => 'These buffs are exactly what we need to keep our production going at full speed. Great work!',
        'EconomicShort3' => 'Very good! Remember to always keep your specialists busy searching for deposits, or refilling them to keep your production balanced!',
        'EconomicShort4' => 'Ah yes. I can already see the fine weapons and the saddlecloth that will come out of this shiny platinum. Good work retrieving it.',
        'ExpDefeatLastBoss' => 'Congratulations! By defeating the Map Boss, we took this island from our opponent and can gather its valuable resources from now on.

But be aware: Our victory will be envied by others, who might want to steal it for themselves. We should build up some defences to keep them away!',
        'ExpDefeatMeleeCamp' => 'Defeat Your First Bandit Encampment',
        'ExpDefeatSectorBoss' => 'Great, our tactics worked! The leader of this sector has been defeated!',
        'ExpUseDistract' => 'Look at them run! Great work! Now the sector is clear, we can move our marshals forward.',
        'FinalGuildFest_OpenPanel2' => 'Guild Fest is over, now take a bow,
See you next time, we’ll top this somehow!',
        'GarrunQ1' => 'The first stage of our assault is complete. Time to deliver the final coup!',
        'GarrunQ2' => 'Garrun is defeated and stands at your mercy. Time to release the fluffy-tailed prisoners.',
        'GuiDaiANobleArgument' => 'We did our very best, and it seems that we managed to calm spirits down. I think we did a pretty good job - perhaps we should consider starting an anger management group?',
        'GuiDaiANobleArgumentSub1' => 'There! We managed to calm them down. I can\'t say it was an easy task…',
        'GuiDaiANobleArgumentSub2' => 'I hope the lords are happy now. Getting that gold was not an easy task.',
        'GuiDaiANobleArgumentSub3' => 'Indeed, the best breed of horses I have seen for a long time! Very good!',
        'GuiDaiANobleArgumentSub4' => 'There! With this many sausages we could feed an entire army. And their families. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiANobleArgumentSub5' => 'Owning that many swords makes us feel safer, does it not? Good work!',
        'GuiDaiANobleArgumentSub6' => 'Well done! The lord has shut his mouth and returned home!',
        'GuiDaiANobleArgumentSub7' => 'Huh! Who\'d have thought noblemen and women would know their way around a crossbow? I tried to convince some of them to join our brave army, but they just laughed at me. Well, if they\'re laughing, at least they\'re not arguing!',
        'GuiDaiANobleArgumentSub8' => 'When our cavalry reached the area, the racket ceased immediately and there was absolute silence. Ah, it felt so peaceful... I hope this doesn\'t become a habit, though. I hate sending the army in to deal with petty situations...',
        'GuiDaiATemporaryTreasure' => 'Using all the map pieces we finally found the treasure, but when we… err… opened it… all we found was some pink underwear. Yes, well, at least the old pirate had a sense of humor. He must be laughing in his grave right now.',
        'GuiDaiATemporaryTreasureSub1' => 'Our explorer came back and has found a pair of leather boots. Black leather. They look piratey enough. And there was a piece of a map inside! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiATemporaryTreasureSub2' => 'Well, the explorer found an old cave along the northern coast! Near a small abandoned camp he found this eye patch. There is a piece of an old map glued on the back of it! Better than nothing, I guess.',
        'GuiDaiATemporaryTreasureSub3' => 'The explorer has returned, and guess what?! Near the beach, he found a hook! A hand hook, or whatever you call them! And there was a piece from a map skewered on it! Great clue!',
        'GuiDaiATemporaryTreasureSub4' => 'Er, our explorer has returned and found this pirate flag! And folded inside the flag was a piece of a map! Good!',
        'GuiDaiATemporaryTreasureSub5' => 'Our explorer has brought back a piece of a map! He claims a parrot landed on his shoulder while he was eating a cracker and traded the map piece with him. Hmm... Let\'s concentrate on the map piece instead of that crazy story.',
        'GuiDaiATemporaryTreasureSub6' => 'The explorer has come back! He found an old cannon ball, and under it there was this map piece! Great!',
        'GuiDaiATemporaryTreasureSub7' => 'It seems my intel may be wrong... The treasure seems to be on another island. Looking on the bright side, though, we gained valuable experience and useful loot on this adventure, wouldn\'t you agree?',
        'GuiDaiATemporaryTreasureSub8' => 'The knights have finished their training. Not only do they now know how to fight like a pirate - they know how to talk like one too. I can\'t understand a word they\'re saying! Who\'s Davy Jones and what\'s in his locker?',
        'GuiDaiAWallOfSwords' => 'I\'ve heard about a lot of weird things in my life, but this wall of swords…? Well it seems possible to build one. At least we can say that we played a large part in its creation.',
        'GuiDaiAWallOfSwordsSub1' => 'It seems that the Maiden was with them! The iron ore is ready to be delivered! Thank the Maiden!',
        'GuiDaiAWallOfSwordsSub2' => 'Well done! We took the steel from the smelters as soon as they were done. We don\'t need more statues.',
        'GuiDaiAWallOfSwordsSub3' => 'Yes, our blacksmiths are ready! Good work! Your guild is proud of you!',
        'GuiDaiAWallOfSwordsSub4' => 'Very good! I know it must have been a hard task, but you and your men did it!',
        'GuiDaiAWallOfSwordsSub5' => 'You got the coins? I\'m surprised! Well done!',
        'GuiDaiAWallOfSwordsSub6' => 'Yes, very good work indeed!',
        'GuiDaiAWallofSwordsSub7' => 'Great work! The king will be pleased to know that our soldiers honour the memory of their comrades by carrying on their duties.',
        'GuiDaiAWallofSwordsSub8' => 'The horses are ready for the parade. Everybody knows their part, and the general even wanted to give a speech in their honour. Everything is on-track thanks to the combined efforts of our guild!',
        'GuiDaiAWildBet' => 'Well, regardless of who won the bet, we did our best! We\'ve even received some crates filled with rewards! Good job!',
        'GuiDaiAWildBetSub1' => 'There! Now our foresters can start planting the trees and make our animals a big and cozy forest!',
        'GuiDaiAWildBetSub2' => 'We just need to stack the wheat, and some of our hunters will find a good place for it!',
        'GuiDaiAWildBetSub3' => 'Very good! Now we\'re definitely going to have enough wheat!',
        'GuiDaiAWildBetSub4' => 'Yes, good work! The animals will love the watering pools if we keep them clear!',
        'GuiDaiAWildBetSub5' => 'With the information provided by your scout, we know exactly where the animals will dwell!',
        'GuiDaiAWildBetSub6' => 'Our men can now start creating the feeding garden! Good work providing the hardwood!',
        'GuiDaiAWildBetSub7' => 'The hunter seems confused! This should buy the animals a bit more time to roam free. We can always move him back to his previous spot later!',
        'GuiDaiAWildBetSub8' => 'Excellent. This stable will hold plenty of horses, and is perfect for helping us win the bet! I hope our guild mates are doing as well as we are!',
        'GuiDaiAirMail' => 'The pigeon coop seems to be finished! Who should I write to first? My mother?',
        'GuiDaiAirMailSub1' => 'The planks are the best we could find! Let\'s hope they will make a nice coop!',
        'GuiDaiAirMailSub2' => 'The recruits had a lot of fun playing with the pigeons, but eventually all the birds flew away.',
        'GuiDaiAirMailSub3' => 'The general returned with the seeds!',
        'GuiDaiAirMailSub4' => 'The water system works perfectly!',
        'GuiDaiAirMailSub5' => 'The bread was delivered. If I were him, I wouldn\'t feed the pigeons too much - they\'ll turn into balloons!',
        'GuiDaiAirMailSub6' => 'The longbows are at the coop. The bird-master can now protect himself from predators.',
        'GuiDaiAirmailSub7' => 'It\'s been a while since I saw so many deer in the forest. The birds noticed it too, they look a lot happier!',
        'GuiDaiAirmailSub8' => 'The new cage is finished, and the birds are currently transferring to their new home. The bird trainer assures us this is perfect for them. Who are we to argue with that, eh?',
        'GuiDaiAllTheShinyRoads' => 'The noble road will be a long and shiny one. We did a great job providing everything we could! The King is most satisfied with us, and he\'s sent us a present!',
        'GuiDaiAllTheShinyRoadsSub1' => 'This stone is really fine. I think the road builders will be extremely satisfied.',
        'GuiDaiAllTheShinyRoadsSub2' => 'I bet they\'ll be licking every one of their fingers after eating the food we\'ve sent them!',
        'GuiDaiAllTheShinyRoadsSub3' => 'Right, we have the required amount of marble ready to ship! Very good job!',
        'GuiDaiAllTheShinyRoadsSub4' => 'They loved the brew! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiAllTheShinyRoadsSub5' => 'You see? I told you they\'d be really happy and work faster!',
        'GuiDaiAllTheShinyRoadsSub6' => 'Our men are ready to leave for Capital Island and be part of the team to build the new road!',
        'GuiDaiAllTheShinyRoadsSub7' => 'The signs are ready, but whoever wrote the names of the towns has got them all wrong! We\'ll have to take them to the cartographer so he can fix this little problem. Oops!',
        'GuiDaiAllTheShinyRoadsSub8' => 'These are really neat chips. I wonder if the king knows that platinum is actually a bit too valuable to be used for things like this? Maybe we should have suggested he made the chips out of a cheaper material instead... Oh well!',
        'GuiDaiBigCityLife' => 'Our island has more homes now, and the King believes we\'re going to grow bigger in the next few years! Great work!',
        'GuiDaiBigCityLifeSub1' => 'We now have the tools to build the new houses! Great work!',
        'GuiDaiBigCityLifeSub2' => 'We now have enough hardwood planks now! Let\'s make those beds!',
        'GuiDaiBigCityLifeSub3' => 'Well I hope the architect will be pleased now! You\'ve done a great deed!',
        'GuiDaiBigCityLifeSub4' => 'Beautiful wells next to beautiful houses! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiBigCityLifeSub5' => 'There! Looks like our settlers are really happy about the food! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiBigCityLifeSub6' => 'The decorated residences are looking really good! Our high society members will be most pleased!',
        'GuiDaiBigCityLifeSub7' => 'Well, even if this doesn\'t draw the scholars in, just look at how many fancy books we have! In fact, I quite fancy one myself. Wait, how much?! Think I might pass after all...',
        'GuiDaiBigCityLifeSub8' => 'The carriages are done, but I still don\'t understand why they... Oh, wait... I understand now. I stepped in some horse droppings. Ew.',
        'GuiDaiBurriedVolcano' => 'The hole seems to be sealed off for good. Or until somebody comes and tries to open it, but who would do that, ha ha?!',
        'GuiDaiBurriedVolcanoSub1' => 'Yes! The plank road is finished! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiBurriedVolcanoSub2' => 'The copper ore is going to be used to make the cauldrons! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiBurriedVolcanoSub3' => 'Good work providing the marble!',
        'GuiDaiBurriedVolcanoSub4' => 'The new iron swords are going to be useful, I bet!',
        'GuiDaiBurriedVolcanoSub5' => 'The soldiers are ready to help out!',
        'GuiDaiBurriedVolcanoSub6' => 'I feel safer now! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiBurriedVolcanoSub7' => 'Turns out that our plan didn\'t make much of a difference. The water was evaporating before it reached the bottom of the volcano! At least we managed to make some delicious sausages over at the volcano!',
        'GuiDaiBurriedVolcanoSub8' => 'We mixed a bunch of saltpetre with herbs and threw it inside. It seemed to work a bit, so just to test a theory, we threw some gunpowder inside too. Big mistake. Nevertheless, it seems to have improved our situation a little.',
        'GuiDaiDaggerIsland' => 'We have just received the reports! We\'ve wiped out all the bandits, but sadly, it seems that Dagger Island was not their main base! We need to keep looking! The King has sent us something though!',
        'GuiDaiDaggerIslandSub1' => 'Yes that lot should suffice! Using those iron swords, they\'ll be able to defend us for a while, if need be. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiDaggerIslandSub2' => 'He loved the fish and the front line is ready for duty! Great work!',
        'GuiDaiDaggerIslandSub3' => 'The bowmen are ready for battle!',
        'GuiDaiDaggerIslandSub4' => 'The cavalry seem to be fit and ready! We\'re off to battle soon!',
        'GuiDaiDaggerIslandSub5' => 'There! We will use the cannons only if we need too! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiDaggerIslandSub6' => 'The bag was delivered and the captain is already friendlier. Bah, that rat.',
        'GuiDaiDaggerIslandSub7' => 'Excellent! We stopped the reinforcements from coming to Dagger Island and made the Nords think twice about helping the bandits again. Now it\'s up to the rest of the guild to finish the job!',
        'GuiDaiDaggerIslandSub8' => 'We caught a couple of bandit scouts trying to reach the thieves. Or should I say we caught a "bandit ambassador"? Do bandits even have ambassadors? Anyway, I\'m glad that my hunch was right, and we dealt with it quickly.',
        'GuiDaiDarkLands' => 'The people that live in the Dark Lands will be happy to see how many nice gifts they\'ve received. I really hope this will help them live an easier life.',
        'GuiDaiDarkLandsSub1' => 'The stone will be used to build or reinforce shelters!',
        'GuiDaiDarkLandsSub2' => 'The hardwood is ready!',
        'GuiDaiDarkLandsSub3' => 'Our friend will surely return the favor!',
        'GuiDaiDarkLandsSub4' => 'The militia is ready and dressed accordingly!',
        'GuiDaiDarkLandsSub5' => 'Done! Great work!',
        'GuiDaiDarkLandsSub6' => 'The transport ship has been fixed! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiDarkLandsSub7' => 'The leader of the dark lands\' authorities was very pleased with the experience, and thinks that with this newfound knowledge he can help restore order there. It\'s all thanks to your tactical thinking - great work!',
        'GuiDaiDarkLandsSub8' => 'I see some sprouts! It\'ll be a while before we see if the seeds can help the people here, but it\'s definitely one step in the right direction.',
        'GuiDaiDesertRiders' => 'The Desert Riders look grumpy, but there\'s a feeling of overall satisfaction in the air. Actually, I\'m not even sure they actually know how to smile. They got want they came for, so well done!',
        'GuiDaiDesertRidersSub1' => 'The Desert Riders are amazed. Look how they\'re holding those longbows! Glad to make them happy!',
        'GuiDaiDesertRidersSub2' => 'Look how careful they are around the horses! They seem really happy to have them!',
        'GuiDaiDesertRidersSub3' => 'We made sure that the wheat is the best a horse can have. I\'m sure the horses are going to miss the wheat when they get here.',
        'GuiDaiDesertRidersSub4' => 'The casks of water have been loaded onto the ship. Both man and beast will find them refreshing!',
        'GuiDaiDesertRidersSub5' => 'Good! Our cavalry will teach them how to use the carriages!',
        'GuiDaiDesertRidersSub6' => 'Well… the ship doesn\'t look like new, but I guess it will manage to transport them back to their lands. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiDesertRidersSub7' => 'Wow, just look at how many volunteers have offered to help! There\'s a lot of work to be done, but our fantastic settlers will make things a lot easier!',
        'GuiDaiDesertRidersSub8' => 'Oh, look at that! It actually works! We should definitely note this down somewhere. That said, I\'m pretty sure that even if wheels helped our goods carriers, they wouldn\'t want them. They\'re quite proud of their muscles!',
        'GuiDaiEagleNest' => 'Eagle Nest was completely abandoned by the time we arrived. There was no way the bandits could have left via the mountain trail - we would have intercepted them. Weird…',
        'GuiDaiEagleNestSub1' => 'The stones were used to fill in the gaps. Now our army can climb up and clear the nest.',
        'GuiDaiEagleNestSub2' => 'The new recruits were added to our army!',
        'GuiDaiEagleNestSub3' => 'The deposits were refilled. The wildlife is blooming again!',
        'GuiDaiEagleNestSub4' => 'Now the recruits are ready to take back Eagle Nest!',
        'GuiDaiEagleNestSub5' => 'The eagles were distracted! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiEagleNestSub6' => 'The mug is ready and the general is satisfied!',
        'GuiDaiEagleNestSub7' => 'The ladders are ready, and they are now part of the whole operation. Great work!',
        'GuiDaiEagleNestSub8' => 'The marksmen got plenty of practice on that adventure - and now we\'re ready for the final assault against the bandits. Great work!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_AmbassadorsAreVisiting' => 'The ambassadors have been taken care of like kings. Thanks to our combined efforts, I\'m sure they\'ll put in a good word for us with their leaders.',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_AmbassadorsAreVisitingSub1' => 'The visitor book is ready, and our first guest has already signed it. Hopefully this will be the first of many friends that come and sign. I can\'t wait to have it full!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_AmbassadorsAreVisitingSub2' => 'The budget is set, the menu has been taken care of, and there\'s enough bread and brew to last for weeks. One thing\'s for sure - our guests will never be hungry. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_AmbassadorsAreVisitingSub3' => 'The workers were well prepared, and they showed the ambassadors how efficient our foundries are. They were so impressed that some of them are even considering investing in our island for future projects!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_AmbassadorsAreVisitingSub4' => 'Ha, you should have seen their faces! When they saw a guy throwing sausages into the sky they were puzzled, but when our archers shot them and pinned them to a fire, their jaw dropped!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_AmbassadorsAreVisitingSub5' => 'When we explained how much lighter and sturdier things become when you use exotic wood, they took some notes to take back to their artisans. I wonder if this will build us better relations?',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_AmbassadorsAreVisitingSub6' => 'Our allies put in a good word for us with the ambassadors, and they\'re pleased to hear that we take such good care of our friends. This will definitely help our cause.',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_AmbassadorsAreVisitingSub7' => 'The fireworks are nothing that the ambassadors haven\'t seen before, of course, but it sure made them feel important. Great work!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_AmbassadorsAreVisitingSub8' => 'Although the ambassador was sure to stay back when the dangerous bits were happening, he still had a lot of fun with the whole experience. He sure looks like an adventurous fella, that\'s for sure.',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_DIYFair' => 'The people enjoyed the fair very much, and some of the participants discovered they have a natural talent for crafstmanship! We may see some job applications coming in soon!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_DIYFairSub1' => 'I don\'t know about you, but there\'s not many things that can top the smell of freshly baked bread. Don\'t you agree? The most important thing is that people enjoyed themselves, and learnt a lot!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_DIYFairSub2' => 'Interesting results, I\'d say! Not only did they manage to do the basic stuff like some tables, but one of our participants also made a proper wardrobe! I\'d say we spotted some real talent today!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_DIYFairSub3' => 'I\'m happy to announce that the course was a great success. I even had a go myself, although I wasn\'t very good. It\'s hard to write properly when you have fingers this thick.',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_DIYFairSub4' => 'People were really impressed with the creation process of the bows. They didn\'t think it would be so delicate and precise, which made them appreciate the job of the bowmaker a lot more.',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_DIYFairSub5' => 'A lot of aspiring chefs signed up for the course. There were so many people that I had to divide it in several sessions! We should definitely consider doing this more often!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_DIYFairSub6' => 'Being notoriously complicated, these may not be the best carriages the kingdom has ever seen, but they are certainly more than functional. The participants were happy to donate them for our storage, too, so win-win!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_DIYFairSub7' => 'I just had a chat with the lecturer. and he suggested that we supervise gunpowder handling for a while, until the fuss dies down. I couldn\'t really tell if it was a joke or not. What on Earth did he teach them?',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_DIYFairSub8' => 'We knew granite is robust, but who would have thought that it could lead to such works of art? They\'ll stand pride of place in many a house, I can tell!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_EasterEggCompetition' => 'The ling has expressed his admiration for our collective work!  The competition will surely be remembered for years to come, and all the contestants are having a lot of fun!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_EasterEggCompetitionSub1' => 'The help our allies provided has proven really valuable. The crates have been completed, and the competition can continue. We even have some to spare in case we run out.',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_EasterEggCompetitionSub2' => 'Oh wow, marble eggs actually look just like the real thing! I just hope nobody throws it at anyone or anything that can be broken!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_EasterEggCompetitionSub3' => 'The prize has been crafted and provided to the judges. They\'re actually a bit worried that the third prize is actually better that what they had in mind for the first, so they\'ll have to improvise. Oops!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_EasterEggCompetitionSub4' => 'The food problem has been taken care of. There\'s enough here to feed an army. No... Two armies! No... Three! Well, there\'s a lot of food, anyway. Nobody will be hungry.',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_EasterEggCompetitionSub5' => 'The podium has been created, and has been sent to the capital island. Don\'t you think that the first place spot is a bit... too high? What if the winner falls?',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_EasterEggCompetitionSub6' => 'Wow, that was a close one. We have enough eggs to send to the capital island now. Did your army bring back any stripy eggs for you? If not, don\'t worry! It just means the king needs all the eggs he can find. They can find more for us some other time!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_EasterEggCompetitionSub7' => 'The hall of fame is ready to be used! There\'s room to document at least 200 different records. I wonder what kind of categories they had in mind...?',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_EasterEggCompetitionSub8' => 'Fantastic! Glad to see that your business sense remains intact! These additional funds will definitely come in handy. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_FunForTheChildren' => 'I\'m convinced that the children will be eagerly waiting for the next festival. I don\'t know, we could always tell them that if they\'re well behaved, we could put together another one soon?',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_FunForTheChildrenSub1' => 'I\'ve supervised the manufacturing of the bows, and I give them my safety seal of approval. The bows are sturdy enough not to break, but they\'re also not powerful enough to hurt anyone.',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_FunForTheChildrenSub2' => 'Well, I can tell that they appreciate the pool! And whoever came up with the idea of crafting a trampoline to go along with it deserves to be treated to some brew. What a nice addition!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_FunForTheChildrenSub3' => 'Some of the horses were too tall for the children, so we made sure that there were also a bunch of ponies that they could use for riding. Everything is set, and I\'m sure that they\'ll appreciate it.',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_FunForTheChildrenSub4' => 'The storyteller gave me a transcript of the stories he\'s going to tell, and wow... I can tell that the kids are going to love them. I\'m even thinking of sitting alongside them, just to listen to them all over again!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_FunForTheChildrenSub5' => 'Despite all the preparations, I was a bit concerned about the safety of the forts, so I\'ve made sure that there are cushions all over the place in case someone falls. Now it\'s all about the fun!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_FunForTheChildrenSub6' => 'The kids are very excited about this! They\'ve even started forming teams and brackets to roll in a friendly tournament! That\'s actually pretty clever... Why didn\'t we think of that?',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_FunForTheChildrenSub7' => 'Ahhh, nothing beats sausage with curry. At least we can be sure that nobody will be hungry during the festival. Great job!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_FunForTheChildrenSub8' => 'I\'ve received the first finished uniform and I have to say that I\'m very impressed by it! I will send it over to the head of the boy scouts and see what they think. Ah, whatever. I\'m sure they\'ll love it!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_WorkerFestival' => 'I\'ve received the first wave of feedback about the event, and it was extremely positive! Our guild did a really good job putting this together.',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_WorkerFestivalSub1' => 'The fishermen are all set and ready to start their event. Let\'s hope it helps them drum up some business!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_WorkerFestivalSub2' => 'People really seem to like the idea of marble name plates. The only ones who complained about it are people with very long names, who\'re concerned that there aren\'t big enough plates. Diminutives, perhaps?',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_WorkerFestivalSub3' => 'The moment we mentioned that Jerdaint would be coming to sign his new book, people went completely crazy and started forming a line. Only problem is, they don\'t even know where the signing will take place! They don\'t mind, they queue anyway.',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_WorkerFestivalSub4' => 'As it turns out, the soldiers may be better at lifting weights, but the militia was better at running. Alas, the rivalry remains unsettled... Oh, you thought they were fighting? Oh, please!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_WorkerFestivalSub5' => 'Ok, the contest is ready, and I\'ve told a doctor to be on stand-by in case someone goes overboard and feels sick after. I\'m actually excited about this. I\'ve always wanted to see one of these contests!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_WorkerFestivalSub6' => 'The food delivery has arrived, and it\'s been distributed to the cooks. I\'m confident that this will be enough for everyone. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_WorkerFestivalSub7' => 'The riders have been briefed and prepared, and their gear is now ready. They will dispatch in a few minutes. This will ensure the Easter event endures!',
        'GuiDaiEaster2016_WorkerFestivalSub8' => 'We\'ve seen some really curious submissions already. There\'s still some time for the artisans to finish, but I\'m sure calling a winner will be a tough decision. If it were up to me, everyone would win!',
        'GuiDaiFallenArmy' => 'We\'ve received a report confirming the Elite Army has arrived safely at Capital Island. The King has sent us a gift! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiFallenArmySub1' => 'The wheat has arrived and cooking has commenced.',
        'GuiDaiFallenArmySub2' => 'They received the marble block!',
        'GuiDaiFallenArmySub3' => 'Our recruits did well and we can now send them our opinion of their tactics.',
        'GuiDaiFallenArmySub4' => 'The adventure did a good job keeping them in shape!',
        'GuiDaiFallenArmySub5' => 'The officers were impressed!',
        'GuiDaiFallenArmySub6' => 'The carriages arrived at Capital Island!',
        'GuiDaiFallenArmySub7' => 'The blacksmith is now back on quota, and he doesn\'t require any additional help. He offers his thanks, and has promised to tell the king about how useful we\'ve been to the cause. Great work!',
        'GuiDaiFallenArmySub8' => 'It saddens me to see our troops depart for war, but when duty calls, we have to answer, for the sake of our kingdoms. I hate war. Why can\'t we all be friends?',
        'GuiDaiFancyFurniture' => 'The ship sailed off. It was a nice experience, but to be honest I didn\'t like the furniture. It looked really weird. What sort of person would buy weird furniture like that, really?',
        'GuiDaiFancyFurnitureSub1' => 'Somehow they managed to cut the stone into the shape of flat holding platforms. Good for them.',
        'GuiDaiFancyFurnitureSub2' => 'I\'ve never seen somebody eat a whole loaf of bread so fast.',
        'GuiDaiFancyFurnitureSub3' => 'The marble was delivered!',
        'GuiDaiFancyFurnitureSub4' => 'Done! The fisherman looks a little bit happier!',
        'GuiDaiFancyFurnitureSub5' => 'Err! The Captain has returned, and it appears he has been injured. I feel sorry for him, but maybe he should stick to the sea!',
        'GuiDaiFancyFurnitureSub6' => 'The Captain was impressed!',
        'GuiDaiFancyFurnitureSub7' => 'The gesture was widely appreciated, and they were really impressed by our exotic wood furniture! We may be getting an order from them soon! Could this be a new business opportunity?',
        'GuiDaiFancyFurnitureSub8' => 'They were really interested in the lesson, but I don\'t think they understood at all. They bought a huge amount of magic beans, but now they\'re planning to sell them for mahogany wood directly. Maybe it works for them, who knows.',
        'GuiDaiFunWithSnow' => 'We\'ve made sure the children will indeed have fun when winter comes round again! Good job!',
        'GuiDaiFunWithSnowSub1' => 'Your friend was happy you visited! Sledge building is no longer a secret to you, in fact anyone can do it. I\'ll talk to our carpenters.',
        'GuiDaiFunWithSnowSub2' => 'The marble block is ready and the sculpture will soon fulfill its purpose!',
        'GuiDaiFunWithSnowSub3' => 'You got the recipe! Now head to the island and hand it over to the guild chef! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiFunWithSnowSub4' => 'The water has been stored!',
        'GuiDaiFunWithSnowSub5' => 'The new settlers have arrived and are every eager to start work.',
        'GuiDaiFunWithSnowSub6' => 'The general has returned and, to cut a long story short, they found the deer!',
        'GuiDaiFunWithSnowSub7' => 'Warm eggnog is the best! Of course, the golden brew mug isn\'t where the kids drink from, it\'s where it\'s served from! You know, for good luck!',
        'GuiDaiFunWithSnowSub8' => 'The kids had a lot of fun! We should probably think about hiring a gardener, though. Otherwise the whole island will get overrun with magic beanstalks at some point...',
        'GuiDaiGardenWalk' => 'We did it! We have our own guild\'s garden inside the Royal Gardens! The King will come and visit, and I bet he will love it!',
        'GuiDaiGardenWalkSub1' => 'Our friend was really happy we visited!',
        'GuiDaiGardenWalkSub2' => 'The hardwood has been loaded!',
        'GuiDaiGardenWalkSub3' => 'The military units are ready to protect us!',
        'GuiDaiGardenWalkSub4' => 'The new settlers are here to stay. We can now leave for Capital Island!',
        'GuiDaiGardenWalkSub5' => 'Nice work! We\'ve found the people!',
        'GuiDaiGardenWalkSub6' => 'The soldiers were… well, trained. Sort of. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiGardenWalkSub7' => 'The captain says he "doesn\'t need any trinkets to carry out his royal duty", but he appreciates the thought nonetheless. I still think his dedication is commendable, so I sent the mug to his home, where it\'s currently displayed over the fireplace.',
        'GuiDaiGardenWalkSub8' => 'Well, our ornaments are certainly... unique! I don\'t know if this qualifies as "beautiful", but we\'ll definitely grab everyone\'s attention with this now!',
        'GuiDaiGeologyDay' => 'We got the winner! Let\'s celebrate the work of these brave men! Hurray! The King was very happy to hear of our actions and has sent us a token of his appreciation!',
        'GuiDaiGeologyDaySub1' => 'I wonder how much time he needs to find the marble deposit!',
        'GuiDaiGeologyDaySub2' => 'The food is packed! Great work!',
        'GuiDaiGeologyDaySub3' => 'The moment he finds that cold deposit he\'s going to become a hero!',
        'GuiDaiGeologyDaySub4' => 'He got the water! Now he can look for coal and make sure he remains clean all the time!',
        'GuiDaiGeologyDaySub5' => 'Yes, that much fish will be enough! I wonder what meal they\'re going to make. I love fish.',
        'GuiDaiGeologyDaySub6' => 'The coins look brand new! I\'m sure the winner will be most pleased!',
        'GuiDaiGeologyDaySub7' => 'For being such skinny guys, they eat a whole lot of meat. I hope this doesn\'t backfire on them!',
        'GuiDaiGeologyDaySub8' => 'Excellent! Worst case scenario, if winter doesn\'t come, the children can use the coal to paint the walls, or something!',
        'GuiDaiHappySailors' => 'I heard some sailors saying this was the best "Day of the Sailors" they’ve ever experienced! You should be proud of that.',
        'GuiDaiHappySailorsSub1' => 'Though I\'m not a big fan of fish, the soup turned out to be fantastic!',
        'GuiDaiHappySailorsSub2' => 'The marble block looks impressive!',
        'GuiDaiHappySailorsSub3' => 'The water is full of fish! Excellent!',
        'GuiDaiHappySailorsSub4' => 'The leader was happy to receive the gift!',
        'GuiDaiHappySailorsSub5' => 'The steel swords are ready!',
        'GuiDaiHappySailorsSub6' => 'The sailors really enjoyed the adventure!',
        'GuiDaiHappySailorsSub7' => 'We clearly underestimated the sailors. They\'ve been drinking us out of house and home! But, we do have a winner now. Unfortunately, he\'s really ugly, so the artisan will have a tough time crafting a good looking bust for him.',
        'GuiDaiHappySailorsSub8' => 'Ok, the griddle is ready, and the salt has been prepared. Just wait until the sailors taste the meat we cook. They\'ll want seconds for sure.',
        'GuiDaiHowToBuildAMountain' => 'Lord Edword was most impressed to see the amazing mountain now standing high in on his land. I\'m not sure the farmers are that happy about it... but that\'s too bad. Anyway, here is the reward Lord Edword sent us.',
        'GuiDaiHowToBuildAMountainSub1' => 'Is that the stone? Ohh it already looks like a mountain! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiHowToBuildAMountainSub2' => 'We could organize the Olympics with so many carriages. I will stop one for us. You never know, right? Very good work.',
        'GuiDaiHowToBuildAMountainSub3' => 'Stop! STOP! Yes, this amount of stone will suffice for now! I\'m sure we can get more if we need it! Nice work!',
        'GuiDaiHowToBuildAMountainSub4' => 'Ohh how beautiful these horses are! My daughter used to pester me for a horse. Maybe now she can have one, what do you say? You did great work for your guild.',
        'GuiDaiHowToBuildAMountainSub5' => 'We sent the granite to the building site. The builders really appreciated it and have sent you a thank you letter. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiHowToBuildAMountainSub6' => 'That\'s a lot of fish. I wonder how they will keep the cats away, ehh? Good job.',
        'GuiDaiHowToBuildAMountainSub7' => 'That should help reach the quota. Perfect!',
        'GuiDaiHowToBuildAMountainSub8' => 'Well, it turns out the rumour wasn\'t true. But on the flipside, we learned that platinum actually makes for great tools! If only the miners could have seen what they were hitting, I guess.',
        'GuiDaiImprovedDarkness' => 'The miner\'s union has promised they will take us on a tour when they\'re ready. I would skip that, if I were you. Ohh look, they\'ve sent you a gift!',
        'GuiDaiImprovedDarknessSub1' => 'The union was really happy see the new tools too! They can\'t wait to start digging!',
        'GuiDaiImprovedDarknessSub2' => 'With so many planks we could build ourselves a roof above the island! Ha ha!',
        'GuiDaiImprovedDarknessSub3' => 'These planks are truly strong. I could have one hundred settlers stand on that hardwood plank and it would not break! I think. Let\'s not try that… Good work!',
        'GuiDaiImprovedDarknessSub4' => 'Yes, the mines are ready, and air is pouring in, filling the tunnels. The miners are happy!',
        'GuiDaiImprovedDarknessSub5' => 'They could open up a meat shop down there… At least they won\'t be hungry anymore! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiImprovedDarknessSub6' => 'By the time they are done, even the king will be able to take a walk down there. The plans are impressive indeed.',
        'GuiDaiImprovedDarknessSub7' => 'Well, guess what, they were right after all! I\'m actually very impressed! Our miners really do know how to make the mine\'s structure resistant! I guess I lost that bet with the general after all...',
        'GuiDaiImprovedDarknessSub8' => 'The swordsmen came out, laughing very loudly. It seems that the growling the other miner heard was just a very, very hungry co-worker just round the corner. We gave the poor lad a sandwich, and he\'s gone back to work.',
        'GuiDaiLostOnTheEndlessSea' => 'The ship is loaded with all the resources the Captain asked for! He was very generous in showing his appreciation for our help! I hope they do find that lost ship… I even heard the captain was Ironplanks\' own son…',
        'GuiDaiLostOnTheEndlessSeaSub1' => 'I hope they know how to cook! That\'s some great quality meat there. It would be a shame to see it go to waste!',
        'GuiDaiLostOnTheEndlessSeaSub2' => 'Do you know the first thing the Captain did when the crates containing the bread arrived on his ship? He opened one up, and started feeding the seagulls. Would you believe it?!',
        'GuiDaiLostOnTheEndlessSeaSub3' => 'The best steel swords a Captain can have! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiLostOnTheEndlessSeaSub4' => 'The ship is loaded with barrels filled with our finest brew!',
        'GuiDaiLostOnTheEndlessSeaSub5' => 'The tallest and strongest bows are on the ship! The Captain is most satisfied!',
        'GuiDaiLostOnTheEndlessSeaSub6' => 'The Captain couldn\'t stop smiling when he saw our gift! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiLostOnTheEndlessSeaSub7' => 'The cannons are ready! Let\'s hope we don\'t have to use them. After all, our cannoneers are no sailors - they work a lot better on land.',
        'GuiDaiLostOnTheEndlessSeaSub8' => 'We may not have found him, but some of the prisoners we took say they saw the captain\'s ship floating around the island. I sense we\'re getting closer. We should head back and deliver our report.',
        'GuiDaiPerAContribution' => 'We will see when and how the royal council will react. Until then, you have done everything possible. Well done!',
        'GuiDaiPerADeedForADeed' => 'Yes! You did it! Your settlers are satisfied! You are indeed a ruler with outstanding diplomatic skills!',
        'GuiDaiPerAGoodFriend' => 'Very nice of you! I\'m sure your friend will return your kindness!',
        'GuiDaiPerAdditionalRooms' => 'We have the rooms and the food - visitors can come and get a good night\'s sleep! Well done!',
        'GuiDaiPerAgainstVengence' => 'The troops are ready for any surprise attacks against our island! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiPerAllTheFishInTheSea' => 'What? Nobody can find the fisherman? Are you kidding me? He ran away? Well… at least we have fish…',
        'GuiDaiPerArcherCamp' => 'Now we have the bows, the young ones can go and learn how to use them! Very good work!',
        'GuiDaiPerBattleReady' => 'Well… the moment the wildlings saw our troops, they ran back into the deep dark woods. I guess that\'s that… Good work!',
        'GuiDaiPerBoiledMeat' => 'The meat is ready for delivery! I\'ve already sent the instructions to the Royal Cooks! Hope the King will enjoy his boiled meat!',
        'GuiDaiPerCleaningTheLibrary' => 'There they go, with all that iron. It sure will weigh down a lot of pages… a lot of books. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiPerDangerousTimes' => 'The swords are ready in the storeroom! I hope we don\'t have to use them!',
        'GuiDaiPerEarlyDayMarket' => 'The people loved your fish! I bet most of them will look for you next time you come here!',
        'GuiDaiPerEarlyMorning' => 'You\'re back! How was it? I knew it won\'t be a problem for you! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiPerEcologicalProblem' => 'The environment is very important and should always be looked after. However, what is even more important is the king\'s favor, and thanks to you, it is secured.',
        'GuiDaiPerFastPlanks' => 'Yes, the planks are now being produced fast enough! If that storm comes, we\'ll be prepared! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiPerFavoriteIsland' => 'Good! We\'re ready for the new settlers! I\'m sure Queen Anita will choose us!',
        'GuiDaiPerFishingGrounds' => 'That should save the fishing grounds for now. I\'m sure the king watched the whole thing with great satisfaction!',
        'GuiDaiPerForBrewBreadAndHorse' => 'There! I hope this will calm the farmers down! Now let\'s have some bread. All this talk of wheat is making me hungry. And thirsty. We should take a horse, don\'t you think?',
        'GuiDaiPerFromForreignHands' => 'Let me taste that bread. Hmm… hmm… I knew it! It\'s a pale copy! Our bread tastes much much better!',
        'GuiDaiPerGardenPets' => 'We\'ve received the marble. I\'m sure her sculptor will have a lot of work to do!',
        'GuiDaiPerHouseOnWheels' => 'Great work! The technician is pleased with the results! So are we!',
        'GuiDaiPerImportTools' => 'Now they have the imported tools, and look at them! They\'re still using *our* tools! And none of them have opened their mouths since… he he. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiPerIntoTheWild' => 'You\'re back? How was it? Good! I\'m glad to hear that! Maybe you should rest for a while before returning to your daily tasks!',
        'GuiDaiPerKeepingAnEyeOpen' => 'We got the coins! Now when the time comes, the guild will take care of the rest!',
        'GuiDaiPerMadeOfGold' => 'Now we can make sure that no gold-eating termites will enter our gold mines! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiPerNewfangledForge' => 'There! Next time he comes he will see that we\'re paying attention to him. Maybe he will be less grumpy too?',
        'GuiDaiPerOverseaFavors' => 'There! The "angel" came and helped us! I hope the lady is happy now!',
        'GuiDaiPerSecretCargo' => 'Very good, now we have the brew and sausages. Now let\'s wait for those ships… if any come.',
        'GuiDaiPerSellingWater' => 'The cannon has been sold - thank the maker for that! We\'re not looking for trouble, and that cannon looked like trouble.',
        'GuiDaiPerSlowTimes' => 'The sandwiches are delicious! I\'m sure the settlers will enjoy them as well! What a great cook you are!',
        'GuiDaiPerSpeedMail' => 'We made sure to send them our most perky horses! Let\'s see how true they are to their claim! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiPerStoneForTheGuild' => 'There are almost certainly people from the guild in need of stone. If you help them, they are sure to help you in return.',
        'GuiDaiPerSwiftness' => 'Very well. You should always keep an eye on your storage. Swiftness pays off.',
        'GuiDaiPerTheAuntsBasket' => 'The baskets are done! I got hungry just looking at them! Very nice job!',
        'GuiDaiPerTheHungryMiners' => 'There! Now we lock the doors and hide the key! If I see even one miner hanging around the storehouse I\'ll alert the guards! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiPerTheIronBanners' => 'They received their iron and have already started to come up with their own designs. At least they\'re going to leave us alone for the time being.',
        'GuiDaiPerTheIronWagon' => 'The iron ore was delivered and the merchant seems to be satisfied. I wonder who he\'s looking for?',
        'GuiDaiPerTheSparkInTheGrass' => 'Well I\'ll be, it was a golden coin! I hope it will bring us luck!',
        'GuiDaiPerTheSupervisor' => 'We have the flour in our storeroom! The supervisor should be satisfied now!',
        'GuiDaiPerTheTimeForBread' => 'The new bakeries are ready to make us fresh bread every time our roosters welcome the sun and sing their song. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiPerTheTraveler' => 'The traveller is very grateful for your help and immediately begins to write a letter to the king, telling of your noble act. Your guild can be proud of you.',
        'GuiDaiPerTheWaterUnderground' => 'We\'ve moved the wells, and sure enough the water we\'ve found is much better. Or at least that\'s what the geologist said. I can\'t tell the difference, to be honest.',
        'GuiDaiPerTheWhiteTrap' => 'So they will waste the flour by using it to track robbers. This I have to see. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiPerTicTocSwords' => 'Great! You made sure everything works as intended!',
        'GuiDaiPerTotalAnihilation' => 'Good work! We\'re fearless!',
        'GuiDaiPerVisitAtTheBarrack' => 'Our militia was trained by our best men! The people were entertained and educated at the same time! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiPerWhenWolvesWageWar' => 'Yes, this small army can patrol when on duty! Very good!',
        'GuiDaiPersonalArmy' => 'We now have an army. I hope that Lord Sardin will be late with his inspection route. The King sent us a reward for being so cooperative.',
        'GuiDaiPersonalArmySub1' => 'I won\'t count the sword, and I hope Lord Sardin won\'t either. Looks like enough! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiPersonalArmySub2' => 'Yes, the militia seems to be ready and happy!',
        'GuiDaiPersonalArmySub3' => 'The horses are strong, the soldiers are strong… they look strong!',
        'GuiDaiPersonalArmySub4' => 'Our soldiers are ready for duty! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiPersonalArmySub5' => 'Those bows are really long, no joke there. I wouldn\'t like to run around with one of those, no siree.',
        'GuiDaiPersonalArmySub6' => 'Now our storehouse is filled with swords and Lord Sardin seems to be satisfied with you, and that\'s a pretty big deal if you ask me. Great work!',
        'GuiDaiPersonalArmySub7' => 'Well that was productive! Mr. Metal has been a big help! Do you think he may have any nice weapons for sale? Maybe we should keep in touch with him!',
        'GuiDaiPersonalArmySub8' => 'The troops are exhausted, but they\'re as motivated as they\'ll ever be, which is exactly what we wanted to achieve. Good work out there. That was some solid commanding!',
        'GuiDaiRainOfGold' => 'I can already hear the cannons and imagine the gold shining in the sunlight. It must be an amazing experience to see something like that. It would have been so nice to be there. Maybe next year we can attend?',
        'GuiDaiRainOfGoldSub1' => 'Well I hope this amount of gold ore will be enough to cause a storm. I still find this whole thing absurd.',
        'GuiDaiRainOfGoldSub2' => 'Using coins for that… well I guess the kid deserves it. We did our part.',
        'GuiDaiRainOfGoldSub3' => 'Well, the cannons are ready. We used our best tools and resources to make them!',
        'GuiDaiRainOfGoldSub4' => 'Very well done! Now we\'ll definitely be able to provide the best gold ore if necessary!',
        'GuiDaiRainOfGoldSub5' => 'Eugh! I don\'t like fish soup! But nevertheless, good work!',
        'GuiDaiRainOfGoldSub6' => 'I hope the carriages don\'t have holes… we don\'t want the coins to roll… away. What am I thinking?!',
        'GuiDaiRainOfGoldSub7' => 'I think this will make a nice change to having so much gold around. I don\'t know about you, but I get headaches when I stare into bright yellow things for a long time.',
        'GuiDaiRainOfGoldSub8' => 'Even though I didn\'t win anything, I have to say that was a very mature thing to do. I assume the king has passed a little bit of his wisdom on to him. Maybe I misjudged the kid after all...',
        'GuiDaiRainyYear' => 'We\'re done here! Let the rain come - we\'re prepared, except if that legendary four winds storm hits. I hope that will never happen - it would provoke a real crisis, let me tell you.',
        'GuiDaiRainyYearSub1' => 'The settlers were curious about the sudden upturn in work, but nobody asked any probing questions. I\'m guessing they trust us enough!',
        'GuiDaiRainyYearSub2' => 'Yes, very good work!',
        'GuiDaiRainyYearSub3' => 'Our friend promised to return the favor!',
        'GuiDaiRainyYearSub4' => 'The hardwood was delivered!',
        'GuiDaiRainyYearSub5' => 'The steel swords are the best we could make!',
        'GuiDaiRainyYearSub6' => 'The Golden Brew Mug is ready. Time to celebrate!',
        'GuiDaiRainyYearSub7' => 'The soldiers are back, and ready to become the designated relief party when the storm hits. They are a bit tired, though. Maybe we should have taken this into account when sending them away for training...',
        'GuiDaiRainyYearSub8' => 'All right! The perfect barn. This should keep the wheat dry no matter how much it rains or pours. I\'m actually more worried about what we\'ll do if people want to get in to shelter! Where will we put the wheat!',
        'GuiDaiRetirementPlan' => 'Sir Rogen is very happy with the package! I saw him trying to hold back a tear before he left. He was indeed a very good general.',
        'GuiDaiRetirementPlanSub1' => 'Our allies really appreciated our gift, and they\'ve decided to send us the missing resources! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiRetirementPlanSub2' => 'Strong relations are always a good thing! You never know when you might need your allies!',
        'GuiDaiRetirementPlanSub3' => 'The fountains seem to be working as intended! What a nice show!',
        'GuiDaiRetirementPlanSub4' => 'The army is ready for the show!',
        'GuiDaiRetirementPlanSub5' => 'Sir Rogen enjoyed the adventure very much!',
        'GuiDaiRetirementPlanSub6' => 'The longbows are ready! Make sure to tell the archers to aim so the flaming arrows land in the water!',
        'GuiDaiRetirementPlanSub7' => 'We\'re all ready. I just hope that Sir Rogen doesn\'t startle himself so much. He\'s known for just flailing with his sword when he senses danger!',
        'GuiDaiRetirementPlanSub8' => 'The mortars are ready. I can\'t wait to see the show. This promises to be beautiful!',
        'GuiDaiRoadToNowhere' => 'The settler colony arrived this morning. They\'re not yet ready to join our community, but I\'m sure they will… some day.',
        'GuiDaiRoadToNowhereSub1' => 'There\'s enough stone for them to have those shelters!',
        'GuiDaiRoadToNowhereSub2' => 'Hmm, the idea was for them to forge the swords into plowshares should they need them. Instead the colonists just strapped the swords into their plows. Anyway, whatever floats their boat.',
        'GuiDaiRoadToNowhereSub3' => 'The people have been chosen! A new life begins for them!',
        'GuiDaiRoadToNowhereSub4' => 'The cavalry is ready to guard the perimeter!',
        'GuiDaiRoadToNowhereSub5' => 'We got the additional settlers ready for work!',
        'GuiDaiRoadToNowhereSub6' => 'The planks were sent to the forest!',
        'GuiDaiRoadToNowhereSub7' => 'The horsemen have returned with a few maps that may be of interest to our new residents. I\'ve shown them what we found, but they said that they were happy here, and that they would happily stay forever if we let them.',
        'GuiDaiRoadToNowhereSub8' => 'The refugees are very grateful for our help. Our very own foreman will stay with them for a while so they\'ll have the best possible residencies.',
        'GuiDaiSeeingTheSea' => 'King Damien believes his ships will amaze his visitors. The ships are a masterwork indeed! Look how amazingly they shine in the sunset! I would sure love a place on one of those ships!',
        'GuiDaiSeeingTheSeaSub1' => 'These are indeed amazing tools your people have made! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiSeeingTheSeaSub2' => 'The amount of wood you provided should be enough for the first few ships! Very good!',
        'GuiDaiSeeingTheSeaSub3' => 'The departing ships move slowly, for they are filled with the steel you provided. Thanks to you, the royal shipyard will be able to make really strong ships!',
        'GuiDaiSeeingTheSeaSub4' => 'Imagine the amazing decorations they will make with all that iron cutlery on the table! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiSeeingTheSeaSub5' => 'I would definitely like to taste that meal, seeing as you provided the sausages! Well done!',
        'GuiDaiSeeingTheSeaSub6' => 'Very good! Now we have time to concentrate on the quest. Well done! I hope many lands will be spotted from the nest!',
        'GuiDaiSeeingTheSeaSub7' => 'This crane will definitely help with the construction. I just hope we have a properly trained settler to operate it!',
        'GuiDaiSeeingTheSeaSub8' => 'The battle horses have pulled off the job perfectly! I have a feeling they enjoyed the variety too. Well, back to the stables! There\'s still a lot to do.',
        'GuiDaiShootingDownTheMoon' => 'The old inventor has all he needs to build his cannon. I don\'t see how he\'ll do it all alone on that island of his. Maybe he will hire some people? Nevertheless, we should keep an eye out for him... we don\'t want that cannonball to land on our island!',
        'GuiDaiShootingDownTheMoonSub1' => 'The cannon forge is ready for the inventor\'s needs. He seems to be excited.',
        'GuiDaiShootingDownTheMoonSub2' => 'The steel is ready for him to take back to the island. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiShootingDownTheMoonSub3' => 'There. That\'s all the gunpowder we can give him. If he wants more, let him visit the other islands too.',
        'GuiDaiShootingDownTheMoonSub4' => 'I hope you placed that hut far from the center of the island. I don\'t trust gunpowder manufacturers.',
        'GuiDaiShootingDownTheMoonSub5' => 'We got enough saltpetre for the inventor. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiShootingDownTheMoonSub6' => 'The cannoneer will teach the inventor how to shoot the cannon. Hopefully.',
        'GuiDaiShootingDownTheMoonSub7' => 'Well, I\'m back from the visit. He\'s already produced lots of drawings and blueprints of alternative grapple guns, and in such a short space of time! He may be cuckoo, but he\'s dedicated!',
        'GuiDaiShootingDownTheMoonSub8' => 'He seemed pleased with his cloth, at least. Still, no matter how I look at it, I just can\'t see how this will help him shoot down the moon. Oh well, as long as he\'s happy, I guess...',
        'GuiDaiSkyResidence' => 'The king promised that when we visited, we would have the best rooms! I do wonder who would simply climb up to the city of their own free will… The king has sent you your reward.',
        'GuiDaiSkyResidenceSub1' => 'Water does magic, if used properly! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiSkyResidenceSub2' => 'I hope they know what they are doing up there. If I were them, I sure would use a lot of planks for the walkways. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiSkyResidenceSub3' => 'You have made sure the new residents will be well fed until they learn how to produce their own food. Can I have a piece of bread?',
        'GuiDaiSkyResidenceSub4' => 'I wonder how many nails they will require to make the structure of the sky town safe. I don\'t even want to imagine what could happen up there during a serious storm…',
        'GuiDaiSkyResidenceSub5' => 'We have the bows ready! Winged predators shall fear the sky town archers!',
        'GuiDaiSkyResidenceSub6' => 'Well, that should be enough I guess! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiSkyResidenceSub7' => 'Honestly, I admire the work of the engineer who put it up there. I\'m afraid of heights, you know? I probably would have fainted as soon as I got a few inches off the ground...',
        'GuiDaiSkyResidenceSub8' => 'The wheelbarrows are ready to roll! Plus, the red colour really makes them look stylish. Did you know red things are scientifically proven to be three times faster than different-coloured things? True story!',
        'GuiDaiSongsOfSeasons' => 'Even if the season didn\'t change, his music touched my heart. I think that one day he will be a great musician. Oh look, he\'s found a bell and is using it to practice!',
        'GuiDaiSongsOfSeasonsSub1' => 'Mike was very happy to learn that he can move into the city!',
        'GuiDaiSongsOfSeasonsSub2' => 'I need to find Samuel, our hunter, so he can help Mike carve new instruments!',
        'GuiDaiSongsOfSeasonsSub3' => 'Mike loved the meal we prepared for him!',
        'GuiDaiSongsOfSeasonsSub4' => 'The cavalry units are ready to march!',
        'GuiDaiSongsOfSeasonsSub5' => 'Mike was excited to be part of an adventure!',
        'GuiDaiSongsOfSeasonsSub6' => 'Mike has returned with loads of new ideas for songs!',
        'GuiDaiSongsOfSeasonsSub7' => 'The composer came back from the adventure with a good grasp of the cannon\'s capabilities. In fact, he\'d studied them so closely, he was temporarily deaf because of the noise! Took us a while to understand why he was yelling to everyone for no apparent reason...',
        'GuiDaiSongsOfSeasonsSub8' => 'The new lute is ready, and the event is scheduled for tonight. Both musicians are really excited about this, and they\'ve decided to compose an all-new song to commemorate their newfound friendship. Isn\'t that nice?',
        'GuiDaiTheAbandonedMines' => 'The exploration of the underground jungle was a success! We\'ve found some nice relics that will surely tell us a lot about our ancestors that lived on this island, a long long time ago.',
        'GuiDaiTheAbandonedMinesSub1' => 'The visit was a great surprise for your friend!',
        'GuiDaiTheAbandonedMinesSub2' => 'The bowmen are ready for duty!',
        'GuiDaiTheAbandonedMinesSub3' => 'The longbowmen are ready for duty!',
        'GuiDaiTheAbandonedMinesSub4' => 'The tools are ready and packed!',
        'GuiDaiTheAbandonedMinesSub5' => 'The gold ore is ready! I would love to receive such a gift!',
        'GuiDaiTheAbandonedMinesSub6' => 'The fisherman was not too happy he had to leave his favorite spot but… exploration is more important!',
        'GuiDaiTheAbandonedMinesSub7' => 'The tunnel shook a bit, but everyone\'s ok. We should continue exploring the mines. Maybe we can figure out why they were abandoned in the first place.',
        'GuiDaiTheAbandonedMinesSub8' => 'Ok! Thanks to our special program, I think they\'ve got quite a good idea about how to mine for rare materials now. When the guild is ready to exploit the mine, we\'ll be ready too.',
        'GuiDaiTheAdventureSeekers' => 'The kids are back on the ship to Capital Island! They learned a lot, I\'m sure! The king seems to be grateful - just look at the reward he\'s sent us!',
        'GuiDaiTheAdventureSeekersSub1' => 'The adventure was a success and the young apprentice was most exited about it! Good work, the king will be happy!',
        'GuiDaiTheAdventureSeekersSub2' => 'The adventure was a success and the young apprentice was most exited about it! Good work, the king will be happy!',
        'GuiDaiTheAdventureSeekersSub3' => 'The adventure was a success and the young apprentice was most exited about it! Good work, the king will be happy!',
        'GuiDaiTheAdventureSeekersSub4' => 'The adventure was a success and the young apprentice was most exited about it! Good work, the king will be happy!',
        'GuiDaiTheAdventureSeekersSub5' => 'The adventure was a success and the young apprentice was most exited about it! Good work, the king will be happy!',
        'GuiDaiTheAdventureSeekersSub6' => 'The adventure was a success and the young apprentice was most exited about it! Good work, the king will be happy!',
        'GuiDaiTheAdventureSeekersSub7' => 'The adventure was a success and the young apprentice was most excited about it! Good work, the king will be happy!',
        'GuiDaiTheAdventureSeekersSub8' => 'The diplomacy missions were a success, and the young apprentice was most excited about it! Good work, the king will be happy!',
        'GuiDaiTheChickenParade' => 'Well we did our best! I hope the chicken parade will be a huge success! Me? No, I wouldn\'t attend an event with singing chickens. The musician has thanked us by sending these packs of goods!',
        'GuiDaiTheChickenParadeSub1' => 'Very good - now we are really efficient and proficient! Oh, that rhymes! He he.',
        'GuiDaiTheChickenParadeSub2' => 'The hardwood planks are ready to be delivered to Capital Island! Outstanding work!',
        'GuiDaiTheChickenParadeSub3' => 'I really hope the builders know what they\'re doing. We sure sent them the best steel we have! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheChickenParadeSub4' => 'There - we have enough wheat to feed an army… as long as it\'s an army of chickens. Wait - that\'s the silliest thing I\'ve ever heard.',
        'GuiDaiTheChickenParadeSub5' => 'Yes, we have enough barrels. I bet all that clucking… I mean singing will get the chickens thirsty! And they will thank you for the water!',
        'GuiDaiTheChickenParadeSub6' => 'Look at him! There are people who would tend to chickens. What a crazy world.',
        'GuiDaiTheChickenParadeSub7' => 'The stage is making good progress, but is it a bit too much? If the show is half as flashy as the stage is, this promises to be the biggest spectacle you\'ll ever witness.',
        'GuiDaiTheChickenParadeSub8' => 'Well now I\'ve seen everything. The animals seem to be attracted to the chicken\'s clucking. Apparently they cluck at a certain frequency that only other animals can hear. And now I\'ve got a massive headache...',
        'GuiDaiTheDayOfTheFrogs' => 'We did a great job! The frogs arrived at the southern ponds and thanked us by singing! Great job!',
        'GuiDaiTheDayOfTheFrogsSub1' => 'The fried fish bits worked like a charm!',
        'GuiDaiTheDayOfTheFrogsSub2' => 'The birds got the message and didn\'t even go near any frogs. Makes you wonder if we really needed to bring the boys out for this.',
        'GuiDaiTheDayOfTheFrogsSub3' => 'The bronze swords are ready to be jumped over by frogs.',
        'GuiDaiTheDayOfTheFrogsSub4' => 'Your friend was happy to welcome you!',
        'GuiDaiTheDayOfTheFrogsSub5' => 'How nice - our neighbours liked the sausages so much, they\'ve asked for more. We\'ve actually gained a new trading partner - who would have thought it?!',
        'GuiDaiTheDayOfTheFrogsSub6' => 'None of the military units has moved in the slightest! The general was probably hallucinating.',
        'GuiDaiTheDayOfTheFrogsSub7' => 'We found a decent amount of those mushrooms, but one of the soldiers didn\'t know what they were for and ate them. What he didn\'t know is that they are toxic to humans. He\'s fine, he just has a tummyache.',
        'GuiDaiTheDayOfTheFrogsSub8' => 'The plaque has been erected by the pond. It\'s actually unusually large for the little message it carries. The frogs may not appreciate it, but hey, it sure looks fancy!',
        'GuiDaiTheDragonRose' => 'These exotic plants are really dangerous if you don\'t know how to transport them. Thankfully, the lady has the best escort there is.',
        'GuiDaiTheDragonRoseSub1' => 'We will add some nice handmade saddles to the shipment! Milady will be most pleased, I\'m sure!',
        'GuiDaiTheDragonRoseSub2' => 'I wouldn\'t mind taking a bite of those amazing looking sausage-filled sandwiches! I\'m sure milady will love them!',
        'GuiDaiTheDragonRoseSub3' => 'They sure will have a good time! I hope they talk about our brew when they get back home!',
        'GuiDaiTheDragonRoseSub4' => 'The steel swords are shining proudly in the morning sun! The guards are most surprised and thank you very much!',
        'GuiDaiTheDragonRoseSub5' => 'Ever wondered what a double wagon would look like? No? Me neither. Good work with the coins!',
        'GuiDaiTheDragonRoseSub6' => 'Whatever gets broken will soo be fixed! Well done training them!',
        'GuiDaiTheDragonRoseSub7' => 'It may not be practical, but it definitely fulfills its purpose! I just hope Milady Verena doesn\'t think we\'re too weird for coming up with this idea.',
        'GuiDaiTheDragonRoseSub8' => 'The Steel Guard welcomes the reinforcements, but they\'re a bit concerned that we used platinum instead of the almighty steel for our units. If only they saw the things we saw...',
        'GuiDaiTheEternalRepository' => 'Not only will this repository be the biggest, but apparently the architectural style is kind of unique. I hope we will have the opportunity to visit it once it\'s completed. The Tagalian has sent you a thank you package. How nice of him.',
        'GuiDaiTheEternalRepositorySub1' => 'It\'s a shame we have to give away so much brew! But you did it! Great job!',
        'GuiDaiTheEternalRepositorySub2' => 'At least that famous repository will have some of the best fish ever supplied! We can be proud of that!',
        'GuiDaiTheEternalRepositorySub3' => 'You did a good job with our miners! The iron ore is about to be sent!',
        'GuiDaiTheEternalRepositorySub4' => 'The Tagalian called our flour \'white dust\'. I\'m not sure if he was trying to be funny…',
        'GuiDaiTheEternalRepositorySub5' => 'I hope the shelves they make from our hardwood planks will hold for an "eternity", he he.',
        'GuiDaiTheEternalRepositorySub6' => 'Yes, now we are prepared! If the Tagalian wants steel swords, we will be ready to make them for him!',
        'GuiDaiTheEternalRepositorySub7' => 'These boxes will work very well. I\'ve personally helped with stuffing them with soft materials, so even if it shakes it won\'t be a problem. Still, handle with care.',
        'GuiDaiTheEternalRepositorySub8' => 'All done! Wait, what do you mean this is too much? Of course we\'re not planning to aim it at people! At least, not that I know of. I guess ultimately, it\'s not up to us...',
        'GuiDaiTheFeastOfTheCentury' => 'I am sure they are going to be able to feed the whole eight island region. The feast will be amazing, I can feel it!',
        'GuiDaiTheFeastOfTheCenturySub1' => 'Either he doesn\'t know how to use fire, or he is mad, but I still can\'t imagine eating raw fish. Anyway, he seemed satisfied with the big fish shipment we sent him.',
        'GuiDaiTheFeastOfTheCenturySub2' => 'They can bake a hundred loaves of breads with that amount of flour! Good riddance!',
        'GuiDaiTheFeastOfTheCenturySub3' => 'I just arrived back from my daily walk, and passed by our grain fields. Gold indeed! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheFeastOfTheCenturySub4' => 'Why do you need to be an artist to boil an egg?… I don\'t know. Well he has his water, so… I wish him happy boiling! Ha ha!',
        'GuiDaiTheFeastOfTheCenturySub5' => 'Thank our great hunters for the meat. They really did their best!',
        'GuiDaiTheFeastOfTheCenturySub6' => 'The idea of matching tables is pretty nice. Remind me to have some of those for our next feast!',
        'GuiDaiTheFeastOfTheCenturySub7' => 'Ah, nothing beats this. The nobles can keep their noble and delicate cuisine, I\'m happy with sausages. Actually, I could use some more right about now.',
        'GuiDaiTheFeastOfTheCenturySub8' => 'I don\'t know about you, but I don\'t think this was a very good idea. My bread\'s burnt to a crisp and barely edible. Some people seem to really enjoy it, though. Maybe it\'s just not for me?',
        'GuiDaiTheFloatingIsland' => 'The balloon, as he calls it, seems to be ready for take off! Interesting little man.',
        'GuiDaiTheFloatingIslandSub1' => 'The stones were delivered to him. He\'s started preparing those little bags.',
        'GuiDaiTheFloatingIslandSub2' => 'The fish school was refilled and the fisherman has calmed down.',
        'GuiDaiTheFloatingIslandSub3' => 'The longbowmen are ready to sail off!',
        'GuiDaiTheFloatingIslandSub4' => 'They\'ve returned, and it seems the balloon guy got what he was looking for.',
        'GuiDaiTheFloatingIslandSub5' => 'The wildlife has been restored, and the balloon guy has been asked not to provoke any of those sounds again. My ears are still ringing.',
        'GuiDaiTheFloatingIslandSub6' => 'The soldiers are ready to help the balloon guy.',
        'GuiDaiTheFloatingIslandSub7' => 'Our allies came to visit almost immediately! They seem to be amazed by the technology behind the flying machine. Intriguing!',
        'GuiDaiTheFloatingIslandSub8' => 'The traveller was very happy that we could help him out! He\'d also never seen any grout before, and has taken a sample to show the folk back on his home island.',
        'GuiDaiTheGoodGenerals' => 'The ceremony went well and all our generals were rewarded! I really think that this was a very noble gesture from our King!',
        'GuiDaiTheGoodGeneralsSub1' => 'The bows are ready and so is your general! Off they go to Capital Island!',
        'GuiDaiTheGoodGeneralsSub2' => 'Your cavalry is read to accompany your general! Off they go to Capital Island!',
        'GuiDaiTheGoodGeneralsSub3' => 'With new swords in their hands, your recruits are ready to escort your general to Capital Island!',
        'GuiDaiTheGoodGeneralsSub4' => 'The cannons were loaded into the hold of the ship!',
        'GuiDaiTheGoodGeneralsSub5' => 'The new crossbows look amazing! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheGoodGeneralsSub6' => 'The equipment is ready! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheGoodGeneralsSub7' => 'Our artillery is ready, and the king has demanded a demonstration. As soon as we\'ve given everyone some earplugs, we can get started. The gunpowder you provided guarantees it\'s going to be heard across the whole island!',
        'GuiDaiTheGoodGeneralsSub8' => 'These swords will please the king for sure. And, as I haven\'t seen many other soldiers around with these, we\'ll impress the others too!',
        'GuiDaiTheHammerBrothers' => 'The brothers have appeared from a hole in the ground to tell us our soil isn\'t the best type for their tests, but they were very thankful nonetheless!',
        'GuiDaiTheHammerBrothersSub1' => 'They got the fish, cooked it, and now they can get to work!',
        'GuiDaiTheHammerBrothersSub2' => 'We have enough troops now.',
        'GuiDaiTheHammerBrothersSub3' => 'The tunnels seems to be clean!',
        'GuiDaiTheHammerBrothersSub4' => 'The recruits enjoyed the field training.',
        'GuiDaiTheHammerBrothersSub5' => 'They welcomed the iron and have left to make new tools!',
        'GuiDaiTheHammerBrothersSub6' => 'Our deposits are filled!',
        'GuiDaiTheHammerBrothersSub7' => 'The brothers came out of the tunnel satisfied with their work. Of course, one of the downsides of it being underground is that we won\'t be able to check on their work ourselves. We\'ll just have to trust them on this one!',
        'GuiDaiTheHammerBrothersSub8' => 'We\'ve shown the brothers how we grow the magic beans, and they\'ve assured us that it\'s perfectly safe to continue doing so, as the beans are nowhere near any waste water. We have to keep using only the purest water for these!',
        'GuiDaiTheHauntedIsland' => 'This is what I call a total waste of time - the island is completely deserted. There must have been a fire or something - the air sure is weird around these parts. Perhaps we should go back home... Wait! Where did the scout disappear to? Hello?',
        'GuiDaiTheHauntedIslandSub1' => 'The wheat stash was replaced. The farmer claims he saw a fiery person run into the barn that night. I\'m sure he was hallucinating.',
        'GuiDaiTheHauntedIslandSub2' => 'Your friend was happy you visited and helped out. He tells us that all the weird stuff stopped when the scout left! Weird. Let\'s go explore that island.',
        'GuiDaiTheHauntedIslandSub3' => 'We\'ve managed to get the wildlife back to the field, and found a strange white spot where Samuel claimed to have seen the mystery person. Don\'t go near.',
        'GuiDaiTheHauntedIslandSub4' => 'The merchant was happy to receive the iron swords. I asked him whether he had seen anything else dancing, but it seems he lacks a sense of humor.',
        'GuiDaiTheHauntedIslandSub5' => 'The wildlife has been restored. We found some weird footprints that were still glowing, but the moment we got closer they disappeared. What\'s going on here?',
        'GuiDaiTheHauntedIslandSub6' => 'The adventure led us to a neighbouring island. It\'s only a short way to the island of Countess Zavora from here.',
        'GuiDaiTheHauntedIslandSub7' => 'Turns out the little creature was not really an imp, he was just a very small and ugly man. However, the information he\'s given us will definitely come in handy. I\'ll spread the intel with the rest of the guild.',
        'GuiDaiTheHauntedIslandSub8' => 'The squad is ready, and I\'ve thought of the perfect name for it: The Haunt Busters! You don\'t like it? How about the Ghost Squad? The Urban Legends? No? Ok, I give up.',
        'GuiDaiTheHoneyIssue' => 'The bee problem was solved! We can expect new shipments of honey to come in by the end of the week!',
        'GuiDaiTheHoneyIssueSub1' => 'The stone was delivered to the honey supplier!',
        'GuiDaiTheHoneyIssueSub2' => 'The new recruits are going to patrol around those fields, for a while at least.',
        'GuiDaiTheHoneyIssueSub3' => 'The deposits were filled!',
        'GuiDaiTheHoneyIssueSub4' => 'Our allies received our gift!',
        'GuiDaiTheHoneyIssueSub5' => 'We have enough troops to send out if needed!',
        'GuiDaiTheHoneyIssueSub6' => 'The adventure was fun, and we even took care of some enemies!',
        'GuiDaiTheHoneyIssueSub7' => 'It seems that we had a partial success! The bees are definitely more calm now with all the smoke, but next time let\'s use just some wood to make a fire, ok? We\'ve left quite a nasty crater on the farm!',
        'GuiDaiTheHoneyIssueSub8' => 'The queen is safe! Hoorah! Our queen? Queen Anita? Heavens, no! She\'s perfectly fine in the palace! I mean the bee queen! Where would the hive be without its queen?',
        'GuiDaiTheLandlords' => 'Our island is the safest! And you know what? We are going to keep it that way! We won the challenge! The King has sent us a nice reward!',
        'GuiDaiTheLandlordsSub1' => 'Very good! Nice armour.',
        'GuiDaiTheLandlordsSub2' => 'The leader of the soldiers in the group have congratulated our stablemaster!',
        'GuiDaiTheLandlordsSub3' => 'We placed the new cannons! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheLandlordsSub4' => 'It seems that the bandit issue is now under control. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheLandlordsSub5' => 'The men are ready to defend the shores if necessary! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheLandlordsSub6' => 'The scouts seems to be happy about the coal! If they are happy, we are happy!',
        'GuiDaiTheLandlordsSub7' => 'The titanium swords have been distributed, and the judges have received one for evaluation. Fingers crossed this helps our standing in the competition!',
        'GuiDaiTheLandlordsSub8' => 'The men have shown their abilities. You should have seen the audience\'s faces as they watched the demonstration. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheLostQueen' => 'Well, we did our best but we couldn\'t find the queen. Even her ship has disappeared, can you believe that? A mysterious event, if ever there was one. I\'m not even sure she was here…',
        'GuiDaiTheLostQueenSub1' => 'Our scout has returned, but he didn\'t see or hear anything. Shame.',
        'GuiDaiTheLostQueenSub2' => 'Our scouts have explored all the sectors, but there\'s no queen or escort in any of them. Weird.',
        'GuiDaiTheLostQueenSub3' => 'The leader of the scouts can now build the lookouts, and maybe they\'ll spot the queen and her escort! They have promised to report back daily.',
        'GuiDaiTheLostQueenSub4' => 'There - at least we\'ve made sure she\'ll be safe… Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheLostQueenSub5' => 'Our search party is ready to leave… or rather gallop away! Ha ha! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheLostQueenSub6' => 'The hunters are very eager to look for the queen while hunting for game. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheLostQueenSub7' => 'I hope we never have to use these, but it\'s better safe than sorry. Let your scouts borrow them, and they\'ll take care of any threat to the queen.',
        'GuiDaiTheLostQueenSub8' => 'These will do nicely. I\'ll equip them with visible banners and signs to inform the queen we\'re not hostile, and dispatch them right away.',
        'GuiDaiTheMapMakerSub7' => 'We\'ve received the first edition of the potential printed copy, and Coron is very pleased with it. With any luck, he\'ll file a request to print a whole batch of them at some point.',
        'GuiDaiTheMapMakerSub8' => 'Here it is! Initially, I didn\'t understand who\'d want to collect printed maps at all... But now that I see this edition closely... It\'s so shiny... And the covers are done with the finest materials... I must have this on my shelf!',
        'GuiDaiTheMapmaker' => 'Coron Franz is done mapping, and is very grateful we helped him!',
        'GuiDaiTheMapmakerSub1' => 'The soldiers are trained and ready! I hope they will protect Coron from any harm!',
        'GuiDaiTheMapmakerSub2' => 'Look at him riding that horse! He seems to enjoy it! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheMapmakerSub3' => 'Our soldiers know how to make a good sandwich. I hope Coron will like it!',
        'GuiDaiTheMapmakerSub4' => 'I found an old scroll that holds the secret to building a table in less than ten minutes. Could be useful, I guess.',
        'GuiDaiTheMapmakerSub5' => 'I sure hope Coron brought enough clothes!',
        'GuiDaiTheMapmakerSub6' => 'The steel plates will hold the maps in place, and no wind will be able to blow them away. Except a hurricane, of course.',
        'GuiDaiTheMarbleBridge' => 'From now on, most of the bridges of Capital Island will be built from marble! Pure marble! The King is most grateful!',
        'GuiDaiTheMarbleBridgeSub1' => 'Let me see… yes, these tools look really good. And strong! Great work!',
        'GuiDaiTheMarbleBridgeSub2' => 'Amazing how they can build all those things from marble! And how beautiful they look!',
        'GuiDaiTheMarbleBridgeSub3' => 'The mason will now work twice as hard! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheMarbleBridgeSub4' => 'We got the marble! Now I can calm down a bit! Thank you!',
        'GuiDaiTheMarbleBridgeSub5' => 'Yes, the settlers are ready to leave! Good job! I\'m sure they are going to build amazing marble bridges!',
        'GuiDaiTheMarbleBridgeSub6' => 'Fresh bread! I love how it smells!',
        'GuiDaiTheMarbleBridgeSub7' => 'The granite should be holding the bridge up well. At least, that\'s what our architect says. I\'m not sure I\'m willing to put it to the test. I trust her, but I\'m afraid of heights!',
        'GuiDaiTheMarbleBridgeSub8' => 'The titanium links have been provided and tested out. Even if an elephant walked over this bridge, they wouldn\'t give in. I just hope they don\'t bring an actual elephant, just in case.',
        'GuiDaiTheMirrorPonds' => 'Lady Amidale was so astonished that she decided to move her residence to among the ponds! Imagine that! She was most grateful, and her gifts are already here. Take a look!',
        'GuiDaiTheMirrorPondsSub1' => 'The tools are finished and delivered. I hope they are strong enough - there are a lot of holes to dig.',
        'GuiDaiTheMirrorPondsSub2' => 'The huts are in perfect condition and the wood is ready to be delivered. There will be a lots of buckets, indeed. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheMirrorPondsSub3' => 'Thank you, your settlers were a big help! There are a lot of goods to move around!',
        'GuiDaiTheMirrorPondsSub4' => 'The whole settlement is bathed in the smell of fresh bread! The men will be happy to hear about the feast awaiting them at the dig site! Wonderful!',
        'GuiDaiTheMirrorPondsSub5' => 'Lady Amidale loves marble! She is very satisfied with the quality you supplied! Thanks for that!',
        'GuiDaiTheMirrorPondsSub6' => 'You could almost fill a lake with that much water. It will be quite enough, thank you! I really like your wells, you know?',
        'GuiDaiTheMirrorPondsSub7' => 'I laughed so hard I nearly choked on my water! You should have seen the cannoneers looking at themselves in the pond, and making flirty faces. It was priceless!',
        'GuiDaiTheMirrorPondsSub8' => 'Well, I took Lady Amidale to look at the new decorations. She did like them, but I was still hoping for a bigger reaction. Oh well. She\'d never notice me anyway...',
        'GuiDaiTheOreCollectors' => 'Yes, the ore collectors left this morning! They seemed to be completely satisfied, though I\'m not sure we talked them into taking the titanium. It\'s as if they were afraid of it… anyway, we got our share of payment!',
        'GuiDaiTheOreCollectorsSub1' => 'The collectors loved the food we served them!',
        'GuiDaiTheOreCollectorsSub2' => 'The copper ore is ready to be delivered to their big ship!',
        'GuiDaiTheOreCollectorsSub3' => 'We have the iron ore ready to be delivered!',
        'GuiDaiTheOreCollectorsSub4' => 'The gold ore is ready to be delivered to their big ship!',
        'GuiDaiTheOreCollectorsSub5' => 'The titanium ore is ready! We\'ve packed it very well. I hope they won\'t get sick anymore! Weird people!',
        'GuiDaiTheOreCollectorsSub6' => 'They kind of enjoyed our food, though it\'s clear that this is not their usual diet. I wonder what do they eat…',
        'GuiDaiTheOreCollectorsSub7' => 'Platinum is a rare mineral to come by. Maybe the next time we encounter the collectors, they can share the mystery of where the platinum minerals come from.',
        'GuiDaiTheOreCollectorsSub8' => 'They seem fascinated by the process! I do wonder how our explorers found the ore before we were able to mine it ourselves, though? Was it just lying on the floor or something?',
        'GuiDaiThePainter' => 'The painter did an amazing work on those walls! We should send him to Capital Island and have him decorate the King\'s palace too! And look, the nobles want to thank us with these rewards! How nice!',
        'GuiDaiThePainterSub1' => 'We gave the man the coins. He is indeed using them to decorate the walls. Well… at least our nobles are happy about it.',
        'GuiDaiThePainterSub2' => 'Well, he got the stones. I wonder what he will do with them.',
        'GuiDaiThePainterSub3' => 'The gold ore is available for the painter. The golden wall shall be made. The noble is happy.',
        'GuiDaiThePainterSub4' => 'The men are ready to carry around the painter\'s supplies. I hope they don\'t ruin their clothes…',
        'GuiDaiThePainterSub5' => 'The copper ore is ready. Does he have the power to smelt the copper?',
        'GuiDaiThePainterSub6' => 'I still don\'t believe that he can actually paint marble. But he seems to be sure he can. Anyway, good job!',
        'GuiDaiTheRoyalShip' => 'Our part is done! The royal ship will be finished in no time, and we should be proud to have contributed to its construction!',
        'GuiDaiTheRoyalShipSub1' => 'A smiling ally is a good ally!',
        'GuiDaiTheRoyalShipSub2' => 'I don\'t know if the King has ever tasted our brew, but it\'s good to know he asked for it, and we delivered!',
        'GuiDaiTheRoyalShipSub3' => 'The recruits are ready to leave whenever the ship is completed!',
        'GuiDaiTheRoyalShipSub4' => 'Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheRoyalShipSub5' => 'The deposits are filled and now our hunters can resume their work!',
        'GuiDaiTheRoyalShipSub6' => 'The longbowmen are ready for duty!',
        'GuiDaiTheRoyalShipSub7' => 'Fantastic! These planks are the perfect materials for the king\'s ship. Great work!',
        'GuiDaiTheRoyalShipSub8' => 'The king\'s engineers have studied the grout, and have dispatched a few squads to obtain some for themselves! What a relief... Grout is already pretty rare as it is!',
        'GuiDaiTheStormyShores' => 'Come cyclone, tornado or hurricane, those buildings are sure to hold strong! The Merchant\'s Guild is most grateful!',
        'GuiDaiTheStormyShoresSub1' => 'Yes, now we are guaranteed to have enough free space to store anything we want. Well, not anything…',
        'GuiDaiTheStormyShoresSub2' => 'They put all the flour into these sacks, and added water. Well… not bad.',
        'GuiDaiTheStormyShoresSub3' => 'The first wall is in top shape! Let\'s hope we can fix all of them!',
        'GuiDaiTheStormyShoresSub4' => 'The storehouse is ready and empty! If they need the space, we can provide it!',
        'GuiDaiTheStormyShoresSub5' => 'We have all the hardwood they need! Let\'s load it into the ship!',
        'GuiDaiTheStormyShoresSub6' => 'The planks are done and stashed. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheStormyShoresSub7' => 'Fantastic! This granite will make the structure sturdier than ever. Well done!',
        'GuiDaiTheStormyShoresSub8' => 'Great! The grout you provided will make the construction indestructible.',
        'GuiDaiTheVault' => 'Warden Tatral is ready to go back to his prison island and build The Vault! Good job!',
        'GuiDaiTheVaultSub1' => 'The planks are ready to be shipped to island.',
        'GuiDaiTheVaultSub2' => 'The recruits are ready to leave!',
        'GuiDaiTheVaultSub3' => 'The horses were welcomed.',
        'GuiDaiTheVaultSub4' => 'The recruits have proved themselves to be good fighters indeed!',
        'GuiDaiTheVaultSub5' => 'They\'re back! Warden Tatral enjoyed the trip!',
        'GuiDaiTheVaultSub6' => 'The wildlife has been restored!',
        'GuiDaiTheVaultSub7' => 'I\'ve never really tried eating magic beanstalks, so I can\'t say whether this plan is actually going to work. In any case, we\'ve done our bit, and the warden is pleased.',
        'GuiDaiTheVaultSub8' => 'The marksmen patrolled the prison, and intimidated the prisoners with their presence. The warden appreciates your help, and looks forward to further collaborations.',
        'GuiDaiTheVeiledWilds' => 'Well, the expedition has returned with some interesting… erm… vases and broken lances, but they didn\'t see the lions. They did however find a cave that had a lion carving above the entrance, but it was empty. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheVeiledWildsSub1' => 'The sausages will make the perfect lure!',
        'GuiDaiTheVeiledWildsSub2' => 'The cavalry units are ready for the expedition!',
        'GuiDaiTheVeiledWildsSub3' => 'The bronze swords will help a lot!',
        'GuiDaiTheVeiledWildsSub4' => 'These horses are the fittest we could find! I hope they\'ll bring them back in the same condition.',
        'GuiDaiTheVeiledWildsSub5' => 'The cook has told me he is very glad we offered them the meat!',
        'GuiDaiTheVeiledWildsSub6' => 'Yes! We found it, so now he can have his ritual drink!',
        'GuiDaiTheVeiledWildsSub7' => 'That will definitely help us progress a lot faster. And as a bonus, I\'m sure it will be a lot of fun!',
        'GuiDaiTheVeiledWildsSub8' => 'The geologist took the platinum ore and started running towards the mountains. If you happen to hear a distant "Yippee!", you\'ll know he\'s been successful. I wouldn\'t count on it this time, though...',
        'GuiDaiTheWarAboveTheRiver' => 'The ship has sailed and the battle of the river will commence as soon as they get the weapons we sent them! I really hope they\'re going to be victorious! They\'ve already sent us the payment!',
        'GuiDaiTheWarAboveTheRiverSub1' => 'The bowmakers are up and ready! If there is high demand for bows, at least you know you\'re up for it!',
        'GuiDaiTheWarAboveTheRiverSub2' => 'The longbows are ready to be delivered to our friends! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheWarAboveTheRiverSub3' => 'These are the finest longbows I\'ve ever seen!',
        'GuiDaiTheWarAboveTheRiverSub4' => 'Good wood! Good work! He he!',
        'GuiDaiTheWarAboveTheRiverSub5' => 'I really hope the swords we gave them are waterproof.',
        'GuiDaiTheWarAboveTheRiverSub6' => 'I find the idea of those exploding globes fascinating. I wouldn\'t hold one, not me, no thank you.',
        'GuiDaiTheWarAboveTheRiverSub7' => 'The watchtowers are set, and we\'ve tested the protection by throwing some stones at them. It may not be the same as an arrow, but we can confirm that they\'re really sturdy.',
        'GuiDaiTheWarAboveTheRiverSub8' => 'As I suspected, they\'d never seen an arquebus before. They\'ve asked if we\'d be willing to share our technology with them in future. We have more pressing matters right now, but we told them to come back in a few months, and we\'d gladly help.',
        'GuiDaiTheWayHome' => 'Sir Arminus was honoured to see how happy we are that he managed to find his way home, and that he was so missed! Great work!',
        'GuiDaiTheWayHomeSub1' => 'The fish meal is ready and it smells so good. It might be a good idea to join the feast!',
        'GuiDaiTheWayHomeSub2' => 'Very good! So cozy, I\'m sure he\'ll settle back in again quickly!',
        'GuiDaiTheWayHomeSub3' => 'The horses were sent to welcome the general!',
        'GuiDaiTheWayHomeSub4' => 'The planks are in place. Danger has been averted!',
        'GuiDaiTheWayHomeSub5' => 'The soldiers were even dressed in old-style uniforms! I saw a big smile on Sir Arminus\' face.',
        'GuiDaiTheWayHomeSub6' => 'Sir Arminus was happy to receive a medal and be treated in a way he very much deserved!',
        'GuiDaiTheWayhomeSub7' => 'The writer is ready to start documenting everything, but maybe we should wait until Sir Arminus is ready to share. He\'s been through a lot, after all, so first let\'s take good care of him.',
        'GuiDaiTheWayhomeSub8' => 'The arsenal is ready. As soon as Sir Arminus is back in shape, he\'ll definitely want to get his hands on one, so I ordered one to be engraved just for him. Do you think he\'ll like our gift?',
        'GuiDaiTheWizards' => 'They found what they came for, and left toward the forest. I think the whole island was disturbed by their presence. I really hope we never see them again. What a bunch of weirdoes.',
        'GuiDaiTheWizardsSub1' => 'The hairy guy got the fish, thanked us and left. Ugh.',
        'GuiDaiTheWizardsSub2' => 'The silvery skinned man really enjoyed the show, though he just clapped - there was no emotion visible on his face.',
        'GuiDaiTheWizardsSub3' => 'The thin guy came back for the bread. He had a crazy look in his eyes, and left without saying thank you. How rude!',
        'GuiDaiTheWizardsSub4' => 'We visited a friend and took a gift. She was really pleased with it.',
        'GuiDaiTheWizardsSub5' => 'The leader of the group was satisfied to see how efficient our cavalry is, and it seems he found something.',
        'GuiDaiTheWizardsSub6' => 'They didn\'t care for the Mug, but thanked us for the kind gesture. At least there\'s that.',
        'GuiDaiTheWizardsSub7' => 'The wise wizard read through the tome in a matter of minutes, and he\'s asked if he can make a copy himself for his own personal research. I always found these books really boring, but if it\'s of interest of him...',
        'GuiDaiTheWizardsSub8' => 'The wizards say they\'d already seen these materials before, but they were equally happy, because they\'d just ran out of these two particular materials for their potions, so they happily accepted them.',
        'GuiDaiTheWorldsBiggestPretzel' => 'We are done! I still can\'t figure out how the cook will bake this pretzel but I\'m sure he knows. I hope. Anyway, the cook has sent us a reward!',
        'GuiDaiTheWorldsBiggestPretzelSub1' => 'The best water he can have! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheWorldsBiggestPretzelSub2' => 'The only problem with flour is that you can\'t get it off your clothes… Well, you can but it\'s rather hard.',
        'GuiDaiTheWorldsBiggestPretzelSub3' => 'The mills are ready. I\'ll have some wheat delivered right away so they can start work.',
        'GuiDaiTheWorldsBiggestPretzelSub4' => 'There. Now he is going to get a lot of new wheat. Thank the maker he doesn\'t want us to give him new copper.',
        'GuiDaiTheWorldsBiggestPretzelSub5' => 'We have the tools and we have the manpower. We\'re going to send them to the salt mines soon! Great work!',
        'GuiDaiTheWorldsBiggestPretzelSub6' => 'These new wells will ensure we don\'t run out of water. Very good!',
        'GuiDaiTheWorldsBiggestPretzelSub7' => 'The coal has been delivered, and our friends have heard all about our culinary efforts. Hopefully there\'s enough time to finish baking the pretzel before our guests start arriving.',
        'GuiDaiTheWorldsBiggestPretzelSub8' => 'It worked! The pigeons have left the pretzel alone! I mean, I guess we could have just set up a scarecrow, but where\'s the fun in that?',
        'GuiDaiTheYellowCaravan' => 'The Yellow Caravan is ready to leave. All went as planned! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiTheYellowCaravanSub1' => 'Your friend was happy to receive the gift!',
        'GuiDaiTheYellowCaravanSub2' => 'They seemed very fond of our offers. A trade well done!',
        'GuiDaiTheYellowCaravanSub3' => 'The longbowmen are ready for duty!',
        'GuiDaiTheYellowCaravanSub4' => 'Very good trip!',
        'GuiDaiTheYellowCaravanSub5' => 'The birds loved the bread! The Caravan leader will surely buy some more bread from us.',
        'GuiDaiTheYellowCaravanSub6' => 'We brought the cannons, but when the other people from the Caravan saw them, they got scared. Hey, well, at least we got some nice cannons.',
        'GuiDaiTheYellowCaravanSub7' => 'They had a lot of interest in the crossbows, but we\'ve agreed that it\'d be a very dangerous item to sell straight away. They\'ve devised a handy way to keep things safe, though - now, you get a free course on how to operate a crossbow with every purchase. It\'s actually pretty clever!',
        'GuiDaiTheYellowCaravanSub8' => 'I agree with them that the platinum brew mug is definitely the most impressive thing that I\'ve ever seen, but I doubt that anyone\'s going to be able to afford one! It\'s bound to become an instant collector\'s item!',
        'GuiDaiUnderTheSun' => 'Theodor was really grateful and promised he will one day pay us back the favor. Just like he said for the last million favors we did for him…',
        'GuiDaiUnderTheSunSub1' => 'Our friends promised to help with transport!',
        'GuiDaiUnderTheSunSub2' => 'The recruits are ready to defend the small town. Hope they brought some sunscreen.',
        'GuiDaiUnderTheSunSub3' => 'The sausages are ready!',
        'GuiDaiUnderTheSunSub4' => 'The longbows are ready!',
        'GuiDaiUnderTheSunSub5' => 'The exotic wood planks are ready!',
        'GuiDaiUnderTheSunSub6' => 'The general has come back with a lot of notes!',
        'GuiDaiUnderTheSunSub7' => 'The blacksmiths paid a lot of attention and asked a lot of questions. I think they\'re ready for action - although I do feel sorry for them... Working in a forge must be hot enough, but a forge in the desert??',
        'GuiDaiUnderTheSunSub8' => 'Their leader greeted us and we apologized on Theodor\'s behalf. He says that while some damage has been done, as soon as it\'s paid back we can come to terms with each other. I\'ll inform Theodor myself.',
        'GuiDaiUniquePrison' => 'The Count has decided to utilize all the various areas of the island. This will give prisoners their own little territories so they won\'t jump at each other\'s necks. He has named the place Bastille Island. Maybe one day we might visit, who knows? Good work!',
        'GuiDaiUniquePrisonSub1' => 'Good work. The stone will sure come useful!',
        'GuiDaiUniquePrisonSub2' => 'The bread smells very good. Too bad it\'s going to get cold by the time it reaches Bastille Island.',
        'GuiDaiUniquePrisonSub3' => 'The builders were happy to receive the tasty fish!',
        'GuiDaiUniquePrisonSub4' => 'The horses did a great job moving the cargo!',
        'GuiDaiUniquePrisonSub5' => 'Our crossbows are the best! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiUniquePrisonSub6' => 'The cannons were delivered!',
        'GuiDaiUniquePrisonSub7' => 'The crossbowmen have been given instructions and have been deployed. They have also been equipped with an extra supply of caffeinated drinks. Nights can get very long up there!',
        'GuiDaiUniquePrisonSub8' => 'We tested the range of the mortars, and confirmed that we can hit a target from so far away, our enemies can\'t possibly strike back. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiVillageContract' => 'Well, Will Fixit has done a great job! He merits his name! I think we should have him visit us next year too.',
        'GuiDaiVillageContractSub1' => 'Will Fixit was pleased to see we also brought some gifts with us.',
        'GuiDaiVillageContractSub2' => 'Not sure whether the bowmen will want to climb up very high, but we\'ll see. Maybe Will can talk some sense into them.',
        'GuiDaiVillageContractSub3' => 'The marble block looks impressive! I wonder whom it will represent when it gets sculpted.',
        'GuiDaiVillageContractSub4' => 'The new breed of fish acts, looks and tastes the same as the old one. Not much improvement, if you ask me.',
        'GuiDaiVillageContractSub5' => 'I\'m not sure what he suspected we were doing with horses other than training them. Anyway, he looks pleased now.',
        'GuiDaiVillageContractSub6' => 'Will Fixit had a good time on the adventure!',
        'GuiDaiVillageContractSub7' => 'Well, Will\'s creation certainly looks attractive, but... I just can\'t figure out what it is! Everyone who came to see it has been saying the same thing. I bet this artisan is one of those "abstract" artists I keep hearing about.',
        'GuiDaiVillageContractSub8' => 'Will says he\'s made some modifications to make it a little bit less hostile. What modifications? Now that you mention it... I forgot to ask. I think he may have just hung them up as decorations.',
        'GuiDaiWelcomeTheTravelers' => 'The travellers will be most satisfied with our hospitality! I am sure they will spread our good reputation to the neighbouring islands!',
        'GuiDaiWelcomeTheTravelersSub1' => 'Good! In case they want to go and hunt, we sure are ready to supply them with the bows!',
        'GuiDaiWelcomeTheTravelersSub2' => 'They can start a race if they want! Good work!',
        'GuiDaiWelcomeTheTravelersSub3' => 'I bet we could even sell the water to them! But we can\'t do that, sadly, he he. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiWelcomeTheTravelersSub4' => 'The fresh smell of bread will surely lure some travellers to this region!',
        'GuiDaiWelcomeTheTravelersSub5' => 'Look at all these clean coins! Who would not love to win some of those?! I hope they know how to play bones…',
        'GuiDaiWelcomeTheTravelersSub6' => 'The soldiers are ready for any troublemakers! Well done training them!',
        'GuiDaiWelcomeTheTravelersSub7' => 'This party will definitely please anyone who comes to visit! I just hope they go easy on the brew... There needs to be enough for everyone!',
        'GuiDaiWelcomeTheTravelersSub8' => 'Perfect! Just like the one my momma used to take me to! Can\'t wait to test my skills. That giant fluffy monkey plush will be mine!',
        'GuiDaiWhitePets' => 'Good news! Our expedition has managed to help Lord Addam\'s crew and we\'ve located the three pets. They were being looked after by a tall man with glasses, but he disappeared when we got near. Lord Addam would have liked to thank him for taking care of his pets. Good work nonetheless!',
        'GuiDaiWhitePetsSub1' => 'The ship seems to be repaired. Now we can go and look for the pets!',
        'GuiDaiWhitePetsSub2' => 'We\'ve counted our military units, and it seems we\'re ready to handle a pirate attack if necessary!',
        'GuiDaiWhitePetsSub3' => 'The gift was well appreciated! Sadly, the pets were not on that island!',
        'GuiDaiWhitePetsSub4' => 'The recruits are ready. They\'ll leave at first light and look for the pets.',
        'GuiDaiWhitePetsSub5' => 'The new settlers are here! Now we can go and look for the pets!',
        'GuiDaiWhitePetsSub6' => 'The soldiers are ready. Nobody told them the pets might get angry, so let\'s not mention it either, alright?',
        'GuiDaiWhitePetsSub7' => 'It\'s been a while since we set the trap, but so far there\'s been no sign of the pet. Let\'s hope that some of our guild mates have been luckier than we have in this regard...',
        'GuiDaiWhitePetsSub8' => 'Now this is a cage that nothing will be able to escape from! Oh wait, there\'s a minor oversight... How do we open it to put the animals inside? I\'ll go fetch the engineer...',
        'GuiDaiWildlifeControl' => 'The list is done! The Wildlife Control Group should leave now. To be honest, I didn’t know we had so many problems until they arrived.',
        'GuiDaiWildlifeControlSub1' => 'Apparently we\'re doing a good job with our fish schools, which is great, but nothing we didn\'t already know before they arrived.',
        'GuiDaiWildlifeControlSub2' => 'I think our neighbour didn\'t even notice our hunters "visiting" their hunting grounds. Anyway, the gifts were very well received and our hunters behaved again, so we\'ve done good!',
        'GuiDaiWildlifeControlSub3' => 'We need to brush the horses more frequently, and feed them some special wheat for a week or two. Other than that, all seems good.',
        'GuiDaiWildlifeControlSub4' => 'The check is finished, and it seems we have enough soldiers to protect the wildlife of the island in case of danger. Good to know.',
        'GuiDaiWildlifeControlSub5' => 'The longbowmen are off to patrol the island and protect the animals.',
        'GuiDaiWildlifeControlSub6' => 'The fish school was refilled and we\'ve passed yet another test.',
        'GuiDaiWildlifeControlSub7' => 'It seems that the signs are working! Our hunters are ignoring the deer and the forests are slowly repopulating. Wildlife Control will be pleased!',
        'GuiDaiWildlifeControlSub8' => 'Our foresters have given us the report. Exotic trees are far from being endangered. We\'ve kept to our quota, and Wildlife Control is happy to see this report. Great work!',
        'GuiDaiWinterMightCome' => 'I should\'ve known it! The cold weather isn\'t about to hit our island at all! Our weather prophet was completely wrong… Well, at least now we have a lot of resources. There\'s no blaming him - everyone makes mistakes from time to time, right? In any case, the King did send us a reward to thank us for the hard work!',
        'GuiDaiWinterMightComeSub1' => 'The mixture will work its magic soon enough! Our hunters will be pleased!',
        'GuiDaiWinterMightComeSub2' => 'The fish will love the lightshow we\'re making for them!',
        'GuiDaiWinterMightComeSub3' => 'There! You did a good thing today! Good job!',
        'GuiDaiWinterMightComeSub4' => 'We have the flour, and it\'s well stored. Done and done!',
        'GuiDaiWinterMightComeSub5' => 'Good! We have the required blankets! Nice work!',
        'GuiDaiWinterMightComeSub6' => 'We need to keep the water indoors - we don\'t want it to freeze. Good work!',
        'GuiDaiWinterMightComeSub7' => 'Excellent! Worst case scenario, if winter doesn\'t come, the children can use the coal for painting the walls, or something!',
        'GuiDaiWinterMightComeSub8' => 'I\'ve tried the prototype on, and it\'s definitely warm! It looks horrible, though. People may actually prefer to be cold rather than wear this... thing.',
        'GuiDaithePainterSub7' => 'I just heard back from our writer. He said that even though there were some interesting bits in the painter\'s memoirs, most of it was rather boring. I think I\'ll wait for the stage show...',
        'GuiDaithePainterSub8' => 'The painter is back, and from the look on his face, I\'d say he got some serious inspiration from his adventure. I\'m actually somewhat excited to see his next painting now!',
        'GuildFest_Adventures_Turnin' => 'The paths are walked, the sights are seen, our adventure’s finished, but we’re still keen.
With every step and every mile, the quest is done, we’ve earned our smile!',
        'GuildFest_Day10_Turnin' => 'The challenge is over, our words are tight, our bookcraft task is out of sight.
With every chapter, plot, and rhyme, the writing’s finished, and it’s sublime!',
        'GuildFest_Day1_Turnin' => 'Today the miners get a reward, for going the extra mile.
Their dedication, and hard work, never failed to bring a smile.',
        'GuildFest_Day2_Turnin' => 'Board of this wood? We don\'t think so! Once the cuts are done, you’ll feel so good.
With every saw and every slice, your craftsmanship will truly suffice!',
        'GuildFest_Day3_Turnin' => 'The veins are tapped and metal’s mined, our hard work\'s done and dusted.
From deep within the earth so wide, our instincts we have trusted!',
        'GuildFest_Day4_Turnin' => 'The pots are clean, the flavors bold, our kitchen’s done and stories told.
With every bite and every taste, our cooking task has been embraced!',
        'GuildFest_Day5_Turnin' => 'The forge has cooled, the sword is bright, our crafting task has ended right.
With every polish and each detail, the sword’s complete and cannot fail!',
        'GuildFest_Day6_Turnin' => 'The quivers full, the scopes aligned, our ranged weapon task is now refined.
With every tweak and every draw, the arms are done and ready for awe!',
        'GuildFest_Day7_Turnin' => 'The pages are set, the story flows, our text is done, as everyone knows.
With every line and every draft, our writing’s complete and ready to craft!',
        'GuildFest_Day8_Turnin' => 'The hands are still, the work’s in sight, our craftsmanship task is done just right.
With every finish, smooth and fine, the project’s complete and now can shine!',
        'GuildFest_Day9_Turnin' => 'The factory’s still, the goods are primed, our processing task, done in time.
The shelves are stacked from high to low, our product line\'s ready to go!',
        'GuildFest_ExtraBuilding' => 'Now the guests are all settled and well catered to, Guild Fest ignites, with an extra queue. Guilds come together, in friendly fight, competing with passion from morning to night.',
        'GuildFest_ExtraBuilding2' => 'You’ve conquered the quest, what a brilliant feat,
Extra accommodations worked a treat.
Tokens are flowing, you’ve proven your worth,
Guild Fest shines thanks to your hard work!',
        'GuildFest_GuildSize2' => 'You’ve joined a guild, and made it complete,
With two members or more, the challenge you’ll beat.',
        'GuildFest_OpenPanel' => 'Here are some gifts, a time to explore; let’s celebrate now, with activities galore!',
        'GuildFest_Tutorial_Main' => 'No longer lonely, you’re where you belong,
Together you’ll rise, where friendships are strong!',
        'HQ1_ThePumpkinMaster' => 'Yes, very good. Now we have enough pumpkins to continue with our plans to stop the Hollow Man! Here, I\'ve also found some pumpkins for you!',
        'HQ1h_TendingTheSpookyCrops' => 'Very good, now my little pumpkins will grow faster! Here, I\'ve found more pumpkins - you can have them!',
        'HQ2_TricksAndTreats' => 'I hope your friend won\'t get mad at you, it\'s just a test after all! But a good one, it seems! Now we know about the true power of darkness! We\'re one step closer in our quest to defeat the Hollow Man! Oh look what I\'ve found! Some pumpkins for you!',
        'HQ3_ShinyLights' => 'It worked! The very strong light repelled the darkness! Great job! Have some more pumpkins!',
        'HQ4_SixFeetUnder' => 'We\'ve found a Zombie! He is not that smart… but hey, what can you expect from a guy who has no brains, right? He is going to help you produce resources more quickly! Also, your settlers found some more pumpkins around the dig site!',
        'HQ5_LordlyCall' => 'Mr. Myers came out of his crypt as soon as I placed the chest armour at the front of the door. He does look a little pale, doesn\'t he? I bet he\'s going to help you train your military units faster! Great! Now that we have all we need here, we should move on to the final phase of our plan: creating a marble moon!',
        'HQ6_MarbleMoon' => 'We got the marble we need! Great! Now I will leave your island to cover the moon in marble. That will scare away the Hollow Man! After he is gone, we\'re going to use this bag of Sun Buff, a magical powder, that will allow us to bring back the sun! You don\'t have to understand how this kind of magic works, it\'s complicated! It was a great pleasure to work with you! Here, take this Sun Buff! Use it, and welcome back the sun!',
        'HQ7_SunBuff' => 'Well done! You have your sun back! You don\'t need my help any more, so I shall say goodbye now. Just one thing though - rumour has it that the Hollow Man comes back every year, so maybe we will see each other again next year, when the Hollow Man returns! Farewell!',
        'HQ8_WildGrowingPumpkins' => 'Great, you found a pumpkin!',
        'HQ9_ImportedPumpkins' => 'Ahh, you brought us some pumpkins from your adventure. Good work!',
        'HW2013_EventMonster1' => 'You did it, the Golem has been turned to stone! Now I can finally collect the first crucial piece for my spell: a chunk of its stony skin.',
        'HW2013_EventMonster2' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2013_EventMonster3' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2013_EventMonster4' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2013_EventMonster_Global' => 'Great work! You and your friends and neighbours defeated enough golems to help me collect the ingredients for my banishing spell!',
        'HW2013_EventMonster_Looped' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2013_EventMonster_Reach19' => 'Great stuff - you reached the level we needed. Now, it\'s time to prepare for the golem\'s fall!',
        'HW2013_EventMonster_Tut1' => 'Very well, this should be enough for a little test.',
        'HW2013_EventMonster_Tut2' => 'Yeah, that\'s how you do it! He\'s already struggling with his balance!',
        'HW2013_ThePumpkinMasterMain' => 'Whoo! You managed to solve the Halloween Event\'s basics. With your new knowledge, you should be able to gather tons of pumpkins. Good luck!',
        'HW2013_ThePumpkinMasterSub1' => 'So, these are the pumpkin cemeteries. They\'re a pretty good way to gather pumpkins, but remember - you can only buy a certain amount of cemeteries. They are not unlimited.',
        'HW2013_ThePumpkinMasterSub2' => 'Wow, you gathered those in a hurry! Feel free to spend them at the merchant for items, or trade them with other players for luxury resources? It\'s up to you.',
        'HW2014_EventMonster1' => 'You did it, the Golem has been turned to stone! Now I can finally collect the first crucial piece for my spell: a chunk of its stony skin.',
        'HW2014_EventMonster2' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2014_EventMonster3' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2014_EventMonster4' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2014_EventMonster_Ancient1' => 'You did it! The big Golem is nothing more than stone now. Perhaps I should collect a chunk of this one as well - it might be even better for my spell.',
        'HW2014_EventMonster_Ancient2' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2014_EventMonster_Ancient3' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2014_EventMonster_Ancient4' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2014_EventMonster_Ancient_Looped' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2014_EventMonster_Greater1' => 'You did it! The big Golem is nothing more than stone now. Perhaps I should collect a chunk of this one as well - it might be better for my spell.',
        'HW2014_EventMonster_Greater2' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2014_EventMonster_Greater3' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2014_EventMonster_Greater4' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2014_EventMonster_Greater_Looped' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2014_EventMonster_Looped' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2014_EventMonster_Reach19' => 'Great stuff - you reached the level we needed. Now, it\'s time to prepare for the golem\'s downfall!',
        'HW2014_EventMonster_Tut1' => 'Good work, this should be enough for a little test!',
        'HW2014_EventMonster_Tut2' => 'Yeah, that\'s how you do it! We\'ve got him on the ropes!',
        'HW2014_ThePumpkinMasterMain' => 'Whoo! Now you know the Halloween Event basics! With your new knowledge, you should be able to gather tons of pumpkins. Good luck!',
        'HW2014_ThePumpkinMasterSub1' => 'So, these are the pumpkin cemeteries. They\'re a pretty good way to gather pumpkins, but remember - you can only buy a certain amount of cemeteries. They are not unlimited.',
        'HW2014_ThePumpkinMasterSub2' => 'Wow, you gathered those in a hurry! Feel free to spend them at the merchant for items, or trade them with other players for luxury resources? It\'s up to you.',
        'HW2016_EventMonster1' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster2' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster3' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster4' => 'You did it, the Golem has been turned to stone! Now I can finally collect the first crucial piece for my spell: a chunk of its stony skin.',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Ancient1' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Ancient2' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Ancient3' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Ancient4' => 'You did it! The big Golem is nothing more than stone now. Perhaps I should collect a chunk of this one as well - it might be even better for my spell.',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Ancient_Looped' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Greater1' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Greater2' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Greater3' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Greater4' => 'You did it! The big Golem is nothing more than stone now. Perhaps I should collect a chunk of this one as well - it might be better for my spell.',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Greater_Looped' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Looped' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Reach19' => 'Great stuff - you reached the level we needed. Now, it\'s time to prepare for the golem\'s downfall!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Supreme1' => 'You did it, the icy golem has melted away! As usual, I will collect a little bit of this one as well, before it completely melts away.',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Supreme2' => 'Great! Another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Supreme3' => 'Great! Another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Supreme4' => 'Great! Another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Supreme_Looped' => 'Great! Another golem down!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Tut1' => 'Good work, this should be enough for a little test!',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Tut2' => 'Yeah, that\'s how you do it! We\'ve got him on the ropes!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_MainLvl19' => 'We did a great thing today. The homeless have found jobs, and a place to stay in our island - and our settlers had a lot of fun too. In the end, I\'d like to say thanks to the original instigator of the rumour, but he\'s nowhere to be seen...',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_MainLvl26' => 'We did a great thing today. The homeless have found jobs, and a place to stay in our island - and our settlers had a lot of fun too. In the end, I\'d like to say thanks to the original instigator of the rumour, but he\'s nowhere to be seen...',
