        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl19' => 'The event was a huge success, and everyone was very helpful and kind to our homeless. Quite ironically, they would have been the forgotten members of society, if this whole ghost chase hadn\'t happened.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl26' => 'The event was a huge success, and everyone was very helpful and kind to our homeless. Quite ironically, they would have been the forgotten members of society, if this whole ghost chase hadn\'t happened.',
