        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl46' => 'The event was a huge success, and everyone was very helpful and kind to our homeless. Quite ironically, they would have been the forgotten members of society, if this whole ghost chase hadn\'t happened.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl56' => 'The event was a huge success, and everyone was very helpful and kind to our homeless. Quite ironically, they would have been the forgotten members of society, if this whole ghost chase hadn\'t happened.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl66' => 'The event was a huge success, and everyone was very helpful and kind to our homeless. Quite ironically, they would have been the forgotten members of society, if this whole ghost chase hadn\'t happened.',
        'HW2016_ThePumpkinMasterMain' => 'Whoo! Now you know the Halloween Event basics! With your new knowledge, you should be able to gather tons of pumpkins. Good luck!',
        'HW2016_ThePumpkinMasterSub1' => 'So, these are the pumpkin cemeteries. They\'re a pretty good way to gather pumpkins, but remember - you can only buy a certain amount of cemeteries. They are not unlimited.',
        'HW2016_ThePumpkinMasterSub2' => 'Wow, you gathered those in a hurry! Feel free to spend them at the merchant for items, or trade them with other players for luxury resources? It\'s up to you.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodMain' => 'This is for you. Farewell.
Oh wait, I almost forgot! You need to water the tree properly! Let me show you.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub1' => 'Fine.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub10' => 'Sweet.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub11' => 'Sublime.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub12' => 'Quaint.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub13' => 'Interesting.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub14' => 'See, it\'s not that hard. Have fun with the tree!
Just be careful - tearing it down will destroy its roots, even though you should be able to get a seed back from it.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub2' => 'Ok.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub3' => 'Splendid.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub4' => 'Good.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub5' => 'Yup.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub6' => 'Very well.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub7' => 'Perfect.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub8' => 'Delightful.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub9' => 'Lovely.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster1' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster2' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster3' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster4' => 'You did it, the golem has been turned to stone! Now I can finally collect the first crucial piece for my spell: a chunk of its stony skin.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Ancient1' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Ancient2' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Ancient3' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Ancient4' => 'You did it! The fiery golem is nothing more than stone now. Perhaps I should collect a chunk of this one as well - it might be better for my spell.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Ancient_Looped' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Greater1' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Greater2' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Greater3' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Greater4' => 'You did it! The big golem is nothing more than stone now. Perhaps I should collect a chunk of this one as well - it might be better for my spell.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Greater_Looped' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Looped' => 'Great, another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Reach19' => 'Great, you reached the level we needed. Now, it\'s time to prepare the golem\'s downfall!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Supreme1' => 'You did it, the icy golem has melted away! As usual, I\'ll collect a little bit of this one before it completely melts away.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Supreme2' => 'Great! Another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Supreme3' => 'Great! Another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Supreme4' => 'Great! Another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Supreme_Looped' => 'Great! Another golem down!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Tut1' => 'Good work, this should be enough for a little test!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Tut2' => 'Yeah, that\'s how you do it! See how he\'s already struggling to balance?',
        'HW2017plus_TerrorizedTownDelay1' => 'The preparations are complete, and everything\'s working. Can you feel that? That\'s the feeling of relief, knowing we\'re safe and ready for anything that might hit us.',
        'HW2017plus_TerrorizedTownDelay2' => 'I just received a letter from our scientist. I hope it contains good news, and not an additional delay.',
        'HW2017plus_TerrorizedTownMain' => 'Evil has been banished, and the townspeople rejoice!
It appears they\'ve been saved for good. But what about next Halloween...?',
        'HW2017plus_TerrorizedTownSub0' => 'We\'ve found it! A tiny island, surrounded by fog.
Even so, I still can\'t believe nobody\'s noticed it before? It\'s almost as if it didn\'t exist until recently...',
        'HW2017plus_TerrorizedTownSub1' => 'Good job! That said, I don\'t like what that scientist said about his lord encouraging him. Could he have anticipated what would happen...?',
        'HW2017plus_TerrorizedTownSub2' => 'As frustrating as it is, we can\'t do anything for now.
The scientist promised to inform us when he figures out how to break the castle\'s barrier. Make sure you\'re ready!',
        'HW2017plus_TerrorizedTownSub3' => 'What a vile creature! A lord that tortures his population for fun? Disgusting!
I\'m just glad we ended up with you. I hope you know how much the settlers appreciate you!',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_MainLvl19' => 'We did a great thing today. The homeless have found jobs and a place to stay on our island - and our settlers had a lot of fun too. In the end, I\'d like to thank the original instigator of the rumor, but he\'s nowhere to be seen...',
