        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl19' => 'The event was a huge success, and everyone was very kind and helpful to our homeless. Quite ironically, they would have been the forgotten members of society if this whole ghost chase hadn\'t happened.',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl26' => 'The event was a huge success, and everyone was very kind and helpful to our homeless. Quite ironically, they would have been the forgotten members of society if this whole ghost chase hadn\'t happened.',
