        'HW2017plus_ThePumpkinMasterMain' => 'Yay! Now you know the Halloween Event basics. With your new knowledge, you should be able to gather tons of pumpkins. Good luck!',
        'HW2017plus_ThePumpkinMasterSub1' => 'So, these are the pumpkin cemeteries. They\'re a pretty good way to gather pumpkins, but remember - you can only buy a certain number of cemeteries. They are not unlimited.',
        'HW2017plus_ThePumpkinMasterSub2' => 'Wow, you gathered those in a hurry! Feel free to spend them at the merchant for items, or trade them with other players for luxury resources? It\'s up to you.',
        'HW2017plus_ZombieInvaders_Intro1' => 'What are these creatures, and where do they come from?',
        'HW2017plus_ZombieInvaders_Reach50' => 'Unholy structures have materialized out of nowhere, and monstrosities are crawling out of them.',
        'HW2017plus_ZombieInvaders_Repeatable_Timer' => 'It is just as I feared... They just keep coming.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv1_Main' => 'Well, that\'s that problem taken care of.
For some reason, I have a bit of a bad feeling about leaving so soon, but I can\'t quite put my finger on why... Still, there\'s nothing more for us to do here, so let\'s just say our farewells to the townsfolk and be off.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv1_Sub1' => 'Well fought! But we have no time to waste. We must act before more golems show up!',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv1_Sub2' => 'Well, that looks sturdy enough. It won\'t last forever - but if we\'ve done our job properly, it won\'t have to.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv1_Sub3' => 'There! I think I can see a structure just ahead. Stay close!',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv1_Sub4' => 'Wait! Stand down! The man swears he didn\'t know what he was doing.

He says he wasn\'t aware that the golems were rampaging about. The island\'s lord was allegedly very interested in this project, and said he\'d take care of the golems. I wonder what happened?',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv2_Main' => 'This is so frustrating! We\'re so close, but we still can\'t do anything! The fact he\'s choosing to hide behind his magic proves that he\'s the culprit, too.

I\'ve asked the scientist for help, and he\'s promised he\'ll start working on a solution right away. His way of making up for the trouble he caused earlier. He said he might well take a few days, though.
I suppose we should return home until we hear from him.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv2_Sub1' => 'We\'re getting there. Still a way to go, though.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv2_Sub2' => 'It feels good to be standing on somewhat even ground again.
The castle looks even scarier up close. But that won\'t stop us, will it?',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv2_Sub3' => 'What is this?! I can\'t even reach the gate! Some invisible force won\'t let us enter.
Is this some kind of dark magic?!',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv3_Main' => 'It looks like "entertainment" was all the motivation the tyrant needed to terrorize an entire island... 
Now that our job here is done, I\'m going to be glad to see the back of this place.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv3_Sub1' => 'The things we saw in those towers almost makes me feel glad for this detour. It\'s good that we put a stop to the witches.

Now, let\'s see if the barrier is gone.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv3_Sub2' => 'He just... evaporated! Was he not of this world?! No wonder he was so evil!',
        'LoadTest1' => 'Well done, you used the buff! Let\'s see whether there\'s anything else we can do.',
        'LoadTest2' => 'Well done, you used the buff! Let\'s see whether there\'s anything else we can do.',
        'LoadTest3' => 'Well done, you used the buff! Let\'s see whether there\'s anything else we can do.',
        'LoadTest4' => 'Well done, you used the buff! Let\'s see whether there\'s anything else we can do.',
        'LoadTest5' => 'Well done, you used the buff! Let\'s see whether there\'s anything else we can do.',
        'LoveGarden_ChainFilter' => 'Oh my, just look around. So many lovebirds have gathered. It fills my heart with joy and happiness.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteCoopMission' => 'Piece of cake, as expected of you. There\'s nothing that can bring you down.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindAdventureLong' => 'Luckily, they didn\'t find anything dangerous or crazy. Phew! You won\'t believe how relieved I am. Thank you!',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindAdventureMedium' => 'A big thank you from my friend. Here is a small token of his gratitude.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindAdventureShort' => 'I knew your specialists would find her. Her husband wanted to thank you with this little present.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindAdventureVeryLong' => 'Incredible! This guy just won\'t stop talking about all the exciting places he\'s been visiting! What did your specialist do? Well, doesn\'t matter - he has the present.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositBronzeOre' => 'You did it! That\'s incredible, thank you!',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositCoal' => 'That is one beautiful chunk of graphite. Thank you for your effort - this is going to help me a lot.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositGoldOre' => 'Here, let me take a look... Yes, yes... Perfect! Thank you.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositGranite' => 'What lovely color and structure... It\'s beautiful. Give me some time to work on it!',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositIronOre' => 'That\'s exactly what I need! Off to work again for me - this is going to be perfect!',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositMarble' => 'Oh, that\'s perfect. Such a nice structure. I just have to put it into the right form ... A gut here, a hit there ... Oh, I almost forgot! Thank you, for bringing this to me.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositSalpeter' => 'Wow, that\'s an interesting one! If you\'ll excuse me, I really must dash - I have to start mixing it with all kind of stuff! Oh, and thank you.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositStone' => 'Oh, nice! That\'s exactly what I needed! Thanks for the help - now it\'s time for me to get back to work!',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositTitaniumOre' => 'Finally! I\'d been having to make do with this iron hammer, and it\'s just not the same!',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindTreasureEvenLonger' => 'Oh, nice! It fits into the garden perfectly. What a lovely sight.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindTreasureLong' => 'He\'s alive! That\'s a huge relief. Thank you for saving him.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindTreasureMedium' => 'There was no treasure? Hmm, that is a little sad... I hope you found something else you can use?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindTreasureProlonged' => 'You found it! Perfect! I\'ll take it to him straight away - oh, he\'s going to be so happy!',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindTreasureShort' => 'You\'re a life-saver. The happiness in the eyes of that student was plain to see. He\'s very grateful to you.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteMiniMission' => 'Well, that was fast! Just when I thought I\'d seen it all from you, you manage to impress me again.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteMission' => 'We found the drill plan! Good job! Did you see the sparkle in his eyes when he got his drill plan back?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteScenario' => 'And another task completed! I\'m sure we\'ll have more use for your skills, soon.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteVenture' => 'Excellent job - here\'s the data! That should help your instructors. Let\'s get back to the garden and relax a little. Maybe we\'ll meet more people there?',
        'MainEpic' => 'You did it again, and have mastered the fairytale adventures. Not only that, but you\'ve upgraded the fairytale castle to level 5 and proved yourself to be one of the greatest war masters around. I\'m really impressed. Keep going!',
        'MainEpicSub1' => 'Very well - that should be enough for the first round. Don\'t look so surprised. Maybe you\'re wondering why you needed to train so many units. Trust me… Most of them will not come back.',
        'MainEpicSub2' => 'Oh, you\'re back. How was it? How did you like my friend the tailor? A bit strange, right? But I am sure you two will get along. I hope he rewarded you accordingly? Let\'s see what you got from the adventure.',
        'MainEpicSub3' => 'So, were you lucky? Didi you see a lot of these new adventures? There\'s a lot to see with all the different possibilities in the follow-up adventures you can get. Try and find all possible paths.',
        'MainEpicSub4' => 'Wow, that\'s a lot of beans. Nice work! Let\'s see what we can buy with them… What? Oh, of course, I meant what **you** can buy with them.',
        'MainEpicSub5' => 'Ah, it\'s raining beans. Marvellous! I have already an idea of what we can buy with them. Can you guess what it is?',
        'MainEpicSub6' => 'My, it is even taller than I expected. Really breathtaking. Let\'s take a look at how it works, and what needs to be done to make it produce Magic Beanstalks.',
        'MainEpicSub7' => 'You made it! I don\'t know how, but you made it. It seems nothing is able to stop you. I always thought that you were pretty skilled, but now I\'m really stunned by your abilities. Anyway, enjoy your stalks and don\'t forget to gather new beans.',
        'MainPremium' => 'So, those are the most important benefits you\'ll receive! You\'ll also get an additional building queue slot, and more daily quests per day. So why not make the most of your Premium Time? If you want to add more time, just visit the merchant.',
        'MaleGuiDaiAirMailSub3' => 'The general has returned and he has the seeds!',
        'MaleGuiDaiFunWithSnowSub6' => 'The general has returned, and to cut a long story short, he found the deer!',
        'MiadArcticExplosionMain' => 'We got the gunpowder back to safety, so now it\'s time to head home. It\'s really cold out here - I\'m missing the warmth of my small hut!',
        'MiadArcticExplosionQ1' => 'Good job! But wait! What are those barrels?',
        'MiadArcticExplosionQ2' => 'Very good, the hard part of the assault seems to be over… or is it?',
        'MiadArcticExplosionQ3' => 'Good, we managed to sink at least half of the barrels! I wonder if there are more…?',
        'MiadArcticExplosionQ4' => 'We scoured the whole island and got rid of the barrels! Good work!',
        'MiadArcticExplosionQ5' => 'Done! What a battle! Very good, I bet we managed to weaken their forces a lot!',
        'MiadBastilleIslandMain' => 'Let\'s head back home - I\'ve had enough of this island. Hopefully we don\'t have to come back any time soon.',
        'MiadBastilleIslandQ1' => 'We threw many of them into the sea - look how it has calmed their fury! The raider wing is now clear of trouble!',
        'MiadBastilleIslandQ2' => 'Harr harr! Cough! How on earth are they making that sound? Right, we\'re done with the pirate wing.',
        'MiadBastilleIslandQ3' => 'Ugh! How can these people live in such ghastly places! I\'m glad we managed to defeat them! Let\'s move on - this place gives me the creeps!',
        'MiadBastilleIslandQ4' => 'Phew! That was a cold approach there! Even under this sun they feel so cold! It might be because of that Hoarfrost Globe they been carrying around all that time! Let\'s move, good job!',
        'MiadBastilleIslandQ5' => 'Good work! Listen to this. Some of the prisoners have told us that every clan has a plan on how to invade the island! Maybe we should look into that, huh?',
        'MiadBastilleIslandQ6' => 'Nice work! Four Invasion Plans on the plate! I\'m going to send them to Capital Island and have the King\'s Generals take a look at them. Maybe we can learn some precious information about our enemy?',
        'MiadPirateLifeMain' => 'The pirates sent us some rewards for helping them. It\'s time to go back home - to be honest, I\'m kind of missing the normal life.',
        'MiadPirateLifeQ1' => 'The forest is now bandit free, as strange as it seems to say it like that. Off we go toward the swamps!',
        'MiadPirateLifeQ1a' => 'No more woodcutting for the pirates!',
        'MiadPirateLifeQ2' => 'The bandit threat has been dealt with! Next we need to find the farms!',
        'MiadPirateLifeQ2a' => 'These burning reeds smell funny. No wonder the pirates love their special brew so much... it smells better than the brew we make.',
        'MiadPirateLifeQ3' => 'The bandits took all the horses with them, but now we have taken them back, haha! Next stop : the gardens.',
        'MiadPirateLifeQ3a' => 'We destroyed all the poisoned wheat fields. Good work!',
        'MiadPirateLifeQ4' => 'Good work! We cleared out every single bandit from this island! The pirates will be happy!',
        'MiadSleepyReefMain' => 'When we head back, can we talk about my retirement? Not that I\'d ask for an island...',
        'MiadSleepyReefQ1' => 'Good, the mountain pass is clear! Let\'s head into the forest!',
        'MiadSleepyReefQ2' => 'The forest is ours! I mean, it\'s not actually in our possession, but it\'s safe. Right, let\'s fight our way inside the village!',
        'MiadSleepyReefQ3' => 'We\'re inside! Head for the main traitor camp and let\'s finish this once and for all!',
        'MiadSleepyReefQ4' => 'Ay! We\'ve found her! Such a smart girl, and a strong one too! Basically she knocked two of our soldiers out before we could convince her of our origin. We\'ve placed her in the safe house!',
        'MiadSleepyReefQ5' => 'Done and done! Off to Bastille Island this leader goes! Great job! The villagers will be really pleased to meet you!',
        'MiadTheLostSkullDq1' => 'Is it just me, or do you get the feeling that Skull was indeed tainted with some… dark energy? I don\'t believe in magic, but I could swear it was watching us! Anyhow, we did what the King wanted us to do! The reward has arrived!',
        'MiadTheLostSkullMain' => 'Congratulations! The Captain has been imprisoned, and it\'s time for us to get back home.',
        'MiadTheLostSkullQ1' => 'We tried to ask them nicely, but they were too stubborn to listen. So, they haven\'t found the treasure or the Skull yet. We should definitely send some spies out to the ruins so they can see themselves. We should also forge on - we need to find their leader.',
        'MiadTheLostSkullQ2' => 'I can’t believe how aggressive they are. Thank the maker we brought enough military force with us! When words don\'t help, there\'s steel, am I right? We should try to find the pirate leader and the Skull.',
        'MiadTheLostSkullQ3' => 'The spies have reported back! They confirmed that the skull was taken by the pirate leader! I guess this leaves us only one option. Let\'s go pay the pirate captain a special visit!',
        'MiadTheLostSkullQ4' => 'Done! The pirate captain was kind enough to release the Skull to our men! He will be taken into custody and transported to Bastille Island, where all the dangerous prisoners end up... eventually! Let\'s head back to our island! Good job!',
        'MiadTheSleepingVolcanoMain' => 'The Alchemist has gone, but at least the island\'s safe again. We should head back home - maybe we can find where the Alchemist went...',
        'MiadTheSleepingVolcanoQ1' => 'Very good! The tower was partially destroyed when we attacked, so I guess the villagers are doing their share of combat. Good to hear.',
        'MiadTheSleepingVolcanoQ2' => 'The tower is down! Quick, get into the village!',
        'MiadTheSleepingVolcanoQ3' => 'We found all the lizard bones and destroyed them. Nobody can make that flaming potion again! Good work!',
        'MiadTheSleepingVolcanoQ4' => 'The tower is down, and so is the mad alchemist… Well not really. He managed to use some kind of vanishing dust and escaped. I hope that he won\'t try to come back! Good job, the people of the village are happy to name you their friend and protector!',
        'MiadTropicalSunMain' => 'There is nothing more for us to do here. We should get back home and inspect our rewards.',
        'MiadTropicalSunQ1' => 'Ha ha! Look at them swimming away with their tails between their legs! Nasty pirates! Good work!',
        'MiadTropicalSunQ2' => 'We cleared out the pirate leader\'s compound! It\'s time to head to the badlands where the bandits are! Be careful, though - there are more bandit camps on the way, so we\'re not done with them yet!',
        'MiadTropicalSunQ3' => 'That was a hard battle, but we arrived! I can see the bandits are building a huge wall to defend their leader\'s camp! We\'re in for some heavy fighting if we want to defeat their leader!',
        'MiadTropicalSunQ4' => 'We found it! It was locked away in a small golden box! Our scouts managed to break it open and have found it! I\'ll send the scroll back to the village at once! Good work!',
        'MiadTropicalSunQ5' => 'Well done! We should probably tell the council about the wall - maybe they\'ll want to remove it and build some ships from all that wood! We\'ll see! Great job you did here!',
        'MiadTropicalSunQ6' => 'We\'re victorious! The island is now under full control of the council and Lord Walder! We should expect some nice rewards to arrive from them.',
        'MilitaryLong1' => 'Great work! One of the generals came to me with a heatstroke, but I already took care of that. Now onto the hundreds of soldiers afflicted by sunburns…',
        'MilitaryLong2' => 'Wow! I have to say, even I’m impressed by that! Your marshals are certainly a force to be reckoned with! Also, I have to give you credit for how well you planned your strategy for attacking the colonies. Great work!',
        'MilitaryLong3' => 'Fantastic! Do you think someone will believe me if I try to sell them in the market?',
        'MilitaryLong4' => 'Great! With the granite we\'ve obtained, we\'ll be able to either construct more elite buildings, or improve our existing ones. Thank you for your efforts!',
        'MilitaryMedium1' => 'You know what my favorite thing about fairytale adventures is? The fact you get a follow-up adventure in almost all of them, so you can continue your epic adventure. Is there no end to the excitement!?',
        'MilitaryMedium2' => 'Very good! Your marshals have performed excellently! I hope that they can hold the colonies until we\'ve had chance to gather their resources. We need all the materials we can get!',
        'MilitaryMedium3' => 'Fantastic! Exotic wood can serve a myriad of purposes, from weapon crafting to building upgrades. If you don’t need any more, though, you can always sell it to someone who really needs it in the market.',
        'MilitaryMedium4' => 'Ah, this is encouraging. Your army has recovered, and is already raring to go on an adventure. Be nice to them and take them somewhere they can prove how strong they are!',
        'MilitaryShort1' => 'That was fantastic! Maybe next time you and your generals will break a sweat, huh?',
        'MilitaryShort2' => 'Mighty fine work! Remember to defend the colonies while you have them. We wouldn’t want to see this precious source of goods lost to another expeditioner, right?',
        'MilitaryShort3' => 'Granite, of course, is not the only benefit of going out on adventures, but it certainly comes in handy. We should do this as often as possible.',
        'MilitaryShort4' => 'Excellent. The new units eagerly await your orders at the barracks. Why not take them out on an adventure soon?',
        'MountainQuest_1' => 'Oh, this worked perfectly! I think we need more. Visit the trader if you want to buy some.',
        'MountainQuest_Main' => 'Behold my power! Erm... Our power... Your Power, I mean! Ahem. You can now transform the island however you wish, thanks to our "ground breaking" technology. Show those accursed mountains who\'s the boss around here!',
        'MountainQuest_Sub1' => 'That\'s it! Did you hear what this crazy old veteran is doing in his backyard? He tinkers with gunpowder and his wife tells us that he wrecks their whole garden on regular basis. I believe this might be our chance. Gunpowder, mountains, you catch my drift?',
        'MountainQuest_Sub2' => 'Oh, the sophistication! This man has truly refined the handling of explosive matters. His delicate craft enables him to blow up entire mountains, not just simple rock formations!',
        'MountainQuest_Sub3' => 'Yeees! This crew of fine artisans has reached the apex of their craft. Their understanding of materials, environmental conditions, and their appreciation of a good fireball are just the right tools to get the job done.',
        'NPCQuestMain' => 'So, it\'s all over. Everything\'s finished, and it\'s time to say goodbye. I really am grateful for your help. Here, take this - I prepared a small gift as reward for your efforts. Farewell. Until we meet again!',
        'NPCQuestSub1' => 'Thank you! This should be enough space to grow some new crops. Which brings me to our next task...',
        'NPCQuestSub2' => 'Wow, that was really generous of you. Now, it is up to me to make good use of it. I will return when I am done with plowing and spreading the seeds.',
        'NPCQuestSub3' => 'The time has come, the wheat is grown and harvest can begin. I am really thankful for your help. I knew I could count on you.',
        'NPCQuestSub4' => 'Well, this should suffice. Therewith, we should have enough wheat to last through the winter, and even a little bit longer.',
        'Once again we must continue our valiant effort to prevent these vermin from spreading into mainland' => 'Will this madness never end?',
        'PremiumSub1' => 'See? Pretty simple. Now you have Premium Time, you can enjoy certain benefits. Let me tell you a little bit more about what you can expect.',
        'PremiumSub2' => 'Super, right? Your friends will love you! Of course, this also works if one of your friends buffs you while they have Premium Time active too.',
        'PremiumSub3' => 'So, what do you say? Not bad, eh? Premium Time really pays off, especially with difficult adventures. Although even with easy adventures, the bonus is not to be sniffed at!',
        'RaidingtheRaidersQ1' => 'The harbor lies in flames and your forces are ready to take the city.
Great job!',
        'RaidingtheRaidersQ2' => 'The leaders have been captured, and the rest of the city has surrendered. 
Time to take your prize!',
        'RaidingtheRaidersQ3' => 'Look at all those wares! This operation was well worth it!

Congratulations are in order!',
