        'ReachLevel51' => 'You have reached Level 51.',
        'RedNose_DonateStuff' => 'Good work! You and your friends have donated enough red noses to fulfill the goal!',
        'RedNose_Main' => 'Fabulous! You now have all the knowledge you\'ll need to gather red noses and help us reach our goal!',
        'RedNose_Reach16' => 'Wonderful - you reached the level we needed. Now we can start getting some noses!',
        'RedNose_Sub1' => 'Wonderful, your explorer has brought you some red noses!',
        'RedNose_Sub2' => 'Nice! If we keep on donating noses, we\'ll reach the server goal in no time!',
        'RedNose_Sub3' => 'Great, you found all the items you\'ll need to build a small basket of red noses.',
        'RedNose_Sub4' => 'That\'s it - the red noses are now in your storage.',
        'SSBookbinder' => 'Thanks to you, a pretty workshop has been built there! This should lend itself well to some serious craftsmanship!',
        'SSCodex' => 'Splendid! Take good care to whom you grant access to these treasures. The knowledge contained in these Codices is invaluable!',
        'SSExplorerBronzeComplete' => 'Well, that turned out to be more productive than I would have guessed. Our lad seems to have a certain talent for what he does. Or perhaps he\'s just a quicker reader than I thought.',
        'SSExplorerCompleteTree' => 'Brilliant - a little structure and discipline has proved to do him good! He is a truly valuable member of our economy now.',
        'SSExplorerFirstSkill' => 'Did you see how he just plowed through those documents? Maybe we can turn him into a man with common sense after all.',
        'SSExplorerGoldComplete' => 'Chapeau! He tought me that a globetrotter does not have to be a lazy prowler. On the contrary, this man has seen the world and is a true expert in his profession.',
        'SSExplorerSilverComplete' => 'Not bad - he has acquired quite a repertoire. I admit, I\'m impressed.',
        'SSFinesmith' => 'Fabulous! The first step for the creation of documents has been completed, but something crucial is still missing …',
        'SSGeneralBronzeComplete' => 'Your general must be a tactical prodigy! Other students need years to memorize all of this.',
        'SSGeneralCompleteTree' => 'That was an all-round impressive display of diligent studying. I\'m sure your general has learned enough, and is eager to put all that knowledge into practice. Your other generals almost look jealous. Why not give them some books to read when the opportunity presents itself.',
        'SSGeneralFirstSkill' => 'As expected, our student is showing great promise already.',
        'SSGeneralGoldComplete' => 'That marks the end of our course on military strategy. Considering the difficulty of the material, your general once again performed amazingly...',
        'SSGeneralSilverComplete' => 'Your general is simply breezing through these lessons. At first I suspected cheating, but the results really speak for themselves.',
        'SSGeologistBronzeComplete' => 'I must say, our friend is becoming a connoisseur of sorts. Isn\'t it touching to see them grow up so quickly?',
        'SSGeologistCompleteTree' => 'Excellent! We\'ve turned this boy into a true specialist. I\'m proud of him. The right book at the right moment can make all the difference.',
        'SSGeologistFirstSkill' => 'Did I just see a flash of joy in the eyes of our young friend? It seems our efforts are being met with actual curiosity. Keep going!',
        'SSGeologistGoldComplete' => 'I can hardly believe that our once so undiscerning young friend has made it to such heights. Very impressive!',
        'SSGeologistSilverComplete' => 'Remarkable - by now this Geologist deserves to be called a true specialist! I dare say it\'s because we went to some lengths for his education.',
        'SSLettersmith' => 'Working with you is a breeze. I can\'t wait to see this new technology in practice!',
        'SSMain1' => 'Fantastic! Keep on producing Manuscripts and spreading the knowledge, and you shall soon see your efforts rewarded!',
        'SSMain2' => 'This is amazing. Our books will be in everyone\'s hands, just imagine!',
        'SSMain3' => 'What a treat - we\'ve managed to create something very special here. Real collectors\' items!',
        'SSManuscript' => 'I am proud of the results of our efforts, and I\'m sure you will choose wisely where to put this knowledge to use.',
        'SSOrnamentalsmith' => 'Isn\'t it just wonderful to watch an artist at work? All this detail and passion. I\'m delighted!',
        'SSPapermillAdvanced' => 'Impressive, such quality! Have you tried touching this paper? One can immediately feel one is holding something extraordinary in one\'s hands.',
        'SSPapermillIntermediate' => 'This significantly increases our wood consumption, which is worrying, but progress cannot be stopped. By all accounts, it\'s a considerable achievement for education in your kingdom!',
        'SSPapermillSimple' => 'Isn\'t it remarkable how something as massive as a tree can be turned into something as tender as paper? The consumption of wood will leave its marks on our tree population though.',
        'SSProductivityCL2' => 'Well that didn\'t seem to be much of a challenge for you. You seem to know what you\'re doing, I\'m looking forward to working with you!',
        'SSProductivityCL3' => 'Excellent! With such an economy in supporting us it should be easy to bring our endeavor to the next level.',
        'SSProductivityCL4' => 'You must have a remarkable economy at your disposal to sport such capacities! Bravo!',
        'SSTome' => 'Isn\'t it a sight to behold, this Tome? I\'m sure whomever the beneficiary is will appreciate this gift.',
        'Soccer2016_Main' => 'Excellent! Now you know everything you need to know to be able to shine at the Settlers Football Championship. I\'ve just announced our official participation. Let the matches begin!',
        'Soccer2016_Main02' => 'The last weeks have been very exciting, haven\'t they? I still can\'t believe that we actually won the finals.
I think you\'ve earned yourself the right to build a monument to commemorate our victory!',
        'Soccer2016_Sub01' => 'Well done! You reached level 16. This is our ticket to the Football Championship!',
        'Soccer2016_Sub02' => 'Great! Come back here at any time if there\'s anything else you want to know about the event.',
        'Soccer2016_Sub03' => 'So, this is the Football Championship fixture list. You know where to find it, and how to use it. And now we have our first opponents! As a reward, you also get your first useful item: a Red Card!',
        'Soccer2016_Sub04' => 'Good work! Now let\'s finish that match!',
        'Soccer2016_Sub05a' => 'Well done! Bananas are used to produce the foul item in the provision house. Did we collect all the other remaining ingredients?',
        'Soccer2016_Sub05b' => 'Excellent! Wet grass. The best way to produce a foul in the provision house.',
        'Soccer2016_Sub06' => 'Yes! Now that we have the foul, we can use it on the playing pitch.',
        'Soccer2016_Sub07' => 'You won your first match! Congratulations! The tournament matches may be harder, but it looks like you\'re well-prepared.',
        'Soccer2016_Sub08' => 'Congratulations! We won the first group stage match. If we can win the second one as well, we might advance to the last 16.',
        'Soccer2016_Sub09' => 'That was really a good performance! Thanks to your excellent tactics, it\'s now official: We reached the last 16!',
        'Soccer2016_Sub10' => 'What a thrilling match! I\'m glad we could beat the Shire of Oxwater – even if it was a close call. Let’s see which opponent is awaiting us next.',
        'Soccer2016_Sub11' => 'Unbelievable! You made it! With this victory we reached the semi-finals and are amongst the four best teams of the competition!',
        'Soccer2016_Sub12' => 'We\'re in the finals! I cannot believe it! We reached the finals! What a game! I always hoped we\'d go far with this team, but to actually reach the finals!! I am thrilled!',
        'Soccer2016_Sub13' => 'What a match! What a tournament! The opposition was incredibly strong but we managed to come out on top and earn the title of champion!
The fans will remember today for years to come.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Main' => 'I\'m impressed! Everyone, from the players to the fans, said they had a great time and are looking forward to visiting again next year.

In the meantime, you can probably make good use of one of those snack stands.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub1' => 'That looks perfect! I can\'t wait to play here!',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub10' => 'These all turned out pretty well, didn\'t they. Your Settlers are excellent artisans.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub11' => 'Just having the guards around will make ruffians think twice before starting any trouble.
With any luck, they won\'t actually have to do anything.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub12' => 'Alright!! That should have us covered until the end of the tournament. Who\'d have thought such a simple idea would turn out to be such a hit?',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub13' => 'Am I just imagining it, or do the players look a little... resigned? Oh well, the fans look really happy so I\'m sure it was worth it.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub14' => 'Splendid! We\'re almost done here, but I did have a final task for you if you want to keep this wave of tourism going...',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub15' => 'Everyone loved your stories, especially the little ones! I think many visitors will stay on for a few more days.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub2' => 'Seems like you\'ve found some very motivated people. Everyone and everything will be in capable hands.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub3' => 'Not a moment too soon! The first wave of people is already arriving. I\'m sure your population figures will benefit from the tourism, too.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub4' => 'That\'s a big stack! You must be very confident about the demand.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub5' => 'They\'re no masterpieces, but they\'re solid enough. Time to think about the menu.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub6' => 'Oooh, those look really refreshing. Don\'t mind if I do!
Hey, what\'s with that judgmental look?! I WAS going to pay for it.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub7' => 'Okay, okay! It\'s a GOOD sausage in a bun!
Everyone will love them!',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub8' => 'The tourists are very appreciative of your transportation system. They\'re even willing to pay for the service!',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_22-27_Sub9' => 'You can always count on Aunt Irma. The gift baskets were also a great success!',
        'Soccer2018plus_Infrastructure_28-39_Main' => 'I\'m impressed! Everyone, from the players to the fans, said they had a great time and are looking forward to visiting again next year.

