        'Soccer2018plus_Main' => 'Excellent! Now you know everything you need to know to be able to shine at the Settlers Football Championship. I\'ve just announced our official participation. Let the matches begin!',
        'Soccer2018plus_Main02' => 'The last weeks have been very exciting, haven\'t they? I still can\'t believe that we actually won the finals.
I think you\'ve earned yourself the right to build a monument to commemorate our victory!',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub01' => 'Well done! You reached level 16. This is our ticket to the Football Championship!',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub02' => 'Great! Come back here if there\'s anything else you want to know about the event.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub03' => 'So, this is the Football Championship fixture list. You know where to find it, and how to use it. And now we have our first opponents! As a reward, you also get your first useful item: a Red Card!',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub04' => 'Good work! Now let\'s finish that match!',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub05a' => 'Well done! Bananas are used to produce the Foul item in the Provision House. Did we collect all the other remaining ingredients?',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub05b' => 'Excellent! Your explorers can find plenty of Shoulder Pads, Helmets, Studs, Wet Grass, and Grease this way. 
You can use these resources to produce tactical items in your Provision House.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub06' => 'Yes! Now that we have the foul, we can use it on the playing pitch.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub07' => 'You won your first match! Congratulations! The tournament matches may be harder, but it looks like you\'re well-prepared.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub08' => 'Congratulations! We won the first group stage game. If we can win the second one as well, we might just advance to the last 16!',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub09' => 'That was really a good performance! Thanks to your excellent tactics, it\'s now official: we made the last 16!',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub10' => 'What a thrilling match! I\'m glad we could beat the Shire of Oxwater – even if it was a close call. Let’s see which opponent is awaiting us next.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub11' => 'Unbelievable! You made it! We\'re in the semi-finals, and are amongst the four best teams in the competition!',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub12' => 'We\'re in the finals! I can\'t believe it! We reached the finals! What a match! I always hoped we\'d go far with this team, but to actually reach the finals!! I\'m thrilled!',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub13' => 'What a match! What a tournament! The opposition was incredibly strong but we managed to come out on top and earn the title of champion!
The fans will remember today for years to come.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Application_Main' => 'The application process is over. Unfortunately, our efforts were unsuccessful, and we were not selected to host the games. But now we can fully focus on winning the games.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Application_Sub1' => 'Our efforts paid off and the promotion campaign was successful. Our people now support the application.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Application_Sub2' => 'We\'ve done it! The application is complete and it turned out well.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Application_Sub3' => 'What a great presentation! The committee was impressed. Being proclaimed host should be a mere formality.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Application_Sub4' => 'Our application was rejected. A competitor with an inferior application prevailed. What a disappointment. Now it is time to lick our wounds and think about what went wrong.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_MainA' => 'Acting swiftly and without hesitation, our agents ensured that nothing could stand between our team and ultimate victory in the game. True to the motto: The end justifies the means.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_MainB' => 'We exposed the dark schemes surrounding the games, and with honor, determination, and true skill, the team fought its way to a well-deserved victory in the finals.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub1A' => 'The bribe was successful, and the official quietly tilted several decisions in our favor. While the victories may not have been entirely deserved, the team climbed the rankings rapidly and secured a much better position in the games.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub1B' => 'Our special investigators have discovered clues pointing to a hidden network that may be behind the manipulation of the games. It may be worthwhile to investigate this further.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub2A' => 'Our agents uncovered compromising secrets about several stubborn officials and used the information to sway them to our side. With opposition silenced and obstacles removed, the team gained a decisive advantage in the competition.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub2B' => 'Our agents successfully infiltrated the hidden network and gathered undeniable evidence of bribery, blackmail, and sabotage throughout the games. Now we just need to find the best way to use it against them.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub3A' => 'Our agents manipulated the supplies of several rival teams, which weakened their performance, allowing our team to seize several victories and climb even higher in the rankings.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub3B' => 'The network has been dismantled, and those responsible for corrupting the games now face justice for their actions. Thanks to your determination and the evidence gathered by our agents, fairness and honour have been restored.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub4A' => 'Fueled by their suspiciously effective energy boost, our athletes secured victory and claimed the championship title for the settlement!',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub4B' => 'Equipped with the finest gear and backed by the full support of your settlement, the team delivered a magnificent performance and claimed victory through true skill and fair competition.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Hub' => 'The time for friendly competition is over. Despite setbacks, difficulties, and tough decisions, our realm emerged victorious in the contests. Now it is time to claim the reward.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Participation_Main' => 'Despite their best efforts, the team ranked below expectations. It was then that an unethical offer was received and a decision was made. The path is now set, and you will have to see it through.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Participation_Sub1' => 'The specialists will analyze the performance of our team and hopefully determine the reasons behind the disappointing results.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Participation_Sub2' => 'Our team of investigators is now looking into the troubling events surrounding the games. Hopefully, their report will shed some light on the irregularities and help restore trust in the competition.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Participation_Sub3a' => 'The deal has been accepted, and the requested price has been paid. Now the hidden influencers behind the scenes will provide us with the assistance necessary to rise through the ranks and achieve victory.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Participation_Sub3b' => 'The offer has been rejected, and investigators have been sent to uncover more about the hidden influencers behind the scenes. We will expose them and achieve victory fair and square.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Preparation_Main' => 'The preparations are complete. We have a well-trained team and provide support to ensure that the games run smoothly. Let\'s go for the win!',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Preparation_Sub1' => 'The team is complete. Our finest are ready to give their very best.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Preparation_Sub2' => 'Through rigorous training and unwavering discipline, our team is now prepared to compete at the highest level and bring glory to our settlement.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Preparation_Sub3' => 'Thanks to your efforts, a well-trained team of referees is now ready to uphold the rules of the games and ensure that every contest is fair and worthy of true champions.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Preparation_Sub4' => 'Your dedication has ensured that the games will remain both safe and orderly. Skilled fan agents and disciplined guards from our settlement now stand ready to support the organizers and protect visitors and athletes alike throughout the festivities.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_47-61_Application_Main' => 'The application process is over. Unfortunately, our efforts were unsuccessful, and we were not selected to host the games. But now we can fully focus on winning the games.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_47-61_Application_Sub1' => 'Our efforts paid off and the promotion campaign was successful. Our people now support the application.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_47-61_Application_Sub2' => 'We\'ve done it! The application is complete and it turned out well.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_47-61_Application_Sub3' => 'What a great presentation! The committee was impressed. Being proclaimed host should be a mere formality.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_47-61_Application_Sub4' => 'Our application was rejected. A competitor with an inferior application prevailed. What a disappointment. Now it is time to lick our wounds and think about what went wrong.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_47-61_Determination_MainA' => 'Acting swiftly and without hesitation, our agents ensured that nothing could stand between our team and ultimate victory in the game. True to the motto: The end justifies the means.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_47-61_Determination_MainB' => 'We exposed the dark schemes surrounding the games, and with honor, determination, and true skill, the team fought its way to a well-deserved victory in the finals.',
