        'SocialLong1' => 'I know barazek are hard to come by, but you still gave it to your friends. In fact, I’ve been so moved by your gesture that I decided to give you my own stash of barazek that I took from the desert for when I was feeling hungry. Use it wisely!',
        'SocialLong2' => 'Now this is what I call dedication! And not only did you manage to keep the workers in great shape, you also got some gems out of it. It’s a win-win situation, you see?',
        'SocialLong3' => 'Wonderful! This will get us back on track to deliver our quota. We\'ll have to give something very special to our friends to thank them for this gesture, wouldn’t you agree?',
        'SocialLong4' => 'Now that was fun! And furthermore, you saved troops and resources thanks to fighting together on your adventure!',
        'SocialMedium1' => 'Now that’s what I call teamwork! You supported each other perfectly, and you both got nice loot in return. Wasn’t that fun?',
        'SocialMedium2' => 'Sometimes I forget how good our friends are. I just hope we can return the favor whenever they need us to! And even if they don’t need it, we should be nice to them as they were to us, don’t you think?',
        'SocialMedium3' => 'The beauty of coins is that they\'re always in demand, so it’s easy to barter in the trade house with it. Now that we have a nice stock of them, perhaps it’s a good moment to put them to good use.',
        'SocialMedium4' => 'Great! I’m sure that the buyers will be more than happy with the deal they got from these materials.',
        'SocialShort1' => 'Fantastic! Our allies will be most grateful for the assistance we\'ve provided. And who knows, maybe they\'ll even reciprocate the favor on our own workyards!',
        'SocialShort2' => 'See? My sixth sense is never wrong! We\'ll definitely put the profit obtained on this deal to good use.',
        'SocialShort3' => 'Thank you for taking the time out to stop by so often. It may not look like it, but your settlers actually care for you and like to see you around. They work harder and enjoy their work more if they know you’re watching, you know?',
        'SocialShort4' => 'That was very helpful indeed. Maybe we should return the favor soon? I\'ll ask Aunt Irma for one of her fabulous gift baskets for our friends, who came when we needed them most.',
