        'SplitCityFall_Main' => 'Oh, this is a sight to behold. Once our scouts finished making their way around the island, announcing that the area is safe for now, heads and people began appearing from all directions. It seems the word is spreading quite fast. The people do still look like they aren\'t sure what to believe, however. They haven\'t been near the city during fall for several years. It seems the evildoers have been getting more aggressive, and have caused more havoc than usual.
But now, they have the chance to salvage the ruins, and maybe even rebuild parts of the town. Until the next beasts appear, that is.',
        'SplitCity_Main' => 'Oh, you should have seen the cheers and smiles on the faces of those who were reunited! Some were even crying in happiness at getting medicine for their ill friends and families. And a kid who couldn\'t remember how sweets tasted just stood there in shock chewing chocolate. 

Ahem... It\'s always hard to keep your composure in times like these. Good job in freeing these people - if only for now. I still can\'t help but wonder what\'s going on here...',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel40' => 'I would love to get chance to get a closer look.',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel52_Main' => 'Not bad, not bad. But I think we can do better. Hmmm...',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel52_Main_Part1' => 'Yes, these will do nicely.

I have all my tools and schematics ready. I’ll get to work right away.',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel52_Main_Part2' => 'Here you go.

