        'XMAS2017plus_Sub6' => 'And up it goes! Look at how well they fly. They really are naturals! In hindsight, maybe reindeers were the wrong choice... It took me years to get them used to flying...',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub7_Easy' => 'So, we\'ve captured the evildoer! Let\'s see what he has to say.',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub7_Hard' => 'So, we\'ve captured the evildoer! Let\'s see what he has to say.',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub7_Medium' => 'So, we\'ve captured the evildoer! Let\'s see what he has to say.',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub8_Easy' => 'Good work, the troops are ready!',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub8_Hard' => 'Good work, the troops are ready!',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub8_Medium' => 'Good work, the troops are ready!',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandDelay1_lvl26' => 'Ribbit..I see everything is prepared ribbit. Have you spent your time well ribbit? Now let me have ribbit some more cake, please ribbit. I\'m Santa, and my belly doesn\'t grow on its own ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandDelay1_lvl36' => 'Ribbit..I see everything is prepared ribbit. Have you spent your time well ribbit? Now let me have ribbit some more cake, please ribbit. I\'m Santa, and my belly doesn\'t grow on its own ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandDelay1_lvl51' => 'Ribbit..I see everything is prepared ribbit. Have you spent your time well ribbit? Now let me have ribbit some more cake, please ribbit. I\'m Santa, and my belly doesn\'t grow on its own ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandDelay2_lvl26' => 'Aaaargghh Ribbit. You will pay for this! I will be ribbit back ribbit! And now I can\'t even go back to my normal appearance. I\'m stuck with this white ribbit beard ribbit. And all those children want to follow me every-ribbit-where ribbit. Go away... aarggh...',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandDelay2_lvl36' => 'Aaaargghh Ribbit. You will pay for this! I will be ribbit back ribbit! And now I can\'t even go back to my normal appearance. I\'m stuck with this white ribbit beard ribbit. And all those children want to follow me every-ribbit-where ribbit. Go away... aarggh...',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandDelay2_lvl51' => 'Aaaargghh Ribbit. You will pay for this! I will be ribbit back ribbit! And now I can\'t even go back to my normal appearance. I\'m stuck with this white ribbit beard ribbit. And all those children want to follow me every-ribbit-where ribbit. Go away... aarggh...',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub0_lvl26' => 'Ho ho well, it would\'ve surprised me if you\'d found those children when my belly wasn\'t able to sense them. Usually, this can only mean one thing... I really worry for the bereaved mothers and fathers. Their houses will feel extraordinarily cold this year.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub0_lvl36' => 'Ho ho well, it would\'ve surprised me if you\'d found those children when my belly wasn\'t able to sense them. Usually, this can only mean one thing... I really worry for the bereaved mothers and fathers. Their houses will feel extraordinarily cold this year.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub0_lvl51' => 'Ho ho well, it would\'ve surprised me if you\'d found those children when my belly wasn\'t able to sense them. Usually, this can only mean one thing... I really worry for the bereaved mothers and fathers. Their houses will feel extraordinarily cold this year.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub1_lvl26' => 'Ah, thank you. that tasted...ribbit...I wanted to ribbit say these houses came out great!....ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub1_lvl36' => 'Ah, thank you. that tasted...ribbit...I wanted to ribbit say these houses came out great!....ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub1_lvl51' => 'Ah, thank you. that tasted...ribbit...I wanted to ribbit say these houses came out great!....ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub2_lvl26' => 'Ah good ribbit good. I didn\'t think it would be so ribbit easy.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub2_lvl36' => 'Ah good ribbit good. I didn\'t think it would be so ribbit easy.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub2_lvl51' => 'Ah good ribbit good. I didn\'t think it would be so ribbit easy.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub3_lvl26' => 'When everyone has been freed from this wicked magic, the spell on the Island should vanish too. 

You have to place these fake presents in areas where the spell\'s power is extra strong. You can identify these areas by keeping a sharp lookout for things that don\'t belong on the island. As these spells work with the imagination of affected Settlers, it even spawns buildings out of their fears and dreams.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub3_lvl36' => 'When everyone has been freed from this wicked magic, the spell on the Island should vanish too. 

You have to place these fake presents in areas where the spell\'s power is extra strong. You can identify these areas by keeping a sharp lookout for things that don\'t belong on the island. As these spells work with the imagination of affected Settlers, it even spawns buildings out of their fears and dreams.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub3_lvl51' => 'When everyone has been freed from this wicked magic, the spell on the Island should vanish too. 

You have to place these fake presents in areas where the spell\'s power is extra strong. You can identify these areas by keeping a sharp lookout for things that don\'t belong on the island. As these spells work with the imagination of affected Settlers, it even spawns buildings out of their fears and dreams.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub4_lvl26' => 'Great, everything\'s back to normal. You gave me my favorite gift this year! Seeing these children reunited with their families was an incredible sight. It\'s been a long time since I saw something so moving. Little Sarah couldn\'t stop crying when she jumped into her parents\' arms.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub4_lvl36' => 'Great, everything\'s back to normal. You gave me my favorite gift this year! Seeing these children reunited with their families was an incredible sight. It\'s been a long time since I saw something so moving. Little Sarah couldn\'t stop crying when she jumped into her parents\' arms.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub4_lvl51' => 'Great, everything\'s back to normal. You gave me my favorite gift this year! Seeing these children reunited with their families was an incredible sight. It\'s been a long time since I saw something so moving. Little Sarah couldn\'t stop crying when she jumped into her parents\' arms.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderland_lvl26' => 'Maybe you won this time ribbit. But my twin brother and I will defeat you one day for sure! Ribbit! You haven\'t seen the last of us ribbit. Ribbit! Ribbit! Riiiibbbbiiiiiit!',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderland_lvl36' => 'Maybe you won this time ribbit. But my twin brother and I will defeat you one day for sure! Ribbit! You haven\'t seen the last of us ribbit. Ribbit! Ribbit! Riiiibbbbiiiiiit!',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderland_lvl51' => 'Maybe you won this time ribbit. But my twin brother and I will defeat you one day for sure! Ribbit! You haven\'t seen the last of us ribbit. Ribbit! Ribbit! Riiiibbbbiiiiiit!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket2_lvl26' => 'So, I hope we\'re not scaring away the fish with all those Toy Ducks around ! We\'re definitely attracting more Settlers to the Christmas Market, though. I love it!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket2_lvl36' => 'So, I hope we\'re not scaring away the fish with all those Toy Ducks around ! We\'re definitely attracting more Settlers to the Christmas Market, though. I love it!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket2_lvl51' => 'So, I hope we\'re not scaring away the fish with all those Toy Ducks around ! We\'re definitely attracting more Settlers to the Christmas Market, though. I love it!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket3_lvl26' => 'Ho ho ho, the kids are really enjoying these gifts. I couldn\'t have done a better job. The gleam in those kids\' eyes almost makes me forget everything bad that\'s happened recently.',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket3_lvl36' => 'Ho ho ho, the kids are really enjoying these gifts. I couldn\'t have done a better job. The gleam in those kids\' eyes almost makes me forget everything bad that\'s happened recently.',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket3_lvl51' => 'Ho ho ho, the kids are really enjoying these gifts. I couldn\'t have done a better job. The gleam in those kids\' eyes almost makes me forget everything bad that\'s happened recently.',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarketFinal_lvl26' => 'Splendid. I\'d say mission accomplished. Maybe not as demanding as bringing presents to every Settler there is, but still very impressive. And, of course, your effort should not go unrewarded!

Until the end of the event, your Settlers will still be able to visit the Christmas Market, so you can still gaze upon its beauty!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarketFinal_lvl36' => 'Splendid. I\'d say mission accomplished. Maybe not as demanding as bringing presents to every Settler there is, but still very impressive. And, of course, your effort should not go unrewarded!

Until the end of the event, your Settlers will still be able to visit the Christmas Market, so you can still gaze upon its beauty!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarketFinal_lvl51' => 'Splendid. I\'d say mission accomplished. Maybe not as demanding as bringing presents to every Settler there is, but still very impressive. And, of course, your effort should not go unrewarded!

Until the end of the event, your Settlers will still be able to visit the Christmas Market, so you can still gaze upon its beauty!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket_LevelRequirement' => 'Great! Now, if you could spare me some time, I\'d like to ask you for a few things. Ho ho ho!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket_Main_lvl26' => 'Not only I, but the families of all the missing children are deeply grateful to you. We cannot express how much you\'ve helped keep all our hopes up and made this truly the best Christmas we ever celebrated. The Settlers of your Island told me they\'ll remember this event forever. In the name of all Settlers, thank you!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket_Main_lvl36' => 'Not only I, but the families of all the missing children are deeply grateful to you. We cannot express how much you\'ve helped keep all our hopes up and made this truly the best Christmas we ever celebrated. The Settlers of your Island told me they\'ll remember this event forever. In the name of all Settlers, thank you!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket_Main_lvl51' => 'Not only I, but the families of all the missing children are deeply grateful to you. We cannot express how much you\'ve helped keep all our hopes up and made this truly the best Christmas we ever celebrated. The Settlers of your Island told me they\'ll remember this event forever. In the name of all Settlers, thank you!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket_lvl26' => 'I\'ve seen many smiles and heard lots of quacking coming from the Market...I guess this means you were successful! But we\'re not finished yet. It takes more than a few quacks to save Christmas!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket_lvl36' => 'I\'ve seen many smiles and heard lots of quacking coming from the Market...I guess this means you were successful! But we\'re not finished yet. It takes more than a few quacks to save Christmas!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket_lvl51' => 'I\'ve seen many smiles and heard lots of quacking coming from the Market...I guess this means you were successful! But we\'re not finished yet. It takes more than a few quacks to save Christmas!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasSpiritFinal_lvl26' => 'Outstanding! Can you feel the power of the Christmas Spirit? You brought this feeling to the people throughout the world. Thank you for your help!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasSpiritFinal_lvl36' => 'Outstanding! Can you feel the power of the Christmas Spirit? You brought this feeling to the people throughout the world. Thank you for your help!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasSpiritFinal_lvl51' => 'Outstanding! Can you feel the power of the Christmas Spirit? You brought this feeling to the people throughout the world. Thank you for your help!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasSpirit_Main_lvl26' => 'You did it! Everyboy loved your messages of joy, marveled your decorations, was touched by the songs, enjoyed the feast and loved the presents. Now the Christmas Spirit has indeed touched all settlers on all islands! I\'m sure it will stay with them throughout the year. Thank you!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasSpirit_Main_lvl36' => 'You did it! Everyboy loved your messages of joy, marveled your decorations, was touched by the songs, enjoyed the feast and loved the presents. Now the Christmas Spirit has indeed touched all settlers on all islands! I\'m sure it will stay with them throughout the year. Thank you!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasSpirit_Main_lvl51' => 'You did it! Everyboy loved your messages of joy, marveled your decorations, was touched by the songs, enjoyed the feast and loved the presents. Now the Christmas Spirit has indeed touched all settlers on all islands! I\'m sure it will stay with them throughout the year. Thank you!',
        'XMASEventAdv' => 'Well done! You made a lot of children (and a lot of parents) happy! Look at all those beautifully arranged houses. Now, that\'s the Christmas spirit I\'m talking about!',
        'XMASEventCookieAdv' => 'Ah... finally, these noises are gone and my eyes- I mean, my ears ribbit can finally rest again. You did good. Santa is pleased with you, teeheehee.',
        'XMASEventCookieAdv_Buff' => 'Very good. As you can see, all this beauty was just an illusion to keep the children trapped! And now, the evildoer will have to reveal itself!',
        'XMASEventCookieAdv_Main' => 'Fast, my beasts ribbit. Bring me away from here ribbit. I need to ribbit recover. No, what are you doing? Don\'t do that. Stop biting me, ribbit! Help, ribbit! Leave ribbit me alone!',
        'XMASEventCookieAdv_Military' => 'Aaahh...noooo...ouuu-ribbit-uucchh. That hurts! Rib-bit...rib...bit...',
    ],
    'QSD' => [
        '10thAnniv_Cake_AdvDefeatAllCamps' => 'The case of the strange island and the suddenly appearing mist... I wonder what\'s behind it all? I guess all we can do is explore the island and defeat any evildoers we find along the way. 
It seems they don\'t have any leaders with them, either. I wonder if that\'ll make it easier, or not?',
        '10thAnniv_Cake_Main' => 'The case of the strange island and the suddenly appearing mist... I wonder what\'s behind it all? I guess all we can do is explore the island and defeat any evildoers we find along the way. 
It seems they don\'t have any leaders with them, either. I wonder if that\'ll make it easier, or not?',
        'AdvDefeatAllBanditleader' => 'Defeat all bandit leaders and get a reward',
        'AdvDefeatAllBandits' => 'Defeat all bandit camps and get a reward',
        'AdvDefeatAllBoneChurches' => 'Defeat all bone churches and get a reward',
        'AdvDefeatAllDarkCastles' => 'Defeat all dark castles and get a reward',
        'AdvDefeatAllDarkCastlesAndBonechurches' => 'Defeat all witch towers and bone churches to get a reward',
        'AdvDefeatAllWitchtower' => 'Defeat the witch tower and get a reward',
        'AdvDefeatCroaker' => 'Croaker is hiding in a camp in the north of this island. Take it out and return the presents he stole!',
        'AdvDefeatOneBanditleader' => 'Defeat the first bandit leader to clear the sector.',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ1_Salesman_1' => 'Ask around in the Tavern',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ1_Salesman_2' => 'In the tavern you are told that a local salesman has gone missing. He was last seen moving east with his baggage and has not been seen since.
Search for clues and find out the salesman\'s whereabouts.',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ1_Salesman_3' => 'Follow the clues to find out about the salesman\'s whereabouts.',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ1_Salesman_4' => 'Follow the clues to find out about the salesman\'s whereabouts.',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ1_Salesman_5' => 'Follow the clues to find out the salesman\'s whereabouts.',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ1_Salesman_6' => 'Defeat the bandits and free the salesman',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ2_SpareOurBoys_1' => 'Please don\'t hurt our boys!',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ2_SpareOurBoys_2' => '"They just want to play," says the old forester\'s wife. "I beg you, don\'t hurt my boys! They decided to form their own little gang and thought a flimsy tent and bad breath was enough to form a band of robbers. Then they set up camp in the north. Please, let them live and I assure you, you shall not regret it!"',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ3_TheTreesHaveEyes_1' => 'They\'re in the trees',
        'AdvMadHenryReloaded_SQ3_TheTreesHaveEyes_2' => 'A terrified townsman complains to you: "Nowhere\'s safe these days! Not only do these scallywags entrench themselves in their camps, they also lurk in the dark of the forest! Do these lands a great service and cast these vermin out from their treetop hideouts!"',
        'AdvPlaceGarrison' => 'You\'ll need your army to defeat the bandits. Go back to your home zone, assign your units to one of your generals and send him to the adventure.

- Send your army to the adventure zone.

NOTE:
Your general needs a few minutes to travel to the adventure zone.',
        'AdvTheNords_SQ1_LostChildren_1' => 'Select the tavern',
        'AdvTheNords_SQ1_LostChildren_2' => 'The tavern owner wears a worried expression on his face: "My daughter should have been home a long time ago! The children like to play near the caves, although we explicitly forbid it. Can you help us search them? Inspect all the caves and mines and bring our children home!"',
        'AdvTheNords_SQ1_LostChildren_3' => '"So you have inspected all the caves but found no sign of the children? Surely they wouldn\'t be foolish enough to hang about near the ruins? Ghastly creatures loiter there! Hurry and search the old temples. I have a bad feeling about this…"',
        'AdvTheNords_SQ1_LostChildren_4' => '"No sign of them near the ruins either? That means they can only have gone to the old well in the woods. Those foolish kids! That\'s where the old witch dwells, lurking and waiting for unsuspecting victims! We have no more time to lose - find the old well!"',
        'AdvTheNords_SQ1_LostChildren_5' => '"Oh no, we were right - the old witch has our children! Free the children from her clutches!"',
        'AdvTraitors_SQ1_destroyHiddenCamps_1' => 'Ask around at the tavern!',
        'AdvTraitors_SQ1_destroyHiddenCamps_2' => 'A slightly tipsy mayor welcomes you with open arms: "What a fortunate coincidence to have you here in our lovely little town! We\'re being harassed by a bunch of marauders that sneak around in the bushes at night and steal our cattle. Drive these wretches away and we will reward you accordingly!"',
        'AdvTraitors_SQ2_findFlowers_1' => 'Click the guild house',
        'AdvTraitors_SQ2_findFlowers_2' => 'The Guild Master is upset because the preparations for the guild\'s annual celebration aren\'t going as planned. "We still don\'t have enough water lilies to weave into our traditional wreathes! Just how can we get them in time? Help us and collect as many as you can and you won\'t regret it!"',
        'AdvVictorTheVicious_SQ1_SpareCenterCamp_1' => 'Visit the Tavern',
        'AdvVictorTheVicious_SQ1_SpareCenterCamp_2' => 'A deserted royal regiment is reported to hide among Victor\'s troops. Make sure they survive so they can be taken before the king for a fair trial.',
        'AdvVictorTheVicious_SQ2_Rivals_1' => 'Click any Camp',
        'AdvVictorTheVicious_SQ2_Rivals_2' => 'Vicious Victor seems to have driven some local scoundrels to the woods when seizing these lands. His old rival Ruppert the Revengeful is secretly gathering troops and is just waiting for Victor to be cast out so he can return to pester the righteous folks. 
Stop the evildoer\'s scheming, and the local regent will increase your rewards even further!',
        'AdvWitchOfTheSwamp_SQ1_SpareNorthCamp_1' => 'Inspect the ruins',
        'AdvWitchOfTheSwamp_SQ1_SpareNorthCamp_2' => 'The old hermit inhabiting the ruins whispers to you: "The old witch is afraid of nothing, not even the king\'s troops! Not all her minions are vile creatures; only recently has she bedeviled a squad of the king\'s men and forced them serve her. The king will certainly be grateful if you manage to let his men to escape."',
        'AdvWitchOfTheSwamp_SQ2_FindLostSouls_1' => 'Select the Witch Tower with your mouse cursor!',
        'AdvWitchOfTheSwamp_SQ2_FindLostSouls_2' => 'The Witch has cast a nasty curse over this swamp and guards the souls of lost explorers to haunt these lands.
Find the 7 hidden graves to free their cursed souls!',
        'Adv_BeautifulPrincess_Q1' => 'You and Aladdin arrive at the island where the informant mentioned Scheherezade was being held. It surprises you how barren everything looks, to the point where you question the information received. You quickly clear your suspicion, however, as you see that bandit camps have been set up to protect their base. They were expecting you.',
        'Adv_BeautifulPrincess_Q2' => 'While Aladdin celebrates having finally found the oil lamp, you find a small crumbled piece of paper on the ground. It reads: "They are taking us to the Oasis in the east. Please help us! There isn\'t much time! - Scheherezade". What could she possibly mean by "us"?',
        'Adv_BeautifulPrincess_Q3' => 'Right before you finish dismantling the camp, you see a horse sprinting away towards the old palace carrying a bandit and two women. You\'re certain that Scheherezade is one of them, and quickly give chase.',
        'Adv_BesiegedCity_Q1' => 'Sinbad warmly greets you, and you share your information. He mentions that there is a city nearby where you may be able to get some more information about your goals. Some raiders stand between you and the city and demand you surrender. It\'s time to show them what you\'re made of.',
        'Adv_BesiegedCity_Q2' => 'Sinbad returns after a quick exploration of the area, and informs you that the city has been overrun with frenzied apes. Putting your main objective aside, you decide to drive the apes away from the city and back into their habitat.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Event_01' => 'You look surprised. In this kingdom, everything looks a bit different. Tee hee hee... Just keep an eye out for buildings that look more like your own, and when you recognize one, simply click on it.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Event_02' => 'So, our glorious hero will save the day! Tee hee hee… just kidding. I\'m hilarious, didn\'t you know? Anyway, have you already seen any buildings that don\'t seem to fit in? I can sense five of them.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Event_03' => 'My, that was a long journey. Tee hee hee… what a strange looking island. I wonder what the people who live here look like. Anyway, we\'re not here for entertainment! Tee hee hee… Just kidding.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Event_04' => 'So, feel free to look around and draw your own conclusions. I\'m very eager to hear your opinion. By the way, I really like this retro style. It reminds me somehow of… oh, never mind. Just look around. Tee hee hee…',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Event_05' => 'Here we are. I was told that there are five strange looking buildings around here. Find them and click on them. Nothing else out of the ordinary to report, except it looks a little like we\'ve traveled back in time. Tee hee hee…',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military2_01' => 'Hmm… reminds me a bit of the last island we were on. However, do you see the dead trees? They are blocking the way through the forest. Remove them by clicking on them.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military2_02' => 'Just as I expected - bandits everywhere. It seems we are not going to be able to get around them, so let\'s clear a way through again. However, clicking will not be enough to drive them back. Tee hee hee…',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military2_03' => 'I would suggest asking the settlers living here. Select the different buildings and ask around. I\'m sure we\'ll get enough information from them.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military2_04' => 'The settlers say we need a special item to unlock the seal of the old ruins that are causing this. This means we need to reach the swamp and defeat the croaker, but there are fences and walls blocking the swamp. Let your units tear them down and defeat the toad.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military2_05' => 'If I\'ve understood correctly, we have to defeat these cult guys in the camps near the ruins to unleash some magic energy, and that will tear down the ruins. So, let\'s go. Tee hee hee…',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military_01' => 'OK, here we are. It does look a bit strange here. The village with the settlers who can provide us with information is behind this mountain chain… oh, and there\'s a bandit horde there too. We should begin with them. Tee hee hee…',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military_02' => 'Seems like the passage is blocked somehow. Gather some of your men and pull the big rocks aside. It basically means you have to click on them. Tee hee hee…',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military_03' => 'Can you see the village? I can\'t see it very well either. We should get nearer, or maybe we should make our way through the bandit camps and check with the inhabitants there?! Even though we probably could reach the village without fighting, saving the villagers from the bandits will gain their trust.',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military_04' => 'We should ask around this little town. It seems some of the buildings look kind of strange here, don\'t you think? I\'m eager to hear the story behind all this. Tee hee hee…',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military_05' => 'Hmm.. The witch is at the end of this canyon. It seems one of those bandit camps is blocking the way, so we\'ll have to fight. It wouldn\'t be any fun otherwise…',
        'Adv_Birthday2013_Military_06' => 'The shaman has his camp deep in these woods. I assume he will have several traps and units set up to prevent visitors from visiting. Tee hee hee… Geddit? Visitors from visiting. Tee hee hee…',
        'Adv_Christmas2013_Q1' => 'I\'m so glad you\'re here! The Croaker has stolen my sleigh!
It was an extra-wide one with low skids, go-faster stripes, and loads of space for presents.
There\'s no way I can let it keep my sleigh… whatever it is.

Unfortunately, the Croaker seems to have learned from our last meeting, as he\'s reinforced his defences.
Two towers now stand guarding the only way to reach him.

They are too strong to attack directly.
But the leader camps on this side of the river are being used to store cannons and explosives.
If we can defeat them, we can use their equipment to destroy the towers.',
        'Adv_Christmas2013_Q2' => 'I can already see the Croaker\'s hut.
He only has a few more servants left! Then we can show him it was a bad idea to steal my sleigh.',
        'Adv_EMEvent1' => 'It is a contest of the strongest and fiercest, a challenge of will, the promise of eternal glory... and you have just received an invitation to this tournament of champions from afar! Awestruck, you marvel at the ornate document, the receipt of which alone is a privilege. Glory and riches await you. And there\'s talk of brew, too!

Your invitation lies ready in your mailbox, so quickly go and prepare for the oncoming challenges, then gather your men and face your contenders!',
        'Adv_EMEvent1_2' => 'It is a contest of the strongest and fiercest, a challenge of will, the promise of eternal glory... and you have just received an invitation to this tournament of champions from afar! Awestruck, you marvel at the ornate document, the receipt of which alone is a privilege. Glory and riches await you. And there\'s talk of brew, too!

Your invitation lies ready in your mailbox, so quickly go and prepare for the oncoming challenges, then gather your men and face your contenders!',
        'Adv_EMEvent2' => 'You have won your first spurs and are ready for the next challenge. The tournament is in full swing now and has taken hold of your island as well. Excitedly bustling everywhere, your settlers elatedly go about their preparations for the upcoming event. This way your men should be up and running in no time! 
And here comes your next invitation already! Don\'t make your opponents wait!',
        'Adv_EMEvent2_2' => 'You have won your first spurs and are ready for the next challenge. The tournament is in full swing now and has taken hold of your island as well. Excitedly bustling everywhere, your settlers elatedly go about their preparations for the upcoming event. This way your men should be up and running in no time! 
And here comes your next invitation already! Don\'t make your opponents wait!',
        'Adv_EMEvent3' => 'You have successfully moved on to the next round and quickly acquired a reputation that earns you numerous enthusiastic followers. Already bets are being placed on your upcoming victories, and your settlers are pleased with your efforts.
Time to prepare your next match. Get a selection of your finest men to the venue!',
        'Adv_EMEvent3_2' => 'You have successfully moved on to the next round and quickly acquired a reputation that earns you numerous enthusiastic followers. Already bets are being placed on your upcoming victories, and your settlers are pleased with your efforts.
Time to prepare your next match. Get a selection of your finest men to the venue!',
        'Adv_EMEvent4' => 'If you thought things were tough so far, then beware! You have successfully mastered the first half of this tournament, but the true challenges are yet to come. Brace yourself, because from here on your opponents know no mercy. Muster your men and set out for the next match!',
        'Adv_EMEvent4_2' => 'If you thought things were tough so far, then beware! You have successfully mastered the first half of this tournament, but the true challenges are yet to come. Brace yourself, because from here on your opponents know no mercy. Muster your men and set out for the next match!',
        'Adv_EMEvent5' => 'The upcoming match promises a thrilling battle. Your opponents travel to the contest from faraway countries, often dressing up peculiarly and employing wondrous tactics. Look out, chose your troops with care, and maybe you\'ll even get to learn a few tricks from your adversaries. Travel to the next venue with your men!',
        'Adv_EMEvent5_2' => 'The upcoming match promises a thrilling battle. Your opponents travel to the contest from faraway countries, often dressing up peculiarly and employing wondrous tactics. Look out, chose your troops with care, and maybe you\'ll even get to learn a few tricks from your adversaries. Travel to the next venue with your men!',
        'Adv_EMEvent6' => 'You have done well to get this far. It took some grim battles and many a brew, but your settlers went through all the highs and lows together with you. Now the final stand-off lies ahead, and a palpable tension is in the air all across your island. In the past, you have proven to be a great contestant with remarkable endurance, but now you will have to show what you have learned in this tournament!
Ready your men and prepare for the final match!',
        'Adv_EMEvent6_2' => 'You have done well to get this far. It took some grim battles and many a brew, but your settlers went through all the highs and lows together with you. Now the final stand-off lies ahead, and a palpable tension is in the air all across your island. In the past, you have proven to be a great contestant with remarkable endurance, but now you will have to show what you have learned in this tournament!
Ready your men and prepare for the final match!',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_01' => '9 Easter eggs are hidden on the island. Find them all to complete this adventure.
Note: to gather the Easter eggs, all you have to do is click on them with your mouse cursor. Click once on every egg to complete the adventure.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_02' => '9 Easter eggs are hidden on the island. Find them all to complete this adventure.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_03' => '9 Easter eggs are hidden on the island. Find them all to complete this adventure.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_04' => '9 Easter eggs are hidden on the island. Find them all to complete this adventure.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_05' => '9 Easter eggs are hidden on the island. Find them all to complete this adventure.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_06' => '9 Easter eggs are hidden on the island. Find them all to complete this adventure.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_07' => '9 Easter eggs are hidden on the island. Find them all to complete this adventure.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_08' => '9 Easter eggs are hidden on the island. Find them all to complete this adventure.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_09' => '15 Easter eggs are hidden on the island. Find them all to complete this adventure.',
        'Adv_Easter_Event_10' => '9 Easter eggs are hidden on the island. Find them all to complete this adventure.',
        'Adv_EoWEventQ1' => 'So this is it, our beloved home island, 1,000 years before our time! The forests are bustling with strange creatures and something seems wrong with the water. I say we stay in the open and go catch these insidious devils as quickly  as possible!',
        'Adv_EoWEventQ2' => 'We have no time to waste - I see their witchdoctors have gathered and are up to no good, that much is certain!',
        'Adv_EoWEventQ3' => 'Over there! They seem to have begun some sort of ritual! Can you feel it? It\'s sending chills down my spine. We must not let them finish their abysmal deeds. Quickly now, we might still be able to prevent them from casting the curse upon all of us!',
        'Adv_FirstThief_Q1' => 'The sun is burning and the sand is hot, what strange lands these are. Ali Baba approaches you holding a map in his hand. The map shows a location where a woman is hold captive, and a path showing you how to get there. But there are outposts guarding the path.',
        'Adv_FirstThief_Q2' => 'Travelling during the night was a lot easier than doing so during the day, so we reached the location in good time Ali Baba and some of your scouts searched the area, and found a bandit camp close by.',
        'Adv_FirstThief_Q3' => 'Travelling through day and night you finally caught up with the caravan. It’s time to strike - and don’t give the thief chance to make another escape.',
        'Adv_OilLamp_Q1' => 'Aladdin tells you that he has an informant that knows where the oil lamp could be, and that he may also know where Scheherezade is being held captive. In between you and the informant, though, there are many bandits that are not willing to let you through, so you ready your weapons to push through by force.',
        'Adv_OilLamp_Q2' => 'The shady informant flees to the east, trying to escape from you. You know he\'s hiding something, and he\'s too valuable to let him get away, so you quickly give chase.',
        'Adv_OilLamp_Q3' => 'The informant has been cornered, yet he still refuses to talk to you. You will need to be more "persuasive" and get the information you need by force if necessary.',
        'Adv_SeaSnake_Q1' => 'You meet Sinbad, an experienced sailor, upon your arrival. He tells you that he has heard rumours among other sailors of a great treasure hidden on this island. In order for them to share more information, however, you\'ll have to win them over by doing what they like doing the most - brawling.',
        'Adv_SeaSnake_Q2' => 'You decide to make your way to the cave the sailors mentioned. You seem to not be the only one after the treasure, though, as there are some bandits heading over there too.',
        'Adv_SecondThief_Q1' => 'Ali Baba tells a tale of an oasis of legend somewhere on this island, and he\'s sure the thief leaders will be near it. You spot several thief caravans in the distance, and you decide to follow them through the huge desert.',
        'Adv_SecondThief_Q2' => 'You see some of the fleeing thieves head towards an ancient ruin in the distance. You deduce they are headed to where their main base is and decide to give chase to them.',
        'Adv_SecondThief_Q3' => 'You intercept one of the thief messengers, who was about to send a warning to the main base about your arrival. Ali Baba feels relieved to confirm his suspicions. You decide it\'s time to push forward to the thieves\' main camp.',
        'Adv_TheBetrayedLittleTailorQ1' => 'Thank you for assisting me once again, old friend!
A greedy inn-keeper has tricked my two youngest sons and stolen our wishing table and the gold-producing donkey.
I fear he may try to get the cudgel-in-a-bag too.
Will you join me looking after my oldest son? Once I’m sure he\'s well, we can start making a plan for getting our stuff back.',
        'Adv_TheBetrayedLittleTailorQ2' => 'Oh no - the inn-keeper has hired an assassin! How cruel. This guy will soon see what an angry father is capable of, but for now we need to stop the assassin!',
        'Adv_TheBetrayedLittleTailorQ3' => 'I’m so relieved my sons are safe now, but the thugs managed to steal the cudgel before we arrived. We need to get it back - I want use it on that mean inn-keeper. Let’s follow them to the village. Maybe we can overtake them.',
        'Adv_TheBetrayedLittleTailorQ4' => 'We are very close to him. Soon he will get to know the little cudgel he wanted to steal!
Let’s move on to the tavern.',
        'Adv_TheBetrayedLittleTailorQ5' => 'Oh how I do love this cudgel, but sadly he managed to escape, and our stuff is not even here. I\'m guessing he\'s hidden it in his overly luxurious mansion in the north-east. Let’s visit him there and demand he return what is ours.',
        'Adv_TheBetrayedLittleTailorQ6' => 'By the looks of the grim-looking welcoming party around his mansion, I\'m guessing he won\'t give up our stuff without a fight.',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ1' => 'Dear friend, thank you for once again arriving to help me out. The princess wants me to spend the night in a stable, with a giant bear!
Luckily, I have a plan: the commoners tell me the bear likes music, so I shall simply entertain him with some songs on the violin, and hope he likes them so much he won’t want to eat me!

The catch is that I left my violin at home because I prefer to travel light. I tried to buy another, but the only one there used to be in the village has been stolen by bandits. Can you help me retrieve it?',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ2' => 'The violin is located in bandit  leader\'s hut.
Their camp is too well guarded - it was impossible for me to sneak into it.
Looks like we\'ll have to fight our way to the violin…',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ3' => 'Now that I have the violin, I doubt it will be enough to keep the bear from eating me.
I need something to trap the bear when things go ugly. A bench vise should do the trick.
A blacksmith who lives in the forest should have one.',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ4' => 'Look, there it is! I wonder where all those animals are coming from. They seem to be besieging the blacksmith. I’m sure he will gladly give you his bench vise if you manage to repulse them.',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ5' => 'You should have seen that! The bear attacked me almost instantly, but as soon as I started to play he was mesmerized.
He even started to dance and wanted me to teach him how to play the violin. You heard right - the bear can speak!
I told him I\'d need to cut his nails first, and used the vise to screw his paw tight.
With the bear trapped, I got a good night’s sleep. In the morning, the princess was very impressed to see me, and she agreed to the marriage, so let’s go to the town and start the ceremony!',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ6' => 'What did you say? The bear is no longer in the stable? Oh no! That other tailor must have freed him.
I don’t want to be eaten on my wedding day. Could you search for the bear and take care of it?',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ7' => 'Looks like I was too optimistic... My rival just attacked me and I barely escaped with my life.
Could you do me a last favor and keep him occupied until the marriage is done?
It looks like he\'s the head of the local bandits, so you\'ll have to fight through his goons to get to him.',
        'Adv_TheCleverLittleTailorQ8' => 'Alright, you see that hut on the coast? That\'s his hideout. Just get in there and rough him up a bit. 
That should give us time to finish the wedding ceremony.',
        'Adv_TheHeroicLittleTailorQ1' => 'You arrive at the forest and read the little tailor’s instructions carefully:
“The hermit who gave me shelter always keeps his hut well lit at night to scare off the wild animals. Just wait for night to fall and you should see the light which will guide you to me.”

And indeed, you do see a bright light at the horizon. It’s not far from here, but the terrifying howls of a nearby wolf pack worry you…',
        'Adv_TheHeroicLittleTailorQ2' => 'You decide to wait the rest of the night before leaving, but in the morning you are aroused by the violent sounds of screaming and roaring animals.

You hurry out of the hut, and on the other side of the nearby river you see a great black bull and a majestic stag fighting each other.

For a long time, it is uncertain which of the two is going to be victorious, but then the bull thrusts his horns into the stag’s body. Though wounded, the stag continues to fight, but it is obvious he won\'t be able to hold on much longer.

Suddenly the tailor runs off, with the words: “Don’t just stand there - we have to help the stag!”',
        'Adv_TheHeroicLittleTailorQ3' => 'Suddenly the stag rushes towards the tailor, entangles him on his antlers and runs away.

You decide to follow them.
Careful though - all the wild animals the stag rushes past in his hurry are now upset, and they will attack you on sight…',
        'Adv_TheHeroicLittleTailorQ4' => 'You follow the tracks to a barren mountainous area. In the distance you can see a soaring tower, and your intuition tells you that you will find the little tailor there.',
        'Adv_TheHeroicLittleTailorQ5' => 'The little Tailor tells you what happened:
“Alright, the stag didn\'t mean to harm me when he caught me on his antlers. He took me to this tower where I found this maiden.
She had been imprisoned in a glass coffin by a dark magician, because she did not return his affection. 

He also imprisoned her entire castle, together with her entire court, by diminishing it in size.
And the stag is in reality her brother! And the bull he was fighting with was the dark magician transformed by dark magic!

We need to reach the Dark Magician’s castle and defeat him so we can free the maiden\'s shire and break the curse affecting her brother!”',
        'Adv_TheHeroicLittleTailorQ6' => '"Alright, now only a few cultists stand between us and the magician. Let’s not waste any time - who knows what dark magic he is conjuring right now…"',
        'Adv_TheNords2Q1' => 'The situation is worse than expected! They\'ve taken over the island, and using a mystical item called the Hoarfrost Globe, they\'ve covered the land in ice. What is the globe? It\'s a mystical item filled with pure frost essence… we need to find it and destroy it! The spy said it\'s inside one of the many enemy camps. Let\'s go, we\'re running out of time!',
        'Adv_TheNords2Q2' => 'This is not good - we\'re going to freeze here! We need to find the globe and destroy it! Let\'s battle our way to the next camp!',
        'Adv_TheNords2Q3' => 'The leader has broken the globe into six pieces! They have all been hidden inside some old depleted wells around the island! You must find and destroy the depleted wells now! The ice is getting to our bones!',
        'Adv_TheNords2Q4' => 'Wait! Our youngest spy has come back, saying there is another part to the globe! The last piece, the core, is in the hands of their leader, Odinom the Cruel! This is it - we need to find him and destroy the final piece!',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ1' => 'Bandits have occupied the village and will hinder us greatly in our search.
I guess we must drive them away first, otherwise we\'ll need much more time to find the sons.',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ2a' => 'My first son always wanted to become a joiner. I bet we\'ll find him chopping wood near the forest in the west.',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ2b' => 'The little tailor greets his son and immediately asks for forgiveness, but the son is still angry that the little tailor preferred to believe a goat more than him.
Maybe he will change his mind when we help him to chop down the red tree in the north-west, but to get there we first need to fight our way through the forest and its dangerous beasts.',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ2c' => 'There it is, the red tree! Some say its wood has magical properties. We will soon find out, because my master has asked me to acquire it so I can create my masterwork: a magical table which can create food whenever we wish!

However, it seems the beasts of this forest don\'t want us to get to the tree. Once again we need to fight our way through!',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ3a' => 'I have spoken with the miller in the village and he has told me that my second son is his apprentice. He has send him to find his donkey that drops gold from its mouth when you say ‘Bricklebrit!’ According to the miller he headed to the mountains, but has not returned yet. 
Let\'s go find him!',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ3b' => 'His eyes wide open, the son starts to speak:
“Father! How glad I am to see you.
The miller has given me the task of finding his gold-producing donkey. I followed its tracks to this old abandoned mine and discovered it had been stolen by a giant! I saw him walking to another old mine and just as I started following him, the inhabitants of the mine returned and I was forced to hide.
Who knows what woudl have happened to me if you hadn\'t come and saveed me, father…

May I ask you to help me to get the gold-producing donkey back from the giant so I can finish my apprenticeship?”',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ4a' => 'The third son is always ready for a good fight to protect others and fight evil. Maybe he is just about to beat up some bandits in the east?',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ4b' => 'You have freed the third son from his chains, but there is no time to talk. The Bandits from the other side of the river have seen your attack and are preparing to retaliate.
To protect the town, you must fight your way to their leader and defeat him.',
        'Adv_TheSonsOfTheLittleTailorQ4c' => 'With the bandits regrouping the little tailor’s son found some time to speak:
“Though I have not forgotten how you sent me away, I appreciate your help here, father.
However, the toughest part is just about to start. If you assist me in defeating their leader you will not only be helping the innocent townsfolk, you\'ll also help me finish my apprenticeship. That’s because their leader wields a magical cudgel-in-a-bag he stole from my master. And of course, my master wants it back!

What, you don’t know what a cudgel-in-a-bag is?

It’s quite simple:
If you say ‘Out of the bag, Cudgel!’ it will leap out of the bag and attack the bad guys.
And when you are done you say: ‘Into the bag Cudgel!’

Really convenient if you ask me.”',
        'Adv_TheValiantLittleTailorQ1' => 'My faithful friend, I need your help!
A few days ago I was eating some jam when some flies settled on it. I killed them all with just one blow!

Anyway, I wanted to let the whole world know, and made a belt describing the deed.
Here, look! I\'ve engraved “Seven in one fell swoop!” on it. 

Unfortuantely, people have misunderstood, and think I killed seven men with one blow.
Sadly, I realised this too late. Now the King thinks I’m a very strong fighter and has sent me on a quest to kill two Giants.

Giants! They can easily kill whole armies. How am I supposed to deal with one, let alone two?
Can you help me with this? All of the King\'s rewards shall be yours.',
        'Adv_TheValiantLittleTailorQ2' => 'The king seemed impressed, but now he wants me to catch an unicorn. 
Killing Giants is one thing, they\'re dumb and can be fooled, but Unicorns possess magical powers and know how to use them.',
        'Adv_TheValiantLittleTailorQ3' => 'I\'ve just returned from seeing the King. Though he said he was impressed, he didn\'t look quite as pleased as I had anticipated.
He has given me one final quest, and promised to make me rich if I succeed.
If you help me one last time, I’ll give you most of the promised treasure.
We need to capture a furious boar which is terrorizing the land!',
        'Adv_TheValiantLittleTailorQ4' => 'Help! Help! The King has broken his promise, and now he wants to kill me.
He says I’m too dangerous, so he keeps sending me on quests where I\'m sure to meet my death!
Oh, I wish I\'d never made that cursed belt…
I barely escaped his soldiers, but they\'ll be here any minute!',
        'Adv_TheWoodcutterMain_Q1' => 'Greetings my dear friend. May I introduce myself? My name is Schahri and I am the king of a small empire, which lies far away in the sands. I am approaching you to discuss an urgent matter. I am searching for my lovely wife Scheherazade, who went missing several days ago. The tracks led us here, but those sword clashers have forced us to call off our search. Will you help me defeat them?',
        'Adv_TheWoodcutterMain_Q2' => 'One of the bandits was very talkative. He told us about a stronghold, where they keep their prisoners. I want to ask you for another favor. Will you help me find this stronghold? My wife might be there.',
        'Adv_ThirdThief_Q1' => 'Your troops arrive on the island, but Ali Baba is nowhere to be found. He specifically asked you to wait for his arrival, as he could be of great help here. While you wait for his arrival, you decide to survey the surroundings for thief camps.',
        'Adv_ThirdThief_Q2' => 'Ali Baba has arrived on the island. He praises your proactiveness, and mentions that the information will be a big help for his plan. He knows of a secret passage that leads directly to the core of the stronghold, but it\'s blocked by a huge boulder. He asks for your help to remove it.',
        'Adv_ThirdThief_Q3' => 'With the secret passage revealed, Ali Baba goes in without a second thought and beckons you to follow him. The cave is long and treacherous, but he assures you it\'s a lot safer than the alternative. You decide to follow him through the cave.',
        'Adv_ThirdThief_Q4' => 'You and your troops are relieved to finally see the sunlight again. Ali Baba smiles and points to where the main stronghold camp is. You prepare for the final attack on the stronghold core.',
        'Adv_TreasureKnowledge_Q1' => 'Upon arriving on the island, you\'re greeted by a huge mountain, which is virtually impossible to climb. Ali Baba manages to spot a few bandit camps on the higher levels, which means that there must be some way up - and you\'re not the only ones after the treasure.',
        'Adv_TreasureKnowledge_Q2' => 'You quickly realize that the mountain\'s labyrinth-like nature is going to make the climb difficult to say the least. On your way up, you spot a horrific plant monster guarding one of the pathways. You decide to take action against it.',
        'Adv_TreasureKnowledge_Q3' => 'With the plant monster gone, the goal is finally at hand. You spot the ancient library in the distance, but it\'s too late. The bandits are already looting the place. You plan your final offensive with the intention of stopping them before they can find the treasure.',
        'Adv_TreasureWisdom_Q1' => 'Arriving at the island, you encounter the remains of an ancient civilization that lived here years, if not centuries ago. You see some raider camps around who don\'t look very pleased to see you. Given their clearly hostile intentions, you decide to take up arms against them.',
        'Adv_TreasureWisdom_Q2' => 'The first camps seem to have been only a diversion to keep you busy while tomb raiders violently loot the ancient\'s tombs. Irritated by the lack of respect to such an ancient culture, you decide to put an end to it.',
        'Adv_TreasureWisdom_Q3' => 'You receive some good news from Ali Baba. The raiders have not managed to access the main temple due to its ancient defence system. You understand why this is good news, but you\'re concerned about how exactly you\'re going to get through the defence system yourself!',
        'AdventureSeasonMercenary_LevelRequirement26' => 'Before diving into some adventures and teaching some mercenaries a lesson, let\'s first focus on strengthening your military and becoming stronger! It will soon be your time to shine!',
        'AdventureSeasonMercenary_Main' => 'One of your scouts spotted an increase in the number of mercenaries on a handful of islands around your kingdom. He went on a mission to uncover the reason, and instead discovered some interesting relics. I would suggest going to these islands, defeating the mercenaries, and grabbing those adventure relics. It’ll be worth it!',
        'AdventureSeasonMercenary_Sub1' => 'What\'s the secret about those Adventure Relics? Those mercenaries are hiding them on so many islands. We need to investigate!',
        'AdventureSeasonMercenary_Sub2' => 'The more Adventure Relics you retrieve, the better we can investigate their purpose.',
        'AdventureSeasonMercenary_Sub3' => 'I think we’ll need a lot, lot more. Please, carry on - and don\'t give up!',
        'BAUMP1' => 'Oh my goodness! Something must have gone wrong.

I am quite sure I read the coordinates correctly. The island should be here!

Don\'t just stand there glaring at me, help those poor sailors!',
        'BAUMP1_Sub1' => 'Quick! Go back to your provision house and make some floaters with these schematics.',
        'BAUMP1_Sub2' => 'Great, you\'re back. Use the floaters you produced to save the drowning sailors, before it\'s too late!',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main1' => 'Who says you can\'t have a party while preparing for an even bigger party? Let\'s do a Celebration Marathon - a Celebrathon - and see how many small parties we can do over the next few weeks! To make things a little easier, you can keep the same structure for every party - but you\'ll have to ratchet the intensity up each time to keep it interesting! I bet you won\'t manage 10 rounds before the end of the anniversary celebrations, he he he.
I\'ve taken the liberty of inviting all our friends to the first party, and told them you\'ll take care of their needs. Aren\'t I a nice guy? And here they are! Already! Hmm, Flora seems a little shy. But I expect the Mad Scientist\'s shenanigans will warm her up. Oh, the Major General is telling one of his famous jokes, gotta go part-ay! I\'m sure you\'ll take care of everything!
Let\'s see if you can keep up!',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10' => 'You know the drill! Let\'s celebrate! It looks like more Settlers have joined in the side-festivities. Ramp it up!',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub1' => 'As always, the first thing we need is something extraordinary to quench the thirst of our new guests. To keep the celebrations going, your guests need some exquisite drinks. Could you fetch some more?',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub10' => 'Oh my, oh my. Would you honestly have forgotten all your other friends? Shame on you! You should go and make amends for forgetting to invite them to these awesome parties!',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub2' => 'Your guests are pushing for you to regale them with some of your greatest stories! Go on... they\'re waiting! What do you mean you don\'t remember any? With all the extraordinary stuff you\'ve done over the last few years? Seriously?? Well, maybe you should go and relive a few of your greatest adventures - then I\'m sure you\'ll have some cool things to brag about.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub3' => 'The roof is on fire - literally! Some party settlers pushed a cake over that had several candles on it. It\'s OK though, nothing serious happened - but they\'d still like you to extinguish the fire in their throats with some brew.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub4' => 'I think you\'d better get some materials in to deal with any repairs. What do you mean why? We\'re celebrating a great anniversary! Something\'s bound to get broken!',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub5' => 'Let\'s have some quick fun with our guests!',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub6' => 'Looks like your guests are having a lot of fun! Maybe in some cases a bit too much... In fact, some of your deposits seem to be missing a few pieces - whatever they may have been used for - while others have been... let\'s just say soiled. Seems some of your guests spent too long dancing in circles. The good news is your fish have had an extra meal... Yuck! Anyway, you should replenish whatever\'s missing.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub7' => 'Every party needs something special to be remembered by. Maybe you can show your guests around some more exotic places?',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub8' => 'You have too many friends! The amount of goods they consume is incredible! Not that I should complain... I\'m not the one who has to keep up with the demand, he he.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main10_Sub9' => 'Yeah, you heard right! There will be gifts! Awesome, right?! Oh no, ha ha. Not gifts for you - they\'re for your guests! Isn\'t that much better? Instead of just one person getting gifts, now everyone gets one! Yeah, I know - I have great ideas, he he. Wait, you don\'t have anything you could give everyone as a gift? Then you\'d better get going!',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main1_Sub1' => 'As always, the first thing we need is something extraordinary to quench the thirst of our new guests. To keep the celebrations going, your guests need some exquisite drinks. Could you fetch some more?',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main1_Sub10' => 'Oh my, oh my! Would you honestly have forgotten all your other friends? Shame on you! You need to go and make amends for forgetting to invite them to these awesome parties!',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main1_Sub2' => 'Your guests are pushing for you to regale them with some of your greatest stories! Go on... they\'re waiting! What do you mean you don\'t remember any? With all the extraordinary stuff you\'ve done over the last few years? Seriously?? Well, maybe you should go and relive a few of your greatest adventures - then I\'m sure you\'ll have some cool things to brag about.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main1_Sub3' => 'The roof is on fire - literally! Some party settlers pushed a cake over that had several candles on it. It\'s OK though, nothing serious happened - but they\'d still like you to extinguish the fire in their throats with some brew.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main1_Sub4' => 'I think you\'d better get some materials in to deal with any repairs. What do you mean why? We\'re celebrating a great anniversary! Something\'s bound to get broken!',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main1_Sub5' => 'Let\'s have some quick fun with our guests!',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main1_Sub6' => 'Looks like your guests are having a lot of fun! Maybe in some cases a bit too much... In fact, some of your deposits seem to be missing a few pieces - whatever they may have been used for - while others have been... let\'s just say soiled. Seems some of your guests spent too long dancing in circles. The good news is your fish have had an extra meal... Yuck! Anyway, you should replenish whatever\'s missing.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main1_Sub7' => 'Every party needs something special to be remembered by. Maybe you can show your guests around some more exotic places?',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main1_Sub8' => 'You have too many friends! The amount of goods they consume is incredible! Not that I should complain... I\'m not the one who has to keep up with the demand, he he.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main1_Sub9' => 'Yeah, you heard right! There will be gifts! Awesome, right?! Oh no, ha ha. Not gifts for you - they\'re for your guests! Isn\'t that much better? Instead of just one person getting gifts, now everyone gets one! Yeah, I know - I have great ideas, he he. Wait, you don\'t have anything you could give everyone as a gift? Then you\'d better get going!',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main2' => 'You know the drill! Let\'s celebrate! It looks like more Settlers have joined in the side-festivities. Ramp it up!',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main2_Sub1' => 'As always, the first thing we need is something extraordinary to quench the thirst of our new guests. To keep the celebrations going, your guests need some exquisite drinks. Could you fetch some more?',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main2_Sub10' => 'Oh my, oh my. Would you honestly have forgotten all your other friends? Shame on you! You should go and make amends for forgetting to invite them to these awesome parties!',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main2_Sub2' => 'Your guests are pushing for you to regale them with some of your greatest stories! Go on... they\'re waiting! What do you mean you don\'t remember any? With all the extraordinary stuff you\'ve done over the last few years? Seriously?? Well, maybe you should go and relive a few of your greatest adventures - then I\'m sure you\'ll have some cool things to brag about.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main2_Sub3' => 'The roof is on fire - literally! Some party settlers pushed a cake over that had several candles on it. It\'s OK though, nothing serious happened - but they\'d still like you to extinguish the fire in their throats with some brew.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main2_Sub4' => 'I think you\'d better get some materials in to deal with any repairs. What do you mean why? We\'re celebrating a great anniversary! Something\'s bound to get broken!',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main2_Sub5' => 'Let\'s have some quick fun with our guests!',
