        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main9_Sub7' => 'Every party needs something special to be remembered by. Maybe you can show your guests around some more exotic places?',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main9_Sub8' => 'You have too many friends! The amount of goods they consume is incredible! Not that I should complain... I\'m not the one who has to keep up with the demand, he he.',
        'Birthday2018plusChallenge_Main9_Sub9' => 'Yeah, you heard right! There will be gifts! Awesome, right?! Oh no, ha ha. Not gifts for you - they\'re for your guests! Isn\'t that much better? Instead of just one person getting gifts, now everyone gets one! Yeah, I know - I have great ideas, he he. Wait, you don\'t have anything you could give everyone as a gift? Then you\'d better get going!',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Looped' => 'Whoah, slow down, champ - I\'m starting to run out of rewards for you now, ha ha...
Afraid I\'m all out of the big prizes - but please do keep helping to make our festival as great as possible!
If you donate more than the target of 1,000 balloons, they\'ll still count towards the community goal, but I won\'t be able to count them towards your next round of 1,000 balloons. 
Why? Ah, don\'t worry about the technical details - this event is all about the fun, you know!',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Main' => 'So, here\'s the deal! This festival will be the greatest the world has ever seen! And you can never have enough balloons, oh no!

Everyone will be helping to get things ready - but I\'ve got a special something to reward you for your personal efforts. Be sure to do your best! Tee hee hee!',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Sub1' => 'I\'ll keep track of your efforts! Donate enough balloons, and I\'ll have a surprise for you!
To donate balloons, first open the event tab at your Mayor\'s House. Secondly, select the balloon resource, click on donate and select an amount. That\'s it!',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Sub2' => 'Gather more balloons to get more rewards. Simple, isn\'t it?',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Sub3' => 'Why do we need so many balloons? Have you ever heard someone say "Hey, I think we have enough balloons here?"
Of course not! You can never have enough balloons!',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Sub4' => 'If you bring me this many balloons, I\'ll give you a special reward, fresh from my own collection.
Tee hee hee, there\'s no way you\'ll manage that, though!',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Sub5' => 'Why am I even promising a reward for so many balloons? It\'s got to be impossible to gather that many!
Consider it your very own carrot on a stick! Ha ha ha!',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Sub6' => 'Now we\'re asking for the impossible, aren\'t we? No one\'s ever come close to that many balloons...',
        'Birthday2018plusDonationRewards_Sub7' => 'This has to be a joke, right? There\'s no way you could get hold of that many balloons - so unreal!',
        'Birthday2018plusLevelRequirement16' => 'Sorry, aren\'t you still a little green behind the ears? Even a fool like me can see that!
Shouldn\'t you be putting a bit more effort into your island before you think about visiting a party?',
        'Birthday2018plusLevelRequirement26' => 'Yaaaaaawn! I know you\'re busy with the whole balloon business, but I could really use some action, you know?
Something big must be going on *somewhere*. Not that any news ever reaches us here... Maybe if your settlement was a little bit more... significant?',
        'Birthday2018plusMissions_Main' => 'Can you believe what this report says?! Buildings - nay, entire landscapes - have magically changed their appearance! And now they look as though they were made of children\'s toy blocks!
Wouldn\'t it be hilarious to have buildings like that here on your island? I can just see the look of shock on everyone\'s faces, ha ha ha! Let\'s investigate!',
        'Birthday2018plusMissions_Sub1' => 'Wow, it\'s true! I\'ve just returned from a visit to an affected island, and everything was all funny-looking! I\'ve gotta show you!',
        'Birthday2018plusMissions_Sub2' => 'Ha ha! A sailor told me about another island with those weird buildings on it. 
Let\'s check it out! Go, go, go!',
        'Birthday2018plusPhaseDelay' => 'Whew! That was quite the achievement - and a lot of work, as we\'d expect from such powerful nobles. Still, the first hurdles have been overcome - now you can enjoy your first rewards!
Just remember - the best ones are yet to come, during the second phase of the event. Be sure to keep donating those balloons, as they\'ll all count towards the goal for the second phase!',
        'Birthday2018plusPhaseDelay2' => 'Whew! That was quite the achievement - and a lot of work, as we\'d expect from such powerful nobles. Still, the challenges have been completed, and you\'ve earned yourself some free time. Enjoy the festivities!',
        'Birthday2018plusPhaseOneDonation_Main' => 'Everyone must work together to make this as awesome a celebration as possible! 
We\'ll be counting balloon donations from all around the world, and will keep updating the numbers every few minutes.

As a special incentive, everyone will receive a special reward if you can meet the objective below before the week is out. There\'ll be another reward next week, too - so stay tuned!',
        'Birthday2018plusPhaseThreeDonation_Main' => 'So, you\'re all going to cooperate and keep donating to make this the best festival ever, right? Just like the last two weeks, the worldwide balloon donations total will be tracked below. I\'ll be sure to update the running total every few minutes! Aren\'t I the best? You know the drill. Reach the target in a week, and everyone will get their reward!',
        'Birthday2018plusPhaseTwoDonation_Main' => 'So, you\'re all going to cooperate, and keep donating to make this festival the biggest, brightest, and bestest festival ever, yes?
Just like last week, all world-wide balloon donations will be tracked below. I\'ll be sure to update the running total every few minutes! Aren\'t I the best?

You know the drill. Reach the target in just one week, and everyone will get their reward!',
        'Birthday2018plusTutorial_Main' => 'Oh, hello - when did you get here? We were just about to celebrate this island\'s discovery, with bright balloons and delicious cake!
But hold your horses! If you want to join in, you\'ll need to help with the preparations. Let this party king show you how.',
        'Birthday2018plusTutorial_Sub1' => 'The celebration will be held in the Festival Hall we erected on the small island on that lake of yours. You don\'t mind, do you?
Actually, why don\'t you pay it a visit? You can order your settlers to deliver resources to trade for balloons too.',
        'Birthday2018plusTutorial_Sub2' => 'If we serve cake in the festival hall, everyone will be extra motivated - and that means you\'ll get more balloons in return for your resources!

To make a nice birthday cake, you\'ll need cake dough, and some pretty candles. Yes, the candles are important! 
Unfortunately, the last candle shipment was intercepted by pirates - and they\'ve hidden the "treasure" across your and your neighbours\' islands.',
        'Birthday2018plusTutorial_Sub3' => 'It looks like you\'ll have to trade with your neighbours to get the remaining ingredients. Don\'t worry, though - it looks like they\'re in a similar situation!
When you have enough candles and cake dough, produce the cake in your provision house, and bring it to the Festival Hall. 

And do hurry! I\'m hungry!',
        'Birthday2018plusTutorial_Sub4' => 'Alright - now I\'m both full and rested, let\'s get to the meat of the matter. You\'re collecting all these balloons so we can use them for our party.
You must deliver them from the storage menu of one of your storehouses. Click the balloons to find the option. Ha ha, what does "click" even mean?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main1' => 'Today, someone dropped a mysterious letter on the mayor\'s house\'s doorstep. It reads:

What’s up, buttercup?

My name\'s Dora, but don’t worry – I\'m here to help you. As you might already know, we have something very special coming up. The big bang of birthday parties: The Settlers Online Anniversary Party! You\'d better get used to my little letters now, honey, because every morning I\'ll be dropping one on your doorstep with new instructions for the party. So let’s get to business - get started with the preparations now, will you, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main10' => 'Today’s letter is somehow hard to read. You squint your eyes and are barely able to decipher it:

My dear friend,

Today I have to make a selfish request. I desperately need new paper and nibs to write further letters to you. The utensils I’ve got left are nearly useless.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main10_Sub1' => 'First, let’s provide some new paper for Dora. It\'d be a shame if she stopped writing letters because she hasn\'t got any good paper, don\'t you think?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main10_Sub2' => 'Secondly, Dora needs some new nibs, as her old ones are all pretty much used up.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main10_Sub3' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main10_Sub4' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to business! We should increase our printing type production. Just in case Dora wants to switch to printing her letters in future!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main11' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We still need some cutlery for the great feast that we\'re planning for anniversary day. Let’s see what we can do.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main11_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start work on the new cutlery, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main11_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work. We really need some new cutlery for the anniversary celebration. First, let\'s strengthen our metal production to make sure we’ve got enough materials for it, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main11_Sub3' => 'Now it\'s time to turn the metal into some nice cutlery. Would you be so kind as to send some of the metal over, sweetheart?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main11_Sub4' => 'Oh my, it seems the knives we made just aren\'t sharp enough! Could you provide some razor-sharp blades, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main12' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We totally forgot to prepare some nice, clean dishes for our celebration day feast. Let’s see what we can do about it, OK?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main12_Sub1' => 'First, let’s go and strengthen our bronze production, my dear! I\'m sure this will come handy when we start producing new dishes.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main12_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main12_Sub3' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work. We still need to work on the new dishes for the anniversary party. We could use some bronze, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main12_Sub4' => 'We\'re still missing some napkins. Let’s produce some paper for it.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main13' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We still need some trained personnel to help on celebration day. Things like keeping the barbecue going, serving food and drinks, cleaning up...',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main13_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we set out to find new personnel for our anniversary party, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main13_Sub2' => 'Firstly, let’s try and find some people we can train to help with things, like keeping the barbecue going, serving food and drinks, or cleaning up.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main13_Sub3' => 'Our new staff still need some nice clothes suitable for the occasion. Could I get some gold coins for that, please?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main14' => 'Another letter from Dora:

My dear friend,

Our hostile neighbors seem to seriously envy our anniversary party. They’ve just sent me a letter threatening to kidnap me if I don’t stop helping you with the preparations for the celebration. I admit I\'m quite anxious, but we won’t let them stop us, right, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main14_Sub1' => 'Let’s start by sending some military forces to protect Dora!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main14_Sub2' => 'Wouldn’t it be a good idea to have some secure padlocks for Dora’s house? Let’s produce some iron for that.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main14_Sub3' => 'I\'m sure you did everything exceptionally well! As always, we should make sure we find the right balance between work and pleasure: you\'re now free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main15' => 'What’s up, buttercup?

How about a nice dance performance on celebration day? I think it would be amazing. Let’s prepare the dance floor and hire some cool dancers, sweetheart!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main15_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we set out to organize the dance performance for our anniversary party, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main15_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work on that dance performance for our anniversary party! First, we\'ll need to lay out our finest wood for the dance floor, yes?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main15_Sub3' => 'Let’s make sure we have enough talent on the dance floor. Can you hire some experienced dancers, sweetie?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main15_Sub4' => 'Oh! Our newly hired dancers have reported that the dance floor could really use another round of waxing. Where I come from, we’d always use fish food to give it that extra smoothness. Could you produce some, please?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main16' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

My delicate senses are telling me something\'s not quite right among your settlers. I can feel some weird vibrations... I\'m a bit worried. Maybe we\'ve just been asking for too much with the party preparations? Let’s see what we can do to cheer the population up, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main16_Sub1' => 'Maybe we asked too much from your settlers regarding the party preparations?! We need to raise their spirits! We could try to lighten the mood by providing some nice things from the provision house?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main16_Sub2' => 'Fresh water is always able to clear one’s mind and help you stay positive throughout the day. Let’s provide some water for your afflicted settlers.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main16_Sub3' => 'I\'m sure you did everything exceptionally well! As always, we should make sure we find the right balance between work and pleasure: you\'re free to go out and seek adventure now, lovey! But today, let’s try a co-op adventure to instill a bit of camaraderie in your people, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main17' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We absolutely have to make sure that our anniversary party is a peaceful celebration. There are some things we could do to make sure it all goes off without a hitch, don’t you think, lovey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main17_Sub1' => 'In order to keep the anniversary festivities peaceful, we should get rid of some of our close-quarters combat weapons.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main17_Sub2' => 'I\'m sure you did everything exceptionally well! Like always, work before pleasure: you\'re now free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main17_Sub3' => 'In order to keep the anniversary festivities peaceful, we should also consider disposing of some of our long-range weaponry, alright?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main17_Sub4' => 'Let’s get some units together and give them proper instructions to facilitate our idea of a positive, jovial anniversary celebration among the military, too.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main17_Sub5' => 'If we\'re looking to have a peaceful celebration, what could be more peaceful than the written word? Produce some nibs, so that we can write peaceful anniversary day letters to all our settlers, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main18' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

What do you think about having a parade through the island on celebration day? That would be super nice, wouldn’t it, my dear? Let’s make it happen.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main18_Sub1' => 'First, we need to make sure that no trees will block our procession’s way. Could you remove any trees that might get in the way?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main18_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main18_Sub3' => 'Okay - let\'s get working on our anniversary parade! I really think we should have some impressive horses to be part of it. Can you please bring some along, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main19' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We should make sure our children are well entertained on celebration day. Kids love to scribble and draw, right? Let’s make sure they have plenty of opportunities to do so, honey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main19_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start with our anniversary party preparations, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main19_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work! We should make sure the children are kept entertained throughout celebration day. All kids love to scribble and draw, right? Let’s make sure they have plenty of opportunity to do so, honey! First, let’s produce some paper the little ones can draw on, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main19_Sub3' => 'Now we need some coal for our children to draw with during the festivities. Just in case they get bored or something, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main1_Sub1' => 'What’s a birthday party without proper space to celebrate in!? We need to build some nice and cozy venues for the anniversary event – and therefore we need materials, right? Let’s start with some planks, sweetheart.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main1_Sub2' => 'The interiors would look so much nicer if we used some of our exquisite marble on it, don’t you think?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main1_Sub3' => 'We definitely should balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main1_Sub4' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work! The interiors could use some nice metal, don\'t you think? For stability, and that extra-strong look of course. Oh, the party on anniversary day\'s gonna be great, honey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main1_Sub5' => 'Another thing we\'ll need is some personnel to help with the construction work. They need to be strong and plenty, my dear!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main2' => 'Another letter from Dora has arrived:

What’s up, buttercup?

Today we’re supposed to make the celebration room nice and jovial. Do you think you could help with that, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main20' => 'What’s up, buttercup?

You know we’re only one day away from our big anniversary party, honey? I know, I know! We\'re all very much looking forward to it, but we must be sensible and think about the time after the party as well. While preparing, we\'ve all but exhausted our storage and deposits. With celebration day almost upon us, it’s time to fill up again, don’t you agree?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main20_Sub1' => 'Firstly, let’s make sure our fishing grounds won\'t be depleted during our anniversary preparations. They need to stay rich and healthy!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main20_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main20_Sub3' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to preparing for the time after the party. I think we should do something about our hunting grounds as well. Wild animals are starting to get a little rare, I’m afraid.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main20_Sub4' => 'In the last three weeks, we\'ve produced quite a lot of brew! Actually, I think we produced a bit too much... Let’s turn at least some of it into coins, so that we can purchase some of the goods we\'re still missing, okay lovey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main21' => 'Another letter form Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

You already know, don’t you? Today is celebration day! I have to congratulate you - the preparations went so well, and it all looks incredible! I’m sure the anniversary party will be a huge hit. My part in the event is herewith finished. I wish you the best of luck with all that\'s happening today.

All the best,
Dora

Does that mean she won’t be helping us anymore? Oh, well…',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main21_Sub1' => 'It looks like you\'re going to be on your own managing the celebration day, mayor! And look, over there! We already have a situation that requires your help! The barbecue is so popular, we\'re running out of food already. Quickly! Help provide some more.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main21_Sub2' => 'No, no, no! We\'ve run out of clean dishes! Let’s clean them with lots of water!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main21_Sub3' => 'Hey! Some of your settlers just told me they\'d love to play a game of horseshoes. But they\'re missing one essential item... That\'s right, a horseshoe! Could you make one, please!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main21_Sub4' => 'As a new day begins to dawn, and the settlers enjoy the last bits of the anniversary party, you catch the eye of one of your advisors and say: “Oh, what a wonderful, wonderful celebration that was. I can’t wait for next year’s anniversary! But now, I will go on one last adventure for today, alright, my friend?"',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main2_Sub1' => 'First, we\'ll need some nice new furniture for the celebration room. Would you be so kind as to send some gold coins for that?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main2_Sub2' => 'We definitely should balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main2_Sub3' => 'Oh my, it seems our new furniture still needs to be assembled! Would it be possible for you to provide some tools, sweetie?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main2_Sub4' => 'Oh no, it seems we’re out of bolts! How are we supposed to finish our furniture now? Could you produce some metal for bolts, please?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main3' => 'Another letter from Dora has arrived:

What’s up, buttercup?

The anniversary party’s guests can’t feast on air alone. We should provide some high-quality food for the party, don’t you think, sweetheart?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main3_Sub1' => 'We should provide some high-quality food for the party. First, we should fetch some sausages from your storehouses.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main3_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main3_Sub3' => 'Okay, back to work! We need some bread for our party. Would you be so kind to produce some, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main3_Sub4' => 'Let\'s not forget the fresh drinks for the party. Could you please up your water production, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main4' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

I\'m sure you know by now that many of your settlers regard a decent brew as essential for any party. We have to make sure our production is running as well as it possibly can.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main4_Sub1' => 'As you know, wheat is one of the main ingredients for our renowned brew. Let’s send some of it to Dora so that she can sample its quality.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main4_Sub2' => 'Crystal clear water is very important for a high-quality brew, too. Could you send some of our water to Dora, so she can test its quality, too?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main4_Sub3' => 'Dora approved both the water and the wheat quality. Let’s go ahead and buff your brewery now, shall we?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main4_Sub4' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main4_Sub5' => 'Okay, back to work! It’s time to turn all the ingredients into a delicious brew. Your people will love it, I\'m sure.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main5' => 'Another letter from Dora:

Dear Mayor,

Unfortunately, I have to interrupt the preparations for today. It seems that a hostile nation’s leader on a neighboring island has heard of our party plans for the anniversary and thinks this would be a good opportunity for a surprise attack. You absolutely should not let your guard down, even in times of celebration. I think we should brace for the attack...',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main5_Sub1' => 'We won\'t back down. If we really are going to be attacked, we\'ll be prepared. First, please delegate some military units.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main5_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main5_Sub3' => 'Okay, back to business. It seems we\'re still lacking some of the weapons we\'d need to properly defend ourselves in case of a surprise attack. Could you please produce some, lovey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main6' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

I am very much looking forward to continuing with the preparations for the anniversary party. It\'d be so nice to have a few celebratory statues honoring the anniversary across your island, don’t you think? Please go ahead and provide the necessary materials, my dear!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main6_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start work on our anniversary celebration statues, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main6_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work! It\'d be nice to have a few celebratory statues honoring the anniversary across your island. Please go ahead and provide the necessary materials, my dear! Let’s start with some bronze.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main6_Sub3' => 'Some marble statues would also be very nice for our anniversary party, wouldn\'t they?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main6_Sub4' => 'Make sure we have the necessary gold production to provide some nice badges for the anniversary statues, OK?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main7' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

A wonderful idea came to mind today, sweetheart. Wouldn’t it be amazing to have a tombola on celebration day? I bet it\'d be great. We\'d still need some basic stuff for it though. Let’s see what we can do.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main7_Sub1' => 'First, we\'d need some tombola prizes of course. Would you be so kind as to send one of your explorers on a treasure search for it?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main7_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main7_Sub3' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work. We\'ll need paper to make tickets for the tombola. Could you provide some please, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main8' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

The weather forecast looks very promising for our anniversary party. I think we should prepare a little barbecue for the celebration day, sweetheart.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main8_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start with the barbecue preparations, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main8_Sub2' => 'Okay, now let\'s get to business. First, we should store some coal to make sure we always have enough to keep the fires going, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main8_Sub3' => 'Secondly, let’s get our meat and bread production going. We need something to put on the grill, right?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main8_Sub4' => 'Wouldn’t it be nice to have some fish for that barbecue too, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main9' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

Our economy\'s been suffering a bit from all the preparations... I think we have a few production chans in need of a buff or two. Could you take care of that please, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main9_Sub1' => 'First, let’s produce some buffs we can use to keep our productions going. I\'d recommend a couple of Fish Platters.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main9_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main9_Sub3' => 'Okay, now we can apply some buffs to strengthen our production chains. Let’s start with the brewery, yes?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_26-35_Main9_Sub4' => 'Now go ahead and apply a buff on either a bakery or an improved bakery, okay, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main1' => 'Today, someone dropped a mysterious letter on the mayor\'s house\'s doorstep. It reads:

What’s up, buttercup?

My name\'s Dora, but don’t worry – I\'m here to help you. As you might already know, we have something very special coming up. The big bang of birthday parties: The Settlers Online Anniversary Party! You\'d better get used to my little letters now, honey, because every morning I\'ll be dropping one on your doorstep with new instructions for the party. So let’s get to business - get started with the preparations now, will you, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main10' => 'Today’s letter is somehow hard to read. You squint your eyes and are barely able to decipher it:

My dear friend,

Today I have to make a selfish request. I desperately need new paper and nibs to write further letters to you. The utensils I’ve got left are nearly useless.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main10_Sub1' => 'First, let’s provide some new paper for Dora. It\'d be a shame if she stopped writing letters because she hasn\'t got any good paper, don\'t you think?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main10_Sub2' => 'Secondly, Dora needs some new nibs, as her old ones are all pretty much used up.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main10_Sub3' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main10_Sub4' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to business! We should increase our printing type production. Just in case Dora wants to switch to printing her letters in future!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main11' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We still need some cutlery for the great feast that we\'re planning for anniversary day. Let’s see what we can do.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main11_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start work on the new cutlery, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main11_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work. We really need some new cutlery for the anniversary celebration. First, let\'s strengthen our metal production to make sure we’ve got enough materials for it, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main11_Sub3' => 'Now it\'s time to turn the metal into some nice cutlery. Would you be so kind as to send some of the metal over, sweetheart?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main11_Sub4' => 'Oh my, it seems the knives we made just aren\'t sharp enough! Could you provide some razor-sharp blades, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main12' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We totally forgot to prepare some nice, clean dishes for our celebration day feast. Let’s see what we can do about it, OK?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main12_Sub1' => 'First, let’s go and strengthen our bronze production, my dear! I\'m sure this will come handy when we start producing new dishes.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main12_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main12_Sub3' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work. We still need to work on the new dishes for the anniversary party. We could use some bronze, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main12_Sub4' => 'We\'re still missing some napkins. Let’s produce some paper for it.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main13' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We still need some trained personnel to help on celebration day. Things like keeping the barbecue going, or serving food and drinks, cleaning up...',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main13_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we set out to find new personnel for our anniversary party, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main13_Sub2' => 'Firstly, let’s try and find some people we can train to help with things, like keeping the barbecue going, serving food and drinks, or cleaning up.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main13_Sub3' => 'Our new staff still need some nice clothes suitable for the occasion. Could I get some gold coins for that, please?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main14_Sub1' => 'Let’s start by sending some military forces to protect Dora!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main14_Sub2' => 'Wouldn’t it be a good idea to have some secure padlocks for Dora’s house? Let’s produce some iron for that.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main14_Sub3' => 'I\'m sure you did everything exceptionally well! As always, we should make sure we find the right balance between work and pleasure: you\'re now free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main15' => 'What’s up, buttercup?

How about a nice dance performance on celebration day? I think it would be amazing. Let’s prepare the dance floor and hire some cool dancers, sweetheart!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main15_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we set out to organize the dance performance for our anniversary party, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main15_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work on that dance performance for our anniversary party! First, we\'ll need to lay out our finest wood for the dance floor, yes?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main15_Sub3' => 'Let’s make sure we have enough talent on the dance floor. Can you hire some experienced dancers, sweetie?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main15_Sub4' => 'Oh! Our newly hired dancers have reported that the dance floor could really use another round of waxing. Where I come from, we’d always use fish food to give it that extra smoothness. Could you produce some, please?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main16' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

My delicate senses are telling me something\'s not quite right among your settlers. I can feel some weird vibrations... I\'m a bit worried. Maybe we\'ve just been asking for too much with the party preparations? Let’s see what we can do to cheer the population up, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main16_Sub1' => 'Maybe we asked too much from your settlers regarding the party preparations?! We need to raise their spirits! We could try to lighten the mood by providing some nice things from the provision house?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main16_Sub2' => 'Fresh water is always able to clear one’s mind and help you stay positive throughout the day. Let’s provide some water for your afflicted settlers.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main16_Sub3' => 'I\'m sure you did everything exceptionally well! As always, we should make sure we find the right balance between work and pleasure: you\'re free to go out and seek adventure now, lovey! But today, let’s try a co-op adventure to instill a bit of camaraderie in your people, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main17' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We absolutely have to make sure that our anniversary party is a peaceful celebration. There are some things we could do to make sure it all goes off without a hitch, don’t you think, lovey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main17_Sub1' => 'In order to keep the anniversary festivities peaceful, we should get rid of some of our close-quarters combat weapons.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main17_Sub2' => 'I\'m sure you did everything exceptionally well! Like always, work before pleasure: you\'re now free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main17_Sub3' => 'In order to keep the anniversary festivities peaceful, we should also consider disposing of some of our long-range weaponry, alright?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main17_Sub4' => 'Let’s get some units together and give them proper instructions to facilitate our idea of a positive, jovial anniversary celebration among the military, too.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main17_Sub5' => 'If we\'re looking to have a peaceful celebration, what could be more peaceful than the written word? Produce some nibs, so that we can write peaceful anniversary day letters to all our settlers, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main18' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

What do you think about having a parade through the island on celebration day? That would be super nice, wouldn’t it, my dear? Let’s make it happen.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main18_Sub1' => 'First, we need to make sure that no trees will block our procession’s way. Could you remove any trees that might get in the way?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main18_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main18_Sub3' => 'Okay - let\'s get working on our anniversary parade! I really think we should have some impressive horses to be part of it. Can you please bring some along, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main19' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We should make sure our children are well entertained on celebration day. Kids love to scribble and draw, right? Let’s make sure they have plenty of opportunities to do so, honey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main19_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start with our anniversary party preparations, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main19_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work! We should make sure the children are kept entertained throughout celebration day. All kids love to scribble and draw, right? Let’s make sure they have plenty of opportunity to do so, honey! First, let’s produce some paper the little ones can draw on, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main19_Sub3' => 'Now we need some coal for our children to draw with during the festivities. Just in case they get bored or something, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main1_Sub1' => 'What’s a birthday party without proper space to celebrate in!? We need to build some nice and cozy venues for the anniversary event – and therefore we need materials, right? Let’s start with some planks, sweetheart.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main1_Sub2' => 'The interiors would look so much nicer if we used some of our exquisite marble on it, don’t you think?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main1_Sub3' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main1_Sub4' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work! The interiors could use some nice metal, don\'t you think? For stability, and that extra-strong look of course. Oh, the party on anniversary day\'s gonna be great, honey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main1_Sub5' => 'Another thing we\'ll need is some personnel to help with the construction work. They\'ll need to be strong and plenty, my dear!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main2' => 'Another letter from Dora has arrived:

What’s up, buttercup?

Today we’re supposed to make the celebration room nice and jovial. Do you think you could help with that, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main20' => 'What’s up, buttercup?

You know we’re only one day away from our big anniversary party, honey? I know, I know! We\'re all very much looking forward to it, but we must be sensible and think about the time after the party as well. While preparing, we\'ve all but exhausted our storage and deposits. With celebration day almost upon us, it’s time to fill up again, don’t you agree?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main20_Sub1' => 'Firstly, let’s make sure our fishing grounds won\'t be depleted during our anniversary preparations. They need to stay rich and healthy!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main20_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main20_Sub3' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to preparing for the time after the party. I think we should do something about our hunting grounds as well. Wild animals are starting to get a little rare, I’m afraid.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main20_Sub4' => 'In the last three weeks, we\'ve produced quite a lot of brew! Actually, I think we produced a bit too much... Let’s turn at least some of it into coins, so that we can purchase some of the goods we\'re still missing, okay lovey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main21' => 'Another letter form Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

You already know, don’t you? Today is celebration day! I have to congratulate you - the preparations went so well, and it all looks incredible! I’m sure the anniversary party will be a huge hit. My part in the event is herewith finished. I wish you the best of luck with all that\'s happening today.

All the best,
Dora

Does that mean she won’t be helping us anymore? Oh, well…',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main21_Sub1' => 'It looks like you\'re going to be on your own managing the celebration day, mayor! And look, over there! We already have a situation that requires your help! The barbecue is so popular, we\'re running out of food already. Quickly! Help provide some more.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main21_Sub2' => 'No no no! We got no clean dishes anymore. Let’s clean them with lots of water!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main21_Sub3' => 'Hey! Some of your settlers just told me they\'d love to play a game of horseshoes. But they\'re missing one essential item... That\'s right, a horseshoe! Could you make one, please!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main21_Sub4' => 'As a new day begins to dawn, and the settlers enjoy the last bits of the anniversary party, you catch the eye of one of your advisors and say: “Oh, what a wonderful, wonderful celebration that was. I can’t wait for next year’s anniversary! But now, I will go on one last adventure for today, alright, my friend?"',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main2_Sub1' => 'First, we\'ll need some nice new furniture for the celebration room. Would you be so kind as to send some gold coins for that?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main2_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main2_Sub3' => 'Oh my, it seems our new furniture still needs to be assembled! Would it be possible for you to provide some tools, sweetie?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main2_Sub4' => 'Oh no, it seems we’re out of bolts! How are we supposed to finish our furniture now? Could you produce some metal for bolts, please?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main3' => 'Another letter from Dora has arrived:

What’s up, buttercup?

The anniversary party’s guests can’t feast on air alone. We should provide some high-quality food for the party, don’t you think, sweetheart?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main3_Sub1' => 'We should provide some high-quality food for the party. First, we should fetch some sausages from your storehouses.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main3_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main3_Sub3' => 'Okay, back to work! We need some bread for our party. Would you be so kind as to produce some, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main3_Sub4' => 'Let\'s not forget the fresh drinks for the party. Could you please up your water production, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main4' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

I\'m sure you know by now that many of your settlers regard a decent brew as essential for any party. We have to make sure our production is running as well as it possibly can.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main4_Sub1' => 'As you know, wheat is one of the main ingredients for our renowned brew. Let’s send some of it to Dora so that she can sample its quality.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main4_Sub2' => 'Crystal clear water is very important for a high-quality brew, too. Could you send some of our water to Dora, so she can test its quality, too?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main4_Sub3' => 'Dora approved both the water and the wheat quality. Let’s go ahead and buff your brewery now, shall we?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main4_Sub4' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main4_Sub5' => 'Okay, back to work! It’s time to turn all the ingredients into a delicious brew. Your people will love it, I\'m sure.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main5' => 'Another letter from Dora:

Dear Mayor,

Unfortunately, I have to interrupt the preparations for today. It seems that a hostile nation’s leader on a neighboring island has heard of our party plans for the anniversary and thinks this would be a good opportunity for a surprise attack. You absolutely should not let your guard down, even in times of celebration. I think we should brace for the attack...',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main5_Sub1' => 'We won\'t back down. If we really are going to be attacked, we\'ll be prepared. First, please delegate some military units.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main5_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main5_Sub3' => 'Okay, back to business. It seems we\'re still lacking some of the weapons we\'d need to properly defend ourselves in case of a surprise attack. Could you please produce some, lovey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main6' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

I am very much looking forward to continuing with the preparations for the anniversary party. It\'d be so nice to have a few celebratory statues honoring the anniversary across your island, don’t you think? Please go ahead and provide the necessary materials, my dear!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main6_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start work on our anniversary celebration statues, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main6_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work! It\'d be nice to have a few celebratory statues honoring the anniversary across your island. Please go ahead and provide the necessary materials, my dear! Let’s start with some bronze.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main6_Sub3' => 'Some marble statues would also be very nice for our anniversary party, wouldn\'t they?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main6_Sub4' => 'Make sure we have the necessary gold production to provide some nice badges for the anniversary statues, OK?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main7' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

A wonderful idea came to mind today, sweetheart. Wouldn’t it be amazing to have a tombola on celebration day? I bet it\'d be great. We\'d still need some basic stuff for it though. Let’s see what we can do.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main7_Sub1' => 'First, we\'d need some tombola prizes of course. Would you be so kind as to send one of your explorers on a treasure search for it?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main7_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main7_Sub3' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work. We\'ll need paper to make tickets for the tombola. Could you provide some please, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main8' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

The weather forecast looks very promising for our anniversary party. I think we should prepare a little barbecue for the celebration day, sweetheart.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main8_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start with the barbecue preparations, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main8_Sub2' => 'Okay, now let\'s get to business. First, we should store some coal to make sure we always have enough to keep the fires going, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main8_Sub3' => 'Secondly, let’s get our meat and bread production going. We need something to put on the grill, right?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main8_Sub4' => 'Wouldn’t it be nice to have some fish for that barbecue too, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main9' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

Our economy\'s been suffering a bit from all the preparations... I think we have a few production chans in need of a buff or two. Could you take care of that please, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main9_Sub1' => 'First, let’s produce some buffs we can use to keep our productions going. I\'d recommend a couple of Fish Platters.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main9_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main9_Sub3' => 'Okay, now we can apply some buffs to strengthen our production chains. Let’s begin with the brewery, yes?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-50_Main9_Sub4' => 'Now go ahead and apply a buff on either a bakery or an improved bakery, okay, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_36-51_Main14' => 'Another letter from Dora:

My dear friend,

Our hostile neighbors seem to seriously envy our anniversary party. They’ve just sent me a letter threatening to kidnap me if I don’t stop helping you with the preparations for the celebration. I admit I\'m quite anxious, but we won’t let them stop us, right, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main1' => 'Today, someone dropped a mysterious letter on the mayor\'s house\'s doorstep. It reads:

What’s up, buttercup?

My name\'s Dora, but don’t worry – I\'m here to help you. As you might already know, we have something very special coming up. The big bang of birthday parties: The Settlers Online Anniversary Party! You\'d better get used to my little letters now, honey, because every morning I\'ll be dropping one on your doorstep with new instructions for the party. So let’s get to business - get started with the preparations now, will you, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main10' => 'Today’s letter is somehow hard to read. You squint your eyes and are barely able to decipher it:

My dear friend,

Today I have to make a selfish request. I desperately need new paper and nibs to write further letters to you. The utensils I’ve got left are nearly useless.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main10_Sub1' => 'First, let’s provide some new paper for Dora. It\'d be a shame if she stopped writing letters because she hasn\'t got any good paper, don\'t you think?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main10_Sub2' => 'Secondly, Dora needs some new nibs, as her old ones are all pretty much used up.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main10_Sub3' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main10_Sub4' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to business! We should increase our printing type production. Just in case Dora wants to switch to printing her letters in future!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main11' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We still need some cutlery for the great feast that we\'re planning for anniversary day. Let’s see what we can do.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main11_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start work on the new cutlery, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main11_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work. We really need some new cutlery for the anniversary celebration. First, let\'s strengthen our metal production to make sure we’ve got enough materials for it, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main11_Sub3' => 'Now it\'s time to turn the metal into some nice cutlery. Would you be so kind as to send some of the metal over, sweetheart?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main11_Sub4' => 'Oh my, it seems the knives we made just aren\'t sharp enough! Could you provide some razor-sharp blades, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main12' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We totally forgot to prepare some nice, clean dishes for our celebration day feast. Let’s see what we can do about it, OK?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main12_Sub1' => 'First, let’s go and strengthen our bronze production, my dear! I\'m sure this will come handy when we start producing new dishes.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main12_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main12_Sub3' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work. We still need to work on the new dishes for the anniversary party. We could use some bronze, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main12_Sub4' => 'We\'re still missing some napkins. Let’s produce some paper for it.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main13' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We still need some trained personnel to help on celebration day. Things like keeping the barbecue going, or serving food and drinks, cleaning up...',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main13_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we set out to find new personnel for our anniversary party, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main13_Sub2' => 'Firstly, let’s try and find some people we can train to help with things, like keeping the barbecue going, serving food and drinks, or cleaning up.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main13_Sub3' => 'Our new staff still need some nice clothes suitable for the occasion. Could I get some gold coins for that, please?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main14' => 'Another letter from Dora:

My dear friend,

Our hostile neighbors seem to seriously envy our anniversary party. They’ve just sent me a letter threatening to kidnap me if I don’t stop helping you with the preparations for the celebration. I admit I\'m quite anxious, but we won’t let them stop us, right, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main14_Sub1' => 'Let’s start by sending some military forces to protect Dora!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main14_Sub2' => 'Wouldn’t it be a good idea to have some secure padlocks for Dora’s house? Let’s produce some iron for that.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main14_Sub3' => 'I\'m sure you did everything exceptionally well! As always, we should make sure we find the right balance between work and pleasure: you\'re now free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main15' => 'What’s up, buttercup?

How about a nice dance performance on celebration day? I think it would be amazing. Let’s prepare the dance floor and hire some cool dancers, sweetheart!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main15_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we set out to organize the dance performance for our anniversary party, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main15_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work on that dance performance for our anniversary party! First, we\'ll need to lay out our finest wood for the dance floor, yes?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main15_Sub3' => 'Let’s make sure we have enough talent on the dance floor. Can you hire some experienced dancers, sweetie?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main15_Sub4' => 'Oh! Our newly hired dancers have reported that the dance floor could really use another round of waxing. Where I come from, we’d always use fish food to give it that extra smoothness. Could you produce some, please?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main16' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

My delicate senses are telling me something\'s not quite right among your settlers. I can feel some weird vibrations... I\'m a bit worried. Maybe we\'ve just been asking for too much with the party preparations? Let’s see what we can do to cheer the population up, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main16_Sub1' => 'Maybe we asked too much from your settlers regarding the party preparations?! We need to raise their spirits! We could try to lighten the mood by providing some nice things from the provision house?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main16_Sub2' => 'Fresh water is always able to clear one’s mind and help you stay positive throughout the day. Let’s provide some water for your afflicted settlers.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main16_Sub3' => 'I\'m sure you did everything exceptionally well! As always, we should make sure we find the right balance between work and pleasure: you\'re free to go out and seek adventure now, lovey! But today, let’s try a co-op adventure to instill a bit of camaraderie in your people, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main17' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We absolutely have to make sure that our anniversary party is a peaceful celebration. There are some things we could do to make sure it all goes off without a hitch, don’t you think, lovey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main17_Sub1' => 'In order to keep the anniversary festivities peaceful, we should get rid of some of our close-quarters combat weapons.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main17_Sub2' => 'I\'m sure you did everything exceptionally well! Like always, work before pleasure: you\'re now free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main17_Sub3' => 'In order to keep the anniversary festivities peaceful, we should also consider disposing of some of our long-range weaponry, alright?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main17_Sub4' => 'Let’s get some units together and give them proper instructions to facilitate our idea of a positive, jovial anniversary celebration among the military, too.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main17_Sub5' => 'If we\'re looking to have a peaceful celebration, what could be more peaceful than the written word? Produce some nibs, so that we can write peaceful anniversary day letters to all our settlers, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main18' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

What do you think about having a parade through the island on celebration day? That would be super nice, wouldn’t it, my dear? Let’s make it happen.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main18_Sub1' => 'First, we need to make sure that no trees will block our procession’s way. Could you remove any trees that might get in the way?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main18_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main18_Sub3' => 'Okay - let\'s get working on our anniversary parade! I really think we should have some impressive horses to be part of it. Can you please bring some along, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main19' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We should make sure our children are well entertained on celebration day. Kids love to scribble and draw, right? Let’s make sure they have plenty of opportunities to do so, honey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main19_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start with our anniversary party preparations, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main19_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work! We should make sure the children are kept entertained throughout celebration day. All kids love to scribble and draw, right? Let’s make sure they have plenty of opportunity to do so, honey! First, let’s produce some paper the little ones can draw on, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main19_Sub3' => 'Now we need some coal for our children to draw with during the festivities. Just in case they get bored or something, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main1_Sub1' => 'What’s a birthday party without proper space to celebrate in!? We need to build some nice and cozy venues for the anniversary event – and therefore we need materials, right? Let’s start with some planks, sweetheart.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main1_Sub2' => 'The interiors would look so much nicer if we used some of our exquisite marble on it, don’t you think?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main1_Sub3' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main1_Sub4' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work! The interiors could use some nice metal, don\'t you think? For stability, and that extra-strong look of course. Oh, the party on anniversary day\'s gonna be great, honey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main1_Sub5' => 'Another thing we\'ll need is some personnel to help with the construction work. They\'ll need to be strong and plenty, my dear!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main2' => 'Another letter from Dora has arrived:

What’s up, buttercup?

Today we’re supposed to make the celebration room nice and jovial. Do you think you could help with that, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main20' => 'What’s up, buttercup?

You know we’re only one day away from our big anniversary party, honey? I know, I know! We\'re all very much looking forward to it, but we must be sensible and think about the time after the party as well. While preparing, we\'ve all but exhausted our storage and deposits. With celebration day almost upon us, it’s time to fill up again, don’t you agree?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main20_Sub1' => 'Firstly, let’s make sure our fishing grounds won\'t be depleted during our anniversary preparations. They need to stay rich and healthy!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main20_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main20_Sub3' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to preparing for the time after the party. I think we should do something about our hunting grounds as well. Wild animals are starting to get a little rare, I’m afraid.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main20_Sub4' => 'In the last three weeks, we\'ve produced quite a lot of brew! Actually, I think we produced a bit too much... Let’s turn at least some of it into coins, so that we can purchase some of the goods we\'re still missing, okay lovey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main21' => 'Another letter form Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

You already know, don’t you? Today is celebration day! I have to congratulate you - the preparations went so well, and it all looks incredible! I’m sure the anniversary party will be a huge hit. My part in the event is herewith finished. I wish you the best of luck with all that\'s happening today.

All the best,
Dora

Does that mean she won’t be helping us anymore? Oh, well…',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main21_Sub1' => 'It looks like you\'re going to be on your own managing the celebration day, mayor! And look, over there! We already have a situation that requires your help! The barbecue is so popular, we\'re running out of food already. Quickly! Help provide some more.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main21_Sub2' => 'No no no! We got no clean dishes anymore. Let’s clean them with lots of water!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main21_Sub3' => 'Hey! Some of your settlers just told me they\'d love to play a game of horseshoes. But they\'re missing one essential item... That\'s right, a horseshoe! Could you make one, please!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main21_Sub4' => 'As a new day begins to dawn, and the settlers enjoy the last bits of the anniversary party, you catch the eye of one of your advisors and say: “Oh, what a wonderful, wonderful celebration that was. I can’t wait for next year’s anniversary! But now, I will go on one last adventure for today, alright, my friend?"',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main2_Sub1' => 'First, we\'ll need some nice new furniture for the celebration room. Would you be so kind as to send some gold coins for that?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main2_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main2_Sub3' => 'Oh my, it seems our new furniture still needs to be assembled! Would it be possible for you to provide some tools, sweetie?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main2_Sub4' => 'Oh no, it seems we’re out of bolts! How are we supposed to finish our furniture now? Could you produce some metal for bolts, please?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main3' => 'Another letter from Dora has arrived:

What’s up, buttercup?

The anniversary party’s guests can’t feast on air alone. We should provide some high-quality food for the party, don’t you think, sweetheart?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main3_Sub1' => 'We should provide some high-quality food for the party. First, we should fetch some sausages from your storehouses.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main3_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main3_Sub3' => 'Okay, back to work! We need some bread for our party. Would you be so kind to produce some, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main3_Sub4' => 'Let\'s not forget the fresh drinks for the party. Could you please up your water production, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main4' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

I\'m sure you know by now that many of your settlers regard a decent brew as essential for any party. We have to make sure our production is running as well as it possibly can.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main4_Sub1' => 'As you know, wheat is one of the main ingredients for our renowned brew. Let’s send some of it to Dora so that she can sample its quality.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main4_Sub2' => 'Crystal clear water is very important for a high-quality brew, too. Could you send some of our water to Dora, so she can test its quality, too?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main4_Sub3' => 'Dora approved both the water and the wheat quality. Let’s go ahead and buff your brewery now, shall we?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main4_Sub4' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main4_Sub5' => 'Okay, back to work! It’s time to turn all the ingredients into a delicious brew. Your people will love it, I\'m sure.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main5' => 'Another letter from Dora:

Dear Mayor,

Unfortunately, I have to interrupt the preparations for today. It seems that a hostile nation’s leader on a neighboring island has heard of our party plans for the anniversary and thinks this would be a good opportunity for a surprise attack. You absolutely should not let your guard down, even in times of celebration. I think we should brace for the attack...',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main5_Sub1' => 'We won\'t back down. If we really are going to be attacked, we\'ll be prepared. First, please delegate some military units.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main5_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main5_Sub3' => 'Okay, back to business. It seems we\'re still lacking some of the weapons we\'d need to properly defend ourselves in case of a surprise attack. Could you please produce some, lovey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main6' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

I am very much looking forward to continuing with the preparations for the anniversary party. It\'d be so nice to have a few celebratory statues honoring the anniversary across your island, don’t you think? Please go ahead and provide the necessary materials, my dear!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main6_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start work on our anniversary celebration statues, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main6_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work! It\'d be nice to have a few celebratory statues honoring the anniversary across your island. Please go ahead and provide the necessary materials, my dear! Let’s start with some bronze.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main6_Sub3' => 'Some marble statues would also be very nice for our anniversary party, wouldn\'t they?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main6_Sub4' => 'Make sure we have the necessary gold production to provide some nice badges for the anniversary statues, OK?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main7' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

A wonderful idea came to mind today, sweetheart. Wouldn’t it be amazing to have a tombola on celebration day? I bet it\'d be great. We\'d still need some basic stuff for it though. Let’s see what we can do.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main7_Sub1' => 'First, we\'d need some tombola prizes of course. Would you be so kind as to send one of your explorers on a treasure search for it?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main7_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main7_Sub3' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work. We\'ll need paper to make tickets for the tombola. Could you provide some please, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main8' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

The weather forecast looks very promising for our anniversary party. I think we should prepare a little barbecue for the celebration day, sweetheart.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main8_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start with the barbecue preparations, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main8_Sub2' => 'Okay, now let\'s get to business. First, we should store some coal to make sure we always have enough to keep the fires going, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main8_Sub3' => 'Secondly, let’s get our meat and bread production going. We need something to put on the grill, right?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main8_Sub4' => 'Wouldn’t it be nice to have some fish for that barbecue too, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main9' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

Our economy\'s been suffering a bit from all the preparations... I think we have a few production chans in need of a buff or two. Could you take care of that please, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main9_Sub1' => 'First, let’s produce some buffs we can use to keep our productions going. I\'d recommend a couple of Fish Platters.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main9_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main9_Sub3' => 'Okay, now we can apply some buffs to strengthen our production chains. Let’s start with the brewery, yes?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_51-61_Main9_Sub4' => 'Now go ahead and apply a buff on either a bakery or an improved bakery, okay, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main1' => 'Today, someone dropped a mysterious letter on the mayor\'s house\'s doorstep. It reads:

What’s up, buttercup?

My name\'s Dora, but don’t worry – I\'m here to help you. As you might already know, we have something very special coming up. The big bang of birthday parties: The Settlers Online Anniversary Party! You\'d better get used to my little letters now, honey, because every morning I\'ll be dropping one on your doorstep with new instructions for the party. So let’s get to business - get started with the preparations now, will you, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main10' => 'Today’s letter is somehow hard to read. You squint your eyes and are barely able to decipher it:

My dear friend,

Today I have to make a selfish request. I desperately need new paper and nibs to write further letters to you. The utensils I’ve got left are nearly useless.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main10_Sub1' => 'First, let’s provide some new paper for Dora. It\'d be a shame if she stopped writing letters because she hasn\'t got any good paper, don\'t you think?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main10_Sub2' => 'Secondly, Dora needs some new nibs, as her old ones are all pretty much used up.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main10_Sub3' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main10_Sub4' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to business! We should increase our printing type production. Just in case Dora wants to switch to printing her letters in future!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main11' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We still need some cutlery for the great feast that we\'re planning for anniversary day. Let’s see what we can do.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main11_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start work on the new cutlery, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main11_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work. We really need some new cutlery for the anniversary celebration. First, let\'s strengthen our metal production to make sure we’ve got enough materials for it, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main11_Sub3' => 'Now it\'s time to turn the metal into some nice cutlery. Would you be so kind as to send some of the metal over, sweetheart?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main11_Sub4' => 'Oh my, it seems the knives we made just aren\'t sharp enough! Could you provide some razor-sharp blades, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main12' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We totally forgot to prepare some nice, clean dishes for our celebration day feast. Let’s see what we can do about it, OK?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main12_Sub1' => 'First, let’s go and strengthen our bronze production, my dear! I\'m sure this will come handy when we start producing new dishes.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main12_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main12_Sub3' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work. We still need to work on the new dishes for the anniversary party. We could use some bronze, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main12_Sub4' => 'We\'re still missing some napkins. Let’s produce some paper for it.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main13' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We still need some trained personnel to help on celebration day. Things like keeping the barbecue going, or serving food and drinks, cleaning up...',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main13_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we set out to find new personnel for our anniversary party, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main13_Sub2' => 'Firstly, let’s try and find some people we can train to help with things, like keeping the barbecue going, serving food and drinks, or cleaning up.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main13_Sub3' => 'Our new staff still need some nice clothes suitable for the occasion. Could I get some gold coins for that, please?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main14' => 'Another letter from Dora:

My dear friend,

Our hostile neighbors seem to seriously envy our anniversary party. They’ve just sent me a letter threatening to kidnap me if I don’t stop helping you with the preparations for the celebration. I admit I\'m quite anxious, but we won’t let them stop us, right, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main14_Sub1' => 'Let’s start by sending some military forces to protect Dora!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main14_Sub2' => 'Wouldn’t it be a good idea to have some secure padlocks for Dora’s house? Let’s produce some iron for that.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main14_Sub3' => 'I\'m sure you did everything exceptionally well! As always, we should make sure we find the right balance between work and pleasure: you\'re now free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main15' => 'What’s up, buttercup?

How about a nice dance performance on celebration day? I think it would be amazing. Let’s prepare the dance floor and hire some cool dancers, sweetheart!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main15_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we set out to organize the dance performance for our anniversary party, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main15_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work on that dance performance for our anniversary party! First, we\'ll need to lay out our finest wood for the dance floor, yes?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main15_Sub3' => 'Let’s make sure we have enough talent on the dance floor. Can you hire some experienced dancers, sweetie?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main15_Sub4' => 'Oh! Our newly hired dancers have reported that the dance floor could really use another round of waxing. Where I come from, we’d always use fish food to give it that extra smoothness. Could you produce some, please?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main16' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

My delicate senses are telling me something\'s not quite right among your settlers. I can feel some weird vibrations... I\'m a bit worried. Maybe we\'ve just been asking for too much with the party preparations? Let’s see what we can do to cheer the population up, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main16_Sub1' => 'Maybe we asked too much from your settlers regarding the party preparations?! We need to raise their spirits! We could try to lighten the mood by providing some nice things from the provision house?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main16_Sub2' => 'Fresh water is always able to clear one’s mind and help you stay positive throughout the day. Let’s provide some water for your afflicted settlers.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main16_Sub3' => 'I\'m sure you did everything exceptionally well! As always, we should make sure we find the right balance between work and pleasure: you\'re free to go out and seek adventure now, lovey! But today, let’s try a co-op adventure to instill a bit of camaraderie in your people, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main17' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We absolutely have to make sure that our anniversary party is a peaceful celebration. There are some things we could do to make sure it all goes off without a hitch, don’t you think, lovey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main17_Sub1' => 'In order to keep the anniversary festivities peaceful, we should get rid of some of our close-quarters combat weapons.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main17_Sub2' => 'I\'m sure you did everything exceptionally well! Like always, work before pleasure: you\'re now free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main17_Sub3' => 'In order to keep the anniversary festivities peaceful, we should also consider disposing of some of our long-range weaponry, alright?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main17_Sub4' => 'Let’s get some units together and give them proper instructions to facilitate our idea of a positive, jovial anniversary celebration among the military, too.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main17_Sub5' => 'If we\'re looking to have a peaceful celebration, what could be more peaceful than the written word? Produce some nibs, so that we can write peaceful anniversary day letters to all our settlers, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main18' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

What do you think about having a parade through the island on celebration day? That would be super nice, wouldn’t it, my dear? Let’s make it happen.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main18_Sub1' => 'First, we need to make sure that no trees will block our procession’s way. Could you remove any trees that might get in the way?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main18_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main18_Sub3' => 'Okay - let\'s get working on our anniversary parade! I really think we should have some impressive horses to be part of it. Can you please bring some along, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main19' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

We should make sure our children are well entertained on celebration day. Kids love to scribble and draw, right? Let’s make sure they have plenty of opportunities to do so, honey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main19_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start with our anniversary party preparations, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main19_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work! We should make sure the children are kept entertained throughout celebration day. All kids love to scribble and draw, right? Let’s make sure they have plenty of opportunity to do so, honey! First, let’s produce some paper the little ones can draw on, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main19_Sub3' => 'Now we need some coal for our children to draw with during the festivities. Just in case they get bored or something, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main1_Sub1' => 'What’s a birthday party without proper space to celebrate in!? We need to build some nice and cozy venues for the anniversary event – and therefore we need materials, right? Let’s start with some planks, sweetheart.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main1_Sub2' => 'The interiors would look so much nicer if we used some of our exquisite marble on it, don’t you think?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main1_Sub3' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main1_Sub4' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work! The interiors could use some nice metal, don\'t you think? For stability, and that extra-strong look of course. Oh, the party on anniversary day\'s gonna be great, honey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main1_Sub5' => 'Another thing we\'ll need is some personnel to help with the construction work. They\'ll need to be strong and plenty, my dear!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main2' => 'Another letter from Dora has arrived:

What’s up, buttercup?

Today we’re supposed to make the celebration room nice and jovial. Do you think you could help with that, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main20' => 'What’s up, buttercup?

You know we’re only one day away from our big anniversary party, honey? I know, I know! We\'re all very much looking forward to it, but we must be sensible and think about the time after the party as well. While preparing, we\'ve all but exhausted our storage and deposits. With celebration day almost upon us, it’s time to fill up again, don’t you agree?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main20_Sub1' => 'Firstly, let’s make sure our fishing grounds won\'t be depleted during our anniversary preparations. They need to stay rich and healthy!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main20_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main20_Sub3' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to preparing for the time after the party. I think we should do something about our hunting grounds as well. Wild animals are starting to get a little rare, I’m afraid.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main20_Sub4' => 'In the last three weeks, we\'ve produced quite a lot of brew! Actually, I think we produced a bit too much... Let’s turn at least some of it into coins, so that we can purchase some of the goods we\'re still missing, okay lovey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main21' => 'Another letter form Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

You already know, don’t you? Today is celebration day! I have to congratulate you - the preparations went so well, and it all looks incredible! I’m sure the anniversary party will be a huge hit. My part in the event is herewith finished. I wish you the best of luck with all that\'s happening today.

All the best,
Dora

Does that mean she won’t be helping us anymore? Oh, well…',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main21_Sub1' => 'It looks like you\'re going to be on your own managing the celebration day, mayor! And look, over there! We already have a situation that requires your help! The barbecue is so popular, we\'re running out of food already. Quickly! Help provide some more.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main21_Sub2' => 'No no no! We got no clean dishes anymore. Let’s clean them with lots of water!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main21_Sub3' => 'Hey! Some of your settlers just told me they\'d love to play a game of horseshoes. But they\'re missing one essential item... That\'s right, a horseshoe! Could you make one, please!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main21_Sub4' => 'As a new day begins to dawn, and the settlers enjoy the last bits of the anniversary party, you catch the eye of one of your advisors and say: “Oh, what a wonderful, wonderful celebration that was. I can’t wait for next year’s anniversary! But now, I will go on one last adventure for today, alright, my friend?"',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main2_Sub1' => 'First, we\'ll need some nice new furniture for the celebration room. Would you be so kind as to send some gold coins for that?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main2_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main2_Sub3' => 'Oh my, it seems our new furniture still needs to be assembled! Would it be possible for you to provide some tools, sweetie?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main2_Sub4' => 'Oh no, it seems we’re out of bolts! How are we supposed to finish our furniture now? Could you produce some metal for bolts, please?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main3' => 'Another letter from Dora has arrived:

What’s up, buttercup?

The anniversary party’s guests can’t feast on air alone. We should provide some high-quality food for the party, don’t you think, sweetheart?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main3_Sub1' => 'We should provide some high-quality food for the party. First, we should fetch some sausages from your storehouses.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main3_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main3_Sub3' => 'Okay, back to work! We need some bread for our party. Would you be so kind to produce some, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main3_Sub4' => 'Let\'s not forget the fresh drinks for the party. Could you please up your water production, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main4' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

I\'m sure you know by now that many of your settlers regard a decent brew as essential for any party. We have to make sure our production is running as well as it possibly can.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main4_Sub1' => 'As you know, wheat is one of the main ingredients for our renowned brew. Let’s send some of it to Dora so that she can sample its quality.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main4_Sub2' => 'Crystal clear water is very important for a high-quality brew, too. Could you send some of our water to Dora, so she can test its quality, too?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main4_Sub3' => 'Dora approved both the water and the wheat quality. Let’s go ahead and buff your brewery now, shall we?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main4_Sub4' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main4_Sub5' => 'Okay, back to work! It’s time to turn all the ingredients into a delicious brew. Your people will love it, I\'m sure.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main5' => 'Another letter from Dora:

Dear Mayor,

Unfortunately, I have to interrupt the preparations for today. It seems that a hostile nation’s leader on a neighboring island has heard of our party plans for the anniversary and thinks this would be a good opportunity for a surprise attack. You absolutely should not let your guard down, even in times of celebration. I think we should brace for the attack...',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main5_Sub1' => 'We won\'t back down. If we really are going to be attacked, we\'ll be prepared. First, please delegate some military units.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main5_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main5_Sub3' => 'Okay, back to business. It seems we\'re still lacking some of the weapons we\'d need to properly defend ourselves in case of a surprise attack. Could you please produce some, lovey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main6' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

I am very much looking forward to continuing with the preparations for the anniversary party. It\'d be so nice to have a few celebratory statues honoring the anniversary across your island, don’t you think? Please go ahead and provide the necessary materials, my dear!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main6_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start work on our anniversary celebration statues, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main6_Sub2' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work! It\'d be nice to have a few celebratory statues honoring the anniversary across your island. Please go ahead and provide the necessary materials, my dear! Let’s start with some bronze.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main6_Sub3' => 'Some marble statues would also be very nice for our anniversary party, wouldn\'t they?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main6_Sub4' => 'Make sure we have the necessary gold production to provide some nice badges for the anniversary statues, OK?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main7' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

A wonderful idea came to mind today, sweetheart. Wouldn’t it be amazing to have a tombola on celebration day? I bet it\'d be great. We\'d still need some basic stuff for it though. Let’s see what we can do.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main7_Sub1' => 'First, we\'d need some tombola prizes of course. Would you be so kind as to send one of your explorers on a treasure search for it?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main7_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main7_Sub3' => 'Okay, let\'s get back to work. We\'ll need paper to make tickets for the tombola. Could you provide some please, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main8' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

The weather forecast looks very promising for our anniversary party. I think we should prepare a little barbecue for the celebration day, sweetheart.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main8_Sub1' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: before we start with the barbecue preparations, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main8_Sub2' => 'Okay, now let\'s get to business. First, we should store some coal to make sure we always have enough to keep the fires going, okay?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main8_Sub3' => 'Secondly, let’s get our meat and bread production going. We need something to put on the grill, right?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main8_Sub4' => 'Wouldn’t it be nice to have some fish for that barbecue too, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main9' => 'Another letter from Dora:

What’s up, buttercup?

Our economy\'s been suffering a bit from all the preparations... I think we have a few production chans in need of a buff or two. Could you take care of that please, my dear?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main9_Sub1' => 'First, let’s produce some buffs we can use to keep our productions going. I\'d recommend a couple of Fish Platters.',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main9_Sub2' => 'We definitely need to balance work and pleasure: for now, you\'re free to go out and seek adventure, lovey!',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main9_Sub3' => 'Okay, now we can apply some buffs to strengthen our production chains. Let’s begin with the brewery, yes?',
        'Birthday2018plus_Infrastructure_62-80_Main9_Sub4' => 'Now go ahead and apply a buff on either a bakery or an improved bakery, okay, honey?',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_Following_Main' => 'Years have passed since Octavianus sailed west in search of the Roman homeland. Though his expedition vanished, scattered clues have begun to surface. I need your help to retrace his journey and uncover the path he took across the sea.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_Following_Sub1' => 'A weathered letter bearing Octavianus\'s seal has been discovered in an old merchant\'s storehouse. Restore what remains of its contents; it may reveal where the expedition first sailed.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_Following_Sub2' => 'No expedition can survive without supplies. Recreate the provisions listed in Octavianus\'s records to better understand how his fleet prepared for the journey ahead.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_Following_Sub3' => 'Explorers have reported the remains of an abandoned Roman camp. Search the area carefully; even the smallest trace could reveal where the expedition went next.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_Following_Sub4' => 'An old lighthouse once guided ships through dangerous waters, but it now lies in ruins. Restore it and search for anything the expedition may have left behind.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_Following_Sub5' => 'The fleet\'s navigator vanished from the records shortly after departure. Recover his notes – they may explain how the expedition crossed the unknown seas.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_Hub' => 'Years ago, Octavianus sailed westward in search of his lost homeland. His fleet vanished beyond the horizon. Recently, strange reports have surfaced – fragments of maps, Roman relics, and tales of survivors. Help his wife, Tinania, to uncover the fate of his expedition!',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_Legacy_Main' => 'The search is nearly over. Ahead lies the answer I have sought for so many years – not only the fate of my husband, but the legacy he left behind.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_Legacy_Sub1' => 'Ancient buildings resemble the architecture of Rome itself. Restore their splendour and search for signs that the expedition finally reached its long-awaited destination.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_Legacy_Sub2' => 'A thriving colony has been discovered, founded by survivors of the expedition. Strengthen your own settlement to honour those who carved out a new home so far from Rome.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_Legacy_Sub3' => 'Octavianus\'s final journal is incomplete. Gather the resources needed to restore its damaged pages and reveal what became of the expedition\'s leader.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_Legacy_Sub4' => 'We gathered every surviving record of the expedition. Complete the final preparations and help preserve Octavianus\'s story for future generations.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_UnknownSeas_Main' => 'The expedition ventured into waters no Roman map had ever shown. What happened there? Did Octavianus brave terrible storms, make unexpected discoveries, or even find new allies? Help me find out what shaped the fate of Octavianus and his companions.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_UnknownSeas_Sub1' => 'The journal speaks of peaceful encounters with distant peoples. Gather valuable goods to honour the friendships that helped the expedition continue its journey.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_UnknownSeas_Sub2' => 'A violent storm scattered the fleet across the open sea. Assemble the resources needed to prepare for such hardships and understand how the expedition endured.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_UnknownSeas_Sub3' => 'Reports suggest several crews founded small settlements after the storm. Make your community thrive to honour those who refused to surrender.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_UnknownSeas_Sub4' => 'A battered Roman standard has been found, a symbol that the expedition stood its ground even in desperate times. Prepare your forces to preserve its legacy.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_26-35_UnknownSeas_Sub5' => 'The last known route leads through a mountain pass. Clear the way and gather the materials needed to follow Octavianus beyond the natural barrier.',
        'Birthday2018plus_LostExpedition_36-50_Following_Main' => 'Years have passed since Octavianus sailed west in search of the Roman homeland. Though his expedition vanished, scattered clues have begun to surface. I need your help to retrace his journey and uncover the path he took across the sea.',
