        'CQC3M1Q1_SomethingEvil_lvl51' => 'Something isn\'t right… Our settlers are tired and exhausted all day. Even nature itself has yet to come out of its hibernation. It is as if the whole kingdom is miserable. Maybe you can provide some refreshments to get your settlers going again?',
