        'CQC3M1Q2_FindingHelp_lvl16' => 'This whole thing is really alarming. I think we might need some help... It is said that a kind healer travels the lands. Some folks say she is just a herb peddler, others say she might even be a witch. If anyone can help, it will be her. She is said to be very shy, but as she is looking for ingridients for her potions on the island, maybe we can scratch her back if she\'ll scratch ours.',
        'CQC3M1Q2_FindingHelp_lvl26' => 'This whole thing is really alarming. I think we might need some help... It is said that a kind healer travels the lands. Some folks say she is just a herb peddler, others say she might even be a witch. If anyone can help, it will be her. She is said to be very shy, but as she is looking for ingridients for her potions on the island, maybe we can scratch her back if she\'ll scratch ours.',
        'CQC3M1Q2_FindingHelp_lvl36' => 'This whole thing is really alarming. I think we might need some help... It is said that a kind healer travels the lands. Some folks say she is just a herb peddler, others say she might even be a witch. If anyone can help, it will be her. She is said to be very shy, but as she is looking for ingridients for her potions on the island, maybe we can scratch her back if she\'ll scratch ours.',
        'CQC3M1Q2_FindingHelp_lvl46' => 'This whole thing is really alarming. I think we might need some help... It is said that a kind healer travels the lands. Some folks say she is just a herb peddler, others say she might even be a witch. If anyone can help, it will be her. She is said to be very shy, but as she is looking for ingridients for her potions on the island, maybe we can scratch her back if she\'ll scratch ours.',
        'CQC3M1Q2_FindingHelp_lvl51' => 'This whole thing is really alarming. I think we might need some outside help... It is said that a kind healer travels the land. Some folks say she\'s just a herb peddler, others say she might even be a witch, but if anyone can help, she can. She is said to be very shy, but as she is looking for ingredients for her potions on the island, perhaps she\'ll scratch our back if we scratch hers?',
        'CQC3M1Q2_FindingHelp_lvl66' => 'This whole thing is really alarming. I think we might need some outside help... It is said that a kind healer travels the land. Some folks say she\'s just a herb peddler, others say she might even be a witch, but if anyone can help, she can. She is said to be very shy, but as she is looking for ingredients for her potions on the island, perhaps she\'ll scratch our back if we scratch hers?',
        'CQC3M1Q3_ProofOfCharacter_lvl16' => 'As you suspected, the witch won\'t agree to meet you in person. You receive a letter from her with a poorly-drawn picture of what looks like a red monkey. The letter reads:
"I am Ma\'Bristley and this little reddish fellow is Munchkin.  So you need help, you say? You know, you mighty kings and queens, you always seem to appear in times of greatest desperation.  But other than that you hardly tolerate an old lady wanting to trespass your kingdom.   Well, you say you are different. Prove it to us. Do something truly selfless for somebody else in need."',
