        'CQC3M2Q1_GettingParaphernalia_lvl16' => 'You receive another letter from the mysterious Ma\'Bristley:
"I was talking to the spirits of nature. They whispher from a great evil, which has befallen the land - a great evil evoked by a magic.  This land has been cursed! The fruits it bears are making your settlers sick.  We must do something! There is a magical ritual to help your settlers. I can perform it, but to do so, I need some natural ingridents - actually a lot of them."',
