        'CQC3M3Q1_SomethingOdd_lvl16' => 'Now that we\'ve solved the immediate crisis, I was wondering if you wanted to find out more about who summoned the forces of evil upon you? To find out more, I would need some samples from your island… maybe we could start with the trees. Deliver me some and I might be able to tell you more.',
