        'CQC3M3Q2_Hunch_lvl16' => 'Ma\'Bristley has sent you another yet another letter:
"So... We know that it was magic alright - but I\'ve got a hunch about the school of magic it came from. To get to know more about the magical matrix behind it, I\'ll need more samples. I need something that saves the magical essence of the curse in a more permanent way. Could you get me some stone, and some samples to compare it with?"',
