        'CQC3M4Q1_SignOfGoodFaith_lvl16' => 'Thanks to Ma\'Bristley, we found out that Lady Fraila has returned to her birthplace, the Island of the Swamp. She also seems to know that we found out about her plot. We should try to talk it out with her. Maybe we can convince her with some gifts. Let\'s start putting a decent package together.',
        'CQC3M4Q1_SignOfGoodFaith_lvl26' => 'Thanks to Ma\'Bristley, we found out that Lady Fraila has returned to her birthplace, the Island of the Swamp. She also seems to know that we found out about her plot. We should try to talk it out with her. Maybe we can convince her with some gifts. Let\'s start putting a decent package together.',
        'CQC3M4Q1_SignOfGoodFaith_lvl36' => 'Thanks to Ma\'Bristley, we found out that Lady Fraila has returned to her birthplace, the Island of the Swamp. She also seems to know that we found out about her plot. We should try to talk it out with her. Maybe we can convince her with some gifts. Let\'s start putting a decent package together.',
        'CQC3M4Q1_SignOfGoodFaith_lvl46' => 'Thanks to Ma\'Bristley, we found out that Lady Fraila has returned to her birthplace, the Island of the Swamp. She also seems to know that we found out about her plot. We should try to talk it out with her. Maybe we can convince her with some gifts. Let\'s start putting a decent package together.',
        'CQC3M4Q1_SignOfGoodFaith_lvl51' => 'Thanks to Ma\'Bristley, we found out that Lady Fraila has returned to her birthplace, the Island of the Swamp. She also seems to know that we found out about her plot. We should try to talk it out with her. Maybe we can win her over with some gifts. Let\'s start putting a decent package together.',
        'CQC3M4Q1_SignOfGoodFaith_lvl66' => 'Thanks to Ma\'Bristley, we found out that Lady Fraila has returned to her birthplace, the Island of the Swamp. She also seems to know that we found out about her plot. We should try to talk it out with her. Maybe we can win her over with some gifts. Let\'s start putting a decent package together.',
        'CQC3M4Q2_SomethingExtraordinary_lvl16' => 'I think we also should add some variety to our gift basket. After all, we really want to convince her. Get your people produce the finest materials they can, and add it to your gift.',
        'CQC3M4Q2_SomethingExtraordinary_lvl26' => 'I think we also should add some variety to our gift basket. After all, we really want to convince her. Get your people produce the finest materials they can, and add it to your gift. Maybe we can even find something special which we can not produce on our own island...',
        'CQC3M4Q2_SomethingExtraordinary_lvl36' => 'I think we also should add some variety to our gift basket. After all, we really want to convince her. Get your people produce the finest materials they can, and add it to your gift. Maybe we can even find something special which we can not produce on our own island...',
        'CQC3M4Q2_SomethingExtraordinary_lvl46' => 'I think we also should add some variety to our gift basket. After all, we really want to convince her. Get your people produce the finest materials they can, and add it to your gift. Maybe we can even find something special which we can not produce on our own island...',
        'CQC3M4Q2_SomethingExtraordinary_lvl51' => 'I think we should add some variety to our gift basket. After all, we really want to convince her we\'re good people! Get your settlers to produce the finest materials they can, and add it to your gift basket. Maybe we can even find something exotic - something we can\'t produce on our own island...',
        'CQC3M4Q2_SomethingExtraordinary_lvl66' => 'I think we should add some variety to our gift basket. After all, we really want to convince her we\'re good people! Get your settlers to produce the finest materials they can, and add it to your gift basket. Maybe we can even find something exotic - something we can\'t produce on our own island...',
        'CQC3M4Q3_CherryOnTop_lvl16' => 'We should maybe put a proverbial cherry on top - just in case. Let\'s take something really valuable with us to show Lady Fraila that there is really no need to fear us or hate us.',
        'CQC3M4Q3_CherryOnTop_lvl26' => 'We should maybe put a proverbial cherry on top - just in case. Let\'s take something really valuable with us to show Lady Fraila that there is really no need to fear us or hate us. But where could we get such a treasure? Maybe something exotic, perhaps? Yes! Let\'s start an expedition to one of the nearby islands, and find Lady Fraila something she has never seen before!',
        'CQC3M4Q3_CherryOnTop_lvl36' => 'We should maybe put a proverbial cherry on top - just in case. Let\'s take something really valuable with us to show Lady Fraila that there is really no need to fear us or hate us. But where could we get such a treasure? Maybe something exotic, perhaps? Yes! Let\'s start an expedition to one of the nearby islands, and find Lady Fraila something she has never seen before!',
