        'CQC4M1Q1_DiplomacyFirst_lvl16' => 'The bandits have set up a fortress in the middle of our island while we weren\'t looking! How did they manage to get this far without us noticing!? Never mind - now they\'re here, we\'ll have to deal with the problem. Perhaps we can gain some time by distracting them with some paperwork or something, and show that we want no kerfuffle with them. I\'ll have the scribes ready at the provision house.',
