        'CQC4M2Q1_SchoolsOut_lvl16' => 'Our scouts have discovered that one of the functions the Bandit Fortress is "offering" is a boot camp for people who want to be bandits. Really? What sort of person would look at their life and think "You know what? I want to be a bandit"? Anyway, we can\'t let this stand. We have to do something about it!',
