        'CQC4M2Q2_CuttingTheMessages_lvl16' => 'We may know that the treasure is a hoax - but the bandits don\'t. We need to make sure that they can\'t send for reinforcements, and the only way to do that is to make sure that our paper production chains are under constant supervision.',
