        'CQC4M4Q1_WatchTower01_lvl16' => 'We\'ll need to make sure we can see the bandits coming should they choose to return - so I\'ve come up with a blueprint for our most ambitious building yet. A watchtower that we can fill with sentries! First, we\'ll need to build the base structure. I hired some builders, but you\'ll have to provide them with the correct tools. The ones we have apparently aren\'t good enough, so you\'ll need to craft some new ones in the provision house.',
