        'CQC4M4Q4_WatchTower04_lvl16' => 'This is it. Phase four - the final stretch! Now comes the part where we finalize the design, reinforcing the structure and making it as stable as possible! Actually, come to think of it, perhaps we should have done this first? Oh well!',
