        'CQS10_SunnyDay_Tcl2' => 'We\'re really close to finishing, and the storm is far away on the other side of the ocean. I don\'t think we\'re going to experience it before some time, but who knows? We need to finish the last repairs, calm the people down... just do all we can to get back to the normal flow of life. I\'ll set up a list with the last things we need to take care of.',
        'CQS10_SunnyDay_Tcl3' => 'We\'re really close to finishing, and the storm is far away on the other side of the ocean. I don\'t think we\'re going to experience it before some time, but who knows? We need to finish the last repairs, calm the people down... just do all we can to get back to the normal flow of life. I\'ll set up a list with the last things we need to take care of.',
        'CQS10_SunnyDay_Tcl4' => 'We\'re really close to finishing, and the storm is far away on the other side of the ocean. I don\'t think we\'re going to experience it before some time, but who knows? We need to finish the last repairs, calm the people down... just do all we can to get back to the normal flow of life. I\'ll set up a list with the last things we need to take care of.',
        'CQS10_SunnyDay_Tcl5' => 'We\'re really close to finishing, and the storm is far away on the other side of the ocean. I don\'t think we\'re going to experience it before some time, but who knows? We need to finish the last repairs, calm the people down... just do all we can to get back to the normal flow of life. I\'ll set up a list with the last things we need to take care of.',
        'CQS1_AStrongAdvice_Tcl1' => 'We still have time before the next dawn, so we need to do the preparations step by step, following a well designed emergency plan. The first step is to send out our specialists so they can find the proper resources we will need. The reinforcement of the buildings is our biggest priority now. Do your best to get this organized, and we can move on to step two!',
        'CQS1_AStrongAdvice_Tcl2' => 'We still have time before the next dawn, so we need to do the preparations step by step, following a well designed emergency plan. The first step is to send out our specialists so they can find the proper resources we will need. The reinforcement of the buildings is our biggest priority now. Do your best to get this organized, and we can move on to step two!',
        'CQS1_AStrongAdvice_Tcl3' => 'We still have time before the next dawn, so we need to do the preparations step by step, following a well designed emergency plan. The first step is to send out our specialists so they can find the proper resources we will need. The reinforcement of the buildings is our biggest priority now. Do your best to get this organized, and we can move on to step two!',
        'CQS1_AStrongAdvice_Tcl4' => 'We still have time before the next dawn, so we need to do the preparations step by step, following a well designed emergency plan. The first step is to send out our specialists so they can find the proper resources we will need. The reinforcement of the buildings is our biggest priority now. Do your best to get this organized, and we can move on to step two!',
        'CQS1_AStrongAdvice_Tcl5' => 'We still have time before the next dawn, so we need to do the preparations step by step, following a well designed emergency plan. The first step is to send out our specialists so they can find the proper resources we will need. The reinforcement of the buildings is our biggest priority now. Do your best to get this organized, and we can move on to step two!',
        'CQS2_FromTheMines_Tcl1' => 'We can count on our miners come wind, rain or shine, and step two requires their hard work. They need to excavate the ore we need to reinforce our buildings on the island, but it seems we need the help of the Barracks. The Island\'s Military Forces could help us a lot. Let\'s keep them happy, so they help us as much as possible!',
        'CQS2_FromTheMines_Tcl2' => 'We can count on our miners come wind, rain or shine, and step two requires the hard work of our people. They have to excavate the ore we need to reinforce our buildings on the island, but it seems we\'ll need the help of the Barracks. The Island\'s Military Forces could help us a lot. Let\'s keep them happy so they do their absolute best!',
        'CQS2_FromTheMines_Tcl3' => 'We can count on our miners come wind, rain or shine, and step two requires the hard work of our people. They have to excavate the ore we need to reinforce our buildings on the island, but it seems we\'ll need the help of the Barracks. The Island\'s Military Forces could help us a lot. Let\'s keep them happy so they do their absolute best!',
        'CQS2_FromTheMines_Tcl4' => 'We can count on our miners come wind, rain or shine, and step two requires the hard work of our people. They have to excavate the ore we need to reinforce our buildings on the island, but it seems we\'ll need the help of the Barracks. The Island\'s Military Forces could help us a lot. Let\'s keep them happy so they do their absolute best!',
        'CQS2_FromTheMines_Tcl5' => 'We can count on our miners come wind, rain or shine, and step two requires the hard work of our people. They have to excavate the ore we need to reinforce our buildings on the island, but it seems we\'ll need the help of the Barracks. The Island\'s Military Forces could help us a lot. Let\'s keep them happy so they do their absolute best!',
        'CQS3_WatcherInTheTower_Tcl1' => 'Before we reinforce our own buildings, there are two things we must protect at all cost: the watcher and the tower. Far out at sea, where the sky is green, there\'s a small island where the watcher lives. He\'s the one looking out for us. The man is really old, and they say the tower has only one window. Anyway, the eye of the storm is going to be situated right above the tower! We must be ready to send the necessary resources in case the storm hits too hard!',
        'CQS3_WatcherInTheTower_Tcl2' => 'Before we reinforce our own buildings, there are two things we must protect at all cost: the watcher and the tower. Far out at sea, where the sky is green, there\'s a small island where the watcher lives. He\'s the one looking out for us. The man is really old, and they say the tower has only one window. Anyway, the eye of the storm is going to be situated right above the tower! We must be ready to send the necessary resources in case the storm hits too hard!',
        'CQS3_WatcherInTheTower_Tcl3' => 'Before we reinforce our own buildings, there are two things we must protect at all cost: the watcher and the tower. Far out at sea, where the sky is green, there\'s a small island where the watcher lives. He\'s the one looking out for us. The man is really old, and they say the tower has only one window. Anyway, the eye of the storm is going to be situated right above the tower! We must be ready to send the necessary resources in case the storm hits too hard!',
        'CQS3_WatcherInTheTower_Tcl4' => 'Before we reinforce our own buildings, there are two things we must protect at all cost: the watcher and the tower. Far out at sea, where the sky is green, there\'s a small island where the watcher lives. He\'s the one looking out for us. The man is really old, and they say the tower has only one window. Anyway, the eye of the storm is going to be situated right above the tower! We must be ready to send the necessary resources in case the storm hits too hard!',
        'CQS3_WatcherInTheTower_Tcl5' => 'Before we reinforce our own buildings, there are two things we must protect at all cost: the watcher and the tower. Far out at sea, where the sky is green, there\'s a small island where the watcher lives. He\'s the one looking out for us. The man is really old, and they say the tower has only one window. Anyway, the eye of the storm is going to be situated right above the tower! We must send the necessary resources so it can be reinforced!',
        'CQS4_Alliance_Tcl1' => 'Waiting hour after hour is pretty annoying, I know, but only the storm knows when it\'s going to hit. Our settlers have already reinforced most of the buildings on the island, but it\'s still not enough! We need help from our allies! I will send out the messengers, and until the answer comes, we should keep on focusing on the storm and how to avoid it.',
        'CQS4_Alliance_Tcl2' => 'Waiting hour after hour is pretty annoying, I know, but only the storm knows when it\'s going to hit. Our settlers have already reinforced most of the buildings on the island, so now we should move on to step four: helping our allies. We need to produce a lot of rations and send them to our friends.',
        'CQS4_Alliance_Tcl3' => 'Waiting hour after hour is pretty annoying, I know, but only the storm knows when it\'s going to hit. Our settlers have already reinforced most of the buildings on the island, so now we should move on to step four: helping our allies. We need to produce a lot of rations and send them to our friends.',
        'CQS4_Alliance_Tcl4' => 'Waiting hour after hour is pretty annoying, I know, but only the storm knows when it\'s going to hit. Our settlers have already reinforced most of the buildings on the island, so now we should move on to step four: helping our allies. We need to produce a lot of rations and send them to our friends.',
        'CQS4_Alliance_Tcl5' => 'Waiting hour after hour is pretty annoying, I know, but only the storm knows when it\'s going to hit. Our settlers have already reinforced most of the buildings on the island, so now we should move on to step four: helping our allies. We need to produce a lot of rations and send them to our friends.',
        'CQS5_WrongTiming_Tcl1' => 'There is a breach in security! The bandits and pirates lurking around our islands have decided to take advantage of the crisis to rob and plunder. They\'ve almost emptied our storage facilities, but thank the maker for our great scouts! First we must prepare to fight back! Then we must regain all the lost resources by any means! We need to be 100% sure they can\'t get their hands on our resources even if they dare come back for more!',
        'CQS5_WrongTiming_Tcl2' => 'There is a breach in security! The bandits and pirates lurking around our islands have decided to take advantage of the crisis to rob and plunder. They\'ve almost emptied our storage facilities, but thank the maker for our great scouts! First we must prepare to fight back! Then we must regain all the lost resources by any means! We need to be 100% sure they can\'t get their hands on our resources even if they dare to come back for more!',
        'CQS5_WrongTiming_Tcl3' => 'There is a breach in security! The bandits and pirates lurking around our islands have decided to take advantage of the crisis to rob and plunder. They\'ve almost emptied our storage facilities, but thank the maker for our great scouts! First we must prepare to fight back! Then we must regain all the lost resources by any means! We need to be 100% sure they can\'t get their hands on our resources even if they dare to come back for more!',
        'CQS5_WrongTiming_Tcl4' => 'There is a breach in security! The bandits and pirates lurking around our islands have decided to take advantage of the crisis to rob and plunder. They\'ve almost emptied our storage facilities, but thank the maker for our great scouts! First we must prepare to fight back! Then we must regain all the lost resources by any means! We need to be 100% sure they can\'t get their hands on our resources even if they dare to come back for more!',
        'CQS5_WrongTiming_Tcl5' => 'There is a breach in security! The bandits and pirates lurking around our islands have decided to take advantage of the crisis to rob and plunder. They\'ve almost emptied our storage facilities, but thank the maker for our great scouts! First we must prepare to fight back! Then we must regain all the lost resources by any means! We need to be 100% sure they can\'t get their hands on our resources even if they dare to come back for more!',
        'CQS6_Aftermath_Tcl2' => 'That was the biggest storm I\'ve ever experienced! It was like being caught in the middle of 105 winds, not just 104! Well, we survived the storm, but lost way too many resources and other items. It seems our work here isn\'t done yet, so we better start with the damage reports and get ourselves back in the game, if you know what I mean. Let\'s get on it.',
        'CQS6_Aftermath_Tcl3' => 'That was the biggest storm I\'ve ever experienced! It was like being caught in the middle of 105 winds, not just 104! Well, we survived the storm, but lost way too many resources and other items. It seems our work here isn\'t done yet, so we better start with the damage reports and get ourselves back in the game, if you know what I mean. Let\'s get on it.',
        'CQS6_Aftermath_Tcl4' => 'That was the biggest storm I\'ve ever experienced! It was like being caught in the middle of 105 winds, not just 104! Well, we survived the storm, but lost way too many resources and other items. It seems our work here isn\'t done yet, so we better start with the damage reports and get ourselves back in the game, if you know what I mean. Let\'s get on it.',
        'CQS6_Aftermath_Tcl5' => 'That was the biggest storm I\'ve ever experienced! It was like being caught in the middle of 105 winds, not just 104! Well, we survived the storm, but lost way too many resources and other items. It seems our work here isn\'t done yet, so we better start with the damage reports and get ourselves back in the game, if you know what I mean. Let\'s get on it.',
        'CQS7_BrokenArmor_Tcl2' => 'Last night was testing, and the air was alive, swooshing from every direction as if we were battling the armies of the storms! Ahh, I should calm down. Remember the Military Force helping us with preparations? Well, they kind of need us now. The Barracks armoury was partially damaged and they lost a lot of weapons. I will alert the smiths to start work. I hope you can manage logistics. Meanwhile, don\'t forget we still need to get resources to help our economy recover!',
        'CQS7_BrokenArmor_Tcl3' => 'Last night was testing, and the air was alive, swooshing from every direction as if we were battling the armies of the storms! Ahh, I should calm down. Remember the Military Force helping us with preparations? Well, they kind of need us now. The Barracks armoury was partially damaged and they lost a lot of weapons. I will alert the smiths to start work. I hope you can manage logistics. Meanwhile, don\'t forget we still need to get resources to help our economy recover!',
        'CQS7_BrokenArmor_Tcl4' => 'Last night was testing, and the air was alive, swooshing from every direction as if we were battling the armies of the storms! Ahh, I should calm down. Remember the Military Force helping us with preparations? Well, they kind of need us now. The Barracks armoury was partially damaged and they lost a lot of weapons. I will alert the smiths to start work. I hope you can manage logistics. Meanwhile, don\'t forget we still need to get resources to help our economy recover!',
        'CQS7_BrokenArmor_Tcl5' => 'Last night was testing, and the air was alive, swooshing from every direction as if we were battling the armies of the storms! Ahh, I should calm down. Remember the Military Force helping us with preparations? Well, they kind of need us now. The Barracks armoury was partially damaged and they lost a lot of weapons. I will alert the smiths to start work. I hope you can manage logistics. Meanwhile, don\'t forget we still need to get resources to help our economy recover!',
        'CQS8_ANewForce_Tcl2' => 'A young scout has tried to deliver a letter from the King, but she couldn\'t find how to push through the storm, so we received it late. In this letter, the King orders every island to strengthen its population, to make sure there will be strong people on hand in case another crisis hits us. Oh, and we should making some more weapons, just in case. Off to work, then!',
        'CQS8_ANewForce_Tcl3' => 'A young scout has tried to deliver a letter from the King, but she couldn\'t find how to push through the storm, so we received it late. In this letter, the King orders every island to strengthen its population, to make sure there will be strong people on hand in case another crisis hits us. Oh, and we should making some more weapons, just in case. Off to work, then!',
        'CQS8_ANewForce_Tcl4' => 'A young scout has tried to deliver a letter from the King, but she couldn\'t find how to push through the storm, so we received it late. In this letter, the King orders every island to strengthen its population, to make sure there will be strong people on hand in case another crisis hits us. Oh, and we should making some more weapons, just in case. Off to work, then!',
        'CQS8_ANewForce_Tcl5' => 'A young scout has tried to deliver a letter from the King, but she couldn\'t find how to push through the storm, so we received it late. In this letter, the King orders every island to strengthen its population, to make sure there will be strong people on hand in case another crisis hits us. Oh, and we should making some more weapons, just in case. Off to work, then!',
        'CQS9_SmallChange_Tcl2' => 'Terrible news! The coinmaster of our island is lost, and with him all our coin reserves! We intended using those coins to repair the damage we suffered during the storm! We need to act quickly! Go to the market and buy some coins! I wonder where our coinmaster is? That old lady at the end of the town said he might have been carried away by a moonlight shadow. Strange, I\'ve never heard of a creature like that, but I certainly don\'t want it in my backyard.',
        'CQS9_SmallChange_Tcl3' => 'Terrible news! The coinmaster of our island is lost, and with him all our coin reserves! We intended using those coins to repair the damage we suffered during the storm! We need to act quickly! Go to the market and buy some coins! I wonder where our coinmaster is? That old lady at the end of the town said he might have been carried away by a moonlight shadow. Strange, I\'ve never heard of a creature like that, but I certainly don\'t want it in my backyard.',
        'CQS9_SmallChange_Tcl4' => 'Terrible news! The coinmaster of our island is lost, and with him all our coin reserves! We intended using those coins to repair the damage we suffered during the storm! We need to act quickly! Go to the market and buy some coins! I wonder where our coinmaster is? That old lady at the end of the town said he might have been carried away by a moonlight shadow. Strange, I\'ve never heard of a creature like that, but I certainly don\'t want it in my backyard.',
        'CQS9_SmallChange_Tcl5' => 'Terrible news! The coinmaster of our island is lost, and with him all our coin reserves! We intended using those coins to repair the damage we suffered during the storm! We need to act quickly! Go to the market and buy some coins! I wonder where our coinmaster is? That old lady at the end of the town said he might have been carried away by a moonlight shadow. Strange, I\'ve never heard of a creature like that, but I certainly don\'t want it in my backyard.',
        'ChrDaiAHugeChristmasTree' => 'You have decided to erect a huge Christmas tree in the village square. This requires building an adequate wooden holder, capable of holding the weight of the tree.',
        'ChrDaiANewShelter' => 'Santa Claus\' reindeers only have a wooden crate for protection, not much good against wind and snow. You propose to build one out of stone.',
        'ChrDaiChristmasPostcard' => 'My council of elves has dispatched Timble Jude to be my consultant during the time I spend on this island. Timble Jude suggested I should ask you about your friends. Have you sent them any gifts yet? No? Well, I think the time has come to do so!',
        'ChrDaiColoredFish' => 'Come here for a moment please. I want to set up an aquarium for the children, and it will require all kinds of coloured fish! Could you talk to the fishermen for me? Tell them Santa asked them to bring some coloured fish! What joy!',
        'ChrDaiCozyChristmasEve' => 'To reward your settlers and secure a cozy Christmas evening, you have decided to place firewood at your settlers\' disposal.',
        'ChrDaiHeavyGifts' => 'Oh no! I\'ve got so many gifts to transfer, but my sledge needs repairing. I\'ve heard that you breed a special kind of horse on your island. Is that right? Oh joy! I\'ll tell Nutty Matty, my technician elf, to get everything prepared. Please, give him a hand getting the horses!',
        'ChrDaiHelpForMotherHolle' => 'Because mother Holle has a lot to do at the moment, Santa Claus wants to send her some of his elves to help out, but they\'ll need provisions for the journey. Help Santa with some sausages.',
        'ChrDaiImportantWood' => 'Wood is an important resource. As recycling is more and more crucial, you have decided to recycle old bows in order to make new ones.',
        'ChrDaiLateDinner' => 'Gigling Oaffy, my little aid elf, is looking out for my… erm… size. I tend to eat a lot you know. Ho ho ho! Actually, I wanted to ask you for some sausage. I\'ve heard that you make the best! Just don\'t tell Gigling Oaffy about our little conversation please! It\'ll be our special secret...',
        'ChrDaiMerryMaintenance' => 'Oh! I\'ve been contacted by my engineer elf, Smiley Nakrul. He says my sledge has been damaged! He tells me he could fix it, but unfortunately he\'s left his tools at the North Pole. Can you help Smiley Nakrul, please?',
        'ChrDaiMulledWine' => 'One of your attendants has been enthusing recently about a beverage called mulled wine. You have become curious, and decide to trade some of it to see whether it really is as tasty as you have been told.',
        'ChrDaiSantasLittleHelper' => 'Santa\'s helpers have worked hard, but the delivery of new tools is still missing. There aren\'t enough tools left to finish all the presents. Help Santa Claus out.',
        'ChrDaiSaveTheChristmasFeast' => 'You have received a strange message telling of a mysterious creature calling itself "Croaker" that is surrounding itself with all kinds of bad people. Go and investigate!',
        'ChrDaiSaveTheChristmasFeast2' => 'You have received a strange message telling of a mysterious creature calling itself "Croaker" that is surrounding itself with all kinds of bad people. Go and investigate!',
        'ChrDaiSaveTheChristmasFeast2Prequest' => 'As you walk through your streets, you come across two citizens, talking about a drunkard in the tavern babbling strange things about Christmas eve. You decide to visit the tavern and investigate.

After completing the quest you will receive the adventure "Save the Christmas Feast" via mail.',
        'ChrDaiSaveTheChristmasFeastPrequest' => 'As you walk through your streets, you come across two citizens, talking about a drunkard in the tavern babbling strange things about Christmas eve. You decide to visit the tavern and investigate.

After completing the quest you will receive the adventure "Save the Christmas Feast" via mail..',
        'ChrDaiSavingOfChristmasEve' => 'Santa Claus is having to deal with a huge wave of illness among his helpers, leading to the faltering production of presents. Buff your friends\' buildings so that they can send some of their settlers to help.',
        'ChrDaiSnowflakeTea' => 'Ho ho… *cough*. Oh my, it seems that Santa may have caught a cold. I wonder, could you perhaps make me and my elves some snowflake tea? We have the snowflakes, all we need is some warm water! Can you prepare some for us?',
        'ChrDaiTallTree' => 'I walked around the island and noticed that some of the settlers can\'t afford to own a tall Christmas tree. This is unacceptable! Help me build some proper tree holders by providing some strong hardwood planks!',
        'ChrDaiTheChristmasBakery' => 'The Christmas bakery has run out of flour for the cookies. Christmas without cookies? Unthinkable! Quick! Help them out with some flour!',
        'ChrDaiTheNaughtyAndTheNice' => 'I\'ve got my naughty or nice list over here made by Sirim Seb, one of the elf knights of the North Pole. He\'s a kind soul, but takes discipline very seriously. He could be a leader one day. Anyway, he needs some coal for the naughty kids, and I always forget to bring some. Can you help us?',
        'ChrDaiTheNewMantelshelf' => 'After having been very reasonable for quite some time, you decide to treat yourself by manufacturing a new mantelpiece out of marble. It will be a much more suitable place to hang up your stockings!',
        'ChrDaiTheSnowyPretzel' => 'Have you ever heard of the fairy Vava? She works for me at the North Pole as my personal cook! Every morning, she bakes me snow coated pretzels! I want you to help her out with some flour and water so she can prepare some for your settlers!',
        'ChrDaiTheToyMaker' => 'A toy for a child is like a sword for a soldier: both would be unhappy without one. You can make swords for your soldiers, and I, Santa Claus, can make toys for the children. Help me out with some wood please.',
        'ChrDaiWarmBrew' => 'One of your attendants has become very enthusiastic recently about a beverage called warm brew. Consequently, you have decided to trade some brew, boil it up, taste it, and see whether it is really as tasty as you have been told.',
        'ChrDaiYellowStar' => 'Every year we place the yellow star on top of the Christmas tree. Sadly, this year we can\'t find the star because there\'s a shadow covering the  night sky. I have called upon my hunter elf - I call him Shady Slayer. He knows how to get rid of shadows! Help him out with some iron ore so he can prepare the iron dust he\'ll use against the shadow!',
        'CollectAllCollectibles' => 'The scouts have reported that the collectible items have appeared on our island. You should go and gather them up!',
        'CollectAllCollectiblesAdventure' => 'The scouts have reported that collectible items have been spotted. You should have a look around and collect them in before we finish our business here.',
        'CollectAllEasterCollectibles' => 'A friend of yours has visited you and has hidden some eggs on your island. Try to find them before the buff on your Mayor\'s house expires. Once the buff expires, both you and your friend will be awarded the number of Easter Eggs you discovered.

- Find all Hidden Easter Eggs',
        'CollectAllEventCollectibles' => 'The scouts report that collectible items have appeared on the island. You should go and gather them up! If you can find them all, they\'ll be transferred to your home island.',
        'CoopLakesideTreasureQ1' => 'It seems the treasure map has led us to this strange looking island! The scouts say that the treasure we seek is hidden in the  ruins of an old temple somewhere on this island. The bad news is that it seems to be being worshipped by a band of cultists. If we want to find the treasure, we shall have to clear out their camps. Their strange magic appears to be controlling some barriers on the other side of the island. We need to work together, and clear out those bone churches.',
        'CoopLakesideTreasureQ2' => 'The cultists seem rather confused. No wonder - they\'re being attacked from both sides! It seems we\'ve unraveled their defences. Time to take care of those big towers.',
        'CoopLakesideTreasureQ3' => 'Now that the cultists are out of the way, we need to get searching for that treasure.',
        'CoopWhirlwindQ1' => 'This is definitely the place! It seems to be heavily guarded... We need to destroy those camps quickly and make a beachhead on the island. The camps also seem to be reinforcing a nearby wall through that dense patch of woods. If we can take them out, our allies can pass through their defences.',
        'CoopWhirlwindQ2' => 'Quickly now, we must make use of our advantage. They were not expecting us to move so swiftly! Go forth and destroy the leaders of their forward guard.',
        'CoopWhirlwindQ3' => 'It seems we\'ve reached their second line of defence. The only way to breach it is to destroy those fortified camps on the Eastern and Western sides; then the wall should fall.',
        'CoopWhirlwindQ4' => 'We\'ve reached the second wall, but we know how to beat it. The fortifications are sustained by fortified camps on the North and South sides of the wall. Destroy them!',
        'CoopWhirlwindQ5' => 'Victory is before us. The keep of our enemies is within our grasp. Go get them!',
        'DaiADarkShadow' => 'We have received several complaints lately about a shadowy figure lurking around the city, scaring people and stealing coins! We must do something! Setting a trap would be the best idea. Let\'s make sure the shadow hears about the huge amount of "wink wink" gold we\'re about to send to Capital Island!',
        'DaiAFullArmory' => 'You remember the Quasadi brothers? The ones that claimed they can cut a tree with one slash? Well they\'re back on the island and they\'re about to put on a show. However, sadly they have been attacked by some pirates and had their swords stolen! No problem - we\'ll get them new ones!',
        'DaiANewGoldDeposit' => 'One of your prospectors has just found a new gold deposit. As a loyal subject, he naturally tells you immediately. You should check it out and begin mining immediately.',
        'DaiANewJob' => 'One of your settlers wants to become a fisherman, but has no experience in this field. Help him out a little with his first fish.',
        'DaiANewQuest' => 'We were on the lookout for a new adventure when a letter reached us, asking that you bring a former bowman to justice. Nice timing!',
        'DaiANewTreasure' => 'Your cousin Frederik, who is known as a wannabe treasure hunter, honours you with a visit once again, and tells you about a hidden treasure. Unfortunately, he is missing some parts of the map and the clues lead him here, to this island. Try to find them, by any means!',
        'DaiASignOfEsteem' => 'The new settlers have been working diligently for you for several months now. Give them a present as a token of your esteem and thanks for their loyalty.',
        'DaiASignOfPeace' => 'As a sign of peace, King Damien decides on a public display of weapons being destroyed in front of the Tyrhand Palace. Because you support the basic idea, you decide to take part and volunteer some of your weapons.',
        'DaiAdventureSeasonMercenary' => 'Have you heard about the new finding on some adventures? There are these things called Adventure Relics, which might come in handy! Go on one of these adventures, defeat the mercenaries and collect your rewards!',
        'DaiAdventures' => 'Your troops in the barracks are really bored because they have run out of glorious stories to tell! I think it\'s time for a fresh adventure that could provide some new tales!',
        'DaiAlienation' => 'The King likes parades, but do you know what he loves even more than parades? Military parades! However, such a big event requires a lot of military units, so we\'re going to send some of our troops to attend!',
        'DaiAnimalMarket' => 'A huge animal market will soon be held in a neighbouring country. One of your cousins wants to participate and buy some new horses, but he is out of gold. Maybe, you can help him out?',
        'DaiAnnoholicsLive' => 'Those Annoholics are a big hit. When they throw a concert, it always sells out. The stages are getting bigger and bigger. More people than ever are going to see them - we should award this success.',
        'DaiArcticExplosion' => 'Our scout reported Nords activity on an abandoned island. He told us they\'ve unloaded several barrels onto the shore. We have no idea what they\'re planning, but we need to take care of this matter! We can\'t risk another Nords invasion!',
        'DaiAttacks' => 'One of my friends, a knight patrolling the wilderness, has told me of some terrible screams coming from the deep forests at night. He believes there is a secret bandit camp in there, somewhere! Who knows what they are up to... We should go and investigate!',
        'DaiBanditNest' => 'A bandit leader named Chuck has mocked you in a letter and displayed it publicly for all to see. We have found out that he is hiding in a nearby forest with his brother, Norys. Do not let him get away with this smear on your name!',
        'DaiBastilleIsland' => 'Have you heard? That prison island to the east is overwhelmed by the clans living on it. We should send a letter and see what\'s going on. Apparently, Count Hackett is the warden right now. Let’s deal with this problem as soon as possible!',
        'DaiBeerSupply' => 'A great feast approaches and experience tells you that a lot of drinking is to be expected. Build up stocks so that your settlers are not left high and dry.',
        'DaiBehindYourBack' => 'You have heard of someone speaking ill of you behind your back and denigrating you in front of your inhabitants. Even though your people trust you, you should investigate. Find out who is behind this smear campaign and take them to task.',
        'DaiBigHarvest' => 'Our town is growing, and we need more food! One farmer had an idea that we could use saltpetre as fertilizer to boost our crops\' growth rate. Maybe we should try it.',
        'DaiBirthday2018plusAdventure1' => 'There have been some messages from another kingdom, saying that strange buildings are appearing on their lands. Tee hee hee… They are requesting help. It might be a side effect of our little party preparations. Could you take care of the buildings?',
        'DaiBirthday2018plusAdventure2' => 'I am contacting you because strange looking buildings are appearing on far away islands. I heard you are a brave and adventurous person. Tee hee hee… I\'m sure you can solve the problem.',
        'DaiBirthday2018plusAdventure3' => 'Have you heard? Strange looking buildings everywhere. They are like a disease. Tee hee hee… I\'ve said you\'ll take care of them. I\'m sure you\'ll manage without any trouble.',
        'DaiBirthday2018plusAdventure4' => 'Tee hee hee... These buildings really do look strange. Or is the landscape around them? Hmm… interesting question. Take a look for yourself. I\'m eager to hear your opinion. Tee hee hee…',
        'DaiBirthday2018plusAdventure5' => 'I wonder whether this is a side effect off our preparations, buildings appearing where they shouldn\'t, I mean. Either way, we need your help. I\'m sure you\'ll know how to deal with the issue. Tee hee hee…',
        'DaiBurntDown' => 'A mysterious heat wave has burned down everything on one of the neighboring islands! Something is wrong here - this is not the first time we\'ve heard about powerful sunbeams that burn everything they "shine" upon… Anyway, we should be supportive, as always.',
        'DaiCannonBurglary' => 'Oh dear! We\'ve lost some cannons! At first we believed they had been stolen by the pirates but… but no! They actually got stolen by some renegade knights of ours, and they have taken over Greenmoor castle in the valley! We need to take back the castle and the cannons! Our city is in danger!',
        'DaiCarvedIntoStone' => 'Your last treasure search brought back a map! And you know what? There is treasure on this island! However, it\'s hidden deep in the old mountain. Whoever hid it made sure nobody was going to get at it easily, and has sealed the entrance to the cave holding the treasure with a huge block of marble. Don\'t ask me how they did it. We need to dig our way in.',
        'DaiCaseOfEmergency' => 'Either there\'s a freak fog or we have a serious case of ghost ships cruising around our island! They have even attacked some of our fishermen! We should prepare our cannons and defend ourselves if we have to!',
        'DaiCheapPrices' => 'There\'s a new exhibition in the city, about a bunch of rare ore! The only problem is, the lady who\'s organizing it has lost some of the exhibits! Let\'s see if we can provide the missing ore they need!',
        'DaiCollapsedMines' => 'The miner\'s union keeps sending us these letters to ensure that we\'re constantly looking after the condition of our mines! We should do that, right?',
        'DaiCopperCopperEverywhere' => 'You have sent some explorers to investigate a nearby area which seems to have rich copper deposits. However, it appears you are not the only one interested. Build some copper mines quickly, before someone else does.',
        'DaiDebts' => 'One of your townswomen approaches, drenched in tears, and tells you how her husband is deep in debt because of gambling. She begs you for help and offers brew in return. Convert the brew into gold.',
        'DaiDeerCrossing' => 'Many of your settlers are being harassed by roaming animals, and carriages are often hindered by deer crossing. Attend to this problem immediately.',
        'DaiDefense' => 'These are uncertain times, and reports accumulate of attacked camps in the surroundings. Raise your steel resources to be prepared for the worst case scenario.',
        'DaiDogFamily' => 'One of your servants has found a totally neglected family of dogs in his back yard. The poor dogs are ravenous and weak. Provide them something to eat.',
        'DaiEliteDrill' => 'One of the battlemasters from your barracks has suggested drilling elite soldiers to keep up with your enemies. Maybe you should give it a try?',
        'DaiFirstWave' => 'One of your cousins wants to claim one of his neighbour\'s islands that is being occupied by devious bandits. Unfortunately, he has no idea about military and resources management. You decide to help him, because chasing bandits is always a good idea.',
        'DaiFollower' => 'One of your farmers is teaching his son to follow in his footsteps, the main training areas being the wheatfields around their farm. Maybe you can lend them a hand and help them a bit with harvesting?!',
        'DaiFoodDonation' => 'King Damien is preparing a food donation for the poor people of his islands, and is asking everyone for support. Surely he can count on you?',
        'DaiFoodForThePeople' => 'Your cousin Frederik has sold too much food. Now he doesn\'t have enough left to feed his settlers. Quick! Help him so that his people do not have to suffer.',
        'DaiFriends' => 'We\'ve managed to open that little box our hunters found the other day! The box contained a message that reads: When trouble comes, a friend will hold the first sword against it! Sounds weird, I know, but it makes you think, right? Let\'s help our friends. I\'m sure they\'ll be happy!',
        'DaiGoodExchangeRate' => 'You have heard about profitable prices for exotic wood. Check your storage! Maybe you can dispense with some?!',
        'DaiGoodFriends' => 'Your brother Theodor is visiting, and tells you incessantly of his economic success. It strikes you that he does not seem to have any friends, and does everything on his own. Show him that friends can be a great help.',
        'DaiGoodThingsCome' => 'Your cousin encountered tougher defences than expected. He needs more effective equipment, and therefore more resources.',
        'DaiHarvestTime' => 'I heard that there\'s been golden rain over our wheatfields! That means the market will be interested in buying our wheat! Let\'s stock up and head for the markets!',
        'DaiHelpToThoseBeingInNeedOf' => 'Oh no! Theodor, your brother, is about to visit us! Again! He almost certainly wants goods from you. Quick! Use any excess resources to support someone who really needs them.',
        'DaiHighRequest' => 'We have had complains from Capital Island that we\'re keeping our best resources for ourselves! That\'s not true! Well… maybe it is, but we need to prove them wrong! Let\'s sell some of our most precious resources!',
        'DaiHiredForces' => 'A small kid just arrived at our gates. He was dirty and tired, and spoke of a small village that needs our help against some bandits. We should send out some of our troops.',
        'DaiHorseGrowing' => 'One of your horse breeders has produced a promising new race of horses. They might bring a high price at market. Make him give you some of them and see what you get for them.',
        'DaiHorseRace' => 'Your settlers are planning on holding a horse race - but they\'ll need some talent on horseback to make it happen.',
        'DaiInTheCitysHonor' => 'A few weeks ago, your city was designated as one of the most beautiful in all the land. Now you\'d like to celebrate this in the proper manner and arrange a great feast for your inhabitants. Make all necessary preparations.',
        'DaiInTheVeld' => 'An exotic bird arrived this morning with a letter attached to its back. The letter is an open challenge from a raider clan called "The Sons of the Veld". They say that you\'re ugly. I have already prepared the ships, so let\'s go visit them. They need to be taught that insults do not go unpunished.',
        'DaiIronOutOfBronze' => 'The old alchemist has come up with a new serum that can turn swords into iron swords. He says that he found the formula inside an old tree near the waterfalls. The problem is that the serum treatment consumes a lot of bronze swords to produce the iron swords. No matter though - it might come useful!',
        'DaiIslandOfThePirates' => 'We have obtained a request for help from a nearby seaport. The inhabitants of Dagger Island have been attacked by cruel bandits, and urgently need military support!',
        'DaiKittyLure' => 'A small kid just arrived at our gates. He was dirty and tired, and spoke of a small village that needs our help against some bandits. We should send out some of our troops.',
        'DaiLiberty' => 'Problems again! We\'ve found out that somebody is recruiting our people for unknown reasons! And now we\'ve also received a message! If you would be so kind and follow me to the main chambers…',
        'DaiLibrary' => 'A couple of caring parents approached me today. They told me we need some kind of a library, a place where our kids can learn about the world. We have to prepare the next generation for the world outside, so they asked if you can help them out with some books.',
        'DaiLocalAlchemist' => 'A man approached me this morning. He was nervous and excited as he explained to me how close he was to inventing the Philosopher\'s Stone. He just needs some gold to compare to the one he was able to create.',
        'DaiLotsOfGunpowder' => 'Old Tempar, the cannon master, has told me that they\'ve received a new kind of cannon that can deal more damage if loaded with sufficient gunpowder. That means they\'re going to need a lot of it!',
        'DaiLovelyGold' => 'Your cousin\'s attack was not as effective as he\'d hoped. Furthermore, he forgot to pay his mercenaries! You should send him some coins if you want to avoid a mutiny!',
        'DaiMarbleOutOfStone' => 'One of your stonecutters is extremely excited, talking of an epoch-making invention of his that can transform stone into marble! You should try it!',
        'DaiMeatForTheNeighbors' => 'A terrible disease has ravaged a neighbouring city, killing many animals. Now, meat is in extremely short supply. Can you spare some from your stock?',
        'DaiMilitaryExtension' => 'One of your ships has disappeared during its most recent voyage, with several of your soldiers on board. They were heading for the Maioranna Triangle. We have sent a search party in hope of finding them, but until they get back we should train some new soldiers!',
        'DaiMoreAdventures' => 'Your mother-in-law has invited herself for a visit and you are not keen on answering her stupid questions. Better make yourself scarce for a while.',
        'DaiMoreCorn' => 'A farmer came to the Mayor\'s House today to complain about some wild animals destroying his wheatfield. We\'ve already sent a search party to capture the wild animals, but in the meantime we should also support the inhabitant. Let\'s build him a wheatfield!',
        'DaiMotivation' => 'Our settlers seem very tired lately. It must be because of those weird scents coming from the woods. They are making everyone sleepy and hungry. We should prepare some food for them! Maybe the food will raise their spirits!',
        'DaiMythBusters' => 'There is a discussion going on. Which swords are better - damascene or platinum? Two guys want to test them out, and maybe bust one or two myths about swords.',
        'DaiNegotiationSkills' => 'You should always keep your negotiation skills finely honed. To have the right touch in this area can be of great advantage.',
        'DaiNeighborlyHelp' => 'We\'re about to welcome a group of high ranking visitors from Capital Island, all friends of King Damien! I fear we will not be able to provide them with all the goods they need! Maybe one of your friends can help?',
        'DaiNewFarm' => 'We have some farmers living at the foot of the old mountain. Why is it called the old mountain? I guess because it\'s old, he he! The farmers want to build some more farms, but they need some stone. Let\'s provide some!',
        'DaiNewHelpForTheodor' => 'Once again, Theodor is in desperate need of your help. He\'s received an order from King Damien, but hasn\'t got the resources to fulfill it. Perhaps you can assist?',
        'DaiNewLand' => 'You extended your land, and with this comes lots of resources. Time to harvest them and increase your stocks.',
        'DaiNewSettlers' => 'A group of people from a neighbouring region has come to you and wants to settle on your land. Provide them with the necessary materials to build their houses.',
        'DaiNobleFurniture' => 'Some of the richest families have decided to design some fancy furniture to decorate their homes. Only the best wood can be used, of course.',
        'DaiNobleHouses' => 'A very rich lord in your settlement just finished building his new house. To make it stand out, he\'s asked you for some Beanstalks. He plans on planting them around his house to cover those empty walls.',
        'DaiNotEnoughGoods' => 'Your brother Theodor has been trading for a short while now. Although he has traded iron ore, he seems to have forgotten that he does not have enough in stock to complete the deal. Quickly obtain some iron ore for him before he gets in trouble.',
        'DaiNutritionForTheNew' => 'Your new settlers have built their houses very fast and are quite hard-working. However, they are in need of food. Provide them some nutrition until they can produce enough food of their own.',
        'DaiOrigami' => 'I didn\'t even know you could do that. This guy from the east is an artist, he just creates sculptures out of paper! Maybe if we give him a lot, he\'ll create something special for us...',
        'DaiPepperoni' => 'To celebrate her 93rd birthday, your oldest living settler, Irma, plans to make her famous pepperoni. But to finish her recipe, she\'ll need some saltpeter.',
        'DaiPirateLife' => 'We got an urgent letter that we must see too. Pack your bags, ready your generals, we\'re leaving as soon as possible!',
        'DaiRaiseYourStock' => 'A traveller residing at your royal court has introduced you to hunting. Now, you want to establish a group for that sport. Provide the necessary resources.',
        'DaiRanAground' => 'A courier reaches you with a message saying that a ship has run aground along your coast. Unfortunately, it is not possible for them to send help, so they ask you for tools to repair the ships.',
        'DaiReforesting' => 'You decide once again to take a long walk through your lands. As you reach the woodcutting area, the wood appears to be thinner than it used to be. You decide to have it reforested.',
        'DaiReparations' => 'During operations over the last few weeks, the equipment of your soldiers has become tattered. Raise your stock of steel to be able to afford repairs.',
        'DaiSecludedExperiments' => 'Your military advisor has confided in you, telling of the feelings of insecurity among your settlers, brought on by tales of people disappearing at the border of your realm. You should show them quickly that they have nothing to fear.',
        'DaiSecondWave' => 'Your cousin has finished the first phase, and the first wave of recruits is on its way. Now he needs new resources for the next one.',
        'DaiSettlerOnTheMoon' => 'You won\'t believe it... I just met a man who told me he can get to the moon. Yeah - that moon. He says all he needs is a cannon, a barrel, and lots of gunpowder...',
        'DaiSleepyReef' => 'There\'s a small island called Sleepy Reef where one of King Damien\'s ex-general lives. I\'ve heard from a scout that there are traitors gathering around the island! This is not good news! We should head over there and stop them damaging the island and harming its citizens!',
        'DaiSocialBehavior' => 'A holiday draws near that is going to boost the social attitude of the people. You should set a good example and show them how social behavior works.',
        'DaiSpecialForces' => 'An ambassador sent by a king from the south just arrived at our gates. He\'s heard about our victorious troops, and asks if they can train the troops of his king. Would you send out your best man to help him?',
        'DaiStrongAllies' => 'One of our sages has predicted a heat wave that\'s going to hit one of your friends\' islands! We should go and help him prepare! You never know what a heat wave can do…',
        'DaiSupplyForTheodor' => 'Your brother Theodor has invited you to his estate. Of course, he has a ulterior motive; he needs a few small things. Produce some carriages to make transportation possible.',
        'DaiTheAnimalInitiative' => 'To guarantee the continued survival of different kinds of animals, King Damien has decided to catch animals and exchange them with other lands in order to refresh the bloodlines and introduce new animals to the land. Support the king with this initiative!',
        'DaiTheBakery' => 'The new settlers have opened a bakery. However, they do not yet produce enough flour to fully supply the bakery. Come to their aid a little.',
        'DaiTheBear' => 'A huge bear is making trouble in your land and the people are understandably afraid of it. You have to do something, but do not want to harm the bear. So, here\'s your brilliant idea; why not build a compound for it and allow the people to see it in captivity?',
        'DaiTheBoneDiscovery' => 'Helvian Kones, a famous archeologist from Capital Island, comes to us excitedly and reports of a bone discovery. Unluckily, the find is buried too deep in the mountain for you to dig it out alone. Help Kones expose the bones!',
        'DaiTheDefendOfTheVillage' => 'A good friend of yours contacts you with a request for a favor. He is the leader of a small desert tribe, and recently the animals in his area have become quite aggressive. The trouble is, he has no weapons to defend the village. Help him out with a few bows.',
        'DaiTheExhibition' => 'A long while ago you helped Helvian Kones, the archeologist, to launch an excavation of a bone. Now, it is complete… and the bones look like they are from a huge animal. Because you have never seen anything like it, you do not want to withhold the find from your settlers. Exhibit the bones publicly.',
        'DaiTheFearAmongstTheSettlers' => 'A short while ago, you exhibited the bones of a huge animal. Even though it was absolutely fascinating, your settlers also got frightened, and now they long for proof that such an animal does not exist anymore. Helvian Kones has offered his services, but he really needs some specialists to help explore this phenomenon. Hire some!',
        'DaiTheGreatDiscovery' => 'A strong glow is emanating underwater near the southern shore. One of our fishermen has made a discovery underwater! However, he needs supplies to recuperate his find. Give him what he needs. Maybe he\'ll come back with great treasure?',
        'DaiTheGreatFeast' => 'Last week one of our lords made a deal with some foreigners. He sold them some old statues he found in his backyard. Now the lords have asked you to help them welcome the buyers! I guess we can surprise them with our best food!',
        'DaiTheHugeStatue' => 'King Damien wants to build a small island in the sea, right in front of Capital Island, and it will require a great amount of resources. The idea is to build a huge statue on the island to welcome all new settlers. Everyone is requested to help the king build the monument.',
        'DaiTheKingsMonument' => 'King Damien wants to build himself a monument, and of course it has to be made of gold. Because he says he doesn\'t have any at the moment - a fact that I very much doubt - he wants you to send him some gold ore. Organize this quickly and deliver it as soon as possible to Capital Island!',
        'DaiTheLastTime' => 'Your scouts bring word of an attack planned against your brother. Although you\'d decided not to help him again, you cannot let the attacker get away with this! After all, family comes first, right? Let\'s send his military leader some quality weapons… just to be sure he can defend himself!',
        'DaiTheLostSkull' => 'I don\'t mean to bother you, but sadly I have some disturbing news. Apparently, there was once a very famous pirate captain, but he died while looking for lost treasure on Skull Island. Now, some brave young pirates have decided to go and find him, or more importantly, the treasure. Don\'t ask me why, but King Damien insists we go stop them at once! They shall not put their dirty hands on that treasure! The King also mentioned he would like us to find the captain\'s Skull. We need to find that island and do what our King asks of us!',
        'DaiTheMonster' => 'Settlers are reporting a huge beast lurking around in the forest. It only comes out at night! Your inhabitants feel insecure and ask you to check on it. Prepare a search party to deal with the monster.',
        'DaiTheMostBeautifulCities' => 'King Damien has announced that once again the time has come to decide which are the most beautiful cities. Noble residences give an obvious advantage. Does your city stand a chance?',
        'DaiTheMostBeautifulCityInTheLand' => 'A short while ago, King Damien came for a visit and was unsure whether to nominate your city. Now, he has announced a new visit and will be arriving soon. Help persuade the king to make a positive decision.',
        'DaiThePlay' => 'Today I met a nice man. His name is William, and he told me about his work. He\'s a director, and he wants to create a new play in our town. I don\'t want to give too much away, but it\'s about a man who robs the rich to give to the poor, and William has to find the perfect person to play the main protagonist. The only criteria is, he should know his way around a bow. Can we send some longbowmen over there? Maybe one of them will catch William\'s attention.',
        'DaiTheProposal' => 'Your brother Theodor is anxious. He has a new beloved he wants to marry. For the proposal, he wants to build a pavilion on a hillside, but he needs additional granite. Will you have pity on him and give him what he needs?',
        'DaiTheRace' => 'Just saw two people discussing whose horse is faster, and it hit me - let\'s make a wagon race!',
        'DaiTheSausageCompetition' => 'A competition is about to be held: who makes the best sausage? You can\'t miss out on this! Submit your sausage for judging.',
        'DaiTheSecretOrder' => 'A strange murmur goes through your land. Dark shapes wander through our streets at night and inhabitants disappear without a trace! People tell of a new brotherhood. Apparently they have found some true shadow essence and now can use it to travel around quickly! We must stop them before it\'s too late!',
        'DaiTheSleepingVolcano' => 'A new cult has emerged on Flintrock island. They plan to revive an old sleeping volcano, and that would mean they\'re going to eventually burn the island to ashes. We should deal with this, as Flintrock is part of our alliance!',
        'DaiTheWorldOfTrading' => 'Your favorite brother Theodor wants to start large-scale trading. However, he has no idea how to go about it. Show him how trading functions.',
        'DaiTheatre' => 'Traveling actors are visiting your island, and have given a stunning theatrical performance. The settlers left delighted, and so did you! Provide an extra tip for the artists to make sure they come again!',
        'DaiTheodorNeedsHelp' => 'Your younger brother Theodor has written you a letter. Oh joy! He writes that he\'s finally begun to settle down, just like you. Unfortunately, he has miscalculated and is now out of hardwood. Unsurprisingly, he\'s asked if you could help him out.',
        'DaiTimberWorm' => 'The trees of Capital Island are being attacked by a timber worm which has already gouged through over 50 percent of the trees. King Damien is angry! We need to send some examples of our wood to the king\'s scientists, to make sure that our trees are not affected.',
        'DaiTitanNarrow' => 'Rumours of a shortage of Titanium have started to spread in the marketplace, causing a sudden jump in prices. Quick! Make sure you have some in reserve, just in case.',
        'DaiTournament' => 'Our people have been asking for more entertainment. Luckily, I met William. He has an idea - a tournament where our finest knights perform against each other, both on horseback and on their feet. Of course, the contest will have to take place under certain rules... but it could be good?',
        'DaiTraitors' => 'I bring ill news! I have received reports from my spies that the upper nobility is about to turn against you! This cannot be allowed!',
        'DaiTropicalSun' => 'Quick! We must find the time to travel to the Sunrimm Islands! There\'s something wrong at our friend Lord Walder\'s village!',
        'DaiTrueFriends' => 'You know those loudmouths down at the pier? They\'re spreading rumours that you do not have true friends, because you never receive anything in return for your generosity. Prove them wrong.',
        'DaiUnsatisfiedSettlers' => 'Your settlers are unsatisfied and have started moaning about bad weather and the excessively long paths they have to walk. You can find a remedy for at least one of these problems.',
        'DaiValuableJugs' => 'You want to organize an exhibition of valuable jugs. Unfortunately, you don\'t really have enough beautiful examples to fill an exhibition. Produce some copper so that additional ones can be produced.',
        'DaiValuableWater' => 'Water is a basic production good that is essential to several production chains. You should always produce enough water to secure an effective and steady flow of goods. Luckily, our architects are doing a nice job making everything look so beautiful!',
        'DaiWarmerRegions' => 'Dark clouds have gathered above an island to the south! We\'ve never seen such manifestations before! Our alchemist, Waltor the Grey, believes it to be the work of an old friend of his who is adept in dark magic! Let\'s not waste any more time! We need to take care of the problem!',
        'DaiWellFilled' => 'Effective wood production is always important for your economy. Make sure you have a well filled wood storage at all times.',
        'DaiWitchHunt' => 'Our troops found a new island last summer that has a swamp on it. It was filled with weird wooden structures. They believed it to be a witch hut, but they never got back to make sure. Well, it actually was a witch hut, and that witch is back. We need to take care of it!',
        'DaiWrongOrder' => 'One of your explorers found an old shrine high up on a mountain to the north. It seems to me that it was built to honor an old king who loved these lands. We want to honor the king by rebuilding the shrine, but we\'ll need some materials. Please provide the materials we need!',
        'EMDaiBalls' => 'Your strikers have been practicing shots for hours - and the practice balls can\'t take much more. 
We\'ll need to have some new balls made - but for that, we\'ll need some raw materials first. You can ask the butchers to hold on to bladders and leather.',
        'EMDaiCelebration' => 'The support from your Settlers during this competition so far has been a pure delight, and leads to you expressing your gratitude by decreeing a new public holiday, the celebration of which demands a special holiday sausage! Provide some sausage to celebrate the championship!',
        'EMDaiCleats' => 'With fascination, you inspect your opponent\'s equipment and find that they have some quite advanced material. Apparently, your foes put their trust in boots with metal cleats, and cozy calf warmers. Well, you certainly don\'t want to look second-rate, so you task your best men to produce some of these impressive boosts.
Make sure that enough iron is available!',
        'EMDaiConcentration' => 'It would certainly help the concentration of your athletes if the spectators stands didn\'t creak so loudly! How is one to exercise properly when the entire hall is groaning and moaning? You should take care of this nuisance; supply some wood for the repairs of your gym!',
        'EMDaiConfetti' => 'Your settlers would like to support your team however they can, both during and after matches, and have specifically asked about the use of confetti.
Only the best paper on the island will make for colourful and light confetti. It seems like a bit of a waste, but motivation goes a long way towards winning the tournament.',
        'EMDaiCubicles' => 'Your athletes complain about having the feeling they\'re being watched sometimes. Certainly, the dilapidated cubicles and missing doors in your dressing rooms might have something to do with that. Some privacy would certainly help them concentrate before the matches. If you can spare some wood planks, you\'ll be able to order the repair of your cubicles!',
        'EMDaiDiet' => 'Astonishingly, the brew diet for your athletes seems to come with some unforeseen side effects. Along with some difficulties in expressing themselves and an alarming sense of balance, your men also complain of feeling bloated. Your medical officers recommend switching to water. Supply them with enough fresh water, and your men should be back on track in no time!',
        'EMDaiDummies' => 'Your men have completely worn their training equipment out. They\'ve used their training dummies so much that effective training just isn\'t possible anymore. In order keep up with the level of competition in this international tournament, you should waste no time investing in top quality materials this time.',
        'EMDaiFireworks' => 'You certainly seem confident that your team is going to win the championship. If you\'re really sure, you should commission some fireworks for the inevitable victory celebration.',
        'EMDaiFraternal' => 'You can\'t help but notice a certain tension between your Settlers and those of the neighbouring islands. The ongoing competition appears to have fostered a competitive attitude that you feel should not be tolerated. Set a good example and spread the fraternal spirit: visit a friend\'s island and buff one of their workyards!',
        'EMDaiFreebeer' => 'Your Settlers have been exceedingly committed to preparing their next match lately. In order to keep up the good spirit and to properly show your appreciation you should hand out some free brew for everyone!',
        'EMDaiFriendly' => 'Some of your team’s players are lacking in experience. Arrange a friendly match and assemble a squad of 11 recruits to play against!',
        'EMDaiGraffiti' => 'Enthusiasm for the tournament occasionally seems to go a little overboard among your settlers. Over the course of a little vespertine drinking session, some of your supporters have scrawled inspirational slogans across the walls of the mayor\'s house. Regrettably, the markings are not always family friendly, so it is recommended that you get them cleaned up quickly.
Provide some marble for repairs on the mayor\'s house!',
        'EMDaiHottestDay' => 'Over the last few days, temperatures have been rising higher and higher. Today it is almost unbearable. Your squad needs way more drinking water than usual. Provide some from your storage!',
        'EMDaiHygiene' => 'It might not be essential for success in the tournament, but it should concern you that even cattle is hot-footing it away from your athletes. Perhaps hygiene hasn\'t been a priority lately, with all the training they\'ve been doing?! A hot bath never hurt anyone, so provide some coal to get your boys scrubbed off in hot water!',
        'EMDaiJerseys' => 'Your players\' jerseys are starting to show some wear and tear. If they\'re going to be representing your island, they really should look the part.
Luckily, I\'ve already found a decent tailor who can bring the kits up to scratch. She just needs some supplies.',
        'EMDaiMagazine' => 'A supportive settler volunteers to produce and hand out stadium magazines during matches. He asks you for some quality materials to print on.',
        'EMDaiNervous' => 'Your athletes are a little concerned about the quality of their travel comfort. Specifically, they seem worried they might not even reach their destination alive, due to the state of their current means of transport. Be lenient and send a few craftsmen with tools for inspection!',
        'EMDaiParade' => 'Your athletes are revered by your Settlers. They even demand to meet their idols in the flesh in order to express their adoration. Consequently, you decide to arrange a grand parade in honour of your heroes. No decent parade can do without horses though. Provide a few freshly-trained specimen for the event!',
        'EMDaiPavement' => 'Daily jogging takes its toll, and not just on your recruits; the roads of your empire show serious signs of wear, with the trampling of your well-fed boys literally leaving its mark. To make sure your economy continues running smoothly, you should order repairs of your sidewalks.
Place stone at disposal to repair your streets!',
        'EMDaiProtection' => 'Some of your opponents have employed some really mean kicks, a technique that appears to you as unfittingly rude for such a fair competition. Consequently, you feel that this ploy needs to be faced with proper equipment. Shin protection made of steel seems like an appropriate response.
Bring some steel to arm your men!',
        'EMDaiRepairs' => 'One of the tournament’s stadiums needs some safety repairs. You can’t risk any of the crowd getting injured. Provide the materials needed to carry out the repairs!',
        'EMDaiRing' => 'You have been informed that other kingdoms are granting their athletes souvenir rings of this great tournament. As your men have rendered outstanding service, you find their demand for such rings only fair. Provide some gold ore to appropriately immortalize the efforts of this championship.',
        'EMDaiSaboteurs' => 'A friendly rival has given me a tip that an unknown, dishonorable opponent is sabotaging competing teams\' training equipment.
It would be wise to post a couple of elite soldiers outside the store room at night.',
        'EMDaiShakespeare' => 'Traveling actors are visiting your island, and have given a stunning theatrical performance of Shakespeare’s “A Midsummer Night’s Dream”. As a team building measure, you and your squad attended the play. The players left delighted, and so did you! Provide an extra tip for the artists to make sure they come again next summer!',
        'EMDaiSouvenirs' => 'Your inhabitants are thrilled about the ongoing tournament. They demand souvenirs of the spectacle so they can reminisce about it with their offspring. Provide the required iron ore so they can produce the much sought-after souvenirs!',
        'EMDaiStadiumsnack' => 'A group of particularly enterprising Settlers has approached you with a promising business idea. They intend to sell all sorts of crispy snacks and nibbles to the audiences at the tournament venues. It\'s a lucrative idea, and all they need is for you to sell them enough flour and water.',
        'EMDaiStands' => 'Your team has so many fans that the stands are threatening to collapse under their combined weight! 
You must reinforce them with better wood.',
        'EMDaiSteaks' => 'After the many privations and hard training, your men deserve a hearty meal every once in a while. To raise their spirits and strengthen their morale, you\'d like to serve them some very decent fillets.
Supply your men with fresh meat!',
        'EMDaiTradebeer' => 'The many exotic nations of the tournament send a wave of inspiration through the kitchens of your empire. Suddenly, your people lust for foreign fruit and fancy spices! Meet the demands of your Settlers and trade using some of that brew that sparkles so nicely!',
        'EMDaiTraining' => 'Your team is slacking off during practice. It\'s time to show them what training really means!
We\'ll have them join your troops for a few drills under one of the more notorious drill sergeants.',
        'EMDaiTravelsnack' => 'Travel to the venues is long and tedious, and it\'s common knowledge there is really nothing useful one can do on a journey besides eating. Make the journey more bearable for everyone by providing bread for some decent sandwiches along the way.',
        'EMDaiWhistles' => 'Discipline is important. Your coaches seem to be having trouble getting through to their charges, judging by the chaos in your barracks. Your boys will never get in shape in time at this rate! Perhaps a few whistles would give your instructors some authority, and allow for some more orderly training.
Provide bronze for whistles!',
        'EMEventAdvQ1' => 'The defensive stance of your first opponent might suggest diffidence, and tempt the foolhardy general into carelessness. However, rest assured that these men, hardened by some fateful battles, have quite a few perfidious tricks up their sleeves, and their injuries may not be as serious as they make out.',
        'EMEventAdvQ2' => 'They seem unpredictable and wayward, but it would not be advisable to underestimate them. Among them are some of the most experienced and well versed fighters, yet word is that their own trainers seem to struggle with their rigidity. It is even reported that in the face of defeat, some of them become inappropriately headstrong...',
        'EMEventAdvQ3' => 'You are now facing veterans of this tournament, even if their historical feats are not always undisputed. These all-weather champions seem quick to battle and always ready for a jolly knees-up, but they can also quickly turn a battle in their favor without much of a plan.',
        'EMEventAdvQ4' => 'One ought to be surprised how ruthless the men from these otherwise cultivated lands can act in battle. These valiant combatants used to win their battles with skill and finesse, proving to be formidable opponents. These days, it is said that when particularly challenged, they resort to combat techniques similar to those practiced in the east.',
        'EMEventAdvQ5' => 'With almost mechanical routine these contestants have turned many a battle in their favor, often not exactly with tactical flair. It seems that only their predictability and confidence in victory could possibly be their undoing. Yet, they may have met their match with you. If you manage to bring them out of their shell, victory is already within reach.',
        'EMEventAdvQ6' => 'How deceptively graceful these apparitions may appear when seen scurrying across the battlefield. These sinuous combatants might tempt the short-witted to underestimate their actual proficiency. But beware, your opponents are astute strategists that are up to every trick in the book. Many opponents have already fallen prey to their clever tactical scheming.',
        'EasAGoodbyePresent' => 'A letter lies on your bed. You open it and see new coordinates for an island. Furthermore, you find an accompanying handwritten letter saying “Thank you for your help. Without you, Easter would have been a disaster. As a gift, we have hidden some more Easter eggs. Have fun searching."',
        'EasALongSearch' => 'The settler reports excitedly about the Easter bunny\'s brother being found unconscious in the garden. It seems he had no energy left because he hadn\'t eaten for quite some time. Provide him something to eat so that he can recover.',
        'EasEasterEggShed' => 'Before the paper chase can go on, you must store the Easter eggs somewhere. You should build a little shed where they can be stored without getting wet.',
        'EasMissingEasterEggs' => 'You take a look at the map and quickly get an idea of what the brother is about to say. He asks you to help collect the missing eggs, and promises to let you keep some of the eggs if you do.',
        'EasMissingMap' => 'A message from the Easter bunny reaches you, telling you that he went all out and fell ill. His brother inherited the task, but he cannot find the map for the last stage of the paper chase. Gather a search party and help him with the search.',
        'EasPaperChaseFinalStage' => 'The Easter bunny\'s brother has already left to hide the remaining Easter eggs. You decide to do the same and visit the last paper chase island.',
        'EasPaperChaseStage1' => 'You have got the coordinates for the first stage of the paper chase. Follow the instructions on the map.
Note: You can start the adventure by clicking on it. No general is required to complete it. Just go to the coordinates and gather all the Easter eggs.',
        'EasPaperChaseStage2' => 'The coordinates for the second stage have arrived. Now the paper chase can continue. So, take your basket and keep on collecting…',
        'EasStartOfThePaperChase' => 'Bored, you take a look at your mail as you recognize a letter from the Easter bunny. He invites you to a paper chase. Should you be able to catch him, you will get a nice reward. You accept the invitation. First, you need to build a big basket for the Easter eggs.',
        'EasTakingABreak' => 'Today is a day for relaxing, my friend. How about a brew on the field?',
        'EasTheDamagedBackpack' => 'As you return to your island, the Easter bunny\'s brother awaits you with noticeably drooping ears. He tells you that while hiding the Easter eggs he realised too late that he had a hole in his backpack. You decide to help him to get his backpack repaired.',
        'EasTheEndOfTheAdventure' => 'Now it seems the end of the chase is really drawing near. You decide to be extraordinarily efficient this time. And with the help of the rabbit, what could possibly go wrong?',
        'EasTheLastIsland' => 'The moment your arrive, you visit the rabbit. He tells you of the last island where he hid Easter eggs. He wants to accompany you, but there are wild beasts on the island. Recruit some military units to protect him.',
        'EasTheMemoryPotion' => 'After returning you speak immediately to the rabbit, but he cannot remember anything before dropping from exhaustion. One of your settlers tells you about a memory potion that brings back memory completely. Provide all necessary ingredients to the settler.',
        'EasTheMissionEasterEggRecovery' => 'You got an exact description of the old man. It really seems like the Easter bunny\'s brother hid the eggs in the wrong area. So, the mission "Easter egg recovery" must goes on.',
        'EasTheOldMan' => 'No sweat. Now let\'s move on. According to the Easter bunny\'s brother, this is the last area where he lost Easter eggs. So, let\'s go!',
        'EasTheSearchGoesOn' => 'The map with the new coordinates lies on the desk waiting to be picked up. So, let\'s go on the next Easter egg hunt!',
        'EasTheSurprise' => 'Now that the Easter adventure seems to have ended, you should take a look at trading. Prices have very likely changed and maybe you can get a bargain.',
        'EasTradings' => 'Unfortunately, the potion still isn\'t working. No matter how intensively you ask, the rabbit still can\'t remember. One of your treasurers comes to you and requests you take care of business while the rabbit regains its memory.',
        'EasUnreadableHandwriting' => 'The Easter bunny\'s brother remembers the first island where he hid Easter eggs by mistake. He also remembers that he could not read his brother\'s handwriting, so he improvised... incorrectly. You should start a new search.',
        'EasWeeklyDailyQuest_Delay' => 'Oh, it\'s you again. OK - let\'s get to it! You\'ve done a great job so far, so now it\'s up to us to make our preparations. Please come back later, and we\'ll decide how to progress.',
        'Easter2015_TutAchievementBuild_Sub02' => 'Now I need you to place the building. It\'s a specific residence which currently holds 40 settlers. With every upgrade, it will be able to hold more tenants. 

To get the highest level, you\'ll need to finish almost all the achievements for me. Sounds like a lot of work? Well, it will be - but it\'ll be worth it when you can show off your shiny new level 5 achievement building.

Who else can say, he has a giant Easter egg-like house in his kingdom?',
        'Easter2015_TutAchievements' => 'Ok, you won\'t believe me when I say this, but... I\'ve brought you a little present. You know, since it\'s Easter and all. Easter! 

Anyway, I need your help with some various Easter related tasks. Since I know there are a lot of slackers out there, I\'ve decided to only be nice to those who really help me out.

So, here\'s the deal: I\'ll give you this cool Easter residence building for free. It\'s unique, and only for this Easter. But instead of paying for your upgrade, I want you to do stuff for me. What kind of stuff? Well, let\'s start at the beginning.',
        'Easter2015_TutAchievements_Sub01' => 'So, you want to know what I need you to do? 

Check out the achievement panel! There are specific Easter-related achievements there, which you can only complete during this event. Each achievement is worth a certain amount of points. 

I will give you the Easter achievement building now.
Instead of spending resources on upgrades, it can be upgraded when you earn achievements and collect achievement points from the Easter event. Every new upgrade level will require more points.

Check out how you can go about earning points in the respective achievement section.',
        'Easter2016_Main1Elite' => 'Greetings. I hope you can help me. I found this person near the tavern. It seems he cannot remember where he is or was. I don\'t know what to do with him. Could you take care of him?',
        'Easter2016_Main1EliteSub1' => 'Where am I? I can\'t remember anything… It seems I went a little overboard last night. Oh that\'s right - my pal the Easter bunny asked me to help him hide Easter eggs! But where are they? Hmm... Could you please help me? I\'m sure my memory will come back if you give me some brew! Not the rough stuff you can purchase. I want the good, self produced stuff!',
        'Easter2016_Main1EliteSub2' => 'I remember myself walking across an island. Hmm.. But where? I\'m sure it wasn\'t here. Could you send out one of your explorers? Maybe he can find a clue.',
        'Easter2016_Main1EliteSub3' => 'Looks like a kind of treasure map. Hmm… It shows an island. I need you to get me there! Don\'t look at me like that - do you want to disappoint the Easter bunny? Come on, let\'s go!',
        'Easter2016_Main1EliteSub4' => 'I can\'t just go to my Easter pal and tell him some eggs are missing! We need to further enlighten our minds. Since brew doesn\'t seem to work, we should use bread and water instead. Give me some of yours, and make sure it\'s the good stuff!',
        'Easter2016_Main1EliteSub5' => 'So, this is where we should go. I know, it is no Picasso painting, but it will have to do. Why are you still standing there? Come on, the eggs won\'t gather themselves!',
        'Easter2016_Main1High' => 'Greetings. I hope you can help me. I found this person near the tavern. It seems he cannot remember where he is or was. I don\'t know what to do with him. Could you take care of him?',
