        'Easter2016_Main1Middle' => 'Greetings. I hope you can help me. I found this person near the tavern. It seems he cannot remember where he is or was. I don\'t know what to do with him. Could you take care of him?',
        'Easter2016_Main1MiddleSub1' => 'Where am I? I can\'t remember anything… It seems I went a little overboard last night. Oh that\'s right - my pal the Easter bunny asked me to help him hide Easter eggs! But where are they? Hmm... Could you please help me? I\'m sure my memory will come back if you give me some brew! Not the rough stuff you can purchase. I want the good, self produced stuff!',
        'Easter2016_Main1MiddleSub2' => 'I remember myself walking across an island. Hmm.. But where? I\'m sure it wasn\'t here. Could you send out one of your explorers? Maybe he can find a clue.',
        'Easter2016_Main1MiddleSub3' => 'Looks like a kind of treasure map. Hmm… It shows an island. I need you to get me there! Don\'t look at me like that - do you want to disappoint the Easter bunny? Come on, let\'s go!',
        'Easter2016_Main1MiddleSub4' => 'I can\'t just go to my Easter pal and tell him some eggs are missing! We need to further enlighten our minds. Since brew doesn\'t seem to work, we should use bread and water instead. Give me some of yours, and make sure it\'s the good stuff!',
        'Easter2016_Main1MiddleSub5' => 'So, this is where we should go. I know, it is no Picasso painting, but it will have to do. Why are you still standing there? Come on, the eggs won\'t gather themselves!',
        'Easter2016_Main2Elite' => 'I am really sorry, but I couldn\'t hold this man back. He says you owe him eggs. Honestly, I have no idea what he is talking about, but maybe… Hey!',
        'Easter2016_Main2EliteSub1' => 'Hey you! One of your settlers has run into my wagon and broken it. When it crashed, all my eggs were thrown from it. Your settler was in a hurry and just gave me your name as the person to go to. He said you would compensate me, so here I am! Give me my compensation and I will forget all about the matter.',
        'Easter2016_Main2EliteSub2' => 'So, what\'s the plan? You don\'t have one? That is unacceptable. If you do not have a plan, you should find someone who does! Let\'s think… I think your settler ran into me when I was near a mine or something. Maybe we should begin there?',
        'Easter2016_Main2EliteSub3' => 'This really is a mess. I have no time for this! Wait. They said the mining settler painted it while he was in the mine. Maybe we\'ll find it if we dig deeper?! Let\'s try it! What? Come on, we don\'t have all day!',
        'Easter2016_Main2EliteSub4' => 'So, back to work! What did you find? A map? Let me take a look! Hmm… looks like an island, but I don\'t recognize it. What? You do? Oh well, I guess you\'re not completely useless after all! What are we waiting for? Let\'s go!',
        'Easter2016_Main2EliteSub5' => 'What do you mean "A second map"? Jeez… There\'s no end to this. Why are you still standing here? Easter is getting closer and closer, and the Easter bunny needs the eggs!',
        'Easter2016_Main2High' => 'I am really sorry, but I couldn\'t hold this man back. He says you owe him eggs. Honestly, I have no idea what he is talking about, but maybe… Hey!',
        'Easter2016_Main2HighSub1' => 'Hey you! One of your settlers has run into my wagon and broken it. When it crashed, all my eggs were thrown from it. Your settler was in a hurry and just gave me your name as the person to go to. He said you would compensate me, so here I am! Give me my compensation and I will forget all about the matter.',
        'Easter2016_Main2HighSub2' => 'So, what\'s the plan? You don\'t have one? That is unacceptable. If you do not have a plan, you should find someone who does! Let\'s think… I think your settler ran into me when I was near a mine or something. Maybe we should begin there?',
        'Easter2016_Main2HighSub3' => 'This really is a mess. I have no time for this! Wait. They said the mining settler painted it while he was in the mine. Maybe we\'ll find it if we dig deeper?! Let\'s try it! What? Come on, we don\'t have all day!',
        'Easter2016_Main2HighSub4' => 'So, back to work! What did you find? A map? Let me take a look! Hmm… looks like an island, but I don\'t recognize it. What? You do? Oh well, I guess you\'re not completely useless after all! What are we waiting for? Let\'s go!',
        'Easter2016_Main2HighSub5' => 'What do you mean "A second map"? Jeez… There\'s no end to this. Why are you still standing here? Easter is getting closer and closer, and the Easter bunny needs the eggs!',
        'Easter2016_Main2Low' => 'I am really sorry, but I couldn\'t hold this man back. He says you owe him eggs. Honestly, I have no idea what he is talking about, but maybe… Hey!',
        'Easter2016_Main2LowSub1' => 'Hey you! One of your settlers has run into my wagon and broken it. When it crashed, all my eggs were thrown from it. Your settler was in a hurry and just gave me your name as the person to go to. He said you would compensate me, so here I am! Give me my compensation and I will forget all about the matter.',
        'Easter2016_Main2LowSub2' => 'So, what\'s the plan? You don\'t have one? That is unacceptable. If you do not have a plan, you should find someone who does! Let\'s think… I think your settler ran into me when I was near a mine or something. Maybe we should begin there?',
        'Easter2016_Main2LowSub3' => 'This really is a mess. I have no time for this! Wait. They said the mining settler painted it while he was in the mine. Maybe we\'ll find it if we dig deeper?! Let\'s try it! What? Come on, we don\'t have all day!',
        'Easter2016_Main2LowSub4' => 'So, back to work! What did you find? A map? Let me take a look! Hmm… looks like an island, but I don\'t recognize it. What? You do? Oh well, I guess you\'re not completely useless after all! What are we waiting for? Let\'s go!',
        'Easter2016_Main2LowSub5' => 'What do you mean "A second map"? Jeez… There\'s no end to this. Why are you still standing here? Easter is getting closer and closer, and the Easter bunny needs the eggs!',
        'Easter2016_Main2Middle' => 'I am really sorry, but I couldn\'t hold this man back. He says you owe him eggs. Honestly, I have no idea what he is talking about, but maybe… Hey!',
        'Easter2016_Main2MiddleSub1' => 'Hey you! One of your settlers has run into my wagon and broken it. When it crashed, all my eggs were thrown from it. Your settler was in a hurry and just gave me your name as the person to go to. He said you would compensate me, so here I am! Give me my compensation and I will forget all about the matter.',
        'Easter2016_Main2MiddleSub2' => 'So, what\'s the plan? You don\'t have one? That is unacceptable. If you do not have a plan, you should find someone who does! Let\'s think… I think your settler ran into me when I was near a mine or something. Maybe we should begin there?',
        'Easter2016_Main2MiddleSub3' => 'This really is a mess. I have no time for this! Wait. They said the mining settler painted it while he was in the mine. Maybe we\'ll find it if we dig deeper?! Let\'s try it! What? Come on, we don\'t have all day!',
        'Easter2016_Main2MiddleSub4' => 'So, back to work! What did you find? A map? Let me take a look! Hmm… looks like an island, but I don\'t recognize it. What? You do? Oh well, I guess you\'re not completely useless after all! What are we waiting for? Let\'s go!',
        'Easter2016_Main2MiddleSub5' => 'What do you mean "A second map"? Jeez… There\'s no end to this. Why are you still standing here? Easter is getting closer and closer, and the Easter bunny needs the eggs!',
        'Easter2016_Main3Elite' => 'I\'m very sorry to disturb you, but I found this strange looking person in front of the mayor\'s house. He seems pretty desperate. Could you maybe listen to him and help? If anyone can do something for the poor guy, it\'s you!',
        'Easter2016_Main3EliteSub0' => 'Hey, hi! Before I say any more, please allow me to show you a special map that I happen to hold. It can unveil great fortunes to the patient adventurer, but you must hold on to it until I can fully explain what\'s going on ...',
        'Easter2016_Main3EliteSub1' => 'Oh no! That is so cruel! What? Well, the Easter bunny picked my cousin and I to help him with the eggs this year, but I failed the test and he dismissed me. I have to win his trust back! First though, I need to sabotage my cousin\'s efforts. Go and steal his eggs! Why you, you ask? Well why not?',
        'Easter2016_Main3EliteSub2' => 'But this sabotage is not enough! We need to steal… erm… borrow more of his eggs! I\'m not sure where the other island lies, but I know someone who does - your baker! The good news is I have spoken to him already. The bad news is he won\'t help us for free. He wants you to support him, so I guess it is up to you again.',
        'Easter2016_Main3EliteSub3' => 'My cousin has an island there? Where did he get it? Anyway, it doesn\'t matter. Just make sure you get all eggs he has hidden. Why I am not going? Isn\'t that obvious? I need an alibi for the time being, so if you need to find me I\'ll be in the tavern!',
        'Easter2016_Main3EliteSub4' => 'Well, the Easter Bunny\'s first criticism was that I have no friends and no one likes me. I\'m the shy type, you know? So what\'s a loner like me to do? That\'s right! You can help me buy myself some friends. Find some money, give it to me and we can start buying them up! What? Don\'t worry, you\'ll get your money back... probably!',
        'Easter2016_Main3EliteSub5' => 'The other thing the Easter bunny disliked was that I was not "green" enough… He loves his ecology you know, so I\'ll show him I\'m totally into this whole nature thing and refill some of your natural deposits! What do you think? Nice idea, right?',
        'Easter2016_Main3High' => 'I\'m very sorry to disturb you, but I found this strange looking person in front of the mayor\'s house. He seems pretty desperate. Could you maybe listen to him and help? If anyone can do something for the poor guy, it\'s you!',
