        'Easter2016_Main3MiddleSub0' => 'Hey, hi! Before I say any more, please allow me to show you a special map that I happen to hold. It can unveil great fortunes to the patient adventurer, but you must hold on to it until I can fully explain what\'s going on ...',
        'Easter2016_Main3MiddleSub1' => 'Oh no! That is so cruel! What? Well, the Easter bunny picked my cousin and I to help him with the eggs this year, but I failed the test and he dismissed me. I have to win his trust back! First though, I need to sabotage my cousin\'s efforts. Go and steal his eggs! Why you, you ask? Well why not?',
