        'Easter2016_PartyCrasher_MainEasy1' => 'Oh no, this is bad! These guys are the party crashers. They\'re trying to ruin our Easter festivities by taking some of our eggs! We can fight them, or we can try to smooth things over peacefully. The choice is yours, but we have to address this problem before they cause more trouble!',
        'Easter2016_PartyCrasher_MainEasy2' => 'Ugh... here they are again. These guys seem to be fixated on crashing our party - and this time, they\'ve bought backup! How will we deal with them today?',
