        'Easter2016_PartyCrasher_Medium5Peace' => 'I personally believe that this situation can be resolved without fighting. Maybe if we give them something they really like, we can reach a truce and they\'ll stop bothering us for a while.',
        'Easter2016_PartyCrasher_Medium5War' => 'So these guys want to prepare for trouble? Then make it double! If we send our troops to "meet them", I\'m sure they\'ll have second thoughts, and will go look for trouble somewhere else.',
        'Easter2017_LevelRequirement' => 'No offence, but the way your city is right now, it\'s really not ready to hold the festivities. If you can grow it just a little bit more, we\'ll be all set!',
        'Easter2017_Main1Elite' => 'Greetings. I hope you can help me. I found this person near the tavern. It seems he cannot remember where he is and how he got here. I don\'t know what to do with him. Could you take care of him?',
        'Easter2017_Main1EliteSub1' => 'Where am I? I can\'t remember anything… It seems I went a little overboard last night. Oh that\'s right - my pal the Easter bunny asked me to help him hide Easter eggs! But where are they? Hmm... Could you please help me? I\'m sure my memory will come back if you give me some brew! Not the rough stuff you can purchase. I want the good, self produced stuff!',
        'Easter2017_Main1EliteSub2' => 'I remember myself walking across an island. Hmm.. But where? I\'m sure it wasn\'t here. Could you send out one of your explorers? Maybe he can find a clue.',
        'Easter2017_Main1EliteSub3' => 'Looks like a kind of treasure map. Hmm… It shows an island. I need you to get me there! Don\'t look at me like that - do you want to disappoint the Easter bunny? Come on, let\'s go!',
        'Easter2017_Main1EliteSub4' => 'I can\'t just go to my Easter pal and tell him some eggs are missing! We need to further enlighten our minds. Since brew doesn\'t seem to work, we should use bread and water instead. Give me some of yours, and make sure it\'s the good stuff!',
        'Easter2017_Main1EliteSub5' => 'So, this is where we should go. I know, it is no Picasso painting, but it will have to do. Why are you still standing there? Come on, the eggs won\'t gather themselves!',
        'Easter2017_Main1High' => 'Greetings. I hope you can help me. I found this person near the tavern. It seems he cannot remember where he is and how he got here. I don\'t know what to do with him. Could you take care of him?',
