        'Easter2017_Main1Middle' => 'Greetings. I hope you can help me. I found this person near the tavern. It seems he cannot remember where he is and how he got here. I don\'t know what to do with him. Could you take care of him?',
        'Easter2017_Main1MiddleSub1' => 'Where am I? I can\'t remember anything… It seems I went a little overboard last night. Oh that\'s right - my pal the Easter bunny asked me to help him hide Easter eggs! But where are they? Hmm... Could you please help me? I\'m sure my memory will come back if you give me some brew! Not the rough stuff you can purchase. I want the good, self produced stuff!',
        'Easter2017_Main1MiddleSub2' => 'I remember myself walking across an island. Hmm.. But where? I\'m sure it wasn\'t here. Could you send out one of your explorers? Maybe he can find a clue.',
        'Easter2017_Main1MiddleSub3' => 'Looks like a kind of treasure map. Hmm… It shows an island. I need you to get me there! Don\'t look at me like that - do you want to disappoint the Easter bunny? Come on, let\'s go!',
        'Easter2017_Main1MiddleSub4' => 'I can\'t just go to my Easter pal and tell him some eggs are missing! We need to further enlighten our minds. Since brew doesn\'t seem to work, we should use bread and water instead. Give me some of yours, and make sure it\'s the good stuff!',
        'Easter2017_Main1MiddleSub5' => 'So, this is where we should go. I know, it is no Picasso painting, but it will have to do. Why are you still standing there? Come on, the eggs won\'t gather themselves!',
        'Easter2017_Main2Elite' => 'I am really sorry, but I couldn\'t hold this man back. He says you owe him eggs. Honestly, I have no idea what he is talking about, but maybe… Hey!',
        'Easter2017_Main2EliteSub1' => 'Hey you! One of your settlers has run into my wagon and broken it. When it crashed, all my eggs were thrown from it. Your settler was in a hurry and just gave me your name as the person to go to. He said you would compensate me, so here I am! Give me my compensation and I will forget all about the matter.',
        'Easter2017_Main2EliteSub2' => 'So, what\'s the plan? You don\'t have one? That is unacceptable. If you do not have a plan, you should find someone who does! Let\'s think… I think your settler ran into me when I was near a mine or something. Maybe we should begin there?',
        'Easter2017_Main2EliteSub3' => 'This really is a mess. I have no time for this! Wait. They said the mining settler painted it while he was in the mine. Maybe we\'ll find it if we dig deeper?! Let\'s try it! What? Come on, we don\'t have all day!',
        'Easter2017_Main2EliteSub4' => 'So, back to work! What did you find? A map? Let me take a look! Hmm… looks like an island, but I don\'t recognize it. What? You do? Oh well, I guess you\'re not completely useless after all! What are we waiting for? Let\'s go!',
        'Easter2017_Main2EliteSub5' => 'What do you mean "A second map"? Jeez… There\'s no end to this. Why are you still standing here? Easter is getting closer and closer, and the Easter bunny needs the eggs!',
        'Easter2017_Main2High' => 'I am really sorry, but I couldn\'t hold this man back. He says you owe him eggs. Honestly, I have no idea what he is talking about, but maybe… Hey!',
        'Easter2017_Main2HighSub1' => 'Hey you! One of your settlers has run into my wagon and broken it. When it crashed, all my eggs were thrown from it. Your settler was in a hurry and just gave me your name as the person to go to. He said you would compensate me, so here I am! Give me my compensation and I will forget all about the matter.',
        'Easter2017_Main2HighSub2' => 'So, what\'s the plan? You don\'t have one? That is unacceptable. If you do not have a plan, you should find someone who does! Let\'s think… I think your settler ran into me when I was near a mine or something. Maybe we should begin there?',
