        'Easter2017_Main3MiddleSub4' => 'Well, the Easter Bunny\'s first criticism was that I have no friends and no one likes me. I\'m the shy type, you know? So what\'s a loner like me to do? That\'s right! You can help me buy myself some friends. Find some money, give it to me and we can start buying them up! What? Don\'t worry, you\'ll get your money back... probably!',
        'Easter2017_Main3MiddleSub5' => 'The other thing the Easter bunny disliked was that I was not "green" enough… He loves his ecology you know, so I\'ll show him I\'m totally into this whole nature thing and refill some of your natural deposits! What do you think? Nice idea, right?',
        'Easter2017_Main4Elite' => 'Greetings! I have a request. I know a guy, a horrible person, always unfriendly and moaning. No-one likes him! However, his cousin has come to see me, and it seems he wants to teach him a lesson. He\'ll need someone to help him though. Might you be that person? I am sure he will appreciate it.',
        'Easter2017_Main4EliteSub1' => 'Oh no! It can\'t be! He already has way more than me. You! You have to help me! I\'ve made a bet with my cousin that I would manage to get more Easter eggs than him, but he\'s cheating and now I\'m way behind. We need to do outdo him, but your storage is way too full! Come on! Make space for the eggs!',
        'Easter2017_Main4EliteSub2' => 'I\'ve heard a rumour that there are hidden Easter eggs on this island, and whoever finds them can keep them. Whatever the story, we need these eggs if we\'re to win the competition. What are you waiting for? Let\'s go!',
        'Easter2017_Main4EliteSub3' => 'Hey there, what\'s up? Pay attention! I have good news and bad news. The good news is, I have found the guy who can help us. The bad news is that he only helps people having a certain reputation… which basically means he dislikes your empty storage. I suppose we should fill your storage again then. Am I right?',
        'Easter2017_Main4EliteSub4' => 'After our fabulous efforts, the guy agreed to help us and gave me the location of a new Easter egg island. So grab your stuff and follow me to victory!',
        'Easter2017_Main4EliteSub5' => 'There is not much time left, and we need more eggs to win the competition. It doesn\'t matter how you get them. Just get them so I stand a chance against my cousin.',
        'Easter2017_Main4High' => 'Greetings! I have a request. I know a guy, a horrible person, always unfriendly and moaning. No-one likes him! However, his cousin has come to see me, and it seems he wants to teach him a lesson. He\'ll need someone to help him though. Might you be that person? I am sure he will appreciate it.',
        'Easter2017_Main4HighSub1' => 'Oh no! It can\'t be! He already has way more than me. You! You have to help me! I\'ve made a bet with my cousin that I would manage to get more Easter eggs than him, but he\'s cheating and now I\'m way behind. We need to do outdo him, but your storage is way too full! Come on! Make space for the eggs!',
        'Easter2017_Main4HighSub2' => 'I\'ve heard a rumour that there are hidden Easter eggs on this island, and whoever finds them can keep them. Whatever the story, we need these eggs if we\'re to win the competition. What are you waiting for? Let\'s go!',
        'Easter2017_Main4HighSub3' => 'Hey there, what\'s up? Pay attention! I have good news and bad news. The good news is, I have found the guy who can help us. The bad news is that he only helps people having a certain reputation… which basically means he dislikes your empty storage. I suppose we should fill your storage again then. Am I right?',
