        'Easter2017_Main4MiddleSub3' => 'Hey there, what\'s up? Pay attention! I have good news and bad news. The good news is, I have found the guy who can help us. The bad news is that he only helps people having a certain reputation… which basically means he dislikes your empty storage. I suppose we should fill your storage again then. Am I right?',
        'Easter2017_Main4MiddleSub4' => 'After our fabulous efforts, the guy agreed to help us and gave me the location of a new Easter egg island. So grab your stuff and follow me to victory!',
        'Easter2017_Main4MiddleSub5' => 'There is not much time left, and we need more eggs to win the competition. It doesn\'t matter how you get them. Just get them so I stand a chance against my cousin.',
        'Easter2017_NewDelight_MainLvl16' => 'Hey, remember the weirdo from last Easter with the funny name? Well, he\'s returned this year, too - and he says that he has an idea that would create the best treat in the world! He\'s convinced the kids would love it - and parents too, as it doesn\'t seem to have any of the downsides! I call shenanigans, but let\'s see if he can put his money where his mouth is.',
        'Easter2017_NewDelight_MainLvl26' => 'Hey, remember the weirdo from last Easter with the funny name? Well, he\'s returned this year, too - and he says that he has an idea that would create the best treat in the world! He\'s convinced the kids would love it - and parents too, as it doesn\'t seem to have any of the downsides! I call shenanigans, but let\'s see if he can put his money where his mouth is.',
