        'Easter2017_NewDelight_Sub1_Lvl16' => 'So here\'s his brilliant theory: He thinks that Easter Eggs have special, magical properties in their shells that could be used to spice a pastry, and make it "the ultimate delight". He\'s asked us to find some test examples, so he can get cracking. Not literally, I hope.',
