        'Easter2017_NewDelight_Sub2_Lvl16' => 'Now that he has enough eggs to make some prototypes, he\'s going to need some sort of place to work. A laboratory, that is also a kitchen. A Kitchenlab? a Laboratoritchen? Anyway, let\'s help him build it.',
