        'Easter2017_NewDelight_Sub5_Lvl16' => 'Time for part two of "Operation: Save Easter". You know what makes people happier than anything else? Exactly - food. Let\'s bring tons of food, so we can at least distract them with it while the baking weirdo works on his treat!',
        'Easter2017_NewDelight_Sub5_Lvl26' => 'Time for part two of "Operation: Save Easter". You know what makes people happier than anything else? Exactly - food. Let\'s bring tons of food, so we can at least distract them with it while the baking weirdo works on his treat!',
