        'Easter2017_PartyCrasher_BossGrind' => 'Wow, they really have gone all-out on this one. As usual, we have more than one way of dealing with this problem, but it seems that either way would be a challenge. What will it be?',
        'Easter2017_PartyCrasher_BossGrindPeace' => 'I personally believe that this situation can be resolved without fighting. Maybe if we give them something they really like, we can reach a truce and they\'ll stop bothering us for a while.',
