        'Easter2017_TutAchievementBuild_Sub02' => 'Of course, before you can start upgrading it and take advantage of this lovely building, you\'ll need to place it somewhere on your island.

A university, though? Where would you put a university? Maybe near to plenty of residencies? I can imagine people not wanting to walk a long way from their homes?',
        'Easter2017_TutAchievements' => 'Surprise! I\'ve brought you a little present since it\'s Easter, and, well, you know, Easter! Anyway, I need your help with some Easter related tasks. Since I know there are a lot of slackers out there, I\'ve decided to only be generous to those who really help me out.

So, here\'s the deal: I\'ll give you this cool university for your island. It\'s unique and only available this Easter. But instead of paying for your upgrade, I want you to do stuff for me. What kind of stuff? Well, let\'s start at the beginning.',
        'Easter2017_TutAchievements_Sub01' => 'So, what do I need you to do? 

Check out the Achievement panel! There are specific Easter-related achievements that you can only do during this event. Each achievement gives you points specific to this event. 

I will give you the Easter Achievement building now.
Instead of spending resources on upgrades, it can be upgraded when you earn achievements and collect more achievement points from the Easter event. Every new upgrade level will require more points.

Check out what you can do in the Achievement panel!',
        'Easter2018plus_LevelRequirement' => 'No offence, but the way your city is right now, it\'s really not ready to hold the festivities. If you can grow it just a little bit more, we\'ll be all set!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1Elite' => 'Greetings. I hope you can help me. I found this person near the tavern. It seems he cannot remember where he is and how he got here. I don\'t know what to do with him. Could you take care of him?',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1EliteSub1' => 'Where am I? I can\'t remember anything… It seems I went a little overboard last night. Oh that\'s right - my pal the Easter bunny asked me to help him hide Easter eggs! But where are they? Hmm... Could you please help me? I\'m sure my memory will come back if you give me some brew! Not the rough stuff you can purchase. I want the good, self produced stuff!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1EliteSub2' => 'I remember myself walking across an island. Hmm.. But where? I\'m sure it wasn\'t here. Could you send out one of your explorers? Maybe he can find a clue.',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1EliteSub3' => 'Looks like a kind of treasure map. Hmm… It shows an island. I need you to get me there! Don\'t look at me like that - do you want to disappoint the Easter bunny? Come on, let\'s go!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1EliteSub4' => 'I can\'t just go to my Easter pal and tell him some eggs are missing! We need to further enlighten our minds. Since brew doesn\'t seem to work, we should use bread and water instead. Give me some of yours, and make sure it\'s the good stuff!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1EliteSub5' => 'So, this is where we should go. I know it\'s no Picasso painting, but it\'ll have to do. Why are you still standing there? Come on, the eggs won\'t gather themselves!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1High' => 'Greetings. I hope you can help me. I found this person near the tavern. It seems he cannot remember where he is and how he got here. I don\'t know what to do with him. Could you take care of him?',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1HighSub1' => 'Where am I? I can\'t remember anything… It seems I went a little overboard last night. Oh that\'s right - my pal the Easter bunny asked me to help him hide Easter eggs! But where are they? Hmm... Could you please help me? I\'m sure my memory will come back if you give me some brew! Not the rough stuff you can purchase. I want the good, self produced stuff!',
        'Easter2018plus_Main1HighSub2' => 'I remember myself walking across an island. Hmm.. But where? I\'m sure it wasn\'t here. Could you send out one of your explorers? Maybe he can find a clue.',
