        'Easter2018plus_Main4MiddleSub5' => 'There is not much time left, and we need more eggs to win the competition. It doesn\'t matter how you get them. Just get them so I stand a chance against my cousin.',
        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_MainLvl16' => 'Hey, remember the weirdo from last Easter with the funny name? Well, he\'s returned this year, too - and he says that he has an idea that would create the best treat in the world! He\'s convinced the kids would love it - and parents too, as it doesn\'t seem to have any of the downsides! I call shenanigans, but let\'s see if he can put his money where his mouth is.',
        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_MainLvl26' => 'Hey, remember the weirdo from last Easter with the funny name? Well, he\'s returned this year, too - and he says that he has an idea that would create the best treat in the world! He\'s convinced the kids would love it - and parents too, as it doesn\'t seem to have any of the downsides! I call shenanigans, but let\'s see if he can put his money where his mouth is.',
        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_MainLvl36' => 'Hey, remember the weirdo from last Easter with the funny name? Well, he\'s returned this year, too - and he says that he has an idea that would create the best treat in the world! He\'s convinced the kids would love it - and parents too, as it doesn\'t seem to have any of the downsides! I call shenanigans, but let\'s see if he can put his money where his mouth is.',
