        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_Sub3_Lvl16' => 'If there\'s no spice, then what exactly makes these eggs so special and valuable? I\'ve been working on this for a few years now, and I still have no idea. I\'m gonna go ask the boss. Why don\'t you go kill some time somewhere, while I\'m out?',
