        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_Sub4_Lvl16' => 'Oh boy, this is bad news. Really, really bad news. If the boss has decided to skip Easter this year, what\'s going to happen to all the children? Not on my watch! We need to bring the Easter spirit back. Let\'s spread some love, people love that kind of stuff.',
