        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_Sub6_Lvl16' => 'Well, who\'d have thought it? It turns out that the shell is just an ordinary shell, with ordinary paint on it. However, the weirdo finally "cracked" the secret after all - it seems that the eggs are, in fact, sweet! He\'s been going on about the possibilities of making a treat with these eggs, and needs to tell your bakers right away. Why don\'t we give it a try?',
        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_Sub6_Lvl26' => 'Well, who\'d have thought it? It turns out that the shell is just an ordinary shell, with ordinary paint on it. However, the weirdo finally "cracked" the secret after all - it seems that the eggs are, in fact, sweet! He\'s been going on about the possibilities of making a treat with these eggs, and needs to tell your bakers right away. Why don\'t we give it a try?',
