        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_Sub6_Lvl66' => 'Well, who\'d have thought it? It turns out that the shell is just an ordinary shell, with ordinary paint on it. However, the weirdo finally "cracked" the secret after all - it seems that the eggs are, in fact, sweet! He\'s been going on about the possibilities of making a treat with these eggs, and needs to tell your bakers right away. Why don\'t we give it a try?',
        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_Sub7_Lvl16' => 'I\'ve got to hand it to the weirdo - this treat is simply sublime. With the recipe nailed down, I think we can already make a start on mass-producing these bad boys, and sharing them with our allies. Let\'s get cracking! That\'s the last time that I\'ll use that pun, I swear.',
        'Easter2018plus_NewDelight_Sub7_Lvl26' => 'I\'ve got to hand it to the weirdo - this treat is simply sublime. With the recipe nailed down, I think we can already make a start on mass-producing these bad boys, and sharing them with our allies. Let\'s get cracking! That\'s the last time that I\'ll use that pun, I swear.',
