        'Easter2018plus_PartyCrasher_BossGrind' => 'Wow, they really have gone all-out on this one. As usual, we have more than one way of dealing with this problem, but it seems that either way would be a challenge. What will it be?',
        'Easter2018plus_PartyCrasher_BossGrindPeace' => 'I personally believe that this situation can be resolved without fighting. Maybe if we give them something they really like, we can reach a truce and they\'ll stop bothering us for a while.',
        'Easter2018plus_PartyCrasher_BossGrindWar' => 'So these guys want to prepare for trouble? Then make it double! If we send our troops to "meet them", I\'m sure they\'ll have second thoughts, and will go look for trouble somewhere else.',
