- Defeat the golem by using enough purified water on it.',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Reach19' => 'Before we can overcome the golem, we have to get you to a certain level. There\'s no way you\'ll be able to take him on as you are! Keep on leveling as you were, and I\'ll come back to you when you\'re ready.',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Supreme1' => 'And here I was thinking the ancient golem was the last one... This one looks a lot more ferocious - and I guess since fire didn\'t work, they\'ve gone with ice now!

Our holy water is no longer effective. We\'ll need something new to defeat this one. 

Fortunately, I have a trump card - some glistening water. There\'s nothing more powerful than this. I\'m sure it\'ll work!

Produce enough glistening water to bring the supreme golem down.

- Defeat the supreme golem by using enough glistening water.',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Supreme2' => 'Another supreme golem has gone astray on your island! I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I\'m sure your settlers would be grateful if you could defeat this one too.

- Defeat the supreme golem by using enough glistening water on it.',
        'HW2016_EventMonster_Supreme3' => 'Another supreme golem has gone astray on your island! I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I\'m sure your settlers would be grateful if you could defeat this one too.

