        'HW2016_EventMonster_Tut2' => 'Alright, now let’s test those canisters of purified water! Simply click on the golem and a new window will appear. You can use your purified water there.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_MainLvl19' => 'There\'s a rumour going around that talks of the presence of a group of spirits known as "The Forgotten"... They\'re the vengeful spirits of an old civilization that used to live on this island before us. People are terrified by this idea. We must do something!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_MainLvl26' => 'There\'s a rumour going around that talks of the presence of a group of spirits known as "The Forgotten"... They\'re the vengeful spirits of an old civilization that used to live on this island before us. People are terrified by this idea. We must do something!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_MainLvl36' => 'There\'s a rumour going around that talks of the presence of a group of spirits known as "The Forgotten"... They\'re the vengeful spirits of an old civilization that used to live on this island before us. People are terrified by this idea. We must do something!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_MainLvl46' => 'There\'s a rumour going around that talks of the presence of a group of spirits known as "The Forgotten"... They\'re the vengeful spirits of an old civilization that used to live on this island before us. People are terrified by this idea. We must do something!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_MainLvl56' => 'There\'s a rumour going around that talks of the presence of a group of spirits known as "The Forgotten"... They\'re the vengeful spirits of an old civilization that used to live on this island before us. People are terrified by this idea. We must do something!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_MainLvl66' => 'There\'s a rumour going around that talks of the presence of a group of spirits known as "The Forgotten"... They\'re the vengeful spirits of an old civilization that used to live on this island before us. People are terrified by this idea. We must do something!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub1_Lvl19' => 'The rumours state that we can appease the angered spirits by giving them an offering. Handily, we already have a small shrine on one of our mountains that would be just right for this. I think it\'d be a good idea to keep the spirits on side either way. Let\'s prepare something that will please them.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub1_Lvl26' => 'The rumours state that we can appease the angered spirits by giving them an offering. Handily, we already have a small shrine on one of our mountains that would be just right for this. I think it\'d be a good idea to keep the spirits on side either way. Let\'s prepare something that will please them.',
