        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub4_Lvl19' => 'The ruffian! Terrorizing the people of our island just to fill his pockets! This makes me so angry I could scream! Let\'s assemble the guard, follow him and catch him red handed! What? Too much? No way, I just want to be sure, is all!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub4_Lvl26' => 'The ruffian! Terrorizing the people of our island just to fill his pockets! This makes me so angry I could scream! Let\'s assemble the guard, follow him and catch him red handed! What? Too much? No way, I just want to be sure, is all!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub4_Lvl36' => 'The ruffian! Terrorizing the people of our island just to fill his pockets! This makes me so angry I could scream! Let\'s assemble the guard, follow him and catch him red handed! What? Too much? No way, I just want to be sure, is all!',
