        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub4_Lvl56' => 'The ruffian! Terrorizing the people of our island just to fill his pockets! This makes me so angry I could scream! Let\'s assemble the guard, follow him and catch him red handed! What? Too much? No way, I just want to be sure, is all!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub4_Lvl66' => 'The ruffian! Terrorizing the people of our island just to fill his pockets! This makes me so angry I could scream! Let\'s assemble the guard, follow him and catch him red handed! What? Too much? No way, I just want to be sure, is all!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub5_Lvl19' => 'Well, I may have been a bit too quick to judge. If he was helping the homeless all along, maybe he\'s not such a bad guy after all? I wonder if the homeless know where he got all the stuff he was giving them, though... We should prepare something for them and ask ourselves.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub5_Lvl26' => 'Well, I may have been a bit too quick to judge. If he was helping the homeless all along, maybe he\'s not such a bad guy after all? I wonder if the homeless know where he got all the stuff he was giving them, though... We should prepare something for them and ask ourselves.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub5_Lvl36' => 'Well, I may have been a bit too quick to judge. If he was helping the homeless all along, maybe he\'s not such a bad guy after all? I wonder if the homeless know where he got all the stuff he was giving them, though... We should prepare something for them and ask ourselves.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub5_Lvl46' => 'Well, I may have been a bit too quick to judge. If he was helping the homeless all along, maybe he\'s not such a bad guy after all? I wonder if the homeless know where he got all the stuff he was giving them, though... We should prepare something for them and ask ourselves.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub5_Lvl56' => 'Well, I may have been a bit too quick to judge. If he was helping the homeless all along, maybe he\'s not such a bad guy after all? I wonder if the homeless know where he got all the stuff he was giving them, though... We should prepare something for them and ask ourselves.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub5_Lvl66' => 'Well, I may have been a bit too quick to judge. If he was helping the homeless all along, maybe he\'s not such a bad guy after all? I wonder if the homeless know where he got all the stuff he was giving them, though... We should prepare something for them and ask ourselves.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub6_Lvl19' => 'Now that we know the island isn\'t being watched over by any vengeful spirits, we should tell everyone. Let\'s plaster signs all over the place!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub6_Lvl26' => 'Now that we know the island isn\'t being watched over by any vengeful spirits, we should tell everyone. Let\'s plaster signs all over the place!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub6_Lvl36' => 'Now that we know the island isn\'t being watched over by any vengeful spirits, we should tell everyone. Let\'s plaster signs all over the place!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub6_Lvl46' => 'Now that we know the island isn\'t being watched over by any vengeful spirits, we should tell everyone. Let\'s plaster signs all over the place!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub6_Lvl56' => 'Now that we know the island isn\'t being watched over by any vengeful spirits, we should tell everyone. Let\'s plaster signs all over the place!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub6_Lvl66' => 'Now that we know the island isn\'t being watched over by any vengeful spirits, we should tell everyone. Let\'s plaster signs all over the place!',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl19' => 'While it\'s true there are no spirits around, "The Forgotten" themselves are very real... They live in the streets, homeless, and struggling to just survive. It\'s a problem we need to stop! Let\'s host a charity event for everyone to help them out.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl26' => 'While it\'s true there are no spirits around, "The Forgotten" themselves are very real... They live in the streets, homeless, and struggling to just survive. It\'s a problem we need to stop! Let\'s host a charity event for everyone to help them out.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl36' => 'While it\'s true there are no spirits around, "The Forgotten" themselves are very real... They live in the streets, homeless, and struggling to just survive. It\'s a problem we need to stop! Let\'s host a charity event for everyone to help them out.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl46' => 'While it\'s true there are no spirits around, "The Forgotten" themselves are very real... They live in the streets, homeless, and struggling to just survive. It\'s a problem we need to stop! Let\'s host a charity event for everyone to help them out.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl56' => 'While it\'s true there are no spirits around, "The Forgotten" themselves are very real... They live in the streets, homeless, and struggling to just survive. It\'s a problem we need to stop! Let\'s host a charity event for everyone to help them out.',
        'HW2016_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl66' => 'While it\'s true there are no spirits around, "The Forgotten" themselves are very real... They live in the streets, homeless, and struggling to just survive. It\'s a problem we need to stop! Let\'s host a charity event for everyone to help them out.',
        'HW2016_ThePumpkinMasterMain' => 'Have we met before? Your face looks... familiar. But where are my manners! My name is Eliot and you look like you\'re confused about what\'s happening on your island. Don\'t worry - I\'ll talk you through everything you need to know. So, where shall we begin?!',
        'HW2016_ThePumpkinMasterSub1' => 'First of all, you should try to get as many pumpkins as you can! Why? Because you can buy cool stuff with them, of course! Even buildings! One way of getting them is through buying pumpkin cemeteries. You find them at the merchant. There are different kinds, sizes and speeds available, so why not take a look and buy some?',
        'HW2016_ThePumpkinMasterSub2' => 'Of course, you can also collect pumpkins in other ways. Besides pumpkin cemeteries, you can earn them as rewards for quests, by taking part in several adventures, as collectibles in your home zone, by buying them at the merchant, or as a reward for defeating a golem! Trading with other players is also possible too! So happy collecting!',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodMain' => 'Greetings. You can call me Darkhood. It is of incredible importance that you complete the following rituals. Who am I really? That doesn\'t matter. No, don\'t come any closer!

Do what I tell you, and you\'ll be rewarded greatly thihihi...I mean, muahahaha! If not, you\'ll have to face the consequences!',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub1' => 'Go gather the ingredients. We need them fresh and oozing life energy.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub10' => 'Strengthen your bond to those dearest to you! Or just anyone, really... It doesn\'t matter. Just don\'t do it all on your own!',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub11' => 'This is really important! I know someone who really likes to eat fish and... I mean, this is important for the "R-i-t-u-a-l-l-l" hihi-cough-muahaha.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub12' => 'To complete the process, we\'ll need people to dig a hole- I mean to prepare the ritual site.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub13' => 'And we\'ll need some dark resources. Coal should do. Yes, this is verrry important. Coal. Coal is always important.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub14' => 'Ah! I was just going to leave, then I realized I hadn\'t shown you how to care for this beautiful thing! I just love all kinds of plants. Whoops! It seems my hood slipped a bit... Well, OK - I think it\'s fine anyway, hihihi.

You know, this kind of tree is brimming with a special energy. Because of this, many even fear its seeds, and far fewer dare to plant them. But this tree is so incredibly rare, it almost vanished completely. And it\'s not the tree\'s fault it was used for evil deeds!
There are just a few of these trees left - but luckily, I was able to get my hands on the one I gave to you. The others can only be traded for.

Please treat it with care and nurture, as best you can.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub2' => 'Harvest some emotion-energy from your friends. Hihi...erm muahaha! I wonder if they\'ll like your "gifts".',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub3' => 'Let your friends feast on your emotions too!',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub4' => 'Go out and prepare your people for the worst!',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub5' => 'Stock up your reserves. You\'ll need plenty of "fertilizer" soon, muhahahihihihahah.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub6' => 'Get some action. You look tired.',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub7' => 'There is still more we need, but I cannot tell you exactly what. You might be shocked. So just get a lot of everything!',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub8' => 'This might seem tedious, but at least you have a choice: don\'t be lazy, get it done! Or else!',
        'HW2017plus_DarkhoodSub9' => 'Let some evildoers repent!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster1' => 'It works! The pure water has weakened him! Just imagine what a few more canisters would do.

Quick - let\'s produce enough pure water to bring him down!

- Defeat the golem by using enough pure water.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster2' => 'Another golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be very grateful if you could defeat this one too.

- Defeat the golem by using enough purified water on it.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster3' => 'Another golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be grateful if you could defeat this one too.

- Defeat the golem by using enough purified water on it.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster4' => 'Another golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be very grateful if you could defeat this one too.

- Defeat the golem by using enough purified water on it.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Ancient1' => 'Wow, yet another type of golem! This one\'s even bigger - and it\'s on fire!
Looks like the enriched water isn\'t working now either. In fact, it almost looks like this thing is protected by a curse of some kind. 

For this, I think we\'ll need to call in the big guns. it\'s time to break out the holy water and douse this golem\'s inner fire!

Produce enough holy water to bring the ancient golem down.

- Defeat the ancient golem by using enough holy water.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Ancient2' => 'Another ancient golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be very grateful if you could defeat this one too.

- Defeat the ancient golem by using enough holy water on it.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Ancient3' => 'Another ancient golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be very grateful if you could defeat this one too.

- Defeat the ancient golem by using enough holy water on it.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Ancient4' => 'Another ancient golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be very grateful if you could defeat this one too.

- Defeat the ancient golem by using enough holy water on it.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Ancient_Looped' => 'Another ancient golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be very grateful if you could defeat this one too.

- Defeat the ancient golem by using enough holy water on it.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Greater1' => 'What?! That golem looks somehow... different? It\'s bigger!
It seems the purified water is no longer effective. What else can we try?

Ah - our settlers do have another technique for making enriched water. Perhaps that could put out the golem\'s inner fire.

Come on, let\'s make some enriched water, and bring the greater golem down.

- Defeat the greater golem by using enough enriched water.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Greater2' => 'Another greater golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be grateful if you defeat this one too.

- Defeat the greater golem by using enough enriched water on it',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Greater3' => 'Another greater golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be grateful if you defeat this one too.

- Defeat the greater golem by using enough enriched water on it',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Greater4' => 'Another greater golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be grateful if you defeat this one too.

- Defeat the greater golem by using enough enriched water on it',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Greater_Looped' => 'Another greater golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be grateful if you defeat this one too.

- Defeat the greater golem by using enough enriched water on it',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Looped' => 'Another golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be very grateful if you could defeat this one too.

- Defeat the golem by using enough purified water on it.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Reach19' => 'Before we can overcome the golem, we have to get you to a certain level. There\'s no way you\'ll be able to take him on as you are! So just keep on leveling, and I\'ll come back to you when you\'re ready.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Supreme1' => 'And here I was thinking the ancient golem was the last one... This one looks a lot more ferocious - and I guess since fire didn\'t work, they\'ve gone with ice now!
Our holy water is no longer effective. We\'ll need something new to defeat this one. 

Fortunately, I have a trump card - some glistening water. There\'s nothing more powerful than this. I\'m sure it\'ll work!

Produce enough glistening water to bring the supreme golem down.

- Defeat the supreme golem by using enough glistening water.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Supreme2' => 'Another supreme golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be very grateful if you could defeat this one too.

- Defeat the supreme golem by using enough glistening water on it.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Supreme3' => 'Another supreme golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be very grateful if you could defeat this one too.

- Defeat the supreme golem by using enough glistening water on it.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Supreme4' => 'Another supreme golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be very grateful if you could defeat this one too.

- Defeat the supreme golem by using enough glistening water on it.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Supreme_Looped' => 'Another supreme golem has gone astray on your island. I\'ve already gathered everything I need from him, but I expect your settlers would be very grateful if you could defeat this one too.

- Defeat the supreme golem by using enough glistening water on it.',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Tut1' => 'Listen closely my friend, I have a cunning plan.
Things aren\'t looking great as they stand. Our weapons cannot harm its stony skin. Even our cannons are shrugged off like mosquito bites.
But there is another way to defeat him.

What animates this golem is its inner fire. If we can extinguish that, it should freeze and turn into stone. 
We tried regular water, but it had no effect. 
Perhaps now we should take the concentrated approach, and try purified water instead!

It\'s worth a shot. Tell your settlers to drop what they\'re doing and start producing purified water as soon as they can!',
        'HW2017plus_EventMonster_Tut2' => 'Alright, now let’s test those canisters of purified water! Simply click on the golem and a new window will appear. You can use your purified water there.',
        'HW2017plus_TerrorizedTownDelay1' => 'I feel great unease when I think of our experience on that island... Being prepared for the worst would put my mind at rest.',
        'HW2017plus_TerrorizedTownDelay2' => 'The scientist is doing everything he can to find a way to break the castle\'s barrier. The only thing we can do right now is put our trust in him, and wait until he\'s finished.',
        'HW2017plus_TerrorizedTownMain' => 'This season always brings out all kinds of darkness and evil... A small town on a small island has sent a desperate plea for help.
Will you be able to beat the horror back from whence it came?',
        'HW2017plus_TerrorizedTownSub0' => 'A fisher reports that they found a really interesting message in a bottle. Apparently, it\'s come from a town under attack by an army of small, but numerous golems!
The sea\'s currents give us a rough idea of the island\'s potential location, but our maps show nothing there... We\'ll have to explore the waters if we want to come to their aid.',
        'HW2017plus_TerrorizedTownSub1' => 'The distress call was worded with great urgency. I advise you make haste, and send over your troops as soon as you can.',
        'HW2017plus_TerrorizedTownSub2' => 'Something terrible is happening on the small island you helped earlier! Yes, the golems are gone, but now ferocious beasts are prowling the wilderness!
It seems we have yet to root out the cause of the evil there.',
        'HW2017plus_TerrorizedTownSub3' => 'We\'ve finally gotten word from your scientist friend! Let\'s visit him right away.
The townsfolk are depending on you!',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_MainLvl19' => 'There\'s a rumor going around about the presence of a group of spirits known as "The Forgotten". They\'re the vengeful spirits of an old civilization that lived on this island long before us. People are terrified by this idea. We must do something!',
