        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub3_Lvl46' => 'Apparently, our tribute is still not enough. I\'m starting to think there may be something fishy going on... Let\'s oblige this time, and keep a close eye on the tribute so we can see exactly what\'s going on',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub3_Lvl56' => 'Apparently, our tribute is still not enough. I\'m starting to think there may be something fishy going on... Let\'s oblige this time, and keep a close eye on the tribute so we can see exactly what\'s going on',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub3_Lvl66' => 'Apparently, our tribute is still not enough. I\'m starting to think there may be something fishy going on... Let\'s oblige this time, and keep a close eye on the tribute so we can see exactly what\'s going on',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub4_Lvl19' => 'The ruffian! Terrorizing the people of our island just to fill his pockets! This makes me so angry I could scream! Let\'s assemble the guard, follow him and arrest him! What? Too much? No way, I just want to be sure is alll!',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub4_Lvl26' => 'The ruffian! Terrorizing the people of our island just to fill his pockets! This makes me so angry I could scream! Let\'s assemble the guard, follow him and arrest him! What? Too much? No way, I just want to be sure is alll!',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub4_Lvl36' => 'The ruffian! Terrorizing the people of our island just to fill his pockets! This makes me so angry I could scream! Let\'s assemble the guard, follow him and arrest him! What? Too much? No way, I just want to be sure is alll!',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub4_Lvl46' => 'The ruffian! Terrorizing the people of our island just to fill his pockets! This makes me so angry I could scream! Let\'s assemble the guard, follow him and arrest him! What? Too much? No way, I just want to be sure is alll!',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub4_Lvl56' => 'The ruffian! Terrorizing the people of our island just to fill his pockets! This makes me so angry I could scream! Let\'s assemble the guard, follow him and arrest him! What? Too much? No way, I just want to be sure is alll!',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub4_Lvl66' => 'The ruffian! Terrorizing the people of our island just to fill his pockets! This makes me so angry I could scream! Let\'s assemble the guard, follow him and arrest him! What? Too much? No way, I just want to be sure is alll!',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub5_Lvl19' => 'Well, I may have been a bit too quick to judge. If he was helping the homeless all along, maybe he\'s not such a bad guy after all? I wonder if the homeless know where he got all the stuff, though... We should prepare something for them and ask them ourselves.',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub5_Lvl26' => 'Well, I may have been a bit too quick to judge. If he was helping the homeless all along, maybe he\'s not such a bad guy after all? I wonder if the homeless know where he got all the stuff, though... We should prepare something for them and ask them ourselves.',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub5_Lvl36' => 'Well, I may have been a bit too quick to judge. If he was helping the homeless all along, maybe he\'s not such a bad guy after all? I wonder if the homeless know where he got all the stuff, though... We should prepare something for them and ask them ourselves.',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub5_Lvl46' => 'Well, I may have been a bit too quick to judge. If he was helping the homeless all along, maybe he\'s not such a bad guy after all? I wonder if the homeless know where he got all the stuff, though... We should prepare something for them and ask them ourselves.',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub5_Lvl56' => 'Well, I may have been a bit too quick to judge. If he was helping the homeless all along, maybe he\'s not such a bad guy after all? I wonder if the homeless know where he got all the stuff, though... We should prepare something for them and ask them ourselves.',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub5_Lvl66' => 'Well, I may have been a bit too quick to judge. If he was helping the homeless all along, maybe he\'s not such a bad guy after all? I wonder if the homeless know where he got all the stuff, though... We should prepare something for them and ask them ourselves.',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub6_Lvl19' => 'Now that we know the island isn\'t being watched over by any vengeful spirits, we should tell everyone. Let\'s plaster signs all over the place!',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub6_Lvl26' => 'Now that we know the island isn\'t being watched by any vengeful spirits, we should tell everyone. Let\'s plaster signs all over the place!',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub6_Lvl36' => 'Now that we know the island isn\'t being watched by any vengeful spirits, we should tell everyone. Let\'s plaster signs all over the place!',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub6_Lvl46' => 'Now that we know the island isn\'t being watched by any vengeful spirits, we should tell everyone. Let\'s plaster signs all over the place!',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub6_Lvl56' => 'Now that we know the island isn\'t being watched by any vengeful spirits, we should tell everyone. Let\'s plaster signs all over the place!',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub6_Lvl66' => 'Now that we know the island isn\'t being watched by any vengeful spirits, we should tell everyone. Let\'s plaster signs all over the place!',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl19' => 'While it\'s true there are no spirits around, "The Forgotten" themselves are very real. They live in the streets, homeless, and struggling just to survive. It\'s a problem we need to deal with! Let\'s host a charity event for everyone to help them out.',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl26' => 'While it\'s true there are no spirits around, "The Forgotten" themselves are very real. They live in the streets, homeless, and struggling just to survive. It\'s a problem we need to deal with! Let\'s host a charity event for everyone to help them out.',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl36' => 'While it\'s true there are no spirits around, "The Forgotten" themselves are very real. They live in the streets, homeless, and struggling just to survive. It\'s a problem we need to deal with! Let\'s host a charity event for everyone to help them out.',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl46' => 'While it\'s true there are no spirits around, "The Forgotten" themselves are very real. They live in the streets, homeless, and struggling just to survive. It\'s a problem we need to deal with! Let\'s host a charity event for everyone to help them out.',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl56' => 'While it\'s true there are no spirits around, "The Forgotten" themselves are very real. They live in the streets, homeless, and struggling just to survive. It\'s a problem we need to deal with! Let\'s host a charity event for everyone to help them out.',
        'HW2017plus_TheForgotten_Sub7_Lvl66' => 'While it\'s true there are no spirits around, "The Forgotten" themselves are very real. They live in the streets, homeless, and struggling just to survive. It\'s a problem we need to deal with! Let\'s host a charity event for everyone to help them out.',
        'HW2017plus_ThePumpkinMasterMain' => 'Have we met before? Your face looks familiar. Anyway, where are my manners?! My name is Eliot, and you look like you\'re confused about what\'s happening on your island. Don\'t worry - I\'ll talk you through everything you need to know. So, where shall we begin?!',
        'HW2017plus_ThePumpkinMasterSub1' => 'First of all, you should try to get as many pumpkins as you can. Why? Because you can buy cool stuff with them! Even buildings! Buying pumpkin cemeteries is one way to get them. You find them at the merchant. There are different kinds, sizes and speeds available, so why not take a look and buy some?',
        'HW2017plus_ThePumpkinMasterSub2' => 'Of course, you can also collect pumpkins in other ways. Besides pumpkin cemeteries, you can earn them by completing quests, taking part in several adventures, as collectibles in your home zone, buying them at the merchant, or as a reward for defeating a golem. Of course, you can also trade with other players!.Happy collecting!',
        'HW2017plus_ZombieInvaders_Intro1' => 'Our scouts reported abominations terrorizing our shores.

Send troops to contain their advance.',
        'HW2017plus_ZombieInvaders_Reach50' => 'Our citizens who live on the southern border have reported unsettling sighting.

I suggest sending scouts to investigate.',
        'HW2017plus_ZombieInvaders_Repeatable' => 'Once again, we must continue our valiant effort to prevent these vermin from spreading to mainland',
        'HW2017plus_ZombieInvaders_Repeatable_Timer' => 'It is said that it is a curse which takes place at this time of year.

The thread has been dealt with for the moment, but we must remain vigilant, for they may come back.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv1_Main' => 'A horde of small golems emerged from the fog, and attacked the town.
This operation should be fairly straight forward. We must deal with the golems, fortify the town against any future waves, and finally investigate and eliminate their source.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv1_Sub1' => 'The golems have paused their assault to give themselves chance to rest, and are hiding amongst the rubble of the houses they\'ve leveled. This is our chance to strike!',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv1_Sub2' => 'Before we leave town, we must ensure it doesn\'t get attacked again in our absence. A simple barrier of wood and stone should suffice.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv1_Sub3' => 'The fog mixes with the darkness, and makes it impossible to see down by the river. Good thing the locals are used to it, and have placed several large braziers along the route. If you make a few torches, we can light the braziers and proceed.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv1_Sub4' => 'That creepy building must be where the golems are being created. In fact, I can just catch a glimpse of a few through the windows.
There\'s also maniacal laughter coming from inside... Prepare for a fight!',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv2_Main' => 'So, the golems weren\'t the only thing plaguing the island! Now, many a monstrous beast is roaming the land.
Whatever, or whoever is behind these terrors, we mustn\'t leave before we\'re sure we\'ve gotten to the root of all this!',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv2_Sub1' => 'The scientist who created the golems just confirmed my suspicions - the island\'s lord must be behind all this!
Not only did he lie about making sure the golems wouldn\'t cause trouble, but the magic influencing the beasts is originating from his castle!
We\'ll have to fight our way up the mountain!',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv2_Sub2' => 'I\'ve been scouting ahead, and can confirm there are more beasts heading our way. The good news is, we\'re halfway up the mountain now. Pull yourself together, and we can make it!',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv2_Sub3' => 'Time to talk to that so called "lord". I\'m sure you\'ve got a question or two for him.
Fancy leading the way?',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv3_Main' => 'Alright - we\'re back on the island to finish what we\'ve started.
The scientist has found a method that\'ll let us break that mysterious barrier. Let\'s follow his plan, so we can confront that "lord" in the name of his charges.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv3_Sub1' => 'The scientist has researched the invisible barrier, and I\'m afraid it really does appear to be magic. However, that doesn\'t mean it doesn\'t have a weakness. In order to keep the barrier up, it needs to be channeled non-stop - and we\'ve pinpointed the location of the casters.

Witches are hiding in three towers on this island. If we take them all out, the barrier will disappear.',
        'HWCampaign1_Adv3_Sub2' => 'Oh, I see how it is! Now he\'s taunting us to come inside and face him, boasting about his evildoings!
It\'s a bit unsettling how his voice seems to echo from all the castle\'s windows, but I can\'t wait to beat some sense into this arrogant monster!

The gates are still barricaded through mundane means, but it\'s nothing a battering ram can\'t handle.',
        'LoadTest1' => 'In this quest, you have to use the Premium Account buff, which we sent you from your star menu.',
        'LoadTest2' => 'In this quest, you have to use the Bookbinder buff, which we sent you from your star menu.',
        'LoadTest3' => 'In this quest, you have to use the Gold Fever buff, which we sent you from your star menu.',
        'LoadTest4' => 'In this quest, you have to use the Chocolate Rabbit buff, which we sent you from your star menu.',
        'LoadTest5' => 'In this quest, you have to use the Supporter Hats buff, which we sent you from your star menu.',
        'LoveGarden_ChainFilter' => 'Hello, my dear! My, that certainly is a beautiful love garden. It makes me so happy to see such a lovely place in your town. I want to see this garden full of people, sharing their passion and love with each other. The smell of flowers filling their minds, and the beauty of love inside their hearts. Here - I brought some new flowers! How about we plant them and wait a little longer until some people arrive?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteCoopMission' => 'Good to see you again, boss. My scouts got some reports about some trouble brewing. This one\'s a bit worrying, so I\'d suggest you take some of your friends with you. Wouldn\'t worry too much though - you still have me on your side, so we should be fine.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindAdventureLong' => 'Your explorer\'s reported some... disturbing things about a mysterious island. We should send them out again to get as much information as we can. I just want to make sure there are no surprises.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindAdventureMedium' => 'I need your help. A friend of mine is drawing a map of some of the islands around us, but he needs a bit of information first. Can you send your explorers out to scout those islands, and find the information he needs?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindAdventureShort' => 'Phew! I knew I\'d find you here in the garden. Listen - I have an urgent matter for you to attend to. One of our scouts has gone missing, and her husband is asking if we can help out. We know where she was sent last, but she has yet to return. Can you please send out one of your specialists to look for her?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindAdventureVeryLong' => 'This is quite a special place... How did you manage to get all the people in here? Actually, never mind - I was just hoping you could give me a bit of a hand? A settler wants to impress his loved one with something special from a foreign land, but he\'s afraid to travel alone. Can you send one of your specialists out to accompany him on his travels?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositBronzeOre' => 'Imagine meeting you in the garden again! Do you come here often? Actually, I\'m glad I bumped into you, as I could use your help... One of my friends wants impress their lover by crafting a special gift out of bronze. It has to be a special alloy - and to craft it, we need some rather pure copper ore. Can you send out a geologist to look for it?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositCoal' => 'Have you ever heard of graphite? That\'s one sturdy piece of crystal! I need some for my experiments - your geologists should know where to find it, right?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositGoldOre' => 'A friend of mine says he\'s found a way to make gold out of iron. I want to put it to the test. Can you help me find some of the purest gold around, so I can compare it to the stuff he produces? I\'ve already told your geologists where to search.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositGranite' => 'Oh, hello! It\'s a pleasure to meet you again. Have you ever looked at the streets in the park and thought "they could really use some bohus granite"? Well, I have - it\'s a special form of granite only available in the tundra regions. As a matter of fact, I was talking to your geologists about this granite the other day. They were keen to bring me some samples. If you could give them a nudge, I could use that granite to turn those streets into something special.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositIronOre' => 'Hmm... I\'ve been thinking. How about we put a fence around this garden? I\'ve been experimenting with a new alloy - it could be just the thing we need. All I need is a special strain of iron. I can tell your geologists exactly where to search for it.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositMarble' => 'Ohh, it\'s you! Well, I\'m almost done with my new project - but it does feel kind of like it\'s missing something... A little unique touch, perhaps... Ah, I know! It need some marble! Yes, a nice flash of marble - but not just any marble will  suffice. Only the finest will do. Luckily, I know exactly where to find some that fits the bill. Can one of your geologists help me out?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositSalpeter' => 'Saltpeter is so fascinating. There are so many different types of it - and I have to study and analyse them all. Can you help me find some of it? Here\'s a quick map I made - it\'ll show your geologists where to look.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositStone' => 'Huh!? Oh, you caught me by surprise - I was just finalizing my newest creation. What do you think? Actually, I\'m glad you\'re here. I need some more stone for my next project - but not just any stone. I need a special one. Can you help me out, and send one of your geologists to find it?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindDepositTitaniumOre' => 'Oh man, my hammer just broke! That was a special one made out of titanium, too! Now I\'ve to build a new one... Can you help me out? Your geologists should know where to find the best titanium around, and I need some of it for my hammer.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindTreasureEvenLonger' => 'You know, this garden could really use some fancy stuff. As luck would have it, I happen to know just where to find some. Here\'s an old map my father gave me - it\'ll show you where to look. An explorer should be able to find it, no problem. Good luck!',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindTreasureLong' => 'We need an explorer, and fast! A settler\'s gone missing! We know his last location, since he was searching for treasure... Our explorers know the lay of the land better than anyone - can you send them out to search? I hope nothing bad\'s happened...',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindTreasureMedium' => 'Ohh... Er, just give me a second. Right, OK. As luck would have it, I\'ve just heard about some interesting treasure - it sounds like it\'s definitely worth investigating. I\'ve marked it on this map for the explorers. Could you take care of it for me?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindTreasureProlonged' => 'Well, this is a pretty big request... One of your soldiers lost his sword during his last battle. The sword is an heirloom and his lucky charm. He lost it in the desert, but he can\'t leave his post to go looking for it. Can you help him and bring his sword back?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteFindTreasureShort' => 'Such lovely architecture... I always come here to relax when I\'m not teaching my students. Actually, I bumped into one of them earlier. He was heartbroken - his girlfriend lost a necklace when they were traveling. He knows where it happened, but he can\'t find a way to go and get it back on his own. Could you send one of your explorers to find it for him?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteMiniMission' => 'You seem to visit this garden quite a lot? I\'m not here to complain, though - actually, I have another request. The last report mentioned a rather small issue - some rascals thinking they can terrorize honest people. How about we teach them a lesson?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteMission' => 'Hey, boss. Happy to see me? Do you have a minute, \'cause I kind of need your help. One of your soldiers said he lost a drill plan on one of the islands he was traveling to. He says he\'d rather like to have it back - mumbled something about speeding up the training to get back home to his loved ones sooner. You know I\'m always up for an adventure, right? So, when do we set sail?',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteScenario' => 'Oh, good to see you! I got another request from one of our bowmen. Time for another adventure. This one shouldn\'t be that dangerous - maybe a little boring, if you ask me.',
        'LoveGarden_CompleteVenture' => 'Good day to you! I always love taking a stroll in the garden - the smell of the flowers helps me relax and think a little bit clearer. In fact, I\'m glad I met you, as I have a little a request. I\'ve had a bit of a tip off about some important data - apparently, it might help us train your troops faster. I\'ve also got an idea where we can find this data. Can you meet me at the Excelsior? Prepare for a venture!',
        'MainEpic' => 'Hi there. I\'ve been watching your adventure efforts, and I\'m really impressed by your skills. You know, lately I heard about some strange things happening far away. Until today I thought this task might be too difficult for you, but now I think you could well be capable. Maybe you should take a look?',
        'MainEpicSub1' => 'OK, so you accept the challenge?! Well well, you are brave, but we\'ll soon see exactly how brave you really are. Of course, you can\'t just go now and win the fight. You\'ll have to prepare well, and by "well" I mean **really** well!',
        'MainEpicSub2' => 'The time has come. I\'ve put the new adventure in your star menu. When you arrive on the new island, a friend of mine will welcome you. He seems a bit weird on first sight but he\'s OK really. Just help him and he will reward you accordingly. Good luck.',
        'MainEpicSub3' => 'Maybe you already realised this, but there are more new adventures besides the one you already tried. To get them, you need to play the first adventure and the others will probably come as follow-ups. The rewards increase with every follow up-adventure, so it will be worth your while!',
        'MainEpicSub4' => 'You got Magic Beans as reward? Hmm… They look pretty ordinary. Did you already check what you can get for them? … What? A giant castle? A tower that produces coins? Wow, that\'s epic. So, what are you waiting for? Gather more of them to get the epic rewards!',
        'MainEpicSub5' => 'Man, we need more beans. There are so many things to be bought. You should continue gathering beans. Maybe there are also other ways to gather beans?! In any case, we need more!',
        'MainEpicSub6' => 'Oh, this castle is gorgeous, don\'t you think? You have to build it on your island. I\'ve heard that when you upgrade it, it produces something from these beans that you can use to buy even more marvellous items.',
        'MainEpicSub7' => 'If I\'ve understood correctly, we need to upgrade the Fairytale Castle to level 5 to make it produce Magic beanstalks. It may take some time but it seems to be worth it! With the stalks you can buy even more cool new items. So, let\'s start!',
        'MainPremium' => 'Hello there my friend! I come bearing news of a most wonderful new invention - so listen very carefully, because I shall share this only once.',
        'MaleGuiDaiAirMailSub3' => 'We need a special kind of bird food that can\'t be acquired easily. Our commander has mentioned he knows which seeds we\'re looking for, and he\'ll bring some back the next time he goes on an adventure. We\'ve urged him to go now.',
        'MaleGuiDaiFunWithSnowSub6' => 'There is a tale of a very friendly breed of deer. It would heighten the mood to have some nice deer in the city when winter comes. The only problem is, we\'ve no idea where to find them. Luckily, the general does, and he wants to go look.',
        'MiadArcticExplosionMain' => 'Do you hear that? Silence. We should be careful, the Nords are fearsome warriors.',
        'MiadArcticExplosionQ1' => 'The island appears to be infested with Nords. We should clear out the camps one by one, and drive them back, but which order should we attack in? I say we should focus on the medium camps first!',
        'MiadArcticExplosionQ2' => 'It seems there are some stronger Nords camps around the island. I think they\'re protecting something! Maybe those barrels? Let\'s clear the camps out and find out more!',
        'MiadArcticExplosionQ3' => 'Yes, it\'s just as we thought! The barrels they want to detonate are all around the island! We should find them and throw them into the water! Find the handcarts that are loaded with the barrels!',
        'MiadArcticExplosionQ4' => 'Wait wait wait! There seem to be even more barrels around the island, hidden inside some wooden crates! It seems we didn\'t manage to destroy all of them in one run. Quick, let\'s find the remaining crates!',
        'MiadArcticExplosionQ5' => 'There is one particular stronghold on a small island in the middle of the… island. On this small island, there is a huge Nords fortress, and I guess that\'s their headquarters, if they even have something like that. It would be wise to destroy it. That would lower their morale, if they have any, that is. Let\'s try to fight our way in and destroy it.',
        'MiadBastilleIslandMain' => 'Welcome to Bastille Island, the most famous prison in the world. We should scout the area and clean-up a little bit.',
        'MiadBastilleIslandQ1' => 'To the southwest you\'ll find the raiders. We know they\'re really angry about all this vegetation, as they\'re used to living on barren land. Maybe it\'s too cold for them here, if they\'re used to a different, hotter climate? Who knows. All I know is we need to raid the raiders (he he), and clear the southwestern wing of the island!',
        'MiadBastilleIslandQ2' => 'Oh, the pirates! They\'re always so sneaky - you never know what to expect, really. I say we storm their encampment. That should teach them a lesson how to behave in a prison, or whatever this island is.',
        'MiadBastilleIslandQ3' => 'It\'s amazing that even on a nice island like this one, the Dark Cult can raise a tower. The construction looks menacing, but we shouldn\'t be intimidated by that, am I right? We need to climb to the top of the tower and clear the main chamber. I hope there are no spiders in the witch tower... I hate spiders!',
        'MiadBastilleIslandQ4' => 'There\'s something cold coming from the eastern wing of the island. I asked the Count and he told me he has some Nords captured over there. That\'s not good news - those people are crazy! We should tread carefully.',
        'MiadBastilleIslandQ5' => 'Count Hackett has asked us to clear all the Watchtowers that were occupied by the various clans. It shouldn\'t be a problem. Anyway, it has to be done if we want to access the other parts of the island, so… let\'s get to it.',
        'MiadBastilleIslandQ6' => 'Some of the captured prisoners have told us that each and every clan on this island has an invasion plan. They also told us these plans are hidden not in the main camps, but somewhere else. We should do a sweep of the island, and see if we can find the plans!',
        'MiadPirateLifeMain' => 'I\'m still not sure I believe the story, but here we are. We should find those pirates and help them.',
        'MiadPirateLifeQ1' => 'The first sector that was occupied by the bandits is the forest, with all those woodcutters. It’s basically a lumberyard where the pirates used to get wood for their ships. We need to clear out the bandit camp!',
        'MiadPirateLifeQ1a' => 'The pirates also asked us to burn down the woodcutter huts inside the forest. They want us to keep them from ever building a ship again. Not sure about burning, but we\'ll definitely destroy them.',
        'MiadPirateLifeQ2' => 'You know how those pirates are always drinking that foul tasting special brew? Well they use some kind of special swamp reed to make it. Yes, you guessed right, the next bandit occupied sector is inside the swamp. We need to get to the bandit camp and destroy it!',
        'MiadPirateLifeQ2a' => 'Wait! We need to find the special reeds and destroy them as well. So the retired pirates want to retire for good, eh? It feels like cleaning up, really.',
        'MiadPirateLifeQ3' => 'The farms are situated on the north side of the island. They\'re harvesting the wheat to make more brew, but since the pirates retired, they\'ve been breeding horses and baking bread. Well, the bandits just took control of the farms. Let\'s take it back.',
        'MiadPirateLifeQ3a' => 'What\'s this? Our scout reports that the bandits know we\'re here, and they\'ve poisoned some of the crops! We should destroy the poisoned wheat fields before this gets out of hand! Let\'s get to it!',
        'MiadPirateLifeQ4' => 'Ohh. Well, the headquarters of the pirates, or the "pirate den", was occupied by the bandits. We need to breach the last line of their defences and reach the den. I must say, the veteran pirates turned the den into a nice garden villa. Nice.',
        'MiadSleepyReefMain' => 'That\'s a pretty nice island to get as a gift from a King. Ohh yes, yes you\'re right - we should search for Gregorid and help his family.',
        'MiadSleepyReefQ1' => 'We need to fight our way through the mountains first. Then comes the forest, and eventually well reach Gregorid\'s village! Let\'s move!',
        'MiadSleepyReefQ2' => 'Golly, this forest seems to be really dense. We\'re expecting the next traitor camp to be on the road to the village! Keep your eyes open!',
        'MiadSleepyReefQ3' => 'There are two more camps before we reach the main one. One traitor camp is situated near the outskirts, and the other one is at the entrance to the village. I don\'t have to tell you what to do next, right?',
        'MiadSleepyReefQ4' => 'One of the villagers has told me they saw Gregorid\'s daughter Sabilyn escaping the village! The villager also said she likes to hide in the forest, up in the trees. Great! We need to find her! Look in the forest or wherever you see trees!',
        'MiadSleepyReefQ5' => 'The leader of the traitors is in the camp, grinding his teeth. That guy needs serious help - he looks completely crazy. All we have to do is storm the main camp and defeat the last of them!',
        'MiadTheLostSkullDq1' => 'I don\'t mean to bother you, but sadly I have some disturbing news. Apparently, there was once a very famous pirate captain, but he died while looking for lost treasure on Skull Island. Now, some brave young pirates have decided to go and find him, or more importantly, the treasure. Don\'t ask me why, but King Damien insists we go stop them at once! They shall not put their dirty hands on that Skull! We should travel there immediately!',
        'MiadTheLostSkullMain' => 'Here we are! Time to set up camp and hunt those pirates down.',
        'MiadTheLostSkullQ1' => 'Wow, this is a small island indeed. So here\'s the story: The island was once occupied by an cult who worshiped some old sea god. Ages later, a famous pirate captain, Longsight Emeric, found the island and raided all their tombs, taking every last piece of treasure. However, he never left the island alive. Now these young pirates have decided they\'re going to find both the treasure and Emeric\'s Skull. Let\'s go and "ask" them nicely to go away.',
        'MiadTheLostSkullQ2' => 'Keep knocking on the doors - let\'s hope some of them are in the right mood to talk peacefully. Or not. There was a camp right at the entrance of the valley. Perhaps we should aim for that!',
        'MiadTheLostSkullQ3' => 'There are about four ruins on this island that are still explorable. Let\'s send some spies ahead to check them out - maybe the pirates missed something in one of them? It\'s not even the treasure we want to find but that Skull the King wants so bad. I wonder why it\'s so important?',
        'MiadTheLostSkullQ4' => 'We need to find the pirate captain! Maybe he is hiding in one of the camps, or somewhere else, I don\'t know! One thing is sure : if we fight off every pirate on the island, we\'ll find him eventually!',
        'MiadTheSleepingVolcanoMain' => 'Hmmm... It does smell as if something was burned recently. Not a good sign. We should get moving and help these people.',
        'MiadTheSleepingVolcanoQ1' => 'In order to get to the tower that is located somewhere around the middle of the island, we need to get to the village. But there are some strange towers blocking the road. We sent out a small scout group and they told us that the towers hold cult members. We need to destroy the towers so we can pass! Make it fast!',
        'MiadTheSleepingVolcanoQ2' => 'Argh! There\'s another tower right near the village! I wonder how they built these things so fast. Could these buildings be coming from underground? Regardless, we should destroy the next tower and head into the village.',
        'MiadTheSleepingVolcanoQ3' => 'I had a talk with the village elder. He is very grateful that we\'re here, and he told me an interesting secret. The mad alchemist in the tower made his flaming potion, the one he wants to revive the volcano with, using a special kind of bone dust. On this island there lived a creature that was able to combust. It was some kind of a weird lizard. Anyway, the old man told us that if we want to make sure that potion is never finished, or made again, we should find all the bones and destroy them. You heard the man! Let the search begin!',
        'MiadTheSleepingVolcanoQ4' => 'The tower stands tall over the sleeping volcano. We need to fight our way to the middle of the island and destroy the mad alchemist and all his towers and whatnots! The village elder told us that we\'re probably going to encounter more statues on our way, so we should be prepared.',
        'MiadTropicalSunMain' => 'We\'ve finally arrived. Looks like there\'s a village nearby. We should contact it, and help Lord Walder.',
        'MiadTropicalSunQ1' => 'Say, what a nice village Lord Walder has here! It would be a shame for it to be raided. Alright, I\'ve had a meeting with the village council and got some interesting news. They want to kill two birds with one stone. Yes, exactly, while getting rid of the bandits, the council wants us to get rid of the pirates too, and they will pay us well. So let\'s go pirate and bandit hunting! First, we need to clear our way as they have blocked the southern roads with wooden walls.',
        'MiadTropicalSunQ2' => 'The pirate leader seems very confused. No wonder - he\'s being attacked from both sides, poor fellow. I think it\'s time for him to consider a vacation, don\'t you think?',
        'MiadTropicalSunQ3' => 'Before we reach the badlands, we need to cross the forest. Our scouts have reported some more bandit camps, so be careful!',
        'MiadTropicalSunQ4' => 'The council has sent a scout after us. Apparently, the pirate leader has the deed of the island, a small scroll, and the council wants it back. I ordered some of our men to look for the scroll inside the compound, but they came back empty handed. However, fear not! One of the prisoners has told us the pirate leader has hidden the scroll on one of their pirate ships! We should send out some scouts to infiltrate the ships and look for it! Oh, and one more thing: burn the ships afterwards, just to be sure!',
        'MiadTropicalSunQ5' => 'The bandits have erected a huge wooden wall at the entrance of the Badlands! I must say, it\'s quite impressive, isn\'t it? Sadly for them, even that wall won\'t stop our determination to get rid of them! We need to destroy at least one frontier camp, but if we destroy all three of them, we might find some sweet loot! Remember, we need to get rid of all the bandits!',
        'MiadTropicalSunQ6' => 'We managed to capture a bandit who claims that their clan\'s name is "The Tropical Suns".  Not really imaginative, if you ask me. That name doesn\'t make any sense. Hah, we should name ourselves "The Arctic Moons"...I bet that would make them as angry as a raging bull! Right, enough fooling around. We need to raid their camp and finish this whole charade once and for all! Enter the bandit leader\'s camp and clear it out!',
        'MilitaryLong1' => 'These “Arabian nights” adventures have proven to be quite a challenge, but their loot is most definitely valuable. In fact, there are very few generals out there that have completed the full raid. Do you think your generals will manage to be amongst them? Send them to complete an “Arabian Nights” adventure and let’s find out!',
        'MilitaryLong2' => 'The only thing harder than taking on an expedition? Taking on several at the same time! You guessed it: I’m officially challenging your marshals to claim and maintain 3 colonies simultaneously over the next week!',
        'MilitaryLong3' => 'Magic beans can be used for many things, including producing beanstalks to get valuable sector deeds. However, there\'s just one catch - they can only be obtained through fairytale adventures. Gather some friends and try to collect some for us!',
        'MilitaryLong4' => 'Colonies are very useful - especially for topping up our resources - but they can only reach their maximum potential when they\'re properly defended. Please capture some colonies so we can get a decent amount of granite out of them.',
        'MilitaryLong5' => 'Our elite army is where our true strength lies. As we all know, it can never really have enough units, so let\'s work on increasing our elite ranks a little.',
        'MilitaryLong6' => 'There are rumours that a sea monster has been observed on a desert island to the east, and is wreaking havoc on the nearby villages. Maybe we should check that everything\'s OK.',
        'MilitaryLong7' => 'We aren\'t the only ones who think colonies are valuable. Some other ill-intentioned ne\'er-do-wells may try to take our colonies from us. In order to keep the income flowing we need to retain as many colonies as possible. Notify your marshals! We\'re departing immediately!',
        'MilitaryLong8' => 'A refugee from an eastern island has come asking for help. Apparently a bunch of bandits and enraged... "apes?" have taken their city under siege. We must help!',
        'MilitaryMedium1' => 'If there\'s huge loot to be found, you can be sure we\'ll find it in fairytale adventures. We should complete at least one to make the most of both our conventional and our elite armies! Will we help out the little tailor? Or perhaps live an “Arabian nights” adventure? I’m so excited!',
        'MilitaryMedium2' => 'Our expedition marshals are hunkering for a bigger challenge. Let’s make this a bit harder for them. Claim control of at least two colonies this week. Make sure you have enough iron in your storage!',
        'MilitaryMedium3' => 'Even though mahogany wood has proven to be very useful - and rare - we mustn’t forget about the wide variety of uses that exotic wood still has. I’m a bit impatient when it comes to gathering it though, so let’s get a good quantity of exotic wood through adventure loot.',
        'MilitaryMedium4' => 'That last adventure we had with our conventional army has left it a little… maimed. We should replenish our ranks with top soldiers armed with the finest equipment. Particularly elite soldiers, cannoneers and crossbowmen.',
        'MilitaryMedium5' => 'It seems our army has been a little agitated as of late. They want to be put to the test with a few adventures, so let\'s do just that.',
        'MilitaryMedium6' => 'Recently, there\'s been sightings of that mad scientist we encountered, carrying out his shady experiments once again. It\'s time we put an end to his madness. Take him down!',
        'MilitaryMedium7' => 'The Nords are back! Our explorers report that they spotted the Nords on a nearby island. Ready our troops! We need to take down this threat as soon as possible.',
        'MilitaryMedium8' => 'Our gold deposits are not providing enough ore to satisfy the coin makers\' needs. What a greedy bunch! Since we\'re in times of need, I\'d suggest we "cheat" and obtain some extra coins from adventure loot.',
        'MilitaryShort1' => 'Our elite army is impressive, but it seems our conventional army has been craving some action lately too. Let’s give them a challenge! Take them on a mission where our allies can’t help us, so they can see that they\'re still important to us.',
        'MilitaryShort2' => 'Remember that claiming colonies is another great way to get an extra boost in certain resources, including the precious granite! Prepare your expedition army and claim a colony for our kingdom!',
        'MilitaryShort3' => 'I may be repeating myself here, but with all the new discoveries we\'ve been making, and new buildings we\'ve designed, granite has become vital to our economy. You can never have enough in your storage! Do you know what one of the best ways to obtain it is? Well, from adventures of course!',
        'MilitaryShort4' => 'There are some places the elite army simply cannot go - and that’s why it’s always important to keep a decent number of units in our conventional army too. Let’s train some recruits, soldiers and horsemen. They will prove useful to our kingdom soon enough.',
        'MilitaryShort5' => 'You know what\'s best at keeping our army\'s morale high? Winning! There\'s nothing like winning and feeling powerful. Win some battles with your army to remind them that they\'re the boss!',
        'MilitaryShort6' => 'The best strategists always know how to minimize their losses in a battle. In fact, the ultimate challenge is to win a battle without giving your opponent time to react, and take no losses at all. I\'m issuing that challenge to you now. Are you up to the task?',
        'MilitaryShort7' => 'We must be ready for adventure! Our forces can never be too strong, so let\'s reinforce our numbers with some more troops.',
        'MilitaryShort8' => 'The traitors are at it again, and the king has sent instructions to all our allies, telling us to take care of the traitors in different locations. We\'ve been instructed to go to a very specific island. Let\'s see to it. For the king!',
        'MountainQuest_1' => 'You\'re not going to believe who\'s offered to work for us. A shotfirer wants to demonstrate his skills, by blowing up a mountain for us.
Shall we give it a try?
If yes, you can find him in the star menu.',
        'MountainQuest_Main' => 'Looking around this island, it doesn\'t take a genius to see that the finite space of our cherished home will someday get us into trouble. If we keep growing as we\'ve done so far, we\'ll need to find a way to make some more space.',
        'MountainQuest_Sub1' => 'I don\'t know about you, but I\'ve always hated the mountains. Yet what can one man do against the forces of nature? If only there were more of us, perhaps some bright mind would eventually rise up to the task. The village needs to grow! Makes sense, right?',
        'MountainQuest_Sub2' => 'The cultural achievements of our settlement are remarkable, I must admit. But these accursed mountains - they just take up so much space! Gunpowder seemed like a great idea, but our handling of it needs to mature just a little bit more. I say throw more people at the problem, and someone shall find a way!',
        'MountainQuest_Sub3' => 'We have truly begun to shape the land according to our vision! The secret is in the numbers, just as I have always thought.  Our Shotfirers can overcome any obstacle, so all we need is more! More people, more firepower! Mooore!',
        'NPCQuestMain' => 'Hello my lord. I am Istvan, one of your young followers, and I need your help. The weather has been terribly dry lately, and thus our crop harvest was poor last year. We don\'t have enough food to last us until the next harvest. Please, help us.',
        'NPCQuestSub1' => 'First, we\'ll need to plow the fields for a new harvest, but they\'re covered in debris. Could you help us and collect some of this debris?',
        'NPCQuestSub2' => 'We don\'t have enough tools and utensils left to plow the complete area. It would be a great help if you could help us find the materials to do so. Here, I made a note of everything we need.',
        'NPCQuestSub3' => 'Phew, we\'re all done! Now, all that\'s left to do is to wait until the wheat has grown. We\'d better wait and see how things go. I\'m sure you\'ve got plenty of other things to be getting on with - I\'ll let you know when the crops have grown.',
        'NPCQuestSub4' => 'To be on the safe side, we\'ll keep some wheat on one side, as a backup We don\'t want to risk a new shortage, after all!',
        'PremiumSub1' => 'There is a new so-called "Premium Time", which you can buy from the merchant and put into your account. The king was so kind as to give me one of these, er, Premium days so that you can try it out for yourself. You can find it in your star menu.',
        'PremiumSub2' => 'One of the benefits you\'ll receive is an increase in your friend buff time. You may already know that your buffs on friend zones last longer, but during Premium time, they\'ll last even longer still. Why not try it out!',
        'PremiumSub3' => 'The best thing about the Premium status is that you\'ll earn more loot from your adventures. But not only do you get more loot, you\'ll earn more experience points too. Completing adventures will now pay better than it ever has done before.  But don\'t just take my word for it - take a look for yourself.',
        'RaidingtheRaidersQ1' => 'We made landfall right inside their raid staging area. We have the element of surprise, so we must move quickly.

Eliminate the forces stationed in the harbor area and dispose of the harbor masters to access the city area.',
        'RaidingtheRaidersQ2' => 'The inner city defences are not to be taken lightly. 

Keep your force\'s momentum going and strike at their leaders with all your strength. After they\'re gone, the plunder is ours.',
        'RaidingtheRaidersQ3' => 'It\'s high time we paid them back for all their looting. 
Open their storehouse and take everything you find!',
        'ReachLevel17' => 'More XP will grant higher levels and unlock new buildings, military units and other rewards.

- Defeat enemy units in bandit camps to gain XP

TIP:
Explore sectors in the northwest or southeast to find new bandit camps.',
