        'Soccer2018plus_InvasiveSpecies_47-61_Main1_Sub2' => 'A trade partner’s cargo vessel brought with it a number of highly invasive species from abroad, which now pose a danger to our ecosystem. Our experts have provided us with a list of appropriate measures to deal with the intruders, one by one.
