        'Soccer2018plus_InvasiveSpecies_62-80_Main7' => 'A trade partner’s cargo vessel brought with it some highly invasive species from abroad, which now pose a real threat to our ecosystem! Luckily, our experts have provided us with a list of appropriate counter-measures to deal with the intruders.
One of the invading species we need to deal with is Vespula Doloris Magni, a tiny little wasp whose sting is excruciating - much more so than the sting or bite of any known insect on our archipelago! We need to stop it from spreading.',
        'Soccer2018plus_InvasiveSpecies_62-80_Main7_Sub1' => 'A trade partner’s cargo vessel brought with it a number of highly invasive species from abroad, which now pose a danger to our ecosystem. Luckily, our experts have provided us with a list of appropriate measures to deal with the intruders.
We found out that Vespula Doloris Magni is highly susceptible to our archipelago’s brew. We can lure them in using brew traps.',
        'Soccer2018plus_InvasiveSpecies_62-80_Main7_Sub2' => 'If we feed Vespula Doloris Magni with enough of our fresh-baked bread, it seems to lose its poisonous potency - and ultimately its invasive potential.',
        'Soccer2018plus_InvasiveSpecies_62-80_Main7_Sub3' => 'A trade partner’s cargo vessel brought with it a number of highly invasive species from abroad, which now pose a danger to our ecosystem. Luckily, our experts have provided us with a list of appropriate measures to deal with the intruders.
If we feed Vespula Doloris Magni with enough of our freshly-baked bread, it seems to lose its poisonous potency, and ultimately, its invasive potential.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Main' => 'Did you hear? The Settlers Football Championship is coming up again! Counties and Kingdoms from all over the continent will be taking part - and we should too, to gain glory and honour for our kingdom. There are prizes to be won, too! By trading the footballs we gather through quests and activities, we could win some amazing stuff! Let me explain how it all works!

Finish all the introduction quests in order to participate in the tournament.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Main02' => 'The tournament has started. To win the Settlers‘ Football Championship we have to win 4 matches in a row. Just remember to regularly check the Football Championship fixture list. You can find your next opponents by opening the green doors.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub01' => 'All parties must be at least level 16 to be able to participate in the Football Championship.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub02' => 'Now the first step. To access information about the Football Championship, open the event window. You can reach it via the options panel, which is right beneath your avatar picture.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub03' => 'Did you notice the calendar button next to your avatar\'s picture? Using it opens the tournament\'s fixture list. This is the most important part of the tournament. Green doors contain your next tournament opponent, brown doors hold a nice present for you, and golden doors contain a special thank you! However, you can only open a golden door if you\'ve managed to open every door that came before it. By the way, you can open green doors at any time during the event.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub05a' => 'At the moment, our Settlers are all going totally crazy about football. As they aren\'t the tidiest bunch, it\'s actually possible to find some items by simply collecting the things these football maniacs have left behind.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub05b' => 'To find some more exotic items, you can send out your explorers. They\'ll observe the other teams, and return with interesting items, so we can improve our own tactics.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub06' => 'Once we\'ve collected enough utensils, we should start to transform those into tactics we can use on the playing pitch. Go to your provision house and order a foul. We\'re going to need it to defeat their midfielder.

Hint: If you have a rarity provision house, you can produce the same items there much faster.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub07' => 'The practice match you found in the fixture list will help us to prepare for the tournament proper. The Knight of Crowrock has agreed to let us practice against his team. Start the match and defeat your opponent!',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub10' => 'Now it\'s getting serious. Our first knock-out match, against the Shire of Oxwater. During the group stage they showed skill in attacking, while maintaining a stabile defence. They play in a 4-2-4 system – that means with four set strikers.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub11' => 'In the quarter finals, we will play the Electorate of Sunflower Grove. They\'ve certainly earned their place amongst the last eight teams in the tournament. Similar to our former opponent they play with a strong attacking squad, although their midfield is a little more balanced. This will be a tough enemy.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub12' => 'Semi-finals… what a wonderful day. If you\'d have told me at the beginning of the tournament that we would make it this far, I wouldn’t have believed you. But here we are, up against the grand Duchy of Darkwood. What do you need to know about this opponent? They stand closely staggered in a 1-4-1-4 system and have many strong players.',
        'Soccer2018plus_Sub13' => 'Can you feel it? The air is filled with a mixture of tension, anticipation, and energy… it’s the day of the finals. Our opponent is the Kingdom of Dragonhead. They were always one of the best teams in the tournament, but they\'ll soon be second best! All players in this team are strong, and they are confident to boot. But they\'ve never played us. Go out on the field and show them what we\'re made of!',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Application_Main' => 'It would be an honor to host the competition on our island. So let\'s do the king\'s bidding and apply.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Application_Sub1' => 'Preparation is crucial for a successful application. We need to make sure our people support hosting the games. Let\'s do a promotion tour to rally support.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Application_Sub2' => 'Having secured the support of our settlers, it\'s now time to prepare an application to host the games. Let\'s make it the best one the committee has ever seen.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Application_Sub3' => 'We created a great application. Now it is time to present it to the committee. Let\'s show them what we can do!',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Application_Sub4' => 'It is time for the proclamation ceremony. We must send a delegation to the festivities and become the host of the games.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_MainA' => 'Decisions have been made and contacts established. Now it is time to take the necessary measures, carry them out with determination, and secure victory.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_MainB' => 'You resisted the temptation to take the easy path. Now it is time to uncover the dark schemes and achieve victory fairly and honestly.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub1A' => 'Through shady contacts, you get the opportunity to bribe an official, allowing you to win some games and rise in the rankings.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub1B' => 'The offer was rejected, but now it is clear that something fishy is going on. Send a team of special investigators to gather information on the matter.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub2A' => 'Unfortunately, not all officials are open to bribery. Some need more pressure. Send some agents to dig up dirt on those who stand in your way.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub2B' => 'There is a hidden network that uses bribery, blackmail and sabotage to manipulate the games. Infiltrate the network and gather evidence.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub3A' => 'Believe it or not, there are still some honest and good people who can neither be bribed nor blackmailed. This means another approach is needed. Sabotage the supplies of the rival teams to ensure victory.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub3B' => 'With enough information, you can finally move against the network and make sure that all those involved are held accountable for what they have done.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub4A' => 'All the tricks and shady deals have paid off, and the finals have been reached. Now it is time for a last effort and a little skullduggery to win the games. With the recipes provided by your business partners, you will provide your team with the necessary energy boost to win.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Determination_Sub4B' => 'Staying true to ideals and exposing the corruption paid off, and the finals have been reached. Now it is time for a last effort to win the games. Provide the team with enough support and top-notch equipment to help them win.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Hub' => 'The realms are getting ready for a round of friendly competition. The king has called upon his vassals to apply to host the games. And of course, all must participate and win for the kingdom.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Participation_Main' => 'Now it is time to participate in the games. You are well prepared, and anything less than a top-ranking position would be a disappointment. Let\'s go for victory.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Participation_Sub1' => 'Despite thorough preparation and good performance, the team fell short of expectations. Build a team of specialists to analyze what went wrong.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Participation_Sub2' => 'Not only did the team perform below expectations, but there were also several questionable decisions and results. Send a team to investigate the matter.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Participation_Sub3a' => 'The investigation revealed that something might be amiss, and a shady character made a whispered offer to improve the team\'s ranking.
Produce and pay treasure to accept the offer.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Participation_Sub3b' => 'The investigation revealed that something might be amiss, and a shady character whispered an offer to help the team secure a better ranking position.
Produce the required resources and send investigators to reject the offer.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Preparation_Main' => 'You might not be hosting the games, but you will participate on all levels. And you will prepare a team that will win.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Preparation_Sub1' => 'You might not be hosting the games, but you will participate at every level. And you will assemble a team that will win.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Preparation_Sub2' => 'We have found our best. Now it is time to train them so they can deliver a top performance at the games.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Preparation_Sub3' => 'We can do our part to ensure that the games are conducted fairly and cleanly. Let us train and send a team of referees to support the organizers.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_26-46_Preparation_Sub4' => 'To ensure safe and peaceful games, the organizers still require qualified fan agents and police forces from all participants. Let’s get to work!',
