        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_47-61_Participation_Sub3b' => 'The investigation showed that something might be amiss, and a shady character makes a whispered offer to help the team get a better ranking position.
Produce and send investigators to deny the offer.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_47-61_Preparation_Main' => 'You might not be hosting the games, but you will participate at every level. And you will assemble a team that will win.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_47-61_Preparation_Sub1' => 'The preparation phase has begun. It is time to assemble a team to compete in the games.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_47-61_Preparation_Sub2' => 'We have found our best. Now it is time to train them so they can deliver a top performance at the games.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_47-61_Preparation_Sub3' => 'We can do our part to ensure that the games are conducted fairly and cleanly. Let us train and send a team of referees to support the organizers.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_47-61_Preparation_Sub4' => 'To ensure safe and peaceful games, the organizers still require qualified fan agents and police forces from all participants. Let’s get to work!',
