        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_62-80_Preparation_Sub1' => 'The preparation phase has begun. It is time to assemble a team to compete in the games.',
        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_62-80_Preparation_Sub2' => 'We have found our best. Now it is time to train them so they can deliver a top performance at the games.',
