        'Soccer2018plus_VictoryByDesign_62-80_Preparation_Sub4' => 'To ensure safe and peaceful games, the organizers still require qualified fan agents and police forces from all participants. Let’s get to work!',
        'SocialLong1' => 'Anyone who wants to keep their production output high will have to make a lot of buffs. We all have friends who practically never stop making new buffs. And if I know people like I think I know people, do you know what I think they\'d love? A barazek buff right in the provision house. Wouldn’t you agree?',
        'SocialLong2' => 'Perfect timing! This is going to be a busy week for our production workyards, so we’re going to need you to come over every day to make sure everyone\'s working as hard as they can. Can we count on you to do that?',
        'SocialLong3' => 'We need to send a massive delivery of weapons to all of our barracks, and our current production chain will struggle to get the order completed in time. I’m afraid we\'ll need help from your allies to buff some of our production chains again. Can you please ask them?',
        'SocialLong4' => 'The joys of co-operation! Wouldn’t you agree that adventures are always a lot more fun when someone has your back? Grab some friends and complete two co-operative missions together!',
        'SocialLong5' => 'If we want to obtain the really big rewards from our combined efforts, the entire guild is going to have to cooperate to obtain the precious guild coins. Let\'s work on that! Otherwise, I guess you can always buy guild coins at the trade office...',
        'SocialLong6' => 'The day of the books is here! Some of our neighbours don\'t yet have access to the finest books, and it\'s traditional that we help them out. Let\'s offer a few of them up for trade.',
        'SocialLong7' => 'We need to remind our allies that we\'re grateful for their constant support. Maybe a bunch of gift baskets will do the trick.',
        'SocialLong8' => 'One of our scientists is convinced that he can turn gunpowder into gold. I personally think he\'s insane, but he\'s asked that we buy some for him to try.',
        'SocialMedium1' => 'Bringing allies on adventures is always helpful, but in some cases it\'s downright necessary. Some specific missions really teach you the true meaning of co-operation. Let’s take our friends on one of these co-operative missions!',
        'SocialMedium2' => 'Some of our production chains could use a little boost, and unfortunately, our buffs no longer cut it. We need more power. Something that lasts longer. We need our friends to buff our buildings for us!',
        'SocialMedium3' => 'We need to have more coins in our storage, whether we\'re saving to upgrade buildings or re-selling them for profit. Speaking of profits, maybe we could try selling some of our spare platinum swords, so we can buy something we really need right now?',
        'SocialMedium4' => 'The market may be the best place to get what you need - but you’re not the only one looking for some essential supplies. Try selling some rare materials at the market. But don’t do it for free! Make sure you get a nice deal in return!',
        'SocialMedium5' => 'Working with a guild comes with plenty of advantages. You get a bunch of helpful allies, and can obtain exclusive rewards by working together and accruing guild coins. Why not get a few of those exclusive rewards?',
        'SocialMedium6' => 'Some of our allies, especially those who haven\'t progressed as much as we have, are often in need of a helping hand. Let\'s show them that we\'re willing to help without getting anything in return by sending them some gift baskets.',
        'SocialMedium7' => 'Our tax manager has suggested that if we want to obtain the best possible profit, we\'ll need to use the trade office more often. He\'s right, you know. Let\'s do something about it!',
        'SocialMedium8' => 'The hardest materials to come by at this point are mahogany wood and platinum ore, and clearly this is what we need the most right now. Let\'s buy some at the trade office.',
        'SocialShort1' => 'Our allies help keep our kingdom strong - and I’m sure they\'d say the same about us too! Why not show them a bit of appreciation by buffing some of their workyards?',
        'SocialShort2' => 'There\'s always a high demand for platinum ore - but my sixth sense tells me that this may be the perfect time to place some of ours on the market and cut a good profit. I’m sure someone will be interested if we price it right!',
        'SocialShort3' => 'It’s always a pleasure to see you! I’m glad you\'re keeping a watchful eye on your land, always ensuring everyone\'s doing their best at work. Would you come in for at least three days this week?',
        'SocialShort4' => 'Buffs have become a critical part of our economy nowadays, but let’s not forget that if it’s one of our allies who comes and buffs one of our buildings, the effect will last for much longer than if we used it ourselves. Please ask our allies to buff 5 of our buildings!',
        'SocialShort5' => 'Sometimes, the best buffs aren\'t the most expensive ones. On deposits that are running low, a longer lasting buff may be wasted if the deposit depletes. Let\'s buff a friend with some solid sandwiches.',
        'SocialShort6' => 'It\'s culture day! On culture day we set aside a small space, where we remind our settlers of the importance of reading books and sharing culture with one another. This tradition also allows us to exchange manuscripts with other islands.',
        'SocialShort7' => 'Let\'s not underestimate the importance of bronze swords. They may be cheap weaponry, but they\'re the ones we use the most, which makes them incredibly valuable to us. Let\'s stock up on a few extras.',
        'SocialShort8' => 'Our generals have suggested that we make some sort of shooting gallery so our marksmen can practice their skills with an arquebus. We should get some arquebuses that are specifically designed for a shooting gallery.',
        'SophisticatedPillager_1001NightsWoodcutter' => 'Your explorer\'s skill "Sophisticated Pillager" has activated a Bonus Quest. 

Complete the adventure "Ali Baba the Woodcutter" to receive additional rewards!',
