        'SplitCityFall_Main' => 'Seeing how rough these lands are gives me the shivers. How are people still living here, and why are they so reluctant to leave?
According to the scout that just returned, we cannot simply evacuate the residents. They are scattered around the land, from the coast in the south to the natural caves of the north. The people have built winter shelters to retreat to when the weather turns cold. Meanwhile, the elderly simply refuse to leave the home they\'ve lived in for generations. Unfortunately, their children and grandchildren cannot bring themselves to leave them behind, so they are stuck, trying to survive as best they can.
As futile as it may seem, we have to free the town again from the invaders. But it won\'t be as easy as last time. The scout was terrified upon her return - she barely made it back alive. She was chased by furry beasts, but could not describe them any further, as she was running for her life.',
        'SplitCity_Main' => 'I\'ve sent a scout as a messenger to the city up north. They confirmed the call for help came from them. They told a story of a strange power that draws all kinds of evildoers to their city all year long. And apparently, it gets worse the colder it gets. The attackers are behaving weirdly too. The townspeople usually aren\'t attacked directly, but nevertheless, they\'re unable to keep the enemies at bay.

They\'ve requested that we rid their land of evildoers, so they can stock up on resources, share medicine and meet with their loved ones on the other side. They know it will not be long until the next wave of bad guys wash ashore, but it will help them greatly right now.',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel40' => 'Something looms over the horizon.',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel52_Main' => 'Mayor! Just the person I wanted to talk to.

I’ve been sketching an upgrade package for the Forerunner.

This will improve the amount of Star Shards that can be stored, and the rewards obtained by researching them.

All without compromising any of her already remarkable capabilities.',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel52_Main_Part1' => 'Please deliver the following list of components as soon as you have the chance. You can commission them from Provision Houses.

I’ll get to work on the modifications as soon as they’ve been delivered.',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel52_Main_Part2' => 'Thank you, kindly. 

I’ll need some quiet time to make the necessary modifications. 

I will let you know once they are ready.',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel52_Main_Part3' => 'In this manual, I’ve written step-by-step instructions for everything the crew will have to do to install the upgrade.

Deliver it to the Forerunner.

Once that it’s done, you can start the upgrade procedure at your own leisure.',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel64_Main' => 'Hello again. 

As discussed earlier, I\'ve come up with a new set modifications to further improve the Forerunner\'s capabilities.

These will improve the amount of Star Shards that can be stored once again - and the rewards we can obtain from researching them.',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel64_Main_Part1' => 'Please deliver the following list of components as soon as you have the chance. You can commission them from Provision Houses.

I’ll get to work on the modifications as soon as they’ve been delivered.',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel64_Main_Part2' => 'Thank you, kindly. 

I’ll need some quiet time to make the necessary modifications. 

I will let you know once they are ready.',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel64_Main_Part3' => 'In this manual, I’ve written step-by-step instructions for everything the crew will have to do to install the upgrade.

Deliver it to the Forerunner.

Once that it’s done, you can start the upgrade procedure at your own leisure.',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel70_Main' => 'As hard as it may be to believe, I’ve managed to come up with one final set of upgrades for the Forerunner.

These will push our Star Shard storage capabilities to the limit, and will yield us the very best rewards from our research.',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel70_Main_Part1' => 'Please deliver the following list of components as soon as you have the chance. You can commission them from Provision Houses.

I’ll get to work on the modifications as soon as they’ve been delivered.',
        'Starfall_ReachLevel70_Main_Part2' => 'Thank you, kindly. 

I’ll need some quiet time to make the necessary modifications. 

