        'XMAS2013_Main1' => 'Merry Christmas, old friend!
I’ve brought some new things with me to make this year’s Christmas even better.

I will show you the new Christmas surprise and how to get presents.',
        'XMAS2013_Main2' => 'My reindeers are gone, someone must have stolen them! Without them I can\'t deliver all those presents!
But you can save the day!',
        'XMAS2013_Main3_Easy' => 'I found the evildoer who stole my Reindeers! He\'s hiding on an Island. I guess we need to set sail and pay him a visit!',
        'XMAS2013_Main3_Hard' => 'I found the evildoer who stole my Reindeers! He\'s hiding on an Island. I guess we need to set sail and pay him a visit!',
        'XMAS2013_Main3_Medium' => 'I found the evildoer who stole my Reindeers! He\'s hiding on an Island. I guess we need to set sail and pay him a visit!',
        'XMAS2013_Reach16' => 'The next thing I want to show you requires you to be Level 16. Please come back when you\'ve gained enough experience. For someone with your potential, that shouldn\'t take too long!',
        'XMAS2013_Reach23' => 'For the next task you need to be Level 23. Please come back when you\'ve gained enough experience.',
        'XMAS2013_Reach26' => 'For the next task you need to be Level 26. Please come back when you\'ve gained enough experience.',
        'XMAS2013_Sub1' => 'First take a look at the brand-new Christmas surprise.
Each day you can open a door and find valuable things inside!

For special days like Christmas Eve or New Year’s Eve you can choose in advance what reward you\'d like to have.

And if you manage to open all the doors. you\'ll get a really special reward!

Even if you miss a door, you can always come back and open it afterwards with some gems.',
        'XMAS2013_Sub2' => 'The next thing I want to show you is how you can produce your own Christmas presents.

For this we need Christmas Bells, Candy Canes and Gingerbread.
You can find those things on your Island - all you have to do is pick them up.',
        'XMAS2013_Sub3' => 'Now that we have enough things to build our presents from, we should give it a try!

Click on your Mayor\'s House, select the \'Collections\' tab and produce a Basket of Presents.',
        'XMAS2013_Sub4' => 'The last thing I wanted to tell you is that your explorers can also find presents during their treasure searches.

Try it out, and send one of your explorers on a treasure search (short).',
        'XMAS2013_Sub5' => 'Let me tell you a little secret.
It\'s not the reindeers that let my sleigh fly. They\'re just for show.
I mean, I could use kittens, but imagine how silly that would look…

The trick here is a magic potion which can make any animal fly.
So here\'s the plan:
First, we train some horses, and we gather some wood to build fake antlers with.
After all, they need to look like reindeers when people see them flying.

Then I simply give them my potion, and they should be able to help me deliver my presents.',
        'XMAS2013_Sub6' => 'I\'m back, but unfortunately, I can\'t find the ingredients I need to brew the potion I mentioned. 

Perhaps you could help me out?

Here, take this list. That\'s everything you need to get. Oh, and could you bring me some malt brew while you’re at it?',
        'XMAS2013_Sub7_Easy' => 'Unfortunately, the guy who stole my reindeers has bribed the rulers of the island to protect him!
 
It seems we\'ll need to take an Army with us if we\'re going to get them back!',
        'XMAS2013_Sub7_Hard' => 'Unfortunately, the guy who stole my reindeers has bribed the rulers of the island to protect him!
 
It seems we\'ll need to take an Army with us if we\'re going to get them back!',
        'XMAS2013_Sub7_Medium' => 'Unfortunately, the guy who stole my reindeers has bribed the rulers of the island to protect him!
 
It seems we\'ll need to take an Army with us if we\'re going to get them back!',
        'XMAS2013_Sub8_Easy' => 'I should have known!
The evildoer was hired by the Croaker!

I don\'t know where he\'s hiding right now, but I think we need to build ourselves back up, and get ready for a showdown.',
        'XMAS2013_Sub8_Hard' => 'I should have known!
The evildoer was hired by the Croaker!

I don\'t know where he\'s hiding right now, but I think we need to build ourselves back up, and get ready for a showdown.',
        'XMAS2013_Sub8_Medium' => 'I should have known!
The evildoer was hired by the Croaker!

I don\'t know where he\'s hiding right now, but I think we need to build ourselves back up, and get ready for a showdown.',
        'XMAS2014_Adv1' => 'We need to help Santa deliver some of his presents! It might be an idea to start with the first adventure. Open your Star Menu, start the gift delivery adventure and visit the adventure zone.

Hint: You\'ll get the adventure from the first green door in the Christmas calendar.',
        'XMAS2014_Adv2_easy' => 'Now that we know what gifts we need to deliver, we should start to produce them! Go to your Provision House and produce some of the objects required. We\'re going to need them if we want to make everyone happy!

Hint: If you have a Rarity Provision House, you can produce the same items there much faster.',
        'XMAS2014_Adv2_hard' => 'Now that we know what gifts we need to deliver, we should start to produce them! Go to your Provision House and produce some of the objects required. We\'re going to need them if we want to make everyone happy!

Hint: If you have a Rarity Provision House, you can produce the same items there much faster.',
        'XMAS2014_Adv2_medium' => 'Now that we know what gifts we need to deliver, we should start to produce them! Go to your Provision House and produce some of the objects required. We\'re going to need them if we want to make everyone happy!

Hint: If you have a Rarity Provision House, you can produce the same items there much faster.',
