        'XMAS2017plus_DecoProduce2_lvl26' => 'To create the right atmosphere of joy and togetherness, we need the houses to look like Christmas too. With your talent I am sure that you can produce some fantastic decorations!',
        'XMAS2017plus_DecoProduce2_lvl36' => 'To create the right atmosphere of joy and togetherness, we need the houses to look like Christmas too. With your talent I am sure that you can produce some fantastic decorations!',
        'XMAS2017plus_DecoProduce2_lvl51' => 'To create the right atmosphere of joy and togetherness, we need the houses to look like Christmas too. With your talent I am sure that you can produce some fantastic decorations!',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Produce1_lvl26' => 'I\'d like you to deliver the required resources to get the base ready. I know it\'s a hassle, but it\'ll be worth it!',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Produce1_lvl36' => 'I\'d like you to deliver the required resources to get the base ready. I know it\'s a hassle, but it\'ll be worth it!',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Produce1_lvl51' => 'I\'d like you to deliver the required resources to get the base ready. I know it\'s a hassle, but it\'ll be worth it!',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Produce2_lvl26' => 'The Market already offers so much, but it\'d be nice if Settlers could get something to eat during their visit. Some of them have also asked if it would be possible to hand out sheets of paper with Christmas songs to sing. Would you be so kind as to prepare the required resources?',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Produce2_lvl36' => 'The Market already offers so much, but it\'d be nice if Settlers could get something to eat during their visit. Some of them have also asked if it would be possible to hand out sheets of paper with Christmas songs to sing. Would you be so kind as to prepare the required resources?',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Produce2_lvl51' => 'The Market already offers so much, but it\'d be nice if Settlers could get something to eat during their visit. Some of them have also asked if it would be possible to hand out sheets of paper with Christmas songs to sing. Would you be so kind as to prepare the required resources?',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Produce3_lvl26' => 'To extend the Market - and brighten the Settlers\' mood even further - we obviously need more resources for the upgrade. Thank you for helping me out, I wouldn\'t be able to accomplish this without your support.',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Produce3_lvl36' => 'To extend the Market - and brighten the Settlers\' mood even further - we obviously need more resources for the upgrade. Thank you for helping me out, I wouldn\'t be able to accomplish this without your support.',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Produce3_lvl51' => 'To extend the Market - and brighten the Settlers\' mood even further - we obviously need more resources for the upgrade. Thank you for helping me out, I wouldn\'t be able to accomplish this without your support.',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Produce4_lvl26' => 'The Market has already grown immensely. We need sturdier materials to make it just a little bit bigger. And then, as the final step, let\'s make the Market sparkle so it can be seen from ships way out on the ocean!',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Produce4_lvl36' => 'The Market has already grown immensely. We need sturdier materials to make it just a little bit bigger. And then, as the final step, let\'s make the Market sparkle so it can be seen from ships way out on the ocean!',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Produce4_lvl51' => 'The Market has already grown immensely. We need sturdier materials to make it just a little bit bigger. And then, as the final step, let\'s make the Market sparkle so it can be seen from ships way out on the ocean!',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Tut1_lvl26' => 'What I want you to do is build a Christmas Market that every Settler from near and far can enjoy. But don\'t worry, I\'ll show you how this can be achieved. First, your people have to stand together and create lovely little gifts that can be handed out to everyone, regardless of whether they can afford them or not!',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Tut1_lvl36' => 'What I want you to do is build a Christmas Market that every Settler from near and far can enjoy. But don\'t worry, I\'ll show you how this can be achieved. First, your people have to stand together and create lovely little gifts that can be handed out to everyone, regardless of whether they can afford them or not!',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Tut1_lvl51' => 'What I want you to do is build a Christmas Market that every Settler from near and far can enjoy. But don\'t worry, I\'ll show you how this can be achieved. First, your people have to stand together and create lovely little gifts that can be handed out to everyone, regardless of whether they can afford them or not!',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Tut2_lvl26' => 'To show you what I mean, I\'ll create an Illusion of a Christmas Market I\'d love to visit. I\'ll also show you how you can deliver all these little gifts, and how to upgrade the Christmas Market.

But remember - although I\'ll lend you the blueprint for now, you\'ll be the one who has to make this reality!',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Tut2_lvl36' => 'To show you what I mean, I\'ll create an Illusion of a Christmas Market I\'d love to visit. I\'ll also show you how you can deliver all these little gifts, and how to upgrade the Christmas Market.

But remember - although I\'ll lend you the blueprint for now, you\'ll be the one who has to make this reality!',
        'XMAS2017plus_EventMarket_Tut2_lvl51' => 'To show you what I mean, I\'ll create an Illusion of a Christmas Market I\'d love to visit. I\'ll also show you how you can deliver all these little gifts, and how to upgrade the Christmas Market.

But remember - although I\'ll lend you the blueprint for now, you\'ll be the one who has to make this reality!',
        'XMAS2017plus_FeastPreparation1_lvl26' => 'You can\'t be in high spirits, if your not comfortable. We need to spread warmth and cozyness. So search for a recipe and prepare a wonderful feast for everyone.',
        'XMAS2017plus_FeastPreparation1_lvl36' => 'You can\'t be in high spirits, if your not comfortable. We need to spread warmth and cozyness. So search for a recipe and prepare a wonderful feast for everyone.',
        'XMAS2017plus_FeastPreparation1_lvl51' => 'You can\'t be in high spirits, if your not comfortable. We need to spread warmth and cozyness. So search for a recipe and prepare a wonderful feast for everyone.',
        'XMAS2017plus_FeastPreparation2_lvl26' => 'Let us use the momentum and boost the feeling of togetherness. Another feast should do the trick. But a little more special then the first one. I\'m sure you will come up with something spectacular!',
        'XMAS2017plus_FeastPreparation2_lvl36' => 'Let us use the momentum and boost the feeling of togetherness. Another feast should do the trick. But a little more special then the first one. I\'m sure you will come up with something spectacular!',
        'XMAS2017plus_FeastPreparation2_lvl51' => 'Let us use the momentum and boost the feeling of togetherness. Another feast should do the trick. But a little more special then the first one. I\'m sure you will come up with something spectacular!',
        'XMAS2017plus_GiftGiving_lvl26' => 'Ho ho ho! Now it is time for Santa\'s Helper to deliver the joy. Show everyone what it means to share and care for each other.',
        'XMAS2017plus_GiftGiving_lvl36' => 'Ho ho ho! Now it is time for Santa\'s Helper to deliver the joy. Show everyone what it means to share and care for each other.',
        'XMAS2017plus_GiftGiving_lvl51' => 'Ho ho ho! Now it is time for Santa\'s Helper to deliver the joy. Show everyone what it means to share and care for each other.',
        'XMAS2017plus_HolidayCheerDelay1_lvl26' => 'You really did a great job as Santa\'s Helper. But now it is time for you to contemplate and feel a little of the joy you brought for yourself!',
        'XMAS2017plus_HolidayCheerDelay1_lvl36' => 'You really did a great job as Santa\'s Helper. But now it is time for you to contemplate and feel a little of the joy you brought for yourself!',
        'XMAS2017plus_HolidayCheerDelay1_lvl51' => 'You really did a great job as Santa\'s Helper. But now it is time for you to contemplate and feel a little of the joy you brought for yourself!',
        'XMAS2017plus_HolidayCheerDelay2_lvl26' => 'Christmas is also a time for reflection and for finding peace. So now it is time for some silent nights.',
        'XMAS2017plus_HolidayCheerDelay2_lvl36' => 'Christmas is also a time for reflection and for finding peace. So now it is time for some silent nights.',
        'XMAS2017plus_HolidayCheerDelay2_lvl51' => 'Christmas is also a time for reflection and for finding peace. So now it is time for some silent nights.',
        'XMAS2017plus_Main1' => 'Merry Christmas, old friend!
I’ve brought some new things with me to help make this Christmas even better!

Let me show you the new Christmas surprise, and how to get presents!',
        'XMAS2017plus_Main2' => 'My reindeers have vanished! Someone must have stolen them! Oh, how am I ever going to deliver those presents now!?
Perhaps you could help me out? This is your chance! You can save the day!',
        'XMAS2017plus_Main3_Easy' => 'I found the evildoer who stole my reindeers! He\'s hiding on an island. I guess we should set sail and pay him a visit!',
        'XMAS2017plus_Main3_Hard' => 'I found the evildoer who stole my reindeers! He\'s hiding on an island. I guess we should set sail and pay him a visit!',
        'XMAS2017plus_Main3_Medium' => 'I found the evildoer who stole my reindeers! He\'s hiding on an island. I guess we should set sail and pay him a visit!',
        'XMAS2017plus_PresentProduction_lvl26' => 'Not long now to the grand finale! I can feel that everyone is brimming with excitement. We should raise the spirits even more by preparing some things to share with the world.',
        'XMAS2017plus_PresentProduction_lvl36' => 'Not long now to the grand finale! I can feel that everyone is brimming with excitement. We should raise the spirits even more by preparing some things to share with the world.',
        'XMAS2017plus_PresentProduction_lvl51' => 'Not long now to the grand finale! I can feel that everyone is brimming with excitement. We should raise the spirits even more by preparing some things to share with the world.',
        'XMAS2017plus_Reach16' => 'Unfortunately, the thing I wanted to show you requires you to be Level 16. Please come back when you\'ve gained enough experience. For someone with your potential, that shouldn\'t take too long!',
        'XMAS2017plus_Reach23' => 'For the next task you need to be Level 23. Please come back when you\'ve gained enough experience.',
        'XMAS2017plus_Reach26' => 'For the next task you need to be Level 26. Please come back when you\'ve gained enough experience.',
        'XMAS2017plus_SongPlacement_lvl26' => 'Time to lift the spirits of the people. Send out your singers and let them perform!',
        'XMAS2017plus_SongPlacement_lvl36' => 'Time to lift the spirits of the people. Send out your singers and let them perform!',
        'XMAS2017plus_SongPlacement_lvl51' => 'Time to lift the spirits of the people. Send out your singers and let them perform!',
        'XMAS2017plus_SongProduction_lvl26' => 'Now that the worldly needs are cared for, we need something to lift the spirit. How about some music that show the spirit of the season? I\'m sure you have some great artists in your realm that can compose the perfect tunes.',
        'XMAS2017plus_SongProduction_lvl36' => 'Now that the worldly needs are cared for, we need something to lift the spirit. How about some music that show the spirit of the season? I\'m sure you have some great artists in your realm that can compose the perfect tunes.',
        'XMAS2017plus_SongProduction_lvl51' => 'Now that the worldly needs are cared for, we need something to lift the spirit. How about some music that show the spirit of the season? I\'m sure you have some great artists in your realm that can compose the perfect tunes.',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub1' => 'Let\'s take a look at the Christmas surprise!
Each day you can open a door, and find valuable things inside.

For special days like Christmas Eve, you can even choose what reward you\'d like to have. There are also some special doors that will give you the opportunity to help Santa out in some special gift delivering adventures.

If you miss a door, you can always come back and open it afterwards by spending some gems.',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub2' => 'The next thing I want to show you is how you can produce your own Christmas presents.

For this, we\'ll need some Christmas bells, candy canes and gingerbread.
You can find all the required bits and pieces on your island - all you have to do is pick them up.',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub2a' => 'To access information about the Christmas event, open the Event Window. You can reach it via the option panel right below your avatar picture',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub3' => 'Now that we\'ve gathered enough stuff to build our presents, we should get to work!

Click on your Mayor\'s house, select the \'Collections\' tab and produce 1 basket of presents.',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub4' => 'The last thing I wanted to tell you is that your explorers can also find presents during their treasure searches.

Try it out, and send one of your explorers on a treasure search (short).',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub5' => 'Let me tell you a little secret.
It\'s not the reindeers that let my sleigh fly. They\'re just for show.
I mean, I could let kittens drag the sleigh, but just imagine how silly that would look…

The trick here is a magic potion which can make any animal fly.
So here\'s the plan:
First, we\'ll train some horses, and we\'ll gather some wood to build fake antlers with.
After all, they need to look like reindeers when people see them flying!

Then I simply give them my potion, and they should be able to help me deliver my presents.',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub6' => 'I\'m back, but I\'m afraid I can\'t find the ingredients I need to brew the potion... 

Perhaps you could help me out?

Here, take this list. That\'s everything you need to get. Oh, and could you bring me some malt brew while you’re at it?',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub7_Easy' => 'Unfortunately, the guy who stole my reindeers has bribed the rulers of the island to protect him!
 
We\'ll need to take an army with us if we\'re going to get them back!',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub7_Hard' => 'Unfortunately, the guy who stole my reindeers has bribed the rulers of the island to protect him!
 
We\'ll need to take an army with us if we\'re going to get them back!',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub7_Medium' => 'Unfortunately, the guy who stole my reindeers has bribed the rulers of the island to protect him!
 
We\'ll need to take an army with us if we\'re going to get them back!',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub8_Easy' => 'I should have known!
The evildoer was hired by the Croaker!

Sadly, I don\'t know where he\'s hiding right now, but I think we need to build ourselves back up, and get ready for a showdown.',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub8_Hard' => 'I should have known!
The evildoer was hired by the Croaker!

Sadly, I don\'t know where he\'s hiding right now, but I think we need to build ourselves back up, and get ready for a showdown.',
        'XMAS2017plus_Sub8_Medium' => 'I should have known!
The evildoer was hired by the Croaker!

Sadly, I don\'t know where he\'s hiding right now, but I think we need to build ourselves back up, and get ready for a showdown.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandDelay1_lvl26' => 'Okay good... very goood... teeheehee, ribbit. Now I need to make it look more friendly. Give me more of your precious ribbit resources! And then just wait until I finish my plan- I mean, my preparations ribbit... teeheehee... ribbit. Go and improve your productions so I can have more tasty ingredients for my- for the Settlers...ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandDelay1_lvl36' => 'Okay good... very goood... teeheehee, ribbit. Now I need to make it look more friendly. Give me more of your precious ribbit resources! And then just wait until I finish my plan- I mean, my preparations ribbit... teeheehee... ribbit. Go and improve your productions so I can have more tasty ingredients for my- for the Settlers...ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandDelay1_lvl51' => 'Okay good... very goood... teeheehee, ribbit. Now I need to make it look more friendly. Give me more of your precious ribbit resources! And then just wait until I finish my plan- I mean, my preparations ribbit... teeheehee... ribbit. Go and improve your productions so I can have more tasty ingredients for my- for the Settlers...ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandDelay2_lvl26' => 'Ah, I\'m such a scatterbrain. I ribbit must have misplaced my presents I so carefully prepared for my captiv- ribbit...I mean, my guests, teeheehee. You do have some of those precious presents left, don\'t you? I\'d really like to get my hands ribbit on those. To give them ribbit to the Settlers, of course, ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandDelay2_lvl36' => 'Ah, I\'m such a scatterbrain. I ribbit must have misplaced my presents I so carefully prepared for my captiv- ribbit...I mean, my guests, teeheehee. You do have some of those precious presents left, don\'t you? I\'d really like to get my hands ribbit on those. To give them ribbit to the Settlers, of course, ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandDelay2_lvl51' => 'Ah, I\'m such a scatterbrain. I ribbit must have misplaced my presents I so carefully prepared for my captiv- ribbit...I mean, my guests, teeheehee. You do have some of those precious presents left, don\'t you? I\'d really like to get my hands ribbit on those. To give them ribbit to the Settlers, of course, ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub0_lvl26' => 'Although they won\'t get the nicest presents this year, I\'m worried about some very naughty children. It seems that many of them have gone missing from this island and others. On the off chance, could you tell your explorers to keep an eye and an ear open and let me know if they hear anything about the missing children?',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub0_lvl36' => 'Although they won\'t get the nicest presents this year, I\'m worried about some very naughty children. It seems that many of them have gone missing from this island and others. On the off chance, could you tell your explorers to keep an eye and an ear open and let me know if they hear anything about the missing children?',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub0_lvl51' => 'Although they won\'t get the nicest presents this year, I\'m worried about some very naughty children. It seems that many of them have gone missing from this island and others. On the off chance, could you tell your explorers to keep an eye and an ear open and let me know if they hear anything about the missing children?',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub1_lvl26' => 'So, regarding my Wonderland, give me your resources so I can- I mean ribbit would you be so kind as to lend me a hand ribbit? I need to bake some delicious cakes..ribbit- I mean I need to bake houses for my guests, ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub1_lvl36' => 'So, regarding my Wonderland, give me your resources so I can- I mean ribbit would you be so kind as to lend me a hand ribbit? I need to bake some delicious cakes..ribbit- I mean I need to bake houses for my guests, ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub1_lvl51' => 'So, regarding my Wonderland, give me your resources so I can- I mean ribbit would you be so kind as to lend me a hand ribbit? I need to bake some delicious cakes..ribbit- I mean I need to bake houses for my guests, ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub2_lvl26' => 'I\'m a bit short on presents this ribbit year... Could you bring some toys over to the Winter Wonderland? Some of these little people are becoming really ribbit annoy- I mean, I want to bring happiness to them! Ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub2_lvl36' => 'I\'m a bit short on presents this ribbit year... Could you bring some toys over to the Winter Wonderland? Some of these little people are becoming really ribbit annoy- I mean, I want to bring happiness to them! Ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub2_lvl51' => 'I\'m a bit short on presents this ribbit year... Could you bring some toys over to the Winter Wonderland? Some of these little people are becoming really ribbit annoy- I mean, I want to bring happiness to them! Ribbit.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub3_lvl26' => 'So - I\'ve just found out that some evildoer is impersonating me! And apparently, they\'ve built a fake Christmas Island to lure children into a trap! Ah... so you know who\'s behind this nefarious scheme? That gives me an idea... 

It seems the children and Settlers who went missing have been lured to that Island. I\'ve taken a look, but it seems the people are under some kind of evil spell, and won\'t leave it on their own. I need some special ingredients to produce a cure for these people. We can disguise these crates full of spell-breaking potions as presents, as the evildoer is apparently after them. Once I\'ve made the mixture, we\'ll have to wait for some time before it becomes really effective.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub3_lvl36' => 'So - I\'ve just found out that some evildoer is impersonating me! And apparently, they\'ve built a fake Christmas Island to lure children into a trap! Ah... so you know who\'s behind this nefarious scheme? That gives me an idea... 

It seems the children and Settlers who went missing have been lured to that Island. I\'ve taken a look, but it seems the people are under some kind of evil spell, and won\'t leave it on their own. I need some special ingredients to produce a cure for these people. We can disguise these crates full of spell-breaking potions as presents, as the evildoer is apparently after them. Once I\'ve made the mixture, we\'ll have to wait for some time before it becomes really effective.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub3_lvl51' => 'So - I\'ve just found out that some evildoer is impersonating me! And apparently, they\'ve built a fake Christmas Island to lure children into a trap! Ah... so you know who\'s behind this nefarious scheme? That gives me an idea... 

It seems the children and Settlers who went missing have been lured to that Island. I\'ve taken a look, but it seems the people are under some kind of evil spell, and won\'t leave it on their own. I need some special ingredients to produce a cure for these people. We can disguise these crates full of spell-breaking potions as presents, as the evildoer is apparently after them. Once I\'ve made the mixture, we\'ll have to wait for some time before it becomes really effective.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub4_lvl26' => 'Only one thing left to do. Bring everyone back home to their families. The children are back to normal and will surely behave better from now on.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub4_lvl36' => 'Only one thing left to do. Bring everyone back home to their families. The children are back to normal and will surely behave better from now on.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderlandSub4_lvl51' => 'Only one thing left to do. Bring everyone back home to their families. The children are back to normal and will surely behave better from now on.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderland_lvl26' => 'This year I\'ve prepared something special for these cheery little Settlers, teeheehee.

I\'m creating a special Island to celebrate Santa\'s- eh, I mean MY festival! I just need some more help preparing it all.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderland_lvl36' => 'This year I\'ve prepared something special for these cheery little Settlers, teeheehee.

I\'m creating a special Island to celebrate Santa\'s- eh, I mean MY festival! I just need some more help preparing it all.',
        'XMAS2017plus_WinterWonderland_lvl51' => 'This year I\'ve prepared something special for these cheery little Settlers, teeheehee.

I\'m creating a special Island to celebrate Santa\'s- eh, I mean MY festival! I just need some more help preparing it all.',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket2_lvl26' => 'It\'s working! The Settlers are swarming the Market and their mood has already improved, despite all the hardships some of them have to face. But it seems the toy ducks have already run out - and the Settlers are asking for more. We\'d better not keep them waiting!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket2_lvl36' => 'It\'s working! The Settlers are swarming the Market and their mood has already improved, despite all the hardships some of them have to face. But it seems the toy ducks have already run out - and the Settlers are asking for more. We\'d better not keep them waiting!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket2_lvl51' => 'It\'s working! The Settlers are swarming the Market and their mood has already improved, despite all the hardships some of them have to face. But it seems the toy ducks have already run out - and the Settlers are asking for more. We\'d better not keep them waiting!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket3_lvl26' => 'At this point, you\'re familiar with how it\'s done. More Market Stalls have opened and they need gifts to hand out. I myself am quite eager to get one of those cute, slightly crazy-looking bunnies!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket3_lvl36' => 'At this point, you\'re familiar with how it\'s done. More Market Stalls have opened and they need gifts to hand out. I myself am quite eager to get one of those cute, slightly crazy-looking bunnies!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket3_lvl51' => 'At this point, you\'re familiar with how it\'s done. More Market Stalls have opened and they need gifts to hand out. I myself am quite eager to get one of those cute, slightly crazy-looking bunnies!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarketFinal_lvl26' => 'Just one last delivery of gifts is required, and those charming bears will definitely do the trick. This should at least put a hint of a smile on everyone\'s face, no matter how saddened they are.',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarketFinal_lvl36' => 'Just one last delivery of gifts is required, and those charming bears will definitely do the trick. This should at least put a hint of a smile on everyone\'s face, no matter how saddened they are.',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarketFinal_lvl51' => 'Just one last delivery of gifts is required, and those charming bears will definitely do the trick. This should at least put a hint of a smile on everyone\'s face, no matter how saddened they are.',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket_LevelRequirement' => 'I\'d like to ask for your help, but first you need to be prepared for the tasks to come.',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket_Main_lvl26' => 'It seems that, this year in particular, many Settlers are feeling uneasy. I\'ve been unable to locate a lot of the children on my naughty list and I fear the worst. That\'s why I want to do my best to cheer everyone up as much as I can. But as you know, I don\'t really have any free time right now. Could I ask you to help making this year\'s Christmas unforgettable by building something special? I heard you\'re quite good in this regard!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket_Main_lvl36' => 'It seems that, this year in particular, many Settlers are feeling uneasy. I\'ve been unable to locate a lot of the children on my naughty list and I fear the worst. That\'s why I want to do my best to cheer everyone up as much as I can. But as you know, I don\'t really have any free time right now. Could I ask you to help making this year\'s Christmas unforgettable by building something special? I heard you\'re quite good in this regard!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket_Main_lvl51' => 'It seems that, this year in particular, many Settlers are feeling uneasy. I\'ve been unable to locate a lot of the children on my naughty list and I fear the worst. That\'s why I want to do my best to cheer everyone up as much as I can. But as you know, I don\'t really have any free time right now. Could I ask you to help making this year\'s Christmas unforgettable by building something special? I heard you\'re quite good in this regard!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket_lvl26' => 'Now the market is up and running, but visitors need something to take home with them to really make it unforgettable! Your ducks will do the job quite nicely, ho ho ho.',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket_lvl36' => 'Now the market is up and running, but visitors need something to take home with them to really make it unforgettable! Your ducks will do the job quite nicely, ho ho ho.',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasMarket_lvl51' => 'Now the market is up and running, but visitors need something to take home with them to really make it unforgettable! Your ducks will do the job quite nicely, ho ho ho.',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasSpiritFinal_lvl26' => 'And now for the final step! To keep the Holiday Cheers high, we need to propagate the feeling of togetherness. Cooperate with others in completing tasks and see the feeling of togetherness grow.',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasSpiritFinal_lvl36' => 'And now for the final step! To keep the Holiday Cheers high, we need to propagate the feeling of togetherness. Cooperate with others in completing tasks and see the feeling of togetherness grow.',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasSpiritFinal_lvl51' => 'And now for the final step! To keep the Holiday Cheers high, we need to propagate the feeling of togetherness. Cooperate with others in completing tasks and see the feeling of togetherness grow.',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasSpirit_Main_lvl26' => 'This should be the best time of the year. A season of happiness, joy and reflection. But everyone seems to be distracted by the mundane worries of life. Unfortunately, the Christmas preparations keep me occupied and don\'t allow me to address the problem myself. So I need your help to cheer up everyone and spread the Christmas spirit throughout the lands. I know you can do this!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasSpirit_Main_lvl36' => 'This should be the best time of the year. A season of happiness, joy and reflection. But everyone seems to be distracted by the mundane worries of life. Unfortunately, the Christmas preparations keep me occupied and don\'t allow me to address the problem myself. So I need your help to cheer up everyone and spread the Christmas spirit throughout the lands. I know you can do this!',
        'XMAS2017plus_XmasSpirit_Main_lvl51' => 'This should be the best time of the year. A season of happiness, joy and reflection. But everyone seems to be distracted by the mundane worries of life. Unfortunately, the Christmas preparations keep me occupied and don\'t allow me to address the problem myself. So I need your help to cheer up everyone and spread the Christmas spirit throughout the lands. I know you can do this!',
        'XMASEventAdv' => 'Use the Christmas present buffs being produced in the provision house and the rarity provision house to help all family members in non-Christmassy houses get into the Christmas spirit.',
        'XMASEventCookieAdv' => 'Ribbit...Those little ones are really noisy aren\'t they. All day long they ask for toys. "Play with me, Santa", they go on and on. Even though I created this happy land, they still aren\'t happy ribbit. Well, I leave it up to you, and you\'ll do what I tell you, right? Thihihibbit.',
        'XMASEventCookieAdv_Buff' => 'Okay, good. We managed to bring the spell-breaking mixtures to this fake Christmas paradise. Now, look for suspicious areas where the evil magic is strongest, and reveal the truth behind the spell.',
        'XMASEventCookieAdv_Main' => 'At last, my presents are ready ribbit! I ribbit waited so long for these. I mean, the children...ribbit...the children waited so long for these! Now, hurry up and bring them to me! To the small Settlers ribbit. Bring them to the small Settlers of course.',
        'XMASEventCookieAdv_Military' => 'So you ribbit have seen through my perfect cover ribbit. That doesn\'t ribbit matter. I won\'t let you have these precious little ones. I can get so many delicious cakes for them and I\'ll never let them go ribbit!',
    ],
