    ],
    'SD1' => [
        '1001NightsBesiegedCity' => 'Help Sinbad the Sailor save a city from a siege, while gathering leads for Scheherazade\'s location.',
        '1001NightsFirstThief' => 'Follow Scheherazade\'s trail with Ali Baba and hunt down the thief.',
        '1001NightsOilLamp' => 'Follow a lead for Scheherazade\'s location, and help Aladdin find an ancient Oil Lamp.',
        '1001NightsPrincess' => 'Follow leads pointing to Scheherazade\'s location with the help of your loyal friend Aladdin.',
        '1001NightsSeaSnake' => 'Help Sinbad the Sailor find treasure hidden in an abandoned cave.',
        '1001NightsSecondThief' => 'Follow the trails of the hidden treasure with Ali Baba.',
        '1001NightsThirdThief' => 'Follow the trails of beautiful women, who are being held captive in a stronghold.',
        '1001NightsTreasureKnowledge' => 'Help Ali Baba follow the trail of the legendary Treasure of Knowledge.',
        '1001NightsTreasureWisdom' => 'Unveil the mystery surrounding the legendary Treasure of Wisdom.',
        '1001NightsWoodcutter' => 'Help King Schahri on his quest to find his lost wife Scheherazade.',
        'AddRecipe_AdventureZoneTravelBoostHigh' => 'The best you can find, when it comes to creating star charts.',
        'AddRecipe_AdventureZoneTravelBoostMedium' => 'Information about how to add more detail to your star charts.',
        'AddRecipe_BaracksBoost' => 'Need some more troops for your colony conquest? Start this enrolment campaign in the combat academy to increase motivation.',
        'AddRecipe_ImprovedPaperConverter' => 'Sometimes, plain white paper just isn\'t enough. To write beautiful greeting cards to your grandmother and all your settling friends, advanced paper is the best choice.',
        'AddRecipe_MarbleRefill' => 'One of your settlers has found out how to refill some of our marble deposits. He\'d be willing to share this knowledge for some scarecrows and herbs...',
        'AddRecipe_PaperConverter' => 'Your settlers have acquired a special paper mill. With this, we can make higher quality paper by recycling ordinary ones.',
        'AddRecipe_PlatinumHorseShoes' => 'A blacksmith has come up with a more durable design for horseshoes. While it will require valuable platinum, I\'m sure your generals will appreciate the new, sturdier design on their more challenging adventures.',
        'AddRecipe_ProductivityAreaBuffLvl3' => 'Our mice problem is getting worse every week... This leaves us with no choice but to engage in a bit of biological warfare! An expert has offered to share her knowledge on how we can attract enough cats to patrol at least a moderately-sized area.',
        'AddRecipe_ProductivityAreaBuffLvl4' => 'In an attempt to keep ancient customs alive, the wrinkled wisewoman offers to teach a ritual to appease the local forest spirits. Even if there were no such things, it\'s sure to boost the woodworkers\' morale.',
        'AddRecipe_ProductivityAreaBuffLvl5' => 'A clever hunter came up with a new trap design. Not only is it stronger, but it selectively catches only full-grown game, which is less damaging to the island\'s ecosystem.',
        'AddRecipe_ProductivityAreaBuffLvl6' => 'Every now and then, a group of muscular Smelters decide to pose for a calendar for charity. To get into shape for the event, all the smelters in the area, and all the workers in the epic forge work extra hard.',
        'AddRecipe_ProductivityBuff300' => 'Aunt Irma has prepared her special feast, so all settlers in a workyard will have enough power for a 24 hour shift.',
        'AddRecipe_RarityProductivityBuffLvl23' => 'Give your settlers a nice steak. This will increase their working morale.',
        'AddRecipe_RemoveBuff' => 'Give special orders to all settlers in a building to ignore all buffs that have been applied to that building.',
        'AddRecipe_SmallGlue' => 'A special glue which helps refine the production process of your book binder. With this glue, everything runs faster.',
        'AddRecipe_StoneRefill' => 'There is a tradesman from a foreign kingdom that\'s rich in stone, but lacking in wood. He needs to build barrels for his trading house, and would like to exchange stone for some barrels.',
        'AddRecipe_TSR_SheetMusic6' => 'Add great music from The Settlers: New Allies to the Concert Hall',
        'AddRecipe_Tower_Unlock_Upgrade2' => 'When you’re so good that even a gigantic, trophy shaped tower isn’t quite pompous enough...

Here’s a guide to make it even more glorious.',
        'AddRecipe_WeaponsmithBoost' => 'Give your weaponsmiths in the Combat Armoury a boost for their production by teaching them a special song from one of our colonies. They\'ll love it!',
        'AdditionalAdmiralShop' => 'Another marshal you can recruit, in addition to those in your tavern. You might be able to make use of the help.',
        'AdvancedPaperLvl1' => 'Finally the complaints of your scribes have been heard - here\'s some paper that doesn\'t irritate your palm when writing. In fact it\'s so comfortable that many have been found face down asleep on it.',
        'AdvancedToolmaker_mini' => 'A tribute to all toolmakers who’ve always loved their advanced tools!',
        'AdvancedToolslvl1' => 'An impressive load of advanced tools to push your peak productivity.',
        'AdventureANightToRemember' => 'Test Adventure',
        'AdventureArcticExplosion' => 'You wouldn\'t believe it! The Nords are back, and this time they mean business. They raided an island that produces gunpowder for the King\'s army, and they took more than one thousand barrels. It takes just one barrel to destroy a small village...imagine what they could do with that amount! If I understood correctly, they want to detonate the barrels, creating a tidal wave that would wipe out several neighbouring islands, including our own. We cannot let this happen! We need to travel to that abandoned island and take care of business!',
        'AdventureBanditNest' => 'The Scouts have found a house hidden in the forest where they think the rogues Chuck, One-Eyed Bert and Metal Tooth are living. Travel to the dark part of the forest and check the rumour out. If you find the scoundrels there, catch them and bring them to justice.',
        'AdventureBastilleIsland' => 'There\'s an island, somewhere far from here, where all the infamous bad guys and their clans have been imprisoned. They live there under their own rules, but they\'re not allowed to leave. The island warden, Count Hackett, has written us a letter saying the clans have started a war between each other to try and win ownership of the island! We must go there quickly and calm them down in our own special way. Yes, that\'s right - we\'re going to do a little cleanup!',
        'AdventureBountyHunter' => 'A rich merchant seeks your help.

Some business partners have double-crossed him and now he wants revenge. They have set up camp in a nearby canyon.',
        'AdventureBuccaneerRoundup' => 'The Pirates have entrenched themselves on this island with a complicated network of unbreakable stockades.
Only proper teamwork and synchronized attacks will be able to unravel the island’s formidable fortifications.',
        'AdventureChristmas1' => 'As you adjourn to your chamber for the evening, you find a letter lying on your bed with no indication who it\'s from. Excited, you open it and read through the hastily written lines. It turns out the letter was written by Santa Claus himself! He explains that a grouch named "Croaker" has stolen all the presents and barricaded himself, together with some other bandits, on an island! It\'s up to you to get the presents back, and save the Christmas feast!',
        'AdventureChristmas2' => 'The Croaker returned and stole Santa\'s beloved Sleigh.
Help Santa to retrieve it and teach the Croaker a lesson.',
        'AdventureEMEvent01' => 'This match can only be repeated for test purposes.',
        'AdventureEMEvent01_2' => 'The defensive stance of your first opponent might suggest diffidence, and tempt the foolhardy general into carelessness. However, rest assured that these men, hardened by some fateful battles, have quite a few perfidious tricks up their sleeves, and their injuries may not be as serious as they make out.',
        'AdventureEMEvent02' => 'This match can only be repeated for test purposes.',
        'AdventureEMEvent02_2' => 'They seem unpredictable and wayward, but it would not be advisable to underestimate them. Among them are some of the most experienced and well versed fighters, yet word is that their own trainers seem to struggle with their rigidity. It is even reported that in the face of defeat, some of them become inappropriately headstrong...',
        'AdventureEMEvent03' => 'This match can only be repeated for test purposes.',
        'AdventureEMEvent03_2' => 'You are now facing veterans of this tournament, even if their historical feats are not always undisputed. These all-weather champions seem quick to battle and always ready for a jolly knees-up, but they can also quickly turn a battle in their favor without much of a plan.',
        'AdventureEMEvent04' => 'This match can only be repeated for test purposes.',
        'AdventureEMEvent04_2' => 'One ought to be surprised how ruthless the men from these otherwise cultivated lands can act in battle. These valiant combatants used to win their battles with skill and finesse, proving to be formidable opponents. These days, it is said that when particularly challenged, they resort to combat techniques similar to those practiced in the east.',
        'AdventureEMEvent05' => 'This match can only be repeated for test purposes.',
        'AdventureEMEvent05_2' => 'With almost mechanical routine these contestants have turned many a battle in their favor, often not exactly with tactical flair. It seems that only their predictability and confidence in victory could possibly be their undoing. Yet, they may have met their match with you. If you manage to bring them out of their shell, victory is already within reach.',
        'AdventureEMEvent06' => 'This match can only be repeated for test purposes.',
        'AdventureEMEvent06_2' => 'How deceptively graceful these apparitions may appear when seen scurrying across the battlefield. These sinuous combatants might tempt the short-witted to underestimate their actual proficiency. But beware, your opponents are astute strategists that are up to every trick in the book. Many opponents have already fallen prey to their clever tactical scheming.',
        'AdventureEMEvent07' => 'This match can only be repeated for test purposes.',
        'AdventureEaster2014' => 'Garrun the Trapper has decided to take upon himself to sabotage Easter. 
To accomplish this he has gathered a cohort of poachers, trappers and hounds and is holding many, if not all, of the Easter Bunnies captive on his camp on Egg Island. 
Set forth to destroy him and liberate the bunnies!',
        'AdventureEasterEvent2013Adventure01' => 'Buy this adventure to search for Easter eggs. 
This adventure does not contain any rewards and can only be bought once!',
        'AdventureEasterEvent2013Adventure02' => 'Buy this adventure to search for Easter eggs. 
This adventure does not contain any rewards and can only be bought once!',
        'AdventureEasterEvent2013Adventure03' => 'Buy this adventure to search for Easter eggs. 
This adventure does not contain any rewards and can only be bought once!',
        'AdventureEasterEvent2013Adventure04' => 'Buy this adventure to search for Easter eggs. 
This adventure does not contain any rewards and can only be bought once!',
        'AdventureEasterEvent2013Adventure05' => 'Buy this adventure to search for Easter eggs. 
This adventure does not contain any rewards and can only be bought once!',
        'AdventureEasterEvent2013Adventure06' => 'Buy this adventure to search for Easter eggs. 
This adventure does not contain any rewards and can only be bought once!',
        'AdventureEasterEvent2013Adventure07' => 'Buy this adventure to search for Easter eggs. 
This adventure does not contain any rewards and can only be bought once!',
        'AdventureEasterEvent2013Adventure08' => 'Buy this adventure to search for Easter eggs. 
This adventure does not contain any rewards and can only be bought once!',
        'AdventureEasterEventAdventure01' => 'You have got the coordinates for the first stage of the paper chase. Follow the instructions on the map.
Note: The Easter adventures only give rewards when finished in context of the quests.',
        'AdventureEasterEventAdventure02' => 'The coordinates for the second stage have arrived. Now the paper chase can continue. Take your basket and keep on collecting...
Note: The Easter adventures only give rewards when finished in context of the quests.',
        'AdventureEasterEventAdventure03' => 'The Easter bunny\'s brother has already left to hide the remaining Easter eggs. You decide to leave too, and visit the last paper chase island.
Note: The Easter adventures only give rewards when finished in context of the quests.',
        'AdventureEasterEventAdventure04' => 'You take a look at the map and immediately guess what the brother is about to ask you; to help collect the missing eggs. He promises to let you keep some of the eggs if you do.
Note: The Easter adventures only give rewards when finished in context of the quests.',
        'AdventureEasterEventAdventure05' => 'The map including the new coordinates lies on the desk waiting to be picked up. So, let\'s go to the next Easter egg search!
Note: The Easter adventures only give rewards when finished in context of the quests.',
        'AdventureEasterEventAdventure06' => 'No sweat. Now let\'s move on. According to the Easter bunny\'s brother, this is the last area where he lost Easter eggs. So, let\'s go!
Note: The Easter adventures only give rewards when finished in context of the quests.',
        'AdventureEasterEventAdventure07' => 'You got an exact description of the old man. It really seems like the Easter bunny\'s brother has hidden the eggs in the wrong area. So, the “Easter egg recovery” mission goes on.
Note: The Easter adventures only give rewards when finished in context of the quests.',
        'AdventureEasterEventAdventure08' => 'The Easter bunny\'s brother remembers the first island where he hid Easter eggs by mistake. He also remembers that he could not read his brother\'s handwriting, so he improvised... incorrectly. You should start a new search.
Note: The Easter adventures only give rewards when finished in context of the quests.',
        'AdventureEasterEventAdventure09' => 'Now it seems the end of the chase is really drawing near. You decide to be extraordinarily efficient this time. And with the help of the rabbit, what could possibly go wrong?
Note: The Easter adventures only give rewards when finished in context of the quests.',
        'AdventureEasterEventAdventure10' => 'A letter lies on your bed. You open it and see new coordinates for an island. Furthermore, you find an accompanying handwritten letter saying “Thank you for your help. Without you, Easter would have been a disaster. As a gift, we have hidden some more Easter eggs. Have fun searching."
Note: The Easter adventures only give rewards when finished in context of the quests.',
        'AdventureEoWEvent' => 'The old astrologist has convinced our venerable King Damien that we are all doomed! A mysterious group of witch-doctors cast a terrible curse over the world a thousand years ago - but luckily, the old astrologist knows how we can escape the disaster. He\'s opened a gateway in time to take you back to the day the curse was cast. We need you to prevent this cataclysmic ritual from ever taking place!',
        'AdventureGunpowder' => 'A spy report tells of a secluded castle in a large valley far to the east. Evidently, the knights there have got hold of some cannons. Those mighty weapons might prove very useful in the future, but the knights surely won\'t give them away freely. You may have to convince them with a little... manpower.',
        'AdventureHorseback' => 'The people of the great veld seek your assistance.

One of the rider clans has started terrorizing the settlers in this region, taking their belongings and stealing their flocks. If no one helps them, they will have to leave their homeland. The local population doesn\'t possess much, but they are willing to offer their most precious heirloom to anyone who can drive the rider clan away.',
        'AdventureLakesideTreasure' => 'An old treasure map we found hints at a great treasure, hidden on a small island. It seems to be linked to an ancient civilization.
Set sail for this island and find the treasure!',
        'AdventureMadHenry' => 'A plea for help reaches your kingdom.
Terrified citizens claim they have been repeatedly raided by a band of villains under the command of a strange woman. She calls herself “Wild Mary" and dares anyone to challenge her. The villagers are in desperate need of help.',
        'AdventureMadHenryReloaded' => 'A plea for help reaches your kingdom.
Terrified citizens claim they have been repeatedly raided by a band of villains under the command of a strange woman. She calls herself "Wild Mary" and dares everyone to challenge her. The villagers are in desperate need of help.',
        'AdventureMiadPirateLife' => 'Are you sitting down? This letter here came from pirates! And it\'s not a call for ransom or a new threat! They need our help! Yes, you heard me well! A group of veteran and retired pirates, who we defeated several times some years ago, are under attack by bandits. They say the bandits came and took over their island. Apparently, the bandits want to become pirates, so they\'re forcing the veterans to teach them about the pirate life. I\'m so confused now... Should we help them? Yes? Well, let\'s buckle up then!',
        'AdventureMiadSleepyReef' => 'We have an urgent matter. Please, sit, there\'s much to tell. King Damien has an elite group of people called "The Unity". These people are the ones the King trusts and shares all his secret plans with and whatnot. One of the generals who was part of this special group retired some years ago, and the King gifted him an island. Yes, you heard me. The man got an island. Gregorid Skoln is his name, and he lives in honoured retirement on his island, Sleepy Reef, along with his wife and his most beloved daughter, Sabilyn. Sadly, Gregorid had some unfinished business before he left Capital Island, and that business has taken over his island. Some of the traitors stormed the island and are now holding Gregorid and his family hostage. I think this calls for a visit, am I right? Don\'t forget your sword.',
        'AdventureMiadTheLostSkull' => 'A letter from King Damien arrived this morning. We are to travel to Skull Island and stop a bunch of young pirates finding a long lost treasure! I\'ll tell you more about it all when we arrive! Off we go to Skull Island!',
        'AdventureMiadTheSleepingVolcano' => 'We\'ve had our share of weird people trying to do weird things but this is going a tad too far. There\'s this alchemist who somehow managed to create the "Cult of the Sleeping Flame". He actually got followers! And that\'s not all, here comes the best part : he wants to revive a sleeping volcano. Yes, you heard me. Flintrock island is basically on top of a sleeping volcano, and we must go there and save those people before the cult leader burns the whole island to ashes!',
        'AdventureMiadTropicalSun' => 'A pigeon landed this morning, bringing news from your good friend Lord Walder the Bold. Or is it bald? Either way, he requested your attention regarding a small problem. His people live on an island that\'s ruled by a fierce pirate leader, but they get along well. Neither hurts the other, and peace fills the air. Then two weeks ago, an unknown bandit gang appeared from the badlands, and they seem to want to take the island for themselves. Lord Walder needs your help! I say we rally some of our military forces and pay them a visit!',
        'AdventureMilitaryBirthday1' => 'A village is in need of your help. Their houses have been changing their appearance because of a dark magical influence. Will you help?',
        'AdventureMilitaryBirthday2' => 'Dark ruins glowing mystically, changing the appearance of buildings. This is the problem these people have to deal with. They could really do with a hand.',
        'AdventureMoreSecludedExperiments' => 'Do you remember the man who did all those strange experiments some time ago? He was not amused that you destroyed his laboratory. Now, he\'s back - and he wants his revenge! Quick - stop his new experiments before they\'re finished!',
        'AdventureMotherLove' => 'The last time you met the crazy ship’s cook, you defeated him and his crew and banished them from the island. After that defeat, the crazy ship’s cook went back to his parent’s house. Now his mother is watching over him. If you want to finish him off, you\'ll have to take on his mother first.',
        'AdventureNewBanditNest' => 'You\'ve received some new messages from your villagers, telling you there are once again some strange things happening in the woods where you defeated the bandits. The villagers have asked you to take a look and get to the bottom of this new mystery.',
        'AdventureOldFriends' => 'The last time you went to battle with the witch of the swamp, you defeated her - but a Dark High Priest eluded your grasp. The priest retreated to an abandoned piece of land and performed a dark ritual to bring the witch back to life again. Now, the witch of the swamp is regenerating - and she\'s planning her revenge against you. Defeat her while she\'s weak!',
        'AdventureOutlaws' => 'It is a mark of troubled times when even captivity cannot stop wicked bandits from forming new groups of outlaws. Travellers tell of fearsome raids in the nearby forests. The local knights cannot deal with this hardened group alone and have requested your assistance. Send your men and make the roads safe again!',
        'AdventurePirates' => 'Test Adventure',
        'AdventureRaidingTheRaiders' => 'One of the scouts managed to track a Raider ship back to its homeport. 
His report indicates it\'s a thriving island governed, in true Raider tradition, by three chieftains.  This seems to be as good a chance as any to give them a taste of their own medicine!
Strike at their leaders and loot their supplies once they are defenceless!',
        'AdventureRoaringBull' => 'The rider clans of the great veld have requested your assistance. Apparently, an evil shaman called "Roaring Bull" has claimed regency over the entire area. He and his fellow shamans command dark magic and fierce warriors. Nobody can stand against them. You will have to send your finest men in order to defeat them.',
        'AdventureSecludedExperiments' => 'You have received word of a mad alchemist who performs experiments on living human beings! He has hired an experienced troop of deadly mercenaries to protect him. You cannot allow this to happen in the vicinity of your realm! Send your troops and stop the madman!',
        'AdventureSonsOfTheVeld' => 'You have received a letter of challenge from a group called "The Sons Of The Veld". Obviously a new rider clan has emerged and is overconfident about its own strength. This challenge is an affront to your honour. You have to show these savages their place!',
        'AdventureSplitCity' => 'A message bound to the foot of a dove revealed a call for help from faraway lands. For a decade, all kinds of evil foes have swarmed into the small town of Kalijenorod all year long. The declining population cannot explain why this is happening, and are unable to defend themselves any longer. Though the invaders do not attack the people directly, the townsfolk are no longer able to live a peaceful life. Will you help them drive out the evildoers?',
        'AdventureStealingFromTheRich' => 'A very concerned landlord has written a letter to you. One of his previously loyal master archers has turned rogue, living in the forest and stealing gold from rich merchants and nobles. With it, he bribes simple peasants into rioting. You have to stop this at once!',
        'AdventureStealingFromTheRich02' => 'Do you remember the master archer who stole from the rich? Well, he’s back! Or at least, that’s what we think... It may just be a copycat. Nevertheless, someone is rioting within our noble kingdom, stealing from rich merchants to fuel another riot. Please, find this guy and put a stop to it before he does any further harm to our kingdom...',
        'AdventureStormRecovery' => 'Help the villagers to rebuild their settlement after a serious storm in this challenging adventure.

Attention: you can fail this adventure.',
        'AdventureSurpriseAttack' => 'A group of the notorious Nords built their camp on a small island nearby. It seems as if they prepare an attack against you. They don’t know that their landing was noticed by you. Therefore it would be intelligent to attack them now.',
        'AdventureTheBetrayedLittleTailor' => 'Though the little tailor reconciled with his sons, new problems have arisen.
A greedy inn-keeper stole the magical items his sons received from their masters.
He once again needs your help to get them back.',
        'AdventureTheBlackKnights' => 'A claim of sovereignty has arrived at your castle. Hector the Black and his brother Barnabas demand a whole mountain range as their new territory. They have already secretly built black castles and recruited numerous men to defend them. What will you do? Allow this treason to happen? Or will you put an end to this claim once and for all?',
        'AdventureTheBlackKnights01' => 'A claim of sovereignty has arrived at your castle. Hector the Black and his brother Barnabas are demanding a whole mountain range be granted to them as their new territory. They have already secretly built black castles across the mountains, and recruited numerous men to defend them. What will you do? Allow this treason to happen? Or will you put an end to this claim once and for all?',
        'AdventureTheBlackKnights02' => 'A claim of sovereignty has arrived at your castle. Hector the Black and his brother Barnabas are demanding a whole mountain range be granted to them as their new territory. They have already secretly built black castles across the mountains, and recruited numerous men to defend them. What will you do? Allow this treason to happen? Or will you put an end to this claim once and for all?',
        'AdventureTheBlackKnights03' => 'A claim of sovereignty has arrived at your castle. Hector the Black and his brother Barnabas are demanding a whole mountain range be granted to them as their new territory. They have already secretly built black castles across the mountains, and recruited numerous men to defend them. What will you do? Allow this treason to happen? Or will you put an end to this claim once and for all?',
        'AdventureTheBlackKnights04' => 'A claim of sovereignty has arrived at your castle. Hector the Black and his brother Barnabas are demanding a whole mountain range be granted to them as their new territory. They have already secretly built black castles across the mountains, and recruited numerous men to defend them. What will you do? Allow this treason to happen? Or will you put an end to this claim once and for all?',
        'AdventureTheBlackKnights05' => 'A claim of sovereignty has arrived at your castle. Hector the Black and his brother Barnabas are demanding a whole mountain range be granted to them as their new territory. They have already secretly built black castles across the mountains, and recruited numerous men to defend them. What will you do? Allow this treason to happen? Or will you put an end to this claim once and for all?',
        'AdventureTheBlackKnights06' => 'A claim of sovereignty has arrived at your castle. Hector the Black and his brother Barnabas are demanding a whole mountain range be granted to them as their new territory. They have already secretly built black castles across the mountains, and recruited numerous men to defend them. What will you do? Allow this treason to happen? Or will you put an end to this claim once and for all?',
        'AdventureTheBlackKnights07' => 'A claim of sovereignty has arrived at your castle. Hector the Black and his brother Barnabas are demanding a whole mountain range be granted to them as their new territory. They have already secretly built black castles across the mountains, and recruited numerous men to defend them. What will you do? Allow this treason to happen? Or will you put an end to this claim once and for all?',
        'AdventureTheBlackKnights08' => 'A claim of sovereignty has arrived at your castle. Hector the Black and his brother Barnabas are demanding a whole mountain range be granted to them as their new territory. They have already secretly built black castles across the mountains, and recruited numerous men to defend them. What will you do? Allow this treason to happen? Or will you put an end to this claim once and for all?',
        'AdventureTheBlackKnights09' => 'A claim of sovereignty has arrived at your castle. Hector the Black and his brother Barnabas are demanding a whole mountain range be granted to them as their new territory. They have already secretly built black castles across the mountains, and recruited numerous men to defend them. What will you do? Allow this treason to happen? Or will you put an end to this claim once and for all?',
        'AdventureTheBlackKnights10' => 'A claim of sovereignty has arrived at your castle. Hector the Black and his brother Barnabas are demanding a whole mountain range be granted to them as their new territory. They have already secretly built black castles across the mountains, and recruited numerous men to defend them. What will you do? Allow this treason to happen? Or will you put an end to this claim once and for all?',
        'AdventureTheCleverLittleTailor' => 'Your friend, the little tailor once again needs your help.

The king you defeated regrets his sins and pledges to approve a marriage between his daughter and the tailor. 

But a rival tailor claimed that he did all the hard work and therefore acquired the right for the princess\' hand.

To prove his competitor wrong, the princess gave the little tailor a difficult task…',
        'AdventureTheDarkBrotherhood' => 'More and more townsfolk are drawn to a mysterious order in the vicinity of your castle. After some investigation it turns out that a dark brotherhood is trying to undermine your regency. You cannot allow that to happen! Send your men to stop this foul corruption from spreading.',
        'AdventureTheDarkPriests' => 'Rumour has it that a couple of dark priests are performing dark rituals. Very dark rituals. There have even been several cats reported missing recently. Understandably, your citizens are more than a little concerned about this. They have turned to you for help and are willing to give what they have in order to compensate you for your efforts.',
        'AdventureTheHeroicLittleTailor' => 'You received a messenger pigeon from your old friend, the little tailor.

He got divorced from the princess, because he realised that she can’t be the right one if she demands from him that he risks his life for no reason.

So he decided to take a journey to learn the wonders of this world.

But unfortunately he wandered too deep into a dark forest and is now stranded in a hermit’s hut.
The forest around him is too dangerous to leave the hut alone, so he needs your help to get back home.',
        'AdventureTheIslandOfThePirates' => 'On a secluded island, a band of pirates has built its headquarters and is attacking helpless port cities and frightening inhabitants for hundreds of kilometers around. If you want to earn fame and glory, visit the island and banish the pirates and their crazy ship\'s cook.',
        'AdventureTheNords' => 'You have received a threatening letter containing the demands of a bunch of wild men that landed on the shore not long ago. Apparently, they are part of some kind of wild Nordic tribe that intends to go pillaging and plundering their way through the area. For the sake of your people\'s safety you should challenge this tribe. Drive them away and restore peace and order to your kingdom.',
        'AdventureTheNords2' => 'One of our traders just arrived back from Nearpole Island bearing bad news! He claims that the most feared Nords invaded the island and they brought a cold wind along! They came from the northern islands that were believed to be buried under the ice. We need to head to Windy Island and see what\'s happening!',
        'AdventureTheSiege' => 'The remote mansion of Lord Scroogius is being besieged by two competing factions. 
Due to the lay of the land, a two-pronged assault will be required to break the siege in the little time they have left until their provisions run out. 
Hurry to help the lord and the reward will be well worth it!',
        'AdventureTheSonsOfTheLittleTailor' => 'You received a letter from your friend, the little tailor.
He told you that he has three sons and that he made a big mistake. 
He now wants to make up for this, but needs your help to do so.',
        'AdventureTheValiantLittleTailor' => 'Your old friend the little tailor is in a bad way. The king has sent him on a very dangerous task where he can’t succeed alone.
Maybe you can help him out?',
        'AdventureTombRaiders' => 'Dark Cultists have retrieved an ancient artefact and secluded it on their fortified island, where they perform unspeakable rituals in its name. 
Sail forth with your comrades and put an end to this abominable practice!',
        'AdventureTraitors' => 'Loyal men they were, but greed turned them into ruthless bandits. The nobles have turned to you for help against these deserters. Be careful if you approach them since these traitors are heavily armed, battle hardened men.',
        'AdventureTraitors02' => 'Do you remember Sir Robin, the king of the traitors? Well, he’s back! Some of his loyal followers freed him from his prison. Ever since, he’s been hiding on an island nearby. Finally, we’ve managed to locate him, and it’s time to take action! We need to put him back in prison before he starts attacking our beautiful kingdom!',
        'AdventureVictorTheVicious' => 'Victor The Vicious hails from a kingdom far away.

His skills in archery are unparalleled. Some say he shot an apple from the head of his own son! Unfortunately he has claimed the nearby hunting valley of a friendly regent for his own. The regent cannot accept such boldness, and has placed a bounty on Victor\'s head.',
        'AdventureWhirlwind' => 'It is a mark of troubled times when bandits join forces to form groups of outlaws. Travellers talk of an island shrouded in mist, where the bandits set sail and spread over the land.
Send your men and see to it that this stronghold is destroyed!',
        'AdventureWitchOfTheSwamp' => 'Rumours tell of a mighty witch.

She lives in a poisonous swamp and is believed to have the ugliest face you can imagine, with warts all over her deformed nose and a laugh that will freeze your spine. Anyone who dares to journey into her realm is sure to earn fame and glory.',
        'AirBundle' => 'A time-limited exclusive anniversary event bundle. It’s packed full of sweet items from the last events, which some of you may have missed due to us changing from our Flash client to the new, swish Air version of our game. This is your chance to get your hands on the content and take advantage of a huge 70% discount!',
        'AnimalBuff_ghosts' => 'An ancient board game... or perhaps it\'s something more? Legend has it that this board can be used to talk with the spirits, and bring them to you... Ages 6+, from 2 to 6 players!',
        'AnimalBuff_zombies' => 'Be careful with this! One mishap may turn dozens of your settlers into zombies! They may be harmless, but they would surely scare away all the wildlife on our island. Just imagine how scary that would be!',
        'Anniversary2019General' => 'Need help during ventures, or just need a general capable of leading a huge army? Don\'t get fooled by this one\'s friendly appearance - recruit him while you can!',
        'AnniversaryBundle2024_Large' => 'It\'s celebration time! Happy people come together to celebrate this beautiful anniversary. Get a drink and some snacks and celebrate with some new buildings and new generals from this chest!',
        'AnniversaryBundle2024_Medium' => 'It\'s celebration time! Happy people come together to celebrate this beautiful anniversary. Get a drink and some snacks and celebrate with some new buildings and a general from this box!',
        'AnniversaryBundle2024_Small' => 'It\'s celebration time! Happy people come together to celebrate this beautiful anniversary. Get a drink and some snacks and celebrate with some new buildings from this bag!',
        'AnniversaryBundle2025_Large' => 'Oh yeah! It\'s that time of the year. Happy people come together to celebrate we are still running laps around the Sun. A-Mazing!',
        'AnniversaryBundle2025_Medium' => 'Oh yeah! It\'s that time of the year. Happy people come together to celebrate we are still running laps around the Sun. A-Mazing!',
        'AnniversaryBundle2025_Small' => 'Oh yeah! It\'s that time of the year. Happy people come together to celebrate we are still running laps around the Sun. A-Mazing!',
        'AnniversaryBundle2026_Large' => 'A chest with goods 30 years in the making.',
        'AnniversaryBundle2026_Medium' => 'A box with goods 30 years in the making.',
        'AnniversaryBundle2026_Small' => 'A bag with goods 30 years in the making.',
        'ArchebusesLvl1' => 'The arquebus is the pinnacle of ranged warfare! Almost like a hand-held cannon, its sheer power is immense. However, its high production cost and the unique training required to use and maintain it, limit its application to a select few elite marksmen.',
        'ArcheologistGeologist' => 'A geologist with a penchant for soccer and archeology. As he enjoys more than just looking for resources, he also has a chance of finding great treasures on certain searches deep underground. He\'s also twice as fast as standard geologists.',
        'ArcticTitaniumMine' => 'A titanium mine built to operate at optimal capacity in cold weather. Works just fine in other weather too.',
        'ArmillarySphere' => 'An overcomplicated contraption made with the same technology that keeps the Forerunner aloft.',
        'ArtMuseum' => 'Breathtaking exhibits, ranging from stone sculptures and history to mind-boggling displays of metalwork.',
        'ArtificerStudy' => 'Develops techniques and methodologies to improve the production of artillery-related products and buffs.',
        'AssassinGeneral' => 'By disguising himself and his garrison to look like bandits, he is able to land sneak attacks and even weaken his foes before the actual fight begins. This makes him particularly formidable against boss units. But don\'t tell anyone, this information is all highly confidential! Ssshhhh!',
        'AuctionAchievement' => 'A prestigious award that serves as proof of being an accomplished businessman.',
        'AuroraTower' => 'An ethereal tower where old sages gather to pass down epic stories to newer generations.',
        'AvatarBuffRedNose' => 'With this Red Nose for your Avatar you can show your support for the good cause.
Additionally we\'ll donate all the money we make from selling Red Noses to the Red Nose Campaign.',
        'BM_Valentines2023BuildingBundle00' => 'This bundle is a love letter for those who fell in love with the Valentine’s 2023 building collection.',
        'Bakery_Mini' => 'This tribute honors all diligent bakers. Let\'s celebrate the early risers that deliver the island’s famous warm and fragrant bread.',
        'BalancedGeologist' => 'This is the most balanced person you will ever meet in your life. Whenever you ask this Balanced Geologist for a task, she will perform it very fast, and additionally refill other deposits. She just balanced herself out to always show her best side.',
        'BalloonsPackLvl1' => 'Need a few more balloons to get that reward? Looking for a way to help everyone achieve that worldwide event objective?
This pack of balloons might be just what you\'re looking for.

Just remember - they\'ll disappear when the event is over!',
        'BalloonsPackLvl2' => 'If you\'re looking to make a large balloon contribution, but you don\'t have the time or resources, have I got an offer for you!

Keep in mind that all balloons will disappear when the event is over!',
        'BattleBuffKill_random_boss_limited' => 'How many of your troops will it take to deal with that monster? None! One shot from this oversized weapon is enough to take out even the biggest threat. 
Better make the shot count!',
        'BattleHorsesLvl1' => 'Bred and trained for combat, these battle horses are more comrades than mounts. Platinum barding offers them additional protection to help riders form a lasting bond with their horses.',
        'BeerLvl1' => 'One of your farmers prides himself on having the most fertile wheatfields. All these years he has been ridiculed by his neighbours, but this year he was either lucky or - finally - right. He\'s offering a huge amount of his finest brew for sale.',
        'BeerLvl2' => 'What better way to motivate eager young men to join your glorious army? A shiny barrel of the most delicious brew in the whole kingdom.',
        'BeginnerBuildingLicense' => 'Ten blank building licenses, direct from the high court of the royal palace. These will allow you to construct even more buildings in your marvelous city.',
        'BeginnerBundle1' => 'Lacking resources to construct or upgrade an important building? This bundle includes enough resources to construct almost any basic or intermediate building.',
        'BeginnerBundle2' => 'Are you ready to move on to more expensive building projects? This bundle includes plenty of important resources for advanced construction projects.',
        'BeginnerBundle3' => 'Only the best for your settlers! Our bakers and brewers prepared this pack for you - brew for your soldiers, and bread to make sandwiches for your workers.',
        'BeginnerFishFarm' => 'The home of a passionate and nature-loving fisherman who loves to fish, but takes great care not to over-fish the wild stocks. He\'s known for his great knowledge of how to breed fish in large numbers.',
        'BeginnerImprovedSilo' => 'Have you always wanted a way to refill your wheat fields more effectively? Then your wish just came true! This new silo refills your fields in the blink of an eye!',
        'BeginnerImprovedWarehouse' => 'Are your storehouses full to bursting point? Are you struggling to find somewhere to put all your resources?
Then you probably need the improved storehouse! It provides three times the space of a normal storehouse.',
        'BeginnerImprovedWatermill' => 'Whether by witchcraft or science, the engineer behind the watermill has managed to enhance his already impressive invention. 
It still generates water from nothing, but is even more efficient than the original.',
        'BeginnerNobleResidence' => 'A large residence, offering all the comfort and luxury a noble expects. Furthermore, this residence is very spacious, so a lot of people can live here.',
        'BeginnerPackage1' => 'A good choice when you\'re first finding your footing. Especially useful for constructing buildings, this contains all the resources you need for low tier buildings.',
        'BeginnerPackage2' => 'A good choice if you want to expand your empire with larger buildings. Contains all the resources you need for higher tier buildings.',
        'BeginnerPackage3' => 'A good choice if you want to boost your military with new units. Contains useful resources that can be used to train new units.',
        'BeginnerRecycling' => 'This new building is really amazing. Here, wood leftovers can rapidly be processed into coal, giving you an inexhaustible coal supply.',
        'BeginnerSilo' => 'A lazy settler, who doesn\'t want to build wheat fields anymore, has had a great idea. He\'ll build a silo, which collects surplus grain and uses it to refill the wheat fields.',
        'BeginnerVillageSchool' => 'The village school is filled with the very best teachers, who\'ll teach the kids how to become fine settlers.',
        'BeginnerWatermill' => 'This is the construction plan for a new, experimental building, which magically produces unlimited water. The inventor is being accused of witchcraft.',
        'BenevolentExplorer' => 'The benevolent explorer is always trying to do good.',
        'BewitchingBundle' => 'The Bewitching Explorer has chosen some really enticing items for you in this time-limited Halloween Special. Come closer, have a look…',
        'BewitchingExplorer' => 'Once so lovely, something strange happened to this explorer. After an adventure to a certain island, the lady returned feeling a bit unusual, and without any memory of what exactly it was that she\'d been doing. Now, she feels stronger than ever, with a distinct power of persuasion.',
        'BigHalloweenBundle2023' => 'This chest really looks uncanny. If you’re brave enough, open it to see the brave specialists, spooky buildings and useful buffs it contains.',
        'BioFarm' => 'No one would ever say that our good old farms are old - but they are! Some settlers took the time to improve the productivity of farms and came up with the Bio Farm, which is just incredible. It doesn’t need additional wheat fields anymore!',
        'Birthday2020CakeMap' => 'A mysterious island has suddenly appeared out of the morning mists, visible on the horizon. Several fishermen and boats that ventured near have given similar reports about seeing evildoers roaming around the island. Strangely, however, it seems everybody saw completely different types of evildoer, but no leaders at all! Either way, you cannot let something like this go unchallenged so close to your own island.',
        'Birthday2020_Bundle1' => 'To celebrate the anniversary with all of you wonderful people, we put together a couple of premium bundles with some of the latest content, all wrapped up with an amazing discount on top. The all-new bundles will exclusively be available throughout the anniversary event.',
        'Birthday2020_Bundle2' => 'To celebrate the anniversary with all of you wonderful people, we put together a couple of premium bundles with some of the latest content, all wrapped up with an amazing discount on top. The all-new bundles will exclusively be available throughout the anniversary event.',
        'Birthday2020_OldEraBundle' => 'Recently, one of your settlers found some dusty old blueprints in his attic. These buildings look intriguingly familiar, don\'t they?

With this awesome bundle you\'ll get all 3 of them at once.',
        'BlackTree_Blue' => 'A seed that lets you plant a tree as black as night. Once the pride and center of a witch\'s dance, this seed mysteriously found its way into your hands. The tree that springs from this seed will swallow the light surrounding it, and in return emit a diffuse, arcane blue light.
Just standing beside such a tree, you can feel its arcane power permeate through you. You feel a strong urge to get as many of these trees on your island as possible, and wonder if this is part of its magic.',
        'BlackTree_Gold' => 'A seed that lets you plant a tree as black as night. Once the pride and center of a witch\'s dance, this seed mysteriously found its way into your hands. The tree that springs from this seed will swallow the light surrounding it, and in return emit a diffuse, arcane golden light.
Just standing beside such a tree, you can feel its arcane power permeate through you. You feel a strong urge to get as many of these trees on your island as possible, and wonder if this is part of its magic.',
        'BlackTree_Green' => 'A seed that lets you plant a tree as black as night. Once the pride and center of a witch\'s dance, this seed mysteriously found its way into your hands. The tree that springs from this seed will swallow the light surrounding it, and in return emit a diffuse, arcane green light.
Just standing beside such a tree, you can feel its arcane power permeate through you. You feel a strong urge to get as many of these trees on your island as possible, and wonder if this is part of its magic.',
        'BlackTree_Purple' => 'A seed that lets you plant a tree as black as night. Once the pride and center of a witch\'s dance, this seed mysteriously found its way into your hands. The tree that springs from this seed will swallow the light surrounding it, and in return emit a diffuse, arcane purple light.
Just standing beside such a tree, you can feel its arcane power permeate through you. You feel a strong urge to get as many of these trees on your island as possible, and wonder if this is part of its magic.',
        'BlackTree_Red' => 'A seed that lets you plant a tree as black as night. Once the pride and center of a witch\'s dance, this seed mysteriously found its way into your hands. The tree that springs from this seed will swallow the light surrounding it, and in return emit a diffuse, arcane red light.
Just standing beside such a tree, you can feel its arcane power permeate through you. You feel a strong urge to get as many of these trees on your island as possible, and wonder if this is part of its magic.',
        'BlacktreeExplorer' => 'The Blacktree Explorer is obsessed by the Blacktree. She loves all variations of it. She is so committed to the Blacktree that when she returns from exploring, she always brings one of the famous Blacktree buffs back with her.',
        'BlastingCartAid' => 'A decoration building that increases the Artificer Study and Stone Depot production speed.',
        'BoatHouse' => 'An old boat turned into a cozy residence. The rocking helps with falling asleep.',
        'BoldExplorer' => 'He\'s every bit as bold as his looks suggest. He absolutely loves to go on a treasure search, and usually brings home 50% more rewards due to his boldness. Whether on treasure or adventure searches, rumor has it he hasn’t come home without a buff yet. Impressive, isn’t it?',
        'BonabertiBusiness' => 'One of the Bonaberti family’s belongings, a beautiful untouched island in the far south, has been overrun by unknown bandits. The Bonabertis, though incredibly wealthy, are not exactly experienced in warfare. Therefore, they\'ve trustingly turned to you for help: could you please eradicate the hostiles on the island? The rewards will definitely be worth it!',
        'BookFittingLvl1' => 'Of course nobody judges a book by its cover, but there\'s no denying that a nicely decorated book just looks so much more intellectual. This bag of ornaments will greatly help you make your eternal wisdom look even wiser.',
        'BookbinderBoostLvl1' => 'Normally our settlers bind the books, but with this glue our settlers can create books twice as fast. However, keep in mind that your settlers only have a limited amount of time to use the glue after opening before it dries up!',
        'BoosterBundle' => 'Make preparations for the end of the world with this time-limited and event-exclusive bundle.',
        'BorisGeneralEgg' => 'A courageous Cossack from the Lands of the East. A graduate of the Imperial Academy.',
        'BowsLvl1' => 'A rack of most-basic bows. While not exactly easy to use, inexperienced bowmen are advised to learn how to use these before moving up to a longbow.',
        'BreadLvl1' => 'A lot of bakers put a lot of effort into making a lot of bread. They\'d appreciate your patronage a lot, too.',
        'BreweryEndless' => 'No one ever thought the inhabitants could drink that much brew, but everyone wants to see people happy. More brew, more happy settlers.',
        'Brohmann' => 'An aggressive warlord that knows only one direction - forward!
He prefers the aid of a small group of reliable horsemen to get the job done. After his enemies are vanquished, he will return home with coffers full of loot.',
        'BronzeMineEndless' => 'Rumours of black magic and sinister curses have surrounded the Endless Mine for decades, until recently, when a resourceful and unflinching young business man decided to avail himself of the concept.',
        'BronzeOreKnowledge1' => 'Notes recovered from distant lands, uncovering the secrets of working copper.
Can be exchanged at the Mayor\'s house for a manuscript.',
        'BronzeOreKnowledge2' => 'Notes recovered from distant lands, uncovering the closely guarded secrets of working copper.
Can be exchanged at the Mayor\'s house for a tome.',
        'BronzeSwordsLvl1' => 'The perfect weapons for new recruits. While useful in combat, these swords are designed to help their wielders adjust to the weight of a blade before transitioning to more powerful ones.',
        'BuffAd_Easter2015' => 'A special scenario only available during Easter. Find out what happened to the mysterious Easter egg production farm.',
        'BuffAdventureGrainConflict' => 'Not far from here there lies Grain Island, a small island full of swaying, golden ears, which gave the island its name. On this small piece of land, there are two towns - one producing the most delicious brew in these spheres, the other baking the tastiest bread of all the known kingdoms.
The guilds in both towns used to share the grain. 
They would meet in the Grain House - a place where they would negotiate and distribute it equally. But one day, the two guilds started arguing over which product would be the best, and to which guild the most grain should go. Since that day, there have been no more negotiations in the Grain house, as every guild just tries to get as much as they can.
Maybe you can help the two guilds to re-enter negotiations, so our Settlers can feast on the Grain Island\'s famous exports again.',
        'BuffAdventureTwins' => 'In a neighbouring city, two twins have gone missing without a trace. The poor kids! Maybe you can help find them?',
        'BuffAdventuresRichesoftheMountain' => 'In a mountain on a nearby island, a valuable ore vein has been found. You have been asked to help with the construction of a mining outpost, and to provide it with security. You\'ll receive a large reward for your help.',
        'BuffAdventures_DragonsRoost' => 'A dragon has suddenly appeared and started terrorizing a chain of islands. Somebody must stop it!',
        'BuffAdventures_ElChupacabra' => 'The legendary Chupacabra has been spotted on an island to the west, where it is spreading madness among the natives. You have to put a stop to it!',
        'BuffAdventures_El_Chupacabra' => 'The legendary Chupacabra has been spotted on an island to the west, where it is spreading madness among the natives. You have to put an end to it!',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Fisherman' => 'A fisherman shares with you the story of how an enchanted flounder granted his wife her wish of becoming all-powerful. Perhaps too powerful. She\'s become blinded with power, and is now oppressing the land!',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Hansel_Gretel' => 'A distressed woodcutter approaches you. He says that his wife convinced him to abandon his children in the woods, but he\'s now extremely worried about their safety. Will you help him find them?',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Piper_Of_Hamelin' => 'The Mayor of the town of Hamelin has contacted you to inform you that a piper has brought a plague of rats to his island. He cordially asks if you could help them deal with it, and promises a huge reward if you do.',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Red_Riding_Hood' => 'The latest reports on the whereabouts of the Evil Queen point to a remote island. The only apparent sign of civilization is a lonely hut in the middle of the island. You decide to investigate a bit further.',
        'BuffAdventures_Evil_Queen_Snow_White' => 'You receive a letter from a young maid called Snow White, stating that her evil stepmother, the queen, has had her hunted down just because she\'s the prettier one. You follow the lead in hopes of finding a clue as to Ilsebille\'s whereabouts.',
        'BuffAdventures_LostCity' => 'We have located an island! It must be the one that houses the fabled City of Glory! 
But why is it teeming with bandits? And where is the city itself? Could the six altars hold the answers?',
        'BuffAdventures_OfSongsAndCurses' => 'An island has been plunged into darkness, and shrouded in eternal mist due to some sort of curse. Could the ghost musicians that Sonya claims to have met be the cause of it?',
        'BuffAdventures_OneStepAhead' => 'Pirates have robbed several of your allied kingdoms. We have identified the island at which their fleet is going to restock. If you can intercept them, you can teach them a lesson, and return your allies\' stolen goods.',
        'BuffAdventures_One_Step_Ahead' => 'Pirates have robbed several of your allied kingdoms. We have identified the island at which their fleet is going to restock. If you can intercept them, you can teach them a lesson and return your allies\' stolen goods.',
        'BuffAdventures_RaidOfTheNords' => 'The natives of a small island need your help! They\'re being threatened by aggressors from the north.',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_A_giant_battle' => 'An epochal enemy reigns high in the mountains, and has caused havoc for many decades. There are several paths to victory against this evil - but which will you choose?',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_At_the_foot_of_the_Mountain' => 'Sonya has heard a rumour about a legendary Mountain Clan, who she believes may be the only ones who can help us with our current mountain difficulty. With little in the way of other options, we probably don\'t have a choice but to set out on this epic venture, chasing a myth of an old Clan of Nords. Will we actually find the help we seek, or is it all nothing more than a legend? There\'s only one way to find out...',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_Mountain_Labyrinth' => 'The search for the Mountain Clan leads you deep into the mountains. Canyons and harsh weather, along with many junctions and hidden paths, await you on your quest to reveal the secrets behind the legends.',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_The_People_of_the_Mountain' => 'Far up in the mountains lies the rumored domain of the Mountain Clan. Few have heard the stories about the Mountain Clan, and no one who lives has actually seen one of their tribe members. Be the first to discover their domain, and find out the truth behind the legends.',
        'BuffAdventures_TMC_Unknown_Regions' => 'Just as you start your journey north, the weather suddenly worsens. There is no way to move forward in this storm. 
You\'ll have to find a way to brave this harsh environment somehow.',
        'BuffAdventures_ValuableIntel' => 'One of your informants has gone missing!
He was tasked with keeping an eye on the dealings of a suspicious island town. They must have captured him because he discovered something they didn\'t want us to know!
We must send out a rescue party!',
        'BuffAdventures_heartOfTheWood_medium' => 'The rangers of a nearby town are calling for aid. A strange sickness has fallen upon the trees near their settlement. They\'ve done all they can, but it seems to be spreading into the forest, and even to the local wildlife. If we help them out, perhaps we can find the cause of this strange plight.',
        'BuffMysteryBox' => 'This time limited mysterious box doesn\'t just give you one buff. It doesn\'t just give you two buffs. No, it gives you THREE whole buffs!!! Well, what are you waiting for?',
        'BuffResourceBox' => 'This box has been washed up ashore. The weathered label on it lets you assume it comes from a place far, far away and may contain precious things...',
        'BuildingAdventureBookbinder' => 'Are your specialists trained the way they should be? Do you need more books to tell your explorers what to look for during searches? Do your generals need some more tricks up their sleeves?
Get more adventure bookbinders, and speed up book production with each additional building.',
        'BuildingAnimatedChristmasTree' => 'At Christmas, a Christmas tree is mandatory. This one here has not only a noble appearance, but also gets delivered with a full collection of decorative lights.',
        'BuildingArcticGoldMine' => 'A special looking gold mine, with the properties of a level 6 gold mine. A must have for all gold farmers!',
        'BuildingArcticIronMine' => 'Architects from the far north have brought you this plan for a brand new mine. It\'s as effective as a normal level five iron mine, but with a chic arctic look. However, it collapses when the deposit is empty. So watch out!',
        'BuildingBalloonMarket' => 'At the Balloon Market, various wonderful balloons are on offer. There definitely will be something for everyone!',
        'BuildingBalloonMarket_mini' => 'A tribute to the colorful and happy Balloon Market. Every settler gets a balloon for even more happiness!',
        'BuildingBookbinderTributeSpecial' => 'A special tribute to all knowledge seekers. By putting this profession on a pedestal, your Settlers are inspired to print their own books.',
        'BuildingBox' => 'A well-traveled architect, who has served under many kings, has made you an offer. He will embellish your island, but you have to trust his taste...',
        'BuildingBronzeMine_Mini' => 'A tribute to all copper mine workers.',
        'BuildingCapaciousWarehouse' => 'All goods are stored, delivered and taken from here. Has the capacity to store 32,000 resources.',
        'BuildingCherry_Tree' => 'A pink cherry tree imported from the far east. While usually associated with the transience of beauty, this particular specimen is in full blossom all year.',
        'BuildingChocolatier' => 'You\'d be surprised at the sweet, useful things a chocolatier can create.',
        'BuildingChristmasBakery' => 'The smells and sounds of baking, handicrafts and singing surround the Christmas Bakery. Just being close to this sweet building already lighten one\'s mood. With special events, this building can boost different productions greatly!',
        'BuildingChristmasMarket_Player' => 'Why limit the Christmas spirit to a few weeks per year, when you can have it whenever you like? Just hold a Christmas Market and all nearby Settlers will be imbued with the holiday spirit.',
        'BuildingChristmasTreeBig' => 'A lovingly decorated Christmas tree. What else could spread the festive spirit more efficiently in your town? Place it at the center of your town to show all of the inhabitants that the yuletide has begun.',
        'BuildingChristmasTreeSmall' => 'A smaller species of tree, more adequate for domestic purposes. Still too large to fit in the living rooms of your residences. Best placed in the front yard.',
        'BuildingCoalWorkyard' => 'This new building is really amazing. It can take leftover wood and rapidly process it into coal, essentially giving you an inexhaustible supply of coal.',
        'BuildingCupidoStatue' => 'The patron of love, reminding your settlers of the most valuable thing in the world.',
        'BuildingDeerstalkerHut' => 'The home of an elite hunter who doesn\'t need a specific spot to hunt, but travels all around the island for game. He\'s known for his exceptional stealth and agility... some even say he used to be one of the royal archers before abandoning Capital Island to live a life of solitude, governed by his own rules and habits.',
        'BuildingEliteTrainingGrounds' => 'This Elite Barracks expansion lets you train your troops even faster.',
        'BuildingEpicGoldMine' => 'This ultra-modern building is very efficient, and allows one single worker to extract all ore from the deposit in short time.',
        'BuildingEpicIronMine' => 'This ultra-modern building is very efficient, and allows one single worker to extract all ore from the deposit in short time.',
        'BuildingEpicResidence' => 'Your settlers couldn\'t ask for more luxury and space. The Magnificent Residence provides enough room and convenience for a king and his entire court.',
        'BuildingEpicTitaniumMine' => 'This ultra-modern building is very efficient, and allows one single worker to extract all the ore from a deposit in short time.',
        'BuildingExoticWoodTreeSchool' => 'Finally! A building, which produces exotic wood. But beware! Unlike regular work yards, this building depletes after a while.',
        'BuildingExotic_Tree_01' => 'A very beautiful red tree, which can be placed on the home zone to prettify it.',
        'BuildingExotic_Tree_02' => 'A very beautiful red tree, which can be placed on the home zone to prettify it.',
        'BuildingExotic_Tree_03' => 'A very beautiful red tree, which can be placed on the home zone to prettify it.',
        'BuildingFarmfield_02' => 'Wheat needs room to grow freely. By halving this space we have doubled the potential amount of wheat for this field. Sure, the wheat might look a little squashed, but it\'s still edible.',
        'BuildingFarmfield_Halloween_01' => 'Everyone knows that pumpkins grow very well in cemeteries. This small one can be built quickly and cheaply, but it will be a long time before you can harvest the first pumpkins.',
        'BuildingFarmfield_Halloween_02' => 'Everyone knows that pumpkins grow very well in cemeteries, so why not buy an eerily beautiful cemetery from your merchant?',
        'BuildingFarmfield_Halloween_03' => 'Everyone knows that pumpkins grow very well in cemeteries. This cemetery is built with the most expensive and high quality materials. This means that pumpkins grow much faster there than in common cemeteries.',
        'BuildingFirebow3_Deco' => 'A decorative metal bowl filled with burning coals that can be placed on your island to prettify it.',
        'BuildingFloatingResidence' => 'Always wanted a house by the sea? No space on your island anymore, and don\'t know what to do? We have the solution! Buy this house built on the water, and your worries will be forgotten.',
        'BuildingFlowerFarm' => 'A production building for Valentine Flowers.',
        'BuildingFlowerFarmDecoration' => 'A decorative version of the Flower Farm.',
        'BuildingFlowerbedHeart' => 'The shape of this flower bed is really unique.',
        'BuildingFlyingHouse' => 'A group of tinkerers have secretly come together to create this fantastic, if slightly obscure building. To watch the 10th anniversary celebration, an idea was born to not just climb high, but to fly into the sky and have the best possible view of all the festivities and fireworks. After months of preparation and testing, take off was still a challenge too far, as the constuction plans included a space to celebrate and live. But with a little help from Sonya, the celebrative lookout was finally able to launch.',
        'BuildingFriary' => 'These hermit monks have perfected the art of brewing brew to a degree that is only possible due to their dedicated and sacrificial way of life. However, for the greater good of all settlers, they are happy to make the sacrifice.',
        'BuildingGhostLantern' => 'A lantern containing tiny swirling ghosts. Somehow looking like luxury housing for the dearly departed, the lantern seems to be from another realm of existence. It\'s not clear how the merchant got his hands on this item - it just appeared, available for sale.',
        'BuildingGiantTreeOfHope' => 'This giant tree is said to erase bad feelings and give hope, even in the worst situations.',
        'BuildingGiftChristmasTree' => 'The most beautiful, and also the most useful Christmas Tree you\'ll ever have. Soak up the Christmas spirit, and receive a random gift every 7 days.',
        'BuildingGingerbreadResidence' => 'Any complaints about taste regarding this building are in vain. This is by far the tastiest residence you can get!',
        'BuildingGingerbreadStorage' => 'Santa\'s let you in on his secret for storing huge amounts of resources.',
        'BuildingGoldTower' => 'Rumpelstiltskin has enchanted this tower so any settler can spin straw into pure gold here!',
        'BuildingGolemDeco' => 'Prove to everyone that you bested the horrible creatures that threatened your island during Halloween! Nobody\'s afraid of golems when you\'re around!',
        'BuildingGranitePit' => 'Finally! A building, which produces granite. But beware! Unlike regular work yards, this building depletes after a while.',
        'BuildingGroutFactory_Mini' => 'A tribute to the mighty grout.',
        'BuildingGuildHouse' => 'A huge, magnificent and impressive mansion where the guild council board takes place.',
        'BuildingHeartTree' => 'What a lovely shape for a tree.',
        'BuildingImprovedButcher' => 'An experienced butcher that produces sausages three times as fast as a regular butcher.',
        'BuildingImprovedDeerstalker' => 'The hunter that works out of this hut has perfected the use of traps and tricks, to become the most efficient hunter in the land. Nobody can rival him in terms of efficiency and speed. It seems your butchers will be busy while he\'s around!',
        'BuildingImprovedFarm' => 'Who would have guessed that the results of modern agricultural research would look more rural than before? This farm harvests wheat with incredible efficiency, yet exudes nostalgic charm.',
        'BuildingImprovedFloatingResidence' => 'Luxury apartments AT the sea are a thing of the past. Living luxuriously ON the sea is the flavor of the month!',
        'BuildingImprovedSilo' => 'Have you always wanted a way to refill your wheat fields more effectively? Then your wish just came true! This new silo refills your fields in the blink of an eye!',
        'BuildingImprovedWarehouse' => 'Are your storehouses full to bursting point, and you\'ve got nowhere to keep your resources?
Then you probably need the Improved Storehouse. It provides three times the space of a normal storehouse.',
        'BuildingImprovedWatermill' => 'Whether by witchcraft or science, the engineer behind the watermill has managed to enhance his already impressive invention. 
It still generates water from nothing, but it does so a lot more efficiently than the original.',
        'BuildingLargeRiverhouse1' => 'An upgrade for those who love the river life, but aren\'t quite so keen on standing shoulder to shoulder with everyone at dinner. The most snugly house that was ever built on water.',
        'BuildingLargeRiverhouse2' => 'The snugly, but much fancier way to live the Settler life in peace and harmony.',
        'BuildingLogistics' => 'Your gate to the whole wide world. With this monumental building you are allowed to trade with other players.',
        'BuildingLoveGarden' => 'A special public building that buffs residencies in an area around it. The more residencies you buff, the stronger the effect is. It can even trigger quest lines with buff rewards.',
        'BuildingLoveTree' => 'A beautiful spot filled with the memories of generations gone by. It\'s said that even your great grandmother once sat in the shadow of this charming old tree to secretly meet your great grandfather during their break. Tears soon sealed their joyful engagement, as they did for hundreds of others. It\'s said the love and energy stored in the tree are transferred to every loving soul who rests a while nearby - which is probably why so many friends and families come here for a picnic.',
        'BuildingLoversStatue' => 'Build the perfect place for all the love-seeking, helplessly romantic settlers on your island. The Lovers\' Statue will kindle the flame of love for all that long for it. Can be upgraded to bronze and gold forms.',
        'BuildingMagicalPavilion' => 'This magical pavilion represents pure harmony on your island.',
        'BuildingMayaResidence' => 'Increases the population limit.',
        'BuildingNobleResidence' => 'A big residence offering all the comfort and luxury expected by a noble. Furthermore, this residence is very spacious, so a lot of people can live here.',
        'BuildingOasisResidence' => 'Increases the population limit.',
        'BuildingObservatory' => 'An intelligence gathering building that crafts star charts.',
        'BuildingOilMillTribute' => 'A tribute to one of the most productive buildings, the oil mill.',
        'BuildingOilmill' => 'After years of research and refinement, finally a building has been invented that is capable of producing a wide range of oils for all needs - the Oil Mill! From oiling tools, weapons and oil stones, to improving the performance and longevity of machinery, the oil mill has every settler covered. And yes, it can even help with preparing food and feeding livestock! You\'ve never seen horses with such soft fur...',
        'BuildingOrientalPalace' => 'A glorious Arabian-style palace with both golden and colourful domes. Its many luxurious towers can house a small village\'s worth of settlers.',
        'BuildingOrientalResidence' => 'Increases the population limit.',
        'BuildingParkPagode' => 'This pagoda, surrounded by flower beds, emanates a sense of tranquility. It makes you want to take a break and meditate.',
        'BuildingPirateResidence' => 'Increases the population limit.',
        'BuildingProvisionHouse2' => 'A provision house is a must-have for any great monarch, but this is also true for your architects\' latest invention: The Rarity Provision House. Not only does it offer rare recipes for buffs, but it\'s a nice looking building too.',
        'BuildingPumpkinMansion' => 'A new settler has come to town - and one with a very sweet spot for pumpkins, it seems! Have a look at just how gorgeously this mansion’s decorated.',
        'BuildingRabbitBreeding' => 'There are lots of happy rabbits in the rabbit retreat. The food is so excellent, our sweet rabbits produce magic beans out of it!',
        'BuildingRabbitsFarmField' => 'This wheatfield is under a spell and planted so tightly that it is perfectly suited as a hiding place for Easter eggs.',
        'BuildingRiverhouse' => 'Ever fancied living a secluded and peaceful life on the water, yet still being close to land? This small river house has got you covered! Although it might get cramped if you invite too many people...',
        'BuildingRuinAncientLibrary_01' => 'A forgotten culture constructed this building. No-one knows what purpose it serves. Rumours suggest that the overgrown ruin is haunted.',
        'BuildingSettlers2HQDeco' => 'Increases the population limit.
Functions as store house entry for production buildings.',
        'BuildingSilo' => 'A lazy settler, who doesn\'t want to build wheat fields anymore, has had a great idea. He\'ll build a silo which collects surplus grain, and use it to refill the wheat fields.',
        'BuildingSkyscraper_Residence' => 'Sonya, Anslem and the Mad Scientist met for an amicable drink to reminisce about their past adventures: of the giant plants and scary dragons they\'ve slain; of the foreign countries they´ve travelled; and the magnificent structures they´ve seen. Suddenly, Sonya challenged the Mad Scientist to come up with something more wondrous and spectacular than anything they\'ve ever seen - and she bet he couldn´t without ending up blowing it up.
However, the very next day, the Mad Scientist visited Sonya holding some crumpled sheets of paper - paper which was covered in some scribbles that looked suspiciously like a construction plan...',
        'BuildingSkyscraper_Residence_Anniversary' => 'Festively redecorated, this wondrous residence shines with a new light to celebrate all settlers. The fact it doesn\'t require any special resources to upgrade it is a gift in itself.',
        'BuildingSkyscraper_Residence_Summer' => 'A redecorated version of the Wondrous Residence. A must for all summer enthusiasts and soccer fans. Instead of tokens, this variant will require soccer balls to upgrade.',
        'BuildingSmallOrientalTower' => 'Increases the population limit.',
        'BuildingSnackStand' => 'Do your Settlers enjoy stadium snacks? Why not build a snack stand so you can produce snacks, or a selection of other buffs yourself!
Unfortunately, they aren\'t very filling, so you\'ll need a lot of snacks to satisfy a whole workyard!',
        'BuildingSnowman' => 'Some of your settlers\' children are very talented at building snowmen. If you want a snowman in your city, you can give the children some presents and they will build one for you.',
        'BuildingSoccerField' => 'Your settlers are really enjoying the tournament, and have asked if you could erect a permanent football pitch on the island. While we cannot realize a full-sized pitch at the moment, we can at least build a fun-sized footie pitch.',
        'BuildingSpaForFlowers' => 'Sometimes your settlers just want to revive and relax. Make your settlers happy and build this wonderful spa.',
        'BuildingSpaForGems' => 'Sometimes your settlers just want to revive and relax. Make your settlers happy and build this wonderful spa.',
        'BuildingStatueLion' => 'A grand lion statue cast in solid gold. The proud animal\'s majesty is sure to rub off on your island.',
        'BuildingStatue_Griffin' => 'A long time ago, a sculptor was rescued by a mystical griffin in the mountains. He created this statue to always remind people that griffins are real!',
        'BuildingStatue_MagicalHero' => 'It is said that this hero still lives within the statue and protects the island.',
        'BuildingStatue_Wolves' => 'There are still many wolf packs in the forest. They live in peace with the residents, and sometimes they even help each other out. A beautiful example of different species living together.',
        'BuildingStorageTower' => 'Need some more space? Build this beauty of a tower between your other buildings to free up some building space and store more goods at the same time!',
        'BuildingSwanBoat' => 'There\'s nothing like a nice, calm boat tour. Get yourself one of these lovely swan boats, while pushing your population limit.',
        'BuildingTheFrozenManor' => 'This elegant mansion is encased in eternal snow and ice, but no one knows why. It has plenty of room for settlers who don\'t mind the cold.',
        'BuildingTipiResidenceColor1' => 'Increases the population limit.',
        'BuildingTipiResidenceColor2' => 'Increases the population limit.',
        'BuildingTipiResidenceWhite1' => 'Increases the population limit.',
        'BuildingTipiResidenceWhite2' => 'Increases the population limit.',
        'BuildingTitanHen' => 'One morning, a farm settler knocked himself unconscious while trying to crack open the eggshell of an unusually heavy and hard egg, thinking his head would be tougher. In that very moment, he understood why his favorite hen was so heavy. Luckily, his family and friends kept him from trying to take a look inside the hen to discover its secrets, but ever since that day, the hen has lived in its very own luxury nest, where it continues to lay titanium ore eggs.',
        'BuildingTomb' => 'This is where you\'ll find the dead settlers that didn\'t return from battle. If you look very closely, you can see their souls flying around the building.',
        'BuildingTopiarySettler' => 'This skillfully crafted topiary honours the courage of all the settlers who left their old lives behind to come to this island.',
        'BuildingTrainingGrounds' => 'This Barracks expansion lets you train your troops even faster.',
        'BuildingTreeHouseResidence' => 'A house in a tree is like a dream come true.',
        'BuildingValentineBench' => 'Settlers can relax on this bench, and pass the time.',
        'BuildingValentineFountain' => 'Some people say throwing flower petals into the fountain will grant a wish.',
        'BuildingValentinePavillon' => 'A pavilion, where your settlers can meet and be together.',
        'BuildingValentineVegetation' => 'Every town could use some more vegetation...',
        'BuildingVillageSchool' => 'The village school is filled with the best teachers who will teach the kids how to become the best settlers out there.',
        'BuildingWallsCorners' => 'A wall without corners is like a house without a ceiling. These four corner segments will be the best friends of the lonesome straight walls behind your house.',
        'BuildingWallsStraightA' => 'The best way to protect your flower beds from your neighbour\'s playing children are these small walls.',
        'BuildingWallsStraightB' => 'The best way to protect your flower beds from your neighbour\'s playing children are these small walls.',
        'BuildingWatchTowerFinished' => 'A robust tower providing living space for your settlers',
        'BuildingWatermill' => 'This is the construction plan of a new experimental building which magically produces unlimited water. The inventor has been accused of witchery.',
        'BuildingWatermillEndless' => 'After years of continuous work on refining his most successful creation, the inventor of the watermill and the improved watermill has surpassed himself with this magnificent beacon of water production.',
        'BuildingWeatherStation' => 'Only the wisest and bravest dare to start an adventure in the challenging weather conditions evoked by sprinkling secret powders in the air.',
        'BuildingWell_02' => 'This ornate water basin is an useful and gorgeous enrichment for every town. Gallons of the freshest water can be gained from this beautiful monument.',
        'BuildingWhiteCastle' => 'You can plant your magic beans in this Fairytale Castle where they will quickly grow into magic beanstalks.',
        'BuildingWitchTower_Wall-North' => 'This wall hasn\'t kept out enemies for a very long time now, but it gives your island a rustic touch (and your bugs a new home).',
        'BuildingWitchTower_Wall-West' => 'This wall hasn\'t kept out enemies for a very long time now, but it gives your island a rustic touch (and your bugs a new home).',
        'BuildingWitchtower_Statue_East' => 'A huge stone statue resembling a gargoyle pointing to the east. Only for statue fetishists…',
        'BuildingWitchtower_Statue_North' => 'A huge stone statue resembling a gargoyle pointing to the north. Weird...',
        'BuildingWitchtower_Statue_South' => 'A huge stone statue resembling a gargoyle pointing to the south. Perfect if you want to make you garden look special.',
        'BuildingWitchtower_Statue_West' => 'A huge stone statue resembling a gargoyle pointing to the west. Delivered polished. Includes base.',
        'BuildingWondrousSpringResidence' => 'Everything blooms and thrives splendidly in the spring - even the Wondrous Spring Residence. The most beautiful flowers have been sown on it, in it and all around it. It’s beautiful!',
        'Building_Bonechurch_Pop' => 'A residence fashioned after a church-like place of ritual of a dark cult. The rough walls and peculiar colours give off an ominous vibe.',
        'Building_Dark_Castle_01_Deco' => 'A sinister but grand castle. While it looks scary from the outside, future inhabitants will be surprised by the comfortable interior.',
        'Building_WitchTower_Deco' => 'Two gargoyles loom over the entrance to this creepy tower. Perhaps one of its many inhabitants might actually be a proper witch!',
        'Building_tent_traitors_leader_Deco' => 'A replica of Sir Robin\'s castle. Unlike the morality of the original\'s lord, this keep\'s magnificence and firmness are unquestionable.',
        'BuildingbarrelTransporter' => 'Does not really help your workers, but looks pretty good.',
        'Buildingbed' => 'Small bed with fresh vegetables from the court gardens.',
        'BuildingbenchGold' => 'This beautiful bench could be the new centerpiece of your town. It\'s almost too beautiful to take a seat on.',
        'BuildingbenchIron' => 'Not as beautiful as the Golden bench, but still an eye-catcher.',
        'BuildingbenchIronGold' => 'With this decadent seating furniture you will show all your visitors the prosperity of your population.',
        'BuildingbenchStone1' => 'Stone accumulates heat from the sun much better than metal, so your population will prefer these benches to metal benches...',
        'BuildingbenchStone2' => 'Foreign sailors brought this extravagant furniture into your shops. Looks like it has been carved out of one huge menhir.',
        'BuildingbigAngelgate' => 'This massive monument, in the shape of a gate, is adorned by a huge angel statue. The pretty park surrounding it looks ever so inviting.',
        'BuildingbollardGate' => 'This set is especially well-suited to emphasize your urban road system.',
        'BuildingbollardGateRotated' => 'This set is especially well-suited to emphasize your urban road system.',
        'BuildingbrokenWagon' => 'The owner of this poor small handcart always overloaded it. Now that it\'s broken, it\'s looking for a new home, somewhere to settle down and spend the twilight of its life.',
        'BuildingcollumAngel' => 'This angel exudes calmness to all your inhabitants. Your workers will find their work easy with this monument.',
        'BuildingcollumStatueTrader' => 'Build to beautify your city',
        'Buildingcrates' => 'Even some scattered boxes can look charming when positioned at the right place.',
        'BuildingfirewoodHut' => 'Improves every woodcutter. Visually.',
        'Buildingflowerbed_blue' => 'A perfect eye-catcher made out of blue, farmed flowers. And additionally they disperse a strong perfume, so sweet that visitors have difficulties leaving your town after smelling it.',
        'Buildingflowerbed_green_salat' => 'Some of your inhabitants have become overweight since the last donnybrook. Of course this also affects their capability to work. Maybe serving a big bowl of salad would help fix the situation.',
        'Buildingflowerbed_red' => 'Roses! Your male population has been asking for this for many years, because a bunch of flowers is the perfect apology after a long night in the tavern. Will you do them this favour?',
        'Buildingflowerbed_yellow' => 'Shiny, yellow sunflowers that put your inhabitants in a bright, sunny mood. Plant them in your town and your settlers will appreciate it with an everlasting smile on their faces.',
        'BuildinglanternQuadBrass' => 'A lantern that looks much better than normal lanterns, but is also more laborious to produce...',
        'BuildinglanternQuadGold' => 'A golden lantern looks so good when placed next to your precious gilded bench.',
        'BuildinglanternSingle' => 'Some standard lanterns to give a little more light.',
        'BuildingloadedCart' => 'Left behind by the owner because of its over heavy load. Maybe you can move it and give it a new home...',
        'BuildingmonumentAngel' => 'A stone statue depicting an angel assisting a collapsed traveller. It forms the centerpiece of a small fenced plaza.',
        'Buildingpavillon' => 'A beautiful pavilion where your workers can take a seat and regenerate after their routine duties.',
        'BuildingsignpostBroken' => 'Have you ever built a broken signpost? This is your great chance to do so, don\'t let it slip away!',
        'Buildingsignpost_01' => 'With this rustic signpost, none of your inhabitants will ever get lost in your town.',
        'Buildingsignpost_02' => 'With this rustic signpost, none of your inhabitants will ever get lost in your town.',
        'Buildingsignpost_03' => 'With this rustic signpost, none of your inhabitants will ever get lost in your town.',
        'BuildingstatueGirl' => 'A wonderful maiden made out of stone, built for eternity.',
        'BuildingstatueRabbid' => 'A huge statue of a crazy looking rabbid. Not only is it made of gold, it also makes a noise when you click on it. Awesome!',
        'BuildingstatueRiding' => 'A tarnished bronze statue of a knight on his steed. Ready for battle, it looks like he\'s guarding the little park that surrounds him.',
        'BuildingstatueSoldier' => 'Build to beautify your city.',
        'BuildingstatueTrader' => 'Build to beautify your city.',
        'BuildingstoneFlowered' => 'Positioned at the wayside, this beautiful stone will raise a smile on every passing worker...',
        'Buildingvases' => 'Since the women in your town don\'t have any time to pick flowers, these poor vessels are unused. You could help them to find a new meaning in life, couldn\'t you?',
        'BuildingwheelBroken' => 'Blends very well together with a broken signpost.',
        'Bungalow' => 'A lovely thatched house by the seaside.',
        'BunnyBurrows' => 'This is not a filthy, damp hole, filled with vermin and stench. It is a bunny burrow.',
        'CactusDeco01' => 'A very beautiful cactus, which can be placed on your island to prettify it.',
        'CactusDeco02' => 'A very beautiful cactus, which can be placed on your island to prettify it.',
        'CactusDeco03' => 'A very beautiful cactus, which can be placed on your island to prettify it.',
        'CakeDoughLvl1' => 'Instant cake dough for Birthday Cakes!
This event resource can usually only be found by players below level 51. Combine with Candles in the provision house to make Birthday Cakes that buff your Festival Hall.',
        'CandidExplorer' => 'When looking into his eyes, you can clearly see his candor.',
        'CandlesLvl1' => 'Need some candles to put on your Birthday Cakes?
This event resource can usually only be found by players of level 51 and above. Combine with Cake Dough in the provision house to make Birthday Cakes that buff your Festival Hall.',
        'CandyFactory' => 'Here we turn all that starch from wheat into sweet treats that will ruin your teeth and make your children hyper.',
        'CannonsLvl1' => 'Defeat bandits and other evildoers with a bang! These cannons sure pack a punch. While they\'re unwieldy and slow, good cannoneers can wipe out entire armies with just a few shots.',
        'CarnivalGrounds' => 'A movable entertainment center where people can have way too much to eat, too much to drink, and too much fun. But mostly too much to drink.',
        'CarriagesLvl1' => '10 extra Carriages.',
        'ChangeColorScheme_Snow' => 'A travelling tradesman visits your city. A little box catches your eye. It radiates pure cold. The merchant says that it  is capable of creating a snowstorm.

Note: The merchant indicates that the snow storm can slow down travelling.',
        'ChangeColorScheme_night' => 'Each day a small man offers some strange powder on the marketplace. He swears it has the power to put the sun to sleep.',
        'ChangeDefaultSkinBuffFarmPermanent' => 'This is a special buff which lets you change the appearance of  one of your farms, giving it a retro-style look.',
        'ChangeDefaultSkinBuffForesterPermanent' => 'This is a special buff which lets you change the appearance of  one of your foresters, giving them a retro-style look.',
        'ChangeDefaultSkinBuffMasonPermanent' => 'This is a special buff which lets you change the appearance of  one of your masons, giving them a retro-style look.',
        'ChangeDefaultSkinBuffWellPermanent' => 'This is a special buff which lets you change the appearance of  one of your wells, giving it a retro-style look.',
        'ChangeDefaultSkinBuffWoodcutterPermanent' => 'This is a special buff which lets you change the appearance of one of your woodcutters, giving them a retro-style look.',
        'ChangeDefaultSkin_ArtMuseum_blue_permanent' => 'A permanent cosmetic skin for the Art Museum in blue.',
        'ChangeDefaultSkin_ChristmasBarracks_permanent' => 'Theme your island with festive cheer and spread holiday joy with our enchanting line of Christmas building skins!',
        'ChangeDefaultSkin_ChristmasProvisionHouse_permanent' => 'Theme your island with festive cheer and spread holiday joy with our enchanting line of Christmas building skins!',
        'ChangeDefaultSkin_ChristmasStorehouse_permanent' => 'Theme your island with festive cheer and spread holiday joy with our enchanting line of Christmas building skins!',
