        'ChangeDefaultSkin_reset' => 'Have you ever used a "Skin Change" buff on one of your buildings, but later came to regret it? There\'s no need to demolish and rebuild!
Don\'t you know it\'s just an illusion? I know a hermit who will gladly teach you to see straight through these falsehoods!',
        'ChangeSkinBuffExcelsiorHalloween' => 'A Halloween themed skin for The Excelsior to make it look a bit more spooky',
        'ChangeSkinBuffExcelsiorHalloweenPermanent' => 'A Halloween themed skin for The Excelsior, to make it look a bit more spooky.',
        'ChangeSkinBuffExcelsiorOriginal' => 'The original look for The Excelsior as it was chosen by Sonya Graham',
        'ChangeSkinBuffExcelsiorRucticPermanent' => 'A rustic look for The Excelsior, to blend in perfectly with the island.',
        'ChangeSkinBuffExcelsiorRustic' => 'A rustic look for The Excelsior to blend in perfectly with the island.',
        'ChangeSkinBuffFarm' => 'This is a special buff that can change the appearance of one of your farms, giving it a retro-style look.',
