        'ChangeSkin_Elari_TrainingGrounds_temp' => 'The Elari share their crafting knowledge and give you the opportunity to change the look of your Barracks into an Elari Training Ground for 15 days!',
        'ChangeSkin_Elari_Warehouse_temp' => 'The Elari share their crafting knowledge and give you the opportunity to change the look of your 2x2 Storagehouse into an Elari Warehouse for 15 days!',
        'ChangeSkin_HauntedSpiderWarehouse_temp' => 'Haunted houses may be more famous, but what’s even scarier than ghosts? YES! SPIDERS! And this haunted warehouse is infested with spiders! Or is it just one huge spider?',
        'ChangeSkin_ImprovedFloatingResidenceWinterSkin_Shop_long' => 'Transforms an Improved Floating Residence into a tranquil winterly variation.',
        'ChangeSkin_ImprovedFloatingResidenceWinterSkin_Shop_permanent' => 'Transforms an Improved Floating Residence into a tranquil winterly variation.',
