        'SummerBundle3' => 'A time-limited exclusive summer event bundle to help all settlers.',
        'SummerBundle_Large' => 'It\'s time for some sunshine! And now imagine the sunshine with some brand new buildings and some very helpful companions. That\'s paradise!',
        'SummerBundle_Medium' => 'It\'s time for some sunshine! And now imagine the sunshine with some brand new buildings and a helpful companion. That\'s paradise!',
        'SummerBundle_Small' => 'It\'s time for some sunshine! And now imagine the sunshine with some brand new buildings. That\'s paradise!',
        'SummerEvent2022Bundle1' => 'Never be caught flat footed by your enemies.',
        'SummerEvent2022Bundle2' => 'Get the most out of the Earth\'s riches with this bundle.',
        'SummerEvent2022Bundle3' => 'An agricultural wonder of a bundle.',
        'SummerEventMysteryBox' => 'A box containing useful resources for all football related topics. For example: shoulder pads, shoes or even footballs.',
        'SunflowerFarm' => 'When the warm sun kisses the earth, magnificent sunflowers turn their beautiful golden heads to the sky.',
        'SunflowerFertilizer' => 'One of your settlers has developed a special fertilizer for raising sunflowers, which increases the production yield of sunflower farms enormously.',
        'SylvanaGeneralHardCurrency' => 'Sylvana is a Cossack woman and a born leader. She’s kind, yet tough, but always fair. Don’t underestimate her, as she really knows how to make your cavalry fight.',
        'SylvanaGeneralSoccerBalls' => 'Sylvana is a Cossack woman and a born leader. She’s kind, yet tough, but always fair. Don’t underestimate her, as she really knows how to make your cavalry fight.',
        'TheSmuggler' => 'A transporter general with the ability to smuggle in weapons and gold with every trip.',
        'ThoroughGeologist' => 'With Teutonic thoroughness, every last bit of useful resources is found. But this takes takes time.',
        'TikiStorehouse' => 'Don’t let the spooky masks intimidate you. It’s much more welcoming than it looks, and spacious too!',
        'TitanOreLv1' => 'This deck of titanium shines bright as the sun and would look very good in your storehouse.',
        'TitanicGeologist' => 'A dignified geologist who specializes in titanium and takes great pride in his work.',
        'TitaniumMine_Mini' => 'This tribute honors all the stout titanium miners. Raise your pickaxe in celebration of this valuable resource.',
        'TitaniumOreKnowledge1' => 'Notes recovered from distant lands, uncovering the secrets of working titanium.
Can be exchanged at the Mayor\'s house for a manuscript.',
        'TitaniumOreKnowledge2' => 'Notes recovered from distant lands, uncovering the secrets of working copper.
Can be exchanged at the Mayor\'s house for a manuscript.',
        'TitaniumSwordsLvl1' => 'These swords are not made from ordinary titanium, but from titanium-based Damascus steel. Its tell-tale flowing patterns show both the sword\'s beauty, and its incredible durability and sharpness.',
        'TokenCoinage' => 'Whilst conducting a wide range of experiments in an attempt to find a stronger metal, a new way of producing tokens was discovered instead. While still an expensive and elaborate process, it provides an additional path to those precious tokens.',
        'TokenLvl1' => 'This resource is accepted by a lot of traders. If you don’t have enough, this package can help you afford the goods you need.',
        'TokenLvl2' => 'This resource is accepted by a lot of traders. If you don’t have enough, this package can help you afford the goods you need.',
        'ToolsLvl1' => 'A local tool dealer offers flawless tools at the weekly flea market for a very small price. Obviously he hasn\'t noticed how valuable these tools are in such times.',
        'ToolsLvl2' => 'In every cellar there is a dusty toolbox. Oh what treasures! A bunch of tools waiting to be put to good use.',
        'TowerOfBraggingRights' => 'A trophy awarded to the mightiest guilds in the realm. Possessing one is testament to the cooperative prowess of the members.',
        'ToyFactory' => 'With love and care, all sorts of toys are made here. There\'s something for everyone! Have you been naughty or nice?',
        'TransporterAdmiral' => 'The expedition supplier can transport a large number of troops to a colony island. As he is a specialist in these kinds of risky trips to unknown islands, he cannot be used on normal adventures.',
        'TransporterGeneral' => 'The Quartermaster General is an expert in logistics.
Though not made for fighting, he can transport larger armies in a shorter amount of time than most of his colleagues.',
        'TransporterGeneralBjoern' => 'Bjoern is a very friendly general. People gather around him and want to follow him. This leads to him being a non-combative general who’s more focused on the well-being of his troops. He’s also capable of hiring recruits during his travels.',
        'TribesmanBundle' => 'Make preparations for the end of the world with this time-limited and event-exclusive bundle.',
        'TunnelOfLove' => 'A place were couples usually go on a first date. Also, most first kisses happen here too. It\'s said that bonds that begin here last for a lifetime.',
        'UnityEvent_Residence' => 'Somehow it can hold 100 people AND 1,000 units of storage. Impressive!',
        'Valentine2024_LargeBundle' => 'A huge bundle filled with love and other useful things.',
        'Valentine2024_MediumBundle' => 'A bundle filled with love and other useful things.',
        'Valentine2024_SmallBundle' => 'A small bundle filled with love and other useful things.',
        'Valentine2025_LargeBundle' => 'Look closely and enjoy the view of this beautiful chest of roses. Yes, roses are beautiful, and they smell so good. Opening the chest just lets you feel good.',
        'Valentine2025_MediumBundle' => 'Look closely and enjoy the view of this beautiful box of roses. Yes, roses are beautiful, and they smell so good. Opening the box just lets you feel good.',
        'Valentine2025_SmallBundle' => 'Look closely and enjoy the view of this beautiful bag of roses. Yes, roses are beautiful, and they smell so good. Opening the bag just lets you feel good.',
        'Valentine2026_LargeBundle' => 'A large bundle prepared with love and care to heal a broken heart. Cheer up, there are plenty of fish in the sea.',
        'Valentine2026_MediumBundle' => 'A bundle prepared with love and care to heal a broken heart. Cheer up, there are plenty of fish in the sea.',
        'Valentine2026_SmallBundle' => 'A small bundle prepared with love and care to heal a broken heart. Cheer up, there are plenty of fish in the sea.',
        'ValentineMysteryBox' => 'A special box for a special day. Take a chance and make a special person happy!',
        'Valentines2021MilitaryBundle' => 'Your island’s foes never sleep, whether it\'s Valentine’s or not. With this bundle, you can help reinforce your island\'s defenses with a sizable military boost.',
        'Valentines2021SpecialistsBundle' => 'Explorers and geologists don\'t always see eye to eye, but some do have the endearing custom of coming together for some well spent quality time during Valentine’s. At least, those who don’t already have a significant other to bewitch...',
        'Valentines2021WondrousBundle' => 'With this special bundle, you\'ll have more space for your population in no time. Actually, lots of space!',
        'ValentinesTransporterGeneral' => 'As a people expert, and a very loving person, he\'s able to transport a huge amount of units quite quickly, but cannot fight himself.',
        'VersedGeologist' => 'This geologist is the generalist under all other geologists.',
        'VesyGeologist' => 'In his aimless, adventurous, amateur attempts at searching for gold, all areas are acceptable for prospecting. It is indeed an arbitrary and absurdly ambitious approach, because he actively avoids any actual advice. However, from time to time, and against all odds, he manages to strike gold.',
