        'WinterGarden' => 'In this beautiful garden, we are able to grow even the most delicate of trees in the worst conditions.',
        'WitchCoven' => 'A group of old ladies seemed to set up a bakery of sorts. Those are definitely not cake ingredients.',
        'WitchCovenAid' => 'The old ladies from the new "bakery" are setting up these things everywhere. Apparently it’s to promote their business, or something...',
        'WoodPackage' => 'A nice compilation of basic wood types to speed up production.',
        'XMAS2020_BuildingBundle' => 'The Christmas Premium Bundle contains highly valuable buildings, a ton of useful buffs, and a nice amount of event resources for you to spend!',
        'XMAS2020_GingerbreadBundle' => 'The Gingerbread Bundle packs together 2 gingerbread buildings, along with some nice decorations and skins to give your home island that special Christmas vibe. You won\'t find a better deal for your gingerbread needs anywhere, that\'s for sure!',
        'XMAS2020_SpecialistBundle' => 'With the Specialist Christmas Bundle, you\'ll get 3 powerful specialists, many useful military buffs and a number of premium days.',
        'XMAS2021_Bundle1' => 'Give yourself the gift of victory with this bundle, including specialist and battle consumables.',
