        'XMAS2025_LargeBundle' => 'Once again, it\'s that time of year when settlers exchange gifts with each other! Here is a chest of them.',
        'XMAS2025_MediumBundle' => 'Once again, it\'s that time of year when settlers exchange gifts with each other! Here is a box of them.',
        'XMAS2025_SmallBundle' => 'Once again, it\'s that time of year when settlers exchange gifts with each other! Here is a bag of them.',
        'XMAS_BoosterBundle' => 'An awesome package for new starters, or those who want to boost their effectiveness.',
        'XMAS_SheetMusic1' => 'Everyone likes Christmas music, right? When you apply this sheet music buff to your concert hall, the musicians will play “Jingle All the Way”, and a musical boost will be applied to increase the production speed of your barracks and elite barracks. That’s pretty groovy, isn’t it?',
        'XMAS_SheetMusic2' => 'Everyone likes Christmas music, right? When you apply this sheet music buff to your concert hall, the musicians will play “Silent Night”, and a musical boost will be applied to increase the production speed of your barracks and elite barracks. That’s pretty groovy, isn’t it?',
        'XMAS_SheetMusic3' => 'Everyone likes Christmas music, right? When you apply this sheet music buff to your concert hall, the musicians will play “We Wish You a Merry Christmas”, and a musical boost will be applied to increase the production speed of your barracks and elite barracks. That’s pretty groovy, isn’t it?',
        'Xmas2019General' => 'Driven by the desire to save her loved one, this general became as tough as tin and as fast as a fish.',
        'YuleGoat' => 'A celebrative decoration from a different culture.',
        'generousbundle12' => 'This well-rounded package gives you everything you could ever need right now!',
        'generousbundle7' => 'This overwhelming, time-limited, luxurious package leaves nothing to the imagination. It\'s everything you could ever want in one enormous bundle, with an incredible 66% new year\'s discount! Get it while you still can!
3 powerful generals, 2 mighty explorers, 2 outstanding geologists, 2 endless mines, 3 special buildings, and so much more in this one bundle to rule them all!',
        'generousbundle8' => 'This time-limited mega-bundle offers everything you need with an outstanding 66% new year\'s discount! Get it while you can!
Includes Vargus, one of the best generals in the game, an endless iron mine, oil mill, adventure bookbinder and much more!',
        'generousbundle9' => 'Sometimes even the friendliest, loveliest and most kindhearted of all Settlers gets forgotten, and doesn\'t get the gift of a Valentine. So, this is your chance to get that Settler a real token of love. Who is that Setller, you ask? 
Well, it\'s you! 
Get this event-exclusive bundle to prove your love to - ahem - yourself.',
        's_flowerbed_lightblue' => 'They say that the intense blue colour of these flowers cheers up the people who walk by, and brings happiness to whoever you gift them to.',
        's_flowerbed_violet' => 'The fragrance of these violets keeps the nasty summer bugs away, so everyone wants them for their garden.',
