        'ArtMuseum' => 'Applies buffs that allow geologists to find bigger deposits and speed up production.
Additional Art Museums reduce the buff\'s cooldown by only 10%.

Stonework Sculpture Exhibit
Buffs all geologists to find x3 larger Stone, Marble, and Granite deposits in half the time.
Lasts for 48 hours.

Metalwork Sculpture Exhibit
Buffs all Geologists to find x3 larger Copper, Iron, Gold, and Titanium deposits in half the time.
Lasts for 48 hours.

Art of War Exhibit
Makes the production of Bronze Swords, Iron Swords, Steel Swords, Damascene Swords, Platinum Swords, Bows, Longbows, Crossbows, Cannons, Mortars, and Arquebuses 25% faster.
Lasts for 48 hours.

2 upgrades. Cost Stripy Eggs
Size 2x2',
