        'BlackTree_Blue' => 'Type: Provisioner, recurring
Effect: Allows the production of different buffs
Size: 2x2
Production times reduced ONLY by additional trees of the SAME glow color.
Trees of different glow colors have their own, separate productions.

Upgrades: 6, which unlock new buff productions, and cost PUMPKINS!

Produces a variety of powerful and unique buffs in exchange for resources after upgrading with PUMPKINS:
Level 1: Black Pollen (freely placeable area buff): +300% output, +100% input required, 7x7 area. 24 hours (36 hours on friend). 
Target: Workyard. Base Production Time: 23.5 hours. 

Level 2: Blackened Titanium Horseshoe: +25% movement speed, 6 hours. Note: This buff affects only a single adventure.
Target: Generals on an adventure. Base Production Time: 18 hours. Upgrade Costs: 500 Exotic Wood Planks, 1,500 Pumpkins

Level 3: Witches\' Grout: Converts 30 Marble, 20 Granite and 50 Brew into 2 Grout
Base Production time: 40 min. Upgrade Costs: 1,000 Exotic Wood Planks, 1,750 Pumpkins

Level 4: Blacktree Blossoms: +300% output, 24 hours. Target: Epic Workyards
Base Production Time: 47.5 hours. Upgrade Costs: 1,500 Exotic Wood Planks, 2,000 Pumpkins

Level 5: Black Vortex (Zone Buff): Reduces travel time for generals by 35%, stacks with other buffs of the same type, e.g. Star Charts. 3 hour duration.
Target: Adventures. Base Production Time: 72 hours. Upgrade Costs: 2,000 Exotic Wood Planks, 2,250 Pumpkins 

Level 6: Arcane Crystallization: Converts 20 Granite, 150 Oilseed and 100 Brew into 1 Crystal Shard
Base Production Time: 3.5 hours. Upgrade Costs: 2,500 Exotic Wood Planks, 2,500 Pumpkins

Level 7: Blacktree Arrow: A set amount of random units in a camp will be defeated and removed.
Defeats fewer units compared to other arrow types, but use on enemy camps is not limited!
Base Production time: 36 hours. Upgrade Costs: 3,000 Exotic Wood Planks, 2,750 Pumpkins

Choose your favorite color(s)!',
