        'MultiplierBuffZone2_PremiumFriendBuff1Day' => 'A token of appreciation for a very good friend. 
• All single production buff effects are doubled!!
• +50% bonus XP from adventures (on top of any Premium Time XP boost!)
• Production time in barracks & elite barracks is halved!
• Production time in the provision house & rarity provision house is halved!
• Weapon producers work twice as fast (except at the combat armory)
• Explorers and geologists complete their tasks 20% faster
• Duration 15 days

Important Note:
• This buff can only be applied to a friend, not on your home island.
• Reapplying the buff will restart the runtime, and any leftover time will be lost.
• The doubling of buff effects does not stack with other buffs of this kind, and does not apply to epic workyards.',
