        'SpookyBronzeMine' => 'Do you want to spice up your bronze production? Get some spectracular help with the Spooky Bronze Mine!

Type: Workyard
Effect: Produces 12 bronze without the need for coal, and with half the normal deposit consumption (6)
Time: 3 min.
Size: 2x2

Features:
• Can be placed on all copper deposits
• Immediately produces bronze (12) using only half (6) the normal copper ore deposit! 
• Does not need to be upgraded to achieve this magnificent efficiency!
• Does not require coal to produce bronze 
• Does not require a building license
• As efficient as 4 copper smelters on level 6! Save space and go ghostly!
• But beware, this mine does NOT return to your star menu after demolition!',
